var data = {"ar":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (نسخة)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 مستخدم من قِبل „%2“.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 من %2 مناطق","0 = all in one row":"0 = الكل في صف واحد","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>الوضع 1</b><br/>الشريط وحواف الشاشة","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>الوضع 2</b><br/>الترتيب التلقائي","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"النافذة الوحيدة تستخدم الشاشة كلها حتى مع ضبط هامش.","A new window joins":"تنضم نافذة جديدة","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"دفعة قصيرة تعطي النصف أو الربع. أبقِ النافذة عند الحافة مدة أطول قليلًا فتكبر حتى النافذة التالية – والمعاينة تُظهر ذلك.","A single window":"نافذة واحدة","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"تتوقف النافذة عند حافة نافذة أخرى حتى لو حركتها بسرعة. هزّ الفأرة أو واصل الدفع لحظة لتحريرها. 0 = يمكن للنوافذ أن تتداخل بحرية.","About & Help":"حول ومساعدة","Accent color":"لون التمييز","Active":"مفعّل","Active mode":"الوضع النشط","Active width along the top edge":"العرض النشط على طول الحافة العلوية","Add an open application":"أضف تطبيقًا مفتوحًا","Add rule":"إضافة قاعدة","All window features in one system.":"كل ميزات النوافذ في نظام واحد.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"يتغير أيضًا عندما تغيّر حجم النافذة الرئيسية يدويًا.","Also while resizing":"أثناء تغيير الحجم أيضًا","Always floating":"طافية دائمًا","Animation":"الحركة","Appearance":"المظهر","Apply":"تطبيق","Arrange windows":"ترتيب النوافذ","Arrange windows automatically":"رتّب النوافذ تلقائيًا","Author":"المؤلف","Automatic tiling":"الترتيب التلقائي","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"الترتيب التلقائي متوقف – يعمل الوضع 1 فقط واختصار الوضع لا يفعل شيئًا.","Automatic tiling off":"الترتيب التلقائي متوقف","Automatic tiling on":"الترتيب التلقائي مفعّل","Automatic tiling on/off":"تشغيل/إيقاف الترتيب التلقائي","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"الترتيب التلقائي، تبديل النوافذ، الاختصارات، ومغناطيس النوافذ للنوافذ الطافية.","Background opacity":"عتامة الخلفية","Behavior & Animation":"السلوك والحركة","Bottom edge: bottom half":"الحافة السفلية: النصف السفلي","Bouncy":"نابض","Buy me a coffee":"اشترِ لي قهوة","Cancel":"إلغاء","Center focus":"تركيز في الوسط","Center the window":"توسيط النافذة","Change":"تغيير","Change key":"تغيير المفتاح","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"غيّر المفتاح في محرر الإعدادات. يحتاج الوضعان إلى الترتيب التلقائي والشريط أو حواف الشاشة.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"غيّرها في صفحة «اختصارات لوحة المفاتيح». مع الترتيب التلقائي تتبادل النوافذ أيضًا مكانها في الترتيب.","Choose…":"اختر…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"انقر على منطقة لتحديدها · انقر مرتين لتقسيمها · اسحب الفواصل","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"انقر أو اضغط %1 لتبديل الوضع.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"انقر ثم موافق – يُفتح محرر الإعدادات.","Close":"إغلاق","Close by, the edges stick together":"عند الاقتراب تلتصق الحواف","Color scheme":"مخطط الألوان","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"ألوان الشريط وحجمه وشكله.","Columns":"أعمدة","Corner radius":"نصف قطر الزوايا","Corner size":"حجم الزاوية","Corner: a quarter":"الزاوية: ربع","Corners: quarter of the screen":"الزوايا: ربع الشاشة","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + مفتاح (افتراضي)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + لوحة الأرقام","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + مفتاح","Custom color":"لون مخصص","Custom layout %1":"تخطيط مخصص %1","Dark":"داكن","Delay before hiding":"التأخير قبل الإخفاء","Delay before showing":"التأخير قبل الإظهار","Delete":"حذف","Delete layout?":"حذف التخطيط؟","Distance at which the handle appears":"المسافة التي يظهر عندها المقبض","Distance before the bar hides again":"المسافة قبل أن يختفي الشريط مجددًا","Distance to the edge":"المسافة إلى الحافة","Donate with PayPal":"تبرّع عبر PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"اسحب حافة مشتركة…","Drag a window against an edge…":"اسحب نافذة نحو حافة…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"اسحب نافذة فوق أخرى لتبديلهما. أفلتها على الشريط أو حافة الشاشة فتطفو بحرية؛ „اجعل النافذة تطفو“ يعيدها. الفراغات من صفحة عام.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"اسحب نافذة فوق منتصف أخرى – تُظهر المعاينة سهمين – ثم أفلت. مع الترتيب التلقائي يكفي أي مكان فوق النافذة الأخرى.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"اسحب نافذة إلى الحافة العلوية للشاشة وأفلتها فوق منطقة.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"اسحب البطاقات لتغيير الترتيب في الشريط. انقر مرتين على بطاقة لتحريرها.","Drop a window onto another one":"إفلات نافذة فوق أخرى","Drop the window onto a zone":"أفلت النافذة فوق منطقة","Duplicate":"تكرار","Duration":"المدة","Dwindle":"تناقص","Dynamic":"ديناميكي","Edges and corners":"الحواف والزوايا","Edit":"تحرير","Edit layout":"تحرير التخطيط","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"يمكن تشغيل كل ميزة وإيقافها على حدة.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"كل تخطيط تبنيه في صفحة التخطيطات يمكنه ترتيب النوافذ أيضًا – ويظهر في الأعلى. النافذة 1 تأخذ المنطقة 1 وهكذا؛ النوافذ الإضافية تتشارك المنطقة الأخيرة. إذا كانت النوافذ أقل من المناطق يُستخدم „رئيسية وكومة“ فلا تظهر فراغات.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"تجد كل نافذة مكانها بنفسها، كما في مدير نوافذ متجانب.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"تجد كل نافذة مكانها على الشاشة بنفسها. تنضم النوافذ الجديدة، وتفسح المغلقة المجال للبقية.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"مثال: نافذتان جنبًا إلى جنب، من ثلاث رئيسية وكومة، من خمس شبكة. دون قاعدة مطابقة يُستخدم التخطيط المختار أعلاه.","Fade in and out":"تلاشٍ عند الظهور والاختفاء","Fade the other windows":"تعتيم النوافذ الأخرى","Features":"الميزات","Feel":"الإحساس","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"التكيّف حول النوافذ الملتقطة مسبقًا","Fits the way you work.":"يناسب طريقة عملك.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"اجعل النافذة تطفو (اخرج من الترتيب)","Four quarters":"أربعة أرباع","From":"من","Fullscreen":"ملء الشاشة","Gap between windows":"المسافة بين النوافذ","Gap to the screen edge":"المسافة عن حافة الشاشة","General":"عام","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"يعطي كل إجراء مفتاح المخطط المختار من جديد ويزيل المفاتيح التي لا يحتويها المخطط.","Good to know":"من المفيد معرفته","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"أمسك النافذة من شريط العنوان واسحبها للأعلى. ينزلق الشريط للأسفل؛ أفلت النافذة فوق منطقة فتملأ تلك المساحة تمامًا. وإذا سحبتها للخارج مجددًا، تستعيد حجمها السابق.","Grab window A…":"أمسك النافذة A…","Grid":"شبكة","Halves":"نصفان","Hiding":"الإخفاء","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"الإمساك عند الحافة لملء المساحة الحرة","Hold time":"مدة الإمساك","Hold to fill":"الإمساك للملء","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"مدى اقتراب الحافة قبل أن تستقر في مكانها.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"مدى اقتراب المؤشر من الحافة.","How far the bar slides down":"مقدار نزول الشريط","How it works":"كيف يعمل","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"المدة التي يجب أن تستند فيها النافذة إلى الحافة – دفعة صغيرة. 0 = فورًا.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"المدة التي يجب أن تبقى فيها النافذة عند الحافة قبل أن تكبر.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"عدد النوافذ التي تتشارك المنطقة الرئيسية (التخطيط «رئيسية وكومة»).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"إذا كانت هناك نافذة في الأسفل، تعطي الحافة العلوية النصف العلوي بدل التكبير. الأنصاف والأرباع أيضًا لا تغطي النوافذ الملتقطة.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"إن أعجبك KSnapUnity يمكنك دعم تطويره – شكرًا!","In bar":"في الشريط","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"مستقل عن الشريط وحواف الشاشة.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"مستقل عن الشريط. يمكن تشغيل كل حافة على حدة.","Information":"معلومات","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"سلوك نوافذ طبيعي وبديهي.","Join at the end":"تنضم في النهاية","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K لـ KWin · Snap لالتقاط أذكى · Unity لكل شيء في نظام واحد","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"لدى KDE إجراءات حواف الشاشة والتقاط النوافذ الخاصة به. إذا كانت الميزة نفسها مفعّلة هنا، فأوقف ميزة KDE: إعدادات النظام ← إدارة النوافذ ← حواف الشاشة، وسلوك النوافذ ← التحريك.","KDE's own edge tiling":"تجانب الحواف الخاص بـ KDE","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"التكبير والترتيب الخاصان بـ KDE عند حواف الشاشة – مع إطاره – يتوقفان أثناء عمل KSnapUnity، فتظهر معاينة واحدة فقط. إعدادات KDE لا تتغير: أوقف هذا أو عطّل KSnapUnity أو أزله فيعود سلوك KDE.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"لا تزال إجراءات حواف الشاشة الخاصة بـ KDE مفعّلة، لذا يستجيب مساعدان للسحب نفسه. أوقف „تكبير“ و„تجانب“ في إعدادات النظام ← إدارة النوافذ ← حواف الشاشة.","KDE's own window snapping":"التقاط النوافذ الخاص بـ KDE","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"التقاط النوافذ الخاص بـ KDE مفعّل أيضًا. لإحساس متسق، اضبط مناطقه على „لا شيء“ في إعدادات النظام ← إدارة النوافذ ← سلوك النوافذ ← التحريك.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"لم تستجب خدمة اختصارات KDE. لا يزال بإمكانك تعيين المفاتيح في إعدادات النظام ← الاختصارات ← KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – محرر الإعدادات","Keep stacked windows in line":"إبقاء النوافذ المكدّسة على خط واحد","Keep the gap between windows":"الحفاظ على المسافة بين النوافذ","Keep them":"الإبقاء عليها","Key scheme":"مخطط المفاتيح","Keyboard shortcuts":"اختصارات لوحة المفاتيح","Keys":"المفاتيح","Keys already in use":"مفاتيح مستخدمة بالفعل","Layout":"التخطيط","Layout by number of windows":"التخطيط حسب عدد النوافذ","Layouts":"التخطيطات","Layouts per row":"التخطيطات في كل صف","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"الحافتان اليسرى واليمنى: نصف الشاشة","Left edge: left half":"الحافة اليسرى: النصف الأيسر","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"أقل من 100 % يبقي النافذة الوحيدة في المنتصف – جميل على الشاشات العريضة.","License":"الترخيص","Light":"فاتح","Linear":"خطي","Live preview":"معاينة حية","Load template…":"تحميل قالب…","Magnet":"المغناطيس","Main + stack":"رئيسي + مكدّس","Main and stack":"رئيسية وكومة","Main area bigger":"تكبير المنطقة الرئيسية","Main area on the right":"المنطقة الرئيسية على اليمين","Main area smaller":"تصغير المنطقة الرئيسية","Main in the middle":"رئيسية في الوسط","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"المفتاح الرئيسي للسحب والمفاتيح.","Main window":"النافذة الرئيسية","Main windows":"النوافذ الرئيسية","Main windows: %1":"النوافذ الرئيسية: %1","Make it the main window":"اجعلها النافذة الرئيسية","Maximize":"تكبير","Maximize or restore":"تكبير أو استعادة","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + مفتاح (نمط KDE)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + مفتاح","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + مفتاح","Minimize":"تصغير","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"يعكس التخطيط: النافذة الرئيسية على اليمين والأخرى على اليسار.","Mode":"الوضع","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"الوضع 1 – الشريط وحواف الشاشة","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"الوضع 2 – الترتيب التلقائي","Modes":"الأوضاع","More ways":"طرق أخرى","Motion curve":"منحنى الحركة","Move a window towards others…":"حرّك نافذة نحو نوافذ أخرى…","Move the window one place back":"انقل النافذة مكانًا للخلف","Move the window one place on":"انقل النافذة مكانًا للأمام","Name:":"الاسم:","New layout":"تخطيط جديد","New windows":"النوافذ الجديدة","Next tiling layout":"التخطيط التالي","Next to the active window":"بجانب النافذة النشطة","No key":"لا مفتاح","No other window open":"لا توجد نافذة أخرى مفتوحة","No outer margin":"بلا هامش خارجي","No shortcuts":"بدون اختصارات","None":"لا شيء","None yet.":"لا شيء بعد.","Off":"إيقاف","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"متوقف = الوضع 1، مفعّل = الوضع 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"إيقاف: إطار محايد – للمعاينات المفعّلة فقط.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"إيقاف: تبقى المفاتيح معيّنة لكنها لا تفعل شيئًا.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"متوقف: تبقى النوافذ حيث تضعها. تعمل الميزات الأخرى في الحالتين.","One at a time":"واحدة تلو الأخرى","One closes – the others fill the gap":"تُغلق واحدة – وتملأ الأخرى الفراغ","One main window less":"نافذة رئيسية أقل","One more main window":"نافذة رئيسية إضافية","One window":"نافذة واحدة","Only one mode is switched on.":"وضع واحد فقط مفعّل.","Open settings editor":"افتح محرر الإعدادات","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"افتح التطبيق أولًا ثم اختره هنا.","Open the layout builder":"افتح منشئ التخطيطات","Own layouts":"تخطيطات خاصة","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"الجزء من كل جانب الذي يُعد زاوية.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"إيقاف تجانب الحواف في KDE ومعاينته مؤقتًا","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"إيقاف مناطق الالتقاط في KDE مؤقتًا ما دام المغناطيس مفعّلًا","Preview":"معاينة","Previews":"المعاينات","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"ادفع النافذة نحو حافة الشاشة أو زاويتها فتملأ ذلك الجزء. يعمل مع الشريط أو بدونه.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"ادفع النافذة نحو حافة أو زاوية: تكبير، أنصاف، أرباع.","Push delay":"تأخير الدفع","Quarters":"الأرباع","Quick":"سريع","Quick settings":"إعدادات سريعة","Recommended values":"القيم الموصى بها","Remove":"إزالة","Remove rule":"إزالة القاعدة","Remove zone":"إزالة المنطقة","Reset all":"إعادة تعيين الكل","Reset all keys":"إعادة تعيين كل المفاتيح","Reset to default":"استعادة الافتراضي","Resistance against overlapping":"مقاومة التداخل","Resize touching windows together":"تغيير حجم النوافذ المتلامسة معًا","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"تغيير الحجم يلتقط أيضًا – هنا إلى الارتفاع الكامل","Restore":"استعادة","Restore default layouts":"استعادة التخطيطات الافتراضية","Restore default layouts?":"استعادة التخطيطات الافتراضية؟","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"استعادة الحجم الأصلي عند سحب النافذة للخارج","Restore the size before snapping":"استعادة الحجم قبل الالتقاط","Rows":"صفوف","Save":"حفظ","Screen edges":"حواف الشاشة","Screen edges on/off":"تشغيل/إيقاف حواف الشاشة","Screen edges preview":"معاينة حواف الشاشة","Set":"تعيين","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"يعيّن مفاتيح جميع الإجراءات دفعة واحدة. لا يزال بإمكانك تغيير المفاتيح منفردة في الأسفل.","Settings":"الإعدادات","Settings file":"ملف الإعدادات","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"أثناء تغيير الحجم هزّ الفأرة بسرعة ذهابًا وإيابًا فتعود النوافذ الأخرى. السحب السريع في اتجاه واحد لا يحررها أبدًا.","Shake to let go":"هزّ للتحرير","Shortcuts":"الاختصارات","Show a small handle first":"إظهار مقبض صغير أولًا","Show layout and zone names":"إظهار أسماء التخطيطات والمناطق","Show previews in the accent color":"عرض المعاينات بلون التمييز","Showing":"الإظهار","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"تُظهر أين ستستقر النافذة عند حافة أو زاوية. إيقاف: لا معاينة إطلاقًا.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"تُظهر أين ستستقر النافذة ما دامت منطقة من الشريط مُبرزة. إيقاف: لا معاينة إطلاقًا.","Sidebar + grid":"شريط جانبي + شبكة","Single zone":"منطقة واحدة","Six tiles":"ستة مربعات","Size & shape":"الحجم والشكل","Size of the main area":"حجم المنطقة الرئيسية","Slide-in duration":"مدة الانزلاق للداخل","Slide-out duration":"مدة الانزلاق للخارج","Smart arranging and detection.":"ترتيب واكتشاف ذكيان.","Smart fill":"الملء الذكي","Smooth (default)":"سلس (افتراضي)","Snap bar":"الشريط","Snap bar and screen edges":"الشريط وحواف الشاشة","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"الشريط وحواف الشاشة متوقفة – يعمل الوضع 2 فقط واختصار الوضع لا يفعل شيئًا.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"الشريط وحواف الشاشة يعيقان الترتيب التلقائي، لذا يعملان كوضعين – بدّل بينهما بالاختصار أو من هنا.","Snap bar colors:":"ألوان الشريط:","Snap bar on/off":"تشغيل/إيقاف الشريط","Snap bar preview":"معاينة الشريط","Snap bar size":"حجم الشريط","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"الشريط، حواف الشاشة، مغناطيس النوافذ، الاختصارات وتبديل النوافذ.","Snap distance":"مسافة الالتقاط","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"التصاق الفواصل (¼، ⅓، ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"تخطيطات الالتقاط والترتيب التلقائي.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"التقط النافذة النشطة باستخدام تركيبات المفاتيح.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"التقط النافذة النشطة بلوحة المفاتيح. هذه اختصارات KDE العامة المعتادة – تجدها أيضًا في إعدادات النظام ← الاختصارات ← KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"التقاط إلى النصف السفلي","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"التقاط إلى الربع السفلي الأيسر","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"التقاط إلى الربع السفلي الأيمن","Snap to the center third":"التقاط إلى الثلث الأوسط","Snap to the left half":"التقاط إلى النصف الأيسر","Snap to the left third":"التقاط إلى الثلث الأيسر","Snap to the left two thirds":"التقاط إلى الثلثين الأيسرين","Snap to the right half":"التقاط إلى النصف الأيمن","Snap to the right third":"التقاط إلى الثلث الأيمن","Snap to the right two thirds":"التقاط إلى الثلثين الأيمنين","Snap to the top half":"التقاط إلى النصف العلوي","Snap to the top-left quarter":"التقاط إلى الربع العلوي الأيسر","Snap to the top-right quarter":"التقاط إلى الربع العلوي الأيمن","Snapping":"الالتصاق","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"الالتقاط والترتيب التلقائي يعملان كوضعين – اختصار واحد يبدّل بينهما.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"هكذا يجذب مغناطيس واحد فقط النافذة. إعدادات KDE لا تتغير: أوقف هذا أو عطّل KSnapUnity أو أزله فيعود التقاط KDE.","Soft":"ناعم","Spacing":"المسافات","Spiral":"حلزون","Split side by side":"تقسيم جنبًا إلى جنب","Split top and bottom":"تقسيم أعلى وأسفل","Stack + main":"مكدّس + رئيسي","Stick to other windows":"الالتصاق بالنوافذ الأخرى","Stick to the screen edges":"الالتصاق بحواف الشاشة","Sticky edges":"الحواف اللاصقة","Support KSnapUnity":"ادعم KSnapUnity","Swap":"تبديل","Swap windows":"تبديل النوافذ","Swap with the window above":"تبديل مع النافذة العليا","Swap with the window below":"تبديل مع النافذة السفلى","Swap with the window on the left":"تبديل مع النافذة اليسرى","Swap with the window on the right":"تبديل مع النافذة اليمنى","Switch mode":"تبديل الوضع","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"تبديل الوضع (الالتقاط / الترتيب)","Switch modes with:":"تبديل الوضع بـ:","Switch the layout by itself":"بدّل التخطيط تلقائيًا","Switched off":"متوقف","System":"النظام","Take it over":"الاستحواذ عليه","Take over all":"الاستحواذ على الكل","Take the main place":"تأخذ المكان الرئيسي","Test animation":"تجربة الحركة","Test on screen":"تجربة على الشاشة","Test the snap bar":"تجربة الشريط","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"القيم الافتراضية مبنية على Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"تستخدم إجراءات الالتقاط المسافات نفسها التي يستخدمها الشريط وتتذكر الحجم قبل الالتقاط: „استعادة الحجم قبل الالتقاط“ يعيده.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"هذه التطبيقات لا تُرتَّب أبدًا وتحتفظ بمكانها. مربعات الحوار تطفو دائمًا.","Thirds":"الأثلاث","Three columns":"ثلاثة أعمدة","Thumbnail width":"عرض الصور المصغرة","Tiling":"الترتيب","Tip":"تلميح","Top / bottom":"أعلى / أسفل","Top edge":"الحافة العلوية","Top edge: full screen":"الحافة العلوية: ملء الشاشة","Top edge: maximize":"الحافة العلوية: تكبير","Top edge: top half":"الحافة العلوية: النصف العلوي","Top half":"النصف العلوي","Trigger distance from the top edge":"مسافة التفعيل من الحافة العلوية","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"أوقف هذا إن كنت تفضّل حدود KDE الخاصة – ثم أوقف معاينة حواف الشاشة في الأعلى.","Two thirds":"ثلثان","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"نافذتان تتبادلان المكان – أسقط إحداهما على الأخرى أو استخدم المفاتيح.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"نافذتان تتبادلان المكان: أسقط إحداهما على الأخرى، أو بمفتاح.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"استخدام اختصارات لوحة المفاتيح","Use screen edges":"استخدام حواف الشاشة","Use the system accent color":"استخدام لون التمييز الخاص بالنظام","Use the window magnet":"استخدام مغناطيس النوافذ","Usual combinations":"تركيبات شائعة","Version":"الإصدار","Wanted for: %1":"مطلوب لـ: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"عند فتح نافذة أو إغلاقها أو تبديلها تتحرك الأخرى بسلاسة بدل القفز.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"عند تغيير حجم نافذة، تحرّك النوافذ الملامسة لها حافتها المشتركة معها – لا تداخل ولا فجوة.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"أثناء تغيير الحجم تظهر النوافذ التي لا تتبع شفافة.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"أثناء تحريك النافذة أو تغيير حجمها، تلتصق حوافها بالنوافذ القريبة وبحواف الشاشة.","Width":"العرض","Window":"النافذة","Window magnet":"مغناطيس النوافذ","Window magnet on/off":"تشغيل/إيقاف مغناطيس النوافذ","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"النوافذ فوق بعضها تُبقي حوافها اليسرى واليمنى معًا، والنوافذ المتجاورة حوافها العليا والسفلى.","Windows glide to their place":"النوافذ تنزلق إلى مكانها","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"تلتصق النوافذ ببعضها وبحواف الشاشة.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"تتوقف النوافذ عند „المسافة بين النوافذ“ من صفحة عام بدل أن تتلامس.","Yes":"نعم","Your own combination":"تركيبتك الخاصة","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"ستفقد تخطيطاتك الخاصة وترتيبها.","Zone %1":"المنطقة %1","for KWin · v%1":"لـ KWin · الإصدار %1","windows:":"نوافذ:","“%1” will be removed.":"ستتم إزالة «%1».","…drag it onto window B…":"…اسحبها فوق النافذة B…","…in every direction":"…في كل اتجاه","…let go: they trade places":"…أفلت: تتبادلان المكانين","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…فتكبر النوافذ المجاورة وتصغر معها","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ جاهز – انقر موافق لفتح محرر الإعدادات."},"be":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (копія)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 выкарыстоўвае «%2».","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 з %2 зон","0 = all in one row":"0 = усе ў адным радку","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Рэжым 1</b><br/>Панэль прыліпання і краі экрана","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Рэжым 2</b><br/>Аўтаматычная мазаіка","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Адзінае акно займае ўвесь экран, нават калі зададзены водступ.","A new window joins":"Далучаецца новае акно","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Кароткі штуршок дае палову ці чвэрць. Патрымайце акно ля краю крыху даўжэй, і яно вырасце да наступнага акна – прагляд гэта пакажа.","A single window":"Адно акно","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Акно спыняецца каля краю іншага, нават калі рухаць яго хутка. Страсяніце мыш або націскайце яшчэ імгненне, каб адпусціць. 0 = вокны могуць свабодна перакрывацца.","About & Help":"Пра праграму і даведка","Accent color":"Акцэнтны колер","Active":"Уключана","Active mode":"Актыўны рэжым","Active width along the top edge":"Актыўная шырыня ўздоўж верхняга краю","Add an open application":"Дадаць адкрытую праграму","Add rule":"Дадаць правіла","All window features in one system.":"Усе функцыі вокнаў у адной сістэме.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Мяняецца і тады, калі вы ўручную мяняеце памер галоўнага акна.","Also while resizing":"Таксама пры змене памеру","Always floating":"Заўсёды вольныя","Animation":"Анімацыя","Appearance":"Выгляд","Apply":"Ужыць","Arrange windows":"Размяшчэнне вокнаў","Arrange windows automatically":"Размяшчаць вокны аўтаматычна","Author":"Аўтар","Automatic tiling":"Аўтаматычная мазаіка","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Аўтаматычная мазаіка выключана – працуе толькі рэжым 1, і клавіша рэжыму нічога не робіць.","Automatic tiling off":"Аўтаматычная мазаіка выключана","Automatic tiling on":"Аўтаматычная мазаіка ўключана","Automatic tiling on/off":"Аўтаматычная мазаіка ўкл./выкл.","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Аўтаматычная мазаіка, абмен вокнаў, спалучэнні клавіш і магніт для вольных вокнаў.","Background opacity":"Непразрыстасць фону","Behavior & Animation":"Паводзіны і анімацыя","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Ніжні край: ніжняя палова","Bouncy":"Спружыністая","Buy me a coffee":"Пачастуйце мяне кавай","Cancel":"Скасаваць","Center focus":"Фокус у цэнтры","Center the window":"Акно па цэнтры","Change":"Змяніць","Change key":"Змяніць клавішу","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Клавішу можна змяніць у рэдактары налад. Абодва рэжымы патрабуюць аўтаматычнай мазаікі і панэлі або краёў экрана.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Змяніць іх можна на старонцы «Спалучэнні клавіш». Пры аўтаматычнай мазаіцы вокны таксама мяняюцца месцамі ў парадку.","Choose…":"Выбраць…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Пстрыкніце зону, каб выбраць яе · падвойная пстрычка дзеліць · перацягвайце раздзяляльнікі","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Націсніце сюды або %1, каб пераключыць рэжым.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Націсніце, потым OK – адкрыецца рэдактар налад.","Close":"Закрыць","Close by, the edges stick together":"Побач краі прыліпаюць","Color scheme":"Схема колераў","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Колеры, памер і форма панэлі.","Columns":"Слупкі","Corner radius":"Радыус вуглоў","Corner size":"Памер вуглоў","Corner: a quarter":"Кут: чвэрць","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Куты: чвэрць экрана","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + клавіша (па змаўчанні)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + лічбавы блок","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + клавіша","Custom color":"Свой колер","Custom layout %1":"Свая раскладка %1","Dark":"Цёмная","Delay before hiding":"Затрымка перад хаваннем","Delay before showing":"Затрымка перад з’яўленнем","Delete":"Выдаліць","Delete layout?":"Выдаліць раскладку?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Адлегласць, на якой з’яўляецца язычок","Distance before the bar hides again":"Адлегласць, пасля якой панэль зноў хаваецца","Distance to the edge":"Адлегласць да краю","Donate with PayPal":"Ахвяраваць праз PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"Цягніце агульны край…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Перацягніце акно да краю…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Перацягніце акно на іншае, каб памяняць іх. Апусціце на панэль або край экрана – і яно вольнае; «Вызваліць акно» вяртае яго. Прамежкі – на старонцы «Агульныя».","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Перацягніце акно на сярэдзіну іншага – прагляд пакажа дзве стрэлкі – і адпусціце. Пры аўтаматычнай мазаіцы дастаткова любога месца над іншым акном.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Перацягніце акно да верхняга краю экрана і адпусціце яго на зоне.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Перацягвайце карткі, каб змяніць парадак на панэлі. Двойчы пстрыкніце картку, каб змяніць яе.","Drop a window onto another one":"Кінуць акно на іншае","Drop the window onto a zone":"Адпусціце акно на зоне","Duplicate":"Дубляваць","Duration":"Працягласць","Dwindle":"Спіраль-выцяжка","Dynamic":"Дынамічная","Edges and corners":"Краі і куты","Edit":"Змяніць","Edit layout":"Змяніць раскладку","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Кожную функцыю можна ўключаць і выключаць асобна.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Кожная раскладка са старонкі «Раскладкі» можа і размяшчаць вокны – яна з’яўляецца вышэй. Акно 1 займае зону 1 і г. д.; лішнія вокны дзеляць апошнюю зону. Калі вокнаў менш, чым зон, ужываецца «Галоўнае і стос», каб не было дзірак.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Кожнае акно само знаходзіць сваё месца, як у мазаічным кіраўніку вокнаў.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Кожнае акно само знаходзіць сваё месца на экране. Новыя вокны становяцца ў рад, закрытыя вызваляюць месца для астатніх.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Прыклад: два вокны побач, з трох – галоўнае і стос, з пяці – сетка. Без правіла ўжываецца выбраная вышэй раскладка.","Fade in and out":"Плаўнае з’яўленне і знікненне","Fade the other windows":"Прыглушаць іншыя вокны","Features":"Функцыі","Feel":"Адчуванне","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Падладжвацца пад ужо прымацаваныя вокны","Fits the way you work.":"Падладжваецца пад ваш спосаб працы.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Вызваліць акно (выйсці з мазаікі)","Four quarters":"Чатыры чвэрці","From":"Ад","Fullscreen":"Поўнаэкранны рэжым","Gap between windows":"Адступ паміж вокнамі","Gap to the screen edge":"Адступ ад краю экрана","General":"Агульныя","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Зноў дае кожнаму дзеянню клавішу выбранай схемы і выдаляе клавішы, якіх у схеме няма.","Good to know":"Карысна ведаць","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Вазьміце акно за загаловак і пацягніце ўверх. Панэль апускаецца; адпусціце акно на зоне — і яно зойме менавіта гэтую вобласць. Калі зноў выцягнуць яго, яно верне ранейшы памер.","Grab window A…":"Вазьміце акно A…","Grid":"Сетка","Halves":"Паловы","Hiding":"Хаванне","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Утрымліваць ля краю, каб запоўніць вольнае месца","Hold time":"Час утрымання","Hold to fill":"Утрымліваць для запаўнення","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Наколькі блізка мусіць падысці край, перш чым стаць на месца.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Наколькі блізка да краю мусіць падысці ўказальнік.","How far the bar slides down":"Наколькі апускаецца панэль","How it works":"Як гэта працуе","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Колькі акно мусіць пабыць ля краю — невялікі штуршок. 0 = адразу.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Колькі акно павінна прабыць ля краю, перш чым вырасці.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Колькі вокнаў дзеляць галоўную вобласць (раскладка «Галоўнае і стос»).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Калі ўнізе ўжо ёсць акно, верхні край дае верхнюю палову замест разгортвання. Паловы і чвэрці таксама пакідаюць прымацаваныя вокны вольнымі.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Калі вам падабаецца KSnapUnity, можаце падтрымаць распрацоўку – дзякуй!","In bar":"На панэлі","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Не залежыць ад панэлі і краёў экрана.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Не залежыць ад панэлі. Кожны край уключаецца асобна.","Information":"Інфармацыя","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Інтуітыўныя, натуральныя паводзіны вокнаў.","Join at the end":"Становяцца ў канец","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K – KWin · Snap – разумнае прыліпанне · Unity – усё ў адной сістэме","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"У KDE ёсць свае дзеянні краёў экрана і сваё прыліпанне вокнаў. Калі тут уключана тая ж функцыя, выключыце функцыю KDE: Налады сістэмы → Кіраванне вокнамі → Краі экрана, а таксама Паводзіны вокнаў → Перамяшчэнне.","KDE's own edge tiling":"Уласная мазаіка краёў KDE","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"Уласнае разгортванне і мазаіка KDE на краях экрана – з контурам – прыпыняюцца, пакуль працуе KSnapUnity, каб быў адзін прагляд. Налады KDE не мяняюцца: выключыце гэта, адключыце або выдаліце KSnapUnity, і паводзіны KDE вернуцца.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"Уласныя дзеянні краёў экрана KDE яшчэ ўключаны, таму на адно і тое ж перацягванне рэагуюць два памочнікі. Выключыце «Разгарнуць» і «Плітка» ў Налады сістэмы → Кіраванне вокнамі → Краі экрана.","KDE's own window snapping":"Уласная прывязка вокнаў KDE","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"Уласнае прыліпанне вокнаў KDE таксама ўключана. Для аднастайнасці задайце яго зонам значэнне «Няма» ў Налады сістэмы → Кіраванне вокнамі → Паводзіны вокнаў → Перамяшчэнне.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Служба спалучэнняў клавіш KDE не адказала. Клавішы ўсё роўна можна задаць у Налады сістэмы → Спалучэнні клавіш → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – рэдактар налад","Keep stacked windows in line":"Трымаць вокны ў слупку ў адну лінію","Keep the gap between windows":"Захоўваць адступ паміж вокнамі","Keep them":"Пакінуць","Key scheme":"Схема клавіш","Keyboard shortcuts":"Спалучэнні клавіш","Keys":"Клавішы","Keys already in use":"Ужо занятыя клавішы","Layout":"Раскладка","Layout by number of windows":"Раскладка па колькасці вокнаў","Layouts":"Раскладкі","Layouts per row":"Раскладак у радку","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Левы і правы край: палова экрана","Left edge: left half":"Левы край: левая палова","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Менш за 100 % трымае адзінае акно па цэнтры – зручна на шырокіх экранах.","License":"Ліцэнзія","Light":"Светлая","Linear":"Лінейная","Live preview":"Жывы прагляд","Load template…":"Загрузіць шаблон…","Magnet":"Магніт","Main + stack":"Галоўнае + стос","Main and stack":"Галоўнае і стос","Main area bigger":"Большая галоўная вобласць","Main area on the right":"Галоўная вобласць справа","Main area smaller":"Меншая галоўная вобласць","Main in the middle":"Галоўнае ў цэнтры","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Галоўны перамыкач для перацягвання і клавіш.","Main window":"Галоўнае акно","Main windows":"Галоўныя вокны","Main windows: %1":"Галоўных вокнаў: %1","Make it the main window":"Зрабіць галоўным акном","Maximize":"Разгарнуць","Maximize or restore":"Разгарнуць або аднавіць","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + клавіша (стыль KDE)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + клавіша","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + клавіша","Minimize":"Згарнуць","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Адлюстроўвае раскладку: галоўнае акно справа, астатнія злева.","Mode":"Рэжым","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Рэжым 1 – панэль прыліпання і краі экрана","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Рэжым 2 – аўтаматычная мазаіка","Modes":"Рэжымы","More ways":"Іншыя спосабы","Motion curve":"Крывая руху","Move a window towards others…":"Рухайце акно да іншых…","Move the window one place back":"Перамясціць акно на месца назад","Move the window one place on":"Перамясціць акно на месца наперад","Name:":"Назва:","New layout":"Новая раскладка","New windows":"Новыя вокны","Next tiling layout":"Наступная раскладка мазаікі","Next to the active window":"Побач з актыўным акном","No key":"Няма клавішы","No other window open":"Іншых вокнаў няма","No outer margin":"Без вонкавага водступу","No shortcuts":"Без спалучэнняў","None":"Няма","None yet.":"Пакуль няма.","Off":"Выключана","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Выкл. = рэжым 1, укл. = рэжым 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Выкл.: нейтральная рамка – толькі для ўключаных праглядаў.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Выключана: клавішы застаюцца прызначанымі, але нічога не робяць.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Выкл.: вокны застаюцца там, куды вы іх паклалі. Астатнія функцыі працуюць у любым выпадку.","One at a time":"Па адным","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Адно закрываецца – астатнія запаўняюць прабел","One main window less":"На адно галоўнае акно менш","One more main window":"Яшчэ адно галоўнае акно","One window":"Адно акно","Only one mode is switched on.":"Уключаны толькі адзін рэжым.","Open settings editor":"Адкрыць рэдактар налад","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Спачатку адкрыйце праграму, потым выберыце яе тут.","Open the layout builder":"Адкрыць канструктар раскладак","Own layouts":"Уласныя раскладкі","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Частка кожнага боку, якая лічыцца вуглом.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Прыпыніць мазаіку краёў KDE і яе прагляд","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Прыпыняць зоны прывязкі KDE, пакуль магніт уключаны","Preview":"Папярэдні прагляд","Previews":"Папярэдні прагляд","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Прыцісніце акно да краю ці кута экрана, і яно запоўніць гэтую частку. Працуе з панэллю і без яе.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Прыцісніце акно да краю ці кута: разгарнуць, паловы, чвэрці.","Push delay":"Затрымка прыціскання","Quarters":"Чвэрці","Quick":"Хуткая","Quick settings":"Хуткія налады","Recommended values":"Рэкамендаваныя значэнні","Remove":"Выдаліць","Remove rule":"Выдаліць правіла","Remove zone":"Выдаліць зону","Reset all":"Скінуць усё","Reset all keys":"Скінуць усе клавішы","Reset to default":"Скінуць да прадвызначанага","Resistance against overlapping":"Супраціў перакрыццю","Resize touching windows together":"Змяняць памер дотыкальных вокнаў разам","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Змена памеру таксама прыліпае – тут на ўсю вышыню","Restore":"Аднавіць","Restore default layouts":"Аднавіць стандартныя раскладкі","Restore default layouts?":"Аднавіць стандартныя раскладкі?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Аднаўляць першапачатковы памер, калі акно выцягваюць","Restore the size before snapping":"Вярнуць памер да прымацавання","Rows":"Радкі","Save":"Захаваць","Screen edges":"Краі экрана","Screen edges on/off":"Краі экрана укл./выкл.","Screen edges preview":"Папярэдні прагляд краёў экрана","Set":"Задаць","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Задае клавішы ўсіх дзеянняў адразу. Асобныя клавішы можна па-ранейшаму мяняць ніжэй.","Settings":"Налады","Settings file":"Файл налад","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Падчас змены памеру хутка страсяніце мыш туды-сюды, і астатнія вокны вернуцца. Хуткі рывок у адзін бок ніколі іх не адпускае.","Shake to let go":"Страсянуць, каб адпусціць","Shortcuts":"Спалучэнні","Show a small handle first":"Спачатку паказваць маленькі язычок","Show layout and zone names":"Паказваць назвы раскладак і зон","Show previews in the accent color":"Паказваць папярэдні прагляд акцэнтным колерам","Showing":"З’яўленне","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Паказвае, куды трапіць акно ля краю ці ў куце. Выкл.: ніякага прагляду.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Паказвае, куды трапіць акно, пакуль зона панэлі вылучана. Выкл.: ніякага прагляду.","Sidebar + grid":"Бакавая панэль + сетка","Single zone":"Адна зона","Six tiles":"Шэсць плітак","Size & shape":"Памер і форма","Size of the main area":"Памер галоўнай вобласці","Slide-in duration":"Працягласць выезду","Slide-out duration":"Працягласць хавання","Smart arranging and detection.":"Разумнае размяшчэнне і распазнаванне.","Smart fill":"Разумнае запаўненне","Smooth (default)":"Плаўная (прадвызначана)","Snap bar":"Панэль прыліпання","Snap bar and screen edges":"Панэль прыліпання і краі экрана","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Панэль і краі экрана выключаны – працуе толькі рэжым 2, і клавіша рэжыму нічога не робіць.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Панэль і краі экрана замінаюць аўтаматычнай мазаіцы. Таму яны працуюць як два рэжымы – пераключайце спалучэннем клавіш або тут.","Snap bar colors:":"Колеры панэлі:","Snap bar on/off":"Панэль укл./выкл.","Snap bar preview":"Папярэдні прагляд панэлі прывязкі","Snap bar size":"Памер панэлі","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Панэль прыліпання, краі экрана, магніт вокнаў, спалучэнні клавіш і абмен вокнаў.","Snap distance":"Адлегласць прыліпання","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Прыліпанне раздзяляльнікаў (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Макеты прыліпання і аўтаматычная мазаіка.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Прымацоўвайце актыўнае акно спалучэннямі клавіш.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Прымацоўвайце актыўнае акно з клавіятуры. Гэта звычайныя глабальныя спалучэнні клавіш KDE — іх таксама можна знайсці ў Налады сістэмы → Спалучэнні клавіш → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Прымацаваць да ніжняй паловы","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Прымацаваць да ніжняй левай чвэрці","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Прымацаваць да ніжняй правай чвэрці","Snap to the center third":"Прымацаваць да сярэдняй трэці","Snap to the left half":"Прымацаваць да левай паловы","Snap to the left third":"Прымацаваць да левай трэці","Snap to the left two thirds":"Прымацаваць да левых дзвюх трэцяў","Snap to the right half":"Прымацаваць да правай паловы","Snap to the right third":"Прымацаваць да правай трэці","Snap to the right two thirds":"Прымацаваць да правых дзвюх трэцяў","Snap to the top half":"Прымацаваць да верхняй паловы","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Прымацаваць да верхняй левай чвэрці","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Прымацаваць да верхняй правай чвэрці","Snapping":"Прыліпанне","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Прыліпанне і аўтаматычная мазаіка працуюць як два рэжымы – адна клавіша пераключае.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Так акно цягне толькі адзін магніт. Налады KDE не мяняюцца: выключыце гэта, адключыце або выдаліце KSnapUnity, і прыліпанне KDE вернецца.","Soft":"Мяккая","Spacing":"Адступы","Spiral":"Спіраль","Split side by side":"Падзяліць побач","Split top and bottom":"Падзяліць зверху і знізу","Stack + main":"Стос + галоўнае","Stick to other windows":"Прыліпаць да іншых вокнаў","Stick to the screen edges":"Прыліпаць да краёў экрана","Sticky edges":"Ліпкія краі","Support KSnapUnity":"Падтрымаць KSnapUnity","Swap":"Абмен","Swap windows":"Абмен вокнаў","Swap with the window above":"Памяняць з акном зверху","Swap with the window below":"Памяняць з акном знізу","Swap with the window on the left":"Памяняць з акном злева","Swap with the window on the right":"Памяняць з акном справа","Switch mode":"Пераключыць рэжым","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Пераключыць рэжым (прыліпанне / мазаіка)","Switch modes with:":"Пераключэнне рэжымаў:","Switch the layout by itself":"Мяняць раскладку самастойна","Switched off":"Выключана","System":"Сістэмная","Take it over":"Забраць","Take over all":"Забраць усе","Take the main place":"Займаюць галоўнае месца","Test animation":"Праверыць анімацыю","Test on screen":"Праверыць на экране","Test the snap bar":"Праверыць панэль","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Прадвызначаныя значэнні заснаваны на Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Дзеянні прыліпання выкарыстоўваюць тыя ж адступы, што і панэль, і запамінаюць памер да прымацавання: «Вярнуць памер да прымацавання» аднаўляе яго.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Гэтыя праграмы ніколі не размяшчаюцца і застаюцца на сваім месцы. Дыялогі заўсёды вольныя.","Thirds":"Трэці","Three columns":"Тры слупкі","Thumbnail width":"Шырыня мініяцюр","Tiling":"Мазаіка","Tip":"Парада","Top / bottom":"Зверху / знізу","Top edge":"Верхні край","Top edge: full screen":"Верхні край: на ўвесь экран","Top edge: maximize":"Верхні край: разгарнуць","Top edge: top half":"Верхні край: верхняя палова","Top half":"Верхняя палова","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Адлегласць спрацоўвання ад верхняга краю","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Выключыце, калі вам больш падабаецца контур KDE, – тады выключыце вышэй прагляд краёў экрана.","Two thirds":"Дзве траціны","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Два вокны мяняюцца месцамі – апусціце адно на другое або карыстайцеся клавішамі.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Два вокны мяняюцца месцамі: апусціце адно на другое або клавішай.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Выкарыстоўваць спалучэнні клавіш","Use screen edges":"Выкарыстоўваць краі экрана","Use the system accent color":"Выкарыстоўваць сістэмны акцэнтны колер","Use the window magnet":"Выкарыстоўваць магніт вокнаў","Usual combinations":"Звычайныя спалучэнні","Version":"Версія","Wanted for: %1":"Патрэбна для: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Калі акно адкрываецца, закрываецца або мяняецца, астатнія рухаюцца плаўна, а не скачуць.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Калі вы змяняеце памер акна, вокны, што яго датыкаюцца, рухаюць агульны край разам з ім – нічога не перакрываецца, шчылін няма.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Падчас змены памеру вокны, якія не рухаюцца разам, становяцца празрыстымі.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Пакуль вы перамяшчаеце акно ці мяняеце яго памер, яго краі прыліпаюць да суседніх вокнаў і да краёў экрана.","Width":"Шырыня","Window":"Акно","Window magnet":"Магніт вокнаў","Window magnet on/off":"Магніт вокнаў укл./выкл.","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Вокны адно над адным трымаюць левыя і правыя краі разам, вокны побач – верхнія і ніжнія.","Windows glide to their place":"Вокны плаўна едуць на месца","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Вокны прыліпаюць адно да аднаго і да краёў экрана.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Вокны спыняюцца на «Адступ паміж вокнамі» са старонкі «Агульныя», а не дакранаюцца.","Yes":"Так","Your own combination":"Уласнае спалучэнне","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Вашы раскладкі і іх парадак будуць страчаны.","Zone %1":"Зона %1","for KWin · v%1":"для KWin · v%1","windows:":"вокнаў:","“%1” will be removed.":"«%1» будзе выдалена.","…drag it onto window B…":"…перацягніце на акно B…","…in every direction":"…у любым кірунку","…let go: they trade places":"…адпусціце: яны мяняюцца месцамі","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…суседзі растуць і памяншаюцца разам з ім","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Гатова – націсніце OK, каб адкрыць рэдактар налад."},"bg":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (копие)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 се използва от „%2“.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 от %2 зони","0 = all in one row":"0 = всички на един ред","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Режим 1</b><br/>Лента за прилепване и ръбове на екрана","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Режим 2</b><br/>Автоматично подреждане","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Самотният прозорец заема целия екран, дори при зададено отстояние.","A new window joins":"Нов прозорец се присъединява","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Кратко бутване дава половина или четвърт. Задръжте прозореца при ръба малко по-дълго и той расте до следващия прозорец – прегледът го показва.","A single window":"Един прозорец","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Прозорецът спира на ръба на друг, дори когато го местите бързо. Разклатете мишката или натискайте още миг, за да го пуснете. 0 = прозорците могат свободно да се застъпват.","About & Help":"Относно и помощ","Accent color":"Акцентен цвят","Active":"Активно","Active mode":"Активен режим","Active width along the top edge":"Активна ширина по горния край","Add an open application":"Добави отворена програма","Add rule":"Добави правило","All window features in one system.":"Всички функции за прозорци в една система.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Променя се и когато ръчно промените размера на главния прозорец.","Also while resizing":"И при промяна на размера","Always floating":"Винаги свободни","Animation":"Анимация","Appearance":"Външен вид","Apply":"Прилагане","Arrange windows":"Подреждане на прозорци","Arrange windows automatically":"Автоматично подреждане на прозорците","Author":"Автор","Automatic tiling":"Автоматично подреждане","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Автоматичното подреждане е изключено – работи само режим 1 и клавишът за режим не прави нищо.","Automatic tiling off":"Автоматичното подреждане е изключено","Automatic tiling on":"Автоматичното подреждане е включено","Automatic tiling on/off":"Автоматично подреждане вкл./изкл.","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Автоматично подреждане, размяна на прозорци, клавишни комбинации и магнит за свободни прозорци.","Background opacity":"Непрозрачност на фона","Behavior & Animation":"Поведение и анимация","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Долен ръб: долна половина","Bouncy":"Пружинираща","Buy me a coffee":"Черпи ме кафе","Cancel":"Отказ","Center focus":"Фокус в центъра","Center the window":"Центриране на прозореца","Change":"Промяна","Change key":"Смяна на клавиша","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Клавишът се сменя в редактора на настройките. И двата режима изискват автоматично подреждане и лентата или ръбовете на екрана.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Променете ги на страницата „Клавишни комбинации“. При автоматично подреждане прозорците си разменят и мястото в реда.","Choose…":"Изберете…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Щракнете върху зона, за да я изберете · двойно щракване я разделя · влачете разделителите","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Щракнете или натиснете %1, за да смените режима.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Щракнете, после OK – редакторът на настройките се отваря.","Close":"Затваряне","Close by, the edges stick together":"Наблизо ръбовете се залепват","Color scheme":"Цветова схема","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Цветове, размер и форма на лентата.","Columns":"Колони","Corner radius":"Радиус на ъглите","Corner size":"Размер на ъглите","Corner: a quarter":"Ъгъл: четвъртина","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Ъгли: четвърт от екрана","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + клавиш (по подразбиране)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + цифров блок","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + клавиш","Custom color":"Собствен цвят","Custom layout %1":"Собствена подредба %1","Dark":"Тъмна","Delay before hiding":"Забавяне преди скриване","Delay before showing":"Забавяне преди показване","Delete":"Изтриване","Delete layout?":"Изтриване на подредбата?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Разстояние, при което се появява дръжката","Distance before the bar hides again":"Разстояние, след което лентата се скрива отново","Distance to the edge":"Разстояние до ръба","Donate with PayPal":"Дарете с PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"Дръпнете общ ръб…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Дръпнете прозорец към ръб…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Дръпнете прозорец върху друг, за да ги размените. Пуснат върху лентата или ръб на екрана, той става свободен; „Освободи прозореца“ го връща. Отстоянията са в страницата „Общи“.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Дръпнете прозорец върху средата на друг – прегледът показва две стрелки – и пуснете. При автоматично подреждане стига всяко място над другия прозорец.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Плъзнете прозорец към горния край на екрана и го пуснете върху зона.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Плъзгайте картите, за да промените реда в лентата. Щракнете двукратно върху карта, за да я редактирате.","Drop a window onto another one":"Пускане на прозорец върху друг","Drop the window onto a zone":"Пуснете прозореца върху зона","Duplicate":"Дублиране","Duration":"Продължителност","Dwindle":"Спирала навътре","Dynamic":"Динамична","Edges and corners":"Ръбове и ъгли","Edit":"Редактиране","Edit layout":"Редактиране на подредба","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Всяка функция може да се включва и изключва поотделно.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Всяка подредба от страницата „Подредби“ може и да подрежда прозорци – тя се появява горе. Прозорец 1 взема зона 1 и т.н.; допълнителните делят последната зона. При по-малко прозорци от зони се ползва „Главен и купчина“, за да няма дупки.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Всеки прозорец сам намира мястото си, както в мозаечен мениджър на прозорци.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Всеки прозорец сам намира мястото си на екрана. Новите прозорци се нареждат, затворените правят място на другите.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Пример: два прозореца един до друг, от три главен и купчина, от пет решетка. Без съвпадащо правило важи избраната горе подредба.","Fade in and out":"Избледняване при появяване и изчезване","Fade the other windows":"Затъмняване на другите прозорци","Features":"Функции","Feel":"Усещане","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Нагаждане около вече прилепени прозорци","Fits the way you work.":"Пасва на начина ви на работа.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Освободи прозореца (излез от подреждането)","Four quarters":"Четири четвъртини","From":"От","Fullscreen":"Цял екран","Gap between windows":"Разстояние между прозорците","Gap to the screen edge":"Разстояние до края на екрана","General":"Общи","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Дава на всяко действие отново клавиша от избраната схема и премахва клавиши, които схемата няма.","Good to know":"Добре е да се знае","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Хванете прозорец за заглавната лента и го плъзнете нагоре. Лентата се спуска; пуснете прозореца върху зона и той заема точно тази област. Когато го изтеглите отново, той си връща предишния размер.","Grab window A…":"Хванете прозорец A…","Grid":"Решетка","Halves":"Половини","Hiding":"Скриване","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Задръжте при ръба, за да запълните свободното място","Hold time":"Време на задържане","Hold to fill":"Задръжте за запълване","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Колко близо трябва да стигне ръбът, преди да щракне на място.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Колко близо до ръба трябва да стигне курсорът.","How far the bar slides down":"Колко надолу се плъзга лентата","How it works":"Как работи","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Колко дълго прозорецът трябва да стои до ръба – малко побутване. 0 = веднага.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Колко дълго прозорецът трябва да остане при ръба, преди да порасне.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Колко прозореца делят главната област (подредба „Главен и купчина“).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Ако долу вече има прозорец, горният ръб дава горната половина вместо максимизиране. Половините и четвъртинките също оставят прилепените прозорци свободни.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Ако KSnapUnity ви харесва, можете да подкрепите разработката – благодарим!","In bar":"В лентата","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Независимо от лентата и ръбовете на екрана.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Независимо от лентата. Всеки ръб се включва поотделно.","Information":"Информация","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Интуитивно, естествено поведение на прозорците.","Join at the end":"Отиват накрая","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K за KWin · Snap за по-умно прилепване · Unity за всичко в една система","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE има свои действия за ръбовете на екрана и свое прилепване на прозорци. Ако тук е включена същата функция, изключете тази на KDE: Системни настройки → Управление на прозорците → Ръбове на екрана, както и Поведение на прозорците → Преместване.","KDE's own edge tiling":"Собственото подреждане по ръбовете на KDE","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"Собственото максимизиране и подреждане на KDE по ръбовете – с контура му – спира, докато работи KSnapUnity, така че има само един преглед. Настройките на KDE не се променят: изключете това, деактивирайте или премахнете KSnapUnity и поведението на KDE се връща.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"Собствените действия на KDE за ръбовете на екрана още са включени, така че два помощника реагират на едно и също влачене. Изключете „Максимизиране“ и „Плочки“ в Системни настройки → Управление на прозорците → Ръбове на екрана.","KDE's own window snapping":"Собственото прилепване на прозорци на KDE","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"Собственото прилепване на прозорци в KDE също е включено. За еднакво усещане задайте зоните му на „Няма“ в Системни настройки → Управление на прозорците → Поведение на прозорците → Преместване.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Услугата за клавишни комбинации на KDE не отговори. Можете да зададете клавишите в Системни настройки → Клавишни комбинации → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – редактор на настройките","Keep stacked windows in line":"Подредени прозорци в една линия","Keep the gap between windows":"Запазване на разстоянието между прозорците","Keep them":"Запазване","Key scheme":"Схема на клавишите","Keyboard shortcuts":"Клавишни комбинации","Keys":"Клавиши","Keys already in use":"Вече заети клавиши","Layout":"Подредба","Layout by number of windows":"Подредба според броя прозорци","Layouts":"Подредби","Layouts per row":"Подредби на ред","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Ляв и десен ръб: половин екран","Left edge: left half":"Ляв ръб: лява половина","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Под 100 % самотният прозорец остава в средата – удобно на широки екрани.","License":"Лиценз","Light":"Светла","Linear":"Линейна","Live preview":"Преглед на живо","Load template…":"Зареждане на шаблон…","Magnet":"Магнит","Main + stack":"Основен + купчина","Main and stack":"Главен и купчина","Main area bigger":"По-голяма главна област","Main area on the right":"Главната област вдясно","Main area smaller":"По-малка главна област","Main in the middle":"Главен в средата","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Главен ключ за дърпането и клавишите.","Main window":"Главен прозорец","Main windows":"Главни прозорци","Main windows: %1":"Главни прозорци: %1","Make it the main window":"Направи главен прозорец","Maximize":"Максимизиране","Maximize or restore":"Максимизиране или възстановяване","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + клавиш (стил KDE)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + клавиш","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + клавиш","Minimize":"Минимизиране","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Огледално: главният прозорец е вдясно, другите вляво.","Mode":"Режим","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Режим 1 – лента за прилепване и ръбове на екрана","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Режим 2 – автоматично подреждане","Modes":"Режими","More ways":"Още начини","Motion curve":"Крива на движение","Move a window towards others…":"Преместете прозорец към други…","Move the window one place back":"Премести прозореца едно място назад","Move the window one place on":"Премести прозореца едно място напред","Name:":"Име:","New layout":"Нова подредба","New windows":"Нови прозорци","Next tiling layout":"Следваща подредба","Next to the active window":"До активния прозорец","No key":"Няма клавиш","No other window open":"Няма друг отворен прозорец","No outer margin":"Без външно отстояние","No shortcuts":"Без комбинации","None":"Няма","None yet.":"Още няма.","Off":"Изключено","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Изкл. = режим 1, вкл. = режим 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Изключено: неутрална рамка – само за включените прегледи.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Изключено: клавишите остават зададени, но не правят нищо.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Изкл.: прозорците остават там, където ги сложите. Другите функции работят и така.","One at a time":"Един по един","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Един се затваря – другите запълват празнината","One main window less":"Един главен прозорец по-малко","One more main window":"Още един главен прозорец","One window":"Един прозорец","Only one mode is switched on.":"Включен е само един режим.","Open settings editor":"Отвори редактора на настройките","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Първо отворете програмата, после я изберете тук.","Open the layout builder":"Отвори редактора на подредби","Own layouts":"Собствени подредби","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Част от всяка страна, която се брои за ъгъл.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Пауза на подреждането по ръбовете на KDE и неговия преглед","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Пауза на зоните за прилепване на KDE, докато магнитът е включен","Preview":"Преглед","Previews":"Прегледи","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Натиснете прозорец към ръб или ъгъл на екрана и той запълва тази част. Работи със или без лентата.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Натиснете прозорец към ръб или ъгъл: максимизиране, половини, четвъртинки.","Push delay":"Забавяне при натиск","Quarters":"Четвъртинки","Quick":"Бърза","Quick settings":"Бързи настройки","Recommended values":"Препоръчани стойности","Remove":"Премахване","Remove rule":"Премахни правилото","Remove zone":"Премахване на зона","Reset all":"Нулиране на всичко","Reset all keys":"Нулиране на всички клавиши","Reset to default":"Връщане към стандартното","Resistance against overlapping":"Съпротивление срещу застъпване","Resize touching windows together":"Преоразмеряване на допиращите се прозорци заедно","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"И преоразмеряването прилепва – тук до пълна височина","Restore":"Възстановяване","Restore default layouts":"Възстановяване на подредбите по подразбиране","Restore default layouts?":"Възстановяване на подредбите по подразбиране?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Възстановяване на оригиналния размер при изтегляне на прозореца","Restore the size before snapping":"Възстановяване на размера отпреди прилепването","Rows":"Редове","Save":"Запазване","Screen edges":"Ръбове на екрана","Screen edges on/off":"Ръбове на екрана вкл./изкл.","Screen edges preview":"Преглед на ръбовете на екрана","Set":"Задаване","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Задава клавишите на всички действия наведнъж. Отделни клавиши можете да променяте и по-долу.","Settings":"Настройки","Settings file":"Файл с настройки","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Докато променяте размера, разклатете бързо мишката напред-назад и другите прозорци се връщат. Бързо дърпане в една посока никога не ги пуска.","Shake to let go":"Разклатете, за да пуснете","Shortcuts":"Комбинации","Show a small handle first":"Първо показване на малка дръжка","Show layout and zone names":"Показване на имената на подредбите и зоните","Show previews in the accent color":"Показване на прегледите в акцентния цвят","Showing":"Показване","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Показва къде ще попадне прозорецът при ръб или ъгъл. Изключено: никакъв преглед.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Показва къде ще попадне прозорецът, докато зона от лентата е осветена. Изключено: никакъв преглед.","Sidebar + grid":"Странична лента + решетка","Single zone":"Една зона","Six tiles":"Шест плочки","Size & shape":"Размер и форма","Size of the main area":"Размер на главната област","Slide-in duration":"Продължителност при спускане","Slide-out duration":"Продължителност при прибиране","Smart arranging and detection.":"Умно подреждане и разпознаване.","Smart fill":"Умно запълване","Smooth (default)":"Плавна (по подразбиране)","Snap bar":"Лента за прилепване","Snap bar and screen edges":"Лента за прилепване и ръбове на екрана","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Лентата и ръбовете са изключени – работи само режим 2 и клавишът за режим не прави нищо.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Лентата и ръбовете на екрана пречат на автоматичното подреждане. Затова работят като два режима – превключвайте с клавишната комбинация или оттук.","Snap bar colors:":"Цветове на лентата:","Snap bar on/off":"Лента вкл./изкл.","Snap bar preview":"Преглед на лентата за прилепване","Snap bar size":"Размер на лентата","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Лента за прилепване, ръбове на екрана, магнит, клавишни комбинации и размяна на прозорци.","Snap distance":"Разстояние за прилепване","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Прилепване на разделителите (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Подредби за прилепване и автоматично подреждане.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Прилепвайте активния прозорец с клавишни комбинации.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Прилепвайте активния прозорец с клавиатурата. Това са обикновени глобални клавишни комбинации на KDE – ще ги намерите и в Системни настройки → Клавишни комбинации → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Прилепване в долната половина","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Прилепване в долната лява четвъртинка","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Прилепване в долната дясна четвъртинка","Snap to the center third":"Прилепване в средната третина","Snap to the left half":"Прилепване в лявата половина","Snap to the left third":"Прилепване в лявата третина","Snap to the left two thirds":"Прилепване в левите две третини","Snap to the right half":"Прилепване в дясната половина","Snap to the right third":"Прилепване в дясната третина","Snap to the right two thirds":"Прилепване в десните две третини","Snap to the top half":"Прилепване в горната половина","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Прилепване в горната лява четвъртинка","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Прилепване в горната дясна четвъртинка","Snapping":"Прилепване","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Прилепването и автоматичното подреждане са два режима – един клавиш превключва между тях.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Така само един магнит дърпа прозореца. Настройките на KDE не се променят: изключете това, деактивирайте или премахнете KSnapUnity и прилепването на KDE се връща.","Soft":"Мека","Spacing":"Разстояния","Spiral":"Спирала","Split side by side":"Разделяне една до друга","Split top and bottom":"Разделяне горе и долу","Stack + main":"Купчина + основен","Stick to other windows":"Залепване за други прозорци","Stick to the screen edges":"Залепване за ръбовете на екрана","Sticky edges":"Лепкави ръбове","Support KSnapUnity":"Подкрепете KSnapUnity","Swap":"Размяна","Swap windows":"Размяна на прозорци","Swap with the window above":"Размяна с прозореца отгоре","Swap with the window below":"Размяна с прозореца отдолу","Swap with the window on the left":"Размяна с прозореца вляво","Swap with the window on the right":"Размяна с прозореца вдясно","Switch mode":"Смяна на режима","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Смяна на режима (прилепване / подреждане)","Switch modes with:":"Смяна на режима с:","Switch the layout by itself":"Сменяй подредбата сама","Switched off":"Изключено","System":"Системна","Take it over":"Поемане","Take over all":"Поемане на всички","Take the main place":"Вземат главното място","Test animation":"Тест на анимацията","Test on screen":"Тест на екрана","Test the snap bar":"Изпробване на лентата","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Стойностите по подразбиране са базирани на Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Действията за прилепване използват същите разстояния като лентата и помнят размера преди прилепването: „Възстановяване на размера отпреди прилепването“ го връща.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Тези програми никога не се подреждат и пазят мястото си. Диалозите винаги са свободни.","Thirds":"Третини","Three columns":"Три колони","Thumbnail width":"Ширина на миниатюрите","Tiling":"Подреждане","Tip":"Съвет","Top / bottom":"Горе / долу","Top edge":"Горен ръб","Top edge: full screen":"Горен ръб: цял екран","Top edge: maximize":"Горен ръб: максимизиране","Top edge: top half":"Горен ръб: горна половина","Top half":"Горна половина","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Разстояние за задействане от горния край","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Изключете, ако предпочитате контура на KDE – тогава изключете горе прегледа на ръбовете.","Two thirds":"Две трети","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Два прозореца си разменят местата – пуснете единия върху другия или ползвайте клавишите.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Два прозореца си разменят местата: пуснете единия върху другия или с клавиш.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Използване на клавишни комбинации","Use screen edges":"Използване на ръбовете на екрана","Use the system accent color":"Използване на системния акцентен цвят","Use the window magnet":"Използване на магнита за прозорци","Usual combinations":"Обичайни комбинации","Version":"Версия","Wanted for: %1":"Желан за: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Когато прозорец се отвори, затвори или размени, другите се движат плавно, без да подскачат.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Когато преоразмерявате прозорец, прозорците, които го допират, местят общия ръб заедно с него – нищо не се застъпва, не остава празнина.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"По време на преоразмеряване прозорците, които не следват, стават прозрачни.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Докато местите прозорец или променяте размера му, ръбовете му залепват за близките прозорци и за ръбовете на екрана.","Width":"Ширина","Window":"Прозорец","Window magnet":"Магнит за прозорци","Window magnet on/off":"Магнит за прозорци вкл./изкл.","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Прозорците един над друг пазят левите и десните си ръбове заедно, прозорците един до друг – горните и долните.","Windows glide to their place":"Прозорците плавно отиват на мястото си","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Прозорците залепват един за друг и за ръбовете на екрана.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Прозорците спират на „Разстояние между прозорците“ от страницата Общи, вместо да се допират.","Yes":"Да","Your own combination":"Собствена комбинация","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Вашите собствени подредби и техният ред ще бъдат загубени.","Zone %1":"Зона %1","for KWin · v%1":"за KWin · v%1","windows:":"прозореца:","“%1” will be removed.":"„%1“ ще бъде премахната.","…drag it onto window B…":"…дръпнете го върху прозорец B…","…in every direction":"…във всяка посока","…let go: they trade places":"…пуснете: разменят местата си","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…съседите растат и се смаляват с него","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Готово – щракнете OK, за да отворите редактора на настройките."},"bn":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (অনুলিপি)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 ব্যবহার করছে \"%2\"।","%1 of %2 zones":"%2টির মধ্যে %1টি জোন","0 = all in one row":"0 = সবগুলো এক সারিতে","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>মোড ১</b><br/>স্ন্যাপ বার ও স্ক্রিনের প্রান্ত","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>মোড ২</b><br/>স্বয়ংক্রিয় টাইলিং","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"একক উইন্ডো পুরো স্ক্রিন নেয়, ফাঁক সেট থাকলেও।","A new window joins":"একটি নতুন উইন্ডো যোগ হয়","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"ছোট ধাক্কায় অর্ধেক বা চতুর্থাংশ হয়। উইন্ডোটি প্রান্তে আরেকটু বেশি সময় রাখলে সেটি পরের উইন্ডো পর্যন্ত বড় হয় – প্রাকদর্শন তা দেখায়।","A single window":"একটি একক উইন্ডো","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"দ্রুত সরালেও উইন্ডো অন্য উইন্ডোর প্রান্তে থেমে যায়। ছাড়াতে মাউস ঝাঁকান বা আরও এক মুহূর্ত ঠেলুন। 0 = উইন্ডো অবাধে একে অপরের উপর পড়তে পারে।","About & Help":"পরিচিতি ও সহায়তা","Accent color":"অ্যাকসেন্ট রং","Active":"সক্রিয়","Active mode":"সক্রিয় মোড","Active width along the top edge":"উপরের প্রান্ত বরাবর সক্রিয় প্রস্থ","Add an open application":"একটি খোলা অ্যাপ যোগ করুন","Add rule":"নিয়ম যোগ করুন","All window features in one system.":"সব উইন্ডো ফিচার এক সিস্টেমে।","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"হাতে প্রধান উইন্ডোর আকার বদলালেও বদলায়।","Also while resizing":"আকার বদলানোর সময়ও","Always floating":"সবসময় ভাসমান","Animation":"অ্যানিমেশন","Appearance":"চেহারা","Apply":"প্রয়োগ করুন","Arrange windows":"উইন্ডো সাজান","Arrange windows automatically":"উইন্ডো স্বয়ংক্রিয়ভাবে সাজান","Author":"লেখক","Automatic tiling":"স্বয়ংক্রিয় টাইলিং","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"স্বয়ংক্রিয় টাইলিং বন্ধ – শুধু মোড ১ চলে এবং মোড শর্টকাট কিছু করে না।","Automatic tiling off":"স্বয়ংক্রিয় টাইলিং বন্ধ","Automatic tiling on":"স্বয়ংক্রিয় টাইলিং চালু","Automatic tiling on/off":"স্বয়ংক্রিয় টাইলিং চালু/বন্ধ","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"স্বয়ংক্রিয় টাইলিং, উইন্ডো অদলবদল, শর্টকাট এবং ভাসমান উইন্ডোর জন্য চুম্বক।","Background opacity":"পটভূমির অস্বচ্ছতা","Behavior & Animation":"আচরণ ও অ্যানিমেশন","Bottom edge: bottom half":"নিচের প্রান্ত: নিচের অর্ধেক","Bouncy":"লাফানো","Buy me a coffee":"আমাকে এক কাপ কফি খাওয়ান","Cancel":"বাতিল","Center focus":"মাঝে ফোকাস","Center the window":"উইন্ডো মাঝখানে আনুন","Change":"বদলান","Change key":"কী বদলান","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"কী বদলান সেটিংস সম্পাদকে। দুটি মোডের জন্যই স্বয়ংক্রিয় টাইলিং এবং স্ন্যাপ বার বা স্ক্রিনের প্রান্ত চালু থাকা দরকার।","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"“কীবোর্ড শর্টকাট” পাতায় এগুলো বদলান। স্বয়ংক্রিয় টাইলিংয়ে উইন্ডো ক্রমেও জায়গা বদলায়।","Choose…":"বেছে নিন…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"বাছাই করতে জোনে ক্লিক করুন · ভাগ করতে ডাবল-ক্লিক করুন · বিভাজক টানুন","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"মোড বদলাতে ক্লিক করুন বা %1 চাপুন।","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"ক্লিক করুন, তারপর OK – সেটিংস সম্পাদক খুলবে।","Close":"বন্ধ করুন","Close by, the edges stick together":"কাছে এলে প্রান্তগুলো লেগে যায়","Color scheme":"রঙের স্কিম","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"স্ন্যাপ বারের রং, আকার ও আকৃতি।","Columns":"কলাম","Corner radius":"কোণের ব্যাসার্ধ","Corner size":"কোণের আকার","Corner: a quarter":"কোণ: এক চতুর্থাংশ","Corners: quarter of the screen":"কোণ: স্ক্রিনের চতুর্থাংশ","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + কী (ডিফল্ট)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + নম্বর প্যাড","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + কী","Custom color":"নিজস্ব রং","Custom layout %1":"নিজস্ব লেআউট %1","Dark":"গাঢ়","Delay before hiding":"লুকানোর আগে বিলম্ব","Delay before showing":"দেখানোর আগে বিলম্ব","Delete":"মুছুন","Delete layout?":"লেআউট মুছবেন?","Distance at which the handle appears":"যে দূরত্বে হাতল দেখা যায়","Distance before the bar hides again":"বার আবার লুকানোর আগের দূরত্ব","Distance to the edge":"প্রান্ত থেকে দূরত্ব","Donate with PayPal":"PayPal দিয়ে দান করুন","Drag a shared edge…":"একটি ভাগ করা প্রান্ত টানুন…","Drag a window against an edge…":"একটি উইন্ডো প্রান্তে টেনে আনুন…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"অদলবদলের জন্য একটি উইন্ডো অন্যটির উপর টানুন। স্ন্যাপ বার বা স্ক্রিনের প্রান্তে ছাড়লে এটি মুক্তভাবে ভাসে; „উইন্ডো ভাসতে দিন“ এটি ফিরিয়ে আনে। ফাঁক আসে সাধারণ পাতা থেকে।","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"একটি উইন্ডো অন্যটির মাঝখানে টানুন – প্রিভিউতে দুটি তীর দেখা যায় – তারপর ছাড়ুন। স্বয়ংক্রিয় টাইলিংয়ে অন্য উইন্ডোর যেকোনো জায়গা চলবে।","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"একটি উইন্ডো স্ক্রিনের উপরের প্রান্তে টেনে আনুন এবং একটি জোনে ছেড়ে দিন।","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"স্ন্যাপ বারে ক্রম বদলাতে কার্ডগুলো টানুন। সম্পাদনা করতে কার্ডে ডাবল-ক্লিক করুন।","Drop a window onto another one":"উইন্ডো অন্যটির উপর ছাড়ুন","Drop the window onto a zone":"উইন্ডোটি একটি জোনে ছেড়ে দিন","Duplicate":"প্রতিলিপি","Duration":"সময়কাল","Dwindle":"ডুইন্ডল","Dynamic":"গতিশীল","Edges and corners":"প্রান্ত ও কোণ","Edit":"সম্পাদনা","Edit layout":"লেআউট সম্পাদনা","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"প্রতিটি ফিচার আলাদাভাবে চালু ও বন্ধ করা যায়।","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"লেআউট পাতায় বানানো প্রতিটি লেআউট উইন্ডোও সাজাতে পারে – এটি উপরে দেখা যায়। উইন্ডো ১ পায় জোন ১, এভাবে; বেশি উইন্ডো শেষ জোন ভাগ করে। জোনের চেয়ে কম উইন্ডো হলে „প্রধান ও স্তূপ“ ব্যবহৃত হয়, যাতে ফাঁক না থাকে।","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"প্রতিটি উইন্ডো নিজেই নিজের জায়গা খুঁজে নেয়, টাইলিং উইন্ডো ম্যানেজারের মতো।","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"প্রতিটি উইন্ডো নিজেই স্ক্রিনে জায়গা খুঁজে নেয়। নতুন উইন্ডো যোগ দেয়, বন্ধ হওয়া উইন্ডো অন্যদের জায়গা ছেড়ে দেয়।","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"উদাহরণ: দুটি উইন্ডো পাশাপাশি, তিন থেকে প্রধান ও স্তূপ, পাঁচ থেকে গ্রিড। মিলে যাওয়া নিয়ম না থাকলে উপরে বাছা লেআউট চলে।","Fade in and out":"আসা-যাওয়ার সময় ফেড করুন","Fade the other windows":"অন্য উইন্ডো ঝাপসা করুন","Features":"বৈশিষ্ট্য","Feel":"অনুভূতি","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"আগে থেকে স্ন্যাপ করা উইন্ডোর সাথে মানিয়ে নিন","Fits the way you work.":"আপনার কাজের ধরনের সঙ্গে মানায়।","Float the window (leave tiling)":"উইন্ডো ভাসতে দিন (টাইলিং ছাড়ুন)","Four quarters":"চার চতুর্থাংশ","From":"থেকে","Fullscreen":"পূর্ণ স্ক্রিন","Gap between windows":"উইন্ডোগুলোর মধ্যে ফাঁক","Gap to the screen edge":"স্ক্রিনের প্রান্ত থেকে ফাঁক","General":"সাধারণ","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"প্রতিটি কাজকে আবার নির্বাচিত বিন্যাসের কী দেয় এবং বিন্যাসে না থাকা কীগুলো সরায়।","Good to know":"জেনে রাখা ভালো","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"উইন্ডোর শিরোনাম বার ধরে উপরে টানুন। স্ন্যাপ বার নিচে নেমে আসে; উইন্ডোটি একটি জোনে ছেড়ে দিন, সেটি ঠিক সেই জায়গাটি ভরাট করবে। আবার টেনে বের করলে আগের আকার ফিরে পাবে।","Grab window A…":"উইন্ডো A ধরুন…","Grid":"গ্রিড","Halves":"অর্ধেক-অর্ধেক","Hiding":"লুকানো","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"খালি জায়গা ভরাতে প্রান্তে ধরে রাখুন","Hold time":"ধরে রাখার সময়","Hold to fill":"ভরাতে ধরে রাখুন","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"প্রান্তকে জায়গামতো বসার আগে কত কাছে আসতে হবে।","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"কার্সরকে প্রান্তের কত কাছে আসতে হবে।","How far the bar slides down":"বার কতটা নিচে নামে","How it works":"এটি কীভাবে কাজ করে","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"উইন্ডোকে প্রান্তে কতক্ষণ লেগে থাকতে হবে – হালকা ধাক্কা। 0 = সঙ্গে সঙ্গে।","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"বড় হওয়ার আগে উইন্ডোকে প্রান্তে কতক্ষণ থাকতে হবে।","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"কয়টি উইন্ডো প্রধান অংশ ভাগ করে (লেআউট “প্রধান ও স্তূপ”)।","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"নিচে আগে থেকেই উইন্ডো থাকলে উপরের প্রান্ত সর্বোচ্চ করার বদলে উপরের অর্ধেক দেয়। অর্ধেক ও চতুর্থাংশও স্ন্যাপ করা উইন্ডো খোলা রাখে।","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"KSnapUnity ভালো লাগলে এর উন্নয়নে সমর্থন দিতে পারেন – ধন্যবাদ!","In bar":"বারে","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"স্ন্যাপ বার ও স্ক্রিনের প্রান্ত থেকে স্বতন্ত্র।","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"স্ন্যাপ বার থেকে স্বতন্ত্র। প্রতিটি প্রান্ত আলাদাভাবে চালু করা যায়।","Information":"তথ্য","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"স্বাভাবিক, সহজাত উইন্ডো আচরণ।","Join at the end":"শেষে যোগ হয়","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K মানে KWin · Snap মানে আরও স্মার্ট স্ন্যাপিং · Unity মানে সব এক সিস্টেমে","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE-র নিজস্ব স্ক্রিন-প্রান্ত কাজ ও উইন্ডো স্ন্যাপিং আছে। এখানে একই বৈশিষ্ট্য চালু থাকলে KDE-রটি বন্ধ করুন: সিস্টেম সেটিংস → উইন্ডো ব্যবস্থাপনা → স্ক্রিনের প্রান্ত, এবং উইন্ডোর আচরণ → সরানো।","KDE's own edge tiling":"KDE-র নিজস্ব প্রান্ত টাইলিং","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"স্ক্রিনের প্রান্তে KDE-র নিজের বড় করা ও টাইলিং – রূপরেখা সহ – KSnapUnity চলার সময় থেমে থাকে, যাতে একটিই প্রিভিউ দেখা যায়। আপনার KDE সেটিংস বদলায় না: এটি বন্ধ করুন, KSnapUnity নিষ্ক্রিয় বা সরান, KDE-র আচরণ ফিরে আসবে।","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"KDE-র নিজস্ব স্ক্রিন-প্রান্ত কাজ এখনো চালু, তাই একই টানে দুটি সহায়ক সাড়া দেয়। সিস্টেম সেটিংস → উইন্ডো ব্যবস্থাপনা → স্ক্রিনের প্রান্ত-এ \"সর্বোচ্চ করুন\" ও \"টাইল\" বন্ধ করুন।","KDE's own window snapping":"KDE-র নিজস্ব উইন্ডো স্ন্যাপিং","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE-র নিজস্ব উইন্ডো স্ন্যাপিংও চালু আছে। একই রকম অনুভূতির জন্য সিস্টেম সেটিংস → উইন্ডো ব্যবস্থাপনা → উইন্ডোর আচরণ → সরানো-তে এর জোনগুলো \"কোনোটি নয়\" করুন।","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"KDE-র শর্টকাট পরিষেবা সাড়া দেয়নি। কীগুলো এখনো সিস্টেম সেটিংস → শর্টকাট → KWin-এ সেট করতে পারবেন।","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – সেটিংস সম্পাদক","Keep stacked windows in line":"স্তূপ করা উইন্ডোগুলো এক লাইনে রাখুন","Keep the gap between windows":"উইন্ডোগুলোর মধ্যে ফাঁক বজায় রাখুন","Keep them":"থাক","Key scheme":"কী বিন্যাস","Keyboard shortcuts":"কীবোর্ড শর্টকাট","Keys":"কী","Keys already in use":"ইতিমধ্যে ব্যবহৃত কী","Layout":"লেআউট","Layout by number of windows":"উইন্ডোর সংখ্যা অনুযায়ী লেআউট","Layouts":"লেআউট","Layouts per row":"প্রতি সারিতে লেআউট","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"বাম ও ডান প্রান্ত: অর্ধেক স্ক্রিন","Left edge: left half":"বাম প্রান্ত: বাম অর্ধেক","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"১০০ %-এর কম হলে একক উইন্ডো মাঝখানে থাকে – চওড়া স্ক্রিনে সুন্দর।","License":"লাইসেন্স","Light":"হালকা","Linear":"রৈখিক","Live preview":"লাইভ প্রিভিউ","Load template…":"টেমপ্লেট লোড করুন…","Magnet":"চুম্বক","Main + stack":"প্রধান + স্তূপ","Main and stack":"প্রধান ও স্তূপ","Main area bigger":"বড় প্রধান অংশ","Main area on the right":"প্রধান অংশ ডানে","Main area smaller":"ছোট প্রধান অংশ","Main in the middle":"মাঝখানে প্রধান","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"টানা ও কীগুলোর প্রধান সুইচ।","Main window":"প্রধান উইন্ডো","Main windows":"প্রধান উইন্ডো","Main windows: %1":"প্রধান উইন্ডো: %1","Make it the main window":"প্রধান উইন্ডো করুন","Maximize":"সর্বোচ্চ করুন","Maximize or restore":"সর্বোচ্চ করুন বা ফেরান","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + কী (KDE ধাঁচ)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + কী","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + কী","Minimize":"ছোট করুন","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"লেআউট উল্টায়: প্রধান উইন্ডো ডানে, বাকিরা বামে।","Mode":"মোড","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"মোড ১ – স্ন্যাপ বার ও স্ক্রিনের প্রান্ত","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"মোড ২ – স্বয়ংক্রিয় টাইলিং","Modes":"মোড","More ways":"আরও উপায়","Motion curve":"গতির বক্ররেখা","Move a window towards others…":"একটি উইন্ডো অন্যগুলোর দিকে সরান…","Move the window one place back":"উইন্ডো এক ঘর পিছনে সরান","Move the window one place on":"উইন্ডো এক ঘর সামনে সরান","Name:":"নাম:","New layout":"নতুন লেআউট","New windows":"নতুন উইন্ডো","Next tiling layout":"পরের টাইলিং লেআউট","Next to the active window":"সক্রিয় উইন্ডোর পাশে","No key":"কোনো কী নেই","No other window open":"আর কোনো উইন্ডো খোলা নেই","No outer margin":"বাইরের ফাঁক নেই","No shortcuts":"কোনো শর্টকাট নেই","None":"কোনোটি নয়","None yet.":"এখনও কিছু নেই।","Off":"বন্ধ","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"বন্ধ = মোড ১, চালু = মোড ২","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"বন্ধ: একটি নিরপেক্ষ ফ্রেম – শুধু চালু থাকা প্রাকদর্শনের জন্য।","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"বন্ধ: কীগুলো বরাদ্দ থাকে, কিন্তু কিছু করে না।","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"বন্ধ: উইন্ডো যেখানে রাখেন সেখানেই থাকে। অন্য ফিচার যেকোনো অবস্থায় কাজ করে।","One at a time":"একে একে","One closes – the others fill the gap":"একটি বন্ধ হয় – বাকিরা ফাঁক ভরে","One main window less":"একটি প্রধান উইন্ডো কম","One more main window":"আরও একটি প্রধান উইন্ডো","One window":"একটি উইন্ডো","Only one mode is switched on.":"শুধু একটি মোড চালু আছে।","Open settings editor":"সেটিংস সম্পাদক খুলুন","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"আগে অ্যাপটি খুলুন, তারপর এখানে বেছে নিন।","Open the layout builder":"লেআউট নির্মাতা খুলুন","Own layouts":"নিজের লেআউট","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"প্রতিটি দিকের যে অংশ কোণ হিসেবে ধরা হয়।","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"KDE-র প্রান্ত টাইলিং ও তার প্রাকদর্শন থামান","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"চুম্বক চালু থাকা অবস্থায় KDE-র স্ন্যাপ জোন থামান","Preview":"পূর্বরূপ","Previews":"প্রাকদর্শন","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"উইন্ডোটি স্ক্রিনের প্রান্ত বা কোণে ঠেলুন, সেটি ওই অংশ ভরে দেবে। স্ন্যাপ বার থাকুক বা না থাকুক কাজ করে।","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"উইন্ডোটি প্রান্ত বা কোণে ঠেলুন: সর্বোচ্চ, অর্ধেক, চতুর্থাংশ।","Push delay":"ঠেলার বিলম্ব","Quarters":"চতুর্থাংশ","Quick":"দ্রুত","Quick settings":"দ্রুত সেটিংস","Recommended values":"প্রস্তাবিত মান","Remove":"সরান","Remove rule":"নিয়ম সরান","Remove zone":"জোন সরান","Reset all":"সব রিসেট করুন","Reset all keys":"সব কী রিসেট করুন","Reset to default":"ডিফল্টে ফেরান","Resistance against overlapping":"ওভারল্যাপের বিরুদ্ধে প্রতিরোধ","Resize touching windows together":"স্পর্শ করা উইন্ডোগুলোর আকার একসাথে বদলান","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"আকার বদলালেও লেগে যায় – এখানে পূর্ণ উচ্চতায়","Restore":"পুনরুদ্ধার করুন","Restore default layouts":"ডিফল্ট লেআউট পুনরুদ্ধার করুন","Restore default layouts?":"ডিফল্ট লেআউট পুনরুদ্ধার করবেন?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"উইন্ডো টেনে বের করলে আসল আকার ফিরিয়ে আনুন","Restore the size before snapping":"স্ন্যাপের আগের আকার ফেরান","Rows":"সারি","Save":"সংরক্ষণ","Screen edges":"স্ক্রিনের প্রান্ত","Screen edges on/off":"স্ক্রিনের প্রান্ত চালু/বন্ধ","Screen edges preview":"স্ক্রিনের প্রান্তের প্রাকদর্শন","Set":"সেট করুন","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"সব কাজের কী একসাথে সেট করে। আলাদা কী নিচে এখনো বদলাতে পারবেন।","Settings":"সেটিংস","Settings file":"সেটিংস ফাইল","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"আকার বদলানোর সময় মাউস দ্রুত সামনে-পিছনে ঝাঁকান, অন্য উইন্ডো ফিরে যাবে। এক দিকে দ্রুত টান কখনও ছাড়ায় না।","Shake to let go":"ঝাঁকিয়ে ছাড়ুন","Shortcuts":"শর্টকাট","Show a small handle first":"প্রথমে একটি ছোট হাতল দেখান","Show layout and zone names":"লেআউট ও জোনের নাম দেখান","Show previews in the accent color":"প্রাকদর্শন অ্যাকসেন্ট রঙে দেখান","Showing":"দেখানো","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"প্রান্ত বা কোণে উইন্ডো কোথায় বসবে তা দেখায়। বন্ধ: কোনো প্রাকদর্শন নেই।","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"স্ন্যাপ বারের কোনো জোন হাইলাইট থাকা অবস্থায় উইন্ডো কোথায় বসবে তা দেখায়। বন্ধ: কোনো প্রাকদর্শন নেই।","Sidebar + grid":"সাইডবার + গ্রিড","Single zone":"একক জোন","Six tiles":"ছয় টাইল","Size & shape":"আকার ও আকৃতি","Size of the main area":"প্রধান অংশের আকার","Slide-in duration":"ভেতরে আসার সময়কাল","Slide-out duration":"বাইরে যাওয়ার সময়কাল","Smart arranging and detection.":"বুদ্ধিমান সাজানো ও শনাক্তকরণ।","Smart fill":"স্মার্ট পূরণ","Smooth (default)":"মসৃণ (ডিফল্ট)","Snap bar":"স্ন্যাপ বার","Snap bar and screen edges":"স্ন্যাপ বার ও স্ক্রিনের প্রান্ত","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"স্ন্যাপ বার ও স্ক্রিনের প্রান্ত বন্ধ – শুধু মোড ২ চলে এবং মোড শর্টকাট কিছু করে না।","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"স্ন্যাপ বার ও স্ক্রিনের প্রান্ত স্বয়ংক্রিয় টাইলিংয়ে বাধা দেয়। তাই এগুলো দুটি মোডে চলে – শর্টকাট বা এখান থেকে বদলান।","Snap bar colors:":"স্ন্যাপ বারের রং:","Snap bar on/off":"স্ন্যাপ বার চালু/বন্ধ","Snap bar preview":"স্ন্যাপ বারের প্রাকদর্শন","Snap bar size":"স্ন্যাপ বারের আকার","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"স্ন্যাপ বার, স্ক্রিনের প্রান্ত, উইন্ডো চুম্বক, শর্টকাট ও উইন্ডো অদলবদল।","Snap distance":"স্ন্যাপ দূরত্ব","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"বিভাজক স্ন্যাপ করুন (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"স্ন্যাপ লেআউট ও স্বয়ংক্রিয় টাইলিং।","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"কী সংমিশ্রণে সক্রিয় উইন্ডো স্ন্যাপ করুন।","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"কীবোর্ড দিয়ে সক্রিয় উইন্ডো স্ন্যাপ করুন। এগুলো সাধারণ KDE গ্লোবাল শর্টকাট – সিস্টেম সেটিংস → শর্টকাট → KWin-এও পাবেন।","Snap to the bottom half":"নিচের অর্ধেকে স্ন্যাপ করুন","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"নিচে-বামের চতুর্থাংশে স্ন্যাপ করুন","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"নিচে-ডানের চতুর্থাংশে স্ন্যাপ করুন","Snap to the center third":"মাঝের এক-তৃতীয়াংশে স্ন্যাপ করুন","Snap to the left half":"বাম অর্ধেকে স্ন্যাপ করুন","Snap to the left third":"বাম এক-তৃতীয়াংশে স্ন্যাপ করুন","Snap to the left two thirds":"বাম দুই-তৃতীয়াংশে স্ন্যাপ করুন","Snap to the right half":"ডান অর্ধেকে স্ন্যাপ করুন","Snap to the right third":"ডান এক-তৃতীয়াংশে স্ন্যাপ করুন","Snap to the right two thirds":"ডান দুই-তৃতীয়াংশে স্ন্যাপ করুন","Snap to the top half":"উপরের অর্ধেকে স্ন্যাপ করুন","Snap to the top-left quarter":"উপরে-বামের চতুর্থাংশে স্ন্যাপ করুন","Snap to the top-right quarter":"উপরে-ডানের চতুর্থাংশে স্ন্যাপ করুন","Snapping":"স্ন্যাপিং","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"স্ন্যাপিং ও স্বয়ংক্রিয় টাইলিং দুটি মোডে চলে – একটি শর্টকাট এদের মধ্যে বদলায়।","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"এভাবে একটিমাত্র চুম্বক উইন্ডো টানে। আপনার KDE সেটিংস বদলায় না: এটি বন্ধ করুন, KSnapUnity নিষ্ক্রিয় বা সরান, KDE-র স্ন্যাপিং ফিরে আসবে।","Soft":"কোমল","Spacing":"ফাঁক","Spiral":"সর্পিল","Split side by side":"পাশাপাশি ভাগ করুন","Split top and bottom":"উপরে-নিচে ভাগ করুন","Stack + main":"স্তূপ + প্রধান","Stick to other windows":"অন্য উইন্ডোর সাথে লেগে থাকুক","Stick to the screen edges":"স্ক্রিনের প্রান্তে লেগে থাকুক","Sticky edges":"আঠালো প্রান্ত","Support KSnapUnity":"KSnapUnity-কে সমর্থন করুন","Swap":"অদলবদল","Swap windows":"উইন্ডো অদলবদল","Swap with the window above":"উপরের উইন্ডোর সাথে বদলান","Swap with the window below":"নিচের উইন্ডোর সাথে বদলান","Swap with the window on the left":"বাঁ দিকের উইন্ডোর সাথে বদলান","Swap with the window on the right":"ডান দিকের উইন্ডোর সাথে বদলান","Switch mode":"মোড বদলান","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"মোড বদলান (স্ন্যাপিং / টাইলিং)","Switch modes with:":"মোড বদলানোর কী:","Switch the layout by itself":"লেআউট নিজে থেকে বদলান","Switched off":"বন্ধ","System":"সিস্টেম","Take it over":"নিয়ে নিন","Take over all":"সব নিয়ে নিন","Take the main place":"প্রধান জায়গা নেয়","Test animation":"অ্যানিমেশন পরীক্ষা করুন","Test on screen":"স্ক্রিনে পরীক্ষা করুন","Test the snap bar":"স্ন্যাপ বার পরখ করুন","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"ডিফল্ট মানগুলো Windows 11-এর উপর ভিত্তি করে।","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"স্ন্যাপ কাজগুলো স্ন্যাপ বারের মতোই ফাঁক ব্যবহার করে এবং স্ন্যাপের আগের আকার মনে রাখে: \"স্ন্যাপের আগের আকার ফেরান\" সেটি ফিরিয়ে আনে।","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"এই অ্যাপগুলো কখনো সাজানো হয় না এবং নিজের জায়গায় থাকে। ডায়ালগ সবসময় ভাসে।","Thirds":"এক-তৃতীয়াংশ","Three columns":"তিন কলাম","Thumbnail width":"থাম্বনেইলের প্রস্থ","Tiling":"টাইলিং","Tip":"পরামর্শ","Top / bottom":"উপর / নিচ","Top edge":"উপরের প্রান্ত","Top edge: full screen":"উপরের প্রান্ত: পূর্ণ স্ক্রিন","Top edge: maximize":"উপরের প্রান্ত: বড় করুন","Top edge: top half":"উপরের প্রান্ত: উপরের অর্ধেক","Top half":"উপরের অর্ধেক","Trigger distance from the top edge":"উপরের প্রান্ত থেকে ট্রিগার দূরত্ব","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"KDE-র নিজের রূপরেখা পছন্দ হলে এটি বন্ধ করুন – তারপর ওপরে স্ক্রিনের প্রান্তের প্রাকদর্শন বন্ধ করুন।","Two thirds":"দুই-তৃতীয়াংশ","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"দুটি উইন্ডো জায়গা বদলায় – একটিকে অন্যটির উপর ফেলুন বা কী ব্যবহার করুন।","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"দুটি উইন্ডো জায়গা বদলায়: একটিকে অন্যটির উপর ফেলুন, বা কী দিয়ে।","Use keyboard shortcuts":"কীবোর্ড শর্টকাট ব্যবহার করুন","Use screen edges":"স্ক্রিনের প্রান্ত ব্যবহার করুন","Use the system accent color":"সিস্টেমের অ্যাকসেন্ট রং ব্যবহার করুন","Use the window magnet":"উইন্ডো চুম্বক ব্যবহার করুন","Usual combinations":"প্রচলিত সংমিশ্রণ","Version":"সংস্করণ","Wanted for: %1":"প্রয়োজন: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"কোনো উইন্ডো খুললে, বন্ধ হলে বা বদলালে বাকিরা লাফ না দিয়ে মসৃণভাবে সরে।","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"একটি উইন্ডোর আকার বদলালে, যেগুলো তাকে স্পর্শ করে সেগুলোও ভাগ করা প্রান্ত সরায় – কিছুই ঢাকা পড়ে না, ফাঁকও হয় না।","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"আকার বদলানোর সময় যেসব উইন্ডো সাথে চলে না সেগুলো স্বচ্ছ দেখায়।","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"উইন্ডো সরানো বা তার আকার বদলানোর সময় তার প্রান্তগুলো কাছের উইন্ডো ও স্ক্রিনের প্রান্তে লেগে যায়।","Width":"প্রস্থ","Window":"উইন্ডো","Window magnet":"উইন্ডো চুম্বক","Window magnet on/off":"উইন্ডো চুম্বক চালু/বন্ধ","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"একটির ওপর আরেকটি থাকা উইন্ডো বাম ও ডান প্রান্ত একসাথে রাখে, পাশাপাশি থাকা উইন্ডো ওপর ও নিচের প্রান্ত।","Windows glide to their place":"উইন্ডো মসৃণভাবে জায়গায় যায়","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"উইন্ডোগুলো একে অপরের সাথে এবং স্ক্রিনের প্রান্তে লেগে থাকে।","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"উইন্ডোগুলো ছুঁয়ে না গিয়ে সাধারণ পাতার \"উইন্ডোগুলোর মধ্যে ফাঁক\"-এ থেমে যায়।","Yes":"হ্যাঁ","Your own combination":"নিজের সংমিশ্রণ","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"আপনার নিজের লেআউট ও তাদের ক্রম হারিয়ে যাবে।","Zone %1":"জোন %1","for KWin · v%1":"KWin-এর জন্য · v%1","windows:":"উইন্ডো:","“%1” will be removed.":"\"%1\" সরানো হবে।","…drag it onto window B…":"…উইন্ডো B-এর উপর টেনে আনুন…","…in every direction":"…সব দিকে","…let go: they trade places":"…ছেড়ে দিন: তারা জায়গা বদলায়","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…পাশের উইন্ডোগুলো সঙ্গে বাড়ে ও কমে","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ প্রস্তুত – সেটিংস সম্পাদক খুলতে OK ক্লিক করুন।"},"bs":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (kopija)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 koristi „%2”.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 od %2 zona","0 = all in one row":"0 = svi u jednom redu","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Način 1</b><br/>Traka za prianjanje i ivice ekrana","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Način 2</b><br/>Automatsko popločavanje","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Samostalni prozor zauzima cijeli ekran, čak i uz zadani razmak.","A new window joins":"Dolazi novi prozor","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Kratko guranje daje polovinu ili četvrtinu. Zadržite prozor uz ivicu malo duže i naraste do sljedećeg prozora – pregled to pokazuje.","A single window":"Jedan prozor","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Prozor se zaustavlja na ivici drugog, i kad ga brzo pomjeraš. Protresi miš ili guraj još trenutak da ga pustiš. 0 = prozori smeju slobodno da se preklapaju.","About & Help":"O programu i pomoć","Accent color":"Boja isticanja","Active":"Aktivno","Active mode":"Aktivni način","Active width along the top edge":"Aktivna širina duž gornje ivice","Add an open application":"Dodaj otvorenu aplikaciju","Add rule":"Dodaj pravilo","All window features in one system.":"Sve funkcije prozora u jednom sistemu.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Menja se i kad ručno promijeniš veličinu glavnog prozora.","Also while resizing":"I pri promjeni veličine","Always floating":"Uvijek slobodni","Animation":"Animacija","Appearance":"Izgled","Apply":"Primijeni","Arrange windows":"Raspoređivanje prozora","Arrange windows automatically":"Automatski rasporedi prozore","Author":"Autor","Automatic tiling":"Automatsko popločavanje","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Automatsko popločavanje je isključeno – radi samo način 1, a prečica za način ne radi ništa.","Automatic tiling off":"Automatsko popločavanje isključeno","Automatic tiling on":"Automatsko popločavanje uključeno","Automatic tiling on/off":"Automatsko popločavanje uklj./isklj.","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Automatsko popločavanje, zamjena prozora, prečice i magnet za slobodne prozore.","Background opacity":"Neprozirnost pozadine","Behavior & Animation":"Ponašanje i animacija","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Donja ivica: donja polovina","Bouncy":"Elastična","Buy me a coffee":"Častite me kafom","Cancel":"Otkaži","Center focus":"Fokus u sredini","Center the window":"Centriraj prozor","Change":"Promijeni","Change key":"Promijeni tipku","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Tipku mijenjaš u uređivaču postavki. Oba načina trebaju automatsko popločavanje i traku ili ivice ekrana.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Promijeni ih na stranici Prečice na tastaturi. Uz automatsko popločavanje prozori mijenjaju i mjesto u redoslijedu.","Choose…":"Odaberi…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Kliknite zonu da je odaberete · dvoklik je dijeli · prevlačite razdjelnike","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Klikni ili pritisni %1 za promjenu načina.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Klikni, pa OK – otvara se uređivač postavki.","Close":"Zatvori","Close by, the edges stick together":"U blizini se ivice slijepe","Color scheme":"Šema boja","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Boje, veličina i oblik trake.","Columns":"Kolone","Corner radius":"Poluprečnik uglova","Corner size":"Veličina uglova","Corner: a quarter":"Ugao: četvrtina","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Uglovi: četvrtina ekrana","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + tipka (zadano)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + numerička tastatura","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + tipka","Custom color":"Vlastita boja","Custom layout %1":"Vlastiti raspored %1","Dark":"Tamna","Delay before hiding":"Kašnjenje prije skrivanja","Delay before showing":"Kašnjenje prije prikaza","Delete":"Obriši","Delete layout?":"Obrisati raspored?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Udaljenost na kojoj se pojavljuje ručica","Distance before the bar hides again":"Udaljenost nakon koje se traka ponovo skriva","Distance to the edge":"Udaljenost od ivice","Donate with PayPal":"Donirajte putem PayPala","Drag a shared edge…":"Povuci zajedničku ivicu…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Povuci prozor prema ivici…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Povuci prozor na drugi da ih zamijeniš. Spušten na traku ili ivicu ekrana, lebdi slobodno; „Pusti prozor da lebdi“ ga vraća. Razmaci dolaze sa stranice Opće.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Povuci prozor preko sredine drugog – pregled pokazuje dvije strelice – i pusti. Kod automatskog popločavanja dovoljno je bilo gdje iznad drugog prozora.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Prevucite prozor do gornje ivice ekrana i spustite ga na zonu.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Prevlačite kartice da promijenite redoslijed na traci. Dvokliknite karticu da je uredite.","Drop a window onto another one":"Pusti prozor na drugi","Drop the window onto a zone":"Spustite prozor na zonu","Duplicate":"Dupliciraj","Duration":"Trajanje","Dwindle":"Spirala prema unutra","Dynamic":"Dinamična","Edges and corners":"Ivice i uglovi","Edit":"Uredi","Edit layout":"Uredi raspored","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Svaka funkcija može da se uključi i isključi zasebno.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Svaki raspored sa stranice Rasporedi može i raspoređivati prozore – pojavljuje se iznad. Prozor 1 dobija zonu 1 i tako dalje; dodatni prozori dijele zadnju zonu. Ako je prozora manje od zona, koristi se „Glavni i gomila“, da ne bude rupa.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Svaki prozor sam pronalazi svoje mjesto, kao u menadžeru prozora sa popločavanjem.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Svaki prozor sam pronalazi svoje mjesto na ekranu. Novi prozori se pridružuju, zatvoreni oslobađaju mjesto ostalima.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Primjer: dva prozora jedan pored drugog, od tri glavni i gomila, od pet mreža. Bez odgovarajućeg pravila vrijedi gore odabrani raspored.","Fade in and out":"Postepeno pojavljivanje i nestajanje","Fade the other windows":"Zatamni ostale prozore","Features":"Funkcije","Feel":"Osjećaj","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Prilagodi se već prilijepljenim prozorima","Fits the way you work.":"Prilagođava se tvom načinu rada.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Pusti prozor da lebdi (napusti popločavanje)","Four quarters":"Četiri četvrtine","From":"Od","Fullscreen":"Cijeli ekran","Gap between windows":"Razmak između prozora","Gap to the screen edge":"Razmak do ivice ekrana","General":"Općenito","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Svakoj radnji ponovo daje tipku odabrane šeme i uklanja tipke koje šema nema.","Good to know":"Dobro je znati","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Uhvatite prozor za naslovnu traku i prevucite ga nagore. Traka se spušta; spustite prozor na zonu i on popunjava tačno to područje. Kad ga ponovo izvučete, vraća mu se stara veličina.","Grab window A…":"Uhvati prozor A…","Grid":"Mreža","Halves":"Polovine","Hiding":"Skrivanje","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Drži uz ivicu za popunjavanje slobodnog prostora","Hold time":"Vrijeme držanja","Hold to fill":"Drži za popunjavanje","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Koliko blizu ivica mora doći prije nego što sjedne na mjesto.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Koliko blizu ivice pokazivač mora doći.","How far the bar slides down":"Koliko se traka spušta","How it works":"Kako radi","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Koliko dugo prozor mora biti uz ivicu – mali potisak. 0 = odmah.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Koliko dugo prozor mora ostati uz ivicu prije nego naraste.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Koliko prozora dijeli glavnu oblast (raspored „Glavni i gomila“).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Ako je dolje već prozor, gornja ivica daje gornju polovinu umjesto maksimiziranja. I polovine i četvrtine ostavljaju prilijepljene prozore slobodnim.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Ako ti se sviđa KSnapUnity, možeš podržati razvoj – hvala!","In bar":"Na traci","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Nezavisno od trake i ivica ekrana.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Nezavisno od trake. Svaka ivica se uključuje zasebno.","Information":"Informacije","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Intuitivno, prirodno ponašanje prozora.","Join at the end":"Idu na kraj","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K za KWin · Snap za pametnije prianjanje · Unity za sve u jednom sistemu","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE ima vlastite radnje ivica ekrana i vlastito prianjanje prozora. Ako je ovdje uključena ista funkcija, isključite KDE-ovu: Sistemske postavke → Upravljanje prozorima → Ivice ekrana, i Ponašanje prozora → Pomjeranje.","KDE's own edge tiling":"KDE-ovo vlastito slaganje uz ivice","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"KDE-ovo maksimiziranje i popločavanje na ivicama – s obrisom – pauzira dok radi KSnapUnity, pa se vidi samo jedan pregled. Postavke KDE-a se ne mijenjaju: isključi ovo, deaktiviraj ili ukloni KSnapUnity i KDE-ovo ponašanje se vraća.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"Vlastite radnje ivica ekrana u KDE-u su još uključene, pa na isto prevlačenje reaguju dva pomoćnika. Isključite „Maksimiziraj” i „Popločaj” u Sistemske postavke → Upravljanje prozorima → Ivice ekrana.","KDE's own window snapping":"KDE-ovo vlastito prikačivanje prozora","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"I vlastito prianjanje prozora u KDE-u je uključeno. Za ujednačen osjećaj postavite njegove zone na „Nijedna” u Sistemske postavke → Upravljanje prozorima → Ponašanje prozora → Pomjeranje.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"KDE servis za prečice nije odgovorio. Tipke i dalje možete postaviti u Sistemske postavke → Prečice → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – uređivač postavki","Keep stacked windows in line":"Drži naslagane prozore u liniji","Keep the gap between windows":"Zadrži razmak između prozora","Keep them":"Zadrži ih","Key scheme":"Šema tipki","Keyboard shortcuts":"Prečice na tastaturi","Keys":"Tasteri","Keys already in use":"Tipke koje se već koriste","Layout":"Raspored","Layout by number of windows":"Raspored prema broju prozora","Layouts":"Rasporedi","Layouts per row":"Rasporeda po redu","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Lijeva i desna ivica: pola ekrana","Left edge: left half":"Lijeva ivica: lijeva polovina","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Ispod 100 % samostalni prozor ostaje u sredini – lijepo na širokim ekranima.","License":"Licenca","Light":"Svijetla","Linear":"Linearna","Live preview":"Pregled uživo","Load template…":"Učitaj šablon…","Main + stack":"Glavni + gomila","Main and stack":"Glavni i gomila","Main area bigger":"Veća glavna oblast","Main area on the right":"Glavno područje desno","Main area smaller":"Manja glavna oblast","Main in the middle":"Glavni u sredini","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Glavni prekidač za povlačenje i tipke.","Main window":"Glavni prozor","Main windows":"Glavni prozori","Main windows: %1":"Glavni prozori: %1","Make it the main window":"Učini glavnim prozorom","Maximize":"Maksimiziraj","Maximize or restore":"Maksimiziraj ili vrati","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + tipka (KDE stil)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + tipka","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + tipka","Minimize":"Minimiziraj","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Zrcali raspored: glavni prozor desno, ostali lijevo.","Mode":"Način","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Način 1 – traka za prianjanje i ivice ekrana","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Način 2 – automatsko popločavanje","Modes":"Načini","More ways":"Još načina","Motion curve":"Kriva kretanja","Move a window towards others…":"Pomjeri prozor prema drugima…","Move the window one place back":"Pomjeri prozor jedno mjesto nazad","Move the window one place on":"Pomjeri prozor jedno mjesto naprijed","Name:":"Naziv:","New layout":"Novi raspored","New windows":"Novi prozori","Next tiling layout":"Sljedeći raspored popločavanja","Next to the active window":"Pored aktivnog prozora","No key":"Nema tipke","No other window open":"Nema drugog otvorenog prozora","No outer margin":"Bez vanjskog razmaka","No shortcuts":"Bez prečica","None":"Nijedna","None yet.":"Još ništa.","Off":"Isključeno","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Isklj. = način 1, uklj. = način 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Isključeno: neutralan okvir – samo za uključene preglede.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Isključeno: tipke ostaju dodijeljene, ali ništa ne rade.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Isključeno: prozori ostaju gdje ih staviš. Ostale funkcije rade svejedno.","One at a time":"Jedan po jedan","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Jedan se zatvara – ostali popune prazninu","One main window less":"Jedan glavni prozor manje","One more main window":"Jedan glavni prozor više","One window":"Jedan prozor","Only one mode is switched on.":"Uključen je samo jedan način.","Open settings editor":"Otvori uređivač postavki","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Prvo otvori aplikaciju, zatim je odaberi ovdje.","Open the layout builder":"Otvori graditelj rasporeda","Own layouts":"Vlastiti rasporedi","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Dio svake stranice koji se računa kao ugao.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Pauziraj KDE-ovo slaganje uz ivice i njegov pregled","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Pauziraj KDE-ove zone prikačivanja dok je magnet uključen","Preview":"Pregled","Previews":"Pregledi","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Pritisnite prozor uz ivicu ili ugao ekrana i on ispuni taj dio. Radi sa trakom ili bez nje.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Pritisnite prozor uz ivicu ili ugao: maksimiziraj, polovine, četvrtine.","Push delay":"Kašnjenje pritiska","Quarters":"Četvrtine","Quick":"Brza","Quick settings":"Brze postavke","Recommended values":"Preporučene vrijednosti","Remove":"Ukloni","Remove rule":"Ukloni pravilo","Remove zone":"Ukloni zonu","Reset all":"Resetuj sve","Reset all keys":"Resetuj sve tipke","Reset to default":"Vrati na zadano","Resistance against overlapping":"Otpor preklapanju","Resize touching windows together":"Mijenjaj veličinu prozora koji se dodiruju zajedno","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"I promjena veličine prianja – ovdje do pune visine","Restore":"Vrati","Restore default layouts":"Vrati zadane rasporede","Restore default layouts?":"Vratiti zadane rasporede?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Vrati izvornu veličinu pri izvlačenju prozora","Restore the size before snapping":"Vrati veličinu prije prianjanja","Rows":"Redovi","Save":"Sačuvaj","Screen edges":"Ivice ekrana","Screen edges on/off":"Ivice ekrana uklj./isklj.","Screen edges preview":"Pregled ivica ekrana","Set":"Postavi","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Postavlja tipke svih radnji odjednom. Pojedinačne tipke i dalje možete mijenjati ispod.","Settings":"Postavke","Settings file":"Datoteka postavki","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Dok mijenjaš veličinu, brzo protresi miš naprijed-nazad i ostali prozori skoče nazad. Brz potez u jednom smjeru ih nikad ne pušta.","Shake to let go":"Protresi za otpuštanje","Shortcuts":"Prečice","Show a small handle first":"Prvo prikaži malu ručicu","Show layout and zone names":"Prikaži nazive rasporeda i zona","Show previews in the accent color":"Prikaži preglede u boji isticanja","Showing":"Prikazivanje","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Pokazuje gdje prozor slijeće na ivici ili u uglu. Isključeno: nikakav pregled.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Pokazuje gdje prozor slijeće dok je zona trake istaknuta. Isključeno: nikakav pregled.","Sidebar + grid":"Bočna traka + mreža","Single zone":"Jedna zona","Six tiles":"Šest pločica","Size & shape":"Veličina i oblik","Size of the main area":"Veličina glavne oblasti","Slide-in duration":"Trajanje spuštanja","Slide-out duration":"Trajanje podizanja","Smart arranging and detection.":"Pametno raspoređivanje i prepoznavanje.","Smart fill":"Pametno popunjavanje","Smooth (default)":"Glatka (zadano)","Snap bar":"Traka za prianjanje","Snap bar and screen edges":"Traka za prianjanje i ivice ekrana","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Traka i ivice ekrana su isključeni – radi samo način 2, a prečica za način ne radi ništa.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Traka i ivice ekrana smetaju automatskom popločavanju. Zato rade kao dva načina – mijenjaj prečicom ili ovdje.","Snap bar colors:":"Boje trake:","Snap bar on/off":"Traka uklj./isklj.","Snap bar preview":"Pregled trake za prikačivanje","Snap bar size":"Veličina trake","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Traka za prianjanje, ivice ekrana, magnet prozora, prečice i zamjena prozora.","Snap distance":"Udaljenost prianjanja","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Prianjanje razdjelnika (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Rasporedi za prianjanje i automatsko popločavanje.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Prilijepite aktivni prozor kombinacijama tipki.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Prilijepite aktivni prozor tastaturom. To su obične globalne KDE prečice – nalaze se i u Sistemske postavke → Prečice → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Prilijepi u donju polovinu","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Prilijepi u donju lijevu četvrtinu","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Prilijepi u donju desnu četvrtinu","Snap to the center third":"Prilijepi u srednju trećinu","Snap to the left half":"Prilijepi u lijevu polovinu","Snap to the left third":"Prilijepi u lijevu trećinu","Snap to the left two thirds":"Prilijepi u lijeve dvije trećine","Snap to the right half":"Prilijepi u desnu polovinu","Snap to the right third":"Prilijepi u desnu trećinu","Snap to the right two thirds":"Prilijepi u desne dvije trećine","Snap to the top half":"Prilijepi u gornju polovinu","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Prilijepi u gornju lijevu četvrtinu","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Prilijepi u gornju desnu četvrtinu","Snapping":"Prianjanje","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Prianjanje i automatsko popločavanje rade kao dva načina – jedna prečica ih mijenja.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Tako samo jedan magnet vuče prozor. Postavke KDE-a se ne mijenjaju: isključi ovo, deaktiviraj ili ukloni KSnapUnity i KDE-ovo prianjanje se vraća.","Soft":"Blaga","Spacing":"Razmaci","Spiral":"Spirala","Split side by side":"Podijeli jedno pored drugog","Split top and bottom":"Podijeli gore i dolje","Stack + main":"Gomila + glavni","Stick to other windows":"Lijepi se uz druge prozore","Stick to the screen edges":"Lijepi se uz ivice ekrana","Sticky edges":"Ljepljive ivice","Support KSnapUnity":"Podrži KSnapUnity","Swap":"Zamjeni","Swap windows":"Zamjena prozora","Swap with the window above":"Zamjeni sa prozorom iznad","Swap with the window below":"Zamjeni sa prozorom ispod","Swap with the window on the left":"Zamjeni sa prozorom lijevo","Swap with the window on the right":"Zamjeni sa prozorom desno","Switch mode":"Promijeni način","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Promijeni način (prianjanje / popločavanje)","Switch modes with:":"Promjena načina:","Switch the layout by itself":"Sam mijenjaj raspored","Switched off":"Isključeno","System":"Sistem","Take it over":"Preuzmi","Take over all":"Preuzmi sve","Take the main place":"Uzimaju glavno mjesto","Test animation":"Isprobaj animaciju","Test on screen":"Isprobaj na ekranu","Test the snap bar":"Isprobaj traku","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Zadane vrijednosti zasnovane su na Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Radnje prianjanja koriste iste razmake kao traka i pamte veličinu prije prianjanja: „Vrati veličinu prije prianjanja” je vraća.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Ove aplikacije se nikad ne raspoređuju i zadržavaju svoje mjesto. Dijalozi su uvijek slobodni.","Thirds":"Trećine","Three columns":"Tri kolone","Thumbnail width":"Širina sličica","Tiling":"Popločavanje","Tip":"Savjet","Top / bottom":"Gore / dolje","Top edge":"Gornja ivica","Top edge: full screen":"Gornja ivica: cijeli ekran","Top edge: maximize":"Gornja ivica: maksimiziraj","Top edge: top half":"Gornja ivica: gornja polovina","Top half":"Gornja polovina","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Udaljenost aktivacije od gornje ivice","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Isključite ako vam je draži KDE-ov obris – tada gore isključite pregled ivica ekrana.","Two thirds":"Dvije trećine","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Dva prozora mijenjaju mjesta – spusti jedan na drugi ili koristi tipke.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Dva prozora mijenjaju mjesta: spusti jedan na drugi ili tipkom.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Koristi prečice na tastaturi","Use screen edges":"Koristi ivice ekrana","Use the system accent color":"Koristi sistemsku boju isticanja","Use the window magnet":"Koristi magnet prozora","Usual combinations":"Uobičajene kombinacije","Version":"Verzija","Wanted for: %1":"Željeno za: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Kad se prozor otvori, zatvori ili zamijeni, ostali se pomjeraju glatko umjesto da skaču.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Kada mijenjate veličinu prozora, prozori koji ga dodiruju pomjeraju zajedničku ivicu s njim – ništa se ne preklapa, nema praznine.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Tokom promjene veličine prozori koji ne prate postaju providni.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Dok pomjerate prozor ili mu mijenjate veličinu, njegove ivice se lijepe uz obližnje prozore i ivice ekrana.","Width":"Širina","Window":"Prozor","Window magnet":"Magnet prozora","Window magnet on/off":"Magnet prozora uklj./isklj.","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Prozori jedan iznad drugog drže lijeve i desne ivice zajedno, prozori jedan pored drugog gornje i donje.","Windows glide to their place":"Prozori klize na svoje mjesto","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Prozori se lijepe jedan uz drugi i uz ivice ekrana.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Prozori se zaustave na „Razmak između prozora” sa stranice Općenito umjesto da se dodiruju.","Yes":"Da","Your own combination":"Vlastita kombinacija","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Vaši rasporedi i njihov redoslijed bit će izgubljeni.","Zone %1":"Zona %1","for KWin · v%1":"za KWin · v%1","windows:":"prozora:","“%1” will be removed.":"„%1” će biti uklonjen.","…drag it onto window B…":"…povuci ga na prozor B…","…in every direction":"…u svakom smjeru","…let go: they trade places":"…pusti: zamijene mjesta","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…susjedi rastu i smanjuju se s njom","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Spremno – klikni OK za otvaranje uređivača postavki."},"ca":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (còpia)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 l’usa «%2».","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 de %2 zones","0 = all in one row":"0 = totes en una fila","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Barra d’ajust i vores de la pantalla","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Mosaic automàtic","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Una finestra sola ocupa tota la pantalla, encara que hi hagi un marge.","A new window joins":"S’hi afegeix una finestra nova","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Una empenta curta dona la meitat o el quart. Manteniu la finestra una mica més a la vora i creix fins a la finestra següent; la previsualització ho mostra.","A single window":"Una sola finestra","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Una finestra s’atura a la vora d’una altra, també si la mous de pressa. Sacseja el ratolí o continua empenyent un moment per deixar-la anar. 0 = les finestres es poden superposar lliurement.","About & Help":"Quant a i ajuda","Accent color":"Color d’èmfasi","Active":"Actiu","Active mode":"Mode actiu","Active width along the top edge":"Amplada activa al llarg de la vora superior","Add an open application":"Afegeix una aplicació oberta","Add rule":"Afegeix una regla","All window features in one system.":"Totes les funcions de finestres en un sol sistema.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"També canvia quan redimensiones la finestra principal a mà.","Also while resizing":"També en redimensionar","Always floating":"Sempre flotants","Animation":"Animació","Appearance":"Aparença","Apply":"Aplica","Arrange windows":"Organitza les finestres","Arrange windows automatically":"Organitza les finestres automàticament","Author":"Autor","Automatic tiling":"Mosaic automàtic","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"El mosaic automàtic està desactivat – només funciona el mode 1 i la drecera de mode no fa res.","Automatic tiling off":"Mosaic automàtic desactivat","Automatic tiling on":"Mosaic automàtic activat","Automatic tiling on/off":"Activa/desactiva el mosaic automàtic","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Mosaic automàtic, intercanvi de finestres, dreceres i l’imant per a finestres flotants.","Background opacity":"Opacitat del fons","Behavior & Animation":"Comportament i animació","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Vora inferior: meitat inferior","Bouncy":"Amb rebot","Buy me a coffee":"Convida'm a un cafè","Cancel":"Cancel·la","Center focus":"Focus central","Center the window":"Centra la finestra","Change":"Canvia","Change key":"Canvia la tecla","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"La tecla es canvia a l’editor de configuració. Tots dos modes necessiten el mosaic automàtic i la barra o les vores de la pantalla.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Canvia-les a la pàgina Dreceres de teclat. Amb el mosaic automàtic, les finestres també intercanvien el lloc en l’ordre.","Choose…":"Tria…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Feu clic en una zona per seleccionar-la · doble clic per dividir-la · arrossegueu els separadors","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Fes clic o prem %1 per canviar el mode.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Fes clic i després D’acord – s’obre l’editor de configuració.","Close":"Tanca","Close by, the edges stick together":"A prop, les vores s’enganxen","Color scheme":"Esquema de colors","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Colors, mida i forma de la barra.","Columns":"Columnes","Corner radius":"Radi de les cantonades","Corner size":"Mida dels cantons","Corner: a quarter":"Cantonada: un quart","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Cantons: un quart de la pantalla","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + tecla (predeterminat)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + teclat numèric","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Maj+Alt + tecla","Custom color":"Color personalitzat","Custom layout %1":"Disposició personalitzada %1","Dark":"Fosc","Delay before hiding":"Retard abans d’amagar","Delay before showing":"Retard abans de mostrar","Delete":"Suprimeix","Delete layout?":"Voleu suprimir la disposició?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Distància a la qual apareix la nansa","Distance before the bar hides again":"Distància abans que la barra torni a amagar-se","Distance to the edge":"Distància a la vora","Donate with PayPal":"Feu una donació amb PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"Arrossega una vora compartida…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Arrossega una finestra cap a una vora…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Arrossega una finestra sobre una altra per intercanviar-les. Si la deixes a la barra o a una vora, flota lliurement; «Deixa surar la finestra» la torna. Els espais venen de la pàgina General.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Arrossega una finestra sobre el centre d’una altra – la previsualització mostra dues fletxes – i deixa-la anar. Amb el mosaic automàtic n’hi ha prou amb qualsevol punt de l’altra finestra.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Arrossegueu una finestra a la vora superior de la pantalla i deixeu-la anar sobre una zona.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Arrossegueu les targetes per canviar l’ordre a la barra. Feu doble clic en una targeta per editar-la.","Drop a window onto another one":"Deixar una finestra sobre una altra","Drop the window onto a zone":"Deixeu anar la finestra sobre una zona","Duplicate":"Duplica","Duration":"Durada","Dwindle":"Espiral interior","Dynamic":"Dinàmica","Edges and corners":"Vores i cantons","Edit":"Edita","Edit layout":"Edita la disposició","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Cada funció es pot activar i desactivar per separat.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Cada disposició que creïs a la pàgina Disposicions també pot ordenar finestres – apareix a dalt. La finestra 1 ocupa la zona 1 i així successivament; les finestres de més comparteixen l’última zona. Amb menys finestres que zones s’usa «Principal i pila», perquè no quedin forats.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Cada finestra troba el seu lloc tota sola, com en un gestor de finestres en mosaic.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Cada finestra troba tota sola el seu lloc a la pantalla. Les finestres noves s’hi afegeixen i les que es tanquen deixen lloc a les altres.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Exemple: dues finestres una al costat de l’altra, a partir de tres principal i pila, a partir de cinc una graella. Sense cap regla vàlida s’usa la disposició triada a dalt.","Fade in and out":"Esvaïment en aparèixer i desaparèixer","Fade the other windows":"Esvaeix les altres finestres","Features":"Funcions","Feel":"Sensació","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Adapta’t a les finestres ja ajustades","Fits the way you work.":"S’adapta a la teva manera de treballar.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Deixa surar la finestra (surt del mosaic)","Four quarters":"Quatre quarts","From":"A partir de","Fullscreen":"Pantalla completa","Gap between windows":"Espai entre finestres","Gap to the screen edge":"Espai fins a la vora de la pantalla","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Torna a donar a cada acció la tecla de l'esquema triat i elimina les tecles que l'esquema no té.","Good to know":"Bo de saber","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Agafeu una finestra per la barra de títol i arrossegueu-la cap amunt. La barra baixa; deixeu anar la finestra sobre una zona i ocuparà exactament aquell espai. Si la torneu a treure, recupera la mida anterior.","Grab window A…":"Agafa la finestra A…","Grid":"Graella","Halves":"Meitats","Hiding":"Ocultació","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Mantén a la vora per omplir l'espai lliure","Hold time":"Temps de manteniment","Hold to fill":"Mantén per omplir","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Com d’a prop ha d’arribar una vora abans d’encaixar.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Com d’a prop de la vora ha d’arribar el cursor.","How far the bar slides down":"Quant baixa la barra","How it works":"Com funciona","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Quant de temps ha d’estar la finestra contra la vora: una petita empenta. 0 = de seguida.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Quanta estona ha de quedar-se la finestra a la vora abans de créixer.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Quantes finestres comparteixen l’àrea principal (disposició «Principal i pila»).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Si ja hi ha una finestra a baix, la vora superior dona la meitat superior en lloc de maximitzar. Les meitats i els quarts també deixen lliures les finestres ajustades.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Si t’agrada KSnapUnity, pots donar suport al seu desenvolupament – gràcies!","In bar":"A la barra","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Independent de la barra d’ajust i de les vores de la pantalla.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Independent de la barra d’ajust. Cada vora s’activa per separat.","Information":"Informació","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Comportament intuïtiu i natural de les finestres.","Join at the end":"S’afegeixen al final","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K de KWin · Snap d’ajust més intel·ligent · Unity de tot en un sol sistema","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"El KDE té les seves pròpies accions de vora de pantalla i el seu propi ajust de finestres. Si la mateixa funció és activa aquí, desactiveu la del KDE: Arranjament del sistema → Gestió de finestres → Vores de la pantalla, i Comportament de les finestres → Moviment.","KDE's own edge tiling":"Mosaic de vores propi de KDE","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"El maximitzar i el mosaic propis de KDE a les vores – amb el seu contorn – es posen en pausa mentre funciona KSnapUnity, perquè només hi hagi una previsualització. La configuració de KDE no canvia: desactiva això, desactiva o elimina KSnapUnity i el comportament de KDE torna.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"Les accions de vora de pantalla del KDE encara estan actives, de manera que dos ajudants reaccionen al mateix arrossegament. Desactiveu «Maximitza» i «Mosaic» a Arranjament del sistema → Gestió de finestres → Vores de la pantalla.","KDE's own window snapping":"Enganxament de finestres propi de KDE","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"L’ajust de finestres propi del KDE també és actiu. Per a una sensació uniforme, poseu les seves zones a «Cap» a Arranjament del sistema → Gestió de finestres → Comportament de les finestres → Moviment.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"El servei de dreceres del KDE no ha respost. Encara podeu assignar les tecles a Arranjament del sistema → Dreceres → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – Editor de configuració","Keep stacked windows in line":"Mantén alineades les finestres apilades","Keep the gap between windows":"Mantén l’espai entre finestres","Keep them":"Deixa-les","Key scheme":"Esquema de tecles","Keyboard shortcuts":"Dreceres de teclat","Keys":"Tecles","Keys already in use":"Tecles ja en ús","Layout":"Disposició","Layout by number of windows":"Disposició segons el nombre de finestres","Layouts":"Disposicions","Layouts per row":"Disposicions per fila","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Vores esquerra i dreta: mitja pantalla","Left edge: left half":"Vora esquerra: meitat esquerra","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Per sota del 100 % una finestra sola queda centrada – bonic en pantalles amples.","License":"Llicència","Light":"Clar","Linear":"Lineal","Live preview":"Previsualització en directe","Load template…":"Carrega una plantilla…","Magnet":"Imant","Main + stack":"Principal + pila","Main and stack":"Principal i pila","Main area bigger":"Àrea principal més gran","Main area on the right":"Àrea principal a la dreta","Main area smaller":"Àrea principal més petita","Main in the middle":"Principal al mig","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Interruptor principal per arrossegar i les tecles.","Main window":"Finestra principal","Main windows":"Finestres principals","Main windows: %1":"Finestres principals: %1","Make it the main window":"Fes-la la finestra principal","Maximize":"Maximitza","Maximize or restore":"Maximitza o restaura","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + tecla (estil KDE)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + tecla","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Maj + tecla","Minimize":"Minimitza","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Emmiralla la disposició: la finestra principal a la dreta, les altres a l’esquerra.","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Mode 1 – Barra d’ajust i vores de la pantalla","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Mode 2 – Mosaic automàtic","More ways":"Més maneres","Motion curve":"Corba de moviment","Move a window towards others…":"Mou una finestra cap a les altres…","Move the window one place back":"Mou la finestra un lloc enrere","Move the window one place on":"Mou la finestra un lloc endavant","Name:":"Nom:","New layout":"Disposició nova","New windows":"Finestres noves","Next tiling layout":"Disposició següent","Next to the active window":"Al costat de la finestra activa","No key":"Sense tecla","No other window open":"No hi ha cap altra finestra oberta","No outer margin":"Sense marge exterior","No shortcuts":"Sense dreceres","None":"Cap","None yet.":"Encara cap.","Off":"Desactivat","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Desactivat = mode 1, activat = mode 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Desactivat: un marc neutre – només per a les previsualitzacions activades.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Desactivat: les tecles continuen assignades però no fan res.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Desactivat: les finestres es queden on les poses. Les altres funcions van igualment.","One at a time":"Una cada vegada","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Una es tanca – les altres omplen el buit","One main window less":"Una finestra principal menys","One more main window":"Una finestra principal més","One window":"Una finestra","Only one mode is switched on.":"Només hi ha un mode activat.","Open settings editor":"Obre l’editor de configuració","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Obre primer l’aplicació i després tria-la aquí.","Open the layout builder":"Obre el constructor de disposicions","Own layouts":"Disposicions pròpies","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Part de cada costat que compta com a cantó.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Pausa el mosaic de vores de KDE i la seva previsualització","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Pausa les zones d'enganxament de KDE mentre l'imant està actiu","Preview":"Vista prèvia","Previews":"Vistes prèvies","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Empenyeu una finestra contra una vora o un cantó de la pantalla i n’omplirà aquesta part. Funciona amb la barra d’ajust o sense.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Empenyeu una finestra contra una vora o un cantó: maximitza, meitats, quarts.","Push delay":"Retard d’empenta","Quarters":"Quarts","Quick":"Ràpida","Quick settings":"Configuració ràpida","Recommended values":"Valors recomanats","Remove":"Elimina","Remove rule":"Elimina la regla","Remove zone":"Elimina la zona","Reset all":"Restableix-ho tot","Reset all keys":"Restableix totes les tecles","Reset to default":"Restableix el valor per defecte","Resistance against overlapping":"Resistència a la superposició","Resize touching windows together":"Redimensiona juntes les finestres que es toquen","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Redimensionar també s’ajusta – aquí a tota l’alçada","Restore":"Restaura","Restore default layouts":"Restaura les disposicions predeterminades","Restore default layouts?":"Voleu restaurar les disposicions predeterminades?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Restaura la mida original en treure la finestra","Restore the size before snapping":"Restaura la mida d’abans de l’ajust","Rows":"Files","Save":"Desa","Screen edges":"Vores de la pantalla","Screen edges on/off":"Vores de la pantalla sí/no","Screen edges preview":"Previsualització de les vores","Set":"Assigna","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Assigna les tecles de totes les accions de cop. Podeu continuar canviant tecles soltes a sota.","Settings":"Configuració","Settings file":"Fitxer de configuració","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Sacseja el ratolí de pressa endavant i enrere mentre canvies la mida i les altres finestres tornen enrere. Una estrebada ràpida en una sola direcció no les deixa anar mai.","Shake to let go":"Sacseja per deixar anar","Shortcuts":"Dreceres","Show a small handle first":"Mostra primer una nansa petita","Show layout and zone names":"Mostra els noms de les disposicions i les zones","Show previews in the accent color":"Mostra les vistes prèvies amb el color d’èmfasi","Showing":"Visualització","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Mostra on anirà la finestra en una vora o una cantonada. Desactivat: cap previsualització.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Mostra on anirà la finestra mentre una zona de la barra està ressaltada. Desactivat: cap previsualització.","Sidebar + grid":"Barra lateral + quadrícula","Single zone":"Zona única","Six tiles":"Sis mosaics","Size & shape":"Mida i forma","Size of the main area":"Mida de l’àrea principal","Slide-in duration":"Durada de la baixada","Slide-out duration":"Durada de la pujada","Smart arranging and detection.":"Disposició i detecció intel·ligents.","Smart fill":"Ompliment intel·ligent","Smooth (default)":"Suau (predeterminada)","Snap bar":"Barra d’ajust","Snap bar and screen edges":"Barra d’ajust i vores de la pantalla","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"La barra i les vores estan desactivades – només funciona el mode 2 i la drecera de mode no fa res.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"La barra i les vores de la pantalla destorben el mosaic automàtic. Per això funcionen com a dos modes – canvia amb la drecera o aquí.","Snap bar colors:":"Colors de la barra:","Snap bar on/off":"Barra d’ajust sí/no","Snap bar preview":"Previsualització de la barra","Snap bar size":"Mida de la barra","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Barra d’ajust, vores de la pantalla, imant de finestres, dreceres i intercanvi de finestres.","Snap distance":"Distància d’enganxada","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Ajusta els separadors (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Disposicions d’ajust i mosaic automàtic.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Ajusteu la finestra activa amb combinacions de tecles.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Ajusteu la finestra activa amb el teclat. Són dreceres globals normals del KDE: també les trobareu a Arranjament del sistema → Dreceres → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Ajusta a la meitat inferior","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Ajusta al quart inferior esquerre","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Ajusta al quart inferior dret","Snap to the center third":"Ajusta al terç central","Snap to the left half":"Ajusta a la meitat esquerra","Snap to the left third":"Ajusta al terç esquerre","Snap to the left two thirds":"Ajusta als dos terços esquerres","Snap to the right half":"Ajusta a la meitat dreta","Snap to the right third":"Ajusta al terç dret","Snap to the right two thirds":"Ajusta als dos terços drets","Snap to the top half":"Ajusta a la meitat superior","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Ajusta al quart superior esquerre","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Ajusta al quart superior dret","Snapping":"Acoblament","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"L’ajust i el mosaic automàtic funcionen com a dos modes – una drecera canvia entre ells.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Així només un imant estira la finestra. La configuració de KDE no canvia: desactiva això, desactiva o elimina KSnapUnity i l’ajust de KDE torna.","Soft":"Delicada","Spacing":"Espaiat","Spiral":"Espiral","Split side by side":"Divideix un al costat de l’altre","Split top and bottom":"Divideix a dalt i a baix","Stack + main":"Pila + principal","Stick to other windows":"Enganxa a altres finestres","Stick to the screen edges":"Enganxa a les vores de la pantalla","Sticky edges":"Vores enganxoses","Support KSnapUnity":"Dona suport a KSnapUnity","Swap":"Intercanvia","Swap windows":"Intercanvia les finestres","Swap with the window above":"Intercanvia amb la finestra de dalt","Swap with the window below":"Intercanvia amb la finestra de baix","Swap with the window on the left":"Intercanvia amb la finestra de l’esquerra","Swap with the window on the right":"Intercanvia amb la finestra de la dreta","Switch mode":"Canvia el mode","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Canvia el mode (ajust / mosaic)","Switch modes with:":"Canvia el mode amb:","Switch the layout by itself":"Canvia la disposició tot sol","Switched off":"Desactivat","System":"Sistema","Take it over":"Pren-la","Take over all":"Pren-les totes","Take the main place":"Ocupen el lloc principal","Test animation":"Prova l’animació","Test on screen":"Prova a la pantalla","Test the snap bar":"Prova la barra d’ajust","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Els valors predeterminats es basen en el Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Les accions d’ajust usen els mateixos espais que la barra i recorden la mida d’abans de l’ajust: «Restaura la mida d’abans de l’ajust» la recupera.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Aquestes aplicacions no s’ordenen mai i conserven el seu lloc. Els diàlegs sempre floten.","Thirds":"Terços","Three columns":"Tres columnes","Thumbnail width":"Amplada de les miniatures","Tiling":"Mosaic","Tip":"Consell","Top / bottom":"A dalt / a baix","Top edge":"Vora superior","Top edge: full screen":"Vora superior: pantalla completa","Top edge: maximize":"Vora superior: maximitza","Top edge: top half":"Vora superior: meitat superior","Top half":"Meitat superior","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Distància d’activació des de la vora superior","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Desactiveu-ho si preferiu el contorn de KDE; aleshores desactiveu a dalt la previsualització de les vores.","Two thirds":"Dos terços","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Dues finestres intercanvien el lloc – deixa’n anar una sobre l’altra o usa les tecles.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Dues finestres intercanvien el lloc: deixa’n anar una sobre l’altra, o amb tecla.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Usa dreceres de teclat","Use screen edges":"Usa les vores de la pantalla","Use the system accent color":"Usa el color d’èmfasi del sistema","Use the window magnet":"Usa l’imant de finestres","Usual combinations":"Combinacions habituals","Version":"Versió","Wanted for: %1":"Volguda per a: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Quan una finestra s’obre, es tanca o s’intercanvia, les altres es mouen suaument en lloc de saltar.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Quan redimensioneu una finestra, les que la toquen mouen la vora compartida amb ella – res no se superposa, no queda cap espai.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Mentre redimensioneu, les finestres que no segueixen es mostren transparents.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Mentre moveu o redimensioneu una finestra, les seves vores s’enganxen a les finestres properes i a les vores de la pantalla.","Width":"Amplada","Window":"Finestra","Window magnet":"Imant de finestres","Window magnet on/off":"Imant de finestres sí/no","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Les finestres una sobre l'altra mantenen juntes les vores esquerra i dreta; les finestres de costat, les de dalt i de baix.","Windows glide to their place":"Les finestres llisquen al seu lloc","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Les finestres s’enganxen entre si i a les vores de la pantalla.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Les finestres s’aturen a l’«Espai entre finestres» de la pàgina General en lloc de tocar-se.","Yes":"Sí","Your own combination":"La vostra combinació","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Es perdran les vostres disposicions i el seu ordre.","Zone %1":"Zona %1","for KWin · v%1":"per a KWin · v%1","windows:":"finestres:","“%1” will be removed.":"S’eliminarà «%1».","…drag it onto window B…":"…arrossega-la sobre la finestra B…","…in every direction":"…en totes direccions","…let go: they trade places":"…deixa-la anar: intercanvien el lloc","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…les veïnes creixen i s’encongeixen amb ella","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ A punt – fes clic a D’acord per obrir l’editor de configuració."},"cs":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (kopie)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 používá „%2“.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 z %2 zón","0 = all in one row":"0 = všechna v jednom řádku","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Režim 1</b><br/>Lišta přichytávání a okraje obrazovky","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Režim 2</b><br/>Automatické dlaždicování","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Jediné okno zabere celou obrazovku, i když je nastaven okraj.","A new window joins":"Přibude nové okno","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Krátké postrčení dá polovinu nebo čtvrtinu. Podržte okno u okraje o chvíli déle a zvětší se až k dalšímu oknu – náhled to ukáže.","A single window":"Jediné okno","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Okno se zastaví na okraji jiného, i když s ním pohybuješ rychle. Zatřes myší nebo chvíli dál tlač, aby se uvolnilo. 0 = okna se smí volně překrývat.","About & Help":"O aplikaci a nápověda","Accent color":"Barva zvýraznění","Active":"Aktivní","Active mode":"Aktivní režim","Active width along the top edge":"Aktivní šířka podél horního okraje","Add an open application":"Přidat otevřenou aplikaci","Add rule":"Přidat pravidlo","All window features in one system.":"Všechny funkce oken v jednom systému.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Mění se i tehdy, když velikost hlavního okna změníš ručně.","Also while resizing":"Také při změně velikosti","Always floating":"Vždy plovoucí","Animation":"Animace","Appearance":"Vzhled","Apply":"Použít","Arrange windows":"Uspořádat okna","Arrange windows automatically":"Uspořádat okna automaticky","Author":"Autor","Automatic tiling":"Automatické dlaždicování","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Automatické dlaždicování je vypnuté – běží jen režim 1 a zkratka režimu nic nedělá.","Automatic tiling off":"Automatické dlaždicování vypnuto","Automatic tiling on":"Automatické dlaždicování zapnuto","Automatic tiling on/off":"Automatické dlaždicování zap/vyp","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Automatické dlaždicování, prohození oken, zkratky a magnet pro plovoucí okna.","Background opacity":"Neprůhlednost pozadí","Behavior & Animation":"Chování a animace","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Dolní okraj: dolní polovina","Bouncy":"Pružná","Buy me a coffee":"Kup mi kávu","Cancel":"Zrušit","Center focus":"Střed v centru","Center the window":"Vycentrovat okno","Change":"Změnit","Change key":"Změnit klávesu","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Klávesu změníte v editoru nastavení. Oba režimy potřebují automatické dlaždicování a lištu nebo okraje obrazovky.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Změníš je na stránce Klávesové zkratky. Při automatickém dlaždicování si okna prohodí i místo v pořadí.","Choose…":"Vyberte…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Kliknutím zónu vyberete · dvojklikem ji rozdělíte · přetahujte oddělovače","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Klikněte nebo stiskněte %1 pro přepnutí režimu.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Klikněte, pak OK – otevře se editor nastavení.","Close":"Zavřít","Close by, the edges stick together":"Nablízku se okraje přilepí","Color scheme":"Barevné schéma","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Barvy, velikost a tvar lišty.","Columns":"Sloupce","Corner radius":"Poloměr rohů","Corner size":"Velikost rohů","Corner: a quarter":"Roh: čtvrtina","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Rohy: čtvrtina obrazovky","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + klávesa (výchozí)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + numerická klávesnice","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + klávesa","Custom color":"Vlastní barva","Custom layout %1":"Vlastní rozvržení %1","Dark":"Tmavé","Delay before hiding":"Prodleva před skrytím","Delay before showing":"Prodleva před zobrazením","Delete":"Smazat","Delete layout?":"Smazat rozvržení?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Vzdálenost, ve které se objeví úchyt","Distance before the bar hides again":"Vzdálenost, po které se lišta znovu skryje","Distance to the edge":"Vzdálenost od okraje","Donate with PayPal":"Přispět přes PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"Táhněte sdílený okraj…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Táhněte okno k okraji…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Přetáhněte okno na jiné a prohodí se. Puštěné na lištu nebo okraj obrazovky volně pluje; „Nechat okno plavat“ ho vrátí. Mezery jsou na stránce Obecné.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Přetáhněte okno nad střed jiného – náhled ukáže dvě šipky – a pusťte. U automatického dlaždicování stačí kdekoli nad druhým oknem.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Přetáhněte okno k hornímu okraji obrazovky a pusťte ho na zónu.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Přetažením karet změníte pořadí v liště. Dvojklikem na kartu ji upravíte.","Drop a window onto another one":"Pustit okno na jiné","Drop the window onto a zone":"Pusťte okno na zónu","Duplicate":"Duplikovat","Duration":"Doba","Dwindle":"Spirála dovnitř","Dynamic":"Dynamická","Edges and corners":"Okraje a rohy","Edit":"Upravit","Edit layout":"Upravit rozvržení","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Každou funkci lze zapnout a vypnout zvlášť.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Každé rozvržení ze stránky Rozvržení umí i uspořádat okna – objeví se nahoře. Okno 1 dostane zónu 1 atd.; další okna sdílí poslední zónu. Při menším počtu oken než zón se použije „Hlavní a zásobník“, aby nevznikly díry.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Každé okno si samo najde své místo, jako v dlaždicovém správci oken.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Každé okno si samo najde své místo na obrazovce. Nová okna se přidají, zavřená uvolní místo ostatním.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Příklad: dvě okna vedle sebe, od tří hlavní a zásobník, od pěti mřížka. Bez odpovídajícího pravidla platí rozvržení zvolené výše.","Fade in and out":"Prolínání při zobrazení a skrytí","Fade the other windows":"Ztlumit ostatní okna","Features":"Funkce","Feel":"Pocit","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Přizpůsobit se již přichyceným oknům","Fits the way you work.":"Přizpůsobí se vašemu způsobu práce.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Nechat okno plavat (opustit dlaždicování)","Four quarters":"Čtyři čtvrtiny","From":"Od","Fullscreen":"Celá obrazovka","Gap between windows":"Mezera mezi okny","Gap to the screen edge":"Mezera od okraje obrazovky","General":"Obecné","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Dá každé akci znovu klávesu zvoleného schématu a odebere klávesy, které schéma nemá.","Good to know":"Dobré vědět","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Chyťte okno za titulkový pruh a táhněte ho nahoru. Lišta sjede dolů; pusťte okno na zónu a vyplní přesně tuto oblast. Když ho znovu odtáhnete, získá zpět původní velikost.","Grab window A…":"Uchopte okno A…","Grid":"Mřížka","Halves":"Poloviny","Hiding":"Skrytí","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Podržet u okraje pro vyplnění volného místa","Hold time":"Doba podržení","Hold to fill":"Podržet pro vyplnění","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Jak blízko se musí okraj dostat, než zaklapne.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Jak blízko k okraji se musí dostat kurzor.","How far the bar slides down":"Jak daleko lišta sjede dolů","How it works":"Jak to funguje","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Jak dlouho musí okno zůstat u okraje – malé postrčení. 0 = hned.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Jak dlouho musí okno zůstat u okraje, než se zvětší.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Kolik oken sdílí hlavní oblast (rozvržení „Hlavní a zásobník“).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Je-li dole už okno, horní okraj dá horní polovinu místo maximalizace. Poloviny a čtvrtiny také nechají přichycená okna volná.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Pokud se vám KSnapUnity líbí, můžete podpořit jeho vývoj – děkujeme!","In bar":"V liště","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Nezávislý na liště přichytávání a okrajích obrazovky.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Nezávislé na liště přichytávání. Každý okraj lze zapnout samostatně.","Information":"Informace","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Intuitivní, přirozené chování oken.","Join at the end":"Přidají se na konec","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K jako KWin · Snap jako chytřejší přichytávání · Unity jako vše v jednom systému","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE má vlastní akce okrajů obrazovky a vlastní přichytávání oken. Pokud je zde zapnutá stejná funkce, vypněte tu v KDE: Nastavení systému → Správa oken → Okraje obrazovky a Chování oken → Přesun.","KDE's own edge tiling":"Vlastní dlaždicování okrajů KDE","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"Vlastní maximalizace a dlaždicování KDE na okrajích – s obrysem – se pozastaví, dokud běží KSnapUnity, aby byl jen jeden náhled. Nastavení KDE se nemění: vypněte to, deaktivujte nebo odeberte KSnapUnity a chování KDE se vrátí.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"Vlastní akce okrajů obrazovky v KDE jsou stále zapnuté, takže na stejné tažení reagují dva pomocníci. Vypněte „Maximalizovat“ a „Dlaždice“ v Nastavení systému → Správa oken → Okraje obrazovky.","KDE's own window snapping":"Vlastní přichytávání oken KDE","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"Vlastní přichytávání oken v KDE je také zapnuté. Pro jednotný pocit nastavte jeho zóny na „Žádná“ v Nastavení systému → Správa oken → Chování oken → Přesun.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Služba zkratek KDE neodpověděla. Klávesy můžete stále nastavit v Nastavení systému → Zkratky → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – editor nastavení","Keep stacked windows in line":"Držet okna nad sebou v jedné linii","Keep the gap between windows":"Zachovat mezeru mezi okny","Keep them":"Ponechat","Key scheme":"Schéma kláves","Keyboard shortcuts":"Klávesové zkratky","Keys":"Klávesy","Keys already in use":"Již použité klávesy","Layout":"Rozvržení","Layout by number of windows":"Rozvržení podle počtu oken","Layouts":"Rozvržení","Layouts per row":"Rozvržení na řádek","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Levý a pravý okraj: polovina obrazovky","Left edge: left half":"Levý okraj: levá polovina","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Pod 100 % zůstane jediné okno uprostřed – hezké na širokých obrazovkách.","License":"Licence","Light":"Světlé","Linear":"Lineární","Live preview":"Živý náhled","Load template…":"Načíst šablonu…","Main + stack":"Hlavní + stoh","Main and stack":"Hlavní a zásobník","Main area bigger":"Větší hlavní oblast","Main area on the right":"Hlavní oblast vpravo","Main area smaller":"Menší hlavní oblast","Main in the middle":"Hlavní uprostřed","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Hlavní vypínač pro tažení a klávesy.","Main window":"Hlavní okno","Main windows":"Hlavní okna","Main windows: %1":"Hlavní okna: %1","Make it the main window":"Udělat hlavním oknem","Maximize":"Maximalizovat","Maximize or restore":"Maximalizovat nebo obnovit","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + klávesa (styl KDE)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + klávesa","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + klávesa","Minimize":"Minimalizovat","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Zrcadlí rozvržení: hlavní okno vpravo, ostatní vlevo.","Mode":"Režim","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Režim 1 – lišta přichytávání a okraje obrazovky","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Režim 2 – automatické dlaždicování","Modes":"Režimy","More ways":"Další způsoby","Motion curve":"Křivka pohybu","Move a window towards others…":"Posuňte okno k ostatním…","Move the window one place back":"Posunout okno o místo zpět","Move the window one place on":"Posunout okno o místo dál","Name:":"Název:","New layout":"Nové rozvržení","New windows":"Nová okna","Next tiling layout":"Další rozvržení dlaždic","Next to the active window":"Vedle aktivního okna","No key":"Žádná klávesa","No other window open":"Žádné jiné okno není otevřené","No outer margin":"Bez vnějšího okraje","No shortcuts":"Bez zkratek","None":"Žádná","None yet.":"Zatím žádné.","Off":"Vypnuto","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Vyp = režim 1, zap = režim 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Vypnuto: neutrální rámeček – jen pro zapnuté náhledy.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Vypnuto: klávesy zůstanou přiřazené, ale nic nedělají.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Vypnuto: okna zůstanou tam, kam je položíš. Ostatní funkce fungují tak jako tak.","One at a time":"Jedno po druhém","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Jedno se zavře – ostatní vyplní mezeru","One main window less":"O jedno hlavní okno míň","One more main window":"O jedno hlavní okno víc","One window":"Jedno okno","Only one mode is switched on.":"Zapnutý je jen jeden režim.","Open settings editor":"Otevřít editor nastavení","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Nejprve aplikaci otevřete, pak ji vyberte zde.","Open the layout builder":"Otevřít tvůrce rozvržení","Own layouts":"Vlastní rozvržení","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Část každé strany, která se počítá jako roh.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Pozastavit dlaždicování okrajů KDE a jeho náhled","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Pozastavit zóny přichycení KDE, dokud je magnet zapnutý","Preview":"Náhled","Previews":"Náhledy","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Přitlačte okno k okraji nebo rohu obrazovky a vyplní tuto část. Funguje s lištou přichytávání i bez ní.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Přitlačte okno k okraji nebo rohu: maximalizace, poloviny, čtvrtiny.","Push delay":"Prodleva přitlačení","Quarters":"Čtvrtiny","Quick":"Rychlá","Quick settings":"Rychlé nastavení","Recommended values":"Doporučené hodnoty","Remove":"Odebrat","Remove rule":"Odebrat pravidlo","Remove zone":"Odstranit zónu","Reset all":"Obnovit vše","Reset all keys":"Obnovit všechny klávesy","Reset to default":"Obnovit výchozí","Resistance against overlapping":"Odpor proti překrývání","Resize touching windows together":"Měnit velikost dotýkajících se oken společně","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Přichytává i změna velikosti – tady na plnou výšku","Restore":"Obnovit","Restore default layouts":"Obnovit výchozí rozvržení","Restore default layouts?":"Obnovit výchozí rozvržení?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Obnovit původní velikost při vytažení okna","Restore the size before snapping":"Obnovit velikost před přichycením","Rows":"Řádky","Save":"Uložit","Screen edges":"Okraje obrazovky","Screen edges on/off":"Okraje obrazovky zap./vyp.","Screen edges preview":"Náhled okrajů obrazovky","Set":"Nastavit","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Nastaví klávesy všech akcí najednou. Jednotlivé klávesy můžete dál měnit níže.","Settings":"Nastavení","Settings file":"Soubor nastavení","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Při změně velikosti rychle zatřes myší sem a tam a ostatní okna skočí zpět. Rychlé trhnutí jedním směrem je nikdy neuvolní.","Shake to let go":"Zatřást pro uvolnění","Shortcuts":"Zkratky","Show a small handle first":"Nejprve zobrazit malý úchyt","Show layout and zone names":"Zobrazit názvy rozvržení a zón","Show previews in the accent color":"Zobrazovat náhledy v barvě zvýraznění","Showing":"Zobrazení","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Ukazuje, kam okno dopadne u okraje nebo v rohu. Vypnuto: žádný náhled.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Ukazuje, kam okno dopadne, dokud je zóna lišty zvýrazněná. Vypnuto: žádný náhled.","Sidebar + grid":"Postranní panel + mřížka","Single zone":"Jedna zóna","Six tiles":"Šest dlaždic","Size & shape":"Velikost a tvar","Size of the main area":"Velikost hlavní oblasti","Slide-in duration":"Délka vysunutí","Slide-out duration":"Délka zasunutí","Smart arranging and detection.":"Chytré uspořádání a rozpoznávání.","Smart fill":"Chytré vyplnění","Smooth (default)":"Plynulá (výchozí)","Snap bar":"Lišta přichytávání","Snap bar and screen edges":"Lišta přichytávání a okraje obrazovky","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Lišta a okraje obrazovky jsou vypnuté – běží jen režim 2 a zkratka režimu nic nedělá.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Lišta a okraje obrazovky překážejí automatickému dlaždicování. Proto běží jako dva režimy – přepínejte zkratkou nebo zde.","Snap bar colors:":"Barvy lišty:","Snap bar on/off":"Lišta přichytávání zap./vyp.","Snap bar preview":"Náhled přichycovací lišty","Snap bar size":"Velikost lišty","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Lišta přichytávání, okraje obrazovky, magnet oken, zkratky a prohození oken.","Snap distance":"Vzdálenost přichycení","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Přichytávat oddělovače (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Rozvržení přichytávání a automatické dlaždicování.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Přichyťte aktivní okno kombinací kláves.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Přichyťte aktivní okno klávesnicí. Jde o běžné globální zkratky KDE – najdete je také v Nastavení systému → Zkratky → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Přichytit do dolní poloviny","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Přichytit do levé dolní čtvrtiny","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Přichytit do pravé dolní čtvrtiny","Snap to the center third":"Přichytit do prostřední třetiny","Snap to the left half":"Přichytit do levé poloviny","Snap to the left third":"Přichytit do levé třetiny","Snap to the left two thirds":"Přichytit do levých dvou třetin","Snap to the right half":"Přichytit do pravé poloviny","Snap to the right third":"Přichytit do pravé třetiny","Snap to the right two thirds":"Přichytit do pravých dvou třetin","Snap to the top half":"Přichytit do horní poloviny","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Přichytit do levé horní čtvrtiny","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Přichytit do pravé horní čtvrtiny","Snapping":"Přichytávání","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Přichytávání a automatické dlaždicování běží jako dva režimy – jedna zkratka mezi nimi přepíná.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Okno tak táhne jen jeden magnet. Nastavení KDE se nemění: vypněte to, deaktivujte nebo odeberte KSnapUnity a přichytávání KDE se vrátí.","Soft":"Měkká","Spacing":"Mezery","Spiral":"Spirála","Split side by side":"Rozdělit vedle sebe","Split top and bottom":"Rozdělit nahoru a dolů","Stack + main":"Stoh + hlavní","Stick to other windows":"Přichytávat k ostatním oknům","Stick to the screen edges":"Přichytávat k okrajům obrazovky","Sticky edges":"Lepivé okraje","Support KSnapUnity":"Podpořte KSnapUnity","Swap":"Prohodit","Swap windows":"Prohodit okna","Swap with the window above":"Prohodit s oknem nahoře","Swap with the window below":"Prohodit s oknem dole","Swap with the window on the left":"Prohodit s oknem vlevo","Swap with the window on the right":"Prohodit s oknem vpravo","Switch mode":"Přepnout režim","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Přepnout režim (přichytávání / dlaždice)","Switch modes with:":"Přepnout režim pomocí:","Switch the layout by itself":"Měnit rozvržení samo","Switched off":"Vypnuto","System":"Systém","Take it over":"Převzít","Take over all":"Převzít vše","Take the main place":"Vezmou hlavní místo","Test animation":"Vyzkoušet animaci","Test on screen":"Vyzkoušet na obrazovce","Test the snap bar":"Vyzkoušet lištu přichytávání","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Výchozí hodnoty vycházejí z Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Akce přichytávání používají stejné mezery jako lišta a pamatují si velikost před přichycením: „Obnovit velikost před přichycením“ ji vrátí.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Tyto aplikace se nikdy neuspořádají a drží si své místo. Dialogy plují vždy.","Thirds":"Třetiny","Three columns":"Tři sloupce","Thumbnail width":"Šířka náhledů","Tiling":"Dlaždicování","Top / bottom":"Nahoře / dole","Top edge":"Horní okraj","Top edge: full screen":"Horní okraj: celá obrazovka","Top edge: maximize":"Horní okraj: maximalizovat","Top edge: top half":"Horní okraj: horní polovina","Top half":"Horní polovina","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Vzdálenost aktivace od horního okraje","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Vypněte, pokud dáváte přednost obrysu KDE – pak nahoře vypněte náhled okrajů obrazovky.","Two thirds":"Dvě třetiny","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Dvě okna si vymění místa – pusťte jedno na druhé nebo použijte klávesy.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Dvě okna si vymění místa: pusťte jedno na druhé, nebo klávesou.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Používat klávesové zkratky","Use screen edges":"Používat okraje obrazovky","Use the system accent color":"Použít systémovou barvu zvýraznění","Use the window magnet":"Používat magnet oken","Usual combinations":"Obvyklé kombinace","Version":"Verze","Wanted for: %1":"Požadováno pro: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Když se okno otevře, zavře nebo prohodí, ostatní se pohnou plynule místo skoku.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Když měníte velikost okna, okna, která se ho dotýkají, posouvají společný okraj s ním – nic se nepřekrývá, nevzniká mezera.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Během změny velikosti jsou okna, která nesledují, průhledná.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Při přesunu nebo změně velikosti okna se jeho okraje přichytávají k okolním oknům a k okrajům obrazovky.","Width":"Šířka","Window":"Okno","Window magnet":"Magnet oken","Window magnet on/off":"Magnet oken zap./vyp.","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Okna nad sebou drží levé a pravé okraje pohromadě, okna vedle sebe horní a dolní.","Windows glide to their place":"Okna plynule klouzají na místo","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Okna se přichytávají k sobě navzájem a k okrajům obrazovky.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Okna se zastaví na „Mezeře mezi okny“ ze stránky Obecné, místo aby se dotýkala.","Yes":"Ano","Your own combination":"Vlastní kombinace","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Vaše vlastní rozvržení a jejich pořadí budou ztracena.","Zone %1":"Zóna %1","for KWin · v%1":"pro KWin · v%1","windows:":"oken:","“%1” will be removed.":"„%1“ bude odstraněno.","…drag it onto window B…":"…přetáhněte ho na okno B…","…in every direction":"…ve všech směrech","…let go: they trade places":"…pusťte: vymění si místa","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…sousedé rostou a zmenšují se s ním","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Připraveno – klikněte na OK a otevře se editor nastavení."},"cy":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (copi)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"Mae %1 yn cael ei ddefnyddio gan “%2”.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 o %2 parth","0 = all in one row":"0 = pob un mewn un rhes","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Modd 1</b><br/>Bar snapio ac ymylon y sgrin","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Modd 2</b><br/>Teilsio awtomatig","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Mae ffenestr unigol yn defnyddio’r sgrin gyfan, hyd yn oed gydag ymyl wedi’i gosod.","A new window joins":"Daw ffenestr newydd i mewn","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Mae gwthiad byr yn rhoi'r hanner neu'r chwarter. Daliwch y ffenestr wrth yr ymyl ychydig yn hirach ac mae'n tyfu hyd at y ffenestr nesaf – mae'r rhagolwg yn ei ddangos.","A single window":"Un ffenestr unigol","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Mae ffenestr yn stopio wrth ymyl un arall, hyd yn oed pan fyddwch yn ei symud yn gyflym. Ysgwydwch y llygoden neu daliwch ati i wthio am eiliad i’w rhyddhau. 0 = gall ffenestri orgyffwrdd yn rhydd.","About & Help":"Ynghylch a chymorth","Accent color":"Lliw acen","Active":"Gweithredol","Active mode":"Modd gweithredol","Active width along the top edge":"Lled gweithredol ar hyd yr ymyl uchaf","Add an open application":"Ychwanegu ap agored","Add rule":"Ychwanegu rheol","All window features in one system.":"Holl nodweddion ffenestri mewn un system.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Mae’n newid hefyd pan fyddwch yn newid maint y brif ffenestr â llaw.","Also while resizing":"Hefyd wrth newid maint","Always floating":"Arnofio bob amser","Animation":"Animeiddio","Appearance":"Golwg","Apply":"Gweithredu","Arrange windows":"Trefnu ffenestri","Arrange windows automatically":"Trefnu ffenestri’n awtomatig","Author":"Awdur","Automatic tiling":"Teilsio awtomatig","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Mae teilsio awtomatig wedi’i ddiffodd – dim ond modd 1 sy’n rhedeg ac nid yw’r llwybr byr modd yn gwneud dim.","Automatic tiling off":"Teilsio awtomatig i ffwrdd","Automatic tiling on":"Teilsio awtomatig ymlaen","Automatic tiling on/off":"Teilsio awtomatig ymlaen/i ffwrdd","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Teilsio awtomatig, cyfnewid ffenestri, llwybrau byr a’r magnet ar gyfer ffenestri arnofiol.","Background opacity":"Didreiddedd y cefndir","Behavior & Animation":"Ymddygiad ac animeiddio","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Ymyl isaf: hanner isaf","Bouncy":"Sbonciog","Buy me a coffee":"Prynwch goffi i mi","Cancel":"Diddymu","Center focus":"Ffocws yn y canol","Center the window":"Canoli’r ffenestr","Change":"Newid","Change key":"Newid allwedd","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Newidiwch yr allwedd yn y golygydd gosodiadau. Mae angen teilsio awtomatig a’r bar neu ymylon y sgrin ar y ddau fodd.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Newidiwch nhw ar y dudalen Llwybrau byr y bysellfwrdd. Gyda theilsio awtomatig, mae’r ffenestri hefyd yn cyfnewid eu lle yn y drefn.","Choose…":"Dewis…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Cliciwch ar barth i’w ddewis · clic dwbl i’w rannu · llusgwch y rhanwyr","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Cliciwch neu pwyswch %1 i newid modd.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Cliciwch, yna Iawn – mae’r golygydd gosodiadau’n agor.","Close":"Cau","Close by, the edges stick together":"Yn agos, mae’r ymylon yn glynu","Color scheme":"Cynllun lliw","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Lliwiau, maint a siâp y bar.","Columns":"Colofnau","Corner radius":"Radiws y corneli","Corner size":"Maint y corneli","Corner: a quarter":"Cornel: chwarter","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Corneli: chwarter y sgrin","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + bysell (rhagosodiad)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + bysellbad rhifau","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + bysell","Custom color":"Lliw personol","Custom layout %1":"Cynllun personol %1","Dark":"Tywyll","Delay before hiding":"Oedi cyn cuddio","Delay before showing":"Oedi cyn dangos","Delete":"Dileu","Delete layout?":"Dileu’r cynllun?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Pellter lle mae’r ddolen yn ymddangos","Distance before the bar hides again":"Pellter cyn i’r bar guddio eto","Distance to the edge":"Pellter o’r ymyl","Donate with PayPal":"Rhoi gyda PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"Llusgwch ymyl a rennir…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Llusgwch ffenestr at ymyl…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Llusgwch ffenestr ar un arall i’w cyfnewid. Gollyngwch hi ar y bar neu ymyl y sgrin ac mae’n arnofio’n rhydd; mae „Gadael i’r ffenestr arnofio“ yn dod â hi’n ôl. Daw’r bylchau o’r dudalen Cyffredinol.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Llusgwch ffenestr dros ganol un arall – mae’r rhagolwg yn dangos dwy saeth – a gollwng. Gyda theilsio awtomatig mae unrhyw le dros y ffenestr arall yn gwneud y tro.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Llusgwch ffenestr i ymyl uchaf y sgrin a’i gollwng ar barth.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Llusgwch y cardiau i newid y drefn yn y bar. Cliciwch ddwywaith ar gerdyn i’w olygu.","Drop a window onto another one":"Gollwng ffenestr ar un arall","Drop the window onto a zone":"Gollyngwch y ffenestr ar barth","Duplicate":"Dyblygu","Duration":"Hyd","Dwindle":"Troell i mewn","Dynamic":"Deinamig","Edges and corners":"Ymylon a chorneli","Edit":"Golygu","Edit layout":"Golygu’r cynllun","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Gellir troi pob nodwedd ymlaen ac i ffwrdd ar ei phen ei hun.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Gall pob cynllun a adeiladwch ar y dudalen Cynlluniau drefnu ffenestri hefyd – mae’n ymddangos uchod. Mae ffenestr 1 yn cael parth 1 ac ati; mae rhagor o ffenestri yn rhannu’r parth olaf. Gyda llai o ffenestri na pharthau defnyddir „Prif a phentwr“, fel nad oes tyllau.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Mae pob ffenestr yn dod o hyd i’w lle ei hun, fel mewn rheolwr ffenestri teils.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Mae pob ffenestr yn dod o hyd i’w lle ar y sgrin ar ei phen ei hun. Mae ffenestri newydd yn ymuno, mae rhai sydd wedi cau yn gadael lle i’r lleill.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Enghraifft: dwy ffenestr ochr yn ochr, o dair prif a phentwr, o bump grid. Heb reol addas defnyddir y cynllun a ddewiswyd uchod.","Fade in and out":"Pylu i mewn ac allan","Fade the other windows":"Pylu'r ffenestri eraill","Features":"Nodweddion","Feel":"Teimlad","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Addasu o gwmpas ffenestri sydd eisoes wedi’u snapio","Fits the way you work.":"Yn gweddu i’r ffordd rydych chi’n gweithio.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Gadael i’r ffenestr arnofio (gadael y teilsio)","Four quarters":"Pedwar chwarter","From":"O","Fullscreen":"Sgrin lawn","Gap between windows":"Bwlch rhwng ffenestri","Gap to the screen edge":"Bwlch i ymyl y sgrin","General":"Cyffredinol","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Yn rhoi bysell y cynllun a ddewiswyd i bob gweithred eto ac yn tynnu bysellau nad ydynt yn y cynllun.","Good to know":"Da gwybod","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Gafaelwch mewn ffenestr wrth ei bar teitl a’i llusgo i fyny. Mae’r bar yn llithro i lawr; gollyngwch y ffenestr ar barth a bydd yn llenwi’r union ardal honno. Llusgwch hi allan eto ac fe gaiff ei hen faint yn ôl.","Grab window A…":"Gafaelwch yn ffenestr A…","Halves":"Haneri","Hiding":"Cuddio","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Dal wrth yr ymyl i lenwi'r gofod rhydd","Hold time":"Amser dal","Hold to fill":"Dal i lenwi","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Pa mor agos y mae’n rhaid i ymyl ddod cyn clicio i’w le.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Pa mor agos at yr ymyl y mae’n rhaid i’r cyrchwr ddod.","How far the bar slides down":"Pa mor bell mae’r bar yn llithro i lawr","How it works":"Sut mae’n gweithio","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Pa mor hir y mae’n rhaid i’r ffenestr aros yn erbyn yr ymyl – gwthiad bach. 0 = ar unwaith.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Pa mor hir mae'n rhaid i'r ffenestr aros wrth yr ymyl cyn iddi dyfu.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Faint o ffenestri sy’n rhannu’r brif ardal (cynllun “Prif a phentwr”).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Os oes ffenestr ar y gwaelod eisoes, mae’r ymyl uchaf yn rhoi’r hanner uchaf yn lle mwyafu. Mae hanerau a chwarteri hefyd yn gadael ffenestri wedi’u snapio yn rhydd.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Os ydych chi’n hoffi KSnapUnity, gallwch gefnogi ei ddatblygiad – diolch!","In bar":"Yn y bar","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Yn annibynnol ar y bar ac ymylon y sgrin.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Yn annibynnol ar y bar. Gellir troi pob ymyl ymlaen ar wahân.","Information":"Gwybodaeth","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Ymddygiad ffenestri greddfol a naturiol.","Join at the end":"Ymuno ar y diwedd","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K am KWin · Snap am snapio callach · Unity am bopeth mewn un system","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"Mae gan KDE ei weithredoedd ymyl sgrin ei hun a’i snapio ffenestri ei hun. Os yw’r un nodwedd ymlaen yma, trowch un KDE i ffwrdd: Gosodiadau’r System → Rheoli Ffenestri → Ymylon y Sgrin, ac Ymddygiad Ffenestri → Symud.","KDE's own edge tiling":"Teilsio ymylon KDE ei hun","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"Mae mwyhau a theilsio KDE ei hun ar yr ymylon – gyda’i amlinell – yn oedi tra mae KSnapUnity yn rhedeg, fel mai dim ond un rhagolwg sy’n ymddangos. Nid yw eich gosodiadau KDE yn newid: diffoddwch hyn, analluogwch neu dynnwch KSnapUnity ac mae ymddygiad KDE yn ôl.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"Mae gweithredoedd ymyl sgrin KDE ei hun yn dal ymlaen, felly mae dau gynorthwyydd yn ymateb i’r un llusgo. Trowch “Mwyafu” a “Theilio” i ffwrdd yn Gosodiadau’r System → Rheoli Ffenestri → Ymylon y Sgrin.","KDE's own window snapping":"Snapio ffenestri KDE ei hun","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"Mae snapio ffenestri KDE ei hun ymlaen hefyd. Am deimlad cyson, gosodwch ei barthau i “Dim” yn Gosodiadau’r System → Rheoli Ffenestri → Ymddygiad Ffenestri → Symud.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Ni atebodd gwasanaeth llwybrau byr KDE. Gallwch osod y bysellau o hyd yn Gosodiadau’r System → Llwybrau Byr → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – Golygydd gosodiadau","Keep stacked windows in line":"Cadw ffenestri wedi'u pentyrru mewn llinell","Keep the gap between windows":"Cadw’r bwlch rhwng ffenestri","Keep them":"Eu cadw","Key scheme":"Cynllun bysellau","Keyboard shortcuts":"Llwybrau byr y bysellfwrdd","Keys":"Bysellau","Keys already in use":"Bysellau sydd eisoes ar waith","Layout":"Cynllun","Layout by number of windows":"Cynllun yn ôl nifer y ffenestri","Layouts":"Cynlluniau","Layouts per row":"Cynlluniau fesul rhes","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Ymyl chwith a de: hanner y sgrin","Left edge: left half":"Ymyl chwith: hanner chwith","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"O dan 100 % mae ffenestr unigol yn aros yn y canol – braf ar sgriniau llydan.","License":"Trwydded","Light":"Golau","Linear":"Llinol","Live preview":"Rhagolwg byw","Load template…":"Llwytho templed…","Main + stack":"Prif + pentwr","Main and stack":"Prif a phentwr","Main area bigger":"Prif ardal fwy","Main area on the right":"Prif ardal ar y dde","Main area smaller":"Prif ardal lai","Main in the middle":"Prif yn y canol","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Prif switsh ar gyfer llusgo a’r allweddi.","Main window":"Prif ffenestr","Main windows":"Prif ffenestri","Main windows: %1":"Prif ffenestri: %1","Make it the main window":"Gwneud yn brif ffenestr","Maximize":"Mwyafu","Maximize or restore":"Mwyafu neu adfer","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + bysell (arddull KDE)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + bysell","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + bysell","Minimize":"Lleihau","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Yn adlewyrchu’r cynllun: y brif ffenestr ar y dde, y lleill ar y chwith.","Mode":"Modd","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Modd 1 – Bar snapio ac ymylon y sgrin","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Modd 2 – Teilsio awtomatig","Modes":"Moddau","More ways":"Rhagor o ffyrdd","Motion curve":"Cromlin symud","Move a window towards others…":"Symudwch ffenestr at eraill…","Move the window one place back":"Symud y ffenestr un lle yn ôl","Move the window one place on":"Symud y ffenestr un lle ymlaen","Name:":"Enw:","New layout":"Cynllun newydd","New windows":"Ffenestri newydd","Next tiling layout":"Y cynllun teilsio nesaf","Next to the active window":"Wrth ymyl y ffenestr weithredol","No key":"Dim allwedd","No other window open":"Dim ffenestr arall ar agor","No outer margin":"Dim ymyl allanol","No shortcuts":"Dim llwybrau byr","None":"Dim","None yet.":"Dim eto.","Off":"I ffwrdd","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"I ffwrdd = modd 1, ymlaen = modd 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"I ffwrdd: ffrâm niwtral – dim ond ar gyfer y rhagolygon sydd ymlaen.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"I ffwrdd: mae’r bysellau’n aros wedi’u neilltuo ond yn gwneud dim.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"I ffwrdd: mae ffenestri’n aros lle rydych yn eu rhoi. Mae’r nodweddion eraill yn gweithio beth bynnag.","One at a time":"Un ar y tro","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Mae un yn cau – mae’r lleill yn llenwi’r bwlch","One main window less":"Un brif ffenestr yn llai","One more main window":"Un brif ffenestr yn rhagor","One window":"Un ffenestr","Only one mode is switched on.":"Dim ond un modd sydd ymlaen.","Open settings editor":"Agor y golygydd gosodiadau","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Agorwch yr ap yn gyntaf, yna dewiswch ef yma.","Open the layout builder":"Agor yr adeiladwr cynlluniau","Own layouts":"Cynlluniau eich hun","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Y rhan o bob ochr sy’n cyfrif fel cornel.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Oedi teilsio ymylon KDE a'i ragolwg","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Oedi parthau snapio KDE tra bo'r magnet ymlaen","Preview":"Rhagolwg","Previews":"Rhagolygon","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Gwthiwch ffenestr yn erbyn ymyl neu gornel y sgrin ac mae’n llenwi’r rhan honno. Yn gweithio gyda’r bar neu hebddo.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Gwthiwch ffenestr yn erbyn ymyl neu gornel: mwyafu, hanerau, chwarteri.","Push delay":"Oedi gwthio","Quarters":"Chwarteri","Quick":"Cyflym","Quick settings":"Gosodiadau cyflym","Recommended values":"Gwerthoedd a argymhellir","Remove":"Tynnu","Remove rule":"Tynnu’r rheol","Remove zone":"Tynnu’r parth","Reset all":"Ailosod y cyfan","Reset all keys":"Ailosod pob bysell","Reset to default":"Ailosod i'r rhagosodiad","Resistance against overlapping":"Gwrthiant rhag gorgyffwrdd","Resize touching windows together":"Newid maint ffenestri sy'n cyffwrdd gyda'i gilydd","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Mae newid maint yn snapio hefyd – yma i’r uchder llawn","Restore":"Adfer","Restore default layouts":"Adfer y cynlluniau rhagosodedig","Restore default layouts?":"Adfer y cynlluniau rhagosodedig?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Adfer y maint gwreiddiol wrth lusgo’r ffenestr allan","Restore the size before snapping":"Adfer y maint cyn snapio","Rows":"Rhesi","Save":"Cadw","Screen edges":"Ymylon y sgrin","Screen edges on/off":"Ymylon y sgrin ymlaen/i ffwrdd","Screen edges preview":"Rhagolwg ymylon y sgrin","Set":"Gosod","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Yn gosod bysellau pob gweithred ar unwaith. Gallwch newid bysellau unigol isod o hyd.","Settings":"Gosodiadau","Settings file":"Ffeil gosodiadau","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Ysgwydwch y llygoden yn gyflym yn ôl ac ymlaen wrth newid maint ac mae’r ffenestri eraill yn neidio’n ôl. Nid yw tyniad cyflym i un cyfeiriad byth yn eu rhyddhau.","Shake to let go":"Ysgwyd i ollwng","Shortcuts":"Llwybrau byr","Show a small handle first":"Dangos dolen fach yn gyntaf","Show layout and zone names":"Dangos enwau cynlluniau a pharthau","Show previews in the accent color":"Dangos rhagolygon yn y lliw acen","Showing":"Dangos","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Yn dangos ble mae'r ffenestr yn glanio wrth ymyl neu gornel. I ffwrdd: dim rhagolwg o gwbl.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Yn dangos ble mae'r ffenestr yn glanio tra bo parth o'r bar wedi'i amlygu. I ffwrdd: dim rhagolwg o gwbl.","Sidebar + grid":"Bar ochr + grid","Single zone":"Un parth","Six tiles":"Chwe teilsen","Size & shape":"Maint a siâp","Size of the main area":"Maint y brif ardal","Slide-in duration":"Hyd llithro i mewn","Slide-out duration":"Hyd llithro allan","Smart arranging and detection.":"Trefnu a chanfod clyfar.","Smart fill":"Llenwi clyfar","Smooth (default)":"Llyfn (rhagosodiad)","Snap bar":"Bar snapio","Snap bar and screen edges":"Bar snapio ac ymylon y sgrin","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Mae’r bar a’r ymylon wedi’u diffodd – dim ond modd 2 sy’n rhedeg ac nid yw’r llwybr byr modd yn gwneud dim.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Mae’r bar ac ymylon y sgrin yn amharu ar deilsio awtomatig. Felly maen nhw’n rhedeg fel dau fodd – newidiwch gyda’r llwybr byr neu yma.","Snap bar colors:":"Lliwiau’r bar:","Snap bar on/off":"Bar snapio ymlaen/i ffwrdd","Snap bar preview":"Rhagolwg y bar snapio","Snap bar size":"Maint y bar","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Bar snapio, ymylon y sgrin, magnet ffenestri, llwybrau byr a chyfnewid ffenestri.","Snap distance":"Pellter snapio","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Snapio’r rhanwyr (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Cynlluniau snapio a theilsio awtomatig.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Snapiwch y ffenestr weithredol gyda chyfuniadau bysellau.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Snapiwch y ffenestr weithredol gyda’r bysellfwrdd. Llwybrau byr byd-eang arferol KDE yw’r rhain – fe’u cewch hefyd yn Gosodiadau’r System → Llwybrau Byr → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Snapio i’r hanner isaf","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Snapio i’r chwarter chwith isaf","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Snapio i’r chwarter de isaf","Snap to the center third":"Snapio i’r traean canol","Snap to the left half":"Snapio i’r hanner chwith","Snap to the left third":"Snapio i’r traean chwith","Snap to the left two thirds":"Snapio i’r ddau draean chwith","Snap to the right half":"Snapio i’r hanner de","Snap to the right third":"Snapio i’r traean de","Snap to the right two thirds":"Snapio i’r ddau draean de","Snap to the top half":"Snapio i’r hanner uchaf","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Snapio i’r chwarter chwith uchaf","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Snapio i’r chwarter de uchaf","Snapping":"Snapio","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Mae snapio a theilsio awtomatig yn rhedeg fel dau fodd – un llwybr byr yn newid rhyngddynt.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Felly dim ond un magnet sy’n tynnu ffenestr. Nid yw eich gosodiadau KDE yn newid: diffoddwch hyn, analluogwch neu dynnwch KSnapUnity ac mae snapio KDE yn ôl.","Soft":"Meddal","Spacing":"Bylchau","Spiral":"Troell","Split side by side":"Rhannu ochr yn ochr","Split top and bottom":"Rhannu top a gwaelod","Stack + main":"Pentwr + prif","Stick to other windows":"Glynu wrth ffenestri eraill","Stick to the screen edges":"Glynu wrth ymylon y sgrin","Sticky edges":"Ymylon gludiog","Support KSnapUnity":"Cefnogi KSnapUnity","Swap":"Cyfnewid","Swap windows":"Cyfnewid ffenestri","Swap with the window above":"Cyfnewid â’r ffenestr uwchben","Swap with the window below":"Cyfnewid â’r ffenestr islaw","Swap with the window on the left":"Cyfnewid â’r ffenestr ar y chwith","Swap with the window on the right":"Cyfnewid â’r ffenestr ar y dde","Switch mode":"Newid modd","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Newid modd (snapio / teilsio)","Switch modes with:":"Newid modd gyda:","Switch the layout by itself":"Newid y cynllun ohono’i hun","Switched off":"Wedi’i ddiffodd","Take it over":"Ei gymryd","Take over all":"Cymryd y cyfan","Take the main place":"Cymryd y prif le","Test animation":"Profi’r animeiddio","Test on screen":"Profi ar y sgrin","Test the snap bar":"Profi’r bar snapio","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Mae’r gwerthoedd rhagosodedig yn seiliedig ar Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Mae’r gweithredoedd snapio’n defnyddio’r un bylchau â’r bar ac yn cofio’r maint cyn snapio: mae “Adfer y maint cyn snapio” yn dod ag ef yn ôl.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Ni chaiff yr apiau hyn eu trefnu byth ac maen nhw’n cadw eu lle. Mae deialogau’n arnofio bob amser.","Thirds":"Traeanau","Three columns":"Tair colofn","Thumbnail width":"Lled y mân-luniau","Tiling":"Teilsio","Tip":"Awgrym","Top / bottom":"Top / gwaelod","Top edge":"Ymyl uchaf","Top edge: full screen":"Ymyl uchaf: sgrin lawn","Top edge: maximize":"Ymyl uchaf: mwyhau","Top edge: top half":"Ymyl uchaf: hanner uchaf","Top half":"Hanner uchaf","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Pellter sbarduno o’r ymyl uchaf","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Diffoddwch hwn os yw'n well gennych amlinell KDE – yna diffoddwch ragolwg ymylon y sgrin uchod.","Two thirds":"Dwy ran o dair","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Mae dwy ffenestr yn cyfnewid lle – gollwng un ar y llall neu defnyddio’r allweddi.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Mae dwy ffenestr yn cyfnewid lle: gollwng un ar y llall, neu ag allwedd.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Defnyddio llwybrau byr y bysellfwrdd","Use screen edges":"Defnyddio ymylon y sgrin","Use the system accent color":"Defnyddio lliw acen y system","Use the window magnet":"Defnyddio’r magnet ffenestri","Usual combinations":"Cyfuniadau arferol","Version":"Fersiwn","Wanted for: %1":"Ei angen ar gyfer: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Pan fydd ffenestr yn agor, cau neu gyfnewid, mae’r lleill yn symud yn llyfn yn lle neidio.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Pan fyddwch yn newid maint ffenestr, mae ffenestri sy'n ei chyffwrdd yn symud yr ymyl a rennir gyda hi – does dim yn gorgyffwrdd, does dim bwlch.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Wrth newid maint, mae ffenestri nad ydynt yn dilyn yn cael eu dangos yn dryloyw.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Wrth i chi symud neu newid maint ffenestr, mae ei hymylon yn glynu wrth ffenestri cyfagos ac wrth ymylon y sgrin.","Width":"Lled","Window":"Ffenestr","Window magnet":"Magnet ffenestri","Window magnet on/off":"Magnet ffenestri ymlaen/i ffwrdd","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Mae ffenestri uwchben ei gilydd yn cadw'u hymylon chwith a de gyda'i gilydd, a ffenestri ochr yn ochr eu hymylon top a gwaelod.","Windows glide to their place":"Mae ffenestri’n llithro i’w lle","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Mae ffenestri’n glynu wrth ei gilydd ac wrth ymylon y sgrin.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Mae ffenestri’n stopio wrth “Bwlch rhwng ffenestri” o’r dudalen Cyffredinol yn lle cyffwrdd.","Yes":"Iawn","Your own combination":"Eich cyfuniad eich hun","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Bydd eich cynlluniau eich hun a’u trefn yn cael eu colli.","Zone %1":"Parth %1","for KWin · v%1":"ar gyfer KWin · v%1","windows:":"ffenestr:","“%1” will be removed.":"Bydd “%1” yn cael ei dynnu.","…drag it onto window B…":"…llusgwch hi ar ffenestr B…","…in every direction":"…i bob cyfeiriad","…let go: they trade places":"…gollyngwch: maen nhw’n cyfnewid lle","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…mae’r cymdogion yn tyfu ac yn crebachu gydag ef","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Barod – cliciwch Iawn i agor y golygydd gosodiadau."},"da":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (kopi)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 bruges af \"%2\".","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 af %2 zoner","0 = all in one row":"0 = alle på én række","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Tilstand 1</b><br/>Fastgørelsesbjælke og skærmkanter","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Tilstand 2</b><br/>Automatisk fliseopdeling","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Et enligt vindue bruger hele skærmen, selv når en margen er sat.","A new window joins":"Et nyt vindue kommer til","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Et kort skub giver halvdelen eller kvarten. Hold vinduet lidt længere ved kanten, så vokser det op til det næste vindue – forhåndsvisningen viser det.","A single window":"Et enkelt vindue","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Et vindue stopper ved kanten af et andet, også når du flytter det hurtigt. Ryst musen eller bliv ved med at skubbe et øjeblik for at slippe. 0 = vinduer må overlappe frit.","About & Help":"Om & hjælp","Accent color":"Accentfarve","Active":"Aktiv","Active mode":"Aktiv tilstand","Active width along the top edge":"Aktiv bredde langs overkanten","Add an open application":"Tilføj et åbent program","Add rule":"Tilføj regel","All window features in one system.":"Alle vinduesfunktioner i ét system.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Ændres også, når du ændrer hovedvinduets størrelse i hånden.","Also while resizing":"Også ved ændring af størrelse","Always floating":"Altid svævende","Appearance":"Udseende","Apply":"Anvend","Arrange windows":"Arranger vinduer","Arrange windows automatically":"Arranger vinduer automatisk","Author":"Ophavsperson","Automatic tiling":"Automatisk fliseopdeling","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Automatisk fliseopdeling er slået fra – kun tilstand 1 kører, og tilstandsgenvejen gør intet.","Automatic tiling off":"Automatisk fliseopdeling fra","Automatic tiling on":"Automatisk fliseopdeling til","Automatic tiling on/off":"Automatisk fliseopdeling til/fra","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Automatisk fliseopdeling, byt vinduer, genveje og magneten til svævende vinduer.","Background opacity":"Baggrundens uigennemsigtighed","Behavior & Animation":"Adfærd & animation","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Underkant: nederste halvdel","Bouncy":"Fjedrende","Buy me a coffee":"Køb mig en kop kaffe","Cancel":"Annullér","Center focus":"Fokus i midten","Center the window":"Centrér vinduet","Change":"Skift","Change key":"Skift tast","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Tasten ændres i indstillingseditoren. Begge tilstande kræver automatisk fliseopdeling og bjælken eller skærmkanterne.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Skift dem på siden Tastaturgenveje. Med automatisk fliseopdeling bytter vinduerne også plads i rækkefølgen.","Choose…":"Vælg…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Klik på en zone for at vælge den · dobbeltklik for at dele · træk i skillelinjerne","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Klik eller tryk %1 for at skifte tilstand.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Klik, derefter OK – indstillingseditoren åbner.","Close":"Luk","Close by, the edges stick together":"Tæt på klæber kanterne sammen","Color scheme":"Farveskema","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Bjælkens farver, størrelse og form.","Columns":"Kolonner","Corner radius":"Hjørneradius","Corner size":"Hjørnestørrelse","Corner: a quarter":"Hjørne: en fjerdedel","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Hjørner: en fjerdedel af skærmen","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + tast (standard)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + numerisk tastatur","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Skift+Alt + tast","Custom color":"Egen farve","Custom layout %1":"Eget layout %1","Dark":"Mørkt","Delay before hiding":"Forsinkelse før skjulning","Delay before showing":"Forsinkelse før visning","Delete":"Slet","Delete layout?":"Slet layoutet?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Afstand hvor håndtaget vises","Distance before the bar hides again":"Afstand før bjælken skjules igen","Distance to the edge":"Afstand til kanten","Donate with PayPal":"Donér med PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"Træk i en fælles kant…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Træk et vindue mod en kant…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Træk et vindue over på et andet for at bytte dem. Slipper du det på bjælken eller en skærmkant, svæver det frit; “Lad vinduet svæve” bringer det tilbage. Mellemrummene kommer fra siden Generelt.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Træk et vindue over midten af et andet – forhåndsvisningen viser to pile – og slip. Med automatisk fliseopdeling er hvor som helst over det andet vindue nok.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Træk et vindue til skærmens overkant og slip det på en zone.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Træk kortene for at ændre rækkefølgen i bjælken. Dobbeltklik på et kort for at redigere det.","Drop a window onto another one":"Slip et vindue på et andet","Drop the window onto a zone":"Slip vinduet på en zone","Duplicate":"Duplikér","Duration":"Varighed","Dwindle":"Spiral indad","Dynamic":"Dynamisk","Edges and corners":"Kanter og hjørner","Edit":"Redigér","Edit layout":"Redigér layout","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Hver funktion kan slås til og fra for sig.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Hvert layout, du bygger på siden Layouts, kan også arrangere vinduer – det vises ovenfor. Vindue 1 får zone 1 osv.; flere vinduer deler den sidste zone. Med færre vinduer end zoner bruges “Hoved og stak”, så der ikke opstår huller.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Hvert vindue finder selv sin plads, som i en fliseopdelende vindueshåndtering.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Hvert vindue finder selv sin plads på skærmen. Nye vinduer kommer med, lukkede giver plads til de andre.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Eksempel: to vinduer side om side, fra tre hoved og stak, fra fem et gitter. Uden passende regel bruges layoutet valgt ovenfor.","Fade in and out":"Ton ind og ud","Fade the other windows":"Ton de andre vinduer ned","Features":"Funktioner","Feel":"Følelse","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Tilpas til vinduer, der allerede er fastgjort","Fits the way you work.":"Passer til den måde, du arbejder på.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Lad vinduet svæve (forlad fliseopdeling)","Four quarters":"Fire fjerdedele","From":"Fra","Fullscreen":"Fuldskærm","Gap between windows":"Afstand mellem vinduer","Gap to the screen edge":"Afstand til skærmkanten","General":"Generelt","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Giver hver handling tasten fra det valgte skema igen og fjerner taster, som skemaet ikke har.","Good to know":"Godt at vide","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Tag fat i et vindue i titellinjen og træk det opad. Bjælken glider ned; slip vinduet på en zone, så fylder det præcis det område. Trækker du det ud igen, får det sin gamle størrelse tilbage.","Grab window A…":"Tag fat i vindue A…","Grid":"Gitter","Halves":"Halvdele","Hiding":"Skjulning","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Hold ved kanten for at fylde den frie plads","Hold time":"Holdetid","Hold to fill":"Hold for at fylde","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Hvor tæt en kant skal komme, før den klikker på plads.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Hvor tæt markøren skal komme på kanten.","How far the bar slides down":"Hvor langt bjælken glider ned","How it works":"Sådan virker det","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Hvor længe vinduet skal ligge mod kanten – et lille skub. 0 = med det samme.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Hvor længe vinduet skal blive ved kanten, før det vokser.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Hvor mange vinduer der deler hovedområdet (layoutet “Hoved og stak”).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Ligger der allerede et vindue nederst, giver overkanten den øverste halvdel i stedet for at maksimere. Halvdele og kvarte lader også fastgjorte vinduer være fri.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Kan du lide KSnapUnity, kan du støtte udviklingen – tak!","In bar":"I bjælken","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Uafhængigt af bjælken og skærmkanterne.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Uafhængigt af bjælken. Hver kant kan slås til for sig.","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Intuitiv, naturlig vinduesadfærd.","Join at the end":"Stiller sig bagerst","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K for KWin · Snap for smartere fastgørelse · Unity for alt i ét system","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE har sine egne skærmkanthandlinger og sin egen vinduesfastgørelse. Når samme funktion er slået til her, så slå KDE's fra: Systemindstillinger → Vindueshåndtering → Skærmkanter samt Vinduesadfærd → Flytning.","KDE's own edge tiling":"KDE's egne kantfliser","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"KDE’s egen maksimering og fliseopdeling ved skærmkanterne – med omrids – holder pause, mens KSnapUnity kører, så der kun vises én forhåndsvisning. Dine KDE-indstillinger ændres ikke: slå dette fra, deaktivér eller fjern KSnapUnity, og KDE’s egen opførsel er tilbage.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"KDE's egne skærmkanthandlinger er stadig slået til, så to hjælpere reagerer på samme træk. Slå \"Maksimér\" og \"Fliselæg\" fra i Systemindstillinger → Vindueshåndtering → Skærmkanter.","KDE's own window snapping":"KDE's egen vinduesfastgørelse","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE's egen vinduesfastgørelse er også slået til. For en ensartet følelse skal du sætte dens zoner til \"Ingen\" i Systemindstillinger → Vindueshåndtering → Vinduesadfærd → Flytning.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"KDE's genvejstjeneste svarede ikke. Du kan stadig angive tasterne i Systemindstillinger → Genveje → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – Indstillingseditor","Keep stacked windows in line":"Hold stablede vinduer på linje","Keep the gap between windows":"Behold afstanden mellem vinduer","Keep them":"Behold dem","Key scheme":"Tasteskema","Keyboard shortcuts":"Tastaturgenveje","Keys":"Taster","Keys already in use":"Taster, der allerede bruges","Layout by number of windows":"Layout efter antal vinduer","Layouts per row":"Layouts pr. række","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Venstre og højre kant: halv skærm","Left edge: left half":"Venstre kant: venstre halvdel","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Under 100 % holder et enligt vindue i midten – flot på brede skærme.","License":"Licens","Light":"Lyst","Linear":"Lineær","Live preview":"Live-forhåndsvisning","Load template…":"Indlæs skabelon…","Main + stack":"Hoved + stak","Main and stack":"Hoved og stak","Main area bigger":"Større hovedområde","Main area on the right":"Hovedområde til højre","Main area smaller":"Mindre hovedområde","Main in the middle":"Hoved i midten","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Hovedkontakt for træk og tasterne.","Main window":"Hovedvindue","Main windows":"Hovedvinduer","Main windows: %1":"Hovedvinduer: %1","Make it the main window":"Gør til hovedvindue","Maximize":"Maksimér","Maximize or restore":"Maksimér eller gendan","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + tast (KDE-stil)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + tast","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Skift + tast","Minimize":"Minimér","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Spejler layoutet: hovedvinduet til højre, de andre til venstre.","Mode":"Tilstand","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Tilstand 1 – Fastgørelsesbjælke og skærmkanter","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Tilstand 2 – Automatisk fliseopdeling","Modes":"Tilstande","More ways":"Flere måder","Motion curve":"Bevægelseskurve","Move a window towards others…":"Flyt et vindue hen mod andre…","Move the window one place back":"Flyt vinduet én plads tilbage","Move the window one place on":"Flyt vinduet én plads frem","Name:":"Navn:","New layout":"Nyt layout","New windows":"Nye vinduer","Next tiling layout":"Næste fliselayout","Next to the active window":"Ved siden af det aktive vindue","No key":"Ingen tast","No other window open":"Intet andet vindue åbent","No outer margin":"Ingen ydre margen","No shortcuts":"Ingen genveje","None":"Ingen","None yet.":"Ingen endnu.","Off":"Fra","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Fra = tilstand 1, til = tilstand 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Fra: en neutral ramme – kun for de forhåndsvisninger, der er slået til.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Fra: tasterne forbliver tildelt, men gør ingenting.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Fra: vinduer bliver, hvor du lægger dem. De andre funktioner virker uanset.","One at a time":"Ét ad gangen","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Ét lukker – de andre fylder hullet","One main window less":"Ét hovedvindue mindre","One more main window":"Ét hovedvindue mere","One window":"Ét vindue","Only one mode is switched on.":"Kun én tilstand er slået til.","Open settings editor":"Åbn indstillingseditoren","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Åbn programmet først, og vælg det så her.","Open the layout builder":"Åbn layoutbyggeren","Own layouts":"Egne layouts","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Den del af hver side, der tæller som hjørne.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Sæt KDE's kantfliser og dens forhåndsvisning på pause","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Sæt KDE's fastgørelseszoner på pause, mens magneten er til","Preview":"Forhåndsvisning","Previews":"Forhåndsvisninger","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Skub et vindue mod en kant eller et hjørne af skærmen, så fylder det den del. Virker med eller uden bjælken.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Skub et vindue mod en kant eller et hjørne: maksimér, halvdele, kvarte.","Push delay":"Skubforsinkelse","Quarters":"Kvarte","Quick":"Hurtig","Quick settings":"Hurtige indstillinger","Recommended values":"Anbefalede værdier","Remove":"Fjern","Remove rule":"Fjern regel","Remove zone":"Fjern zone","Reset all":"Nulstil alle","Reset all keys":"Nulstil alle taster","Reset to default":"Nulstil til standard","Resistance against overlapping":"Modstand mod overlapning","Resize touching windows together":"Ændr størrelsen på vinduer, der rører hinanden, sammen","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Størrelsesændring klæber også – her til fuld højde","Restore":"Gendan","Restore default layouts":"Gendan standardlayouts","Restore default layouts?":"Gendan standardlayouts?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Gendan den oprindelige størrelse, når vinduet trækkes ud","Restore the size before snapping":"Gendan størrelsen fra før fastgørelse","Rows":"Rækker","Save":"Gem","Screen edges":"Skærmkanter","Screen edges on/off":"Skærmkanter til/fra","Screen edges preview":"Forhåndsvisning for skærmkanterne","Set":"Angiv","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Angiver tasterne for alle handlinger på én gang. Enkelte taster kan stadig ændres nedenfor.","Settings":"Indstillinger","Settings file":"Indstillingsfil","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Ryst musen hurtigt frem og tilbage, mens du ændrer størrelse, så springer de andre vinduer tilbage. Et hurtigt træk i én retning slipper aldrig.","Shake to let go":"Ryst for at slippe","Shortcuts":"Genveje","Show a small handle first":"Vis først et lille håndtag","Show layout and zone names":"Vis navne på layouts og zoner","Show previews in the accent color":"Vis forhåndsvisninger i accentfarven","Showing":"Visning","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Viser, hvor vinduet lander ved en kant eller et hjørne. Fra: ingen forhåndsvisning.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Viser, hvor vinduet lander, mens en zone i bjælken er fremhævet. Fra: ingen forhåndsvisning.","Sidebar + grid":"Sidepanel + gitter","Single zone":"Én zone","Six tiles":"Seks felter","Size & shape":"Størrelse & form","Size of the main area":"Størrelse på hovedområdet","Slide-in duration":"Varighed ind","Slide-out duration":"Varighed ud","Smart arranging and detection.":"Smart placering og genkendelse.","Smart fill":"Smart udfyldning","Smooth (default)":"Blød (standard)","Snap bar":"Fastgørelsesbjælke","Snap bar and screen edges":"Fastgørelsesbjælke og skærmkanter","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Bjælken og skærmkanterne er slået fra – kun tilstand 2 kører, og tilstandsgenvejen gør intet.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Bjælken og skærmkanterne står i vejen for automatisk fliseopdeling. Derfor kører de som to tilstande – skift med genvejen eller her.","Snap bar colors:":"Bjælkens farver:","Snap bar on/off":"Bjælke til/fra","Snap bar preview":"Forhåndsvisning for snapbjælken","Snap bar size":"Bjælkens størrelse","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Fastgørelsesbjælke, skærmkanter, vinduesmagnet, genveje og byt vinduer.","Snap distance":"Fastgørelsesafstand","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Fastgør skillelinjer (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Fastgørelseslayouts og automatisk fliseopdeling.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Fastgør det aktive vindue med tastekombinationer.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Fastgør det aktive vindue med tastaturet. Det er almindelige globale KDE-genveje – du finder dem også i Systemindstillinger → Genveje → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Fastgør i nederste halvdel","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Fastgør i nederste venstre kvart","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Fastgør i nederste højre kvart","Snap to the center third":"Fastgør i midterste tredjedel","Snap to the left half":"Fastgør i venstre halvdel","Snap to the left third":"Fastgør i venstre tredjedel","Snap to the left two thirds":"Fastgør i venstre to tredjedele","Snap to the right half":"Fastgør i højre halvdel","Snap to the right third":"Fastgør i højre tredjedel","Snap to the right two thirds":"Fastgør i højre to tredjedele","Snap to the top half":"Fastgør i øverste halvdel","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Fastgør i øverste venstre kvart","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Fastgør i øverste højre kvart","Snapping":"Fastgørelse","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Fastgørelse og automatisk fliseopdeling kører som to tilstande – én genvej skifter mellem dem.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Så trækker kun én magnet i et vindue. Dine KDE-indstillinger ændres ikke: slå dette fra, deaktivér eller fjern KSnapUnity, og KDE’s egen fastgørelse er tilbage.","Soft":"Rolig","Spacing":"Afstand","Split side by side":"Del side om side","Split top and bottom":"Del øverst og nederst","Stack + main":"Stak + hoved","Stick to other windows":"Klæb til andre vinduer","Stick to the screen edges":"Klæb til skærmkanterne","Sticky edges":"Klæbende kanter","Support KSnapUnity":"Støt KSnapUnity","Swap":"Byt","Swap windows":"Byt vinduer","Swap with the window above":"Byt med vinduet ovenover","Swap with the window below":"Byt med vinduet nedenunder","Swap with the window on the left":"Byt med vinduet til venstre","Swap with the window on the right":"Byt med vinduet til højre","Switch mode":"Skift tilstand","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Skift tilstand (fastgørelse / fliser)","Switch modes with:":"Skift tilstand med:","Switch the layout by itself":"Skift layout af sig selv","Switched off":"Slået fra","Take it over":"Overtag","Take over all":"Overtag alle","Take the main place":"Tager hovedpladsen","Test on screen":"Test på skærmen","Test the snap bar":"Test bjælken","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Standardværdierne er baseret på Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Fastgørelseshandlingerne bruger de samme afstande som bjælken og husker størrelsen fra før fastgørelsen: \"Gendan størrelsen fra før fastgørelse\" henter den tilbage.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Disse programmer arrangeres aldrig og beholder deres egen plads. Dialoger svæver altid.","Thirds":"Tredjedele","Three columns":"Tre kolonner","Thumbnail width":"Miniaturernes bredde","Tiling":"Fliseopdeling","Top / bottom":"Øverst / nederst","Top edge":"Overkant","Top edge: full screen":"Øverste kant: fuld skærm","Top edge: maximize":"Øverste kant: maksimér","Top edge: top half":"Øverste kant: øverste halvdel","Top half":"Øverste halvdel","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Aktiveringsafstand fra overkanten","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Slå dette fra, hvis du foretrækker KDE's eget omrids – slå så forhåndsvisningen for skærmkanterne ovenfor fra.","Two thirds":"To tredjedele","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"To vinduer bytter plads – slip det ene på det andet, eller brug tasterne.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"To vinduer bytter plads: slip det ene på det andet, eller med en tast.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Brug tastaturgenveje","Use screen edges":"Brug skærmkanter","Use the system accent color":"Brug systemets accentfarve","Use the window magnet":"Brug vinduesmagneten","Usual combinations":"Almindelige kombinationer","Wanted for: %1":"Ønsket til: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Når et vindue åbner, lukker eller bytter, flytter de andre sig blødt i stedet for at hoppe.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Når du ændrer størrelsen på et vindue, flytter vinduer, der rører det, den fælles kant med – intet overlapper, intet mellemrum opstår.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Mens du ændrer størrelse, vises vinduer, der ikke følger med, gennemsigtige.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Mens du flytter eller ændrer størrelse på et vindue, klæber kanterne til nærliggende vinduer og til skærmkanterne.","Width":"Bredde","Window":"Vindue","Window magnet":"Vinduesmagnet","Window magnet on/off":"Vinduesmagnet til/fra","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Vinduer over hinanden holder venstre og højre kant sammen, vinduer ved siden af hinanden top- og bundkant.","Windows glide to their place":"Vinduer glider på plads","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Vinduer klæber til hinanden og til skærmkanterne.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Vinduer stopper ved \"Afstand mellem vinduer\" fra siden Generelt i stedet for at røre hinanden.","Yes":"Ja","Your own combination":"Din egen kombination","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Dine egne layouts og deres rækkefølge går tabt.","for KWin · v%1":"til KWin · v%1","windows:":"vinduer:","“%1” will be removed.":"“%1” bliver fjernet.","…drag it onto window B…":"…træk det over på vindue B…","…in every direction":"…i alle retninger","…let go: they trade places":"…slip: de bytter plads","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…naboerne vokser og krymper med","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Klar – klik OK for at åbne indstillingseditoren."},"de":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (Kopie)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 wird von „%2“ verwendet.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 von %2 Zonen","0 = all in one row":"0 = alle in einer Reihe","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Modus 1</b><br/>Snap-Leiste und Bildschirmkanten","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Modus 2</b><br/>Automatisch anordnen","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Ein einzelnes Fenster nutzt den ganzen Bildschirm, auch wenn ein Abstand eingestellt ist.","A new window joins":"Ein neues Fenster kommt dazu","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Ein kurzer Stoß gibt die Hälfte oder das Viertel. Hältst du das Fenster etwas länger an der Kante, wächst es bis zum nächsten Fenster – die Vorschau zeigt es an.","A single window":"Ein einzelnes Fenster","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Ein Fenster stoppt an der Kante eines anderen, auch wenn du es schnell bewegst. Schüttle die Maus oder drück einen Moment weiter, um es zu lösen. 0 = Fenster dürfen sich frei überlappen.","About & Help":"Info & Hilfe","Accent color":"Akzentfarbe","Active":"Aktiv","Active mode":"Aktiver Modus","Active width along the top edge":"Aktive Breite am oberen Rand","Add an open application":"Geöffnetes Programm hinzufügen","Add rule":"Regel hinzufügen","All window features in one system.":"Alle Fensterfunktionen in einem System.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Ändert sich auch, wenn du das Hauptfenster von Hand größer oder kleiner ziehst.","Also while resizing":"Auch beim Ändern der Größe","Always floating":"Immer schwebend","Appearance":"Aussehen","Apply":"Anwenden","Arrange windows":"Fenster anordnen","Arrange windows automatically":"Fenster automatisch anordnen","Author":"Autor","Automatic tiling":"Automatisch anordnen","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Automatisch anordnen ist aus – nur Modus 1 läuft, und das Modus-Kürzel macht nichts.","Automatic tiling off":"Automatisch anordnen aus","Automatic tiling on":"Automatisch anordnen an","Automatic tiling on/off":"Automatisch anordnen an/aus","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Automatisch anordnen, Fenster tauschen, Tastenkürzel und der Fenster-Magnet für freie Fenster.","Background opacity":"Deckkraft des Hintergrunds","Behavior & Animation":"Verhalten & Animation","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Untere Kante: untere Hälfte","Bouncy":"Federnd","Cancel":"Abbrechen","Center focus":"Fokus Mitte","Center the window":"Fenster zentrieren","Change":"Ändern","Change key":"Taste ändern","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Die Taste änderst du im Einstellungseditor. Beide Modi brauchen das automatische Anordnen und die Snap-Leiste oder die Bildschirmkanten.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Ändern kannst du sie auf der Seite Tastenkürzel. Bei automatischer Anordnung tauschen die Fenster auch ihre Plätze in der Reihenfolge.","Choose…":"Auswählen …","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Zone anklicken zum Auswählen · Doppelklick teilt sie · Teiler mit der Maus ziehen","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Klick oder drück %1, um den Modus zu wechseln.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Klick, dann OK – der Einstellungseditor öffnet sich.","Close":"Schließen","Close by, the edges stick together":"In der Nähe kleben die Kanten zusammen","Color scheme":"Farbschema","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Farben, Größe und Form der Snap-Leiste.","Columns":"Spalten","Corner radius":"Eckenradius","Corner size":"Eckengröße","Corner: a quarter":"Ecke: ein Viertel","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Ecken: Viertel des Bildschirms","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Strg+Alt + Taste (Standard)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Strg+Alt + Ziffernblock","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Strg+Umschalt+Alt + Taste","Custom color":"Eigene Farbe","Custom layout %1":"Eigenes Layout %1","Dark":"Dunkel","Delay before hiding":"Verzögerung bis zum Einfahren","Delay before showing":"Verzögerung bis zum Ausfahren","Delete":"Löschen","Delete layout?":"Layout löschen?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Abstand, ab dem der Griff erscheint","Distance before the bar hides again":"Abstand, bis die Leiste wieder einfährt","Distance to the edge":"Abstand zur Kante","Donate with PayPal":"Mit PayPal spenden","Drag a shared edge…":"Zieh an einer gemeinsamen Kante …","Drag a window against an edge…":"Zieh ein Fenster gegen einen Rand …","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Zieh ein Fenster auf ein anderes, um sie zu tauschen. Lässt du es auf der Snap-Leiste oder einem Bildschirmrand los, schwebt es frei; „Fenster schweben lassen“ holt es zurück. Die Abstände kommen von der Seite Allgemein.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Zieh ein Fenster über die Mitte eines anderen – die Vorschau zeigt zwei Pfeile – und lass los. Beim automatischen Anordnen genügt irgendwo über dem anderen Fenster.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Fenster an den oberen Bildschirmrand ziehen und auf einer Zone ablegen.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Karten ziehen, um die Reihenfolge in der Snap-Leiste zu ändern. Doppelklick auf eine Karte öffnet den Editor.","Drop a window onto another one":"Fenster auf ein anderes ziehen","Drop the window onto a zone":"Fenster auf einer Zone ablegen","Duplicate":"Duplizieren","Duration":"Dauer","Dynamic":"Dynamisch","Edges and corners":"Kanten und Ecken","Edit":"Bearbeiten","Edit layout":"Layout bearbeiten","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Jede Funktion lässt sich einzeln ein- und ausschalten.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Jedes Layout, das du auf der Seite Layouts baust, kann auch Fenster anordnen – es erscheint oben. Fenster 1 kommt in Zone 1 und so weiter; weitere Fenster teilen sich die letzte Zone. Mit weniger Fenstern als Zonen wird „Haupt und Stapel“ benutzt, damit keine Löcher entstehen.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Jedes Fenster bekommt seinen Platz von selbst, wie bei einem Kachel-Fenstermanager.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Jedes Fenster bekommt seinen Platz auf dem Bildschirm von selbst. Neue Fenster reihen sich ein, geschlossene machen Platz für die anderen.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Beispiel: zwei Fenster nebeneinander, ab drei Haupt und Stapel, ab fünf ein Raster. Ohne passende Regel gilt das oben gewählte Layout.","Fade in and out":"Beim Ein- und Ausfahren überblenden","Fade the other windows":"Andere Fenster ausblenden","Features":"Funktionen","Feel":"Gefühl","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"An bereits eingerastete Fenster anpassen","Fits the way you work.":"Passt sich deiner Arbeitsweise an.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Fenster schweben lassen (Anordnung verlassen)","Four quarters":"Vier Viertel","From":"Ab","Fullscreen":"Vollbild","Gap between windows":"Abstand zwischen Fenstern","Gap to the screen edge":"Abstand zum Bildschirmrand","General":"Allgemein","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Gibt jeder Aktion wieder die Taste des gewählten Schemas und entfernt Tasten, die das Schema nicht hat.","Good to know":"Gut zu wissen","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Fenster an der Titelleiste greifen und nach oben ziehen. Die Snap-Leiste fährt herunter; das Fenster auf einer Zone ablegen und es füllt genau diesen Bereich. Wieder wegziehen, und es bekommt seine alte Größe zurück.","Grab window A…":"Fenster A greifen …","Grid":"Raster","Halves":"Hälften","Hiding":"Ausblenden","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"An der Kante halten, um den freien Platz zu füllen","Hold time":"Haltezeit","Hold to fill":"Halten zum Auffüllen","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Wie nah eine Kante kommen muss, bevor sie einrastet.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Wie nah der Mauszeiger an die Kante kommen muss.","How far the bar slides down":"Wie weit die Leiste herunterfährt","How it works":"So funktioniert’s","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Wie lange das Fenster an der Kante anliegen muss – ein kleiner Stoß. 0 = sofort.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Wie lange das Fenster an der Kante bleiben muss, bevor es wächst.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Wie viele Fenster sich den Hauptbereich teilen (Layout „Haupt und Stapel“).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Liegt unten schon ein Fenster, gibt die obere Kante die obere Hälfte statt zu maximieren. Auch Hälften und Viertel lassen eingerastete Fenster frei.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Wenn dir KSnapUnity gefällt, kannst du die Entwicklung unterstützen – danke!","In bar":"In Leiste","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Unabhängig von der Snap-Leiste und den Bildschirmkanten.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Unabhängig von der Snap-Leiste. Jede Kante lässt sich einzeln schalten.","Information":"Informationen","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Intuitives, natürliches Fensterverhalten.","Join at the end":"Hinten anstellen","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K für KWin · Snap für smarteres Einrasten · Unity für alles in einem System","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE hat eigene Bildschirmkanten-Aktionen und ein eigenes Fenster-Einrasten. Wenn hier dieselbe Funktion an ist, schalte die von KDE aus: Systemeinstellungen → Fensterverwaltung → Bildschirmränder sowie Fensterverhalten → Verschieben.","KDE's own edge tiling":"KDEs eigenes Kanten-Kacheln","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"KDEs eigenes Maximieren und Kacheln an den Bildschirmkanten – mit seinem Umriss – pausiert, solange KSnapUnity läuft, damit nur eine Vorschau erscheint. Deine KDE-Einstellungen bleiben unverändert: Schalte das aus, deaktiviere oder entferne KSnapUnity, und KDEs eigenes Verhalten ist zurück.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"Die eigenen Bildschirmkanten-Aktionen von KDE sind noch an, dann reagieren zwei Helfer auf dasselbe Ziehen. Schalte „Maximieren“ und „Kacheln“ aus unter Systemeinstellungen → Fensterverwaltung → Bildschirmränder.","KDE's own window snapping":"KDEs eigenes Fenster-Einrasten","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"Das eigene Fenster-Einrasten von KDE ist ebenfalls an. Für ein einheitliches Gefühl stell seine Einrastzonen auf „Keine“ unter Systemeinstellungen → Fensterverwaltung → Fensterverhalten → Verschieben.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Der KDE-Kurzbefehldienst hat nicht geantwortet. Du kannst die Tasten weiterhin unter Systemeinstellungen → Kurzbefehle → KWin festlegen.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – Einstellungseditor","Keep stacked windows in line":"Gestapelte Fenster in einer Linie halten","Keep the gap between windows":"Abstand zwischen Fenstern beibehalten","Keep them":"Behalten","Key scheme":"Tastenschema","Keyboard shortcuts":"Tastenkürzel","Keys":"Tasten","Keys already in use":"Bereits belegte Tasten","Layout by number of windows":"Layout nach Anzahl der Fenster","Layouts per row":"Layouts pro Reihe","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Linke und rechte Kante: halber Bildschirm","Left edge: left half":"Linker Rand: linke Hälfte","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Unter 100 % bleibt ein einzelnes Fenster mittig – schön auf breiten Bildschirmen.","License":"Lizenz","Light":"Hell","Live preview":"Live-Vorschau","Load template…":"Vorlage laden …","Main + stack":"Haupt + Stapel","Main and stack":"Haupt und Stapel","Main area bigger":"Hauptbereich größer","Main area on the right":"Hauptbereich rechts","Main area smaller":"Hauptbereich kleiner","Main in the middle":"Haupt in der Mitte","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Hauptschalter für das Ziehen und die Tasten.","Main window":"Hauptfenster","Main windows":"Hauptfenster-Anzahl","Main windows: %1":"Hauptfenster: %1","Make it the main window":"Zum Hauptfenster machen","Maximize":"Maximieren","Maximize or restore":"Maximieren oder wiederherstellen","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + Taste (KDE-Stil)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Strg+Alt + Taste","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Umschalt + Taste","Minimize":"Minimieren","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Spiegelt das Layout: Das Hauptfenster sitzt rechts, die anderen links.","Mode":"Modus","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Modus 1 – Snap-Leiste und Bildschirmkanten","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Modus 2 – Automatisch anordnen","Modes":"Modi","More ways":"Mehrere Wege","Motion curve":"Bewegungskurve","Move a window towards others…":"Schieb ein Fenster zu anderen …","Move the window one place back":"Fenster einen Platz zurück","Move the window one place on":"Fenster einen Platz weiter","New layout":"Neues Layout","New windows":"Neue Fenster","Next tiling layout":"Nächstes Anordnungs-Layout","Next to the active window":"Neben das aktive Fenster","No key":"Keine Taste","No other window open":"Kein anderes Fenster offen","No outer margin":"Kein Außenabstand","No shortcuts":"Keine Kürzel","None":"Keine","None yet.":"Noch keine.","Off":"Aus","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Aus = Modus 1, an = Modus 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Aus: ein neutraler Rahmen – nur für die Vorschauen, die eingeschaltet sind.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Aus: Die Tasten bleiben belegt, tun aber nichts.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Aus: Fenster bleiben, wo du sie hinlegst. Die anderen Funktionen gehen in beiden Fällen.","One at a time":"Eins nach dem anderen","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Eins schließt – die anderen füllen die Lücke","One main window less":"Ein Hauptfenster weniger","One more main window":"Ein Hauptfenster mehr","One window":"Ein Fenster","Only one mode is switched on.":"Nur ein Modus ist eingeschaltet.","Open settings editor":"Einstellungseditor öffnen","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Öffne das Programm zuerst und wähle es dann hier.","Open the layout builder":"Layout-Baukasten öffnen","Own layouts":"Eigene Layouts","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Anteil jeder Seite, der als Ecke zählt.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"KDEs Kanten-Kacheln und dessen Vorschau pausieren","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"KDEs Einrastzonen pausieren, solange der Magnet an ist","Preview":"Vorschau","Previews":"Vorschauen","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Drück ein Fenster gegen eine Kante oder Ecke des Bildschirms, und es füllt diesen Teil aus. Funktioniert mit oder ohne Snap-Leiste.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Fenster gegen eine Kante oder Ecke drücken: maximieren, Hälften, Viertel.","Push delay":"Andruck-Verzögerung","Quarters":"Viertel","Quick":"Zügig","Quick settings":"Quick-Einstellungen","Recommended values":"Empfohlene Werte","Remove":"Entfernen","Remove rule":"Regel entfernen","Remove zone":"Zone entfernen","Reset all":"Alle zurücksetzen","Reset all keys":"Alle Tasten zurücksetzen","Reset to default":"Auf Standard zurücksetzen","Resistance against overlapping":"Widerstand gegen Überlappen","Resize touching windows together":"Berührende Fenster gemeinsam in der Größe ändern","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Auch beim Größe-Ändern rastet es ein – hier auf volle Höhe","Restore":"Wiederherstellen","Restore default layouts":"Standard-Layouts wiederherstellen","Restore default layouts?":"Standard-Layouts wiederherstellen?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Ursprüngliche Größe beim Herausziehen wiederherstellen","Restore the size before snapping":"Größe von vor dem Einrasten wiederherstellen","Rows":"Zeilen","Save":"Speichern","Screen edges":"Bildschirmkanten","Screen edges on/off":"Bildschirmkanten an/aus","Screen edges preview":"Vorschau der Bildschirmkanten","Set":"Setzen","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Setzt die Tasten aller Aktionen auf einmal. Einzelne Tasten kannst du unten weiterhin ändern.","Settings":"Einstellungen","Settings file":"Einstellungsdatei","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Schüttle beim Größe-Ändern die Maus schnell hin und her, und die anderen Fenster springen zurück. Ein schneller Zug in eine Richtung löst nie.","Shake to let go":"Schütteln zum Lösen","Shortcuts":"Kürzel","Show a small handle first":"Zuerst einen kleinen Griff zeigen","Show layout and zone names":"Layout- und Zonennamen anzeigen","Show previews in the accent color":"Vorschauen in der Akzentfarbe zeigen","Showing":"Einblenden","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Zeigt, wo das Fenster an einer Kante oder Ecke landet. Aus: gar keine Vorschau.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Zeigt, wo das Fenster landet, solange eine Zone der Snap-Leiste markiert ist. Aus: gar keine Vorschau.","Sidebar + grid":"Seitenleiste + Raster","Single zone":"Eine Zone","Six tiles":"Sechs Kacheln","Size & shape":"Größe & Form","Size of the main area":"Größe des Hauptbereichs","Slide-in duration":"Dauer beim Herunterfahren","Slide-out duration":"Dauer beim Zurückfahren","Smart arranging and detection.":"Kluges Anordnen und Erkennen.","Smart fill":"Intelligentes Füllen","Smooth (default)":"Sanft (Standard)","Snap bar":"Snap-Leiste","Snap bar and screen edges":"Snap-Leiste und Bildschirmkanten","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Snap-Leiste und Bildschirmkanten sind aus – nur Modus 2 läuft, und das Modus-Kürzel macht nichts.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Snap-Leiste und Bildschirmkanten stören das automatische Anordnen. Darum laufen sie als zwei Modi – wechsle mit dem Tastenkürzel oder hier.","Snap bar colors:":"Farben der Snap-Leiste:","Snap bar on/off":"Snap-Leiste an/aus","Snap bar preview":"Vorschau der Snap-Leiste","Snap bar size":"Größe der Snap-Leiste","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Snap-Leiste, Bildschirmkanten, Fenster-Magnet, Tastenkürzel und Fenster tauschen.","Snap distance":"Einrastabstand","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Teiler einrasten (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Snap-Layouts und automatisches Anordnen.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Das aktive Fenster per Tastenkombination einrasten.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Das aktive Fenster mit der Tastatur einrasten. Das sind normale globale KDE-Kurzbefehle – du findest sie auch unter Systemeinstellungen → Kurzbefehle → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"In die untere Hälfte","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Ins Viertel unten links","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Ins Viertel unten rechts","Snap to the center third":"Ins mittlere Drittel","Snap to the left half":"In die linke Hälfte","Snap to the left third":"Ins linke Drittel","Snap to the left two thirds":"In die linken zwei Drittel","Snap to the right half":"In die rechte Hälfte","Snap to the right third":"Ins rechte Drittel","Snap to the right two thirds":"In die rechten zwei Drittel","Snap to the top half":"In die obere Hälfte","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Ins Viertel oben links","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Ins Viertel oben rechts","Snapping":"Andocken","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Einrasten und automatisches Anordnen laufen als zwei Modi – ein Tastenkürzel wechselt zwischen ihnen.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"So zieht nur ein Magnet an einem Fenster. Deine KDE-Einstellungen bleiben unverändert: Schalte das aus, deaktiviere oder entferne KSnapUnity, und KDEs eigenes Einrasten ist zurück.","Soft":"Weich","Spacing":"Abstände","Spiral":"Spirale","Split side by side":"Nebeneinander teilen","Split top and bottom":"Übereinander teilen","Stack + main":"Stapel + Haupt","Stick to other windows":"An anderen Fenstern haften","Stick to the screen edges":"An den Bildschirmrändern haften","Sticky edges":"Klebende Kanten","Support KSnapUnity":"KSnapUnity unterstützen","Swap":"Tauschen","Swap windows":"Fenster tauschen","Swap with the window above":"Mit dem Fenster darüber tauschen","Swap with the window below":"Mit dem Fenster darunter tauschen","Swap with the window on the left":"Mit dem Fenster links tauschen","Swap with the window on the right":"Mit dem Fenster rechts tauschen","Switch mode":"Modus wechseln","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Modus wechseln (Einrasten / Anordnen)","Switch modes with:":"Modus wechseln mit:","Switch the layout by itself":"Layout selbst wechseln","Switched off":"Ausgeschaltet","Take it over":"Übernehmen","Take over all":"Alle übernehmen","Take the main place":"Den Hauptplatz nehmen","Test animation":"Animation testen","Test on screen":"Auf dem Bildschirm testen","Test the snap bar":"Snap-Leiste testen","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Die Standardwerte orientieren sich an Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Die Einrast-Aktionen nutzen dieselben Abstände wie die Snap-Leiste und merken sich die Größe vor dem Einrasten: „Größe von vor dem Einrasten wiederherstellen“ holt sie zurück.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Diese Programme werden nie angeordnet und behalten ihren eigenen Platz. Dialoge schweben immer.","Thirds":"Drittel","Three columns":"Drei Spalten","Thumbnail width":"Breite der Vorschaubilder","Tiling":"Anordnung","Tip":"Tipp","Top / bottom":"Oben / Unten","Top edge":"Obere Kante","Top edge: full screen":"Oberer Rand: Vollbild","Top edge: maximize":"Oberer Rand: maximieren","Top edge: top half":"Oberer Rand: obere Hälfte","Top half":"Obere Hälfte","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Auslöseabstand zum oberen Rand","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Schalte das aus, wenn dir KDEs eigener Umriss lieber ist – dann schalte oben die Vorschau der Bildschirmkanten aus.","Two thirds":"Zwei Drittel","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Zwei Fenster tauschen die Plätze – eins auf das andere ziehen oder die Tasten nutzen.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Zwei Fenster tauschen die Plätze: eins auf das andere ziehen oder per Taste.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Tastenkürzel verwenden","Use screen edges":"Bildschirmkanten verwenden","Use the system accent color":"Akzentfarbe des Systems verwenden","Use the window magnet":"Fenster-Magnet verwenden","Usual combinations":"Übliche Kombinationen","Wanted for: %1":"Gewünscht für: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Wenn ein Fenster öffnet, schließt oder tauscht, bewegen sich die anderen sanft, statt zu springen.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Wenn du ein Fenster in der Größe änderst, schieben Fenster, die es berühren, die gemeinsame Kante mit – nichts überlappt, keine Lücke entsteht.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Beim Größe-Ändern werden Fenster, die nicht mitgehen, durchsichtig angezeigt.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Während du ein Fenster verschiebst oder seine Größe änderst, haften seine Kanten an nahen Fenstern und an den Bildschirmrändern.","Width":"Breite","Window":"Fenster","Window magnet":"Fenster-Magnet","Window magnet on/off":"Fenster-Magnet an/aus","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Fenster übereinander halten ihre linken und rechten Kanten zusammen, Fenster nebeneinander ihre oberen und unteren.","Windows glide to their place":"Fenster gleiten an ihren Platz","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Fenster haften aneinander und an den Bildschirmrändern.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Fenster halten den „Abstand zwischen Fenstern“ von der Seite Allgemein ein, statt sich zu berühren.","Yes":"Ja","Your own combination":"Eigene Kombination","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Eigene Layouts und die Reihenfolge gehen dabei verloren.","for KWin · v%1":"für KWin · v%1","windows:":"Fenstern:","“%1” will be removed.":"„%1“ wird entfernt.","…drag it onto window B…":"… auf Fenster B ziehen …","…in every direction":"… in jede Richtung","…let go: they trade places":"… loslassen: sie tauschen die Plätze","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"… die Nachbarn wachsen und schrumpfen mit","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Bereit – klick OK, um den Einstellungseditor zu öffnen."},"el":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (αντίγραφο)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"Το %1 χρησιμοποιείται από «%2».","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 από %2 ζώνες","0 = all in one row":"0 = όλες σε μία σειρά","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Λειτουργία 1</b><br/>Μπάρα προσκόλλησης και άκρα οθόνης","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Λειτουργία 2</b><br/>Αυτόματη παράθεση","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Ένα μόνο παράθυρο καλύπτει όλη την οθόνη, ακόμη κι αν έχει οριστεί περιθώριο.","A new window joins":"Προστίθεται νέο παράθυρο","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Ένα σύντομο σπρώξιμο δίνει το μισό ή το τέταρτο. Κρατήστε το παράθυρο λίγο περισσότερο στην άκρη και μεγαλώνει ως το επόμενο παράθυρο – η προεπισκόπηση το δείχνει.","A single window":"Ένα μόνο παράθυρο","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Ένα παράθυρο σταματά στην άκρη ενός άλλου, ακόμα κι αν το μετακινείτε γρήγορα. Κουνήστε το ποντίκι ή συνεχίστε να σπρώχνετε για μια στιγμή για να το αφήσετε. 0 = τα παράθυρα επικαλύπτονται ελεύθερα.","About & Help":"Σχετικά & βοήθεια","Accent color":"Χρώμα έμφασης","Active":"Ενεργό","Active mode":"Ενεργή λειτουργία","Active width along the top edge":"Ενεργό πλάτος κατά μήκος του πάνω άκρου","Add an open application":"Προσθήκη ανοιχτής εφαρμογής","Add rule":"Προσθήκη κανόνα","All window features in one system.":"Όλες οι λειτουργίες παραθύρων σε ένα σύστημα.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Αλλάζει επίσης όταν αλλάζετε με το χέρι το μέγεθος του κύριου παραθύρου.","Also while resizing":"Και κατά την αλλαγή μεγέθους","Always floating":"Πάντα αιωρούμενα","Animation":"Κίνηση","Appearance":"Εμφάνιση","Apply":"Εφαρμογή","Arrange windows":"Τακτοποίηση παραθύρων","Arrange windows automatically":"Αυτόματη τακτοποίηση παραθύρων","Author":"Δημιουργός","Automatic tiling":"Αυτόματη παράθεση","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Η αυτόματη παράθεση είναι ανενεργή – τρέχει μόνο η λειτουργία 1 και η συντόμευση λειτουργίας δεν κάνει τίποτα.","Automatic tiling off":"Αυτόματη παράθεση ανενεργή","Automatic tiling on":"Αυτόματη παράθεση ενεργή","Automatic tiling on/off":"Αυτόματη παράθεση ναι/όχι","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Αυτόματη παράθεση, ανταλλαγή παραθύρων, συντομεύσεις και ο μαγνήτης για αιωρούμενα παράθυρα.","Background opacity":"Αδιαφάνεια φόντου","Behavior & Animation":"Συμπεριφορά & κίνηση","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Κάτω άκρο: κάτω μισό","Bouncy":"Ελαστική","Buy me a coffee":"Κέρασέ με έναν καφέ","Cancel":"Ακύρωση","Center focus":"Εστίαση στο κέντρο","Center the window":"Κεντράρισμα παραθύρου","Change":"Αλλαγή","Change key":"Αλλαγή πλήκτρου","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Το πλήκτρο αλλάζει στον επεξεργαστή ρυθμίσεων. Και οι δύο λειτουργίες χρειάζονται αυτόματη παράθεση και τη μπάρα ή τα άκρα της οθόνης.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Αλλάξτε τα στη σελίδα Συντομεύσεις πληκτρολογίου. Με την αυτόματη παράθεση, τα παράθυρα ανταλλάσσουν και τη θέση τους στη σειρά.","Choose…":"Επιλογή…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Κλικ σε ζώνη για επιλογή · διπλό κλικ για διαίρεση · σύρετε τα διαχωριστικά","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Κάντε κλικ ή πατήστε %1 για αλλαγή λειτουργίας.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Κλικ και μετά OK – ανοίγει ο επεξεργαστής ρυθμίσεων.","Close":"Κλείσιμο","Close by, the edges stick together":"Κοντά, τα άκρα κολλάνε μεταξύ τους","Color scheme":"Χρωματικός συνδυασμός","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Χρώματα, μέγεθος και σχήμα της μπάρας.","Columns":"Στήλες","Corner radius":"Ακτίνα γωνιών","Corner size":"Μέγεθος γωνιών","Corner: a quarter":"Γωνία: ένα τέταρτο","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Γωνίες: ένα τέταρτο της οθόνης","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + πλήκτρο (προεπιλογή)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + αριθμητικό πληκτρολόγιο","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + πλήκτρο","Custom color":"Προσαρμοσμένο χρώμα","Custom layout %1":"Προσαρμοσμένη διάταξη %1","Dark":"Σκοτεινό","Delay before hiding":"Καθυστέρηση πριν την απόκρυψη","Delay before showing":"Καθυστέρηση πριν την εμφάνιση","Delete":"Διαγραφή","Delete layout?":"Διαγραφή διάταξης;","Distance at which the handle appears":"Απόσταση στην οποία εμφανίζεται η λαβή","Distance before the bar hides again":"Απόσταση πριν κρυφτεί ξανά η μπάρα","Distance to the edge":"Απόσταση από το άκρο","Donate with PayPal":"Δωρεά με PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"Σύρετε ένα κοινό άκρο…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Σύρετε ένα παράθυρο σε ένα άκρο…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Σύρετε ένα παράθυρο πάνω σε άλλο για να τα ανταλλάξετε. Αφημένο στη μπάρα ή σε άκρο της οθόνης, αιωρείται ελεύθερα· η «Αιώρηση παραθύρου» το επαναφέρει. Τα κενά ορίζονται στη σελίδα Γενικά.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Σύρετε ένα παράθυρο πάνω από τη μέση άλλου – η προεπισκόπηση δείχνει δύο βέλη – και αφήστε. Με αυτόματη παράθεση αρκεί οπουδήποτε πάνω στο άλλο παράθυρο.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Σύρετε ένα παράθυρο στο πάνω άκρο της οθόνης και αφήστε το σε μια ζώνη.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Σύρετε τις κάρτες για να αλλάξετε τη σειρά στη μπάρα. Διπλό κλικ σε μια κάρτα για επεξεργασία.","Drop a window onto another one":"Άφημα παραθύρου πάνω σε άλλο","Drop the window onto a zone":"Αφήστε το παράθυρο σε μια ζώνη","Duplicate":"Αντίγραφο","Duration":"Διάρκεια","Dwindle":"Σπείρα προς τα μέσα","Dynamic":"Δυναμική","Edges and corners":"Άκρα και γωνίες","Edit":"Επεξεργασία","Edit layout":"Επεξεργασία διάταξης","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Κάθε λειτουργία ενεργοποιείται και απενεργοποιείται ξεχωριστά.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Κάθε διάταξη που φτιάχνετε στη σελίδα Διατάξεις μπορεί να τακτοποιεί και παράθυρα – εμφανίζεται πιο πάνω. Το παράθυρο 1 παίρνει τη ζώνη 1 κ.ο.κ.· τα επιπλέον μοιράζονται την τελευταία ζώνη. Με λιγότερα παράθυρα από ζώνες χρησιμοποιείται το «Κύριο και στοίβα», ώστε να μη μένουν κενά.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Κάθε παράθυρο βρίσκει μόνο του τη θέση του, όπως σε έναν διαχειριστή παραθύρων με παράθεση.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Κάθε παράθυρο βρίσκει μόνο του τη θέση του στην οθόνη. Τα νέα παράθυρα μπαίνουν στη σειρά, τα κλειστά αφήνουν χώρο στα άλλα.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Παράδειγμα: δύο παράθυρα δίπλα-δίπλα, από τρία κύριο και στοίβα, από πέντε πλέγμα. Χωρίς κανόνα ισχύει η διάταξη που επιλέξατε πάνω.","Fade in and out":"Σταδιακή εμφάνιση και εξαφάνιση","Fade the other windows":"Ξεθώριασμα των άλλων παραθύρων","Features":"Λειτουργίες","Feel":"Αίσθηση","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Προσαρμογή γύρω από ήδη προσκολλημένα παράθυρα","Fits the way you work.":"Ταιριάζει στον τρόπο που δουλεύετε.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Αιώρηση παραθύρου (έξοδος από την παράθεση)","Four quarters":"Τέσσερα τέταρτα","From":"Από","Fullscreen":"Πλήρης οθόνη","Gap between windows":"Απόσταση μεταξύ παραθύρων","Gap to the screen edge":"Απόσταση από το άκρο της οθόνης","General":"Γενικά","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Δίνει ξανά σε κάθε ενέργεια το πλήκτρο του επιλεγμένου σχήματος και αφαιρεί πλήκτρα που δεν έχει το σχήμα.","Good to know":"Καλό να ξέρετε","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Πιάστε ένα παράθυρο από τη γραμμή τίτλου και σύρετέ το προς τα πάνω. Η μπάρα κατεβαίνει· αφήστε το παράθυρο σε μια ζώνη και θα καλύψει ακριβώς αυτή την περιοχή. Αν το τραβήξετε ξανά έξω, παίρνει πίσω το παλιό του μέγεθος.","Grab window A…":"Πιάστε το παράθυρο A…","Grid":"Πλέγμα","Halves":"Μισά","Hiding":"Απόκρυψη","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Κράτημα στην άκρη για γέμισμα του ελεύθερου χώρου","Hold time":"Χρόνος κρατήματος","Hold to fill":"Κράτημα για γέμισμα","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Πόσο κοντά πρέπει να φτάσει ένα άκρο πριν κουμπώσει στη θέση του.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Πόσο κοντά στο άκρο πρέπει να φτάσει ο δείκτης.","How far the bar slides down":"Πόσο χαμηλά κατεβαίνει η μπάρα","How it works":"Πώς λειτουργεί","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Πόσο πρέπει να μείνει το παράθυρο στο άκρο – μια μικρή ώθηση. 0 = αμέσως.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Πόση ώρα πρέπει να μείνει το παράθυρο στην άκρη πριν μεγαλώσει.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Πόσα παράθυρα μοιράζονται την κύρια περιοχή (διάταξη «Κύριο και στοίβα»).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Αν υπάρχει ήδη παράθυρο κάτω, το πάνω άκρο δίνει το πάνω μισό αντί για μεγιστοποίηση. Και τα μισά και τα τέταρτα αφήνουν ελεύθερα τα προσκολλημένα παράθυρα.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Αν σας αρέσει το KSnapUnity, μπορείτε να υποστηρίξετε την ανάπτυξή του – ευχαριστούμε!","In bar":"Στη μπάρα","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Ανεξάρτητα από τη μπάρα και τα άκρα της οθόνης.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Ανεξάρτητα από τη μπάρα. Κάθε άκρο ενεργοποιείται χωριστά.","Information":"Πληροφορίες","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Διαισθητική, φυσική συμπεριφορά παραθύρων.","Join at the end":"Μπαίνουν στο τέλος","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K για KWin · Snap για εξυπνότερη προσκόλληση · Unity για όλα σε ένα σύστημα","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"Το KDE έχει δικές του ενέργειες άκρων οθόνης και δική του προσκόλληση παραθύρων. Αν η ίδια λειτουργία είναι ενεργή εδώ, απενεργοποιήστε του KDE: Ρυθμίσεις συστήματος → Διαχείριση παραθύρων → Άκρα οθόνης, και Συμπεριφορά παραθύρων → Μετακίνηση.","KDE's own edge tiling":"Η παράθεση άκρων του ίδιου του KDE","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"Η μεγιστοποίηση και παράθεση του KDE στα άκρα – με το περίγραμμά της – παύει όσο τρέχει το KSnapUnity, ώστε να εμφανίζεται μία μόνο προεπισκόπηση. Οι ρυθμίσεις του KDE δεν αλλάζουν: απενεργοποιήστε αυτό ή το KSnapUnity ή αφαιρέστε το, και η συμπεριφορά του KDE επιστρέφει.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"Οι δικές του ενέργειες άκρων οθόνης του KDE είναι ακόμη ενεργές, έτσι δύο βοηθοί αντιδρούν στο ίδιο σύρσιμο. Απενεργοποιήστε τα «Μεγιστοποίηση» και «Παράθεση» στις Ρυθμίσεις συστήματος → Διαχείριση παραθύρων → Άκρα οθόνης.","KDE's own window snapping":"Το κούμπωμα παραθύρων του ίδιου του KDE","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"Η δική του προσκόλληση παραθύρων του KDE είναι επίσης ενεργή. Για ενιαία αίσθηση, ορίστε τις ζώνες της σε «Κανένα» στις Ρυθμίσεις συστήματος → Διαχείριση παραθύρων → Συμπεριφορά παραθύρων → Μετακίνηση.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Η υπηρεσία συντομεύσεων του KDE δεν απάντησε. Μπορείτε ακόμη να ορίσετε τα πλήκτρα στις Ρυθμίσεις συστήματος → Συντομεύσεις → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – Επεξεργαστής ρυθμίσεων","Keep stacked windows in line":"Στοιβαγμένα παράθυρα σε μία γραμμή","Keep the gap between windows":"Διατήρηση της απόστασης μεταξύ παραθύρων","Keep them":"Κράτησέ τα","Key scheme":"Σχήμα πλήκτρων","Keyboard shortcuts":"Συντομεύσεις πληκτρολογίου","Keys":"Πλήκτρα","Keys already in use":"Πλήκτρα σε χρήση","Layout":"Διάταξη","Layout by number of windows":"Διάταξη ανά αριθμό παραθύρων","Layouts":"Διατάξεις","Layouts per row":"Διατάξεις ανά σειρά","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Αριστερό και δεξί άκρο: μισή οθόνη","Left edge: left half":"Αριστερό άκρο: αριστερό μισό","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Κάτω από 100 % ένα μόνο παράθυρο μένει στο κέντρο – ωραίο σε φαρδιές οθόνες.","License":"Άδεια","Light":"Φωτεινό","Linear":"Γραμμική","Live preview":"Ζωντανή προεπισκόπηση","Load template…":"Φόρτωση προτύπου…","Magnet":"Μαγνήτης","Main + stack":"Κύριο + στοίβα","Main and stack":"Κύριο και στοίβα","Main area bigger":"Μεγαλύτερη κύρια περιοχή","Main area on the right":"Κύρια περιοχή δεξιά","Main area smaller":"Μικρότερη κύρια περιοχή","Main in the middle":"Κύριο στη μέση","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Κεντρικός διακόπτης για το σύρσιμο και τα πλήκτρα.","Main window":"Κύριο παράθυρο","Main windows":"Κύρια παράθυρα","Main windows: %1":"Κύρια παράθυρα: %1","Make it the main window":"Κάνε το κύριο παράθυρο","Maximize":"Μεγιστοποίηση","Maximize or restore":"Μεγιστοποίηση ή επαναφορά","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + πλήκτρο (στυλ KDE)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + πλήκτρο","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + πλήκτρο","Minimize":"Ελαχιστοποίηση","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Καθρεφτίζει τη διάταξη: το κύριο παράθυρο δεξιά, τα άλλα αριστερά.","Mode":"Λειτουργία","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Λειτουργία 1 – Μπάρα προσκόλλησης και άκρα οθόνης","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Λειτουργία 2 – Αυτόματη παράθεση","Modes":"Λειτουργίες","More ways":"Περισσότεροι τρόποι","Motion curve":"Καμπύλη κίνησης","Move a window towards others…":"Μετακινήστε ένα παράθυρο προς άλλα…","Move the window one place back":"Μετακίνηση παραθύρου μία θέση πίσω","Move the window one place on":"Μετακίνηση παραθύρου μία θέση μπροστά","Name:":"Όνομα:","New layout":"Νέα διάταξη","New windows":"Νέα παράθυρα","Next tiling layout":"Επόμενη διάταξη παράθεσης","Next to the active window":"Δίπλα στο ενεργό παράθυρο","No key":"Χωρίς πλήκτρο","No other window open":"Κανένα άλλο ανοιχτό παράθυρο","No outer margin":"Χωρίς εξωτερικό περιθώριο","No shortcuts":"Χωρίς συντομεύσεις","None":"Κανένα","None yet.":"Τίποτα ακόμη.","Off":"Ανενεργό","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Ανενεργό = λειτουργία 1, ενεργό = λειτουργία 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Ανενεργό: ουδέτερο πλαίσιο – μόνο για τις ενεργές προεπισκοπήσεις.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Ανενεργό: τα πλήκτρα παραμένουν αντιστοιχισμένα αλλά δεν κάνουν τίποτα.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Ανενεργό: τα παράθυρα μένουν εκεί που τα βάζετε. Οι άλλες λειτουργίες δουλεύουν έτσι κι αλλιώς.","One at a time":"Ένα κάθε φορά","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Ένα κλείνει – τα άλλα γεμίζουν το κενό","One main window less":"Ένα κύριο παράθυρο λιγότερο","One more main window":"Ένα κύριο παράθυρο ακόμη","One window":"Ένα παράθυρο","Only one mode is switched on.":"Μόνο μία λειτουργία είναι ενεργή.","Open settings editor":"Άνοιγμα επεξεργαστή ρυθμίσεων","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Ανοίξτε πρώτα την εφαρμογή και μετά επιλέξτε την εδώ.","Open the layout builder":"Άνοιγμα του δημιουργού διατάξεων","Own layouts":"Δικές σας διατάξεις","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Τμήμα κάθε πλευράς που μετρά ως γωνία.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Παύση της παράθεσης άκρων του KDE και της προεπισκόπησής της","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Παύση των ζωνών κουμπώματος του KDE όσο ο μαγνήτης είναι ενεργός","Preview":"Προεπισκόπηση","Previews":"Προεπισκοπήσεις","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Σπρώξτε ένα παράθυρο σε άκρο ή γωνία της οθόνης και θα γεμίσει αυτό το μέρος. Λειτουργεί με ή χωρίς τη μπάρα.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Σπρώξτε ένα παράθυρο σε άκρο ή γωνία: μεγιστοποίηση, μισά, τέταρτα.","Push delay":"Καθυστέρηση ώθησης","Quarters":"Τέταρτα","Quick":"Γρήγορη","Quick settings":"Γρήγορες ρυθμίσεις","Recommended values":"Προτεινόμενες τιμές","Remove":"Αφαίρεση","Remove rule":"Αφαίρεση κανόνα","Remove zone":"Αφαίρεση ζώνης","Reset all":"Επαναφορά όλων","Reset all keys":"Επαναφορά όλων των πλήκτρων","Reset to default":"Επαναφορά προεπιλογής","Resistance against overlapping":"Αντίσταση στην επικάλυψη","Resize touching windows together":"Αλλαγή μεγέθους των παραθύρων που ακουμπούν μαζί","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Και η αλλαγή μεγέθους κολλάει – εδώ σε πλήρες ύψος","Restore":"Επαναφορά","Restore default layouts":"Επαναφορά προεπιλεγμένων διατάξεων","Restore default layouts?":"Επαναφορά προεπιλεγμένων διατάξεων;","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Επαναφορά του αρχικού μεγέθους όταν τραβάτε το παράθυρο έξω","Restore the size before snapping":"Επαναφορά μεγέθους πριν την προσκόλληση","Rows":"Γραμμές","Save":"Αποθήκευση","Screen edges":"Άκρα οθόνης","Screen edges on/off":"Άκρα οθόνης ναι/όχι","Screen edges preview":"Προεπισκόπηση άκρων οθόνης","Set":"Ορισμός","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Ορίζει τα πλήκτρα όλων των ενεργειών μαζί. Μεμονωμένα πλήκτρα αλλάζουν ακόμη παρακάτω.","Settings":"Ρυθμίσεις","Settings file":"Αρχείο ρυθμίσεων","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Κατά την αλλαγή μεγέθους κουνήστε γρήγορα το ποντίκι μπρος-πίσω και τα άλλα παράθυρα επιστρέφουν. Ένα γρήγορο τράβηγμα προς μία κατεύθυνση δεν τα αφήνει ποτέ.","Shake to let go":"Κουνήστε για απελευθέρωση","Shortcuts":"Συντομεύσεις","Show a small handle first":"Πρώτα εμφάνιση μικρής λαβής","Show layout and zone names":"Εμφάνιση ονομάτων διατάξεων και ζωνών","Show previews in the accent color":"Εμφάνιση προεπισκοπήσεων στο χρώμα έμφασης","Showing":"Εμφάνιση","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Δείχνει πού θα καταλήξει το παράθυρο σε άκρη ή γωνία. Ανενεργό: καμία προεπισκόπηση.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Δείχνει πού θα καταλήξει το παράθυρο όσο μια ζώνη της γραμμής είναι επισημασμένη. Ανενεργό: καμία προεπισκόπηση.","Sidebar + grid":"Πλευρική μπάρα + πλέγμα","Single zone":"Μία ζώνη","Six tiles":"Έξι πλακίδια","Size & shape":"Μέγεθος & σχήμα","Size of the main area":"Μέγεθος κύριας περιοχής","Slide-in duration":"Διάρκεια καθόδου","Slide-out duration":"Διάρκεια ανόδου","Smart arranging and detection.":"Έξυπνη διάταξη και αναγνώριση.","Smart fill":"Έξυπνο γέμισμα","Smooth (default)":"Ομαλή (προεπιλογή)","Snap bar":"Μπάρα προσκόλλησης","Snap bar and screen edges":"Μπάρα προσκόλλησης και άκρα οθόνης","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Η μπάρα και τα άκρα είναι ανενεργά – τρέχει μόνο η λειτουργία 2 και η συντόμευση λειτουργίας δεν κάνει τίποτα.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Η μπάρα και τα άκρα της οθόνης εμποδίζουν την αυτόματη παράθεση. Γι’ αυτό λειτουργούν ως δύο λειτουργίες – αλλάξτε με τη συντόμευση ή εδώ.","Snap bar colors:":"Χρώματα μπάρας:","Snap bar on/off":"Μπάρα ναι/όχι","Snap bar preview":"Προεπισκόπηση γραμμής κουμπώματος","Snap bar size":"Μέγεθος μπάρας","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Μπάρα προσκόλλησης, άκρα οθόνης, μαγνήτης παραθύρων, συντομεύσεις και ανταλλαγή παραθύρων.","Snap distance":"Απόσταση προσκόλλησης","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Προσκόλληση διαχωριστικών (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Διατάξεις προσκόλλησης και αυτόματη παράθεση.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Προσκολλήστε το ενεργό παράθυρο με συνδυασμούς πλήκτρων.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Προσκολλήστε το ενεργό παράθυρο με το πληκτρολόγιο. Είναι κανονικές καθολικές συντομεύσεις του KDE – τις βρίσκετε και στις Ρυθμίσεις συστήματος → Συντομεύσεις → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Προσκόλληση στο κάτω μισό","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Προσκόλληση στο κάτω αριστερό τέταρτο","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Προσκόλληση στο κάτω δεξί τέταρτο","Snap to the center third":"Προσκόλληση στο μεσαίο τρίτο","Snap to the left half":"Προσκόλληση στο αριστερό μισό","Snap to the left third":"Προσκόλληση στο αριστερό τρίτο","Snap to the left two thirds":"Προσκόλληση στα αριστερά δύο τρίτα","Snap to the right half":"Προσκόλληση στο δεξί μισό","Snap to the right third":"Προσκόλληση στο δεξί τρίτο","Snap to the right two thirds":"Προσκόλληση στα δεξιά δύο τρίτα","Snap to the top half":"Προσκόλληση στο πάνω μισό","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Προσκόλληση στο πάνω αριστερό τέταρτο","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Προσκόλληση στο πάνω δεξί τέταρτο","Snapping":"Προσκόλληση","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Η προσκόλληση και η αυτόματη παράθεση είναι δύο λειτουργίες – μία συντόμευση αλλάζει μεταξύ τους.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Έτσι μόνο ένας μαγνήτης τραβά ένα παράθυρο. Οι ρυθμίσεις του KDE δεν αλλάζουν: απενεργοποιήστε αυτό ή το KSnapUnity ή αφαιρέστε το, και η προσκόλληση του KDE επιστρέφει.","Soft":"Απαλή","Spacing":"Αποστάσεις","Spiral":"Σπείρα","Split side by side":"Διαίρεση δίπλα-δίπλα","Split top and bottom":"Διαίρεση πάνω και κάτω","Stack + main":"Στοίβα + κύριο","Stick to other windows":"Κόλλημα σε άλλα παράθυρα","Stick to the screen edges":"Κόλλημα στα άκρα της οθόνης","Sticky edges":"Κολλητικές άκρες","Support KSnapUnity":"Υποστηρίξτε το KSnapUnity","Swap":"Ανταλλαγή","Swap windows":"Ανταλλαγή παραθύρων","Swap with the window above":"Ανταλλαγή με το παράθυρο από πάνω","Swap with the window below":"Ανταλλαγή με το παράθυρο από κάτω","Swap with the window on the left":"Ανταλλαγή με το παράθυρο αριστερά","Swap with the window on the right":"Ανταλλαγή με το παράθυρο δεξιά","Switch mode":"Εναλλαγή λειτουργίας","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Εναλλαγή λειτουργίας (προσκόλληση / παράθεση)","Switch modes with:":"Εναλλαγή λειτουργίας με:","Switch the layout by itself":"Αλλαγή διάταξης αυτόματα","Switched off":"Απενεργοποιημένο","System":"Σύστημα","Take it over":"Ανάληψη","Take over all":"Ανάληψη όλων","Take the main place":"Παίρνουν την κύρια θέση","Test animation":"Δοκιμή κίνησης","Test on screen":"Δοκιμή στην οθόνη","Test the snap bar":"Δοκιμή της μπάρας","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Οι προεπιλεγμένες τιμές βασίζονται στα Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Οι ενέργειες προσκόλλησης χρησιμοποιούν τις ίδιες αποστάσεις με τη μπάρα και θυμούνται το μέγεθος πριν την προσκόλληση: η «Επαναφορά μεγέθους πριν την προσκόλληση» το επαναφέρει.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Αυτές οι εφαρμογές δεν τακτοποιούνται ποτέ και κρατούν τη θέση τους. Οι διάλογοι αιωρούνται πάντα.","Thirds":"Τρίτα","Three columns":"Τρεις στήλες","Thumbnail width":"Πλάτος μικρογραφιών","Tiling":"Παράθεση","Tip":"Συμβουλή","Top / bottom":"Πάνω / κάτω","Top edge":"Πάνω άκρο","Top edge: full screen":"Πάνω άκρο: πλήρης οθόνη","Top edge: maximize":"Πάνω άκρο: μεγιστοποίηση","Top edge: top half":"Πάνω άκρο: πάνω μισό","Top half":"Πάνω μισό","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Απόσταση ενεργοποίησης από το πάνω άκρο","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Απενεργοποιήστε το αν προτιμάτε το περίγραμμα του KDE – τότε απενεργοποιήστε παραπάνω την προεπισκόπηση άκρων.","Two thirds":"Δύο τρίτα","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Δύο παράθυρα αλλάζουν θέσεις – αφήστε το ένα πάνω στο άλλο ή χρησιμοποιήστε τα πλήκτρα.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Δύο παράθυρα αλλάζουν θέσεις: αφήστε το ένα πάνω στο άλλο, ή με πλήκτρο.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Χρήση συντομεύσεων πληκτρολογίου","Use screen edges":"Χρήση των άκρων της οθόνης","Use the system accent color":"Χρήση του χρώματος έμφασης του συστήματος","Use the window magnet":"Χρήση του μαγνήτη παραθύρων","Usual combinations":"Συνήθεις συνδυασμοί","Version":"Έκδοση","Wanted for: %1":"Ζητείται για: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Όταν ένα παράθυρο ανοίγει, κλείνει ή ανταλλάσσεται, τα άλλα κινούνται ομαλά αντί να πηδούν.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Όταν αλλάζετε το μέγεθος ενός παραθύρου, τα παράθυρα που το ακουμπούν μετακινούν μαζί την κοινή άκρη – τίποτα δεν επικαλύπτεται, δεν ανοίγει κενό.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Κατά την αλλαγή μεγέθους, τα παράθυρα που δεν ακολουθούν εμφανίζονται διαφανή.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Ενώ μετακινείτε ή αλλάζετε μέγεθος σε ένα παράθυρο, τα άκρα του κολλάνε σε κοντινά παράθυρα και στα άκρα της οθόνης.","Width":"Πλάτος","Window":"Παράθυρο","Window magnet":"Μαγνήτης παραθύρων","Window magnet on/off":"Μαγνήτης παραθύρων ναι/όχι","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Τα παράθυρα το ένα πάνω από το άλλο κρατούν μαζί αριστερές και δεξιές άκρες, τα παράθυρα δίπλα-δίπλα επάνω και κάτω.","Windows glide to their place":"Τα παράθυρα γλιστρούν στη θέση τους","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Τα παράθυρα κολλάνε μεταξύ τους και στα άκρα της οθόνης.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Τα παράθυρα σταματούν στην «Απόσταση μεταξύ παραθύρων» της σελίδας Γενικά αντί να ακουμπούν.","Yes":"Ναι","Your own combination":"Δικός σας συνδυασμός","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Οι δικές σας διατάξεις και η σειρά τους θα χαθούν.","Zone %1":"Ζώνη %1","for KWin · v%1":"για KWin · v%1","windows:":"παράθυρα:","“%1” will be removed.":"Η διάταξη «%1» θα αφαιρεθεί.","…drag it onto window B…":"…σύρετέ το πάνω στο παράθυρο B…","…in every direction":"…προς κάθε κατεύθυνση","…let go: they trade places":"…αφήστε: αλλάζουν θέσεις","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…οι γείτονες μεγαλώνουν και μικραίνουν μαζί του","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Έτοιμο – πατήστε OK για να ανοίξει ο επεξεργαστής ρυθμίσεων."},"es":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (copia)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 lo usa «%2».","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 de %2 zonas","0 = all in one row":"0 = todos en una fila","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Modo 1</b><br/>Barra de acople y bordes de la pantalla","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Modo 2</b><br/>Mosaico automático","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Una ventana sola usa toda la pantalla, aunque haya un margen.","A new window joins":"Se une una ventana nueva","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Un empujón corto da la mitad o el cuarto. Mantén la ventana un poco más en el borde y crece hasta la siguiente ventana; la vista previa lo muestra.","A single window":"Una sola ventana","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Una ventana se detiene en el borde de otra, también si la mueves rápido. Agita el ratón o sigue empujando un momento para soltarla. 0 = las ventanas pueden solaparse libremente.","About & Help":"Acerca de y ayuda","Accent color":"Color de acento","Active":"Activo","Active mode":"Modo activo","Active width along the top edge":"Ancho activo en el borde superior","Add an open application":"Añadir una aplicación abierta","Add rule":"Añadir regla","All window features in one system.":"Todas las funciones de ventanas en un sistema.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"También cambia cuando redimensionas la ventana principal a mano.","Also while resizing":"También al cambiar el tamaño","Always floating":"Siempre flotantes","Animation":"Animación","Appearance":"Apariencia","Apply":"Aplicar","Arrange windows":"Organizar ventanas","Arrange windows automatically":"Organizar ventanas automáticamente","Author":"Autor","Automatic tiling":"Mosaico automático","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"El mosaico automático está desactivado – solo funciona el modo 1 y el atajo de modo no hace nada.","Automatic tiling off":"Mosaico automático desactivado","Automatic tiling on":"Mosaico automático activado","Automatic tiling on/off":"Activar/desactivar mosaico automático","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Mosaico automático, intercambio de ventanas, atajos y el imán para ventanas flotantes.","Background opacity":"Opacidad del fondo","Behavior & Animation":"Comportamiento y animación","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Borde inferior: mitad inferior","Bouncy":"Con rebote","Buy me a coffee":"Invítame a un café","Cancel":"Cancelar","Center focus":"Foco central","Center the window":"Centrar la ventana","Change":"Cambiar","Change key":"Cambiar tecla","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"La tecla se cambia en el editor de ajustes. Ambos modos necesitan el mosaico automático y la barra o los bordes de la pantalla.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Cámbialas en la página Atajos de teclado. Con el mosaico automático, las ventanas también intercambian su lugar en el orden.","Choose…":"Elegir…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Haz clic en una zona para seleccionarla · doble clic para dividirla · arrastra los divisores","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Haz clic o pulsa %1 para cambiar de modo.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Haz clic y luego Aceptar – se abre el editor de ajustes.","Close":"Cerrar","Close by, the edges stick together":"De cerca, los bordes se pegan","Color scheme":"Esquema de color","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Colores, tamaño y forma de la barra.","Columns":"Columnas","Corner radius":"Radio de las esquinas","Corner size":"Tamaño de las esquinas","Corner: a quarter":"Esquina: un cuarto","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Esquinas: un cuarto de la pantalla","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + tecla (predeterminado)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + teclado numérico","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Mayús+Alt + tecla","Custom color":"Color personalizado","Custom layout %1":"Diseño personalizado %1","Dark":"Oscuro","Delay before hiding":"Retraso antes de ocultar","Delay before showing":"Retraso antes de mostrar","Delete":"Eliminar","Delete layout?":"¿Eliminar el diseño?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Distancia a la que aparece el tirador","Distance before the bar hides again":"Distancia antes de que la barra se oculte","Distance to the edge":"Distancia al borde","Donate with PayPal":"Donar con PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"Arrastra un borde compartido…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Arrastra una ventana contra un borde…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Arrastra una ventana sobre otra para intercambiarlas. Si la sueltas en la barra o en un borde, flota libremente; «Dejar flotar la ventana» la devuelve. Los espacios vienen de la página General.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Arrastra una ventana sobre el centro de otra – la vista previa muestra dos flechas – y suelta. Con el mosaico automático basta cualquier punto sobre la otra ventana.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Arrastra una ventana al borde superior de la pantalla y suéltala sobre una zona.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Arrastra las tarjetas para cambiar el orden en la barra. Haz doble clic en una tarjeta para editarla.","Drop a window onto another one":"Soltar una ventana sobre otra","Drop the window onto a zone":"Suelta la ventana sobre una zona","Duplicate":"Duplicar","Duration":"Duración","Dwindle":"Espiral interior","Dynamic":"Dinámica","Edges and corners":"Bordes y esquinas","Edit":"Editar","Edit layout":"Editar diseño","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Cada función se puede activar y desactivar por separado.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Cada diseño que crees en la página Diseños también puede organizar ventanas – aparece arriba. La ventana 1 ocupa la zona 1 y así sucesivamente; las demás comparten la última zona. Con menos ventanas que zonas se usa «Principal y pila», para que no queden huecos.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Cada ventana encuentra su sitio sola, como en un gestor de ventanas en mosaico.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Cada ventana encuentra su sitio en la pantalla sola. Las ventanas nuevas se suman y las que se cierran dejan sitio a las demás.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Ejemplo: dos ventanas lado a lado, desde tres principal y pila, desde cinco una cuadrícula. Sin regla aplicable se usa el diseño elegido arriba.","Fade in and out":"Fundido al aparecer y desaparecer","Fade the other windows":"Atenuar las demás ventanas","Features":"Funciones","Feel":"Sensación","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Ajustarse a las ventanas ya acopladas","Fits the way you work.":"Se adapta a tu forma de trabajar.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Dejar flotar la ventana (salir del mosaico)","Four quarters":"Cuatro cuartos","From":"Desde","Fullscreen":"Pantalla completa","Gap between windows":"Separación entre ventanas","Gap to the screen edge":"Separación con el borde de la pantalla","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Vuelve a dar a cada acción la tecla del esquema elegido y quita las teclas que el esquema no tiene.","Good to know":"Bueno saber","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Agarra una ventana por la barra de título y arrástrala hacia arriba. La barra baja; suelta la ventana sobre una zona y ocupará exactamente ese espacio. Si vuelves a sacarla, recupera su tamaño anterior.","Grab window A…":"Agarra la ventana A…","Grid":"Cuadrícula","Halves":"Mitades","Hiding":"Ocultar","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Mantener en el borde para rellenar el espacio libre","Hold time":"Tiempo de espera","Hold to fill":"Mantener para rellenar","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Cuánto debe acercarse un borde antes de encajar.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Cuánto debe acercarse el cursor al borde.","How far the bar slides down":"Cuánto baja la barra","How it works":"Cómo funciona","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Cuánto tiempo debe quedarse la ventana contra el borde: un pequeño empujón. 0 = al instante.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Cuánto tiempo debe quedarse la ventana en el borde antes de crecer.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Cuántas ventanas comparten el área principal (diseño «Principal y pila»).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Si hay una ventana abajo, el borde superior da la mitad superior en lugar de maximizar. Las mitades y los cuartos también dejan libres las ventanas acopladas.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Si te gusta KSnapUnity, puedes apoyar su desarrollo – ¡gracias!","In bar":"En la barra","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Independiente de la barra de acople y de los bordes de la pantalla.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Independiente de la barra de acople. Cada borde se activa por separado.","Information":"Información","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Comportamiento de ventanas intuitivo y natural.","Join at the end":"Se ponen al final","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K de KWin · Snap de acople más inteligente · Unity de todo en un sistema","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE tiene sus propias acciones de borde de pantalla y su propio acople de ventanas. Si la misma función está activa aquí, desactiva la de KDE: Preferencias del sistema → Gestión de ventanas → Bordes de la pantalla, y Comportamiento de las ventanas → Movimiento.","KDE's own edge tiling":"Mosaico de bordes propio de KDE","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"El maximizado y mosaico propios de KDE en los bordes – con su contorno – se pausan mientras funciona KSnapUnity, para que solo aparezca una vista previa. Tus ajustes de KDE no cambian: desactiva esto, desactiva o quita KSnapUnity y vuelve el comportamiento de KDE.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"Las acciones de borde de pantalla de KDE siguen activas, así que dos ayudantes reaccionan al mismo arrastre. Desactiva «Maximizar» y «Mosaico» en Preferencias del sistema → Gestión de ventanas → Bordes de la pantalla.","KDE's own window snapping":"Ajuste de ventanas propio de KDE","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"El acople de ventanas propio de KDE también está activo. Para un comportamiento uniforme, pon sus zonas en «Ninguna» en Preferencias del sistema → Gestión de ventanas → Comportamiento de las ventanas → Movimiento.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"El servicio de atajos de KDE no respondió. Aún puedes asignar las teclas en Preferencias del sistema → Atajos → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – Editor de ajustes","Keep stacked windows in line":"Mantener alineadas las ventanas apiladas","Keep the gap between windows":"Mantener el espacio entre ventanas","Keep them":"Dejarlas","Key scheme":"Esquema de teclas","Keyboard shortcuts":"Atajos de teclado","Keys":"Teclas","Keys already in use":"Teclas ya en uso","Layout":"Diseño","Layout by number of windows":"Diseño según el número de ventanas","Layouts":"Diseños","Layouts per row":"Diseños por fila","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Bordes izquierdo y derecho: media pantalla","Left edge: left half":"Borde izquierdo: mitad izquierda","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Por debajo del 100 % una ventana sola queda centrada – ideal en pantallas anchas.","License":"Licencia","Light":"Claro","Linear":"Lineal","Live preview":"Vista previa en vivo","Load template…":"Cargar plantilla…","Magnet":"Imán","Main + stack":"Principal + pila","Main and stack":"Principal y pila","Main area bigger":"Área principal más grande","Main area on the right":"Área principal a la derecha","Main area smaller":"Área principal más pequeña","Main in the middle":"Principal en el centro","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Interruptor principal para arrastrar y las teclas.","Main window":"Ventana principal","Main windows":"Ventanas principales","Main windows: %1":"Ventanas principales: %1","Make it the main window":"Convertir en ventana principal","Maximize":"Maximizar","Maximize or restore":"Maximizar o restaurar","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + tecla (estilo KDE)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + tecla","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Mayús + tecla","Minimize":"Minimizar","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Refleja el diseño: la ventana principal a la derecha, las demás a la izquierda.","Mode":"Modo","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Modo 1 – Barra de acople y bordes de la pantalla","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Modo 2 – Mosaico automático","Modes":"Modos","More ways":"Más formas","Motion curve":"Curva de movimiento","Move a window towards others…":"Acerca una ventana a otras…","Move the window one place back":"Mover la ventana un puesto atrás","Move the window one place on":"Mover la ventana un puesto adelante","Name:":"Nombre:","New layout":"Nuevo diseño","New windows":"Ventanas nuevas","Next tiling layout":"Siguiente diseño de mosaico","Next to the active window":"Junto a la ventana activa","No key":"Sin tecla","No other window open":"No hay otra ventana abierta","No outer margin":"Sin margen exterior","No shortcuts":"Sin atajos","None":"Ninguno","None yet.":"Ninguna todavía.","Off":"Desactivado","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Desactivado = modo 1, activado = modo 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Desactivado: un marco neutro – solo para las vistas previas activadas.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Desactivado: las teclas siguen asignadas pero no hacen nada.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Desactivado: las ventanas se quedan donde las pongas. Las demás funciones van igual.","One at a time":"Una a la vez","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Una se cierra – las demás llenan el hueco","One main window less":"Una ventana principal menos","One more main window":"Una ventana principal más","One window":"Una ventana","Only one mode is switched on.":"Solo hay un modo activado.","Open settings editor":"Abrir el editor de ajustes","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Abre primero la aplicación y luego elígela aquí.","Open the layout builder":"Abrir el creador de diseños","Own layouts":"Diseños propios","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Parte de cada lado que cuenta como esquina.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Pausar el mosaico de bordes de KDE y su vista previa","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Pausar las zonas de ajuste de KDE mientras el imán está activo","Preview":"Vista previa","Previews":"Vistas previas","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Empuja una ventana contra un borde o una esquina de la pantalla y ocupará esa parte. Funciona con o sin la barra de acople.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Empuja una ventana contra un borde o una esquina: maximizar, mitades, cuartos.","Push delay":"Retardo de empuje","Quarters":"Cuartos","Quick":"Rápida","Quick settings":"Ajustes rápidos","Recommended values":"Valores recomendados","Remove":"Quitar","Remove rule":"Quitar regla","Remove zone":"Quitar zona","Reset all":"Restablecer todo","Reset all keys":"Restablecer todas las teclas","Reset to default":"Restablecer predeterminado","Resistance against overlapping":"Resistencia a la superposición","Resize touching windows together":"Redimensionar juntas las ventanas que se tocan","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Redimensionar también se acopla – aquí a toda la altura","Restore":"Restaurar","Restore default layouts":"Restaurar diseños predeterminados","Restore default layouts?":"¿Restaurar los diseños predeterminados?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Restaurar el tamaño original al sacar la ventana","Restore the size before snapping":"Restaurar el tamaño anterior al acople","Rows":"Filas","Save":"Guardar","Screen edges":"Bordes de la pantalla","Screen edges on/off":"Bordes de la pantalla sí/no","Screen edges preview":"Vista previa de los bordes","Set":"Asignar","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Asigna las teclas de todas las acciones a la vez. Abajo puedes seguir cambiando teclas sueltas.","Settings":"Ajustes","Settings file":"Archivo de ajustes","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Agita el ratón rápido de un lado a otro al cambiar el tamaño y las demás ventanas vuelven. Un tirón rápido en una sola dirección nunca las suelta.","Shake to let go":"Agitar para soltar","Shortcuts":"Atajos","Show a small handle first":"Mostrar primero un pequeño tirador","Show layout and zone names":"Mostrar nombres de diseños y zonas","Show previews in the accent color":"Mostrar las vistas previas en el color de acento","Showing":"Mostrar","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Muestra dónde cae la ventana en un borde o una esquina. Desactivado: ninguna vista previa.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Muestra dónde cae la ventana mientras una zona de la barra está resaltada. Desactivado: ninguna vista previa.","Sidebar + grid":"Barra lateral + cuadrícula","Single zone":"Zona única","Six tiles":"Seis mosaicos","Size & shape":"Tamaño y forma","Size of the main area":"Tamaño del área principal","Slide-in duration":"Duración al bajar","Slide-out duration":"Duración al subir","Smart arranging and detection.":"Organización y detección inteligentes.","Smart fill":"Relleno inteligente","Smooth (default)":"Suave (predeterminada)","Snap bar":"Barra de acople","Snap bar and screen edges":"Barra de acople y bordes de la pantalla","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"La barra y los bordes están desactivados – solo funciona el modo 2 y el atajo de modo no hace nada.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"La barra y los bordes de la pantalla estorban al mosaico automático. Por eso funcionan como dos modos – cambia con el atajo o aquí.","Snap bar colors:":"Colores de la barra:","Snap bar on/off":"Barra de acople sí/no","Snap bar preview":"Vista previa de la barra","Snap bar size":"Tamaño de la barra","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Barra de acople, bordes de la pantalla, imán de ventanas, atajos e intercambio de ventanas.","Snap distance":"Distancia de enganche","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Ajustar divisores (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Diseños de acople y mosaico automático.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Acopla la ventana activa con combinaciones de teclas.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Acopla la ventana activa con el teclado. Son atajos globales normales de KDE: también los encuentras en Preferencias del sistema → Atajos → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Acoplar a la mitad inferior","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Acoplar al cuarto inferior izquierdo","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Acoplar al cuarto inferior derecho","Snap to the center third":"Acoplar al tercio central","Snap to the left half":"Acoplar a la mitad izquierda","Snap to the left third":"Acoplar al tercio izquierdo","Snap to the left two thirds":"Acoplar a los dos tercios izquierdos","Snap to the right half":"Acoplar a la mitad derecha","Snap to the right third":"Acoplar al tercio derecho","Snap to the right two thirds":"Acoplar a los dos tercios derechos","Snap to the top half":"Acoplar a la mitad superior","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Acoplar al cuarto superior izquierdo","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Acoplar al cuarto superior derecho","Snapping":"Acoplar","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"El acople y el mosaico automático funcionan como dos modos – un atajo cambia entre ellos.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Así solo un imán tira de una ventana. Tus ajustes de KDE no cambian: desactiva esto, desactiva o quita KSnapUnity y vuelve el acople de KDE.","Soft":"Delicada","Spacing":"Espaciado","Spiral":"Espiral","Split side by side":"Dividir en paralelo","Split top and bottom":"Dividir arriba y abajo","Stack + main":"Pila + principal","Stick to other windows":"Adherirse a otras ventanas","Stick to the screen edges":"Adherirse a los bordes de la pantalla","Sticky edges":"Bordes pegajosos","Support KSnapUnity":"Apoya KSnapUnity","Swap":"Intercambiar","Swap windows":"Intercambiar ventanas","Swap with the window above":"Intercambiar con la ventana de arriba","Swap with the window below":"Intercambiar con la ventana de abajo","Swap with the window on the left":"Intercambiar con la ventana de la izquierda","Swap with the window on the right":"Intercambiar con la ventana de la derecha","Switch mode":"Cambiar de modo","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Cambiar de modo (acople / mosaico)","Switch modes with:":"Cambiar de modo con:","Switch the layout by itself":"Cambiar el diseño solo","Switched off":"Desactivado","System":"Sistema","Take it over":"Quedármela","Take over all":"Quedármelas todas","Take the main place":"Toman el lugar principal","Test animation":"Probar animación","Test on screen":"Probar en pantalla","Test the snap bar":"Probar la barra de acople","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Los valores predeterminados se basan en Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Las acciones de acople usan los mismos espacios que la barra y recuerdan el tamaño anterior al acople: «Restaurar el tamaño anterior al acople» lo recupera.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Estas aplicaciones nunca se organizan y mantienen su lugar. Los diálogos siempre flotan.","Thirds":"Tercios","Three columns":"Tres columnas","Thumbnail width":"Ancho de las miniaturas","Tiling":"Mosaico","Tip":"Consejo","Top / bottom":"Arriba / abajo","Top edge":"Borde superior","Top edge: full screen":"Borde superior: pantalla completa","Top edge: maximize":"Borde superior: maximizar","Top edge: top half":"Borde superior: mitad superior","Top half":"Mitad superior","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Distancia de activación desde el borde superior","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Desactívalo si prefieres el contorno de KDE; entonces desactiva arriba la vista previa de los bordes.","Two thirds":"Dos tercios","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Dos ventanas intercambian su lugar – suelta una sobre la otra o usa las teclas.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Dos ventanas intercambian su lugar: suelta una sobre la otra, o con tecla.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Usar atajos de teclado","Use screen edges":"Usar los bordes de la pantalla","Use the system accent color":"Usar el color de acento del sistema","Use the window magnet":"Usar el imán de ventanas","Usual combinations":"Combinaciones habituales","Version":"Versión","Wanted for: %1":"Se quería para: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Cuando una ventana se abre, se cierra o se intercambia, las demás se mueven suavemente en vez de saltar.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Al cambiar el tamaño de una ventana, las que la tocan mueven el borde compartido con ella: nada se superpone, no queda hueco.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Mientras redimensionas, las ventanas que no siguen se muestran transparentes.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Mientras mueves o cambias el tamaño de una ventana, sus bordes se adhieren a las ventanas cercanas y a los bordes de la pantalla.","Width":"Ancho","Window":"Ventana","Window magnet":"Imán de ventanas","Window magnet on/off":"Imán de ventanas sí/no","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Las ventanas una encima de otra mantienen juntos sus bordes izquierdo y derecho; las ventanas de lado, los superiores e inferiores.","Windows glide to their place":"Las ventanas se deslizan a su lugar","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Las ventanas se adhieren entre sí y a los bordes de la pantalla.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Las ventanas se detienen en la «Separación entre ventanas» de la página General en lugar de tocarse.","Yes":"Sí","Your own combination":"Tu propia combinación","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Se perderán tus diseños propios y su orden.","Zone %1":"Zona %1","for KWin · v%1":"para KWin · v%1","windows:":"ventanas:","“%1” will be removed.":"Se eliminará «%1».","…drag it onto window B…":"…arrástrala sobre la ventana B…","…in every direction":"…en todas las direcciones","…let go: they trade places":"…suelta: intercambian sus lugares","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…las vecinas crecen y encogen con él","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Listo – haz clic en Aceptar para abrir el editor de ajustes."},"et":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (koopia)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 kasutab „%2”.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 / %2 tsooni","0 = all in one row":"0 = kõik ühes reas","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Režiim 1</b><br/>Haakeriba ja ekraani servad","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Režiim 2</b><br/>Automaatne paanimine","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Üksik aken kasutab kogu ekraani, isegi kui veeris on määratud.","A new window joins":"Uus aken liitub","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Lühike tõuge annab poole või veerandi. Hoia akent serva juures veidi kauem ja see kasvab järgmise aknani – eelvaade näitab seda.","A single window":"Üksik aken","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Aken peatub teise akna serva juures, ka siis, kui liigutad seda kiiresti. Raputa hiirt või lükka veel hetk, et lahti lasta. 0 = aknad võivad vabalt kattuda.","About & Help":"Teave ja abi","Accent color":"Rõhuvärv","Active":"Aktiivne","Active mode":"Aktiivne režiim","Active width along the top edge":"Aktiivne laius ülaserval","Add an open application":"Lisa avatud rakendus","Add rule":"Lisa reegel","All window features in one system.":"Kõik aknafunktsioonid ühes süsteemis.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Muutub ka siis, kui muudad peaakna suurust käsitsi.","Also while resizing":"Ka suuruse muutmisel","Always floating":"Alati hõljuvad","Animation":"Animatsioon","Appearance":"Välimus","Apply":"Rakenda","Arrange windows":"Akende paigutamine","Arrange windows automatically":"Paiguta aknad automaatselt","Author":"Autor","Automatic tiling":"Automaatne paanimine","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Automaatne paanimine on välja lülitatud – töötab ainult režiim 1 ja režiimi kiirklahv ei tee midagi.","Automatic tiling off":"Automaatne paanimine väljas","Automatic tiling on":"Automaatne paanimine sees","Automatic tiling on/off":"Automaatne paanimine sisse/välja","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Automaatne paanimine, akende vahetamine, kiirklahvid ja magnet hõljuvatele akendele.","Background opacity":"Tausta läbipaistmatus","Behavior & Animation":"Käitumine ja animatsioon","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Alaserv: alumine pool","Bouncy":"Vetruv","Buy me a coffee":"Osta mulle kohv","Cancel":"Loobu","Center focus":"Keskne fookus","Center the window":"Joonda aken keskele","Change":"Muuda","Change key":"Muuda klahvi","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Klahvi muudad seadete redaktoris. Mõlemad režiimid vajavad automaatset paanimist ja haakeriba või ekraani servi.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Muuda neid lehel Kiirklahvid. Automaatse paanimise korral vahetavad aknad ka järjekorras kohad.","Choose…":"Vali…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Klõpsa tsoonil selle valimiseks · topeltklõps jagab · lohista eraldajaid","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Klõpsa või vajuta %1 režiimi vahetamiseks.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Klõpsa, siis OK – seadete redaktor avaneb.","Close":"Sulge","Close by, the edges stick together":"Lähedal jäävad servad kokku","Color scheme":"Värviskeem","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Haakeriba värvid, suurus ja kuju.","Columns":"Veerud","Corner radius":"Nurkade raadius","Corner size":"Nurga suurus","Corner: a quarter":"Nurk: veerand","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Nurgad: veerand ekraanist","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + klahv (vaikimisi)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + numbriklahvistik","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + klahv","Custom color":"Oma värv","Custom layout %1":"Oma paigutus %1","Dark":"Tume","Delay before hiding":"Viivitus enne peitmist","Delay before showing":"Viivitus enne näitamist","Delete":"Kustuta","Delete layout?":"Kas kustutada paigutus?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Kaugus, millel pide ilmub","Distance before the bar hides again":"Kaugus, mille järel riba uuesti peitub","Distance to the edge":"Kaugus servast","Donate with PayPal":"Anneta PayPaliga","Drag a shared edge…":"Lohista ühist serva…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Lohista aken vastu serva…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Lohista aken teisele, et neid vahetada. Haakeribale või ekraani servale lastuna hõljub see vabalt; „Lase aknal hõljuda“ toob selle tagasi. Vahed tulevad lehelt Üldine.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Lohista aken teise keskele – eelvaade näitab kahte noolt – ja lase lahti. Automaatse paanimise korral piisab ükskõik kus teise akna kohal.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Lohista aken ekraani ülaserva ja aseta see tsoonile.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Lohista kaarte, et muuta järjekorda ribal. Topeltklõpsa kaardil selle muutmiseks.","Drop a window onto another one":"Akna kukutamine teisele","Drop the window onto a zone":"Aseta aken tsoonile","Duplicate":"Klooni","Duration":"Kestus","Dwindle":"Spiraal sissepoole","Dynamic":"Dünaamiline","Edges and corners":"Servad ja nurgad","Edit":"Muuda","Edit layout":"Muuda paigutust","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Iga funktsiooni saab eraldi sisse ja välja lülitada.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Iga paigutus, mille ehitad lehel Paigutused, oskab ka aknaid paigutada – see ilmub ülal. Aken 1 saab tsooni 1 ja nii edasi; lisaaknad jagavad viimast tsooni. Kui aknaid on vähem kui tsoone, kasutatakse „Pea ja virn“, et auke ei tekiks.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Iga aken leiab oma koha ise, nagu paaniva aknahalduri puhul.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Iga aken leiab oma koha ekraanil ise. Uued aknad liituvad, suletud teevad teistele ruumi.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Näide: kaks akent kõrvuti, alates kolmest pea ja virn, alates viiest ruudustik. Sobiva reeglita kehtib ülal valitud paigutus.","Fade in and out":"Hajutus sisse ja välja","Fade the other windows":"Tuhmista teised aknad","Features":"Funktsioonid","Feel":"Tunnetus","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Kohandu juba haagitud akendega","Fits the way you work.":"Sobib sinu tööviisiga.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Lase aknal hõljuda (lahku paanimisest)","Four quarters":"Neli veerandit","From":"Alates","Fullscreen":"Täisekraan","Gap between windows":"Vahe akende vahel","Gap to the screen edge":"Vahe ekraani servani","General":"Üldine","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Annab igale toimingule taas valitud skeemi klahvi ja eemaldab klahvid, mida skeemis pole.","Good to know":"Hea teada","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Haara aken tiitliribast ja lohista see üles. Riba libiseb alla; aseta aken tsoonile ja see täidab täpselt selle ala. Kui lohistad selle uuesti välja, saab see tagasi oma endise suuruse.","Grab window A…":"Haara aken A…","Grid":"Ruudustik","Halves":"Pooled","Hiding":"Peitmine","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Hoia serva juures, et täita vaba ruum","Hold time":"Hoidmisaeg","Hold to fill":"Hoia täitmiseks","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Kui lähedale serv peab jõudma, enne kui see paika klõpsab.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Kui lähedale servale kursor peab jõudma.","How far the bar slides down":"Kui kaugele riba alla libiseb","How it works":"Kuidas see töötab","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Kui kaua aken peab vastu serva olema – väike tõuge. 0 = kohe.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Kui kaua peab aken serva juures olema, enne kui see kasvab.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Mitu akent jagavad põhiala (paigutus „Pea ja virn“).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Kui all on juba aken, annab ülaserv maksimeerimise asemel ülemise poole. Ka pooled ja veerandid jätavad haagitud aknad vabaks.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Kui KSnapUnity sulle meeldib, saad selle arendust toetada – aitäh!","In bar":"Ribal","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Haakeribast ja ekraani servadest sõltumatu.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Haakeribast sõltumatu. Iga serva saab eraldi sisse lülitada.","Information":"Teave","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Intuitiivne, loomulik akende käitumine.","Join at the end":"Lähevad lõppu","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K nagu KWin · Snap nagu nutikam haakimine · Unity nagu kõik ühes süsteemis","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE-l on oma ekraaniserva toimingud ja oma akende haakimine. Kui sama funktsioon on siin sees, lülita KDE oma välja: Süsteemi seadistused → Aknahaldus → Ekraani servad ning Akende käitumine → Liigutamine.","KDE's own edge tiling":"KDE enda servaplaatimine","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"KDE enda maksimeerimine ja paanimine servadel – koos piirjoonega – peatub, kuni KSnapUnity töötab, nii et näha on vaid üks eelvaade. Su KDE seaded ei muutu: lülita see välja, keela või eemalda KSnapUnity ja KDE käitumine on tagasi.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"KDE enda ekraaniserva toimingud on endiselt sees, nii et samale lohistamisele reageerib kaks abilist. Lülita „Maksimeeri” ja „Paanid” välja: Süsteemi seadistused → Aknahaldus → Ekraani servad.","KDE's own window snapping":"KDE enda akende kinnitumine","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE enda akende haakimine on samuti sees. Ühtse tunnetuse jaoks sea selle tsoonid väärtusele „Puudub”: Süsteemi seadistused → Aknahaldus → Akende käitumine → Liigutamine.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"KDE kiirklahvide teenus ei vastanud. Klahve saad endiselt määrata asukohas Süsteemi seadistused → Kiirklahvid → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – seadete redaktor","Keep stacked windows in line":"Hoia virnastatud aknad ühel joonel","Keep the gap between windows":"Hoia akende vahet","Keep them":"Jäta alles","Key scheme":"Klahviskeem","Keyboard shortcuts":"Kiirklahvid","Keys":"Klahvid","Keys already in use":"Juba kasutusel olevad klahvid","Layout":"Paigutus","Layout by number of windows":"Paigutus akende arvu järgi","Layouts":"Paigutused","Layouts per row":"Paigutusi rea kohta","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Vasak ja parem serv: pool ekraani","Left edge: left half":"Vasak serv: vasak pool","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Alla 100 % jääb üksik aken keskele – kena laial ekraanil.","License":"Litsents","Light":"Hele","Linear":"Lineaarne","Live preview":"Reaalajas eelvaade","Load template…":"Laadi mall…","Main + stack":"Põhi + virn","Main and stack":"Pea ja virn","Main area bigger":"Suurem põhiala","Main area on the right":"Peaala paremal","Main area smaller":"Väiksem põhiala","Main in the middle":"Pea keskel","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Pealüliti lohistamisele ja klahvidele.","Main window":"Peaaken","Main windows":"Peaaknad","Main windows: %1":"Peaaknaid: %1","Make it the main window":"Tee peaaknaks","Maximize":"Maksimeeri","Maximize or restore":"Maksimeeri või taasta","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + klahv (KDE stiil)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + klahv","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + klahv","Minimize":"Minimeeri","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Peegeldab paigutust: peaaken paremal, teised vasakul.","Mode":"Režiim","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Režiim 1 – haakeriba ja ekraani servad","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Režiim 2 – automaatne paanimine","Modes":"Režiimid","More ways":"Veel viise","Motion curve":"Liikumiskõver","Move a window towards others…":"Liiguta akent teiste poole…","Move the window one place back":"Liiguta akent koht tagasi","Move the window one place on":"Liiguta akent koht edasi","Name:":"Nimi:","New layout":"Uus paigutus","New windows":"Uued aknad","Next tiling layout":"Järgmine paanimise paigutus","Next to the active window":"Aktiivse akna kõrvale","No key":"Klahv puudub","No other window open":"Teist avatud akent pole","No outer margin":"Välisveerist pole","No shortcuts":"Kiirklahve pole","None":"Puudub","None yet.":"Veel pole.","Off":"Väljas","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Väljas = režiim 1, sees = režiim 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Väljas: neutraalne raam – ainult sisse lülitatud eelvaadetele.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Väljas: klahvid jäävad määratuks, aga ei tee midagi.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Väljas: aknad jäävad sinna, kuhu need paned. Teised funktsioonid töötavad igal juhul.","One at a time":"Üks korraga","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Üks sulgub – teised täidavad tühimiku","One main window less":"Üks peaaken vähem","One more main window":"Üks peaaken rohkem","One window":"Üks aken","Only one mode is switched on.":"Sisse on lülitatud ainult üks režiim.","Open settings editor":"Ava seadete redaktor","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Ava rakendus esmalt ja vali see siis siit.","Open the layout builder":"Ava paigutuste ehitaja","Own layouts":"Omad paigutused","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Iga külje osa, mis loetakse nurgaks.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Peata KDE servaplaatimine ja selle eelvaade","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Peata KDE kinnitustsoonid, kui magnet on sees","Preview":"Eelvaade","Previews":"Eelvaated","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Lükka aken vastu ekraani serva või nurka ja see täidab selle osa. Töötab haakeribaga või ilma.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Lükka aken vastu serva või nurka: maksimeeri, pooled, veerandid.","Push delay":"Lükke viivitus","Quarters":"Veerandid","Quick":"Kiire","Quick settings":"Kiirseaded","Recommended values":"Soovitatud väärtused","Remove":"Eemalda","Remove rule":"Eemalda reegel","Remove zone":"Eemalda tsoon","Reset all":"Lähtesta kõik","Reset all keys":"Lähtesta kõik klahvid","Reset to default":"Lähtesta vaikeväärtusele","Resistance against overlapping":"Takistus kattumisele","Resize touching windows together":"Muuda üksteist puudutavate akende suurust koos","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Ka suuruse muutmine haagib – siin täiskõrguseni","Restore":"Taasta","Restore default layouts":"Taasta vaikepaigutused","Restore default layouts?":"Kas taastada vaikepaigutused?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Taasta algne suurus, kui aken välja lohistatakse","Restore the size before snapping":"Taasta haakimiseelne suurus","Rows":"Read","Save":"Salvesta","Screen edges":"Ekraani servad","Screen edges on/off":"Ekraani servad sisse/välja","Screen edges preview":"Ekraani servade eelvaade","Set":"Määra","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Määrab kõigi toimingute klahvid korraga. Üksikuid klahve saad allpool endiselt muuta.","Settings":"Seaded","Settings file":"Seadistuste fail","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Raputa suuruse muutmise ajal hiirt kiiresti edasi-tagasi ja teised aknad hüppavad tagasi. Kiire tõmme ühes suunas ei lase neid kunagi lahti.","Shake to let go":"Raputa lahti","Shortcuts":"Otseteed","Show a small handle first":"Näita esmalt väikest pidet","Show layout and zone names":"Näita paigutuste ja tsoonide nimesid","Show previews in the accent color":"Näita eelvaateid rõhuvärviga","Showing":"Näitamine","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Näitab, kuhu aken jõuab serva või nurga juures. Väljas: eelvaadet pole.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Näitab, kuhu aken jõuab, kui riba tsoon on esile tõstetud. Väljas: eelvaadet pole.","Sidebar + grid":"Külgriba + ruudustik","Single zone":"Üks tsoon","Six tiles":"Kuus paani","Size & shape":"Suurus ja kuju","Size of the main area":"Põhiala suurus","Slide-in duration":"Sisselibisemise kestus","Slide-out duration":"Väljalibisemise kestus","Smart arranging and detection.":"Nutikas paigutus ja tuvastus.","Smart fill":"Nutikas täitmine","Smooth (default)":"Sujuv (vaikimisi)","Snap bar":"Haakeriba","Snap bar and screen edges":"Haakeriba ja ekraani servad","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Haakeriba ja servad on välja lülitatud – töötab ainult režiim 2 ja režiimi kiirklahv ei tee midagi.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Haakeriba ja ekraani servad segavad automaatset paanimist. Seepärast töötavad need kahe režiimina – vaheta kiirklahviga või siin.","Snap bar colors:":"Haakeriba värvid:","Snap bar on/off":"Haakeriba sisse/välja","Snap bar preview":"Kinnitusriba eelvaade","Snap bar size":"Riba suurus","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Haakeriba, ekraani servad, aknamagnet, kiirklahvid ja akende vahetamine.","Snap distance":"Haakekaugus","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Haagi eraldajad (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Haakepaigutused ja automaatne paanimine.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Haagi aktiivne aken klahvikombinatsioonidega.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Haagi aktiivne aken klaviatuuriga. Need on tavalised KDE globaalsed kiirklahvid – leiad need ka asukohast Süsteemi seadistused → Kiirklahvid → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Haagi alumisse poolde","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Haagi alumisse vasakusse veerandisse","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Haagi alumisse paremasse veerandisse","Snap to the center third":"Haagi keskmisse kolmandikku","Snap to the left half":"Haagi vasakusse poolde","Snap to the left third":"Haagi vasakusse kolmandikku","Snap to the left two thirds":"Haagi vasakusse kahte kolmandikku","Snap to the right half":"Haagi paremasse poolde","Snap to the right third":"Haagi paremasse kolmandikku","Snap to the right two thirds":"Haagi paremasse kahte kolmandikku","Snap to the top half":"Haagi ülemisse poolde","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Haagi ülemisse vasakusse veerandisse","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Haagi ülemisse paremasse veerandisse","Snapping":"Haakimine","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Haakimine ja automaatne paanimine töötavad kahe režiimina – üks kiirklahv vahetab nende vahel.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Nii tõmbab akent ainult üks magnet. Su KDE seaded ei muutu: lülita see välja, keela või eemalda KSnapUnity ja KDE haakimine on tagasi.","Soft":"Pehme","Spacing":"Vahed","Spiral":"Spiraal","Split side by side":"Jaga kõrvuti","Split top and bottom":"Jaga üles ja alla","Stack + main":"Virn + põhi","Stick to other windows":"Kleepu teiste akende külge","Stick to the screen edges":"Kleepu ekraani servade külge","Sticky edges":"Kleepuvad servad","Support KSnapUnity":"Toeta KSnapUnity’t","Swap":"Vaheta","Swap windows":"Akende vahetamine","Swap with the window above":"Vaheta ülemise aknaga","Swap with the window below":"Vaheta alumise aknaga","Swap with the window on the left":"Vaheta vasakpoolse aknaga","Swap with the window on the right":"Vaheta parempoolse aknaga","Switch mode":"Vaheta režiimi","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Vaheta režiimi (haakimine / paanimine)","Switch modes with:":"Vaheta režiimi klahviga:","Switch the layout by itself":"Vaheta paigutust ise","Switched off":"Välja lülitatud","System":"Süsteem","Take it over":"Võta üle","Take over all":"Võta kõik üle","Take the main place":"Võtavad peakoha","Test animation":"Proovi animatsiooni","Test on screen":"Proovi ekraanil","Test the snap bar":"Proovi haakeriba","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Vaikeväärtused põhinevad Windows 11-l.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Haakimistoimingud kasutavad samu vahesid kui haakeriba ja jätavad meelde haakimiseelse suuruse: „Taasta haakimiseelne suurus” toob selle tagasi.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Neid rakendusi ei paigutata kunagi ja nad hoiavad oma kohta. Dialoogid hõljuvad alati.","Thirds":"Kolmandikud","Three columns":"Kolm veergu","Thumbnail width":"Pisipiltide laius","Tiling":"Paanimine","Tip":"Nõuanne","Top / bottom":"Üleval / all","Top edge":"Ülaserv","Top edge: full screen":"Ülemine serv: täisekraan","Top edge: maximize":"Ülemine serv: maksimeeri","Top edge: top half":"Ülemine serv: ülemine pool","Top half":"Ülemine pool","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Käivituskaugus ülaservast","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Lülita see välja, kui eelistad KDE enda kontuuri – siis lülita ülal ekraani servade eelvaade välja.","Two thirds":"Kaks kolmandikku","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Kaks akent vahetavad kohad – lase üks teisele või kasuta klahve.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Kaks akent vahetavad kohad: lase üks teisele või klahviga.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Kasuta kiirklahve","Use screen edges":"Kasuta ekraani servi","Use the system accent color":"Kasuta süsteemi rõhuvärvi","Use the window magnet":"Kasuta aknamagnetit","Usual combinations":"Tavalised kombinatsioonid","Version":"Versioon","Wanted for: %1":"Soovitud toimingule: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Kui aken avaneb, sulgub või vahetab kohta, liiguvad teised sujuvalt, mitte hüppeliselt.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Kui muudad akna suurust, liigutavad seda puudutavad aknad ühist serva kaasa – midagi ei kattu, tühimikku ei teki.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Suuruse muutmise ajal näidatakse aknaid, mis ei järgne, läbipaistvana.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Kui liigutad akent või muudad selle suurust, kleepuvad selle servad lähedalasuvate akende ja ekraani servade külge.","Width":"Laius","Window":"Aken","Window magnet":"Aknamagnet","Window magnet on/off":"Aknamagnet sisse/välja","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Üksteise kohal olevad aknad hoiavad vasakut ja paremat serva koos, kõrvuti aknad ülemist ja alumist.","Windows glide to their place":"Aknad libisevad oma kohale","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Aknad kleepuvad üksteise ja ekraani servade külge.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Aknad peatuvad üldlehe „Vahe akende vahel” kaugusel, selle asemel et kokku puutuda.","Yes":"Jah","Your own combination":"Oma kombinatsioon","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Sinu oma paigutused ja nende järjekord lähevad kaotsi.","Zone %1":"Tsoon %1","for KWin · v%1":"KWinile · v%1","windows:":"aknast:","“%1” will be removed.":"„%1“ eemaldatakse.","…drag it onto window B…":"…lohista see aknale B…","…in every direction":"…igas suunas","…let go: they trade places":"…lase lahti: nad vahetavad kohad","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…naabrid kasvavad ja kahanevad sellega","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Valmis – klõpsa OK, et avada seadete redaktor."},"eu":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (kopia)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 «%2»-k erabiltzen du.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 / %2 eremu","0 = all in one row":"0 = denak errenkada batean","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>1. modua</b><br/>Atxikitze-barra eta pantailaren ertzak","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>2. modua</b><br/>Lauza automatikoak","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Leiho bakarrak pantaila osoa erabiltzen du, marjina ezarrita egon arren.","A new window joins":"Leiho berri bat gehitzen da","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Bultzada labur batek erdia edo laurdena ematen du. Eutsi leihoari ertzean pixka bat gehiago eta hurrengo leihoraino haziko da – aurrebistak erakusten du.","A single window":"Leiho bakar bat","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Leiho bat beste baten ertzean gelditzen da, azkar mugitzen baduzu ere. Astindu sagua edo jarraitu une batez bultzatzen askatzeko. 0 = leihoak askatasunez gainjar daitezke.","About & Help":"Honi buruz eta laguntza","Accent color":"Nabarmentze-kolorea","Active":"Aktibo","Active mode":"Modu aktiboa","Active width along the top edge":"Zabalera aktiboa goiko ertzean zehar","Add an open application":"Gehitu aplikazio ireki bat","Add rule":"Gehitu araua","All window features in one system.":"Leihoen funtzio guztiak sistema bakarrean.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Leiho nagusiaren tamaina eskuz aldatzean ere aldatzen da.","Also while resizing":"Tamaina aldatzean ere bai","Always floating":"Beti flotatzaile","Animation":"Animazioa","Appearance":"Itxura","Apply":"Aplikatu","Arrange windows":"Leihoak antolatu","Arrange windows automatically":"Leihoak automatikoki antolatu","Author":"Egilea","Automatic tiling":"Lauza automatikoak","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Lauza automatikoak desaktibatuta – 1. modua bakarrik dabil eta moduaren lasterbideak ez du ezer egiten.","Automatic tiling off":"Lauza automatikoak desaktibatuta","Automatic tiling on":"Lauza automatikoak aktibatuta","Automatic tiling on/off":"Lauza automatikoak aktibatu/desaktibatu","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Lauza automatikoak, leihoen trukea, lasterbideak eta imana leiho flotatzaileentzat.","Background opacity":"Atzeko planoaren opakotasuna","Behavior & Animation":"Portaera eta animazioa","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Beheko ertza: beheko erdia","Bouncy":"Errebotea","Buy me a coffee":"Gonbidatu kafe batera","Cancel":"Utzi","Center focus":"Erdiko fokua","Center the window":"Zentratu leihoa","Change":"Aldatu","Change key":"Aldatu tekla","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Tekla ezarpenen editorean aldatzen da. Bi moduek lauza automatikoak eta barra edo pantailaren ertzak behar dituzte.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Aldatu Teklatuko lasterbideak orrian. Lauza automatikoekin, leihoek ordenako lekua ere trukatzen dute.","Choose…":"Aukeratu…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Egin klik eremu batean hautatzeko · klik bikoitzak zatitzen du · arrastatu bereizleak","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Egin klik edo sakatu %1 modua aldatzeko.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Egin klik, gero Ados – ezarpenen editorea irekitzen da.","Close":"Itxi","Close by, the edges stick together":"Gertu, ertzak elkarri itsasten zaizkio","Color scheme":"Kolore-eskema","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Barraren koloreak, tamaina eta forma.","Columns":"Zutabeak","Corner radius":"Izkinen erradioa","Corner size":"Izkinen tamaina","Corner: a quarter":"Izkina: laurden bat","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Izkinak: pantailaren laurdena","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + tekla (lehenetsia)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + zenbakizko teklatua","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + tekla","Custom color":"Kolore pertsonalizatua","Custom layout %1":"Diseinu pertsonalizatua %1","Dark":"Iluna","Delay before hiding":"Atzerapena ezkutatu aurretik","Delay before showing":"Atzerapena erakutsi aurretik","Delete":"Ezabatu","Delete layout?":"Diseinua ezabatu?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Heldulekua agertzen den distantzia","Distance before the bar hides again":"Barra berriro ezkutatu aurreko distantzia","Distance to the edge":"Ertzerainoko distantzia","Donate with PayPal":"Egin dohaintza PayPal bidez","Drag a shared edge…":"Arrastatu ertz partekatu bat…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Arrastatu leiho bat ertz batera…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Arrastatu leiho bat beste baten gainera trukatzeko. Barran edo pantailaren ertzean askatuz gero, aske flotatzen du; «Leihoa flotatzen utzi» itzultzen du. Tarteak Orokorra orritik datoz.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Arrastatu leiho bat beste baten erdiaren gainera – aurrebistak bi gezi erakusten ditu – eta askatu. Lauza automatikoekin nahikoa da beste leihoaren edozein tokitan.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Arrastatu leiho bat pantailaren goiko ertzera eta askatu eremu baten gainean.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Arrastatu txartelak barrako ordena aldatzeko. Egin klik bikoitza txartel batean editatzeko.","Drop a window onto another one":"Leiho bat beste baten gainean askatu","Drop the window onto a zone":"Askatu leihoa eremu batean","Duplicate":"Bikoiztu","Duration":"Iraupena","Dwindle":"Barrurako espirala","Dynamic":"Dinamikoa","Edges and corners":"Ertzak eta izkinak","Edit":"Editatu","Edit layout":"Editatu diseinua","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Funtzio bakoitza bere aldetik aktiba eta desaktiba daiteke.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Diseinuak orrian sortzen duzun diseinu orok leihoak ere antola ditzake – goian agertzen da. 1. leihoak 1. eremua hartzen du eta abar; gainerakoek azken eremua partekatzen dute. Eremuak baino leiho gutxiago badaude, «Nagusia eta pila» erabiltzen da, zulorik gera ez dadin.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Leiho bakoitzak bere lekua berez hartzen du, lauza-leiho kudeatzaile batean bezala.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Leiho bakoitzak pantailan bere lekua berez hartzen du. Leiho berriak gehitu egiten dira, itxitakoek tokia uzten diete besteei.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Adibidea: bi leiho alboz albo, hirutik aurrera nagusia eta pila, bostetik aurrera sareta. Araurik gabe goian aukeratutako diseinua erabiltzen da.","Fade in and out":"Iraungitzea agertzean eta desagertzean","Fade the other windows":"Iluntu beste leihoak","Features":"Eginbideak","Feel":"Sentsazioa","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Egokitu dagoeneko atxikitako leihoei","Fits the way you work.":"Zure lan egiteko erara egokitzen da.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Leihoa flotatzen utzi (lauzetatik irten)","Four quarters":"Lau laurden","From":"Hemendik","Fullscreen":"Pantaila osoa","Gap between windows":"Leihoen arteko tartea","Gap to the screen edge":"Pantailaren ertzerainoko tartea","General":"Orokorra","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Ekintza bakoitzari aukeratutako eskemaren tekla ematen dio berriro eta eskemak ez dituen teklak kentzen ditu.","Good to know":"Jakitea ona da","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Heldu leiho bati titulu-barratik eta arrastatu gora. Barra jaisten da; askatu leihoa eremu batean eta eremu hori bera beteko du. Berriro ateratzen baduzu, lehengo tamaina berreskuratzen du.","Grab window A…":"Heldu A leihoari…","Grid":"Sareta","Halves":"Erdiak","Hiding":"Ezkutatzea","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Eutsi ertzean leku librea betetzeko","Hold time":"Eusteko denbora","Hold to fill":"Eutsi betetzeko","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Ertz batek zenbat hurbildu behar duen bere lekuan sartu aurretik.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Kurtsoreak ertzetik zenbat hurbildu behar duen.","How far the bar slides down":"Barra zenbat jaisten den","How it works":"Nola dabilen","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Leihoak ertzaren kontra zenbat denbora egon behar duen – bultzada txiki bat. 0 = berehala.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Zenbat denbora egon behar duen leihoak ertzean hazi aurretik.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Zenbat leihok partekatzen duten eremu nagusia («Nagusia eta pila» diseinua).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Behean leiho bat badago, goiko ertzak goiko erdia ematen du maximizatu beharrean. Erdiek eta laurdenek ere libre uzten dituzte atxikitako leihoak.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"KSnapUnity gustuko baduzu, haren garapena lagun dezakezu – eskerrik asko!","In bar":"Barran","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Atxikitze-barratik eta pantailaren ertzetatik aparte.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Atxikitze-barratik aparte. Ertz bakoitza bere aldetik aktibatzen da.","Information":"Informazioa","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Leihoen portaera intuitibo eta naturala.","Join at the end":"Amaieran sartzen dira","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K KWin-erako · Snap atxikitze azkarragorako · Unity dena sistema bakarrean","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDEk pantaila-ertzetarako bere ekintzak eta leihoak atxikitzeko bere sistema ditu. Funtzio bera hemen aktibatuta badago, desaktibatu KDErena: Sistemaren ezarpenak → Leiho-kudeaketa → Pantailaren ertzak, eta Leihoen portaera → Mugimendua.","KDE's own edge tiling":"KDEren berezko ertz-lauzaketa","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"KDEren maximizatzea eta lauzak ertzetan – bere ingeradarekin – pausatuta daude KSnapUnity dabilen bitartean, aurrebista bakarra ager dadin. KDEren ezarpenak ez dira aldatzen: desaktibatu hau, desgaitu edo kendu KSnapUnity eta KDEren portaera itzultzen da.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"KDEren pantaila-ertzetako ekintzak aktibatuta daude oraindik, beraz bi laguntzailek erreakzionatzen dute arrastatze berean. Desaktibatu «Maximizatu» eta «Lauza» Sistemaren ezarpenak → Leiho-kudeaketa → Pantailaren ertzak atalean.","KDE's own window snapping":"KDEren berezko leiho-atxikitzea","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDEren leihoak atxikitzeko sistema ere aktibatuta dago. Sentsazio bateraturako, ezarri bere eremuak «Bat ere ez» balioan Sistemaren ezarpenak → Leiho-kudeaketa → Leihoen portaera → Mugimendua atalean.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"KDEren lasterbide-zerbitzuak ez du erantzun. Teklak oraindik ezar ditzakezu Sistemaren ezarpenak → Lasterbideak → KWin atalean.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – Ezarpenen editorea","Keep stacked windows in line":"Mantendu pilatutako leihoak lerroan","Keep the gap between windows":"Mantendu leihoen arteko tartea","Keep them":"Utzi","Key scheme":"Tekla-eskema","Keyboard shortcuts":"Teklatuko lasterbideak","Keys":"Teklak","Keys already in use":"Dagoeneko erabiltzen diren teklak","Layout":"Diseinua","Layout by number of windows":"Diseinua leiho kopuruaren arabera","Layouts":"Diseinuak","Layouts per row":"Diseinu errenkadako","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Ezkerreko eta eskuineko ertza: pantailaren erdia","Left edge: left half":"Ezkerreko ertza: ezkerreko erdia","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"100 %-tik behera leiho bakarra erdian geratzen da – polita pantaila zabaletan.","License":"Lizentzia","Light":"Argia","Linear":"Lineala","Live preview":"Zuzeneko aurrebista","Load template…":"Kargatu txantiloia…","Magnet":"Imana","Main + stack":"Nagusia + pila","Main and stack":"Nagusia eta pila","Main area bigger":"Eremu nagusia handiagoa","Main area on the right":"Eremu nagusia eskuinean","Main area smaller":"Eremu nagusia txikiagoa","Main in the middle":"Nagusia erdian","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Etengailu nagusia arrastatzeko eta teklentzat.","Main window":"Leiho nagusia","Main windows":"Leiho nagusiak","Main windows: %1":"Leiho nagusiak: %1","Make it the main window":"Leiho nagusi bihurtu","Maximize":"Maximizatu","Maximize or restore":"Maximizatu edo berrezarri","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + tekla (KDE estiloa)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + tekla","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + tekla","Minimize":"Minimizatu","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Diseinua ispilatzen du: leiho nagusia eskuinean, besteak ezkerrean.","Mode":"Modua","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"1. modua – Atxikitze-barra eta pantailaren ertzak","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"2. modua – Lauza automatikoak","Modes":"Moduak","More ways":"Modu gehiago","Motion curve":"Mugimendu-kurba","Move a window towards others…":"Mugitu leiho bat besteengana…","Move the window one place back":"Mugitu leihoa leku bat atzera","Move the window one place on":"Mugitu leihoa leku bat aurrera","Name:":"Izena:","New layout":"Diseinu berria","New windows":"Leiho berriak","Next tiling layout":"Hurrengo lauza-diseinua","Next to the active window":"Leiho aktiboaren ondoan","No key":"Teklarik ez","No other window open":"Ez dago beste leihorik irekita","No outer margin":"Kanpoko marjinarik ez","No shortcuts":"Lasterbiderik ez","None":"Bat ere ez","None yet.":"Bat ere ez oraindik.","Off":"Desaktibatuta","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Desaktibatuta = 1. modua, aktibatuta = 2. modua","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Desaktibatuta: marko neutro bat – aktibatutako aurrebistetarako soilik.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Desaktibatuta: teklak esleituta geratzen dira baina ez dute ezer egiten.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Desaktibatuta: leihoak jartzen dituzun lekuan geratzen dira. Beste funtzioek berdin funtzionatzen dute.","One at a time":"Banan-banan","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Bat ixten da – besteek hutsunea betetzen dute","One main window less":"Leiho nagusi bat gutxiago","One more main window":"Leiho nagusi bat gehiago","One window":"Leiho bat","Only one mode is switched on.":"Modu bakarra dago aktibatuta.","Open settings editor":"Ireki ezarpenen editorea","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Ireki aplikazioa lehenik, eta aukeratu hemen.","Open the layout builder":"Ireki diseinu-sortzailea","Own layouts":"Diseinu propioak","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Alde bakoitzeko izkinatzat hartzen den zatia.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Pausatu KDEren ertz-lauzaketa eta haren aurrebista","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Pausatu KDEren atxikitze-zonak imana aktibo dagoen bitartean","Preview":"Aurrebista","Previews":"Aurrebistak","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Bultzatu leiho bat pantailaren ertz edo izkina baten kontra eta zati hori beteko du. Atxikitze-barrarekin edo gabe dabil.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Bultzatu leiho bat ertz edo izkina baten kontra: maximizatu, erdiak, laurdenak.","Push delay":"Bultzatze-atzerapena","Quarters":"Laurdenak","Quick":"Azkarra","Quick settings":"Ezarpen azkarrak","Recommended values":"Gomendatutako balioak","Remove":"Kendu","Remove rule":"Kendu araua","Remove zone":"Kendu eremua","Reset all":"Berrezarri dena","Reset all keys":"Berrezarri tekla guztiak","Reset to default":"Berrezarri lehenetsia","Resistance against overlapping":"Gainjartzearen aurkako erresistentzia","Resize touching windows together":"Aldatu elkar ukitzen duten leihoen tamaina batera","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Tamaina aldatzean ere atxikitzen da – hemen altuera osora","Restore":"Leheneratu","Restore default layouts":"Leheneratu diseinu lehenetsiak","Restore default layouts?":"Diseinu lehenetsiak leheneratu?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Leheneratu jatorrizko tamaina leihoa ateratzean","Restore the size before snapping":"Berrezarri atxiki aurreko tamaina","Rows":"Errenkadak","Save":"Gorde","Screen edges":"Pantailaren ertzak","Screen edges on/off":"Pantailaren ertzak bai/ez","Screen edges preview":"Pantaila-ertzen aurrebista","Set":"Ezarri","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Ekintza guztien teklak batera ezartzen ditu. Tekla bakarrak behean alda ditzakezu oraindik.","Settings":"Ezarpenak","Settings file":"Ezarpen-fitxategia","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Tamaina aldatzean astindu sagua azkar aurrera eta atzera, eta beste leihoak atzera egingo dute. Norabide bakarreko tira azkar batek ez ditu inoiz askatzen.","Shake to let go":"Astindu askatzeko","Shortcuts":"Lasterbideak","Show a small handle first":"Erakutsi lehenik helduleku txiki bat","Show layout and zone names":"Erakutsi diseinuen eta eremuen izenak","Show previews in the accent color":"Erakutsi aurrebistak nabarmentze-kolorean","Showing":"Erakustea","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Leihoa ertz edo izkina batean non geratuko den erakusten du. Desaktibatuta: aurrebistarik ez.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Leihoa non geratuko den erakusten du barrako zona bat nabarmenduta dagoen bitartean. Desaktibatuta: aurrebistarik ez.","Sidebar + grid":"Alboko barra + sareta","Single zone":"Eremu bakarra","Six tiles":"Sei lauza","Size & shape":"Tamaina eta forma","Size of the main area":"Eremu nagusiaren tamaina","Slide-in duration":"Jaitsieraren iraupena","Slide-out duration":"Igoeraren iraupena","Smart arranging and detection.":"Antolaketa eta detekzio adimentsuak.","Smart fill":"Betetze adimenduna","Smooth (default)":"Leuna (lehenetsia)","Snap bar":"Atxikitze-barra","Snap bar and screen edges":"Atxikitze-barra eta pantailaren ertzak","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Barra eta ertzak desaktibatuta – 2. modua bakarrik dabil eta moduaren lasterbideak ez du ezer egiten.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Barrak eta pantailaren ertzek lauza automatikoak oztopatzen dituzte. Horregatik bi modu dira – aldatu lasterbidearekin edo hemen.","Snap bar colors:":"Barraren koloreak:","Snap bar on/off":"Atxikitze-barra bai/ez","Snap bar preview":"Atxikitze-barraren aurrebista","Snap bar size":"Barraren tamaina","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Atxikitze-barra, pantailaren ertzak, leihoen imana, lasterbideak eta leihoen trukea.","Snap distance":"Atxikitze-distantzia","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Atxiki bereizleak (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Atxikitze-diseinuak eta lauza automatikoak.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Atxiki leiho aktiboa tekla-konbinazioekin.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Atxiki leiho aktiboa teklatuarekin. KDEren lasterbide global arruntak dira – Sistemaren ezarpenak → Lasterbideak → KWin atalean ere aurkituko dituzu.","Snap to the bottom half":"Atxiki beheko erdian","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Atxiki beheko ezkerreko laurdenean","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Atxiki beheko eskuineko laurdenean","Snap to the center third":"Atxiki erdiko herenean","Snap to the left half":"Atxiki ezkerreko erdian","Snap to the left third":"Atxiki ezkerreko herenean","Snap to the left two thirds":"Atxiki ezkerreko bi herenetan","Snap to the right half":"Atxiki eskuineko erdian","Snap to the right third":"Atxiki eskuineko herenean","Snap to the right two thirds":"Atxiki eskuineko bi herenetan","Snap to the top half":"Atxiki goiko erdian","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Atxiki goiko ezkerreko laurdenean","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Atxiki goiko eskuineko laurdenean","Snapping":"Atxikitzea","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Atxikitzea eta lauza automatikoak bi modu dira – lasterbide batek bien artean aldatzen du.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Horrela imana bakarrak tiratzen du leihotik. KDEren ezarpenak ez dira aldatzen: desaktibatu hau, desgaitu edo kendu KSnapUnity eta KDEren atxikitzea itzultzen da.","Soft":"Bigun","Spacing":"Tarteak","Spiral":"Espirala","Split side by side":"Zatitu alboz albo","Split top and bottom":"Zatitu goian eta behean","Stack + main":"Pila + nagusia","Stick to other windows":"Itsatsi beste leihoei","Stick to the screen edges":"Itsatsi pantailaren ertzei","Sticky edges":"Ertz itsaskorrak","Support KSnapUnity":"Lagundu KSnapUnity","Swap":"Trukatu","Swap windows":"Leihoak trukatu","Swap with the window above":"Trukatu goiko leihoarekin","Swap with the window below":"Trukatu beheko leihoarekin","Swap with the window on the left":"Trukatu ezkerreko leihoarekin","Swap with the window on the right":"Trukatu eskuineko leihoarekin","Switch mode":"Aldatu modua","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Aldatu modua (atxikitzea / lauzak)","Switch modes with:":"Aldatu modua honekin:","Switch the layout by itself":"Aldatu diseinua berez","Switched off":"Desaktibatuta","System":"Sistema","Take it over":"Hartu","Take over all":"Hartu denak","Take the main place":"Leku nagusia hartzen dute","Test animation":"Probatu animazioa","Test on screen":"Probatu pantailan","Test the snap bar":"Probatu atxikitze-barra","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Balio lehenetsiak Windows 11n oinarrituta daude.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Atxikitze-ekintzek barraren tarte berak erabiltzen dituzte eta atxiki aurreko tamaina gogoratzen dute: «Berrezarri atxiki aurreko tamaina» aukerak itzultzen du.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Aplikazio hauek ez dira inoiz antolatzen eta beren lekua gordetzen dute. Elkarrizketa-koadroak beti flotatzen dute.","Thirds":"Herenak","Three columns":"Hiru zutabe","Thumbnail width":"Koadro txikien zabalera","Tiling":"Lauzak","Tip":"Aholkua","Top / bottom":"Goian / behean","Top edge":"Goiko ertza","Top edge: full screen":"Goiko ertza: pantaila osoa","Top edge: maximize":"Goiko ertza: maximizatu","Top edge: top half":"Goiko ertza: goiko erdia","Top half":"Goiko erdia","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Aktibatze-distantzia goiko ertzetik","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Desaktibatu hau KDEren ingerada nahiago baduzu – orduan desaktibatu goian pantaila-ertzen aurrebista.","Two thirds":"Bi heren","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Bi leihok tokiak trukatzen dituzte – askatu bat bestearen gainean edo erabili teklak.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Bi leihok tokiak trukatzen dituzte: askatu bat bestearen gainean, edo teklaz.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Erabili teklatuko lasterbideak","Use screen edges":"Erabili pantailaren ertzak","Use the system accent color":"Erabili sistemaren nabarmentze-kolorea","Use the window magnet":"Erabili leihoen imana","Usual combinations":"Ohiko konbinazioak","Version":"Bertsioa","Wanted for: %1":"Honetarako nahi da: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Leiho bat ireki, itxi edo trukatzean, besteak leunki mugitzen dira salto egin beharrean.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Leiho baten tamaina aldatzean, hura ukitzen duten leihoek ertz partekatua mugitzen dute harekin – ez da ezer gainjartzen, ez da hutsunerik sortzen.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Tamaina aldatzean, jarraitzen ez duten leihoak garden erakusten dira.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Leiho bat mugitu edo tamainaz aldatzen duzun bitartean, haren ertzak inguruko leihoei eta pantailaren ertzei itsasten zaizkie.","Width":"Zabalera","Window":"Leihoa","Window magnet":"Leihoen imana","Window magnet on/off":"Leihoen imana bai/ez","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Bata bestearen gainean dauden leihoek ezkerreko eta eskuineko ertzak elkarrekin mantentzen dituzte; alboz albokoek goikoak eta behekoak.","Windows glide to their place":"Leihoak lerratu egiten dira beren lekura","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Leihoak elkarri eta pantailaren ertzei itsasten zaizkie.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Leihoak Orokorra orriko «Leihoen arteko tartea»-n gelditzen dira, elkar ukitu ordez.","Yes":"Bai","Your own combination":"Zure konbinazioa","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Zure diseinuak eta haien ordena galduko dira.","Zone %1":"%1. eremua","for KWin · v%1":"KWin-erako · v%1","windows:":"leiho:","“%1” will be removed.":"«%1» kenduko da.","…drag it onto window B…":"…arrastatu B leihoaren gainera…","…in every direction":"…norabide guztietan","…let go: they trade places":"…askatu: tokiak trukatzen dituzte","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…ondokoak harekin hazi eta txikitzen dira","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Prest – egin klik Ados-en ezarpenen editorea irekitzeko."},"fa":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (رونوشت)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 را «%2» استفاده می‌کند.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 از %2 ناحیه","0 = all in one row":"0 = همه در یک ردیف","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>حالت ۱</b><br/>نوار و لبه‌های صفحه","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>حالت ۲</b><br/>کاشی‌کاری خودکار","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"پنجرهٔ تنها کل صفحه را می‌گیرد، حتی وقتی حاشیه تنظیم شده باشد.","A new window joins":"یک پنجرهٔ تازه اضافه می‌شود","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"یک فشار کوتاه نیمه یا یک‌چهارم می‌دهد. پنجره را کمی بیشتر در لبه نگه دارید تا تا پنجرهٔ بعدی بزرگ شود – پیش‌نمایش آن را نشان می‌دهد.","A single window":"یک پنجرهٔ تنها","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"پنجره کنار لبهٔ پنجرهٔ دیگر می‌ایستد، حتی اگر سریع جابه‌جایش کنید. برای رها کردن، ماوس را تکان دهید یا لحظه‌ای بیشتر هل دهید. 0 = پنجره‌ها آزادانه روی هم می‌افتند.","About & Help":"درباره و راهنما","Accent color":"رنگ تأکیدی","Active":"فعال","Active mode":"حالت فعال","Active width along the top edge":"پهنای فعال در امتداد لبهٔ بالا","Add an open application":"افزودن یک برنامهٔ باز","Add rule":"افزودن قاعده","All window features in one system.":"همهٔ قابلیت‌های پنجره در یک سامانه.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"وقتی اندازهٔ پنجرهٔ اصلی را دستی تغییر می‌دهید هم عوض می‌شود.","Also while resizing":"هنگام تغییر اندازه هم","Always floating":"همیشه شناور","Animation":"پویانمایی","Appearance":"ظاهر","Apply":"اعمال","Arrange windows":"چیدن پنجره‌ها","Arrange windows automatically":"چیدن خودکار پنجره‌ها","Author":"سازنده","Automatic tiling":"کاشی‌کاری خودکار","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"کاشی‌کاری خودکار خاموش است – فقط حالت ۱ کار می‌کند و میان‌بر حالت کاری نمی‌کند.","Automatic tiling off":"کاشی‌کاری خودکار خاموش","Automatic tiling on":"کاشی‌کاری خودکار روشن","Automatic tiling on/off":"روشن/خاموش کاشی‌کاری خودکار","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"کاشی‌کاری خودکار، جابه‌جایی پنجره‌ها، میان‌برها و آهنربا برای پنجره‌های شناور.","Background opacity":"کدری پس‌زمینه","Behavior & Animation":"رفتار و پویانمایی","Bottom edge: bottom half":"لبهٔ پایین: نیمهٔ پایین","Bouncy":"فنری","Buy me a coffee":"برایم یک قهوه بخر","Cancel":"لغو","Center focus":"تمرکز در وسط","Center the window":"وسط‌چین کردن پنجره","Change":"تغییر","Change key":"تغییر کلید","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"کلید را در ویرایشگر تنظیمات عوض کنید. هر دو حالت به کاشی‌کاری خودکار و نوار یا لبه‌های صفحه نیاز دارند.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"آن‌ها را در صفحهٔ «میان‌برهای صفحه‌کلید» تغییر دهید. با کاشی‌کاری خودکار، پنجره‌ها جایشان را در ترتیب هم عوض می‌کنند.","Choose…":"انتخاب…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"برای انتخاب روی ناحیه کلیک کنید · با دوبار کلیک تقسیم کنید · جداکننده‌ها را بکشید","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"برای تغییر حالت کلیک کنید یا %1 را بزنید.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"کلیک کنید، بعد تأیید – ویرایشگر تنظیمات باز می‌شود.","Close":"بستن","Close by, the edges stick together":"در نزدیکی، لبه‌ها به هم می‌چسبند","Color scheme":"طرح رنگ","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"رنگ‌ها، اندازه و شکل نوار.","Columns":"ستون‌ها","Corner radius":"شعاع گوشه‌ها","Corner size":"اندازهٔ گوشه","Corner: a quarter":"گوشه: یک‌چهارم","Corners: quarter of the screen":"گوشه‌ها: یک‌چهارم صفحه","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + کلید (پیش‌فرض)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + صفحه‌کلید عددی","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + کلید","Custom color":"رنگ دلخواه","Custom layout %1":"چیدمان دلخواه %1","Dark":"تیره","Delay before hiding":"تأخیر پیش از پنهان شدن","Delay before showing":"تأخیر پیش از نمایش","Delete":"حذف","Delete layout?":"چیدمان حذف شود؟","Distance at which the handle appears":"فاصله‌ای که دستگیره ظاهر می‌شود","Distance before the bar hides again":"فاصله تا پنهان شدن دوبارهٔ نوار","Distance to the edge":"فاصله تا لبه","Donate with PayPal":"اهدا با PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"یک لبهٔ مشترک را بکشید…","Drag a window against an edge…":"یک پنجره را به لبه بکشید…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"یک پنجره را روی دیگری بکشید تا جابه‌جا شوند. اگر روی نوار یا لبهٔ صفحه رها شود آزادانه شناور می‌شود؛ «شناور کردن پنجره» آن را برمی‌گرداند. فاصله‌ها از صفحهٔ عمومی می‌آیند.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"یک پنجره را روی وسط پنجرهٔ دیگر بکشید – پیش‌نمایش دو پیکان نشان می‌دهد – و رها کنید. در کاشی‌کاری خودکار هر جای پنجرهٔ دیگر کافی است.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"پنجره‌ای را به لبهٔ بالای صفحه بکشید و روی یک ناحیه رها کنید.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"کارت‌ها را بکشید تا ترتیب نوار را تغییر دهید. برای ویرایش روی کارت دوبار کلیک کنید.","Drop a window onto another one":"رها کردن پنجره روی پنجرهٔ دیگر","Drop the window onto a zone":"پنجره را روی یک ناحیه رها کنید","Duplicate":"تکثیر","Duration":"مدت","Dwindle":"مارپیچ درونی","Dynamic":"پویا","Edges and corners":"لبه‌ها و گوشه‌ها","Edit":"ویرایش","Edit layout":"ویرایش چیدمان","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"هر قابلیت را می‌توان جداگانه روشن و خاموش کرد.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"هر چیدمانی که در صفحهٔ چیدمان‌ها می‌سازید می‌تواند پنجره‌ها را هم بچیند – بالا نمایش داده می‌شود. پنجرهٔ ۱ ناحیهٔ ۱ را می‌گیرد و همین‌طور؛ پنجره‌های بیشتر ناحیهٔ آخر را شریک می‌شوند. با پنجره‌های کمتر از ناحیه‌ها «اصلی و پشته» به کار می‌رود تا جای خالی نماند.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"هر پنجره خودش جایش را پیدا می‌کند، مثل یک مدیر پنجرهٔ کاشی‌ای.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"هر پنجره خودش جایش را روی صفحه پیدا می‌کند. پنجره‌های تازه به صف می‌پیوندند و بسته‌شده‌ها جا را برای بقیه باز می‌کنند.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"نمونه: دو پنجره کنار هم، از سه اصلی و پشته، از پنج شبکه. بدون قاعدهٔ مناسب، چیدمان انتخاب‌شدهٔ بالا به کار می‌رود.","Fade in and out":"محو شدن هنگام ظاهر و ناپدید شدن","Fade the other windows":"کم‌رنگ کردن پنجره‌های دیگر","Features":"ویژگی‌ها","Feel":"حس","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"جا دادن در کنار پنجره‌هایی که از قبل چسبانده شده‌اند","Fits the way you work.":"با روش کار شما جور می‌شود.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"شناور کردن پنجره (خروج از کاشی‌کاری)","Four quarters":"چهار ربع","From":"از","Fullscreen":"تمام‌صفحه","Gap between windows":"فاصلهٔ بین پنجره‌ها","Gap to the screen edge":"فاصله تا لبهٔ صفحه","General":"عمومی","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"به هر کنش دوباره کلید طرح انتخاب‌شده را می‌دهد و کلیدهایی را که طرح ندارد حذف می‌کند.","Good to know":"خوب است بدانید","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"پنجره را از نوار عنوانش بگیرید و به بالا بکشید. نوار پایین می‌آید؛ پنجره را روی یک ناحیه رها کنید تا دقیقاً همان بخش را پر کند. اگر دوباره بیرونش بکشید، اندازهٔ قبلی‌اش را پس می‌گیرد.","Grab window A…":"پنجرهٔ A را بگیرید…","Grid":"شبکه","Halves":"نیمه‌ها","Hiding":"پنهان شدن","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"نگه داشتن در لبه برای پر کردن فضای خالی","Hold time":"زمان نگه داشتن","Hold to fill":"نگه داشتن برای پر کردن","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"لبه چقدر باید نزدیک شود تا سر جایش قفل شود.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"نشانگر چقدر باید به لبه نزدیک شود.","How far the bar slides down":"نوار چقدر پایین می‌آید","How it works":"چطور کار می‌کند","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"پنجره چه مدت باید به لبه تکیه کند – یک فشار کوچک. 0 = بی‌درنگ.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"پنجره پیش از بزرگ شدن چه مدت باید در لبه بماند.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"چند پنجره ناحیهٔ اصلی را تقسیم می‌کنند (چیدمان «اصلی و پشته»).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"اگر پنجره‌ای از قبل پایین باشد، لبهٔ بالا به‌جای بیشینه کردن، نیمهٔ بالا را می‌دهد. نیمه‌ها و یک‌چهارم‌ها هم پنجره‌های چسبانده‌شده را نمی‌پوشانند.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"اگر KSnapUnity را دوست دارید، می‌توانید از توسعه‌اش حمایت کنید – سپاس!","In bar":"در نوار","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"مستقل از نوار و لبه‌های صفحه.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"مستقل از نوار. هر لبه را می‌توان جداگانه روشن کرد.","Information":"اطلاعات","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"رفتار طبیعی و شهودی پنجره‌ها.","Join at the end":"به انتها می‌روند","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K برای KWin · Snap برای چسباندن هوشمندتر · Unity برای همه‌چیز در یک سامانه","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE کنش‌های لبهٔ صفحه و چسباندن پنجرهٔ خودش را دارد. اگر همان ویژگی اینجا روشن است، نسخهٔ KDE را خاموش کنید: تنظیمات سیستم ← مدیریت پنجره ← لبه‌های صفحه، و رفتار پنجره ← جابه‌جایی.","KDE's own edge tiling":"کاشی‌کاری لبه‌های خود KDE","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"بیشینه‌سازی و کاشی‌کاری خود KDE در لبه‌ها – با طرح آن – تا وقتی KSnapUnity کار می‌کند متوقف است تا فقط یک پیش‌نمایش دیده شود. تنظیمات KDE شما تغییر نمی‌کند: این را خاموش کنید، KSnapUnity را غیرفعال یا حذف کنید و رفتار KDE برمی‌گردد.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"کنش‌های لبهٔ صفحهٔ خود KDE هنوز روشن‌اند، پس دو ابزار به یک کشیدن واکنش نشان می‌دهند. «بیشینه کردن» و «کاشی‌کاری» را در تنظیمات سیستم ← مدیریت پنجره ← لبه‌های صفحه خاموش کنید.","KDE's own window snapping":"چسباندن پنجرهٔ خود KDE","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"چسباندن پنجرهٔ خود KDE هم روشن است. برای حسی یکدست، ناحیه‌های آن را در تنظیمات سیستم ← مدیریت پنجره ← رفتار پنجره ← جابه‌جایی روی «هیچ» بگذارید.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"سرویس میان‌بر KDE پاسخ نداد. همچنان می‌توانید کلیدها را در تنظیمات سیستم ← میان‌برها ← KWin تنظیم کنید.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – ویرایشگر تنظیمات","Keep stacked windows in line":"پنجره‌های روی هم در یک خط بمانند","Keep the gap between windows":"حفظ فاصلهٔ بین پنجره‌ها","Keep them":"نگه داشتن","Key scheme":"طرح کلیدها","Keyboard shortcuts":"میان‌برهای صفحه‌کلید","Keys":"کلیدها","Keys already in use":"کلیدهای در حال استفاده","Layout":"چیدمان","Layout by number of windows":"چیدمان بر اساس تعداد پنجره‌ها","Layouts":"چیدمان‌ها","Layouts per row":"چیدمان در هر ردیف","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"لبهٔ چپ و راست: نیمی از صفحه","Left edge: left half":"لبهٔ چپ: نیمهٔ چپ","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"کمتر از ۱۰۰ ٪ پنجرهٔ تنها را وسط نگه می‌دارد – روی صفحه‌های پهن زیباست.","License":"پروانه","Light":"روشن","Linear":"خطی","Live preview":"پیش‌نمایش زنده","Load template…":"بارگذاری الگو…","Magnet":"آهنربا","Main + stack":"اصلی + پشته","Main and stack":"اصلی و پشته","Main area bigger":"ناحیهٔ اصلی بزرگ‌تر","Main area on the right":"ناحیهٔ اصلی در راست","Main area smaller":"ناحیهٔ اصلی کوچک‌تر","Main in the middle":"اصلی در وسط","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"کلید اصلی برای کشیدن و کلیدها.","Main window":"پنجرهٔ اصلی","Main windows":"پنجره‌های اصلی","Main windows: %1":"پنجره‌های اصلی: %1","Make it the main window":"پنجرهٔ اصلی کن","Maximize":"بیشینه کردن","Maximize or restore":"بیشینه کردن یا بازگرداندن","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + کلید (سبک KDE)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + کلید","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + کلید","Minimize":"کمینه","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"چیدمان را آینه می‌کند: پنجرهٔ اصلی راست، بقیه چپ.","Mode":"حالت","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"حالت ۱ – نوار و لبه‌های صفحه","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"حالت ۲ – کاشی‌کاری خودکار","Modes":"حالت‌ها","More ways":"راه‌های بیشتر","Motion curve":"منحنی حرکت","Move a window towards others…":"یک پنجره را به سمت بقیه ببرید…","Move the window one place back":"جابه‌جایی پنجره یک جای عقب‌تر","Move the window one place on":"جابه‌جایی پنجره یک جای جلوتر","Name:":"نام:","New layout":"چیدمان جدید","New windows":"پنجره‌های تازه","Next tiling layout":"چیدمان کاشی بعدی","Next to the active window":"کنار پنجرهٔ فعال","No key":"بدون کلید","No other window open":"پنجرهٔ باز دیگری نیست","No outer margin":"بدون حاشیهٔ بیرونی","No shortcuts":"بدون میان‌بر","None":"هیچ","None yet.":"هنوز هیچ.","Off":"خاموش","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"خاموش = حالت ۱، روشن = حالت ۲","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"خاموش: یک قاب خنثی – فقط برای پیش‌نمایش‌های روشن.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"خاموش: کلیدها اختصاص‌یافته می‌مانند اما کاری نمی‌کنند.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"خاموش: پنجره‌ها همان‌جا که می‌گذارید می‌مانند. قابلیت‌های دیگر در هر حال کار می‌کنند.","One at a time":"یکی‌یکی","One closes – the others fill the gap":"یکی بسته می‌شود – بقیه جای خالی را پر می‌کنند","One main window less":"یک پنجرهٔ اصلی کمتر","One more main window":"یک پنجرهٔ اصلی بیشتر","One window":"یک پنجره","Only one mode is switched on.":"فقط یک حالت روشن است.","Open settings editor":"باز کردن ویرایشگر تنظیمات","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"اول برنامه را باز کنید، بعد اینجا انتخابش کنید.","Open the layout builder":"باز کردن سازندهٔ چیدمان","Own layouts":"چیدمان‌های خودتان","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"بخشی از هر ضلع که گوشه به حساب می‌آید.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"توقف کاشی‌کاری لبه‌های KDE و پیش‌نمایش آن","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"توقف ناحیه‌های چسباندن KDE تا وقتی آهنربا روشن است","Preview":"پیش‌نمایش","Previews":"پیش‌نمایش‌ها","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"پنجره را به لبه یا گوشهٔ صفحه فشار دهید تا آن بخش را پر کند. با نوار یا بدون آن کار می‌کند.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"پنجره را به لبه یا گوشه فشار دهید: بیشینه، نیمه‌ها، یک‌چهارم‌ها.","Push delay":"تأخیر فشار","Quarters":"یک‌چهارم‌ها","Quick":"سریع","Quick settings":"تنظیمات سریع","Recommended values":"مقادیر پیشنهادی","Remove":"حذف","Remove rule":"حذف قاعده","Remove zone":"حذف ناحیه","Reset all":"بازنشانی همه","Reset all keys":"بازنشانی همهٔ کلیدها","Reset to default":"بازگرداندن پیش‌فرض","Resistance against overlapping":"مقاومت در برابر هم‌پوشانی","Resize touching windows together":"تغییر اندازهٔ هم‌زمان پنجره‌های چسبیده به هم","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"تغییر اندازه هم می‌چسبد – اینجا تا تمام ارتفاع","Restore":"بازگرداندن","Restore default layouts":"بازگرداندن چیدمان‌های پیش‌فرض","Restore default layouts?":"چیدمان‌های پیش‌فرض بازگردانده شوند؟","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"بازگرداندن اندازهٔ اصلی هنگام بیرون کشیدن پنجره","Restore the size before snapping":"بازگرداندن اندازهٔ پیش از چسباندن","Rows":"ردیف‌ها","Save":"ذخیره","Screen edges":"لبه‌های صفحه","Screen edges on/off":"روشن/خاموش کردن لبه‌های صفحه","Screen edges preview":"پیش‌نمایش لبه‌های صفحه","Set":"تنظیم","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"کلیدهای همهٔ کنش‌ها را یک‌جا تنظیم می‌کند. همچنان می‌توانید کلیدهای تکی را در پایین تغییر دهید.","Settings":"تنظیمات","Settings file":"پروندهٔ تنظیمات","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"هنگام تغییر اندازه ماوس را سریع به جلو و عقب تکان دهید تا پنجره‌های دیگر برگردند. کشیدن سریع در یک جهت هرگز آن‌ها را رها نمی‌کند.","Shake to let go":"تکان دهید تا رها شود","Shortcuts":"میان‌برها","Show a small handle first":"ابتدا یک دستگیرهٔ کوچک نشان داده شود","Show layout and zone names":"نمایش نام چیدمان‌ها و ناحیه‌ها","Show previews in the accent color":"نمایش پیش‌نمایش‌ها با رنگ تأکیدی","Showing":"نمایش","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"نشان می‌دهد پنجره در لبه یا گوشه کجا قرار می‌گیرد. خاموش: هیچ پیش‌نمایشی.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"تا وقتی ناحیه‌ای از نوار برجسته است، نشان می‌دهد پنجره کجا قرار می‌گیرد. خاموش: هیچ پیش‌نمایشی.","Sidebar + grid":"نوار کناری + شبکه","Single zone":"یک ناحیه","Six tiles":"شش کاشی","Size & shape":"اندازه و شکل","Size of the main area":"اندازهٔ ناحیهٔ اصلی","Slide-in duration":"مدت ورود","Slide-out duration":"مدت خروج","Smart arranging and detection.":"چینش و تشخیص هوشمند.","Smart fill":"پرکردن هوشمند","Smooth (default)":"نرم (پیش‌فرض)","Snap bar":"نوار","Snap bar and screen edges":"نوار و لبه‌های صفحه","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"نوار و لبه‌ها خاموش‌اند – فقط حالت ۲ کار می‌کند و میان‌بر حالت کاری نمی‌کند.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"نوار و لبه‌های صفحه مزاحم کاشی‌کاری خودکارند. برای همین دو حالت دارند – با میان‌بر یا از اینجا عوض کنید.","Snap bar colors:":"رنگ‌های نوار:","Snap bar on/off":"روشن/خاموش کردن نوار","Snap bar preview":"پیش‌نمایش نوار","Snap bar size":"اندازهٔ نوار","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"نوار، لبه‌های صفحه، آهنربای پنجره، میان‌برها و جابه‌جایی پنجره‌ها.","Snap distance":"فاصلهٔ چسبیدن","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"چسباندن جداکننده‌ها (¼، ⅓، ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"چیدمان‌های چسباندن و کاشی‌کاری خودکار.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"پنجرهٔ فعال را با ترکیب کلیدها بچسبانید.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"پنجرهٔ فعال را با صفحه‌کلید بچسبانید. این‌ها میان‌برهای سراسری معمول KDE هستند – در تنظیمات سیستم ← میان‌برها ← KWin هم پیدا می‌شوند.","Snap to the bottom half":"چسباندن به نیمهٔ پایین","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"چسباندن به یک‌چهارم پایین-چپ","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"چسباندن به یک‌چهارم پایین-راست","Snap to the center third":"چسباندن به یک‌سوم میانی","Snap to the left half":"چسباندن به نیمهٔ چپ","Snap to the left third":"چسباندن به یک‌سوم چپ","Snap to the left two thirds":"چسباندن به دوسوم چپ","Snap to the right half":"چسباندن به نیمهٔ راست","Snap to the right third":"چسباندن به یک‌سوم راست","Snap to the right two thirds":"چسباندن به دوسوم راست","Snap to the top half":"چسباندن به نیمهٔ بالا","Snap to the top-left quarter":"چسباندن به یک‌چهارم بالا-چپ","Snap to the top-right quarter":"چسباندن به یک‌چهارم بالا-راست","Snapping":"چسباندن","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"چسباندن و کاشی‌کاری خودکار دو حالت‌اند – یک میان‌بر بینشان جابه‌جا می‌کند.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"این‌گونه فقط یک آهنربا پنجره را می‌کشد. تنظیمات KDE شما تغییر نمی‌کند: این را خاموش کنید، KSnapUnity را غیرفعال یا حذف کنید و چسباندن KDE برمی‌گردد.","Soft":"ملایم","Spacing":"فاصله‌ها","Spiral":"مارپیچ","Split side by side":"تقسیم کنار هم","Split top and bottom":"تقسیم بالا و پایین","Stack + main":"پشته + اصلی","Stick to other windows":"چسبیدن به پنجره‌های دیگر","Stick to the screen edges":"چسبیدن به لبه‌های صفحه","Sticky edges":"لبه‌های چسبنده","Support KSnapUnity":"از KSnapUnity حمایت کنید","Swap":"جابه‌جایی","Swap windows":"جابه‌جایی پنجره‌ها","Swap with the window above":"جابه‌جایی با پنجرهٔ بالا","Swap with the window below":"جابه‌جایی با پنجرهٔ پایین","Swap with the window on the left":"جابه‌جایی با پنجرهٔ چپ","Swap with the window on the right":"جابه‌جایی با پنجرهٔ راست","Switch mode":"تغییر حالت","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"تغییر حالت (چسباندن / کاشی‌کاری)","Switch modes with:":"تغییر حالت با:","Switch the layout by itself":"تغییر خودکار چیدمان","Switched off":"خاموش","System":"سامانه","Take it over":"تصاحب","Take over all":"تصاحب همه","Take the main place":"جای اصلی را می‌گیرند","Test animation":"آزمایش پویانمایی","Test on screen":"آزمایش روی صفحه","Test the snap bar":"آزمودن نوار","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"مقادیر پیش‌فرض بر پایهٔ Windows 11 هستند.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"کنش‌های چسباندن از همان فاصله‌های نوار استفاده می‌کنند و اندازهٔ پیش از چسباندن را به خاطر می‌سپارند: «بازگرداندن اندازهٔ پیش از چسباندن» آن را برمی‌گرداند.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"این برنامه‌ها هرگز چیده نمی‌شوند و جای خودشان را نگه می‌دارند. گفتگوها همیشه شناورند.","Thirds":"یک‌سوم‌ها","Three columns":"سه ستون","Thumbnail width":"پهنای تصاویر کوچک","Tiling":"کاشی‌کاری","Tip":"نکته","Top / bottom":"بالا / پایین","Top edge":"لبهٔ بالا","Top edge: full screen":"لبهٔ بالا: تمام‌صفحه","Top edge: maximize":"لبهٔ بالا: بیشینه","Top edge: top half":"لبهٔ بالا: نیمهٔ بالا","Top half":"نیمهٔ بالا","Trigger distance from the top edge":"فاصلهٔ فعال‌سازی از لبهٔ بالا","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"اگر قاب خود KDE را ترجیح می‌دهید این را خاموش کنید – سپس پیش‌نمایش لبه‌های صفحه را در بالا خاموش کنید.","Two thirds":"دو سوم","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"دو پنجره جایشان را عوض می‌کنند – یکی را روی دیگری رها کنید یا از کلیدها استفاده کنید.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"دو پنجره جایشان را عوض می‌کنند: یکی را روی دیگری رها کنید، یا با کلید.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"استفاده از میان‌برهای صفحه‌کلید","Use screen edges":"استفاده از لبه‌های صفحه","Use the system accent color":"استفاده از رنگ تأکیدی سامانه","Use the window magnet":"استفاده از آهنربای پنجره","Usual combinations":"ترکیب‌های رایج","Version":"نسخه","Wanted for: %1":"مورد نیاز برای: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"وقتی پنجره‌ای باز، بسته یا جابه‌جا می‌شود، بقیه به‌جای پریدن نرم حرکت می‌کنند.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"وقتی اندازهٔ پنجره‌ای را تغییر می‌دهید، پنجره‌هایی که به آن چسبیده‌اند لبهٔ مشترک را همراه آن جابه‌جا می‌کنند – نه هم‌پوشانی، نه فاصله.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"هنگام تغییر اندازه، پنجره‌هایی که همراه نمی‌شوند شفاف نمایش داده می‌شوند.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"هنگام جابه‌جایی یا تغییر اندازهٔ پنجره، لبه‌هایش به پنجره‌های نزدیک و لبه‌های صفحه می‌چسبند.","Width":"پهنا","Window":"پنجره","Window magnet":"آهنربای پنجره","Window magnet on/off":"روشن/خاموش کردن آهنربای پنجره","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"پنجره‌های روی هم لبه‌های چپ و راست خود را کنار هم نگه می‌دارند و پنجره‌های کنار هم لبه‌های بالا و پایین را.","Windows glide to their place":"پنجره‌ها نرم سر جایشان می‌لغزند","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"پنجره‌ها به یکدیگر و به لبه‌های صفحه می‌چسبند.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"پنجره‌ها به‌جای تماس، در «فاصلهٔ بین پنجره‌ها» از صفحهٔ عمومی می‌ایستند.","Yes":"بله","Your own combination":"ترکیب دلخواه شما","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"چیدمان‌های شما و ترتیبشان از بین می‌رود.","Zone %1":"ناحیهٔ %1","for KWin · v%1":"برای KWin · نسخه %1","windows:":"پنجره:","“%1” will be removed.":"«%1» حذف خواهد شد.","…drag it onto window B…":"…آن را روی پنجرهٔ B بکشید…","…in every direction":"…در هر جهت","…let go: they trade places":"…رها کنید: جایشان عوض می‌شود","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…همسایه‌ها با آن بزرگ و کوچک می‌شوند","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ آماده – برای باز شدن ویرایشگر تنظیمات تأیید را بزنید."},"fi":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (kopio)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 on käytössä kohteella ”%2”.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1/%2 aluetta","0 = all in one row":"0 = kaikki samalla rivillä","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Tila 1</b><br/>Kiinnityspalkki ja näytön reunat","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Tila 2</b><br/>Automaattinen ruudutus","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Yksinäinen ikkuna käyttää koko näytön, vaikka marginaali on asetettu.","A new window joins":"Uusi ikkuna liittyy","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Lyhyt työntö antaa puolikkaan tai neljänneksen. Pidä ikkunaa reunassa hieman pidempään, niin se kasvaa seuraavaan ikkunaan asti – esikatselu näyttää sen.","A single window":"Yksittäinen ikkuna","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Ikkuna pysähtyy toisen reunaan, vaikka liikuttaisit sitä nopeasti. Ravista hiirtä tai jatka työntämistä hetki irrottaaksesi. 0 = ikkunat saavat mennä vapaasti päällekkäin.","About & Help":"Tietoja ja ohje","Accent color":"Korostusväri","Active":"Käytössä","Active mode":"Aktiivinen tila","Active width along the top edge":"Aktiivinen leveys yläreunassa","Add an open application":"Lisää avoin sovellus","Add rule":"Lisää sääntö","All window features in one system.":"Kaikki ikkunatoiminnot yhdessä järjestelmässä.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Muuttuu myös, kun muutat pääikkunan kokoa käsin.","Also while resizing":"Myös kokoa muutettaessa","Always floating":"Aina kelluvat","Animation":"Animaatio","Appearance":"Ulkoasu","Apply":"Käytä","Arrange windows":"Järjestä ikkunat","Arrange windows automatically":"Järjestä ikkunat automaattisesti","Author":"Tekijä","Automatic tiling":"Automaattinen ruudutus","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Automaattinen ruudutus on pois päältä – vain tila 1 toimii, eikä tilan pikanäppäin tee mitään.","Automatic tiling off":"Automaattinen ruudutus pois","Automatic tiling on":"Automaattinen ruudutus päällä","Automatic tiling on/off":"Automaattinen ruudutus päälle/pois","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Automaattinen ruudutus, ikkunoiden vaihto, pikanäppäimet ja magneetti kelluville ikkunoille.","Background opacity":"Taustan peittävyys","Behavior & Animation":"Toiminta ja animaatio","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Alareuna: alapuolisko","Bouncy":"Joustava","Buy me a coffee":"Tarjoa minulle kahvi","Cancel":"Peru","Center focus":"Keskikohdistus","Center the window":"Keskitä ikkuna","Change":"Muuta","Change key":"Vaihda näppäin","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Näppäimen voit vaihtaa asetuseditorissa. Molemmat tilat tarvitsevat automaattisen ruudutuksen ja palkin tai näytön reunat.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Muuta niitä Pikanäppäimet-sivulla. Automaattisessa ruudutuksessa ikkunat vaihtavat myös paikkaa järjestyksessä.","Choose…":"Valitse…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Valitse alue napsauttamalla · jaa kaksoisnapsautuksella · vedä jakajia","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Napsauta tai paina %1 vaihtaaksesi tilaa.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Napsauta, sitten OK – asetuseditori avautuu.","Close":"Sulje","Close by, the edges stick together":"Lähellä reunat tarttuvat toisiinsa","Color scheme":"Väriteema","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Palkin värit, koko ja muoto.","Columns":"Sarakkeet","Corner radius":"Kulmien pyöristys","Corner size":"Kulman koko","Corner: a quarter":"Kulma: neljännes","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Kulmat: neljännes näytöstä","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + näppäin (oletus)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + numeronäppäimistö","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Vaihto+Alt + näppäin","Custom color":"Oma väri","Custom layout %1":"Oma asettelu %1","Dark":"Tumma","Delay before hiding":"Viive ennen piilottamista","Delay before showing":"Viive ennen näyttämistä","Delete":"Poista","Delete layout?":"Poistetaanko asettelu?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Etäisyys, jolla kahva ilmestyy","Distance before the bar hides again":"Etäisyys, jonka jälkeen palkki piiloutuu","Distance to the edge":"Etäisyys reunasta","Donate with PayPal":"Lahjoita PayPalilla","Drag a shared edge…":"Vedä yhteistä reunaa…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Vedä ikkuna reunaa vasten…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Vedä ikkuna toisen päälle vaihtaaksesi ne. Palkille tai näytön reunalle pudotettuna se kelluu vapaasti; ”Anna ikkunan kellua” tuo sen takaisin. Välit tulevat Yleiset-sivulta.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Vedä ikkuna toisen keskelle – esikatselu näyttää kaksi nuolta – ja päästä irti. Automaattisessa ruudutuksessa riittää mikä tahansa kohta toisen ikkunan päällä.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Vedä ikkuna näytön yläreunaan ja pudota se alueelle.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Muuta järjestystä palkissa vetämällä kortteja. Muokkaa korttia kaksoisnapsauttamalla.","Drop a window onto another one":"Pudota ikkuna toisen päälle","Drop the window onto a zone":"Pudota ikkuna alueelle","Duplicate":"Monista","Duration":"Kesto","Dwindle":"Sisäänpäin kiertyvä","Dynamic":"Dynaaminen","Edges and corners":"Reunat ja kulmat","Edit":"Muokkaa","Edit layout":"Muokkaa asettelua","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Jokaisen toiminnon voi kytkeä päälle ja pois erikseen.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Jokainen Asettelut-sivulla tekemäsi asettelu osaa myös järjestää ikkunoita – se näkyy yllä. Ikkuna 1 saa alueen 1 ja niin edelleen; ylimääräiset jakavat viimeisen alueen. Jos ikkunoita on vähemmän kuin alueita, käytetään asettelua ”Pää ja pino”, jotta aukkoja ei jää.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Jokainen ikkuna löytää paikkansa itse, kuten ruudutetussa ikkunanhallinnassa.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Jokainen ikkuna löytää paikkansa näytöltä itse. Uudet ikkunat liittyvät mukaan, suljetut jättävät tilaa muille.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Esimerkki: kaksi ikkunaa rinnakkain, kolmesta alkaen pää ja pino, viidestä alkaen ruudukko. Ilman sopivaa sääntöä käytetään yllä valittua asettelua.","Fade in and out":"Häivytys sisään ja ulos","Fade the other windows":"Himmennä muut ikkunat","Features":"Ominaisuudet","Feel":"Tuntuma","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Sovita jo kiinnitettyjen ikkunoiden ympärille","Fits the way you work.":"Sopii tapaasi työskennellä.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Anna ikkunan kellua (poistu ruudutuksesta)","Four quarters":"Neljä neljännestä","From":"Alkaen","Fullscreen":"Koko näyttö","Gap between windows":"Ikkunoiden väli","Gap to the screen edge":"Väli näytön reunaan","General":"Yleiset","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Antaa jokaiselle toiminnolle taas valitun mallin näppäimen ja poistaa näppäimet, joita mallissa ei ole.","Good to know":"Hyvä tietää","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Tartu ikkunaan otsikkopalkista ja vedä se ylös. Palkki liukuu alas; pudota ikkuna alueelle, niin se täyttää juuri sen kohdan. Kun vedät sen taas pois, se saa entisen kokonsa takaisin.","Grab window A…":"Tartu ikkunaan A…","Grid":"Ruudukko","Halves":"Puolikkaat","Hiding":"Piilottaminen","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Pidä reunassa täyttääksesi vapaan tilan","Hold time":"Pitoaika","Hold to fill":"Pidä täyttääksesi","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Kuinka lähelle reunan on tultava ennen kuin se napsahtaa paikalleen.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Kuinka lähelle reunaa osoittimen on tultava.","How far the bar slides down":"Kuinka alas palkki liukuu","How it works":"Näin se toimii","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Kuinka kauan ikkunan on oltava reunaa vasten – pieni tönäisy. 0 = heti.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Kuinka kauan ikkunan on oltava reunassa ennen kuin se kasvaa.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Kuinka monta ikkunaa jakaa pääalueen (asettelu ”Pää ja pino”).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Jos alhaalla on jo ikkuna, yläreuna antaa yläpuoliskon suurentamisen sijaan. Myös puolikkaat ja neljännekset jättävät kiinnitetyt ikkunat näkyviin.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Jos pidät KSnapUnitysta, voit tukea sen kehitystä – kiitos!","In bar":"Palkissa","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Kiinnityspalkista ja näytön reunoista riippumaton.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Kiinnityspalkista riippumaton. Jokaisen reunan voi kytkeä erikseen.","Information":"Tiedot","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Intuitiivinen, luonteva ikkunoiden käytös.","Join at the end":"Menevät loppuun","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K niin kuin KWin · Snap niin kuin fiksumpi kiinnitys · Unity niin kuin kaikki yhdessä järjestelmässä","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE:llä on omat näytön reunan toiminnot ja oma ikkunoiden kiinnitys. Jos sama ominaisuus on täällä päällä, poista KDE:n oma käytöstä: Järjestelmäasetukset → Ikkunanhallinta → Näytön reunat sekä Ikkunoiden toiminta → Siirtäminen.","KDE's own edge tiling":"KDE:n oma reunalaatoitus","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"KDE:n oma suurennus ja ruudutus reunoilla – ääriviivoineen – on tauolla KSnapUnityn toimiessa, jotta näkyy vain yksi esikatselu. KDE-asetuksesi eivät muutu: kytke tämä pois, poista KSnapUnity käytöstä tai poista se, niin KDE:n oma toiminta palaa.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"KDE:n omat näytön reunan toiminnot ovat yhä päällä, joten kaksi apuria reagoi samaan vetoon. Poista ”Suurenna” ja ”Laattoja” käytöstä kohdassa Järjestelmäasetukset → Ikkunanhallinta → Näytön reunat.","KDE's own window snapping":"KDE:n oma ikkunoiden kiinnitys","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE:n oma ikkunoiden kiinnitys on myös päällä. Yhtenäisen tuntuman saat asettamalla sen alueet arvoon ”Ei mitään” kohdassa Järjestelmäasetukset → Ikkunanhallinta → Ikkunoiden toiminta → Siirtäminen.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"KDE:n pikanäppäinpalvelu ei vastannut. Voit silti asettaa näppäimet kohdassa Järjestelmäasetukset → Pikanäppäimet → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – asetuseditori","Keep stacked windows in line":"Pidä pinotut ikkunat linjassa","Keep the gap between windows":"Säilytä ikkunoiden väli","Keep them":"Pidä ne","Key scheme":"Näppäinmalli","Keyboard shortcuts":"Pikanäppäimet","Keys":"Näppäimet","Keys already in use":"Jo käytössä olevat näppäimet","Layout":"Asettelu","Layout by number of windows":"Asettelu ikkunoiden määrän mukaan","Layouts":"Asettelut","Layouts per row":"Asetteluja riviä kohden","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Vasen ja oikea reuna: puolet näytöstä","Left edge: left half":"Vasen reuna: vasen puolisko","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Alle 100 % pitää yksinäisen ikkunan keskellä – hieno leveillä näytöillä.","License":"Lisenssi","Light":"Vaalea","Linear":"Lineaarinen","Live preview":"Esikatselu livenä","Load template…":"Lataa malli…","Magnet":"Magneetti","Main + stack":"Pää + pino","Main and stack":"Pää ja pino","Main area bigger":"Suurempi pääalue","Main area on the right":"Pääalue oikealla","Main area smaller":"Pienempi pääalue","Main in the middle":"Pää keskellä","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Pääkytkin vetämiselle ja näppäimille.","Main window":"Pääikkuna","Main windows":"Pääikkunat","Main windows: %1":"Pääikkunoita: %1","Make it the main window":"Tee pääikkunaksi","Maximize":"Suurenna","Maximize or restore":"Suurenna tai palauta","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + näppäin (KDE-tyyli)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + näppäin","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Vaihto + näppäin","Minimize":"Pienennä","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Peilaa asettelun: pääikkuna oikealla, muut vasemmalla.","Mode":"Tila","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Tila 1 – kiinnityspalkki ja näytön reunat","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Tila 2 – automaattinen ruudutus","Modes":"Tilat","More ways":"Lisää tapoja","Motion curve":"Liikekäyrä","Move a window towards others…":"Siirrä ikkunaa muita kohti…","Move the window one place back":"Siirrä ikkunaa paikka taaksepäin","Move the window one place on":"Siirrä ikkunaa paikka eteenpäin","Name:":"Nimi:","New layout":"Uusi asettelu","New windows":"Uudet ikkunat","Next tiling layout":"Seuraava ruudutusasettelu","Next to the active window":"Aktiivisen ikkunan viereen","No key":"Ei näppäintä","No other window open":"Muita ikkunoita ei ole auki","No outer margin":"Ei ulkomarginaalia","No shortcuts":"Ei pikanäppäimiä","None":"Ei mitään","None yet.":"Ei vielä yhtään.","Off":"Pois","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Pois = tila 1, päällä = tila 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Pois: neutraali kehys – vain päällä oleville esikatseluille.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Pois: näppäimet pysyvät määritettyinä mutta eivät tee mitään.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Pois: ikkunat jäävät sinne, minne ne laitat. Muut toiminnot toimivat silti.","One at a time":"Yksi kerrallaan","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Yksi sulkeutuu – muut täyttävät aukon","One main window less":"Yksi pääikkuna vähemmän","One more main window":"Yksi pääikkuna lisää","One window":"Yksi ikkuna","Only one mode is switched on.":"Vain yksi tila on päällä.","Open settings editor":"Avaa asetuseditori","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Avaa sovellus ensin ja valitse se sitten tästä.","Open the layout builder":"Avaa asettelujen rakentaja","Own layouts":"Omat asettelut","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Osa kustakin sivusta, joka lasketaan kulmaksi.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Keskeytä KDE:n reunalaatoitus ja sen esikatselu","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Keskeytä KDE:n kiinnitysalueet, kun magneetti on päällä","Preview":"Esikatselu","Previews":"Esikatselut","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Paina ikkuna näytön reunaa tai kulmaa vasten, niin se täyttää sen osan. Toimii kiinnityspalkin kanssa tai ilman.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Paina ikkuna reunaa tai kulmaa vasten: suurenna, puolikkaat, neljännekset.","Push delay":"Painalluksen viive","Quarters":"Neljännekset","Quick":"Nopea","Quick settings":"Pika-asetukset","Recommended values":"Suositellut arvot","Remove":"Poista","Remove rule":"Poista sääntö","Remove zone":"Poista alue","Reset all":"Palauta kaikki","Reset all keys":"Palauta kaikki näppäimet","Reset to default":"Palauta oletus","Resistance against overlapping":"Vastus päällekkäisyydelle","Resize touching windows together":"Muuta toisiinsa koskevien ikkunoiden kokoa yhdessä","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Myös koon muutos kiinnittyy – tässä täyteen korkeuteen","Restore":"Palauta","Restore default layouts":"Palauta oletusasettelut","Restore default layouts?":"Palautetaanko oletusasettelut?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Palauta alkuperäinen koko, kun ikkuna vedetään pois","Restore the size before snapping":"Palauta kiinnitystä edeltävä koko","Rows":"Rivit","Save":"Tallenna","Screen edges":"Näytön reunat","Screen edges on/off":"Näytön reunat päälle/pois","Screen edges preview":"Näytön reunojen esikatselu","Set":"Aseta","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Asettaa kaikkien toimintojen näppäimet kerralla. Yksittäisiä näppäimiä voit yhä muuttaa alla.","Settings":"Asetukset","Settings file":"Asetustiedosto","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Ravista hiirtä nopeasti edestakaisin kokoa muuttaessasi, niin muut ikkunat palaavat takaisin. Nopea veto yhteen suuntaan ei irrota koskaan.","Shake to let go":"Ravista irrottaaksesi","Shortcuts":"Pikanäppäimet","Show a small handle first":"Näytä ensin pieni kahva","Show layout and zone names":"Näytä asettelujen ja alueiden nimet","Show previews in the accent color":"Näytä esikatselut korostusvärillä","Showing":"Näyttäminen","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Näyttää, mihin ikkuna päätyy reunassa tai kulmassa. Pois: ei esikatselua lainkaan.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Näyttää, mihin ikkuna päätyy, kun palkin alue on korostettu. Pois: ei esikatselua lainkaan.","Sidebar + grid":"Sivupalkki + ruudukko","Single zone":"Yksi alue","Six tiles":"Kuusi ruutua","Size & shape":"Koko ja muoto","Size of the main area":"Pääalueen koko","Slide-in duration":"Sisääntulon kesto","Slide-out duration":"Poistumisen kesto","Smart arranging and detection.":"Älykäs järjestely ja tunnistus.","Smart fill":"Älykäs täyttö","Smooth (default)":"Pehmeä (oletus)","Snap bar":"Kiinnityspalkki","Snap bar and screen edges":"Kiinnityspalkki ja näytön reunat","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Palkki ja reunat ovat pois päältä – vain tila 2 toimii, eikä tilan pikanäppäin tee mitään.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Kiinnityspalkki ja näytön reunat häiritsevät automaattista ruudutusta. Siksi ne toimivat kahtena tilana – vaihda pikanäppäimellä tai tästä.","Snap bar colors:":"Palkin värit:","Snap bar on/off":"Kiinnityspalkki päälle/pois","Snap bar preview":"Kiinnityspalkin esikatselu","Snap bar size":"Palkin koko","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Kiinnityspalkki, näytön reunat, ikkunamagneetti, pikanäppäimet ja ikkunoiden vaihto.","Snap distance":"Tarttumisetäisyys","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Kiinnitä jakajat (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Kiinnitysasettelut ja automaattinen ruudutus.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Kiinnitä aktiivinen ikkuna näppäinyhdistelmillä.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Kiinnitä aktiivinen ikkuna näppäimistöllä. Nämä ovat tavallisia KDE:n yleisiä pikanäppäimiä – löydät ne myös kohdasta Järjestelmäasetukset → Pikanäppäimet → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Kiinnitä alapuoliskoon","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Kiinnitä vasempaan alaneljännekseen","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Kiinnitä oikeaan alaneljännekseen","Snap to the center third":"Kiinnitä keskimmäiseen kolmannekseen","Snap to the left half":"Kiinnitä vasempaan puoliskoon","Snap to the left third":"Kiinnitä vasempaan kolmannekseen","Snap to the left two thirds":"Kiinnitä vasempaan kahteen kolmannekseen","Snap to the right half":"Kiinnitä oikeaan puoliskoon","Snap to the right third":"Kiinnitä oikeaan kolmannekseen","Snap to the right two thirds":"Kiinnitä oikeaan kahteen kolmannekseen","Snap to the top half":"Kiinnitä yläpuoliskoon","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Kiinnitä vasempaan yläneljännekseen","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Kiinnitä oikeaan yläneljännekseen","Snapping":"Kiinnitys","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Kiinnitys ja automaattinen ruudutus toimivat kahtena tilana – yksi pikanäppäin vaihtaa niiden välillä.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Näin ikkunaa vetää vain yksi magneetti. KDE-asetuksesi eivät muutu: kytke tämä pois, poista KSnapUnity käytöstä tai poista se, niin KDE:n kiinnitys palaa.","Soft":"Lempeä","Spacing":"Välit","Spiral":"Spiraali","Split side by side":"Jaa vierekkäin","Split top and bottom":"Jaa ylös ja alas","Stack + main":"Pino + pää","Stick to other windows":"Tartu muihin ikkunoihin","Stick to the screen edges":"Tartu näytön reunoihin","Sticky edges":"Tarttuvat reunat","Support KSnapUnity":"Tue KSnapUnitya","Swap":"Vaihda","Swap windows":"Vaihda ikkunoiden paikkaa","Swap with the window above":"Vaihda yläpuolisen ikkunan kanssa","Swap with the window below":"Vaihda alapuolisen ikkunan kanssa","Swap with the window on the left":"Vaihda vasemmanpuoleisen ikkunan kanssa","Swap with the window on the right":"Vaihda oikeanpuoleisen ikkunan kanssa","Switch mode":"Vaihda tilaa","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Vaihda tilaa (kiinnitys / ruudutus)","Switch modes with:":"Vaihda tilaa näppäimellä:","Switch the layout by itself":"Vaihda asettelua itsestään","Switched off":"Pois päältä","System":"Järjestelmä","Take it over":"Ota käyttöön","Take over all":"Ota kaikki käyttöön","Take the main place":"Ottavat pääpaikan","Test animation":"Kokeile animaatiota","Test on screen":"Kokeile näytöllä","Test the snap bar":"Kokeile kiinnityspalkkia","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Oletusarvot perustuvat Windows 11:een.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Kiinnitystoiminnot käyttävät samoja välejä kuin palkki ja muistavat kiinnitystä edeltävän koon: ”Palauta kiinnitystä edeltävä koko” tuo sen takaisin.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Näitä sovelluksia ei koskaan järjestellä ja ne pitävät oman paikkansa. Valintaikkunat kelluvat aina.","Thirds":"Kolmannekset","Three columns":"Kolme saraketta","Thumbnail width":"Pikkukuvien leveys","Tiling":"Ruudutus","Tip":"Vinkki","Top / bottom":"Ylä / ala","Top edge":"Yläreuna","Top edge: full screen":"Yläreuna: koko näyttö","Top edge: maximize":"Yläreuna: suurenna","Top edge: top half":"Yläreuna: yläpuolisko","Top half":"Yläpuolisko","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Aktivointietäisyys yläreunasta","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Kytke tämä pois, jos pidät enemmän KDE:n omasta ääriviivasta – kytke silloin yllä näytön reunojen esikatselu pois.","Two thirds":"Kaksi kolmasosaa","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Kaksi ikkunaa vaihtaa paikkaa – pudota toinen toisen päälle tai käytä näppäimiä.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Kaksi ikkunaa vaihtaa paikkaa: pudota toinen toisen päälle tai näppäimellä.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Käytä pikanäppäimiä","Use screen edges":"Käytä näytön reunoja","Use the system accent color":"Käytä järjestelmän korostusväriä","Use the window magnet":"Käytä ikkunamagneettia","Usual combinations":"Tavalliset yhdistelmät","Version":"Versio","Wanted for: %1":"Haluttu toiminnolle: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Kun ikkuna avautuu, sulkeutuu tai vaihtaa paikkaa, muut liikkuvat pehmeästi hyppimättä.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Kun muutat ikkunan kokoa, siihen koskevat ikkunat siirtävät yhteistä reunaa mukana – mikään ei mene päällekkäin eikä rakoa synny.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Koon muuttamisen aikana ikkunat, jotka eivät seuraa, näytetään läpinäkyvinä.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Kun siirrät ikkunaa tai muutat sen kokoa, sen reunat tarttuvat lähellä oleviin ikkunoihin ja näytön reunoihin.","Width":"Leveys","Window":"Ikkuna","Window magnet":"Ikkunamagneetti","Window magnet on/off":"Ikkunamagneetti päälle/pois","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Päällekkäiset ikkunat pitävät vasemman ja oikean reunansa yhdessä, vierekkäiset ylä- ja alareunansa.","Windows glide to their place":"Ikkunat liukuvat paikalleen","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Ikkunat tarttuvat toisiinsa ja näytön reunoihin.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Ikkunat pysähtyvät Yleiset-sivun ”Ikkunoiden väli” -asetukseen koskettamisen sijaan.","Yes":"Kyllä","Your own combination":"Oma yhdistelmä","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Omat asettelusi ja niiden järjestys menetetään.","Zone %1":"Alue %1","for KWin · v%1":"KWinille · v%1","windows:":"ikkunasta:","“%1” will be removed.":"”%1” poistetaan.","…drag it onto window B…":"…vedä se ikkunan B päälle…","…in every direction":"…joka suuntaan","…let go: they trade places":"…päästä irti: ne vaihtavat paikkaa","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…naapurit kasvavat ja kutistuvat mukana","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Valmis – napsauta OK avataksesi asetuseditorin."},"fr":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (copie)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 est utilisé par « %2 ».","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 zones sur %2","0 = all in one row":"0 = toutes sur une ligne","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Barre d’ancrage et bords de l’écran","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Disposition automatique","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Une fenêtre seule occupe tout l’écran, même si une marge est définie.","A new window joins":"Une nouvelle fenêtre arrive","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Une courte poussée donne la moitié ou le quart. Gardez la fenêtre un peu plus longtemps au bord et elle s'agrandit jusqu'à la fenêtre suivante – l'aperçu le montre.","A single window":"Une seule fenêtre","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Une fenêtre s’arrête au bord d’une autre, même si vous la déplacez vite. Secouez la souris ou continuez à pousser un instant pour la libérer. 0 = les fenêtres peuvent se chevaucher librement.","About & Help":"À propos & aide","Accent color":"Couleur d’accentuation","Active":"Actif","Active mode":"Mode actif","Active width along the top edge":"Largeur active le long du bord supérieur","Add an open application":"Ajouter une application ouverte","Add rule":"Ajouter une règle","All window features in one system.":"Toutes les fonctions de fenêtres dans un seul système.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Change aussi quand vous redimensionnez la fenêtre principale à la main.","Also while resizing":"Aussi lors du redimensionnement","Always floating":"Toujours flottantes","Appearance":"Apparence","Apply":"Appliquer","Arrange windows":"Disposer les fenêtres","Arrange windows automatically":"Disposer les fenêtres automatiquement","Author":"Auteur","Automatic tiling":"Disposition automatique","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"La disposition automatique est désactivée – seul le mode 1 fonctionne et le raccourci de mode ne fait rien.","Automatic tiling off":"Disposition automatique désactivée","Automatic tiling on":"Disposition automatique activée","Automatic tiling on/off":"Disposition automatique on/off","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Disposition automatique, échange de fenêtres, raccourcis et l’aimant pour les fenêtres flottantes.","Background opacity":"Opacité de l’arrière-plan","Behavior & Animation":"Comportement & animation","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Bord inférieur : moitié basse","Bouncy":"Rebondissante","Buy me a coffee":"Offrez-moi un café","Cancel":"Annuler","Center focus":"Focus central","Center the window":"Centrer la fenêtre","Change":"Modifier","Change key":"Changer la touche","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"La touche se change dans l’éditeur de réglages. Les deux modes demandent la disposition automatique et la barre ou les bords de l’écran.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Modifiez-les sur la page Raccourcis clavier. Avec la disposition automatique, les fenêtres échangent aussi leur place dans l’ordre.","Choose…":"Choisir…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Cliquez sur une zone pour la sélectionner · double-clic pour la diviser · faites glisser les séparateurs","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Cliquez ou appuyez sur %1 pour changer de mode.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Cliquez, puis OK – l’éditeur de réglages s’ouvre.","Close":"Fermer","Close by, the edges stick together":"De près, les bords se collent","Color scheme":"Jeu de couleurs","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Couleurs, taille et forme de la barre d’ancrage.","Columns":"Colonnes","Corner radius":"Rayon des coins","Corner size":"Taille des coins","Corner: a quarter":"Coin : un quart","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Coins : quart de l’écran","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + touche (par défaut)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + pavé numérique","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Maj+Alt + touche","Custom color":"Couleur personnalisée","Custom layout %1":"Disposition personnalisée %1","Dark":"Sombre","Delay before hiding":"Délai avant le masquage","Delay before showing":"Délai avant l’affichage","Delete":"Supprimer","Delete layout?":"Supprimer la disposition ?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Distance à laquelle la poignée apparaît","Distance before the bar hides again":"Distance avant que la barre ne disparaisse","Distance to the edge":"Distance au bord","Donate with PayPal":"Faire un don avec PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"Tirez un bord commun…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Faites glisser une fenêtre contre un bord…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Glissez une fenêtre sur une autre pour les échanger. Déposée sur la barre ou un bord de l’écran, elle flotte librement ; « Laisser flotter la fenêtre » la ramène. Les espacements viennent de la page Général.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Glissez une fenêtre au-dessus du centre d’une autre – l’aperçu montre deux flèches – et lâchez. Avec la disposition automatique, n’importe où sur l’autre fenêtre suffit.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Faites glisser une fenêtre vers le bord supérieur de l’écran et déposez-la sur une zone.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Faites glisser les cartes pour changer l’ordre dans la barre. Double-cliquez sur une carte pour la modifier.","Drop a window onto another one":"Déposer une fenêtre sur une autre","Drop the window onto a zone":"Déposez la fenêtre sur une zone","Duplicate":"Dupliquer","Duration":"Durée","Dwindle":"Spirale intérieure","Dynamic":"Dynamique","Edges and corners":"Bords et coins","Edit":"Modifier","Edit layout":"Modifier la disposition","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Chaque fonction peut être activée ou désactivée séparément.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Chaque disposition créée sur la page Dispositions peut aussi ranger les fenêtres – elle apparaît ci-dessus. La fenêtre 1 prend la zone 1, et ainsi de suite ; les fenêtres en plus partagent la dernière zone. Avec moins de fenêtres que de zones, « Principale et pile » est utilisé, pour éviter les trous.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Chaque fenêtre trouve sa place toute seule, comme dans un gestionnaire de fenêtres en mosaïque.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Chaque fenêtre trouve sa place à l’écran toute seule. Les nouvelles fenêtres s’ajoutent, celles qu’on ferme laissent la place aux autres.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Exemple : deux fenêtres côte à côte, dès trois principale et pile, dès cinq une grille. Sans règle adaptée, la disposition choisie ci-dessus s’applique.","Fade in and out":"Fondu à l’entrée et à la sortie","Fade the other windows":"Estomper les autres fenêtres","Features":"Fonctions","Feel":"Sensation","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"S’adapter aux fenêtres déjà ancrées","Fits the way you work.":"S’adapte à votre façon de travailler.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Laisser flotter la fenêtre (quitter la mosaïque)","Four quarters":"Quatre quarts","From":"À partir de","Fullscreen":"Plein écran","Gap between windows":"Écart entre les fenêtres","Gap to the screen edge":"Écart avec le bord de l’écran","General":"Général","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Redonne à chaque action la touche du schéma choisi et supprime les touches que le schéma n'a pas.","Good to know":"Bon à savoir","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Saisissez une fenêtre par sa barre de titre et faites-la glisser vers le haut. La barre descend ; déposez la fenêtre sur une zone et elle occupe exactement cet espace. Écartez-la à nouveau et elle retrouve sa taille d’origine.","Grab window A…":"Saisissez la fenêtre A…","Grid":"Grille","Halves":"Moitiés","Hiding":"Masquage","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Maintenir au bord pour remplir l'espace libre","Hold time":"Durée de maintien","Hold to fill":"Maintenir pour remplir","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"À quelle distance un bord doit arriver avant de s’accrocher.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"À quelle distance du bord le curseur doit arriver.","How far the bar slides down":"Distance de descente de la barre","How it works":"Fonctionnement","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Combien de temps la fenêtre doit rester contre le bord – une petite poussée. 0 = immédiatement.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Combien de temps la fenêtre doit rester au bord avant de s'agrandir.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Combien de fenêtres partagent la zone principale (disposition « Principale et pile »).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Si une fenêtre occupe le bas, le bord supérieur donne la moitié haute au lieu d’agrandir. Les moitiés et les quarts laissent aussi les fenêtres ancrées visibles.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Si vous aimez KSnapUnity, vous pouvez soutenir son développement – merci !","In bar":"Dans la barre","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Indépendant de la barre d’ancrage et des bords de l’écran.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Indépendant de la barre d’ancrage. Chaque bord s’active séparément.","Information":"Informations","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Un comportement des fenêtres intuitif et naturel.","Join at the end":"Se placent à la fin","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K pour KWin · Snap pour un ancrage plus malin · Unity pour tout dans un seul système","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE possède ses propres actions de bord d’écran et son propre ancrage des fenêtres. Si la même fonction est active ici, désactivez celle de KDE : Configuration du système → Gestion des fenêtres → Bords de l’écran, et Comportement des fenêtres → Déplacement.","KDE's own edge tiling":"La mosaïque de bord de KDE","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"La maximisation et la mosaïque propres à KDE sur les bords – avec leur contour – sont en pause tant que KSnapUnity fonctionne, pour qu’un seul aperçu apparaisse. Vos réglages KDE ne changent pas : désactivez ceci, désactivez ou supprimez KSnapUnity et le comportement de KDE revient.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"Les actions de bord d’écran de KDE sont encore actives : deux outils réagissent au même glissement. Désactivez « Agrandir » et « Mosaïque » dans Configuration du système → Gestion des fenêtres → Bords de l’écran.","KDE's own window snapping":"L'aimantation des fenêtres de KDE","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"L’ancrage des fenêtres de KDE est aussi actif. Pour un comportement cohérent, réglez ses zones sur « Aucune » dans Configuration du système → Gestion des fenêtres → Comportement des fenêtres → Déplacement.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Le service de raccourcis de KDE n’a pas répondu. Vous pouvez toujours définir les touches dans Configuration du système → Raccourcis → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – Éditeur de réglages","Keep stacked windows in line":"Garder les fenêtres empilées alignées","Keep the gap between windows":"Garder l’espace entre les fenêtres","Keep them":"Les garder","Key scheme":"Schéma de touches","Keyboard shortcuts":"Raccourcis clavier","Keys":"Touches","Keys already in use":"Touches déjà utilisées","Layout":"Disposition","Layout by number of windows":"Disposition selon le nombre de fenêtres","Layouts":"Dispositions","Layouts per row":"Dispositions par ligne","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Bords gauche et droit : moitié de l’écran","Left edge: left half":"Bord gauche : moitié gauche","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Sous 100 %, une fenêtre seule reste centrée – idéal sur les écrans larges.","License":"Licence","Light":"Clair","Linear":"Linéaire","Live preview":"Aperçu en direct","Load template…":"Charger un modèle…","Magnet":"Aimant","Main + stack":"Principale + pile","Main and stack":"Principale et pile","Main area bigger":"Zone principale plus grande","Main area on the right":"Zone principale à droite","Main area smaller":"Zone principale plus petite","Main in the middle":"Principale au centre","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Interrupteur principal pour le glisser et les touches.","Main window":"Fenêtre principale","Main windows":"Fenêtres principales","Main windows: %1":"Fenêtres principales : %1","Make it the main window":"En faire la fenêtre principale","Maximize":"Agrandir","Maximize or restore":"Agrandir ou restaurer","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + touche (style KDE)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + touche","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Maj + touche","Minimize":"Réduire","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Inverse la disposition : la fenêtre principale à droite, les autres à gauche.","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Mode 1 – Barre d’ancrage et bords de l’écran","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Mode 2 – Disposition automatique","More ways":"Autres façons","Motion curve":"Courbe de mouvement","Move a window towards others…":"Approchez une fenêtre des autres…","Move the window one place back":"Reculer la fenêtre d’une place","Move the window one place on":"Avancer la fenêtre d’une place","Name:":"Nom :","New layout":"Nouvelle disposition","New windows":"Nouvelles fenêtres","Next tiling layout":"Disposition suivante","Next to the active window":"À côté de la fenêtre active","No key":"Aucune touche","No other window open":"Aucune autre fenêtre ouverte","No outer margin":"Pas de marge extérieure","No shortcuts":"Aucun raccourci","None":"Aucun","None yet.":"Aucune pour l’instant.","Off":"Désactivé","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Désactivé = mode 1, activé = mode 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Désactivé : un cadre neutre – seulement pour les aperçus activés.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Désactivé : les touches restent attribuées mais ne font rien.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Désactivé : les fenêtres restent là où vous les posez. Les autres fonctions marchent dans les deux cas.","One at a time":"Une à la fois","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Une se ferme – les autres comblent le vide","One main window less":"Une fenêtre principale de moins","One more main window":"Une fenêtre principale de plus","One window":"Une fenêtre","Only one mode is switched on.":"Un seul mode est activé.","Open settings editor":"Ouvrir l’éditeur de réglages","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Ouvrez d’abord l’application, puis choisissez-la ici.","Open the layout builder":"Ouvrir le créateur de dispositions","Own layouts":"Dispositions personnelles","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Part de chaque côté qui compte comme coin.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Mettre en pause la mosaïque de KDE et son aperçu","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Mettre en pause les zones d'aimantation de KDE tant que l'aimant est actif","Preview":"Aperçu","Previews":"Aperçus","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Poussez une fenêtre contre un bord ou un coin de l’écran et elle remplit cette partie. Fonctionne avec ou sans la barre d’ancrage.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Poussez une fenêtre contre un bord ou un coin : agrandir, moitiés, quarts.","Push delay":"Délai de poussée","Quarters":"Quarts","Quick":"Rapide","Quick settings":"Réglages rapides","Recommended values":"Valeurs recommandées","Remove":"Supprimer","Remove rule":"Supprimer la règle","Remove zone":"Supprimer la zone","Reset all":"Tout réinitialiser","Reset all keys":"Réinitialiser toutes les touches","Reset to default":"Rétablir la valeur par défaut","Resistance against overlapping":"Résistance au chevauchement","Resize touching windows together":"Redimensionner ensemble les fenêtres qui se touchent","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Le redimensionnement s’aimante aussi – ici sur toute la hauteur","Restore":"Restaurer","Restore default layouts":"Restaurer les dispositions par défaut","Restore default layouts?":"Restaurer les dispositions par défaut ?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Restaurer la taille d’origine en sortant la fenêtre","Restore the size before snapping":"Restaurer la taille d’avant l’ancrage","Rows":"Lignes","Save":"Enregistrer","Screen edges":"Bords de l’écran","Screen edges on/off":"Bords de l’écran activés/désactivés","Screen edges preview":"Aperçu des bords de l'écran","Set":"Définir","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Définit les touches de toutes les actions d’un coup. Vous pouvez toujours modifier chaque touche ci-dessous.","Settings":"Paramètres","Settings file":"Fichier de configuration","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Secouez vite la souris d’avant en arrière pendant le redimensionnement et les autres fenêtres reviennent. Un geste rapide dans une seule direction ne les libère jamais.","Shake to let go":"Secouer pour détacher","Shortcuts":"Raccourcis","Show a small handle first":"Afficher d’abord une petite poignée","Show layout and zone names":"Afficher les noms des dispositions et des zones","Show previews in the accent color":"Afficher les aperçus dans la couleur d’accentuation","Showing":"Affichage","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Montre où la fenêtre arrive sur un bord ou un coin. Désactivé : aucun aperçu.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Montre où la fenêtre arrive tant qu'une zone de la barre est surlignée. Désactivé : aucun aperçu.","Sidebar + grid":"Barre latérale + grille","Single zone":"Zone unique","Six tiles":"Six tuiles","Size & shape":"Taille & forme","Size of the main area":"Taille de la zone principale","Slide-in duration":"Durée d’apparition","Slide-out duration":"Durée de disparition","Smart arranging and detection.":"Disposition et détection intelligentes.","Smart fill":"Remplissage intelligent","Smooth (default)":"Douce (par défaut)","Snap bar":"Barre d’ancrage","Snap bar and screen edges":"Barre d’ancrage et bords de l’écran","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"La barre et les bords sont désactivés – seul le mode 2 fonctionne et le raccourci de mode ne fait rien.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"La barre et les bords de l’écran gênent la disposition automatique. Ils fonctionnent donc comme deux modes – changez avec le raccourci ou ici.","Snap bar colors:":"Couleurs de la barre :","Snap bar on/off":"Barre d’ancrage activée/désactivée","Snap bar preview":"Aperçu de la barre d'ancrage","Snap bar size":"Taille de la barre","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Barre d’ancrage, bords de l’écran, aimant de fenêtres, raccourcis et échange de fenêtres.","Snap distance":"Distance d’accroche","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Aimanter les séparateurs (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Dispositions d’ancrage et disposition automatique.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Ancrez la fenêtre active avec des combinaisons de touches.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Ancrez la fenêtre active au clavier. Ce sont des raccourcis globaux KDE normaux – vous les trouvez aussi dans Configuration du système → Raccourcis → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Ancrer à la moitié basse","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Ancrer au quart bas gauche","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Ancrer au quart bas droit","Snap to the center third":"Ancrer au tiers central","Snap to the left half":"Ancrer à la moitié gauche","Snap to the left third":"Ancrer au tiers gauche","Snap to the left two thirds":"Ancrer aux deux tiers gauches","Snap to the right half":"Ancrer à la moitié droite","Snap to the right third":"Ancrer au tiers droit","Snap to the right two thirds":"Ancrer aux deux tiers droits","Snap to the top half":"Ancrer à la moitié haute","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Ancrer au quart haut gauche","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Ancrer au quart haut droit","Snapping":"Ancrage","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"L’ancrage et la disposition automatique fonctionnent comme deux modes – un raccourci passe de l’un à l’autre.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Ainsi un seul aimant tire sur une fenêtre. Vos réglages KDE ne changent pas : désactivez ceci, désactivez ou supprimez KSnapUnity et l’ancrage de KDE revient.","Soft":"Légère","Spacing":"Espacement","Spiral":"Spirale","Split side by side":"Diviser côte à côte","Split top and bottom":"Diviser en haut et en bas","Stack + main":"Pile + principale","Stick to other windows":"S’attacher aux autres fenêtres","Stick to the screen edges":"S’attacher aux bords de l’écran","Sticky edges":"Bords collants","Support KSnapUnity":"Soutenir KSnapUnity","Swap":"Échanger","Swap windows":"Échanger les fenêtres","Swap with the window above":"Échanger avec la fenêtre du dessus","Swap with the window below":"Échanger avec la fenêtre du dessous","Swap with the window on the left":"Échanger avec la fenêtre de gauche","Swap with the window on the right":"Échanger avec la fenêtre de droite","Switch mode":"Changer de mode","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Changer de mode (ancrage / mosaïque)","Switch modes with:":"Changer de mode avec :","Switch the layout by itself":"Changer de disposition tout seul","Switched off":"Désactivé","System":"Système","Take it over":"Reprendre","Take over all":"Tout reprendre","Take the main place":"Prennent la place principale","Test animation":"Tester l’animation","Test on screen":"Tester à l’écran","Test the snap bar":"Tester la barre d’ancrage","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Les valeurs par défaut s’inspirent de Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Les actions d’ancrage utilisent les mêmes espaces que la barre et mémorisent la taille d’avant l’ancrage : « Restaurer la taille d’avant l’ancrage » la rétablit.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Ces applications ne sont jamais rangées et gardent leur place. Les boîtes de dialogue flottent toujours.","Thirds":"Tiers","Three columns":"Trois colonnes","Thumbnail width":"Largeur des miniatures","Tiling":"Mosaïque","Tip":"Astuce","Top / bottom":"Haut / bas","Top edge":"Bord supérieur","Top edge: full screen":"Bord haut : plein écran","Top edge: maximize":"Bord haut : maximiser","Top edge: top half":"Bord haut : moitié haute","Top half":"Moitié haute","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Distance de déclenchement depuis le bord supérieur","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Désactivez ceci si vous préférez le contour de KDE – désactivez alors l'aperçu des bords ci-dessus.","Two thirds":"Deux tiers","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Deux fenêtres échangent leurs places – déposez l’une sur l’autre ou utilisez les touches.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Deux fenêtres échangent leurs places : déposez l’une sur l’autre, ou par touche.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Utiliser les raccourcis clavier","Use screen edges":"Utiliser les bords de l’écran","Use the system accent color":"Utiliser la couleur d’accentuation du système","Use the window magnet":"Utiliser l’aimant de fenêtres","Usual combinations":"Combinaisons usuelles","Wanted for: %1":"Voulu pour : %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Quand une fenêtre s’ouvre, se ferme ou s’échange, les autres bougent en douceur au lieu de sauter.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Quand vous redimensionnez une fenêtre, celles qui la touchent déplacent le bord commun avec elle – rien ne se chevauche, aucun espace ne se crée.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Pendant le redimensionnement, les fenêtres qui ne suivent pas sont affichées en transparence.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Pendant que vous déplacez ou redimensionnez une fenêtre, ses bords s’attachent aux fenêtres proches et aux bords de l’écran.","Width":"Largeur","Window":"Fenêtre","Window magnet":"Aimant de fenêtres","Window magnet on/off":"Aimant de fenêtres activé/désactivé","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Les fenêtres l'une au-dessus de l'autre gardent leurs bords gauche et droit ensemble, les fenêtres côte à côte leurs bords haut et bas.","Windows glide to their place":"Les fenêtres glissent à leur place","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Les fenêtres s’attachent entre elles et aux bords de l’écran.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Les fenêtres s’arrêtent à l’« Écart entre les fenêtres » de la page Général au lieu de se toucher.","Yes":"Oui","Your own combination":"Votre propre combinaison","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Vos propres dispositions et leur ordre seront perdus.","for KWin · v%1":"pour KWin · v%1","windows:":"fenêtres :","“%1” will be removed.":"« %1 » sera supprimée.","…drag it onto window B…":"…faites-la glisser sur la fenêtre B…","…in every direction":"…dans toutes les directions","…let go: they trade places":"…lâchez : elles échangent leurs places","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…les voisines grandissent et rétrécissent avec lui","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Prêt – cliquez sur OK pour ouvrir l’éditeur de réglages."},"ga":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (cóip)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"Tá %1 in úsáid ag „%2”.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 as %2 crios","0 = all in one row":"0 = gach ceann in aon ró amháin","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Mód 1</b><br/>Barra greamaithe agus imill an scáileáin","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Mód 2</b><br/>Tíliú uathoibríoch","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Úsáideann fuinneog aonair an scáileán ar fad, fiú má tá imeall socraithe.","A new window joins":"Tagann fuinneog nua isteach","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Tugann brú gearr an leath nó an ceathrú. Coinnigh an fhuinneog ag an imeall beagán níos faide agus fásann sí go dtí an chéad fhuinneog eile – taispeánann an réamhamharc é.","A single window":"Fuinneog aonair","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Stopann fuinneog ag imeall fuinneoige eile, fiú má bhogann tú go tapa í. Croith an luch nó lean ort ag brú ar feadh nóiméid chun í a scaoileadh. 0 = is féidir le fuinneoga forluí go saor.","About & Help":"Maidir leis agus cabhair","Accent color":"Dath aibhsithe","Active":"Gníomhach","Active mode":"Mód gníomhach","Active width along the top edge":"Leithead gníomhach feadh an imill uachtaraigh","Add an open application":"Cuir feidhmchlár oscailte leis","Add rule":"Cuir riail leis","All window features in one system.":"Gach gné fuinneoige in aon chóras amháin.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Athraíonn sé freisin nuair a athraíonn tú méid na príomhfhuinneoige de láimh.","Also while resizing":"Agus méid á athrú freisin","Always floating":"Ar snámh i gcónaí","Animation":"Beochan","Appearance":"Cuma","Apply":"Cuir i bhfeidhm","Arrange windows":"Fuinneoga a eagrú","Arrange windows automatically":"Eagraigh fuinneoga go huathoibríoch","Author":"Údar","Automatic tiling":"Tíliú uathoibríoch","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Tá an tíliú uathoibríoch múchta – níl ach mód 1 ag rith agus ní dhéanann aicearra an mhóid faic.","Automatic tiling off":"Tíliú uathoibríoch múchta","Automatic tiling on":"Tíliú uathoibríoch ar siúl","Automatic tiling on/off":"Tíliú uathoibríoch air/as","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Tíliú uathoibríoch, malartú fuinneog, aicearraí agus an maighnéad d’fhuinneoga ar snámh.","Background opacity":"Teimhneacht an chúlra","Behavior & Animation":"Iompar agus beochan","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Imeall íochtarach: an leath íochtarach","Bouncy":"Preabach","Buy me a coffee":"Ceannaigh caife dom","Cancel":"Cealaigh","Center focus":"Fócas sa lár","Center the window":"Láraigh an fhuinneog","Change":"Athraigh","Change key":"Athraigh eochair","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Athraigh an eochair san eagarthóir socruithe. Teastaíonn tíliú uathoibríoch agus an barra nó imill an scáileáin ón dá mhód.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Athraigh iad ar an leathanach Aicearraí méarchláir. Le tíliú uathoibríoch, malartaíonn na fuinneoga a n-áit san ord freisin.","Choose…":"Roghnaigh…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Cliceáil ar chrios chun é a roghnú · cliceáil faoi dhó chun é a roinnt · tarraing na deighilteoirí","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Cliceáil nó brúigh %1 chun an mód a athrú.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Cliceáil, ansin OK – osclaíonn an t-eagarthóir socruithe.","Close":"Dún","Close by, the edges stick together":"In aice láimhe, greamaíonn na himill dá chéile","Color scheme":"Scéim dathanna","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Dathanna, méid agus cruth an bharra.","Columns":"Colúin","Corner radius":"Ga na gcúinní","Corner size":"Méid na gcúinní","Corner: a quarter":"Cúinne: ceathrú","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Cúinní: ceathrú den scáileán","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + eochair (réamhshocrú)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + eochaircheap uimhriúil","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + eochair","Custom color":"Dath saincheaptha","Custom layout %1":"Leagan amach saincheaptha %1","Dark":"Dorcha","Delay before hiding":"Moill roimh fholú","Delay before showing":"Moill roimh thaispeáint","Delete":"Scrios","Delete layout?":"Scrios an leagan amach?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Fad ag a dtaispeántar an hanla","Distance before the bar hides again":"Fad sula bhfolaítear an barra arís","Distance to the edge":"Fad ón imeall","Donate with PayPal":"Deonaigh le PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"Tarraing imeall comhroinnte…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Tarraing fuinneog in aghaidh imill…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Tarraing fuinneog ar cheann eile chun iad a mhalartú. Má scaoiltear ar an mbarra nó ar imeall í, bíonn sí ar snámh; tugann „Lig don fhuinneog snámh“ ar ais í. Tagann na bearnaí ón leathanach Ginearálta.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Tarraing fuinneog thar lár fuinneoige eile – taispeánann an réamhamharc dhá shaighead – agus scaoil. Le tíliú uathoibríoch is leor áit ar bith os cionn na fuinneoige eile.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Tarraing fuinneog go dtí barr an scáileáin agus scaoil ar chrios í.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Tarraing na cártaí chun an t-ord sa bharra a athrú. Cliceáil faoi dhó ar chárta chun é a chur in eagar.","Drop a window onto another one":"Scaoil fuinneog ar fhuinneog eile","Drop the window onto a zone":"Scaoil an fhuinneog ar chrios","Duplicate":"Dúblaigh","Duration":"Fad","Dwindle":"Bíseach isteach","Dynamic":"Dinimiciúil","Edges and corners":"Imill agus cúinní","Edit":"Cuir in eagar","Edit layout":"Cuir leagan amach in eagar","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Is féidir gach gné a chasadh air agus as ar leith.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Is féidir le gach leagan amach a thógann tú ar an leathanach Leagain amach fuinneoga a shocrú freisin – feictear thuas é. Faigheann fuinneog 1 crios 1 agus mar sin de; roinneann fuinneoga breise an crios deireanach. Le níos lú fuinneog ná criosanna úsáidtear „Príomh agus cruach“, ionas nach mbíonn poill.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Aimsíonn gach fuinneog a háit féin, mar a dhéanann bainisteoir fuinneog tílithe.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Aimsíonn gach fuinneog a háit ar an scáileán léi féin. Téann fuinneoga nua isteach, fágann na cinn dúnta spás do na cinn eile.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Sampla: dhá fhuinneog taobh le taobh, ó thrí príomh agus cruach, ó chúig greille. Gan riail oiriúnach úsáidtear an leagan amach a roghnaíodh thuas.","Fade in and out":"Céimnigh isteach agus amach","Fade the other windows":"Maolaigh na fuinneoga eile","Features":"Gnéithe","Feel":"Mothú","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Oiriúnaigh do fhuinneoga atá greamaithe cheana","Fits the way you work.":"Oireann sé don chaoi a n-oibríonn tú.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Lig don fhuinneog snámh (fág an tíliú)","Four quarters":"Ceithre cheathrú","From":"Ó","Fullscreen":"Lánscáileán","Gap between windows":"Bearna idir fuinneoga","Gap to the screen edge":"Bearna go dtí imeall an scáileáin","General":"Ginearálta","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Tugann sé eochair na scéime roghnaithe do gach gníomh arís agus baineann sé eochracha nach bhfuil sa scéim.","Good to know":"Is maith a fhios","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Beir ar fhuinneog ag a barra teidil agus tarraing suas í. Sleamhnaíonn an barra síos; scaoil an fhuinneog ar chrios agus líonfaidh sí an limistéar sin go díreach. Má tharraingíonn tú amach arís í, gheobhaidh sí a seanmhéid ar ais.","Grab window A…":"Beir ar fhuinneog A…","Grid":"Greille","Halves":"Leatha","Hiding":"Folú","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Coinnigh ag an imeall chun an spás saor a líonadh","Hold time":"Am coinneála","Hold to fill":"Coinnigh chun líonadh","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Cé chomh gar a chaithfidh imeall teacht sula léimeann sé ina áit.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Cé chomh gar don imeall a chaithfidh an cúrsóir teacht.","How far the bar slides down":"Cé chomh fada síos a shleamhnaíonn an barra","How it works":"Conas a oibríonn sé","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Cé chomh fada a chaithfidh an fhuinneog fanacht leis an imeall – brú beag. 0 = láithreach.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Cé chomh fada is gá don fhuinneog fanacht ag an imeall sula bhfásann sí.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Cé mhéad fuinneog a roinneann an príomhlimistéar (leagan amach “Príomh agus cruach”).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Má tá fuinneog ag an mbun cheana, tugann an t-imeall uachtarach an leath uachtarach in ionad uasmhéadú. Fágann leatha agus ceathrúna fuinneoga greamaithe saor freisin.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Má thaitníonn KSnapUnity leat, is féidir leat tacú lena fhorbairt – go raibh maith agat!","In bar":"Sa bharra","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Neamhspleách ar an mbarra greamaithe agus ar imill an scáileáin.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Neamhspleách ar an mbarra greamaithe. Is féidir gach imeall a chasadh air ar leith.","Information":"Faisnéis","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Iompar fuinneog iomasach, nádúrtha.","Join at the end":"Téann siad go dtí an deireadh","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K do KWin · Snap do ghreamú níos cliste · Unity do gach rud in aon chóras amháin","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"Tá a ghníomhartha féin d’imill an scáileáin agus a ghreamú fuinneog féin ag KDE. Má tá an ghné chéanna air anseo, cas as gné KDE: Socruithe an Chórais → Bainistíocht Fuinneog → Imill an Scáileáin, agus Iompar Fuinneog → Bogadh.","KDE's own edge tiling":"Tíleáil imill KDE féin","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"Cuirtear uasmhéadú agus tíliú KDE féin ag na himill – lena imlíne – ar sos fad a ritheann KSnapUnity, ionas nach mbíonn ach réamhamharc amháin. Ní athraítear do shocruithe KDE: múch é seo, díchumasaigh nó bain KSnapUnity agus tagann iompar KDE ar ais.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"Tá gníomhartha imill scáileáin KDE féin fós air, mar sin freagraíonn dhá chúntóir don tarraingt chéanna. Cas as „Uasmhéadaigh” agus „Tíl” in Socruithe an Chórais → Bainistíocht Fuinneog → Imill an Scáileáin.","KDE's own window snapping":"Greamú fuinneog KDE féin","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"Tá greamú fuinneog KDE féin air freisin. Le haghaidh mothú comhsheasmhach, socraigh a chriosanna go „Dada” in Socruithe an Chórais → Bainistíocht Fuinneog → Iompar Fuinneog → Bogadh.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Níor fhreagair seirbhís aicearraí KDE. Is féidir leat na heochracha a shocrú fós in Socruithe an Chórais → Aicearraí → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – Eagarthóir socruithe","Keep stacked windows in line":"Coinnigh fuinneoga cruachta ar líne","Keep the gap between windows":"Coinnigh an bhearna idir fuinneoga","Keep them":"Fág iad","Key scheme":"Scéim eochracha","Keyboard shortcuts":"Aicearraí méarchláir","Keys":"Eochracha","Keys already in use":"Eochracha in úsáid cheana","Layout":"Leagan amach","Layout by number of windows":"Leagan amach de réir líon na bhfuinneog","Layouts":"Leagain amach","Layouts per row":"Leagain amach in aghaidh an ró","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Imeall clé agus deas: leath an scáileáin","Left edge: left half":"Imeall clé: an leath chlé","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Faoi 100 % fanann fuinneog aonair sa lár – deas ar scáileáin leathana.","License":"Ceadúnas","Light":"Geal","Linear":"Líneach","Live preview":"Réamhamharc beo","Load template…":"Luchtaigh teimpléad…","Magnet":"Maighnéad","Main + stack":"Príomh + cruach","Main and stack":"Príomh agus cruach","Main area bigger":"Príomhlimistéar níos mó","Main area on the right":"Príomhlimistéar ar dheis","Main area smaller":"Príomhlimistéar níos lú","Main in the middle":"Príomh sa lár","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Príomhlasc don tarraingt agus do na heochracha.","Main window":"Príomhfhuinneog","Main windows":"Príomhfhuinneoga","Main windows: %1":"Príomhfhuinneoga: %1","Make it the main window":"Déan príomhfhuinneog di","Maximize":"Uasmhéadaigh","Maximize or restore":"Uasmhéadaigh nó athchóirigh","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + eochair (stíl KDE)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + eochair","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + eochair","Minimize":"Íoslaghdaigh","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Scáthánaíonn sé an leagan amach: an phríomhfhuinneog ar dheis, an chuid eile ar chlé.","Mode":"Mód","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Mód 1 – Barra greamaithe agus imill an scáileáin","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Mód 2 – Tíliú uathoibríoch","Modes":"Móid","More ways":"Tuilleadh bealaí","Motion curve":"Cuar gluaiseachta","Move a window towards others…":"Bog fuinneog i dtreo fuinneog eile…","Move the window one place back":"Bog an fhuinneog áit amháin siar","Move the window one place on":"Bog an fhuinneog áit amháin ar aghaidh","Name:":"Ainm:","New layout":"Leagan amach nua","New windows":"Fuinneoga nua","Next tiling layout":"An chéad leagan amach eile","Next to the active window":"In aice leis an bhfuinneog ghníomhach","No key":"Gan eochair","No other window open":"Níl aon fhuinneog eile oscailte","No outer margin":"Gan imeall seachtrach","No shortcuts":"Gan aicearraí","None":"Dada","None yet.":"Dada fós.","Off":"As","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Múchta = mód 1, ar siúl = mód 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"As: fráma neodrach – do na réamhamhairc atá ar siúl amháin.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"As: fanann na heochracha sannta ach ní dhéanann siad faic.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"As: fanann fuinneoga san áit a gcuireann tú iad. Oibríonn na gnéithe eile ar aon nós.","One at a time":"Ceann ar cheann","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Dúnann ceann – líonann na cinn eile an bhearna","One main window less":"Príomhfhuinneog amháin níos lú","One more main window":"Príomhfhuinneog amháin eile","One window":"Fuinneog amháin","Only one mode is switched on.":"Níl ach mód amháin ar siúl.","Open settings editor":"Oscail an t-eagarthóir socruithe","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Oscail an feidhmchlár ar dtús, ansin roghnaigh anseo é.","Open the layout builder":"Oscail tógálaí na leagan amach","Own layouts":"Leagain amach féin","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"An chuid de gach taobh a chomhairtear mar chúinne.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Cuir tíleáil imill KDE agus a réamhamharc ar sos","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Cuir criosanna greamaithe KDE ar sos fad atá an maighnéad ar siúl","Preview":"Réamhamharc","Previews":"Réamhamhairc","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Brúigh fuinneog in aghaidh imill nó cúinne den scáileán agus líonfaidh sí an chuid sin. Oibríonn sé leis an mbarra greamaithe nó gan é.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Brúigh fuinneog in aghaidh imill nó cúinne: uasmhéadú, leatha, ceathrúna.","Push delay":"Moill bhrú","Quarters":"Ceathrúna","Quick":"Tapa","Quick settings":"Socruithe tapa","Recommended values":"Luachanna molta","Remove":"Bain","Remove rule":"Bain an riail","Remove zone":"Bain an crios","Reset all":"Athshocraigh gach rud","Reset all keys":"Athshocraigh na heochracha go léir","Reset to default":"Athshocraigh go réamhshocrú","Resistance against overlapping":"Friotaíocht in aghaidh forluí","Resize touching windows together":"Athraigh méid na bhfuinneog a theagmhaíonn le chéile in éineacht","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Greamaíonn athrú méide freisin – anseo go dtí an airde iomlán","Restore":"Athchóirigh","Restore default layouts":"Athchóirigh na leagain amach réamhshocraithe","Restore default layouts?":"Athchóirigh na leagain amach réamhshocraithe?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Athchóirigh an bunmhéid nuair a tharraingítear an fhuinneog amach","Restore the size before snapping":"Athchóirigh an méid roimh ghreamú","Rows":"Rónna","Save":"Sábháil","Screen edges":"Imill an scáileáin","Screen edges on/off":"Imill an scáileáin air/as","Screen edges preview":"Réamhamharc imill an scáileáin","Set":"Socraigh","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Socraíonn sé eochracha gach gnímh in éineacht. Is féidir leat eochracha aonair a athrú thíos fós.","Settings":"Socruithe","Settings file":"Comhad socruithe","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Croith an luch go tapa anonn is anall agus tú ag athrú méide, agus léimeann na fuinneoga eile ar ais. Ní scaoileann tarraingt thapa i dtreo amháin iad riamh.","Shake to let go":"Croith chun scaoileadh","Shortcuts":"Aicearraí","Show a small handle first":"Taispeáin hanla beag ar dtús","Show layout and zone names":"Taispeáin ainmneacha leagan amach agus crios","Show previews in the accent color":"Taispeáin réamhamhairc sa dath aibhsithe","Showing":"Taispeáint","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Taispeánann sé cá dtiocfaidh an fhuinneog ag imeall nó cúinne. As: gan réamhamharc ar bith.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Taispeánann sé cá dtiocfaidh an fhuinneog fad atá crios den bharra aibhsithe. As: gan réamhamharc ar bith.","Sidebar + grid":"Barra taoibh + greille","Single zone":"Crios aonair","Six tiles":"Sé thíl","Size & shape":"Méid agus cruth","Size of the main area":"Méid an phríomhlimistéir","Slide-in duration":"Fad sleamhnú isteach","Slide-out duration":"Fad sleamhnú amach","Smart arranging and detection.":"Socrú agus aithint chliste.","Smart fill":"Líonadh cliste","Smooth (default)":"Réidh (réamhshocrú)","Snap bar":"Barra greamaithe","Snap bar and screen edges":"Barra greamaithe agus imill an scáileáin","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Tá an barra agus na himill múchta – níl ach mód 2 ag rith agus ní dhéanann aicearra an mhóid faic.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Cuireann an barra agus imill an scáileáin isteach ar an tíliú uathoibríoch. Mar sin is dhá mhód iad – athraigh leis an aicearra nó anseo.","Snap bar colors:":"Dathanna an bharra:","Snap bar on/off":"Barra greamaithe air/as","Snap bar preview":"Réamhamharc an bharra ghreamaithe","Snap bar size":"Méid an bharra","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Barra greamaithe, imill an scáileáin, maighnéad fuinneog, aicearraí agus malartú fuinneog.","Snap distance":"Fad greamaithe","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Greamaigh na deighilteoirí (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Leagain amach greamaithe agus tíliú uathoibríoch.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Greamaigh an fhuinneog ghníomhach le teaglaim eochracha.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Greamaigh an fhuinneog ghníomhach leis an méarchlár. Is gnáth-aicearraí domhanda KDE iad seo – gheobhaidh tú iad freisin in Socruithe an Chórais → Aicearraí → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Greamaigh sa leath íochtarach","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Greamaigh sa cheathrú íochtarach chlé","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Greamaigh sa cheathrú íochtarach dheis","Snap to the center third":"Greamaigh sa trian láir","Snap to the left half":"Greamaigh sa leath clé","Snap to the left third":"Greamaigh sa trian clé","Snap to the left two thirds":"Greamaigh sa dá thrian ar chlé","Snap to the right half":"Greamaigh sa leath dheis","Snap to the right third":"Greamaigh sa trian deas","Snap to the right two thirds":"Greamaigh sa dá thrian ar dheis","Snap to the top half":"Greamaigh sa leath uachtarach","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Greamaigh sa cheathrú uachtarach chlé","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Greamaigh sa cheathrú uachtarach dheis","Snapping":"Greamú","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Ritheann greamú agus tíliú uathoibríoch mar dhá mhód – aicearra amháin chun athrú eatarthu.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Mar sin ní tharraingíonn ach maighnéad amháin ar fhuinneog. Ní athraítear do shocruithe KDE: múch é seo, díchumasaigh nó bain KSnapUnity agus tagann greamú KDE ar ais.","Soft":"Bog","Spacing":"Spásáil","Spiral":"Bíseach","Split side by side":"Roinn taobh le taobh","Split top and bottom":"Roinn barr agus bun","Stack + main":"Cruach + príomh","Stick to other windows":"Greamaigh d’fhuinneoga eile","Stick to the screen edges":"Greamaigh d’imill an scáileáin","Sticky edges":"Imill ghreamaitheacha","Support KSnapUnity":"Tacaigh le KSnapUnity","Swap":"Malartaigh","Swap windows":"Fuinneoga a mhalartú","Swap with the window above":"Malartaigh leis an bhfuinneog thuas","Swap with the window below":"Malartaigh leis an bhfuinneog thíos","Swap with the window on the left":"Malartaigh leis an bhfuinneog ar chlé","Swap with the window on the right":"Malartaigh leis an bhfuinneog ar dheis","Switch mode":"Athraigh mód","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Athraigh mód (greamú / tíliú)","Switch modes with:":"Athraigh mód le:","Switch the layout by itself":"Athraigh an leagan amach leis féin","Switched off":"Múchta","System":"Córas","Take it over":"Glac é","Take over all":"Glac iad go léir","Take the main place":"Glacann siad an príomháit","Test animation":"Tástáil an bheochan","Test on screen":"Tástáil ar an scáileán","Test the snap bar":"Tástáil an barra greamaithe","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Tá na luachanna réamhshocraithe bunaithe ar Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Úsáideann na gníomhartha greamaithe na bearnaí céanna leis an mbarra agus cuimhníonn siad ar an méid roimh an ngreamú: tugann „Athchóirigh an méid roimh ghreamú” ar ais é.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Ní shocraítear na feidhmchláir seo riamh agus coinníonn siad a n-áit féin. Bíonn dialóga ar snámh i gcónaí.","Thirds":"Trianta","Three columns":"Trí cholún","Thumbnail width":"Leithead na mionsamhlacha","Tiling":"Tíliú","Tip":"Leid","Top / bottom":"Barr / bun","Top edge":"Imeall uachtarach","Top edge: full screen":"Imeall barr: lánscáileán","Top edge: maximize":"Imeall barr: uasmhéadaigh","Top edge: top half":"Imeall barr: an leath uachtair","Top half":"An leath uachtarach","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Fad truicir ón imeall uachtarach","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Múch é seo más fearr leat imlíne KDE féin – ansin múch réamhamharc imill an scáileáin thuas.","Two thirds":"Dhá thrian","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Athraíonn dhá fhuinneog áit – scaoil ceann ar an gceann eile nó úsáid na heochracha.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Athraíonn dhá fhuinneog áit: scaoil ceann ar an gceann eile, nó le heochair.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Úsáid aicearraí méarchláir","Use screen edges":"Úsáid imill an scáileáin","Use the system accent color":"Úsáid dath aibhsithe an chórais","Use the window magnet":"Úsáid an maighnéad fuinneog","Usual combinations":"Teaglaim choitianta","Version":"Leagan","Wanted for: %1":"Teastaíonn sé do: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Nuair a osclaíonn, a dhúnann nó a mhalartaíonn fuinneog, bogann an chuid eile go réidh in ionad léim.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Nuair a athraíonn tú méid fuinneoige, bogann na fuinneoga a theagmhaíonn léi an t-imeall comhroinnte léi – ní fhorluíonn aon rud, ní osclaítear bearna.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Agus an méid á athrú, taispeántar go trédhearcach fuinneoga nach leanann.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Fad is a bhogann tú nó a athraíonn tú méid fuinneoige, greamaíonn a himill d’fhuinneoga in aice láimhe agus d’imill an scáileáin.","Width":"Leithead","Window":"Fuinneog","Window magnet":"Maighnéad fuinneog","Window magnet on/off":"Maighnéad fuinneog air/as","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Coinníonn fuinneoga os cionn a chéile a n-imill chlé agus dheis le chéile, agus fuinneoga taobh le taobh a n-imill bharr agus bhun.","Windows glide to their place":"Sleamhnaíonn fuinneoga ina n-áit","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Greamaíonn fuinneoga dá chéile agus d’imill an scáileáin.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Stopann fuinneoga ag „Bearna idir fuinneoga” ón leathanach Ginearálta in ionad teagmháil a dhéanamh.","Yes":"Tá","Your own combination":"Do theaglaim féin","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Caillfear do leagain amach féin agus a n-ord.","Zone %1":"Crios %1","for KWin · v%1":"do KWin · v%1","windows:":"fhuinneog:","“%1” will be removed.":"Bainfear “%1”.","…drag it onto window B…":"…tarraing ar fhuinneog B í…","…in every direction":"…i ngach treo","…let go: they trade places":"…scaoil: athraíonn siad áit","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…fásann agus crapann na comharsana leis","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Réidh – cliceáil OK chun an t-eagarthóir socruithe a oscailt."},"gl":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (copia)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 úsaa «%2».","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 de %2 zonas","0 = all in one row":"0 = todas nunha fila","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Modo 1</b><br/>Barra de axuste e bordos da pantalla","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Modo 2</b><br/>Mosaico automático","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Unha xanela soa usa toda a pantalla, aínda que haxa unha marxe.","A new window joins":"Únese unha xanela nova","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Un empurrón curto dá a metade ou o cuarto. Mantén a xanela un pouco máis no bordo e crece ata a seguinte xanela; a vista previa amósao.","A single window":"Unha soa xanela","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Unha xanela detense no bordo doutra, tamén se a moves rápido. Axita o rato ou segue empurrando un momento para soltala. 0 = as xanelas poden solaparse libremente.","About & Help":"Sobre e axuda","Accent color":"Cor de realce","Active":"Activo","Active mode":"Modo activo","Active width along the top edge":"Largura activa ao longo do bordo superior","Add an open application":"Engadir unha aplicación aberta","Add rule":"Engadir regra","All window features in one system.":"Todas as funcións de xanelas nun sistema.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Tamén cambia cando redimensionas a xanela principal á man.","Also while resizing":"Tamén ao redimensionar","Always floating":"Sempre flotantes","Animation":"Animación","Appearance":"Aparencia","Apply":"Aplicar","Arrange windows":"Organizar as xanelas","Arrange windows automatically":"Organizar as xanelas automaticamente","Author":"Autor","Automatic tiling":"Mosaico automático","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"O mosaico automático está desactivado – só funciona o modo 1 e o atallo de modo non fai nada.","Automatic tiling off":"Mosaico automático desactivado","Automatic tiling on":"Mosaico automático activado","Automatic tiling on/off":"Activar/desactivar o mosaico automático","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Mosaico automático, intercambio de xanelas, atallos e o imán para xanelas flotantes.","Background opacity":"Opacidade do fondo","Behavior & Animation":"Comportamento e animación","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Bordo inferior: metade inferior","Bouncy":"Con rebote","Buy me a coffee":"Convídame a un café","Cancel":"Cancelar","Center focus":"Foco central","Center the window":"Centrar a xanela","Change":"Cambiar","Change key":"Cambiar a tecla","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"A tecla cámbiase no editor de axustes. Os dous modos precisan o mosaico automático e a barra ou os bordos da pantalla.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Cámbiaas na páxina Atallos de teclado. Co mosaico automático, as xanelas tamén intercambian o sitio na orde.","Choose…":"Escoller…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Prema nunha zona para seleccionala · dobre clic para dividila · arrastre os separadores","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Preme aquí ou %1 para cambiar de modo.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Preme e logo Aceptar – ábrese o editor de axustes.","Close":"Pechar","Close by, the edges stick together":"De preto, os bordos péganse","Color scheme":"Esquema de cores","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Cores, tamaño e forma da barra.","Columns":"Columnas","Corner radius":"Raio das esquinas","Corner size":"Tamaño das esquinas","Corner: a quarter":"Esquina: un cuarto","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Esquinas: un cuarto da pantalla","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + tecla (predeterminado)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + teclado numérico","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Maiús+Alt + tecla","Custom color":"Cor personalizada","Custom layout %1":"Disposición personalizada %1","Dark":"Escuro","Delay before hiding":"Atraso antes de agochar","Delay before showing":"Atraso antes de amosar","Delete":"Eliminar","Delete layout?":"Eliminar a disposición?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Distancia á que aparece a asa","Distance before the bar hides again":"Distancia antes de que a barra se agoche de novo","Distance to the edge":"Distancia ao bordo","Donate with PayPal":"Doar con PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"Arrastra un bordo compartido…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Arrastra unha xanela contra un bordo…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Arrastra unha xanela sobre outra para intercambialas. Se a soltas na barra ou nun bordo, flota libremente; «Deixar flotar a xanela» devólvea. Os espazos veñen da páxina Xeral.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Arrastra unha xanela sobre o centro doutra – a vista previa mostra dúas frechas – e solta. Co mosaico automático abonda calquera punto sobre a outra xanela.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Arrastre unha xanela ao bordo superior da pantalla e sóltea sobre unha zona.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Arrastre as tarxetas para cambiar a orde na barra. Prema dúas veces nunha tarxeta para editala.","Drop a window onto another one":"Soltar unha xanela enriba doutra","Drop the window onto a zone":"Solte a xanela sobre unha zona","Duplicate":"Duplicar","Duration":"Duración","Dwindle":"Espiral interior","Dynamic":"Dinámica","Edges and corners":"Bordos e esquinas","Edit":"Editar","Edit layout":"Editar a disposición","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Cada función pódese activar e desactivar por separado.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Cada disposición que crees na páxina Disposicións tamén pode organizar xanelas – aparece arriba. A xanela 1 ocupa a zona 1 e así; as demais comparten a última zona. Con menos xanelas ca zonas úsase «Principal e pila», para que non queden ocos.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Cada xanela atopa o seu sitio soa, coma nun xestor de xanelas en mosaico.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Cada xanela atopa soa o seu sitio na pantalla. As xanelas novas engádense e as pechadas deixan sitio ás outras.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Exemplo: dúas xanelas lado a lado, desde tres principal e pila, desde cinco unha grade. Sen regra axeitada úsase a disposición escollida arriba.","Fade in and out":"Esvaecemento ao aparecer e desaparecer","Fade the other windows":"Atenuar as demais xanelas","Features":"Funcións","Feel":"Sensación","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Adaptarse ás xanelas xa axustadas","Fits the way you work.":"Adáptase á túa forma de traballar.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Deixar flotar a xanela (saír do mosaico)","Four quarters":"Catro cuartos","From":"Desde","Fullscreen":"Pantalla completa","Gap between windows":"Espazo entre xanelas","Gap to the screen edge":"Espazo ata o bordo da pantalla","General":"Xeral","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Volve dar a cada acción a tecla do esquema escollido e quita as teclas que o esquema non ten.","Good to know":"Bo saber","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Colla unha xanela pola barra de título e arrástrea cara arriba. A barra baixa; solte a xanela sobre unha zona e ocupará exactamente esa área. Se a volve sacar, recupera o tamaño anterior.","Grab window A…":"Colle a xanela A…","Grid":"Grade","Halves":"Metades","Hiding":"Agochar","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Manter no bordo para encher o espazo libre","Hold time":"Tempo de espera","Hold to fill":"Manter para encher","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Canto se ten que achegar un bordo antes de encaixar.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Canto se ten que achegar o cursor ao bordo.","How far the bar slides down":"Canto baixa a barra","How it works":"Como funciona","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Canto tempo ten que estar a xanela contra o bordo: un pequeno empurrón. 0 = ao momento.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Canto tempo debe quedar a xanela no bordo antes de crecer.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Cantas xanelas comparten a área principal (disposición «Principal e pila»).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Se xa hai unha xanela abaixo, o bordo superior dá a metade superior en vez de maximizar. As metades e os cuartos tamén deixan libres as xanelas axustadas.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Se che gusta KSnapUnity, podes apoiar o seu desenvolvemento – grazas!","In bar":"Na barra","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Independente da barra de axuste e dos bordos da pantalla.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Independente da barra de axuste. Cada bordo actívase por separado.","Information":"Información","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Comportamento de xanelas intuitivo e natural.","Join at the end":"Póñense ao final","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K de KWin · Snap de axuste máis intelixente · Unity de todo nun sistema","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"O KDE ten as súas propias accións de bordo da pantalla e o seu propio axuste de xanelas. Se a mesma función está activa aquí, desactiva a do KDE: Configuración do sistema → Xestión de xanelas → Bordos da pantalla, e Comportamento das xanelas → Movemento.","KDE's own edge tiling":"Mosaico de bordos propio de KDE","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"O maximizado e o mosaico propios de KDE nos bordos – co seu contorno – detéñense mentres funciona KSnapUnity, para que só apareza unha vista previa. Os teus axustes de KDE non cambian: desactiva isto, desactiva ou quita KSnapUnity e volve o comportamento de KDE.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"As accións de bordo da pantalla do KDE seguen activas, así que dous axudantes reaccionan ao mesmo arrastre. Desactiva «Maximizar» e «Mosaico» en Configuración do sistema → Xestión de xanelas → Bordos da pantalla.","KDE's own window snapping":"Axuste de xanelas propio de KDE","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"O axuste de xanelas propio do KDE tamén está activo. Para unha sensación uniforme, pon as súas zonas en «Ningunha» en Configuración do sistema → Xestión de xanelas → Comportamento das xanelas → Movemento.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"O servizo de atallos do KDE non respondeu. Aínda podes asignar as teclas en Configuración do sistema → Atallos → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – Editor de axustes","Keep stacked windows in line":"Manter aliñadas as xanelas apiladas","Keep the gap between windows":"Manter o espazo entre xanelas","Keep them":"Deixalas","Key scheme":"Esquema de teclas","Keyboard shortcuts":"Atallos de teclado","Keys":"Teclas","Keys already in use":"Teclas xa en uso","Layout":"Disposición","Layout by number of windows":"Disposición segundo o número de xanelas","Layouts":"Disposicións","Layouts per row":"Disposicións por fila","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Bordos esquerdo e dereito: media pantalla","Left edge: left half":"Bordo esquerdo: metade esquerda","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Por baixo do 100 % unha xanela soa queda centrada – ideal en pantallas anchas.","License":"Licenza","Light":"Claro","Linear":"Lineal","Live preview":"Vista previa en directo","Load template…":"Cargar un modelo…","Magnet":"Imán","Main + stack":"Principal + morea","Main and stack":"Principal e pila","Main area bigger":"Área principal máis grande","Main area on the right":"Área principal á dereita","Main area smaller":"Área principal máis pequena","Main in the middle":"Principal no medio","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Interruptor principal para arrastrar e as teclas.","Main window":"Xanela principal","Main windows":"Xanelas principais","Main windows: %1":"Xanelas principais: %1","Make it the main window":"Facer xanela principal","Maximize":"Maximizar","Maximize or restore":"Maximizar ou restaurar","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + tecla (estilo KDE)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + tecla","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Maiús + tecla","Minimize":"Minimizar","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Reflicte a disposición: a xanela principal á dereita, as demais á esquerda.","Mode":"Modo","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Modo 1 – Barra de axuste e bordos da pantalla","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Modo 2 – Mosaico automático","Modes":"Modos","More ways":"Máis xeitos","Motion curve":"Curva de movemento","Move a window towards others…":"Achega unha xanela a outras…","Move the window one place back":"Mover a xanela un posto atrás","Move the window one place on":"Mover a xanela un posto adiante","Name:":"Nome:","New layout":"Nova disposición","New windows":"Xanelas novas","Next tiling layout":"Seguinte disposición","Next to the active window":"Xunto á xanela activa","No key":"Sen tecla","No other window open":"Non hai outra xanela aberta","No outer margin":"Sen marxe exterior","No shortcuts":"Sen atallos","None":"Ningún","None yet.":"Ningunha aínda.","Off":"Desactivado","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Desactivado = modo 1, activado = modo 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Desactivado: un marco neutro – só para as vistas previas activadas.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Desactivado: as teclas seguen asignadas pero non fan nada.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Desactivado: as xanelas quedan onde as poñas. As outras funcións van igual.","One at a time":"Unha de cada vez","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Pecha unha – as outras enchen o oco","One main window less":"Unha xanela principal menos","One more main window":"Unha xanela principal máis","One window":"Unha xanela","Only one mode is switched on.":"Só hai un modo activado.","Open settings editor":"Abrir o editor de axustes","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Abre primeiro a aplicación e logo escóllea aquí.","Open the layout builder":"Abrir o creador de disposicións","Own layouts":"Disposicións propias","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Parte de cada lado que conta como esquina.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Pausar o mosaico de bordos de KDE e a súa vista previa","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Pausar as zonas de axuste de KDE mentres o imán está activo","Preview":"Vista previa","Previews":"Vistas previas","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Empurra unha xanela contra un bordo ou unha esquina da pantalla e encherá esa parte. Funciona coa barra de axuste ou sen ela.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Empurra unha xanela contra un bordo ou unha esquina: maximizar, metades, cuartos.","Push delay":"Atraso do empurrón","Quarters":"Cuartos","Quick":"Rápida","Quick settings":"Axustes rápidos","Recommended values":"Valores recomendados","Remove":"Quitar","Remove rule":"Quitar a regra","Remove zone":"Retirar a zona","Reset all":"Restabelecer todo","Reset all keys":"Restabelecer todas as teclas","Reset to default":"Restabelecer o predeterminado","Resistance against overlapping":"Resistencia á superposición","Resize touching windows together":"Redimensionar xuntas as xanelas que se tocan","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Redimensionar tamén se axusta – aquí a toda a altura","Restore":"Restaurar","Restore default layouts":"Restaurar as disposicións predeterminadas","Restore default layouts?":"Restaurar as disposicións predeterminadas?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Restaurar o tamaño orixinal ao sacar a xanela","Restore the size before snapping":"Restaurar o tamaño anterior ao axuste","Rows":"Filas","Save":"Gardar","Screen edges":"Bordos da pantalla","Screen edges on/off":"Bordos da pantalla si/non","Screen edges preview":"Vista previa dos bordos","Set":"Asignar","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Asigna as teclas de todas as accións dunha vez. Podes seguir cambiando teclas soltas abaixo.","Settings":"Configuración","Settings file":"Ficheiro de configuración","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Axita o rato rápido adiante e atrás ao cambiar o tamaño e as outras xanelas volven atrás. Un tirón rápido nunha soa dirección nunca as solta.","Shake to let go":"Axitar para soltar","Shortcuts":"Atallos","Show a small handle first":"Amosar primeiro unha pequena asa","Show layout and zone names":"Amosar os nomes das disposicións e zonas","Show previews in the accent color":"Amosar as vistas previas na cor de realce","Showing":"Amosar","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Mostra onde vai a xanela nun bordo ou nunha esquina. Desactivado: ningunha vista previa.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Mostra onde vai a xanela mentres unha zona da barra está resaltada. Desactivado: ningunha vista previa.","Sidebar + grid":"Barra lateral + grade","Single zone":"Zona única","Six tiles":"Seis mosaicos","Size & shape":"Tamaño e forma","Size of the main area":"Tamaño da área principal","Slide-in duration":"Duración da baixada","Slide-out duration":"Duración da subida","Smart arranging and detection.":"Organización e detección intelixentes.","Smart fill":"Enchido intelixente","Smooth (default)":"Suave (predeterminada)","Snap bar":"Barra de axuste","Snap bar and screen edges":"Barra de axuste e bordos da pantalla","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"A barra e os bordos están desactivados – só funciona o modo 2 e o atallo de modo non fai nada.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"A barra e os bordos da pantalla estorban o mosaico automático. Por iso funcionan como dous modos – cambia co atallo ou aquí.","Snap bar colors:":"Cores da barra:","Snap bar on/off":"Barra de axuste si/non","Snap bar preview":"Vista previa da barra","Snap bar size":"Tamaño da barra","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Barra de axuste, bordos da pantalla, imán de xanelas, atallos e intercambio de xanelas.","Snap distance":"Distancia de enganche","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Axustar os separadores (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Disposicións de axuste e mosaico automático.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Axusta a xanela activa con combinacións de teclas.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Axusta a xanela activa co teclado. Son atallos globais normais do KDE: tamén os atopas en Configuración do sistema → Atallos → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Axustar á metade inferior","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Axustar ao cuarto inferior esquerdo","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Axustar ao cuarto inferior dereito","Snap to the center third":"Axustar ao terzo central","Snap to the left half":"Axustar á metade esquerda","Snap to the left third":"Axustar ao terzo esquerdo","Snap to the left two thirds":"Axustar aos dous terzos esquerdos","Snap to the right half":"Axustar á metade dereita","Snap to the right third":"Axustar ao terzo dereito","Snap to the right two thirds":"Axustar aos dous terzos dereitos","Snap to the top half":"Axustar á metade superior","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Axustar ao cuarto superior esquerdo","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Axustar ao cuarto superior dereito","Snapping":"Acoplamento","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"O axuste e o mosaico automático funcionan como dous modos – un atallo cambia entre eles.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Así só un imán tira dunha xanela. Os teus axustes de KDE non cambian: desactiva isto, desactiva ou quita KSnapUnity e volve o axuste de KDE.","Soft":"Delicada","Spacing":"Espazado","Spiral":"Espiral","Split side by side":"Dividir en paralelo","Split top and bottom":"Dividir arriba e abaixo","Stack + main":"Morea + principal","Stick to other windows":"Pegar a outras xanelas","Stick to the screen edges":"Pegar aos bordos da pantalla","Sticky edges":"Bordos pegañentos","Support KSnapUnity":"Apoia KSnapUnity","Swap":"Intercambiar","Swap windows":"Intercambiar xanelas","Swap with the window above":"Intercambiar coa xanela de arriba","Swap with the window below":"Intercambiar coa xanela de abaixo","Swap with the window on the left":"Intercambiar coa xanela da esquerda","Swap with the window on the right":"Intercambiar coa xanela da dereita","Switch mode":"Cambiar de modo","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Cambiar de modo (axuste / mosaico)","Switch modes with:":"Cambiar de modo con:","Switch the layout by itself":"Cambiar a disposición só","Switched off":"Desactivado","System":"Sistema","Take it over":"Quedar con ela","Take over all":"Quedar con todas","Take the main place":"Collen o lugar principal","Test animation":"Probar a animación","Test on screen":"Probar na pantalla","Test the snap bar":"Probar a barra de axuste","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Os valores predeterminados baséanse en Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"As accións de axuste usan os mesmos espazos ca a barra e lembran o tamaño anterior ao axuste: «Restaurar o tamaño anterior ao axuste» recupérao.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Estas aplicacións nunca se organizan e manteñen o seu lugar. Os diálogos sempre flotan.","Thirds":"Terzos","Three columns":"Tres columnas","Thumbnail width":"Largura das miniaturas","Tiling":"Mosaico","Tip":"Consello","Top / bottom":"Arriba / abaixo","Top edge":"Bordo superior","Top edge: full screen":"Bordo superior: pantalla completa","Top edge: maximize":"Bordo superior: maximizar","Top edge: top half":"Bordo superior: metade superior","Top half":"Metade superior","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Distancia de activación desde o bordo superior","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Desactívao se prefires o contorno de KDE; entón desactiva arriba a vista previa dos bordos.","Two thirds":"Dous terzos","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Dúas xanelas intercambian o lugar – solta unha sobre a outra ou usa as teclas.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Dúas xanelas intercambian o lugar: solta unha sobre a outra, ou con tecla.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Usar atallos de teclado","Use screen edges":"Usar os bordos da pantalla","Use the system accent color":"Usar a cor de realce do sistema","Use the window magnet":"Usar o imán de xanelas","Usual combinations":"Combinacións habituais","Version":"Versión","Wanted for: %1":"Desexada para: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Cando unha xanela se abre, se pecha ou se intercambia, as outras móvense suavemente en vez de saltar.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Ao cambiar o tamaño dunha xanela, as que a tocan moven o bordo compartido con ela: nada se superpón, non queda oco.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Mentres redimensionas, as xanelas que non seguen móstranse transparentes.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Mentres moves ou redimensionas unha xanela, os seus bordos pegan ás xanelas próximas e aos bordos da pantalla.","Width":"Largura","Window":"Xanela","Window magnet":"Imán de xanelas","Window magnet on/off":"Imán de xanelas si/non","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"As xanelas unha enriba doutra manteñen xuntos os bordos esquerdo e dereito; as xanelas lado a lado, os superiores e inferiores.","Windows glide to their place":"As xanelas esvaran ao seu lugar","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"As xanelas pegan entre si e aos bordos da pantalla.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"As xanelas detéñense no «Espazo entre xanelas» da páxina Xeral en vez de tocarse.","Yes":"Si","Your own combination":"A túa combinación","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Perderanse as súas disposicións e a súa orde.","Zone %1":"Zona %1","for KWin · v%1":"para KWin · v%1","windows:":"xanelas:","“%1” will be removed.":"Retirarase «%1».","…drag it onto window B…":"…arrástraa sobre a xanela B…","…in every direction":"…en todas as direccións","…let go: they trade places":"…solta: intercambian o lugar","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…as veciñas medran e encollen con el","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Listo – preme Aceptar para abrir o editor de axustes."},"gu":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (નકલ)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 “%2” વાપરે છે.","%1 of %2 zones":"%2 માંથી %1 ઝોન","0 = all in one row":"0 = બધા એક જ હરોળમાં","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>મોડ 1</b><br/>સ્નેપ બાર અને સ્ક્રીનની કિનારીઓ","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>મોડ 2</b><br/>આપમેળે ટાઇલિંગ","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"એકલી વિન્ડો આખી સ્ક્રીન વાપરે છે, હાંસિયો સેટ હોય તો પણ.","A new window joins":"નવી વિન્ડો ઉમેરાય છે","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"ટૂંકો ધક્કો અડધો કે ચોથો ભાગ આપે છે. વિન્ડોને કિનારી પર થોડી વધુ વાર રાખો અને તે આગળની વિન્ડો સુધી વધે છે – પૂર્વાવલોકન તે બતાવે છે.","A single window":"એક એકલી વિન્ડો","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"ઝડપથી ખસેડો તો પણ વિન્ડો બીજી વિન્ડોની કિનારીએ અટકે છે. છોડાવવા માઉસ હલાવો કે થોડી ક્ષણ વધુ ધકેલો. 0 = વિન્ડો મુક્તપણે એકબીજા પર આવી શકે છે.","About & Help":"વિશે અને મદદ","Accent color":"એક્સેન્ટ રંગ","Active":"સક્રિય","Active mode":"સક્રિય મોડ","Active width along the top edge":"ઉપરની ધાર સાથે સક્રિય પહોળાઈ","Add an open application":"ખુલ્લી એપ ઉમેરો","Add rule":"નિયમ ઉમેરો","All window features in one system.":"બધી વિન્ડો સુવિધાઓ એક સિસ્ટમમાં.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"હાથથી મુખ્ય વિન્ડોનું કદ બદલો ત્યારે પણ બદલાય છે.","Also while resizing":"કદ બદલતી વખતે પણ","Always floating":"હંમેશા તરતી","Animation":"એનિમેશન","Appearance":"દેખાવ","Apply":"લાગુ કરો","Arrange windows":"વિન્ડો ગોઠવો","Arrange windows automatically":"વિન્ડો આપમેળે ગોઠવો","Author":"લેખક","Automatic tiling":"આપમેળે ટાઇલિંગ","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"આપમેળે ટાઇલિંગ બંધ છે – ફક્ત મોડ 1 ચાલે છે અને મોડ શૉર્ટકટ કંઈ કરતો નથી.","Automatic tiling off":"આપમેળે ટાઇલિંગ બંધ","Automatic tiling on":"આપમેળે ટાઇલિંગ ચાલુ","Automatic tiling on/off":"આપમેળે ટાઇલિંગ ચાલુ/બંધ","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"આપમેળે ટાઇલિંગ, વિન્ડો અદલાબદલી, શૉર્ટકટ અને તરતી વિન્ડો માટે ચુંબક.","Background opacity":"પૃષ્ઠભૂમિની અપારદર્શકતા","Behavior & Animation":"વર્તન અને એનિમેશન","Bottom edge: bottom half":"નીચેની કિનારી: નીચેનો અડધો ભાગ","Bouncy":"ઉછળતો","Buy me a coffee":"મને એક કોફી પીવડાવો","Cancel":"રદ કરો","Center focus":"વચ્ચે ધ્યાન","Center the window":"વિન્ડોને કેન્દ્રમાં લાવો","Change":"બદલો","Change key":"કી બદલો","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"કી સેટિંગ્સ સંપાદકમાં બદલો. બંને મોડ માટે આપમેળે ટાઇલિંગ અને સ્નેપ બાર અથવા સ્ક્રીનની કિનારીઓ જરૂરી છે.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"તેમને “કીબોર્ડ શૉર્ટકટ” પાના પર બદલો. આપમેળે ટાઇલિંગમાં વિન્ડો ક્રમમાં પણ જગ્યા બદલે છે.","Choose…":"પસંદ કરો…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"પસંદ કરવા ઝોન પર ક્લિક કરો · વિભાજિત કરવા ડબલ-ક્લિક કરો · વિભાજકો ખેંચો","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"મોડ બદલવા ક્લિક કરો અથવા %1 દબાવો.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"ક્લિક કરો, પછી OK – સેટિંગ્સ સંપાદક ખૂલે છે.","Close":"બંધ કરો","Close by, the edges stick together":"નજીક આવતાં કિનારીઓ ચોંટી જાય છે","Color scheme":"રંગ યોજના","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"સ્નેપ બારના રંગો, કદ અને આકાર.","Columns":"કૉલમ","Corner radius":"ખૂણાની ત્રિજ્યા","Corner size":"ખૂણાનું કદ","Corner: a quarter":"ખૂણો: ચોથો ભાગ","Corners: quarter of the screen":"ખૂણા: સ્ક્રીનનો ચોથો ભાગ","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + કી (ડિફૉલ્ટ)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + નંબર પૅડ","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + કી","Custom color":"પોતાનો રંગ","Custom layout %1":"પોતાનું લેઆઉટ %1","Dark":"ઘેરો","Delay before hiding":"છુપાવતા પહેલા વિલંબ","Delay before showing":"બતાવતા પહેલા વિલંબ","Delete":"કાઢી નાખો","Delete layout?":"લેઆઉટ કાઢી નાખવું?","Distance at which the handle appears":"હેન્ડલ દેખાય તે અંતર","Distance before the bar hides again":"બાર ફરી છુપાય તે પહેલાંનું અંતર","Distance to the edge":"કિનારીથી અંતર","Donate with PayPal":"PayPal થી દાન કરો","Drag a shared edge…":"સામાન્ય કિનારી ખેંચો…","Drag a window against an edge…":"વિન્ડોને કિનારી તરફ ખેંચો…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"અદલાબદલી માટે એક વિન્ડોને બીજી પર ખેંચો. સ્નેપ બાર કે સ્ક્રીનની કિનારી પર છોડતાં તે મુક્ત રીતે તરે છે; „વિન્ડોને તરવા દો“ તેને પાછી લાવે છે. અંતર સામાન્ય પાનાં પરથી આવે છે.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"વિન્ડોને બીજીની મધ્ય પર ખેંચો – પૂર્વાવલોકન બે તીર બતાવે છે – અને છોડો. આપમેળે ટાઇલિંગમાં બીજી વિન્ડો પર ગમે ત્યાં ચાલે.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"વિન્ડોને સ્ક્રીનની ઉપરની ધાર સુધી ખેંચો અને કોઈ ઝોન પર છોડો.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"સ્નેપ બારમાં ક્રમ બદલવા કાર્ડ ખેંચો. સંપાદિત કરવા કાર્ડ પર ડબલ-ક્લિક કરો.","Drop a window onto another one":"વિન્ડોને બીજી પર છોડો","Drop the window onto a zone":"વિન્ડોને કોઈ ઝોન પર છોડો","Duplicate":"નકલ બનાવો","Duration":"અવધિ","Dwindle":"ડ્વિન્ડલ","Dynamic":"ગતિશીલ","Edges and corners":"કિનારીઓ અને ખૂણા","Edit":"સંપાદિત કરો","Edit layout":"લેઆઉટ સંપાદિત કરો","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"દરેક સુવિધા અલગથી ચાલુ અને બંધ કરી શકાય છે.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"લેઆઉટ પાનાં પર બનાવેલો દરેક લેઆઉટ વિન્ડો પણ ગોઠવી શકે છે – તે ઉપર દેખાય છે. વિન્ડો 1 ને ઝોન 1 મળે છે વગેરે; વધારાની વિન્ડો છેલ્લો ઝોન વહેંચે છે. ઝોન કરતાં ઓછી વિન્ડો હોય ત્યારે „મુખ્ય અને ઢગલો“ વપરાય છે, જેથી ખાલી જગ્યા ન રહે.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"દરેક વિન્ડો પોતાની જગ્યા જાતે શોધે છે, ટાઇલિંગ વિન્ડો મેનેજરની જેમ.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"દરેક વિન્ડો સ્ક્રીન પર પોતાની જગ્યા જાતે શોધે છે. નવી વિન્ડો જોડાય છે, બંધ થયેલી બીજાને જગ્યા આપે છે.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"ઉદાહરણ: બે વિન્ડો બાજુ-બાજુ, ત્રણથી મુખ્ય અને ઢગલો, પાંચથી ગ્રિડ. મેળ ખાતો નિયમ ન હોય તો ઉપર પસંદ કરેલો લેઆઉટ વપરાય છે.","Fade in and out":"આવતાં-જતાં ઝાંખું કરો","Fade the other windows":"બીજી વિન્ડો ઝાંખી કરો","Features":"સુવિધાઓ","Feel":"અનુભવ","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"પહેલેથી સ્નેપ કરેલી વિન્ડોની આસપાસ ગોઠવો","Fits the way you work.":"તમારી કામ કરવાની રીતને અનુરૂપ.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"વિન્ડોને તરવા દો (ટાઇલિંગ છોડો)","Four quarters":"ચાર ચતુર્થાંશ","From":"થી","Fullscreen":"પૂર્ણ સ્ક્રીન","Gap between windows":"વિન્ડો વચ્ચેનું અંતર","Gap to the screen edge":"સ્ક્રીનની ધારથી અંતર","General":"સામાન્ય","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"દરેક ક્રિયાને ફરીથી પસંદ કરેલી યોજનાની કી આપે છે અને યોજનામાં ન હોય તેવી કી દૂર કરે છે.","Good to know":"જાણવા જેવું","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"વિન્ડોને તેના શીર્ષક પટ્ટીથી પકડીને ઉપર ખેંચો. સ્નેપ બાર નીચે સરકે છે; વિન્ડોને કોઈ ઝોન પર છોડો અને તે બરાબર તે જ વિસ્તાર ભરી દેશે. ફરી બહાર ખેંચતા તેને જૂનું કદ પાછું મળે છે.","Grab window A…":"વિન્ડો A પકડો…","Grid":"ગ્રિડ","Halves":"અડધા-અડધા","Hiding":"છુપાવવું","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"ખાલી જગ્યા ભરવા માટે કિનારી પર પકડી રાખો","Hold time":"પકડવાનો સમય","Hold to fill":"ભરવા માટે પકડી રાખો","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"કિનારી જગ્યાએ બેસે તે પહેલાં કેટલી નજીક આવવી પડે.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"કર્સરને કિનારીની કેટલી નજીક આવવું પડે.","How far the bar slides down":"બાર કેટલો નીચે સરકે છે","How it works":"આ કેવી રીતે કામ કરે છે","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"વિન્ડોને કિનારી સામે કેટલો સમય ટેકવવી પડે – હળવો ધક્કો. 0 = તરત.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"વધતા પહેલાં વિન્ડોને કિનારી પર કેટલો સમય રહેવું પડે.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"કેટલી વિન્ડો મુખ્ય વિસ્તાર વહેંચે છે (લેઆઉટ “મુખ્ય અને ઢગલો”).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"જો નીચે પહેલેથી વિન્ડો હોય, તો ઉપરની કિનારી મહત્તમ કરવાને બદલે ઉપરનો અડધો ભાગ આપે છે. અડધા અને ચોથા ભાગ પણ સ્નેપ કરેલી વિન્ડોને ઢાંકતા નથી.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"જો તમને KSnapUnity ગમે, તો તમે તેના વિકાસને ટેકો આપી શકો – આભાર!","In bar":"બારમાં","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"સ્નેપ બાર અને સ્ક્રીનની કિનારીઓથી સ્વતંત્ર.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"સ્નેપ બારથી સ્વતંત્ર. દરેક કિનારી અલગથી ચાલુ કરી શકાય છે.","Information":"માહિતી","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"સહજ, કુદરતી વિન્ડો વર્તન.","Join at the end":"અંતે જોડાય","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K એટલે KWin · Snap એટલે વધુ સ્માર્ટ સ્નેપિંગ · Unity એટલે બધું એક સિસ્ટમમાં","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE પાસે પોતાની સ્ક્રીન-કિનારી ક્રિયાઓ અને વિન્ડો સ્નેપિંગ છે. જો અહીં એ જ સુવિધા ચાલુ હોય, તો KDE ની બંધ કરો: સિસ્ટમ સેટિંગ્સ → વિન્ડો વ્યવસ્થાપન → સ્ક્રીનની કિનારીઓ, અને વિન્ડો વર્તન → ખસેડવું.","KDE's own edge tiling":"KDE નું પોતાનું કિનારી ટાઇલિંગ","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"કિનારીઓ પર KDEનું પોતાનું મોટું કરવું અને ટાઇલિંગ – તેની રૂપરેખા સાથે – KSnapUnity ચાલે ત્યારે થોભે છે, જેથી એક જ પૂર્વાવલોકન દેખાય. તમારી KDE સેટિંગ્સ બદલાતી નથી: આ બંધ કરો, KSnapUnity નિષ્ક્રિય કરો કે દૂર કરો અને KDEનું વર્તન પાછું આવે છે.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"KDE ની પોતાની સ્ક્રીન-કિનારી ક્રિયાઓ હજુ ચાલુ છે, તેથી એક જ ખેંચાણ પર બે સહાયકો પ્રતિક્રિયા આપે છે. સિસ્ટમ સેટિંગ્સ → વિન્ડો વ્યવસ્થાપન → સ્ક્રીનની કિનારીઓમાં “મહત્તમ કરો” અને “ટાઇલ” બંધ કરો.","KDE's own window snapping":"KDE નું પોતાનું વિન્ડો સ્નેપિંગ","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE નું પોતાનું વિન્ડો સ્નેપિંગ પણ ચાલુ છે. એકસરખા અનુભવ માટે સિસ્ટમ સેટિંગ્સ → વિન્ડો વ્યવસ્થાપન → વિન્ડો વર્તન → ખસેડવુંમાં તેના ઝોન “કંઈ નહીં” પર સેટ કરો.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"KDE ની શૉર્ટકટ સેવાએ જવાબ ન આપ્યો. તમે કી સિસ્ટમ સેટિંગ્સ → શૉર્ટકટ → KWin માં પણ સેટ કરી શકો છો.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – સેટિંગ્સ સંપાદક","Keep stacked windows in line":"સ્ટેક થયેલી વિન્ડોને એક લાઇનમાં રાખો","Keep the gap between windows":"વિન્ડો વચ્ચેનું અંતર જાળવો","Keep them":"રહેવા દો","Key scheme":"કી યોજના","Keyboard shortcuts":"કીબોર્ડ શૉર્ટકટ","Keys":"કી","Keys already in use":"પહેલેથી વપરાતી કી","Layout":"લેઆઉટ","Layout by number of windows":"વિન્ડોની સંખ્યા મુજબ લેઆઉટ","Layouts":"લેઆઉટ","Layouts per row":"દરેક હરોળમાં લેઆઉટ","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"ડાબી અને જમણી કિનારી: અડધી સ્ક્રીન","Left edge: left half":"ડાબી કિનારી: ડાબો અડધો ભાગ","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"100 % થી ઓછું એકલી વિન્ડોને વચ્ચે રાખે છે – પહોળી સ્ક્રીન પર સરસ.","License":"લાઇસન્સ","Light":"આછો","Linear":"રેખીય","Live preview":"લાઇવ પૂર્વાવલોકન","Load template…":"ટેમ્પ્લેટ લોડ કરો…","Magnet":"ચુંબક","Main + stack":"મુખ્ય + ઢગલો","Main and stack":"મુખ્ય અને ઢગલો","Main area bigger":"મોટો મુખ્ય વિસ્તાર","Main area on the right":"મુખ્ય વિસ્તાર જમણે","Main area smaller":"નાનો મુખ્ય વિસ્તાર","Main in the middle":"વચ્ચે મુખ્ય","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"ખેંચવા અને કી માટે મુખ્ય સ્વિચ.","Main window":"મુખ્ય વિન્ડો","Main windows":"મુખ્ય વિન્ડો","Main windows: %1":"મુખ્ય વિન્ડો: %1","Make it the main window":"મુખ્ય વિન્ડો બનાવો","Maximize":"મહત્તમ કરો","Maximize or restore":"મહત્તમ કરો અથવા પુનઃસ્થાપિત કરો","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + કી (KDE શૈલી)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + કી","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + કી","Minimize":"નાનું કરો","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"લેઆઉટને ઉલટાવે છે: મુખ્ય વિન્ડો જમણે, બાકીની ડાબે.","Mode":"મોડ","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"મોડ 1 – સ્નેપ બાર અને સ્ક્રીનની કિનારીઓ","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"મોડ 2 – આપમેળે ટાઇલિંગ","Modes":"મોડ","More ways":"વધુ રીતો","Motion curve":"ગતિ વળાંક","Move a window towards others…":"વિન્ડોને બીજી વિન્ડો તરફ ખસેડો…","Move the window one place back":"વિન્ડોને એક સ્થાન પાછળ ખસેડો","Move the window one place on":"વિન્ડોને એક સ્થાન આગળ ખસેડો","Name:":"નામ:","New layout":"નવું લેઆઉટ","New windows":"નવી વિન્ડો","Next tiling layout":"આગળનું ટાઇલિંગ લેઆઉટ","Next to the active window":"સક્રિય વિન્ડોની બાજુમાં","No key":"કોઈ કી નથી","No other window open":"બીજી કોઈ વિન્ડો ખુલ્લી નથી","No outer margin":"બહારનો હાંસિયો નહીં","No shortcuts":"કોઈ શૉર્ટકટ નથી","None":"કંઈ નહીં","None yet.":"હજી કોઈ નથી.","Off":"બંધ","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"બંધ = મોડ 1, ચાલુ = મોડ 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"બંધ: તટસ્થ ફ્રેમ – ફક્ત ચાલુ પૂર્વાવલોકનો માટે.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"બંધ: કી સોંપેલી રહે છે પણ કંઈ કરતી નથી.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"બંધ: વિન્ડો તમે મૂકો ત્યાં જ રહે છે. બાકીની સુવિધાઓ કોઈ પણ રીતે કામ કરે છે.","One at a time":"એક પછી એક","One closes – the others fill the gap":"એક બંધ થાય છે – બાકીની જગ્યા ભરે છે","One main window less":"એક મુખ્ય વિન્ડો ઓછી","One more main window":"એક વધુ મુખ્ય વિન્ડો","One window":"એક વિન્ડો","Only one mode is switched on.":"ફક્ત એક જ મોડ ચાલુ છે.","Open settings editor":"સેટિંગ્સ સંપાદક ખોલો","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"પહેલાં એપ ખોલો, પછી અહીં પસંદ કરો.","Open the layout builder":"લેઆઉટ બિલ્ડર ખોલો","Own layouts":"પોતાના લેઆઉટ","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"દરેક બાજુનો ખૂણા તરીકે ગણાતો ભાગ.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"KDE નું કિનારી ટાઇલિંગ અને તેનું પૂર્વાવલોકન થોભાવો","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"ચુંબક ચાલુ હોય ત્યારે KDE ના સ્નેપ ઝોન થોભાવો","Preview":"પૂર્વાવલોકન","Previews":"પૂર્વાવલોકન","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"વિન્ડોને સ્ક્રીનની કિનારી કે ખૂણા તરફ ધકેલો અને તે એ ભાગ ભરી દે છે. સ્નેપ બાર સાથે કે વગર કામ કરે છે.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"વિન્ડોને કિનારી કે ખૂણા તરફ ધકેલો: મહત્તમ, અડધા, ચોથા ભાગ.","Push delay":"ધક્કાનો વિલંબ","Quarters":"ચોથા ભાગ","Quick":"ઝડપી","Quick settings":"ઝડપી સેટિંગ્સ","Recommended values":"ભલામણ કરેલ મૂલ્યો","Remove":"દૂર કરો","Remove rule":"નિયમ દૂર કરો","Remove zone":"ઝોન દૂર કરો","Reset all":"બધું રીસેટ કરો","Reset all keys":"બધી કી રીસેટ કરો","Reset to default":"ડિફૉલ્ટ પર પાછું લાવો","Resistance against overlapping":"ઓવરલેપ સામે પ્રતિકાર","Resize touching windows together":"અડકતી વિન્ડોનું કદ સાથે બદલો","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"કદ બદલતાં પણ ચોંટે છે – અહીં પૂરી ઊંચાઈ સુધી","Restore":"પુનઃસ્થાપિત કરો","Restore default layouts":"મૂળભૂત લેઆઉટ પુનઃસ્થાપિત કરો","Restore default layouts?":"મૂળભૂત લેઆઉટ પુનઃસ્થાપિત કરવા?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"વિન્ડો બહાર ખેંચતા મૂળ કદ પાછું લાવો","Restore the size before snapping":"સ્નેપ પહેલાંનું કદ પુનઃસ્થાપિત કરો","Rows":"હરોળ","Save":"સાચવો","Screen edges":"સ્ક્રીનની કિનારીઓ","Screen edges on/off":"સ્ક્રીનની કિનારીઓ ચાલુ/બંધ","Screen edges preview":"સ્ક્રીનની કિનારીઓનું પૂર્વાવલોકન","Set":"સેટ કરો","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"બધી ક્રિયાઓની કી એકસાથે સેટ કરે છે. અલગ કી નીચે હજુ પણ બદલી શકો છો.","Settings":"સેટિંગ્સ","Settings file":"સેટિંગ્સ ફાઇલ","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"કદ બદલતી વખતે માઉસ ઝડપથી આગળ-પાછળ હલાવો અને બાકીની વિન્ડો પાછી કૂદે છે. એક દિશામાં ઝડપી ખેંચાણ તેમને ક્યારેય છોડતું નથી.","Shake to let go":"છોડવા માટે હલાવો","Shortcuts":"શૉર્ટકટ","Show a small handle first":"પહેલા નાનું હેન્ડલ બતાવો","Show layout and zone names":"લેઆઉટ અને ઝોનના નામ બતાવો","Show previews in the accent color":"પૂર્વાવલોકન ઍક્સેન્ટ રંગમાં બતાવો","Showing":"બતાવવું","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"કિનારી કે ખૂણે વિન્ડો ક્યાં આવશે તે બતાવે છે. બંધ: કોઈ પૂર્વાવલોકન નહીં.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"સ્નેપ બારનો કોઈ ઝોન હાઇલાઇટ હોય ત્યારે વિન્ડો ક્યાં આવશે તે બતાવે છે. બંધ: કોઈ પૂર્વાવલોકન નહીં.","Sidebar + grid":"બાજુપટ્ટી + ગ્રીડ","Single zone":"એક ઝોન","Six tiles":"છ ટાઇલ","Size & shape":"કદ અને આકાર","Size of the main area":"મુખ્ય વિસ્તારનું કદ","Slide-in duration":"અંદર આવવાનો સમયગાળો","Slide-out duration":"બહાર જવાનો સમયગાળો","Smart arranging and detection.":"સ્માર્ટ ગોઠવણી અને ઓળખ.","Smart fill":"સ્માર્ટ ભરણ","Smooth (default)":"સરળ (મૂળભૂત)","Snap bar":"સ્નેપ બાર","Snap bar and screen edges":"સ્નેપ બાર અને સ્ક્રીનની કિનારીઓ","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"સ્નેપ બાર અને કિનારીઓ બંધ છે – ફક્ત મોડ 2 ચાલે છે અને મોડ શૉર્ટકટ કંઈ કરતો નથી.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"સ્નેપ બાર અને સ્ક્રીનની કિનારીઓ આપમેળે ટાઇલિંગમાં વિઘ્ન કરે છે. તેથી તે બે મોડ તરીકે ચાલે છે – શૉર્ટકટથી કે અહીંથી બદલો.","Snap bar colors:":"સ્નેપ બારના રંગો:","Snap bar on/off":"સ્નેપ બાર ચાલુ/બંધ","Snap bar preview":"સ્નેપ બારનું પૂર્વાવલોકન","Snap bar size":"સ્નેપ બારનું કદ","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"સ્નેપ બાર, સ્ક્રીનની કિનારીઓ, વિન્ડો ચુંબક, શૉર્ટકટ અને વિન્ડો અદલાબદલી.","Snap distance":"સ્નેપ અંતર","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"વિભાજકો સ્નેપ કરો (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"સ્નેપ લેઆઉટ અને આપમેળે ટાઇલિંગ.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"સક્રિય વિન્ડોને કી સંયોજનોથી સ્નેપ કરો.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"સક્રિય વિન્ડોને કીબોર્ડથી સ્નેપ કરો. આ સામાન્ય KDE વૈશ્વિક શૉર્ટકટ છે – તે સિસ્ટમ સેટિંગ્સ → શૉર્ટકટ → KWin માં પણ મળે છે.","Snap to the bottom half":"નીચેના અડધા ભાગમાં સ્નેપ કરો","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"નીચે-ડાબા ચોથા ભાગમાં સ્નેપ કરો","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"નીચે-જમણા ચોથા ભાગમાં સ્નેપ કરો","Snap to the center third":"વચ્ચેના ત્રીજા ભાગમાં સ્નેપ કરો","Snap to the left half":"ડાબા અડધા ભાગમાં સ્નેપ કરો","Snap to the left third":"ડાબા ત્રીજા ભાગમાં સ્નેપ કરો","Snap to the left two thirds":"ડાબા બે-તૃતીયાંશમાં સ્નેપ કરો","Snap to the right half":"જમણા અડધા ભાગમાં સ્નેપ કરો","Snap to the right third":"જમણા ત્રીજા ભાગમાં સ્નેપ કરો","Snap to the right two thirds":"જમણા બે-તૃતીયાંશમાં સ્નેપ કરો","Snap to the top half":"ઉપરના અડધા ભાગમાં સ્નેપ કરો","Snap to the top-left quarter":"ઉપર-ડાબા ચોથા ભાગમાં સ્નેપ કરો","Snap to the top-right quarter":"ઉપર-જમણા ચોથા ભાગમાં સ્નેપ કરો","Snapping":"સ્નેપિંગ","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"સ્નેપિંગ અને આપમેળે ટાઇલિંગ બે મોડ તરીકે ચાલે છે – એક શૉર્ટકટ બંને વચ્ચે બદલે છે.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"આ રીતે ફક્ત એક જ ચુંબક વિન્ડો ખેંચે છે. તમારી KDE સેટિંગ્સ બદલાતી નથી: આ બંધ કરો, KSnapUnity નિષ્ક્રિય કરો કે દૂર કરો અને KDEનું સ્નેપિંગ પાછું આવે છે.","Soft":"મૃદુ","Spacing":"અંતર","Spiral":"સર્પિલ","Split side by side":"બાજુ-બાજુમાં વિભાજિત કરો","Split top and bottom":"ઉપર-નીચે વિભાજિત કરો","Stack + main":"ઢગલો + મુખ્ય","Stick to other windows":"બીજી વિન્ડોને ચોંટો","Stick to the screen edges":"સ્ક્રીનની કિનારીઓને ચોંટો","Sticky edges":"ચોંટતી કિનારીઓ","Support KSnapUnity":"KSnapUnityને ટેકો આપો","Swap":"અદલાબદલી","Swap windows":"વિન્ડો અદલાબદલી","Swap with the window above":"ઉપરની વિન્ડો સાથે અદલાબદલી","Swap with the window below":"નીચેની વિન્ડો સાથે અદલાબદલી","Swap with the window on the left":"ડાબી વિન્ડો સાથે અદલાબદલી","Swap with the window on the right":"જમણી વિન્ડો સાથે અદલાબદલી","Switch mode":"મોડ બદલો","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"મોડ બદલો (સ્નેપિંગ / ટાઇલિંગ)","Switch modes with:":"મોડ બદલવાની કી:","Switch the layout by itself":"લેઆઉટ આપમેળે બદલો","Switched off":"બંધ","System":"સિસ્ટમ","Take it over":"લઈ લો","Take over all":"બધી લઈ લો","Take the main place":"મુખ્ય સ્થાન લે","Test animation":"એનિમેશન ચકાસો","Test on screen":"સ્ક્રીન પર ચકાસો","Test the snap bar":"સ્નેપ બાર અજમાવો","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"મૂળભૂત મૂલ્યો Windows 11 પર આધારિત છે.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"સ્નેપ ક્રિયાઓ સ્નેપ બાર જેવાં જ અંતર વાપરે છે અને સ્નેપ પહેલાંનું કદ યાદ રાખે છે: “સ્નેપ પહેલાંનું કદ પુનઃસ્થાપિત કરો” તેને પાછું લાવે છે.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"આ એપ્સ ક્યારેય ગોઠવાતી નથી અને પોતાની જગ્યા રાખે છે. સંવાદો હંમેશા તરે છે.","Thirds":"ત્રીજા ભાગ","Three columns":"ત્રણ સ્તંભ","Thumbnail width":"થંબનેલની પહોળાઈ","Tiling":"ટાઇલિંગ","Tip":"ટીપ","Top / bottom":"ઉપર / નીચે","Top edge":"ઉપરની કિનારી","Top edge: full screen":"ઉપરની કિનારી: પૂર્ણ સ્ક્રીન","Top edge: maximize":"ઉપરની કિનારી: મોટું કરો","Top edge: top half":"ઉપરની કિનારી: ઉપરનો અડધો ભાગ","Top half":"ઉપરનો અડધો ભાગ","Trigger distance from the top edge":"ઉપરની ધારથી ટ્રિગર અંતર","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"જો તમને KDE ની પોતાની રૂપરેખા વધુ ગમે તો આ બંધ કરો – પછી ઉપર સ્ક્રીનની કિનારીઓનું પૂર્વાવલોકન બંધ કરો.","Two thirds":"બે તૃતીયાંશ","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"બે વિન્ડો જગ્યા બદલે છે – એકને બીજી પર છોડો અથવા કી વાપરો.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"બે વિન્ડો જગ્યા બદલે છે: એકને બીજી પર છોડો, અથવા કી વડે.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"કીબોર્ડ શૉર્ટકટ વાપરો","Use screen edges":"સ્ક્રીનની કિનારીઓ વાપરો","Use the system accent color":"સિસ્ટમનો એક્સેન્ટ રંગ વાપરો","Use the window magnet":"વિન્ડો ચુંબક વાપરો","Usual combinations":"સામાન્ય સંયોજનો","Version":"આવૃત્તિ","Wanted for: %1":"આ માટે જોઈએ: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"જ્યારે વિન્ડો ખૂલે, બંધ થાય કે અદલાબદલી થાય, ત્યારે બાકીની કૂદ્યા વિના સરળતાથી ખસે છે.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"કોઈ વિન્ડોનું કદ બદલો ત્યારે તેને અડકતી વિન્ડો સહિયારી કિનારી સાથે ખસેડે છે – કંઈ ઢંકાતું નથી, ગેપ પડતો નથી.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"કદ બદલતી વખતે સાથે ન આવતી વિન્ડો પારદર્શક બતાવાય છે.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"વિન્ડો ખસેડતી કે તેનું કદ બદલતી વખતે તેની કિનારીઓ નજીકની વિન્ડો અને સ્ક્રીનની કિનારીઓને ચોંટે છે.","Width":"પહોળાઈ","Window":"વિન્ડો","Window magnet":"વિન્ડો ચુંબક","Window magnet on/off":"વિન્ડો ચુંબક ચાલુ/બંધ","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"એકબીજા ઉપર રહેલી વિન્ડો ડાબી અને જમણી કિનારીઓ સાથે રાખે છે, બાજુબાજુની વિન્ડો ઉપર અને નીચેની.","Windows glide to their place":"વિન્ડો સરળતાથી પોતાની જગ્યાએ સરકે છે","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"વિન્ડો એકબીજાને અને સ્ક્રીનની કિનારીઓને ચોંટે છે.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"વિન્ડો એકબીજાને અડકવાને બદલે સામાન્ય પાનાના “વિન્ડો વચ્ચેનું અંતર” પર અટકે છે.","Yes":"હા","Your own combination":"તમારું પોતાનું સંયોજન","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"તમારા પોતાના લેઆઉટ અને તેમનો ક્રમ ખોવાઈ જશે.","Zone %1":"ઝોન %1","for KWin · v%1":"KWin માટે · v%1","windows:":"વિન્ડો:","“%1” will be removed.":"\"%1\" દૂર કરવામાં આવશે.","…drag it onto window B…":"…તેને વિન્ડો B પર ખેંચો…","…in every direction":"…દરેક દિશામાં","…let go: they trade places":"…છોડો: તેઓ જગ્યા બદલે છે","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…પડોશીઓ તેની સાથે મોટા-નાના થાય છે","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ તૈયાર – સેટિંગ્સ સંપાદક ખોલવા OK ક્લિક કરો."},"he":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (עותק)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 בשימוש על ידי „%2“.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 מתוך %2 אזורים","0 = all in one row":"0 = כולן בשורה אחת","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>מצב 1</b><br/>סרגל ההצמדה וקצוות המסך","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>מצב 2</b><br/>ריצוף אוטומטי","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"חלון יחיד משתמש בכל המסך, גם כשמוגדרים שוליים.","A new window joins":"מצטרף חלון חדש","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"דחיפה קצרה נותנת חצי או רבע. החזיקו את החלון בקצה עוד רגע והוא גדל עד החלון הבא – התצוגה המקדימה מראה זאת.","A single window":"חלון יחיד","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"חלון נעצר בקצה של חלון אחר, גם כשמזיזים אותו מהר. נער את העכבר או המשך לדחוף רגע כדי לשחרר. 0 = חלונות יכולים לחפוף בחופשיות.","About & Help":"על אודות ועזרה","Accent color":"צבע הדגשה","Active":"פעיל","Active mode":"מצב פעיל","Active width along the top edge":"רוחב פעיל לאורך הקצה העליון","Add an open application":"הוספת יישום פתוח","Add rule":"הוספת כלל","All window features in one system.":"כל תכונות החלונות במערכת אחת.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"משתנה גם כשמשנים ידנית את גודל החלון הראשי.","Also while resizing":"גם בזמן שינוי גודל","Always floating":"צפים תמיד","Animation":"הנפשה","Appearance":"מראה","Apply":"החלה","Arrange windows":"סידור חלונות","Arrange windows automatically":"סידור חלונות אוטומטי","Author":"יוצר","Automatic tiling":"ריצוף אוטומטי","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"הריצוף האוטומטי כבוי – רק מצב 1 פועל וקיצור המצב לא עושה דבר.","Automatic tiling off":"ריצוף אוטומטי כבוי","Automatic tiling on":"ריצוף אוטומטי פועל","Automatic tiling on/off":"ריצוף אוטומטי פועל/כבוי","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"ריצוף אוטומטי, החלפת חלונות, קיצורים והמגנט לחלונות צפים.","Background opacity":"אטימות הרקע","Behavior & Animation":"התנהגות והנפשה","Bottom edge: bottom half":"הקצה התחתון: החצי התחתון","Bouncy":"קופצנית","Buy me a coffee":"קנו לי קפה","Cancel":"ביטול","Center focus":"מיקוד במרכז","Center the window":"מירכוז החלון","Change":"שינוי","Change key":"שינוי מקש","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"את המקש משנים בעורך ההגדרות. שני המצבים צריכים ריצוף אוטומטי ואת הסרגל או קצוות המסך.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"שנה אותם בעמוד „קיצורי מקלדת”. בריצוף אוטומטי החלונות מחליפים גם את מקומם בסדר.","Choose…":"בחירה…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"לחיצה על אזור בוחרת אותו · לחיצה כפולה מפצלת · גררו את המפרידים","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"לחצו או הקישו %1 כדי להחליף מצב.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"לחצו ואז אישור – עורך ההגדרות נפתח.","Close":"סגירה","Close by, the edges stick together":"מקרוב, הקצוות נדבקים זה לזה","Color scheme":"ערכת צבעים","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"צבעים, גודל וצורה של הסרגל.","Columns":"עמודות","Corner radius":"רדיוס הפינות","Corner size":"גודל פינה","Corner: a quarter":"פינה: רבע","Corners: quarter of the screen":"פינות: רבע מסך","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + מקש (ברירת מחדל)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + לוח מספרים","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + מקש","Custom color":"צבע מותאם אישית","Custom layout %1":"פריסה מותאמת %1","Dark":"כהה","Delay before hiding":"השהיה לפני הסתרה","Delay before showing":"השהיה לפני הצגה","Delete":"מחיקה","Delete layout?":"למחוק את הפריסה?","Distance at which the handle appears":"המרחק שבו הידית מופיעה","Distance before the bar hides again":"המרחק עד שהסרגל נעלם שוב","Distance to the edge":"מרחק מהקצה","Donate with PayPal":"תרומה דרך PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"גררו קצה משותף…","Drag a window against an edge…":"גררו חלון אל קצה…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"גררו חלון על אחר כדי להחליף ביניהם. שחרור על הסרגל או על קצה המסך משאיר אותו צף; „הנח לחלון לצוף“ מחזיר אותו. המרווחים מגיעים מעמוד כללי.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"גררו חלון מעל מרכזו של חלון אחר – התצוגה מראה שני חצים – ושחררו. בריצוף אוטומטי מספיק כל מקום מעל החלון האחר.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"גררו חלון לקצה העליון של המסך ושחררו אותו על אזור.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"גררו את הכרטיסים כדי לשנות את הסדר בסרגל. לחיצה כפולה על כרטיס פותחת אותו לעריכה.","Drop a window onto another one":"שחרור חלון על חלון אחר","Drop the window onto a zone":"שחררו את החלון על אזור","Duplicate":"שכפול","Duration":"משך","Dwindle":"ספירלה פנימה","Dynamic":"דינמית","Edges and corners":"קצוות ופינות","Edit":"עריכה","Edit layout":"עריכת פריסה","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"אפשר להפעיל ולכבות כל תכונה בנפרד.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"כל פריסה שבונים בעמוד הפריסות יכולה גם לסדר חלונות – היא מופיעה למעלה. חלון 1 מקבל את אזור 1 וכן הלאה; חלונות נוספים חולקים את האזור האחרון. כשיש פחות חלונות מאזורים משמשת „ראשי וערימה“, כדי שלא יהיו חורים.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"כל חלון מוצא את מקומו בעצמו, כמו במנהל חלונות מרצף.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"כל חלון מוצא את מקומו על המסך בעצמו. חלונות חדשים מצטרפים, וסגורים מפנים מקום לאחרים.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"דוגמה: שני חלונות זה לצד זה, משלושה ראשי וערימה, מחמישה רשת. בלי כלל מתאים משמשת הפריסה שנבחרה למעלה.","Fade in and out":"עמעום בכניסה וביציאה","Fade the other windows":"עמעום החלונות האחרים","Features":"תכונות","Feel":"תחושה","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"התאמה סביב חלונות שכבר הוצמדו","Fits the way you work.":"מתאים לדרך העבודה שלכם.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"הנח לחלון לצוף (צא מהריצוף)","Four quarters":"ארבעה רבעים","From":"מ־","Fullscreen":"מסך מלא","Gap between windows":"מרווח בין חלונות","Gap to the screen edge":"מרווח מקצה המסך","General":"כללי","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"נותן לכל פעולה שוב את המקש מהערכה שנבחרה ומסיר מקשים שאין בערכה.","Good to know":"כדאי לדעת","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"תפסו חלון בשורת הכותרת וגררו אותו למעלה. הסרגל גולש למטה; שחררו את החלון על אזור והוא ימלא בדיוק את השטח הזה. כשתמשכו אותו שוב החוצה, הוא יחזור לגודלו הקודם.","Grab window A…":"תפסו את חלון A…","Grid":"רשת","Halves":"חצאים","Hiding":"הסתרה","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"החזקה בקצה למילוי השטח הפנוי","Hold time":"זמן החזקה","Hold to fill":"החזקה למילוי","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"כמה קרוב קצה צריך להגיע לפני שהוא ננעל במקומו.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"כמה קרוב הסמן צריך להגיע לקצה.","How far the bar slides down":"כמה רחוק הסרגל יורד","How it works":"איך זה עובד","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"כמה זמן החלון צריך להישען על הקצה – דחיפה קטנה. 0 = מיד.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"כמה זמן החלון צריך להישאר בקצה לפני שהוא גדל.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"כמה חלונות חולקים את האזור הראשי (פריסת „ראשי וערימה”).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"אם כבר יש חלון למטה, הקצה העליון נותן את החצי העליון במקום הגדלה. גם חצאים ורבעים לא מכסים חלונות מוצמדים.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"אם KSnapUnity מוצא חן בעיניכם, אפשר לתמוך בפיתוח – תודה!","In bar":"בסרגל","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"בלתי תלוי בסרגל ובקצוות המסך.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"בלתי תלוי בסרגל. כל קצה ניתן להפעלה בנפרד.","Information":"מידע","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"התנהגות חלונות טבעית ואינטואיטיבית.","Join at the end":"מצטרפים בסוף","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K עבור KWin · Snap עבור הצמדה חכמה יותר · Unity עבור הכול במערכת אחת","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"ל-KDE יש פעולות קצה מסך והצמדת חלונות משלו. אם אותה תכונה פעילה כאן, כבו את זו של KDE: הגדרות מערכת ← ניהול חלונות ← קצוות מסך, וגם התנהגות חלונות ← הזזה.","KDE's own edge tiling":"ריצוף הקצוות של KDE עצמו","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"ההגדלה והריצוף של KDE עצמו בקצוות – עם המתאר – מושהים כל עוד KSnapUnity פועל, כך שמופיעה תצוגה מקדימה אחת בלבד. הגדרות KDE שלכם לא משתנות: כבו זאת, השביתו או הסירו את KSnapUnity וההתנהגות של KDE חוזרת.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"פעולות קצה המסך של KDE עדיין פעילות, ולכן שני עוזרים מגיבים לאותה גרירה. כבו את „הגדלה“ ו„ריצוף“ בהגדרות מערכת ← ניהול חלונות ← קצוות מסך.","KDE's own window snapping":"הצמדת החלונות של KDE עצמו","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"גם הצמדת החלונות של KDE פעילה. לתחושה אחידה, הגדירו את האזורים שלה ל„ללא“ בהגדרות מערכת ← ניהול חלונות ← התנהגות חלונות ← הזזה.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"שירות הקיצורים של KDE לא הגיב. עדיין אפשר להגדיר את המקשים בהגדרות מערכת ← קיצורי דרך ← KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – עורך הגדרות","Keep stacked windows in line":"שמירה על חלונות מוערמים בקו אחד","Keep the gap between windows":"שמירה על מרווח בין חלונות","Keep them":"להשאיר","Key scheme":"ערכת מקשים","Keyboard shortcuts":"קיצורי מקלדת","Keys":"מקשים","Keys already in use":"מקשים שכבר בשימוש","Layout":"פריסה","Layout by number of windows":"פריסה לפי מספר החלונות","Layouts":"פריסות","Layouts per row":"פריסות בכל שורה","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"הקצה השמאלי והימני: חצי מסך","Left edge: left half":"קצה שמאלי: חצי שמאלי","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"פחות מ־100 % שומר חלון יחיד במרכז – יפה במסכים רחבים.","License":"רישיון","Light":"בהירה","Linear":"ליניארית","Live preview":"תצוגה מקדימה חיה","Load template…":"טעינת תבנית…","Magnet":"מגנט","Main + stack":"ראשי + ערימה","Main and stack":"ראשי וערימה","Main area bigger":"אזור ראשי גדול יותר","Main area on the right":"האזור הראשי מימין","Main area smaller":"אזור ראשי קטן יותר","Main in the middle":"ראשי באמצע","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"מתג ראשי לגרירה ולמקשים.","Main window":"חלון ראשי","Main windows":"חלונות ראשיים","Main windows: %1":"חלונות ראשיים: %1","Make it the main window":"הפוך לחלון הראשי","Maximize":"הגדלה","Maximize or restore":"הגדלה או שחזור","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + מקש (סגנון KDE)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + מקש","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + מקש","Minimize":"מזעור","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"משקף את הפריסה: החלון הראשי מימין, האחרים משמאל.","Mode":"מצב","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"מצב 1 – סרגל ההצמדה וקצוות המסך","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"מצב 2 – ריצוף אוטומטי","Modes":"מצבים","More ways":"דרכים נוספות","Motion curve":"עקומת תנועה","Move a window towards others…":"הזיזו חלון לעבר אחרים…","Move the window one place back":"הזזת החלון מקום אחד אחורה","Move the window one place on":"הזזת החלון מקום אחד קדימה","Name:":"שם:","New layout":"פריסה חדשה","New windows":"חלונות חדשים","Next tiling layout":"פריסת הריצוף הבאה","Next to the active window":"ליד החלון הפעיל","No key":"אין מקש","No other window open":"אין חלון פתוח אחר","No outer margin":"בלי שוליים חיצוניים","No shortcuts":"ללא קיצורים","None":"ללא","None yet.":"עדיין אין.","Off":"כבוי","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"כבוי = מצב 1, פועל = מצב 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"כבוי: מסגרת ניטרלית – רק לתצוגות המקדימות שמופעלות.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"כבוי: המקשים נשארים מוקצים אך אינם עושים דבר.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"כבוי: החלונות נשארים היכן ששמת אותם. שאר התכונות עובדות בכל מקרה.","One at a time":"אחד בכל פעם","One closes – the others fill the gap":"אחד נסגר – האחרים ממלאים את הרווח","One main window less":"חלון ראשי אחד פחות","One more main window":"עוד חלון ראשי אחד","One window":"חלון אחד","Only one mode is switched on.":"רק מצב אחד מופעל.","Open settings editor":"פתיחת עורך ההגדרות","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"פתחו קודם את היישום ואז בחרו אותו כאן.","Open the layout builder":"פתיחת בונה הפריסות","Own layouts":"פריסות משלכם","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"החלק מכל צד שנחשב פינה.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"השהיית ריצוף הקצוות של KDE והתצוגה המקדימה שלו","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"השהיית אזורי ההצמדה של KDE כל עוד המגנט פעיל","Preview":"תצוגה מקדימה","Previews":"תצוגות מקדימות","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"דחפו חלון אל קצה או פינה של המסך והוא ימלא את החלק הזה. עובד עם הסרגל או בלעדיו.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"דחיפת חלון אל קצה או פינה: הגדלה, חצאים, רבעים.","Push delay":"השהיית דחיפה","Quarters":"רבעים","Quick":"מהירה","Quick settings":"הגדרות מהירות","Recommended values":"ערכים מומלצים","Remove":"הסרה","Remove rule":"הסרת כלל","Remove zone":"הסרת אזור","Reset all":"איפוס הכול","Reset all keys":"איפוס כל המקשים","Reset to default":"איפוס לברירת המחדל","Resistance against overlapping":"התנגדות לחפיפה","Resize touching windows together":"שינוי גודל משותף לחלונות שנוגעים זה בזה","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"גם שינוי גודל נצמד – כאן לגובה מלא","Restore":"שחזור","Restore default layouts":"שחזור פריסות ברירת המחדל","Restore default layouts?":"לשחזר את פריסות ברירת המחדל?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"שחזור הגודל המקורי בעת משיכת החלון החוצה","Restore the size before snapping":"שחזור הגודל שלפני ההצמדה","Rows":"שורות","Save":"שמירה","Screen edges":"קצוות המסך","Screen edges on/off":"הפעלה/כיבוי של קצוות המסך","Screen edges preview":"תצוגה מקדימה של קצוות המסך","Set":"הגדרה","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"מגדירה את המקשים של כל הפעולות בבת אחת. עדיין אפשר לשנות מקשים בודדים למטה.","Settings":"הגדרות","Settings file":"קובץ הגדרות","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"בזמן שינוי גודל נער את העכבר מהר הלוך ושוב והחלונות האחרים קופצים חזרה. משיכה מהירה לכיוון אחד לעולם לא משחררת אותם.","Shake to let go":"ניעור לשחרור","Shortcuts":"קיצורים","Show a small handle first":"הצגת ידית קטנה תחילה","Show layout and zone names":"הצגת שמות פריסות ואזורים","Show previews in the accent color":"הצגת תצוגות מקדימות בצבע ההדגשה","Showing":"הצגה","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"מראה היכן החלון ינחת בקצה או בפינה. כבוי: אין תצוגה מקדימה בכלל.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"מראה היכן החלון ינחת כל עוד אזור בסרגל מודגש. כבוי: אין תצוגה מקדימה בכלל.","Sidebar + grid":"סרגל צד + רשת","Single zone":"אזור יחיד","Six tiles":"שישה אריחים","Size & shape":"גודל וצורה","Size of the main area":"גודל האזור הראשי","Slide-in duration":"משך הכניסה","Slide-out duration":"משך היציאה","Smart arranging and detection.":"סידור וזיהוי חכמים.","Smart fill":"מילוי חכם","Smooth (default)":"חלקה (ברירת מחדל)","Snap bar":"הסרגל","Snap bar and screen edges":"סרגל ההצמדה וקצוות המסך","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"הסרגל והקצוות כבויים – רק מצב 2 פועל וקיצור המצב לא עושה דבר.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"הסרגל וקצוות המסך מפריעים לריצוף האוטומטי. לכן הם פועלים כשני מצבים – החליפו בקיצור או כאן.","Snap bar colors:":"צבעי הסרגל:","Snap bar on/off":"הפעלה/כיבוי של הסרגל","Snap bar preview":"תצוגה מקדימה של הסרגל","Snap bar size":"גודל הסרגל","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"סרגל ההצמדה, קצוות המסך, מגנט חלונות, קיצורים והחלפת חלונות.","Snap distance":"מרחק הצמדה","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"הצמדת מפרידים (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"פריסות הצמדה וריצוף אוטומטי.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"הצמדת החלון הפעיל בצירופי מקשים.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"הצמדת החלון הפעיל מהמקלדת. אלה קיצורי דרך גלובליים רגילים של KDE – תמצאו אותם גם בהגדרות מערכת ← קיצורי דרך ← KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"הצמדה לחצי התחתון","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"הצמדה לרבע השמאלי התחתון","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"הצמדה לרבע הימני התחתון","Snap to the center third":"הצמדה לשליש האמצעי","Snap to the left half":"הצמדה לחצי השמאלי","Snap to the left third":"הצמדה לשליש השמאלי","Snap to the left two thirds":"הצמדה לשני השלישים השמאליים","Snap to the right half":"הצמדה לחצי הימני","Snap to the right third":"הצמדה לשליש הימני","Snap to the right two thirds":"הצמדה לשני השלישים הימניים","Snap to the top half":"הצמדה לחצי העליון","Snap to the top-left quarter":"הצמדה לרבע השמאלי העליון","Snap to the top-right quarter":"הצמדה לרבע הימני העליון","Snapping":"הצמדה","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"הצמדה וריצוף אוטומטי פועלים כשני מצבים – קיצור אחד מחליף ביניהם.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"כך רק מגנט אחד מושך חלון. הגדרות KDE שלכם לא משתנות: כבו זאת, השביתו או הסירו את KSnapUnity וההצמדה של KDE חוזרת.","Soft":"רכה","Spacing":"מרווחים","Spiral":"ספירלה","Split side by side":"פיצול זה לצד זה","Split top and bottom":"פיצול למעלה ולמטה","Stack + main":"ערימה + ראשי","Stick to other windows":"היצמדות לחלונות אחרים","Stick to the screen edges":"היצמדות לקצוות המסך","Sticky edges":"קצוות דביקים","Support KSnapUnity":"תמכו ב־KSnapUnity","Swap":"החלפה","Swap windows":"החלפת חלונות","Swap with the window above":"החלפה עם החלון מעל","Swap with the window below":"החלפה עם החלון מתחת","Swap with the window on the left":"החלפה עם החלון משמאל","Swap with the window on the right":"החלפה עם החלון מימין","Switch mode":"החלפת מצב","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"החלפת מצב (הצמדה / ריצוף)","Switch modes with:":"החלפת מצב עם:","Switch the layout by itself":"החלפת פריסה מעצמה","Switched off":"כבוי","System":"מערכת","Take it over":"השתלטות","Take over all":"השתלטות על הכול","Take the main place":"לוקחים את המקום הראשי","Test animation":"בדיקת ההנפשה","Test on screen":"בדיקה על המסך","Test the snap bar":"ניסיון הסרגל","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"ערכי ברירת המחדל מבוססים על Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"פעולות ההצמדה משתמשות באותם מרווחים כמו הסרגל וזוכרות את הגודל שלפני ההצמדה: „שחזור הגודל שלפני ההצמדה“ מחזיר אותו.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"יישומים אלה לעולם אינם מסודרים ושומרים על מקומם. תיבות דו־שיח צפות תמיד.","Thirds":"שלישים","Three columns":"שלוש עמודות","Thumbnail width":"רוחב התמונות הממוזערות","Tiling":"ריצוף","Tip":"עצה","Top / bottom":"למעלה / למטה","Top edge":"הקצה העליון","Top edge: full screen":"קצה עליון: מסך מלא","Top edge: maximize":"קצה עליון: הגדלה","Top edge: top half":"קצה עליון: חצי עליון","Top half":"החצי העליון","Trigger distance from the top edge":"מרחק ההפעלה מהקצה העליון","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"כבו זאת אם אתם מעדיפים את המתאר של KDE – ואז כבו למעלה את התצוגה המקדימה של קצוות המסך.","Two thirds":"שני שלישים","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"שני חלונות מחליפים מקומות – שחררו אחד על השני או השתמשו במקשים.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"שני חלונות מחליפים מקומות: שחררו אחד על השני, או במקש.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"שימוש בקיצורי מקלדת","Use screen edges":"שימוש בקצוות המסך","Use the system accent color":"שימוש בצבע ההדגשה של המערכת","Use the window magnet":"שימוש במגנט חלונות","Usual combinations":"צירופים נפוצים","Version":"גרסה","Wanted for: %1":"נדרש עבור: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"כשחלון נפתח, נסגר או מתחלף, האחרים זזים בעדינות במקום לקפוץ.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"כשמשנים גודל של חלון, חלונות שנוגעים בו מזיזים איתו את הקצה המשותף – שום דבר לא חופף ולא נפתח רווח.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"בזמן שינוי הגודל, חלונות שאינם עוקבים מוצגים שקופים.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"בזמן הזזה או שינוי גודל של חלון, קצותיו נצמדים לחלונות סמוכים ולקצוות המסך.","Width":"רוחב","Window":"חלון","Window magnet":"מגנט חלונות","Window magnet on/off":"הפעלה/כיבוי של מגנט החלונות","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"חלונות זה מעל זה שומרים על הקצוות השמאליים והימניים יחד, וחלונות זה לצד זה על העליונים והתחתונים.","Windows glide to their place":"החלונות גולשים למקומם","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"חלונות נצמדים זה לזה ולקצוות המסך.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"החלונות נעצרים ב„מרווח בין חלונות“ מעמוד כללי במקום לגעת זה בזה.","Yes":"כן","Your own combination":"צירוף משלך","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"הפריסות שלכם והסדר שלהן יאבדו.","Zone %1":"אזור %1","for KWin · v%1":"ל-KWin · גרסה %1","windows:":"חלונות:","“%1” will be removed.":"„%1” תוסר.","…drag it onto window B…":"…גררו אותו על חלון B…","…in every direction":"…לכל כיוון","…let go: they trade places":"…שחררו: הם מחליפים מקומות","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…השכנים גדלים וקטנים איתו","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ מוכן – לחצו אישור כדי לפתוח את עורך ההגדרות."},"hi":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (प्रति)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 का उपयोग \"%2\" कर रहा है।","%1 of %2 zones":"%2 में से %1 ज़ोन","0 = all in one row":"0 = सभी एक ही पंक्ति में","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>मोड 1</b><br/>स्नैप बार और स्क्रीन के किनारे","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>मोड 2</b><br/>स्वचालित टाइलिंग","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"अकेली विंडो पूरी स्क्रीन लेती है, हाशिया सेट होने पर भी।","A new window joins":"एक नई विंडो जुड़ती है","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"छोटा धक्का आधा या चौथाई देता है। विंडो को किनारे पर थोड़ा और देर रखें और वह अगली विंडो तक बढ़ जाती है – पूर्वावलोकन इसे दिखाता है।","A single window":"एक अकेली विंडो","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"विंडो दूसरी विंडो के किनारे पर रुक जाती है, तेज़ी से हिलाने पर भी। छुड़ाने के लिए माउस हिलाएँ या एक पल और धकेलें। 0 = विंडो आज़ादी से एक-दूसरे पर आ सकती हैं।","About & Help":"परिचय और सहायता","Accent color":"एक्सेंट रंग","Active":"सक्रिय","Active mode":"सक्रिय मोड","Active width along the top edge":"ऊपरी किनारे के साथ सक्रिय चौड़ाई","Add an open application":"खुला ऐप जोड़ें","Add rule":"नियम जोड़ें","All window features in one system.":"सभी विंडो सुविधाएँ एक सिस्टम में।","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"जब आप हाथ से मुख्य विंडो का आकार बदलते हैं तब भी बदलता है।","Also while resizing":"आकार बदलते समय भी","Always floating":"हमेशा तैरती","Animation":"एनिमेशन","Appearance":"रूप-रंग","Apply":"लागू करें","Arrange windows":"विंडो व्यवस्थित करें","Arrange windows automatically":"विंडो अपने आप व्यवस्थित करें","Author":"लेखक","Automatic tiling":"स्वचालित टाइलिंग","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"स्वचालित टाइलिंग बंद है – केवल मोड 1 चलता है और मोड शॉर्टकट कुछ नहीं करता।","Automatic tiling off":"स्वचालित टाइलिंग बंद","Automatic tiling on":"स्वचालित टाइलिंग चालू","Automatic tiling on/off":"स्वचालित टाइलिंग चालू/बंद","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"स्वचालित टाइलिंग, विंडो अदला-बदली, शॉर्टकट और तैरती विंडो के लिए चुंबक।","Background opacity":"पृष्ठभूमि की अपारदर्शिता","Behavior & Animation":"व्यवहार और एनिमेशन","Bottom edge: bottom half":"निचला किनारा: निचला आधा","Bouncy":"उछालदार","Buy me a coffee":"मुझे एक कॉफ़ी पिलाएँ","Cancel":"रद्द करें","Center focus":"बीच में फ़ोकस","Center the window":"विंडो को बीच में करें","Change":"बदलें","Change key":"कुंजी बदलें","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"कुंजी सेटिंग्स संपादक में बदलें। दोनों मोड के लिए स्वचालित टाइलिंग और स्नैप बार या स्क्रीन के किनारे चालू होने चाहिए।","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"इन्हें “कीबोर्ड शॉर्टकट” पेज पर बदलें। स्वचालित टाइलिंग में विंडो क्रम में भी जगह बदलती हैं।","Choose…":"चुनें…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"चुनने के लिए ज़ोन पर क्लिक करें · बाँटने के लिए डबल-क्लिक करें · विभाजक खींचें","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"मोड बदलने के लिए क्लिक करें या %1 दबाएँ।","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"क्लिक करें, फिर OK – सेटिंग्स संपादक खुलता है।","Close":"बंद करें","Close by, the edges stick together":"पास आने पर किनारे चिपक जाते हैं","Color scheme":"रंग योजना","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"स्नैप बार के रंग, आकार और आकृति।","Columns":"कॉलम","Corner radius":"कोनों की त्रिज्या","Corner size":"कोने का आकार","Corner: a quarter":"कोना: एक चौथाई","Corners: quarter of the screen":"कोने: स्क्रीन का चौथाई","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + कुंजी (डिफ़ॉल्ट)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + संख्या पैड","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + कुंजी","Custom color":"अपना रंग","Custom layout %1":"अपना लेआउट %1","Dark":"गहरा","Delay before hiding":"छिपाने से पहले विलंब","Delay before showing":"दिखाने से पहले विलंब","Delete":"हटाएँ","Delete layout?":"लेआउट हटाएँ?","Distance at which the handle appears":"वह दूरी जहाँ हैंडल दिखाई देता है","Distance before the bar hides again":"बार के फिर से छिपने से पहले की दूरी","Distance to the edge":"किनारे से दूरी","Donate with PayPal":"PayPal से दान करें","Drag a shared edge…":"साझा किनारा खींचें…","Drag a window against an edge…":"विंडो को किसी किनारे पर खींचें…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"अदला-बदली के लिए एक विंडो को दूसरी पर खींचें। स्नैप बार या स्क्रीन किनारे पर छोड़ने पर वह आज़ाद तैरती है; „विंडो को तैरने दें“ उसे वापस लाता है। अंतर सामान्य पेज से आते हैं।","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"विंडो को दूसरी के बीच पर खींचें – पूर्वावलोकन दो तीर दिखाता है – और छोड़ें। स्वचालित टाइलिंग में दूसरी विंडो पर कहीं भी चलेगा।","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"विंडो को स्क्रीन के ऊपरी किनारे तक खींचें और किसी ज़ोन पर छोड़ दें।","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"स्नैप बार में क्रम बदलने के लिए कार्ड खींचें। संपादित करने के लिए कार्ड पर डबल-क्लिक करें।","Drop a window onto another one":"विंडो को दूसरी पर छोड़ें","Drop the window onto a zone":"विंडो को किसी ज़ोन पर छोड़ें","Duplicate":"प्रतिलिपि बनाएँ","Duration":"अवधि","Dwindle":"ड्विंडल","Dynamic":"गतिशील","Edges and corners":"किनारे और कोने","Edit":"संपादित करें","Edit layout":"लेआउट संपादित करें","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"हर सुविधा अलग से चालू और बंद की जा सकती है।","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"लेआउट पेज पर बनाया हर लेआउट विंडो भी सजा सकता है – यह ऊपर दिखता है। विंडो 1 को ज़ोन 1 मिलता है, इसी तरह आगे; अतिरिक्त विंडो आख़िरी ज़ोन साझा करती हैं। ज़ोन से कम विंडो होने पर „मुख्य और ढेर“ इस्तेमाल होता है, ताकि खाली जगह न रहे।","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"हर विंडो अपनी जगह खुद ढूँढती है, जैसे टाइलिंग विंडो मैनेजर में।","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"हर विंडो स्क्रीन पर अपनी जगह खुद ढूँढती है। नई विंडो जुड़ जाती हैं, बंद विंडो बाकी के लिए जगह छोड़ती हैं।","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"उदाहरण: दो विंडो साथ-साथ, तीन से मुख्य और ढेर, पाँच से ग्रिड। मिलता नियम न हो तो ऊपर चुना लेआउट इस्तेमाल होता है।","Fade in and out":"आते-जाते समय फ़ेड करें","Fade the other windows":"दूसरी विंडो धुंधली करें","Features":"सुविधाएँ","Feel":"अनुभव","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"पहले से स्नैप की गई विंडो के हिसाब से ढलें","Fits the way you work.":"आपके काम करने के तरीके के अनुरूप।","Float the window (leave tiling)":"विंडो को तैरने दें (टाइलिंग छोड़ें)","Four quarters":"चार चौथाई","From":"से","Fullscreen":"पूर्ण स्क्रीन","Gap between windows":"विंडो के बीच अंतराल","Gap to the screen edge":"स्क्रीन किनारे से अंतराल","General":"सामान्य","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"हर कार्य को फिर से चुनी गई योजना की कुंजी देता है और योजना में न होने वाली कुंजियाँ हटा देता है।","Good to know":"जानने योग्य","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"विंडो को उसके शीर्षक बार से पकड़कर ऊपर खींचें। स्नैप बार नीचे आ जाता है; विंडो को किसी ज़ोन पर छोड़ें और वह ठीक उसी क्षेत्र को भर देगी। फिर से बाहर खींचने पर उसे पुराना आकार वापस मिल जाता है।","Grab window A…":"विंडो A पकड़ें…","Grid":"ग्रिड","Halves":"आधा-आधा","Hiding":"छिपना","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"खाली जगह भरने के लिए किनारे पर थामें","Hold time":"थामने का समय","Hold to fill":"भरने के लिए थामें","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"किनारे को अपनी जगह जमने से पहले कितना पास आना है।","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"कर्सर को किनारे के कितना पास आना है।","How far the bar slides down":"बार कितना नीचे खिसकता है","How it works":"यह कैसे काम करता है","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"विंडो को किनारे से कितनी देर सटे रहना है – हल्का धक्का। 0 = तुरंत।","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"बढ़ने से पहले विंडो को किनारे पर कितनी देर रहना है।","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"कितनी विंडो मुख्य क्षेत्र साझा करती हैं (लेआउट “मुख्य और ढेर”)।","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"अगर नीचे पहले से विंडो है, तो ऊपरी किनारा अधिकतम करने के बजाय ऊपरी आधा देता है। आधे और चौथाई भी स्नैप की गई विंडो को खुला छोड़ते हैं।","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"अगर आपको KSnapUnity पसंद है, तो आप इसके विकास का समर्थन कर सकते हैं – धन्यवाद!","In bar":"बार में","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"स्नैप बार और स्क्रीन के किनारों से स्वतंत्र।","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"स्नैप बार से स्वतंत्र। हर किनारे को अलग से चालू किया जा सकता है।","Information":"जानकारी","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"सहज, स्वाभाविक विंडो व्यवहार।","Join at the end":"अंत में जुड़ें","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K यानी KWin · Snap यानी स्मार्ट स्नैपिंग · Unity यानी सब कुछ एक सिस्टम में","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE के अपने स्क्रीन-किनारे कार्य और अपनी विंडो स्नैपिंग है। अगर यहाँ वही सुविधा चालू है, तो KDE वाली बंद करें: सिस्टम सेटिंग्स → विंडो प्रबंधन → स्क्रीन के किनारे, और विंडो व्यवहार → खिसकाना।","KDE's own edge tiling":"KDE की अपनी किनारा टाइलिंग","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"किनारों पर KDE का अपना बड़ा करना और टाइलिंग – अपनी रूपरेखा सहित – KSnapUnity चलने तक रुका रहता है, ताकि एक ही पूर्वावलोकन दिखे। आपकी KDE सेटिंग्स नहीं बदलतीं: इसे बंद करें, KSnapUnity निष्क्रिय करें या हटाएँ और KDE का व्यवहार लौट आता है।","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"KDE के अपने स्क्रीन-किनारे कार्य अब भी चालू हैं, इसलिए एक ही खिंचाव पर दो सहायक प्रतिक्रिया देते हैं। सिस्टम सेटिंग्स → विंडो प्रबंधन → स्क्रीन के किनारे में \"अधिकतम करें\" और \"टाइल\" बंद करें।","KDE's own window snapping":"KDE का अपना विंडो स्नैपिंग","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE की अपनी विंडो स्नैपिंग भी चालू है। एक जैसे अनुभव के लिए सिस्टम सेटिंग्स → विंडो प्रबंधन → विंडो व्यवहार → खिसकाना में इसके ज़ोन \"कोई नहीं\" पर सेट करें।","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"KDE की शॉर्टकट सेवा ने जवाब नहीं दिया। आप कुंजियाँ सिस्टम सेटिंग्स → शॉर्टकट → KWin में भी सेट कर सकते हैं।","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – सेटिंग्स संपादक","Keep stacked windows in line":"एक के ऊपर एक विंडो को एक रेखा में रखें","Keep the gap between windows":"विंडो के बीच अंतराल बनाए रखें","Keep them":"रहने दें","Key scheme":"कुंजी योजना","Keyboard shortcuts":"कीबोर्ड शॉर्टकट","Keys":"कुंजियाँ","Keys already in use":"पहले से उपयोग में कुंजियाँ","Layout":"लेआउट","Layout by number of windows":"विंडो की संख्या के अनुसार लेआउट","Layouts":"लेआउट","Layouts per row":"प्रति पंक्ति लेआउट","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"बायाँ और दायाँ किनारा: आधी स्क्रीन","Left edge: left half":"बायाँ किनारा: बायाँ आधा","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"100 % से कम पर अकेली विंडो बीच में रहती है – चौड़ी स्क्रीन पर बढ़िया।","License":"लाइसेंस","Light":"हल्का","Linear":"रैखिक","Live preview":"लाइव पूर्वावलोकन","Load template…":"टेम्पलेट लोड करें…","Magnet":"चुंबक","Main + stack":"मुख्य + ढेर","Main and stack":"मुख्य और ढेर","Main area bigger":"बड़ा मुख्य क्षेत्र","Main area on the right":"मुख्य क्षेत्र दाईं ओर","Main area smaller":"छोटा मुख्य क्षेत्र","Main in the middle":"बीच में मुख्य","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"खींचने और कुंजियों का मुख्य स्विच।","Main window":"मुख्य विंडो","Main windows":"मुख्य विंडो","Main windows: %1":"मुख्य विंडो: %1","Make it the main window":"मुख्य विंडो बनाएँ","Maximize":"अधिकतम करें","Maximize or restore":"अधिकतम करें या वापस लाएँ","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + कुंजी (KDE शैली)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + कुंजी","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + कुंजी","Minimize":"छोटा करें","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"लेआउट को उलटता है: मुख्य विंडो दाएँ, बाकी बाएँ।","Mode":"मोड","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"मोड 1 – स्नैप बार और स्क्रीन के किनारे","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"मोड 2 – स्वचालित टाइलिंग","Modes":"मोड","More ways":"और तरीके","Motion curve":"गति वक्र","Move a window towards others…":"विंडो को दूसरों की ओर ले जाएँ…","Move the window one place back":"विंडो को एक जगह पीछे ले जाएँ","Move the window one place on":"विंडो को एक जगह आगे ले जाएँ","Name:":"नाम:","New layout":"नया लेआउट","New windows":"नई विंडो","Next tiling layout":"अगला टाइलिंग लेआउट","Next to the active window":"सक्रिय विंडो के बगल में","No key":"कोई कुंजी नहीं","No other window open":"कोई और विंडो खुली नहीं","No outer margin":"बाहरी हाशिया नहीं","No shortcuts":"कोई शॉर्टकट नहीं","None":"कोई नहीं","None yet.":"अभी कोई नहीं।","Off":"बंद","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"बंद = मोड 1, चालू = मोड 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"बंद: एक तटस्थ फ़्रेम – केवल चालू पूर्वावलोकनों के लिए।","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"बंद: कुंजियाँ असाइन रहती हैं, पर कुछ नहीं करतीं।","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"बंद: विंडो वहीं रहती हैं जहाँ आप रखते हैं। बाकी सुविधाएँ हर हाल में काम करती हैं।","One at a time":"एक-एक करके","One closes – the others fill the gap":"एक बंद होती है – बाकी खाली जगह भरती हैं","One main window less":"एक मुख्य विंडो कम","One more main window":"एक और मुख्य विंडो","One window":"एक विंडो","Only one mode is switched on.":"केवल एक मोड चालू है।","Open settings editor":"सेटिंग्स संपादक खोलें","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"पहले ऐप खोलें, फिर यहाँ चुनें।","Open the layout builder":"लेआउट बिल्डर खोलें","Own layouts":"अपने लेआउट","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"हर किनारे का वह हिस्सा जो कोना माना जाता है।","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"KDE की किनारा टाइलिंग और उसका पूर्वावलोकन रोकें","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"चुंबक चालू रहने तक KDE के स्नैप ज़ोन रोकें","Preview":"पूर्वावलोकन","Previews":"पूर्वावलोकन","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"विंडो को स्क्रीन के किनारे या कोने से सटाएँ, वह उस हिस्से को भर देगी। स्नैप बार के साथ या उसके बिना काम करता है।","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"विंडो को किनारे या कोने से सटाएँ: अधिकतम, आधा, चौथाई।","Push delay":"धक्का विलंब","Quarters":"चौथाई","Quick":"तेज़","Quick settings":"त्वरित सेटिंग्स","Recommended values":"अनुशंसित मान","Remove":"हटाएँ","Remove rule":"नियम हटाएँ","Remove zone":"ज़ोन हटाएँ","Reset all":"सब रीसेट करें","Reset all keys":"सभी कुंजियाँ रीसेट करें","Reset to default":"डिफ़ॉल्ट पर लौटाएँ","Resistance against overlapping":"ओवरलैप के विरुद्ध प्रतिरोध","Resize touching windows together":"छूती हुई विंडो का आकार साथ में बदलें","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"आकार बदलने पर भी चिपकता है – यहाँ पूरी ऊँचाई तक","Restore":"पुनर्स्थापित करें","Restore default layouts":"डिफ़ॉल्ट लेआउट पुनर्स्थापित करें","Restore default layouts?":"डिफ़ॉल्ट लेआउट पुनर्स्थापित करें?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"विंडो बाहर खींचने पर मूल आकार वापस लाएँ","Restore the size before snapping":"स्नैप से पहले का आकार वापस लाएँ","Rows":"पंक्तियाँ","Save":"सहेजें","Screen edges":"स्क्रीन के किनारे","Screen edges on/off":"स्क्रीन के किनारे चालू/बंद","Screen edges preview":"स्क्रीन किनारों का पूर्वावलोकन","Set":"सेट करें","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"सभी कार्यों की कुंजियाँ एक साथ सेट करता है। अलग-अलग कुंजियाँ आप नीचे बदल सकते हैं।","Settings":"सेटिंग्स","Settings file":"सेटिंग्स फ़ाइल","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"आकार बदलते समय माउस को तेज़ी से आगे-पीछे हिलाएँ और बाकी विंडो वापस आ जाती हैं। एक दिशा में तेज़ खिंचाव उन्हें कभी नहीं छोड़ता।","Shake to let go":"छोड़ने के लिए हिलाएँ","Shortcuts":"शॉर्टकट","Show a small handle first":"पहले एक छोटा हैंडल दिखाएँ","Show layout and zone names":"लेआउट और ज़ोन के नाम दिखाएँ","Show previews in the accent color":"पूर्वावलोकन एक्सेंट रंग में दिखाएँ","Showing":"दिखना","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"दिखाता है कि किनारे या कोने पर विंडो कहाँ जाएगी। बंद: कोई पूर्वावलोकन नहीं।","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"जब तक स्नैप बार का कोई ज़ोन हाइलाइट है, दिखाता है कि विंडो कहाँ जाएगी। बंद: कोई पूर्वावलोकन नहीं।","Sidebar + grid":"साइडबार + ग्रिड","Single zone":"एक ज़ोन","Six tiles":"छह टाइल","Size & shape":"आकार और आकृति","Size of the main area":"मुख्य क्षेत्र का आकार","Slide-in duration":"अंदर आने की अवधि","Slide-out duration":"बाहर जाने की अवधि","Smart arranging and detection.":"समझदार व्यवस्था और पहचान।","Smart fill":"स्मार्ट भराव","Smooth (default)":"सहज (डिफ़ॉल्ट)","Snap bar":"स्नैप बार","Snap bar and screen edges":"स्नैप बार और स्क्रीन के किनारे","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"स्नैप बार और किनारे बंद हैं – केवल मोड 2 चलता है और मोड शॉर्टकट कुछ नहीं करता।","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"स्नैप बार और स्क्रीन के किनारे स्वचालित टाइलिंग में बाधा डालते हैं। इसलिए ये दो मोड में चलते हैं – शॉर्टकट से या यहाँ से बदलें।","Snap bar colors:":"स्नैप बार के रंग:","Snap bar on/off":"स्नैप बार चालू/बंद","Snap bar preview":"स्नैप बार पूर्वावलोकन","Snap bar size":"स्नैप बार का आकार","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"स्नैप बार, स्क्रीन के किनारे, विंडो चुंबक, शॉर्टकट और विंडो अदला-बदली।","Snap distance":"स्नैप दूरी","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"विभाजकों को स्नैप करें (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"स्नैप लेआउट और स्वचालित टाइलिंग।","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"सक्रिय विंडो को कुंजी संयोजनों से स्नैप करें।","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"सक्रिय विंडो को कीबोर्ड से स्नैप करें। ये सामान्य KDE वैश्विक शॉर्टकट हैं – ये सिस्टम सेटिंग्स → शॉर्टकट → KWin में भी मिलते हैं।","Snap to the bottom half":"निचले आधे में स्नैप करें","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"नीचे-बाएँ चौथाई में स्नैप करें","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"नीचे-दाएँ चौथाई में स्नैप करें","Snap to the center third":"बीच के तिहाई में स्नैप करें","Snap to the left half":"बाएँ आधे में स्नैप करें","Snap to the left third":"बाएँ तिहाई में स्नैप करें","Snap to the left two thirds":"बाएँ दो-तिहाई में स्नैप करें","Snap to the right half":"दाएँ आधे में स्नैप करें","Snap to the right third":"दाएँ तिहाई में स्नैप करें","Snap to the right two thirds":"दाएँ दो-तिहाई में स्नैप करें","Snap to the top half":"ऊपरी आधे में स्नैप करें","Snap to the top-left quarter":"ऊपर-बाएँ चौथाई में स्नैप करें","Snap to the top-right quarter":"ऊपर-दाएँ चौथाई में स्नैप करें","Snapping":"स्नैपिंग","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"स्नैपिंग और स्वचालित टाइलिंग दो मोड में चलते हैं – एक शॉर्टकट दोनों के बीच बदलता है।","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"इस तरह केवल एक चुंबक विंडो खींचता है। आपकी KDE सेटिंग्स नहीं बदलतीं: इसे बंद करें, KSnapUnity निष्क्रिय करें या हटाएँ और KDE की स्नैपिंग लौट आती है।","Soft":"कोमल","Spacing":"अंतराल","Spiral":"सर्पिल","Split side by side":"अगल-बगल बाँटें","Split top and bottom":"ऊपर-नीचे बाँटें","Stack + main":"ढेर + मुख्य","Stick to other windows":"दूसरी विंडो से चिपकें","Stick to the screen edges":"स्क्रीन के किनारों से चिपकें","Sticky edges":"चिपकने वाले किनारे","Support KSnapUnity":"KSnapUnity का समर्थन करें","Swap":"अदला-बदली","Swap windows":"विंडो अदला-बदली","Swap with the window above":"ऊपर वाली विंडो से बदलें","Swap with the window below":"नीचे वाली विंडो से बदलें","Swap with the window on the left":"बाईं विंडो से बदलें","Swap with the window on the right":"दाईं विंडो से बदलें","Switch mode":"मोड बदलें","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"मोड बदलें (स्नैपिंग / टाइलिंग)","Switch modes with:":"मोड बदलने की कुंजी:","Switch the layout by itself":"लेआउट अपने आप बदलें","Switched off":"बंद","System":"सिस्टम","Take it over":"ले लें","Take over all":"सभी ले लें","Take the main place":"मुख्य जगह लें","Test animation":"एनिमेशन आज़माएँ","Test on screen":"स्क्रीन पर आज़माएँ","Test the snap bar":"स्नैप बार आज़माएँ","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"डिफ़ॉल्ट मान Windows 11 पर आधारित हैं।","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"स्नैप कार्य स्नैप बार जैसे ही अंतराल उपयोग करते हैं और स्नैप से पहले का आकार याद रखते हैं: \"स्नैप से पहले का आकार वापस लाएँ\" उसे लौटाता है।","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"ये ऐप कभी व्यवस्थित नहीं होते और अपनी जगह रखते हैं। संवाद हमेशा तैरते हैं।","Thirds":"तिहाई","Three columns":"तीन कॉलम","Thumbnail width":"थंबनेल की चौड़ाई","Tiling":"टाइलिंग","Tip":"सुझाव","Top / bottom":"ऊपर / नीचे","Top edge":"ऊपरी किनारा","Top edge: full screen":"ऊपरी किनारा: पूर्ण स्क्रीन","Top edge: maximize":"ऊपरी किनारा: बड़ा करें","Top edge: top half":"ऊपरी किनारा: ऊपरी आधा","Top half":"ऊपरी आधा","Trigger distance from the top edge":"ऊपरी किनारे से ट्रिगर दूरी","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"अगर आपको KDE की अपनी रूपरेखा पसंद है तो इसे बंद करें – फिर ऊपर स्क्रीन किनारों का पूर्वावलोकन बंद करें।","Two thirds":"दो-तिहाई","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"दो विंडो जगह बदलती हैं – एक को दूसरी पर छोड़ें या कुंजियाँ इस्तेमाल करें।","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"दो विंडो जगह बदलती हैं: एक को दूसरी पर छोड़ें, या कुंजी से।","Use keyboard shortcuts":"कीबोर्ड शॉर्टकट उपयोग करें","Use screen edges":"स्क्रीन के किनारे उपयोग करें","Use the system accent color":"सिस्टम का एक्सेंट रंग उपयोग करें","Use the window magnet":"विंडो चुंबक उपयोग करें","Usual combinations":"आम संयोजन","Version":"संस्करण","Wanted for: %1":"चाहिए इसके लिए: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"जब कोई विंडो खुलती, बंद होती या बदलती है, बाकी उछलने के बजाय आराम से खिसकती हैं।","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"किसी विंडो का आकार बदलने पर उसे छूने वाली विंडो साझा किनारा साथ खिसकाती हैं – कुछ ओवरलैप नहीं होता, कोई खाली जगह नहीं बनती।","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"आकार बदलते समय जो विंडो साथ नहीं चलतीं वे पारदर्शी दिखती हैं।","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"विंडो को खिसकाते या उसका आकार बदलते समय उसके किनारे पास की विंडो और स्क्रीन के किनारों से चिपकते हैं।","Width":"चौड़ाई","Window":"विंडो","Window magnet":"विंडो चुंबक","Window magnet on/off":"विंडो चुंबक चालू/बंद","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"ऊपर-नीचे रखी विंडो अपने बाएँ और दाएँ किनारे साथ रखती हैं, अगल-बगल की विंडो ऊपर और नीचे के।","Windows glide to their place":"विंडो अपनी जगह पर सरकती हैं","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"विंडो आपस में और स्क्रीन के किनारों से चिपकती हैं।","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"विंडो छूने के बजाय सामान्य पेज के \"विंडो के बीच अंतराल\" पर रुकती हैं।","Yes":"हाँ","Your own combination":"अपना संयोजन","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"आपके अपने लेआउट और उनका क्रम खो जाएगा।","Zone %1":"ज़ोन %1","for KWin · v%1":"KWin के लिए · v%1","windows:":"विंडो:","“%1” will be removed.":"\"%1\" हटा दिया जाएगा।","…drag it onto window B…":"…उसे विंडो B पर खींचें…","…in every direction":"…हर दिशा में","…let go: they trade places":"…छोड़ें: वे जगह बदल लेती हैं","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…पड़ोसी उसके साथ बढ़ते और घटते हैं","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ तैयार – सेटिंग्स संपादक खोलने के लिए OK क्लिक करें।"},"hr":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (kopija)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 koristi „%2”.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 od %2 zona","0 = all in one row":"0 = svi u jednom retku","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Način 1</b><br/>Traka za prianjanje i rubovi zaslona","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Način 2</b><br/>Automatsko popločavanje","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Samostalni prozor zauzima cijeli zaslon, čak i uz zadani razmak.","A new window joins":"Dolazi novi prozor","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Kratko guranje daje polovicu ili četvrtinu. Zadržite prozor uz rub malo duže i naraste do sljedećeg prozora – pregled to pokazuje.","A single window":"Jedan prozor","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Prozor se zaustavlja na rubu drugog, i kad ga brzo pomičeš. Protresi miš ili guraj još trenutak da ga otpustiš. 0 = prozori se smiju slobodno preklapati.","About & Help":"O programu i pomoć","Accent color":"Boja isticanja","Active":"Aktivno","Active mode":"Aktivni način","Active width along the top edge":"Aktivna širina uz gornji rub","Add an open application":"Dodaj otvorenu aplikaciju","Add rule":"Dodaj pravilo","All window features in one system.":"Sve funkcije prozora u jednom sustavu.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Mijenja se i kad ručno promijeniš veličinu glavnog prozora.","Also while resizing":"I pri promjeni veličine","Always floating":"Uvijek slobodni","Animation":"Animacija","Appearance":"Izgled","Apply":"Primijeni","Arrange windows":"Raspoređivanje prozora","Arrange windows automatically":"Automatski rasporedi prozore","Author":"Autor","Automatic tiling":"Automatsko popločavanje","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Automatsko popločavanje je isključeno – radi samo način 1, a prečac načina ne radi ništa.","Automatic tiling off":"Automatsko popločavanje isključeno","Automatic tiling on":"Automatsko popločavanje uključeno","Automatic tiling on/off":"Automatsko popločavanje uklj./isklj.","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Automatsko popločavanje, zamjena prozora, prečaci i magnet za slobodne prozore.","Background opacity":"Neprozirnost pozadine","Behavior & Animation":"Ponašanje i animacija","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Donji rub: donja polovica","Bouncy":"Elastična","Buy me a coffee":"Častite me kavom","Cancel":"Odustani","Center focus":"Fokus u sredini","Center the window":"Centriraj prozor","Change":"Promijeni","Change key":"Promijeni tipku","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Tipku mijenjaš u uređivaču postavki. Oba načina trebaju automatsko popločavanje i traku ili rubove zaslona.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Promijeni ih na stranici Tipkovnički prečaci. Uz automatsko popločavanje prozori mijenjaju i mjesto u redoslijedu.","Choose…":"Odaberi…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Kliknite zonu za odabir · dvostruki klik je dijeli · povucite razdjelnike","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Klikni ili pritisni %1 za promjenu načina.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Klikni, zatim U redu – otvara se uređivač postavki.","Close":"Zatvori","Close by, the edges stick together":"U blizini se rubovi slijepe","Color scheme":"Shema boja","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Boje, veličina i oblik trake.","Columns":"Stupci","Corner radius":"Polumjer kutova","Corner size":"Veličina kutova","Corner: a quarter":"Kut: četvrtina","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Kutovi: četvrtina zaslona","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + tipka (zadano)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + numerička tipkovnica","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + tipka","Custom color":"Vlastita boja","Custom layout %1":"Vlastiti raspored %1","Dark":"Tamna","Delay before hiding":"Odgoda prije skrivanja","Delay before showing":"Odgoda prije prikaza","Delete":"Izbriši","Delete layout?":"Izbrisati raspored?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Udaljenost na kojoj se pojavljuje ručka","Distance before the bar hides again":"Udaljenost nakon koje se traka opet skriva","Distance to the edge":"Udaljenost od ruba","Donate with PayPal":"Donirajte putem PayPala","Drag a shared edge…":"Povuci zajednički rub…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Povuci prozor prema rubu…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Povuci prozor na drugi da ih zamijeniš. Spušten na traku ili rub zaslona, lebdi slobodno; „Pusti prozor da lebdi” ga vraća. Razmaci dolaze sa stranice Općenito.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Povuci prozor preko sredine drugog – pregled pokazuje dvije strelice – i pusti. Kod automatskog popločavanja dovoljno je bilo gdje iznad drugog prozora.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Povucite prozor do gornjeg ruba zaslona i ispustite ga na zonu.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Povlačite kartice kako biste promijenili redoslijed na traci. Dvaput kliknite karticu za uređivanje.","Drop a window onto another one":"Ispusti prozor na drugi","Drop the window onto a zone":"Ispustite prozor na zonu","Duplicate":"Dupliciraj","Duration":"Trajanje","Dwindle":"Spirala prema unutra","Dynamic":"Dinamična","Edges and corners":"Rubovi i kutovi","Edit":"Uredi","Edit layout":"Uredi raspored","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Svaka se funkcija može zasebno uključiti i isključiti.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Svaki raspored sa stranice Rasporedi može i raspoređivati prozore – pojavljuje se iznad. Prozor 1 dobiva zonu 1 i tako dalje; dodatni prozori dijele zadnju zonu. Ako je prozora manje od zona, koristi se „Glavni i hrpa”, da ne bude rupa.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Svaki prozor sam pronalazi svoje mjesto, kao u upravitelju prozora s popločavanjem.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Svaki prozor sam pronalazi svoje mjesto na zaslonu. Novi prozori se pridružuju, zatvoreni oslobađaju mjesto ostalima.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Primjer: dva prozora jedan uz drugi, od tri glavni i hrpa, od pet mreža. Bez odgovarajućeg pravila vrijedi gore odabrani raspored.","Fade in and out":"Postupno pojavljivanje i nestajanje","Fade the other windows":"Zatamni ostale prozore","Features":"Značajke","Feel":"Osjećaj","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Prilagodi se već prilijepljenim prozorima","Fits the way you work.":"Prilagođava se tvom načinu rada.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Pusti prozor da lebdi (napusti popločavanje)","Four quarters":"Četiri četvrtine","From":"Od","Fullscreen":"Cijeli zaslon","Gap between windows":"Razmak između prozora","Gap to the screen edge":"Razmak do ruba zaslona","General":"Općenito","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Svakoj radnji ponovno daje tipku odabrane sheme i uklanja tipke koje shema nema.","Good to know":"Dobro je znati","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Uhvatite prozor za naslovnu traku i povucite ga prema gore. Traka se spušta; ispustite prozor na zonu i on ispuni točno to područje. Kad ga ponovno izvučete, vraća mu se stara veličina.","Grab window A…":"Uhvati prozor A…","Grid":"Mreža","Halves":"Polovice","Hiding":"Skrivanje","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Drži uz rub za popunjavanje slobodnog prostora","Hold time":"Vrijeme držanja","Hold to fill":"Drži za popunjavanje","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Koliko blizu rub mora doći prije nego što sjedne na mjesto.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Koliko blizu rubu pokazivač mora doći.","How far the bar slides down":"Koliko se traka spušta","How it works":"Kako radi","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Koliko dugo prozor mora biti uz rub – mali potisak. 0 = odmah.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Koliko dugo prozor mora ostati uz rub prije nego naraste.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Koliko prozora dijeli glavno područje (raspored „Glavni i hrpa”).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Ako je dolje već prozor, gornji rub daje gornju polovicu umjesto maksimiziranja. I polovice i četvrtine ostavljaju prilijepljene prozore slobodnima.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Ako ti se sviđa KSnapUnity, možeš podržati razvoj – hvala!","In bar":"Na traci","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Neovisno o traci i rubovima zaslona.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Neovisno o traci. Svaki rub može se zasebno uključiti.","Information":"Informacije","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Intuitivno, prirodno ponašanje prozora.","Join at the end":"Idu na kraj","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K za KWin · Snap za pametnije prianjanje · Unity za sve u jednom sustavu","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE ima vlastite radnje rubova zaslona i vlastito prianjanje prozora. Ako je ovdje uključena ista značajka, isključite KDE-ovu: Postavke sustava → Upravljanje prozorima → Rubovi zaslona te Ponašanje prozora → Pomicanje.","KDE's own edge tiling":"KDE-ovo vlastito slaganje uz rubove","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"KDE-ovo maksimiziranje i popločavanje na rubovima – s obrisom – pauzira dok radi KSnapUnity, pa se vidi samo jedan pregled. Postavke KDE-a se ne mijenjaju: isključi ovo, deaktiviraj ili ukloni KSnapUnity i KDE-ovo ponašanje se vraća.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"KDE-ove vlastite radnje rubova zaslona još su uključene pa na isto povlačenje reagiraju dva pomoćnika. Isključite „Maksimiziraj” i „Popločaj” u Postavke sustava → Upravljanje prozorima → Rubovi zaslona.","KDE's own window snapping":"KDE-ovo vlastito pričvršćivanje prozora","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"I KDE-ovo vlastito prianjanje prozora je uključeno. Za ujednačen osjećaj postavite njegove zone na „Nijedna” u Postavke sustava → Upravljanje prozorima → Ponašanje prozora → Pomicanje.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"KDE-ova usluga prečaca nije odgovorila. Tipke i dalje možete postaviti u Postavke sustava → Prečaci → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – uređivač postavki","Keep stacked windows in line":"Drži složene prozore u liniji","Keep the gap between windows":"Zadrži razmak između prozora","Keep them":"Zadrži ih","Key scheme":"Shema tipki","Keyboard shortcuts":"Tipkovnički prečaci","Keys":"Tipke","Keys already in use":"Tipke koje se već koriste","Layout":"Raspored","Layout by number of windows":"Raspored prema broju prozora","Layouts":"Rasporedi","Layouts per row":"Rasporeda po retku","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Lijevi i desni rub: pola zaslona","Left edge: left half":"Lijevi rub: lijeva polovica","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Ispod 100 % samostalni prozor ostaje u sredini – lijepo na širokim zaslonima.","License":"Licenca","Light":"Svijetla","Linear":"Linearna","Live preview":"Pregled uživo","Load template…":"Učitaj predložak…","Main + stack":"Glavni + hrpa","Main and stack":"Glavni i hrpa","Main area bigger":"Veće glavno područje","Main area on the right":"Glavno područje desno","Main area smaller":"Manje glavno područje","Main in the middle":"Glavni u sredini","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Glavni prekidač za povlačenje i tipke.","Main window":"Glavni prozor","Main windows":"Glavni prozori","Main windows: %1":"Glavni prozori: %1","Make it the main window":"Učini glavnim prozorom","Maximize":"Maksimiziraj","Maximize or restore":"Maksimiziraj ili vrati","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + tipka (KDE stil)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + tipka","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + tipka","Minimize":"Minimiziraj","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Zrcali raspored: glavni prozor desno, ostali lijevo.","Mode":"Način","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Način 1 – traka za prianjanje i rubovi zaslona","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Način 2 – automatsko popločavanje","Modes":"Načini","More ways":"Više načina","Motion curve":"Krivulja kretanja","Move a window towards others…":"Pomakni prozor prema drugima…","Move the window one place back":"Pomakni prozor jedno mjesto natrag","Move the window one place on":"Pomakni prozor jedno mjesto naprijed","Name:":"Naziv:","New layout":"Novi raspored","New windows":"Novi prozori","Next tiling layout":"Sljedeći raspored popločavanja","Next to the active window":"Uz aktivni prozor","No key":"Nema tipke","No other window open":"Nema drugog otvorenog prozora","No outer margin":"Bez vanjskog razmaka","No shortcuts":"Bez prečaca","None":"Nijedna","None yet.":"Još ništa.","Off":"Isključeno","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Isklj. = način 1, uklj. = način 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Isključeno: neutralan okvir – samo za uključene preglede.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Isključeno: tipke ostaju dodijeljene, ali ništa ne rade.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Isključeno: prozori ostaju gdje ih staviš. Ostale funkcije rade svejedno.","One at a time":"Jedan po jedan","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Jedan se zatvara – ostali popune prazninu","One main window less":"Jedan glavni prozor manje","One more main window":"Jedan glavni prozor više","One window":"Jedan prozor","Only one mode is switched on.":"Uključen je samo jedan način.","Open settings editor":"Otvori uređivač postavki","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Najprije otvori aplikaciju, zatim je odaberi ovdje.","Open the layout builder":"Otvori graditelj rasporeda","Own layouts":"Vlastiti rasporedi","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Dio svake stranice koji se računa kao kut.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Pauziraj KDE-ovo slaganje uz rubove i njegov pregled","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Pauziraj KDE-ove zone pričvršćivanja dok je magnet uključen","Preview":"Pregled","Previews":"Pretpregledi","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Pritisnite prozor uz rub ili kut zaslona i on ispuni taj dio. Radi s trakom ili bez nje.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Pritisnite prozor uz rub ili kut: maksimiziraj, polovice, četvrtine.","Push delay":"Odgoda pritiska","Quarters":"Četvrtine","Quick":"Brza","Quick settings":"Brze postavke","Recommended values":"Preporučene vrijednosti","Remove":"Ukloni","Remove rule":"Ukloni pravilo","Remove zone":"Ukloni zonu","Reset all":"Vrati sve","Reset all keys":"Vrati sve tipke","Reset to default":"Vrati na zadano","Resistance against overlapping":"Otpor preklapanju","Resize touching windows together":"Mijenjaj veličinu prozora koji se dodiruju zajedno","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"I promjena veličine prianja – ovdje do pune visine","Restore":"Vrati","Restore default layouts":"Vrati zadane rasporede","Restore default layouts?":"Vratiti zadane rasporede?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Vrati izvornu veličinu pri izvlačenju prozora","Restore the size before snapping":"Vrati veličinu prije prianjanja","Rows":"Retci","Save":"Spremi","Screen edges":"Rubovi zaslona","Screen edges on/off":"Rubovi zaslona uklj./isklj.","Screen edges preview":"Pregled rubova zaslona","Set":"Postavi","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Postavlja tipke svih radnji odjednom. Pojedinačne tipke i dalje možete mijenjati ispod.","Settings":"Postavke","Settings file":"Datoteka postavki","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Dok mijenjaš veličinu, brzo protresi miš naprijed-natrag i ostali prozori skoče natrag. Brzi potez u jednom smjeru nikad ih ne otpušta.","Shake to let go":"Protresi za otpuštanje","Shortcuts":"Prečaci","Show a small handle first":"Prvo prikaži malu ručku","Show layout and zone names":"Prikaži nazive rasporeda i zona","Show previews in the accent color":"Prikaži pretpreglede u boji isticanja","Showing":"Prikazivanje","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Pokazuje gdje prozor slijeće na rubu ili u kutu. Isključeno: nikakav pregled.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Pokazuje gdje prozor slijeće dok je zona trake istaknuta. Isključeno: nikakav pregled.","Sidebar + grid":"Bočna traka + mreža","Single zone":"Jedna zona","Six tiles":"Šest pločica","Size & shape":"Veličina i oblik","Size of the main area":"Veličina glavnog područja","Slide-in duration":"Trajanje spuštanja","Slide-out duration":"Trajanje podizanja","Smart arranging and detection.":"Pametno raspoređivanje i prepoznavanje.","Smart fill":"Pametno popunjavanje","Smooth (default)":"Glatka (zadano)","Snap bar":"Traka za prianjanje","Snap bar and screen edges":"Traka za prianjanje i rubovi zaslona","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Traka i rubovi su isključeni – radi samo način 2, a prečac načina ne radi ništa.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Traka i rubovi zaslona smetaju automatskom popločavanju. Zato rade kao dva načina – mijenjaj prečacem ili ovdje.","Snap bar colors:":"Boje trake:","Snap bar on/off":"Traka uklj./isklj.","Snap bar preview":"Pregled trake za pričvršćivanje","Snap bar size":"Veličina trake","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Traka za prianjanje, rubovi zaslona, magnet prozora, prečaci i zamjena prozora.","Snap distance":"Udaljenost prianjanja","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Prianjanje razdjelnika (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Rasporedi za prianjanje i automatsko popločavanje.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Prilijepite aktivni prozor kombinacijama tipki.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Prilijepite aktivni prozor tipkovnicom. To su obični globalni KDE prečaci – nalaze se i u Postavke sustava → Prečaci → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Prilijepi u donju polovicu","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Prilijepi u donju lijevu četvrtinu","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Prilijepi u donju desnu četvrtinu","Snap to the center third":"Prilijepi u srednju trećinu","Snap to the left half":"Prilijepi u lijevu polovicu","Snap to the left third":"Prilijepi u lijevu trećinu","Snap to the left two thirds":"Prilijepi u lijeve dvije trećine","Snap to the right half":"Prilijepi u desnu polovicu","Snap to the right third":"Prilijepi u desnu trećinu","Snap to the right two thirds":"Prilijepi u desne dvije trećine","Snap to the top half":"Prilijepi u gornju polovicu","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Prilijepi u gornju lijevu četvrtinu","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Prilijepi u gornju desnu četvrtinu","Snapping":"Prianjanje","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Prianjanje i automatsko popločavanje rade kao dva načina – jedan prečac ih mijenja.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Tako samo jedan magnet vuče prozor. Postavke KDE-a se ne mijenjaju: isključi ovo, deaktiviraj ili ukloni KSnapUnity i KDE-ovo prianjanje se vraća.","Soft":"Blaga","Spacing":"Razmaci","Spiral":"Spirala","Split side by side":"Podijeli jedno pokraj drugog","Split top and bottom":"Podijeli gore i dolje","Stack + main":"Hrpa + glavni","Stick to other windows":"Lijepi se uz druge prozore","Stick to the screen edges":"Lijepi se uz rubove zaslona","Sticky edges":"Ljepljivi rubovi","Support KSnapUnity":"Podrži KSnapUnity","Swap":"Zamijeni","Swap windows":"Zamjena prozora","Swap with the window above":"Zamijeni s prozorom iznad","Swap with the window below":"Zamijeni s prozorom ispod","Swap with the window on the left":"Zamijeni s prozorom lijevo","Swap with the window on the right":"Zamijeni s prozorom desno","Switch mode":"Promijeni način","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Promijeni način (prianjanje / popločavanje)","Switch modes with:":"Promjena načina:","Switch the layout by itself":"Sam mijenjaj raspored","Switched off":"Isključeno","System":"Sustav","Take it over":"Preuzmi","Take over all":"Preuzmi sve","Take the main place":"Uzimaju glavno mjesto","Test animation":"Isprobaj animaciju","Test on screen":"Isprobaj na zaslonu","Test the snap bar":"Isprobaj traku","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Zadane vrijednosti temelje se na Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Radnje prianjanja koriste iste razmake kao traka i pamte veličinu prije prianjanja: „Vrati veličinu prije prianjanja” je vraća.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Ove se aplikacije nikad ne raspoređuju i zadržavaju svoje mjesto. Dijalozi su uvijek slobodni.","Thirds":"Trećine","Three columns":"Tri stupca","Thumbnail width":"Širina sličica","Tiling":"Popločavanje","Tip":"Savjet","Top / bottom":"Gore / dolje","Top edge":"Gornji rub","Top edge: full screen":"Gornji rub: cijeli zaslon","Top edge: maximize":"Gornji rub: maksimiziraj","Top edge: top half":"Gornji rub: gornja polovica","Top half":"Gornja polovica","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Udaljenost aktivacije od gornjeg ruba","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Isključite ako vam je draži KDE-ov obris – tada gore isključite pregled rubova zaslona.","Two thirds":"Dvije trećine","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Dva prozora mijenjaju mjesta – spusti jedan na drugi ili koristi tipke.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Dva prozora mijenjaju mjesta: spusti jedan na drugi ili tipkom.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Koristi tipkovničke prečace","Use screen edges":"Koristi rubove zaslona","Use the system accent color":"Koristi boju isticanja sustava","Use the window magnet":"Koristi magnet prozora","Usual combinations":"Uobičajene kombinacije","Version":"Verzija","Wanted for: %1":"Željeno za: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Kad se prozor otvori, zatvori ili zamijeni, ostali se pomiču glatko umjesto da skaču.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Kada mijenjate veličinu prozora, prozori koji ga dodiruju pomiču zajednički rub s njim – ništa se ne preklapa, ne nastaje praznina.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Tijekom promjene veličine prozori koji ne prate prikazuju se prozirno.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Dok pomičete prozor ili mu mijenjate veličinu, njegovi se rubovi lijepe uz obližnje prozore i rubove zaslona.","Width":"Širina","Window":"Prozor","Window magnet":"Magnet prozora","Window magnet on/off":"Magnet prozora uklj./isklj.","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Prozori jedan iznad drugoga drže lijeve i desne rubove zajedno, prozori jedan uz drugi gornje i donje.","Windows glide to their place":"Prozori klize na svoje mjesto","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Prozori se lijepe jedan uz drugi i uz rubove zaslona.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Prozori se zaustave na „Razmak između prozora” sa stranice Općenito umjesto da se dodiruju.","Yes":"Da","Your own combination":"Vlastita kombinacija","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Vaši rasporedi i njihov redoslijed bit će izgubljeni.","Zone %1":"Zona %1","for KWin · v%1":"za KWin · v%1","windows:":"prozora:","“%1” will be removed.":"„%1” će biti uklonjen.","…drag it onto window B…":"…povuci ga na prozor B…","…in every direction":"…u svakom smjeru","…let go: they trade places":"…pusti: zamijene mjesta","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…susjedi rastu i smanjuju se s njim","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Spremno – klikni U redu za otvaranje uređivača postavki."},"hu":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (másolat)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"A(z) %1 billentyűt ez használja: „%2”.","%1 of %2 zones":"%2 zónából %1","0 = all in one row":"0 = mind egy sorban","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>1. mód</b><br/>Illesztősáv és képernyőszélek","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>2. mód</b><br/>Automatikus csempézés","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Az egyetlen ablak az egész képernyőt használja, még beállított margóval is.","A new window joins":"Új ablak érkezik","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Egy rövid lökés felet vagy negyedet ad. Tartsa az ablakot kicsit tovább a szélnél, és megnő a következő ablakig – az előnézet mutatja.","A single window":"Egyetlen ablak","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Egy ablak megáll egy másik szélén, akkor is, ha gyorsan mozgatod. Rázd meg az egeret, vagy told még egy pillanatig az elengedéshez. 0 = az ablakok szabadon átfedhetik egymást.","About & Help":"Névjegy és súgó","Accent color":"Kiemelőszín","Active":"Aktív","Active mode":"Aktív mód","Active width along the top edge":"Aktív szélesség a felső szél mentén","Add an open application":"Nyitott alkalmazás hozzáadása","Add rule":"Szabály hozzáadása","All window features in one system.":"Minden ablakfunkció egy rendszerben.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Akkor is változik, ha kézzel méretezed át a fő ablakot.","Also while resizing":"Átméretezéskor is","Always floating":"Mindig lebegő","Animation":"Animáció","Appearance":"Megjelenés","Apply":"Alkalmaz","Arrange windows":"Ablakok elrendezése","Arrange windows automatically":"Ablakok automatikus elrendezése","Author":"Szerző","Automatic tiling":"Automatikus csempézés","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Az automatikus csempézés ki van kapcsolva – csak az 1. mód fut, és a módváltó billentyű nem csinál semmit.","Automatic tiling off":"Automatikus csempézés ki","Automatic tiling on":"Automatikus csempézés be","Automatic tiling on/off":"Automatikus csempézés be/ki","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Automatikus csempézés, ablakcsere, billentyűparancsok és a mágnes lebegő ablakokhoz.","Background opacity":"Háttér átlátszatlansága","Behavior & Animation":"Viselkedés és animáció","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Alsó szél: alsó fele","Bouncy":"Rugalmas","Buy me a coffee":"Hívj meg egy kávéra","Cancel":"Mégse","Center focus":"Középső fókusz","Center the window":"Ablak középre helyezése","Change":"Módosítás","Change key":"Billentyű módosítása","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"A billentyűt a beállításszerkesztőben módosíthatod. Mindkét módhoz kell az automatikus csempézés és a sáv vagy a képernyőszélek.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"A Billentyűparancsok oldalon módosíthatod őket. Automatikus csempézésnél az ablakok a sorrendben is helyet cserélnek.","Choose…":"Válassz…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Kattintson egy zónára a kijelöléshez · dupla kattintással felosztja · húzza az elválasztókat","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Kattints vagy nyomd meg: %1 a módváltáshoz.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Kattints, majd OK – megnyílik a beállításszerkesztő.","Close":"Bezárás","Close by, the edges stick together":"Közel érve a szélek összetapadnak","Color scheme":"Színséma","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Az illesztősáv színei, mérete és formája.","Columns":"Oszlopok","Corner radius":"Sarokkerekítés","Corner size":"Sarokméret","Corner: a quarter":"Sarok: negyed","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Sarkok: a képernyő negyede","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + billentyű (alapértelmezett)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + számbillentyűzet","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + billentyű","Custom color":"Egyéni szín","Custom layout %1":"Egyéni elrendezés %1","Dark":"Sötét","Delay before hiding":"Késleltetés elrejtés előtt","Delay before showing":"Késleltetés megjelenítés előtt","Delete":"Törlés","Delete layout?":"Törli az elrendezést?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Távolság, ahol a fogantyú megjelenik","Distance before the bar hides again":"Távolság, amely után a sáv újra eltűnik","Distance to the edge":"Távolság a széltől","Donate with PayPal":"Adományozás PayPallal","Drag a shared edge…":"Húzz egy közös szélt…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Húzz egy ablakot a szélhez…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Húzz egy ablakot egy másikra a cseréhez. A sávra vagy képernyőszélre ejtve szabadon lebeg; az „Ablak lebegtetése” visszahozza. A térközök az Általános oldalról jönnek.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Húzz egy ablakot egy másik közepe fölé – az előnézet két nyilat mutat – és engedd el. Automatikus csempézésnél a másik ablak bármely pontja elég.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Húzzon egy ablakot a képernyő felső széléhez, és engedje el egy zónán.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Húzza a kártyákat a sorrend módosításához. Dupla kattintással szerkesztheti a kártyát.","Drop a window onto another one":"Ablak ejtése egy másikra","Drop the window onto a zone":"Engedje el az ablakot egy zónán","Duplicate":"Kettőzés","Duration":"Időtartam","Dwindle":"Befelé tekeredő","Dynamic":"Dinamikus","Edges and corners":"Szélek és sarkok","Edit":"Szerkesztés","Edit layout":"Elrendezés szerkesztése","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Minden funkció külön be- és kikapcsolható.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Minden elrendezés, amit az Elrendezések oldalon építesz, ablakokat is el tud rendezni – fent jelenik meg. Az 1. ablak az 1. zónát kapja és így tovább; a további ablakok osztoznak az utolsó zónán. Ha kevesebb az ablak, mint a zóna, a „Fő és halom” kerül használatra, hogy ne maradjanak lyukak.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Minden ablak magától megtalálja a helyét, mint egy csempéző ablakkezelőben.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Minden ablak magától megtalálja a helyét a képernyőn. Az új ablakok beállnak a sorba, a bezártak helyet adnak a többinek.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Példa: két ablak egymás mellett, háromtól fő és halom, öttől rács. Illő szabály nélkül a fent választott elrendezés érvényes.","Fade in and out":"Áttűnés megjelenéskor és eltűnéskor","Fade the other windows":"A többi ablak halványítása","Features":"Funkciók","Feel":"Érzet","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Igazodás a már illesztett ablakokhoz","Fits the way you work.":"Illeszkedik a munkamódszeredhez.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Ablak lebegtetése (kilépés a csempézésből)","Four quarters":"Negyedelés","From":"Ennyitől:","Fullscreen":"Teljes képernyő","Gap between windows":"Térköz az ablakok között","Gap to the screen edge":"Térköz a képernyő szélétől","General":"Általános","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Minden műveletnek újra a választott séma billentyűjét adja, és eltávolítja azokat, amelyek a sémában nincsenek.","Good to know":"Jó tudni","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Fogja meg az ablakot a címsoránál, és húzza felfelé. A sáv lecsúszik; engedje el az ablakot egy zónán, és pontosan azt a területet tölti ki. Ha újra elhúzza, visszakapja korábbi méretét.","Grab window A…":"Fogd meg az A ablakot…","Grid":"Rács","Halves":"Felezés","Hiding":"Elrejtés","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Tartás a szélnél a szabad hely kitöltéséhez","Hold time":"Tartási idő","Hold to fill":"Tartás a kitöltéshez","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Milyen közel kell egy szélnek kerülnie, mielőtt bepattan.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Milyen közel kell a mutatónak a szélhez érnie.","How far the bar slides down":"Mennyire csúszik le a sáv","How it works":"Hogyan működik","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Mennyi ideig kell az ablaknak a szélnél maradnia – egy kis lökés. 0 = azonnal.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Mennyi ideig kell az ablaknak a szélnél maradnia, mielőtt megnő.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Hány ablak osztozik a fő területen („Fő és halom” elrendezés).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Ha alul már van egy ablak, a felső szél a felső felet adja teljes méret helyett. A felek és negyedek is szabadon hagyják az illesztett ablakokat.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Ha tetszik a KSnapUnity, támogathatod a fejlesztését – köszönjük!","In bar":"A sávban","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Független az illesztősávtól és a képernyőszélektől.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Független az illesztősávtól. Minden szél külön kapcsolható.","Information":"Információ","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Intuitív, természetes ablakviselkedés.","Join at the end":"A végére kerülnek","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K mint KWin · Snap mint okosabb illesztés · Unity mint minden egy rendszerben","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"A KDE-nek saját képernyőszél-műveletei és saját ablakillesztése van. Ha itt ugyanaz a funkció be van kapcsolva, kapcsolja ki a KDE-ét: Rendszerbeállítások → Ablakkezelés → Képernyőszélek, valamint Ablakviselkedés → Mozgatás.","KDE's own edge tiling":"A KDE saját szélmozaikja","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"A KDE saját teljes méretre állítása és csempézése a széleken – körvonalával – szünetel, amíg a KSnapUnity fut, így csak egy előnézet látszik. A KDE-beállításaid nem változnak: kapcsold ki ezt, tiltsd le vagy távolítsd el a KSnapUnityt, és visszatér a KDE viselkedése.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"A KDE saját képernyőszél-műveletei még be vannak kapcsolva, így két segéd reagál ugyanarra a húzásra. Kapcsolja ki a „Teljes méret” és a „Csempézés” lehetőséget: Rendszerbeállítások → Ablakkezelés → Képernyőszélek.","KDE's own window snapping":"A KDE saját ablakillesztése","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"A KDE saját ablakillesztése is be van kapcsolva. Az egységes érzethez állítsa a zónáit „Nincs” értékre: Rendszerbeállítások → Ablakkezelés → Ablakviselkedés → Mozgatás.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"A KDE billentyűparancs-szolgáltatása nem válaszolt. A billentyűket a Rendszerbeállítások → Billentyűparancsok → KWin alatt is beállíthatja.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – beállításszerkesztő","Keep stacked windows in line":"Egymás alatti ablakok egy vonalban","Keep the gap between windows":"Térköz megtartása az ablakok között","Keep them":"Megtartás","Key scheme":"Billentyűséma","Keyboard shortcuts":"Billentyűparancsok","Keys":"Billentyűk","Keys already in use":"Már használt billentyűk","Layout":"Elrendezés","Layout by number of windows":"Elrendezés az ablakok száma szerint","Layouts":"Elrendezések","Layouts per row":"Elrendezések soronként","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Bal és jobb szél: a képernyő fele","Left edge: left half":"Bal szél: bal fele","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"100 % alatt az egyetlen ablak középen marad – szép széles képernyőn.","License":"Licenc","Light":"Világos","Linear":"Lineáris","Live preview":"Élő előnézet","Load template…":"Sablon betöltése…","Magnet":"Mágnes","Main + stack":"Fő + köteg","Main and stack":"Fő és halom","Main area bigger":"Nagyobb fő terület","Main area on the right":"Fő terület jobbra","Main area smaller":"Kisebb fő terület","Main in the middle":"Fő középen","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Főkapcsoló a húzáshoz és a billentyűkhöz.","Main window":"Fő ablak","Main windows":"Fő ablakok","Main windows: %1":"Főablakok: %1","Make it the main window":"Legyen ez a fő ablak","Maximize":"Teljes méret","Maximize or restore":"Teljes méret vagy visszaállítás","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + billentyű (KDE-stílus)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + billentyű","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + billentyű","Minimize":"Kis méret","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Tükrözi az elrendezést: a főablak jobbra, a többi balra.","Mode":"Mód","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"1. mód – illesztősáv és képernyőszélek","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"2. mód – automatikus csempézés","Modes":"Módok","More ways":"További módok","Motion curve":"Mozgásgörbe","Move a window towards others…":"Vigyél egy ablakot a többiekhez…","Move the window one place back":"Ablak eggyel hátrébb","Move the window one place on":"Ablak eggyel előrébb","Name:":"Név:","New layout":"Új elrendezés","New windows":"Új ablakok","Next tiling layout":"Következő csempeelrendezés","Next to the active window":"Az aktív ablak mellé","No key":"Nincs billentyű","No other window open":"Nincs más nyitott ablak","No outer margin":"Nincs külső margó","No shortcuts":"Nincs billentyűparancs","None":"Nincs","None yet.":"Még nincs.","Off":"Ki","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Ki = 1. mód, be = 2. mód","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Ki: semleges keret – csak a bekapcsolt előnézetekhez.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Ki: a billentyűk hozzárendelve maradnak, de nem csinálnak semmit.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Ki: az ablakok ott maradnak, ahová teszed őket. A többi funkció így is működik.","One at a time":"Egyszerre egy","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Egy bezárul – a többiek kitöltik a rést","One main window less":"Eggyel kevesebb főablak","One more main window":"Eggyel több főablak","One window":"Egy ablak","Only one mode is switched on.":"Csak egy mód van bekapcsolva.","Open settings editor":"Beállításszerkesztő megnyitása","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Először nyisd meg az alkalmazást, aztán itt válaszd ki.","Open the layout builder":"Elrendezésépítő megnyitása","Own layouts":"Saját elrendezések","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Az egyes oldalak sarokként számító része.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"A KDE szélmozaikjának és előnézetének szüneteltetése","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"A KDE illesztési zónáinak szüneteltetése, amíg a mágnes be van kapcsolva","Preview":"Előnézet","Previews":"Előnézetek","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Nyomja az ablakot a képernyő egy széléhez vagy sarkához, és kitölti azt a részt. Az illesztősávval vagy anélkül is működik.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Nyomja az ablakot egy szélhez vagy sarokhoz: teljes méret, felek, negyedek.","Push delay":"Nyomási késleltetés","Quarters":"Negyedek","Quick":"Gyors","Quick settings":"Gyorsbeállítások","Recommended values":"Ajánlott értékek","Remove":"Eltávolítás","Remove rule":"Szabály törlése","Remove zone":"Zóna eltávolítása","Reset all":"Összes visszaállítása","Reset all keys":"Minden billentyű visszaállítása","Reset to default":"Alapértelmezés visszaállítása","Resistance against overlapping":"Átfedés elleni ellenállás","Resize touching windows together":"Az egymáshoz érő ablakok együttes átméretezése","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Az átméretezés is illeszt – itt teljes magasságra","Restore":"Visszaállítás","Restore default layouts":"Alapértelmezett elrendezések visszaállítása","Restore default layouts?":"Visszaállítja az alapértelmezett elrendezéseket?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Eredeti méret visszaállítása az ablak kihúzásakor","Restore the size before snapping":"Méret visszaállítása az illesztés előttire","Rows":"Sorok","Save":"Mentés","Screen edges":"Képernyőszélek","Screen edges on/off":"Képernyőszélek be/ki","Screen edges preview":"A képernyőszélek előnézete","Set":"Beállítás","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Egyszerre állítja be az összes művelet billentyűit. Az egyes billentyűket lent továbbra is módosíthatja.","Settings":"Beállítások","Settings file":"Beállításfájl","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Átméretezés közben rázd gyorsan oda-vissza az egeret, és a többi ablak visszaugrik. Egy gyors rántás egy irányba soha nem engedi el őket.","Shake to let go":"Rázás az elengedéshez","Shortcuts":"Parancsok","Show a small handle first":"Először egy kis fogantyú megjelenítése","Show layout and zone names":"Elrendezés- és zónanevek megjelenítése","Show previews in the accent color":"Előnézetek a kiemelőszínnel","Showing":"Megjelenítés","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Megmutatja, hová kerül az ablak egy szélen vagy sarokban. Ki: semmilyen előnézet.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Megmutatja, hová kerül az ablak, amíg a sáv egy zónája ki van emelve. Ki: semmilyen előnézet.","Sidebar + grid":"Oldalsáv + rács","Single zone":"Egyetlen zóna","Six tiles":"Hat csempe","Size & shape":"Méret és forma","Size of the main area":"A fő terület mérete","Slide-in duration":"Lecsúszás időtartama","Slide-out duration":"Visszacsúszás időtartama","Smart arranging and detection.":"Okos elrendezés és felismerés.","Smart fill":"Okos kitöltés","Smooth (default)":"Lágy (alapértelmezett)","Snap bar":"Illesztősáv","Snap bar and screen edges":"Illesztősáv és képernyőszélek","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"A sáv és a szélek ki vannak kapcsolva – csak a 2. mód fut, és a módváltó billentyű nem csinál semmit.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Az illesztősáv és a képernyőszélek zavarják az automatikus csempézést. Ezért két módként futnak – válts billentyűparanccsal vagy itt.","Snap bar colors:":"A sáv színei:","Snap bar on/off":"Illesztősáv be/ki","Snap bar preview":"Az illesztősáv előnézete","Snap bar size":"Sáv mérete","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Illesztősáv, képernyőszélek, ablakmágnes, billentyűparancsok és ablakcsere.","Snap distance":"Illesztési távolság","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Elválasztók illesztése (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Illesztési elrendezések és automatikus csempézés.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Illessze az aktív ablakot billentyűkombinációval.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Illessze az aktív ablakot a billentyűzettel. Ezek szokásos globális KDE-billentyűparancsok – a Rendszerbeállítások → Billentyűparancsok → KWin alatt is megtalálja őket.","Snap to the bottom half":"Illesztés az alsó félre","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Illesztés a bal alsó negyedbe","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Illesztés a jobb alsó negyedbe","Snap to the center third":"Illesztés a középső harmadba","Snap to the left half":"Illesztés a bal félre","Snap to the left third":"Illesztés a bal harmadba","Snap to the left two thirds":"Illesztés a bal kétharmadba","Snap to the right half":"Illesztés a jobb félre","Snap to the right third":"Illesztés a jobb harmadba","Snap to the right two thirds":"Illesztés a jobb kétharmadba","Snap to the top half":"Illesztés a felső félre","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Illesztés a bal felső negyedbe","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Illesztés a jobb felső negyedbe","Snapping":"Illesztés","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Az illesztés és az automatikus csempézés két mód – egy billentyűparancs vált köztük.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Így csak egy mágnes húz egy ablakot. A KDE-beállításaid nem változnak: kapcsold ki ezt, tiltsd le vagy távolítsd el a KSnapUnityt, és visszatér a KDE illesztése.","Soft":"Finom","Spacing":"Térközök","Spiral":"Spirál","Split side by side":"Felosztás egymás mellé","Split top and bottom":"Felosztás felül és alul","Stack + main":"Köteg + fő","Stick to other windows":"Tapadás más ablakokhoz","Stick to the screen edges":"Tapadás a képernyő széleihez","Sticky edges":"Tapadó szélek","Support KSnapUnity":"Támogasd a KSnapUnityt","Swap":"Csere","Swap windows":"Ablakok cseréje","Swap with the window above":"Csere a fölötte lévő ablakkal","Swap with the window below":"Csere az alatta lévő ablakkal","Swap with the window on the left":"Csere a bal oldali ablakkal","Swap with the window on the right":"Csere a jobb oldali ablakkal","Switch mode":"Mód váltása","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Mód váltása (illesztés / csempézés)","Switch modes with:":"Módváltás ezzel:","Switch the layout by itself":"Elrendezés váltása magától","Switched off":"Kikapcsolva","System":"Rendszer","Take it over":"Átvétel","Take over all":"Mind átvétele","Take the main place":"Elfoglalják a fő helyet","Test animation":"Animáció kipróbálása","Test on screen":"Kipróbálás a képernyőn","Test the snap bar":"Illesztősáv kipróbálása","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Az alapértékek a Windows 11-en alapulnak.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Az illesztő műveletek ugyanazokat a térközöket használják, mint a sáv, és megjegyzik az illesztés előtti méretet: a „Méret visszaállítása az illesztés előttire” visszahozza.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Ezek az alkalmazások soha nincsenek elrendezve, és megtartják a helyüket. A párbeszédablakok mindig lebegnek.","Thirds":"Harmadok","Three columns":"Három oszlop","Thumbnail width":"Bélyegképek szélessége","Tiling":"Csempézés","Tip":"Tipp","Top / bottom":"Fent / lent","Top edge":"Felső szél","Top edge: full screen":"Felső szél: teljes képernyő","Top edge: maximize":"Felső szél: teljes méret","Top edge: top half":"Felső szél: felső fele","Top half":"Felső fele","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Aktiválási távolság a felső széltől","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Kapcsolja ki, ha a KDE saját körvonala jobban tetszik – ekkor kapcsolja ki fent a képernyőszélek előnézetét.","Two thirds":"Kétharmad","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Két ablak helyet cserél – ejtsd az egyiket a másikra, vagy használd a billentyűket.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Két ablak helyet cserél: ejtsd az egyiket a másikra, vagy billentyűvel.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Billentyűparancsok használata","Use screen edges":"Képernyőszélek használata","Use the system accent color":"A rendszer kiemelőszínének használata","Use the window magnet":"Ablakmágnes használata","Usual combinations":"Szokásos kombinációk","Version":"Verzió","Wanted for: %1":"Ehhez kellene: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Ha egy ablak nyílik, bezárul vagy cserél, a többi ugrás helyett finoman mozdul.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Ha átméretez egy ablakot, a hozzá érő ablakok vele mozgatják a közös szélt – semmi sem fedi át egymást, nem keletkezik rés.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Átméretezés közben a nem követő ablakok átlátszóan jelennek meg.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Ablak mozgatása vagy átméretezése közben a szélei a közeli ablakokhoz és a képernyő széleihez tapadnak.","Width":"Szélesség","Window":"Ablak","Window magnet":"Ablakmágnes","Window magnet on/off":"Ablakmágnes be/ki","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Az egymás feletti ablakok együtt tartják bal és jobb szélüket, az egymás melletti ablakok a felsőt és az alsót.","Windows glide to their place":"Az ablakok a helyükre siklanak","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Az ablakok egymáshoz és a képernyő széleihez tapadnak.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Az ablakok az Általános oldal „Térköz az ablakok között” értékénél megállnak, ahelyett hogy összeérnének.","Yes":"Igen","Your own combination":"Saját kombináció","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"A saját elrendezések és azok sorrendje elvesznek.","Zone %1":"%1. zóna","for KWin · v%1":"KWinhez · v%1","windows:":"ablak:","“%1” will be removed.":"„%1” el lesz távolítva.","…drag it onto window B…":"…húzd a B ablakra…","…in every direction":"…minden irányban","…let go: they trade places":"…engedd el: helyet cserélnek","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…a szomszédok vele nőnek és zsugorodnak","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Kész – kattints az OK gombra a beállításszerkesztő megnyitásához."},"hy":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (պատճեն)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1-ն օգտագործվում է «%2»-ի կողմից։","%1 of %2 zones":"%1՝ %2 գոտուց","0 = all in one row":"0 = բոլորը մեկ տողում","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Ռեժիմ 1</b><br/>Վահանակ և էկրանի եզրեր","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Ռեժիմ 2</b><br/>Ավտոմատ սալիկավորում","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Միակ պատուհանը զբաղեցնում է ամբողջ էկրանը, նույնիսկ լուսանցքի առկայությամբ։","A new window joins":"Նոր պատուհան է միանում","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Կարճ հրումը տալիս է կեսը կամ քառորդը։ Պատուհանը մի փոքր ավելի երկար պահեք եզրին, և այն կմեծանա մինչև հաջորդ պատուհանը – նախադիտումը դա ցույց է տալիս։","A single window":"Մեկ առանձին պատուհան","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Պատուհանը կանգ է առնում մյուսի եզրին, նույնիսկ եթե արագ եք շարժում։ Բաց թողնելու համար թափահարեք մկնիկը կամ մի պահ էլ հրեք։ 0 = պատուհանները կարող են ազատ ծածկել միմյանց։","About & Help":"Ծրագրի մասին և օգնություն","Accent color":"Շեշտի գույն","Active":"Ակտիվ","Active mode":"Ակտիվ ռեժիմ","Active width along the top edge":"Ակտիվ լայնությունը վերին եզրի երկայնքով","Add an open application":"Ավելացնել բաց ծրագիր","Add rule":"Ավելացնել կանոն","All window features in one system.":"Պատուհանների բոլոր գործառույթները մեկ համակարգում։","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Փոխվում է նաև, երբ ձեռքով եք փոխում գլխավոր պատուհանի չափը։","Also while resizing":"Նաև չափը փոխելիս","Always floating":"Միշտ լողացող","Animation":"Անիմացիա","Appearance":"Տեսք","Apply":"Կիրառել","Arrange windows":"Պատուհանների դասավորում","Arrange windows automatically":"Ավտոմատ դասավորել պատուհանները","Author":"Հեղինակ","Automatic tiling":"Ավտոմատ սալիկավորում","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Ավտոմատ սալիկավորումն անջատված է – աշխատում է միայն ռեժիմ 1-ը, և ռեժիմի դյուրանցումը ոչինչ չի անում։","Automatic tiling off":"Ավտոմատ սալիկավորումն անջատված է","Automatic tiling on":"Ավտոմատ սալիկավորումը միացված է","Automatic tiling on/off":"Ավտոմատ սալիկավորում միաց./անջատ.","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Ավտոմատ սալիկավորում, պատուհանների փոխանակում, դյուրանցումներ և մագնիս լողացող պատուհանների համար։","Background opacity":"Ֆոնի անթափանցիկությունը","Behavior & Animation":"Վարքագիծ և անիմացիա","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Ստորին եզր՝ ստորին կես","Bouncy":"Զսպանակավոր","Buy me a coffee":"Հյուրասիրիր ինձ մի բաժակ սուրճ","Cancel":"Չեղարկել","Center focus":"Կենտրոնական ֆոկուս","Center the window":"Պատուհանը կենտրոնում","Change":"Փոխել","Change key":"Փոխել ստեղնը","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Ստեղնը փոխեք կարգավորումների խմբագրում։ Երկու ռեժիմներին էլ պետք են ավտոմատ սալիկավորում և վահանակ կամ էկրանի եզրեր։","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Փոխեք դրանք «Ստեղնաշարի դյուրանցումներ» էջում։ Ավտոմատ սալիկավորման դեպքում պատուհանները փոխում են նաև իրենց տեղը հերթականության մեջ։","Choose…":"Ընտրել…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Սեղմեք գոտու վրա՝ ընտրելու համար · կրկնակի սեղմումը բաժանում է · քաշեք բաժանարարները","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Սեղմեք կամ %1՝ ռեժիմը փոխելու համար։","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Սեղմեք, ապա OK – կարգավորումների խմբագիրը բացվում է։","Close":"Փակել","Close by, the edges stick together":"Մոտիկից եզրերը կպչում են","Color scheme":"Գունային սխեմա","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Վահանակի գույները, չափը և ձևը։","Columns":"Սյունակներ","Corner radius":"Անկյունների շառավիղը","Corner size":"Անկյան չափ","Corner: a quarter":"Անկյուն՝ քառորդ","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Անկյուններ՝ էկրանի քառորդ","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + ստեղն (լռելյայն)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + թվային ստեղնաշար","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + ստեղն","Custom color":"Սեփական գույն","Custom layout %1":"Սեփական դասավորություն %1","Dark":"Մուգ","Delay before hiding":"Հապաղում թաքցնելուց առաջ","Delay before showing":"Հապաղում ցուցադրելուց առաջ","Delete":"Ջնջել","Delete layout?":"Ջնջե՞լ դասավորությունը","Distance at which the handle appears":"Հեռավորությունը, որտեղ հայտնվում է բռնակը","Distance before the bar hides again":"Հեռավորությունը, որից հետո վահանակը նորից թաքնվում է","Distance to the edge":"Հեռավորությունը մինչև եզր","Donate with PayPal":"Նվիրաբերել PayPal-ով","Drag a shared edge…":"Քաշեք ընդհանուր եզրը…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Քաշեք պատուհանը դեպի եզր…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Քաշեք պատուհանը մյուսի վրա՝ փոխանակելու համար։ Վահանակին կամ էկրանի եզրին գցելիս այն ազատ լողում է. «Թողնել պատուհանը լողալ»-ը վերադարձնում է այն։ Բացատները գալիս են Ընդհանուր էջից։","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Քաշեք պատուհանը մյուսի կենտրոնի վրա – նախադիտումը ցույց է տալիս երկու սլաք – և բաց թողեք։ Ավտոմատ սալիկավորման դեպքում բավական է մյուս պատուհանի ցանկացած կետ։","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Քաշեք պատուհանը էկրանի վերին եզրը և բաց թողեք գոտու վրա։","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Քաշեք քարտերը՝ վահանակում հերթականությունը փոխելու համար։ Կրկնակի սեղմեք քարտի վրա՝ այն խմբագրելու համար։","Drop a window onto another one":"Պատուհանը գցել մյուսի վրա","Drop the window onto a zone":"Բաց թողեք պատուհանը գոտու վրա","Duplicate":"Կրկնօրինակել","Duration":"Տևողություն","Dwindle":"Ներս պտտվող","Dynamic":"Դինամիկ","Edges and corners":"Եզրեր և անկյուններ","Edit":"Խմբագրել","Edit layout":"Խմբագրել դասավորությունը","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Յուրաքանչյուր գործառույթ կարելի է առանձին միացնել և անջատել։","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Դասավորություններ էջում ստեղծված յուրաքանչյուր դասավորություն կարող է նաև պատուհաններ դասավորել – այն երևում է վերևում։ 1-ին պատուհանը ստանում է 1-ին գոտին և այլն. ավելորդ պատուհանները կիսում են վերջին գոտին։ Գոտիներից քիչ պատուհանների դեպքում օգտագործվում է «Գլխավոր և կույտ», որպեսզի բացեր չմնան։","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Յուրաքանչյուր պատուհան ինքն է գտնում իր տեղը, ինչպես սալիկավոր պատուհանների կառավարիչում։","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Յուրաքանչյուր պատուհան ինքն է գտնում իր տեղն էկրանին։ Նոր պատուհանները միանում են, փակվածները տեղ են թողնում մյուսներին։","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Օրինակ՝ երկու պատուհան կողք կողքի, երեքից՝ գլխավոր և կույտ, հինգից՝ ցանց։ Համապատասխան կանոնի բացակայության դեպքում գործում է վերևում ընտրված դասավորությունը։","Fade in and out":"Աստիճանական հայտնվել և անհետանալ","Fade the other windows":"Խամրեցնել մյուս պատուհանները","Features":"Գործառույթներ","Feel":"Զգացողություն","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Հարմարվել արդեն կցված պատուհաններին","Fits the way you work.":"Համապատասխանում է ձեր աշխատաոճին։","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Թողնել պատուհանը լողալ (դուրս գալ սալիկավորումից)","Four quarters":"Չորս քառորդ","From":"Սկսած","Fullscreen":"Ամբողջ էկրան","Gap between windows":"Միջակայք պատուհանների միջև","Gap to the screen edge":"Միջակայք էկրանի եզրից","General":"Ընդհանուր","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Յուրաքանչյուր գործողությանը կրկին տալիս է ընտրված սխեմայի ստեղնը և հեռացնում սխեմայում չեղած ստեղները։","Good to know":"Լավ է իմանալ","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Բռնեք պատուհանը վերնագրի գոտուց և քաշեք վերև։ Վահանակը սահում է ներքև. բաց թողեք պատուհանը գոտու վրա, և այն կզբաղեցնի հենց այդ տարածքը։ Երբ նորից դուրս քաշեք, այն կվերադարձնի նախկին չափը։","Grab window A…":"Բռնեք A պատուհանը…","Grid":"Ցանց","Halves":"Կեսեր","Hiding":"Թաքցում","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Պահել եզրին՝ ազատ տարածքը լցնելու համար","Hold time":"Պահելու ժամանակ","Hold to fill":"Պահել լցնելու համար","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Որքան մոտ պետք է եզրը գա, մինչև տեղում ամրանա։","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Որքան մոտ պետք է կուրսորը գա եզրին։","How far the bar slides down":"Որքան ցած է սահում վահանակը","How it works":"Ինչպես է աշխատում","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Որքան երկար պետք է պատուհանը հենվի եզրին՝ փոքր հրում։ 0 = անմիջապես։","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Որքան պետք է պատուհանը մնա եզրին, մինչև մեծանա։","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Քանի պատուհան են կիսում գլխավոր տարածքը («Գլխավոր և կույտ» դասավորություն)։","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Եթե ներքևում արդեն պատուհան կա, վերին եզրը առավելագույնի փոխարեն տալիս է վերին կեսը։ Կեսերն ու քառորդները նույնպես չեն ծածկում կցված պատուհանները։","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Եթե KSnapUnity-ն ձեզ դուր է գալիս, կարող եք աջակցել դրա մշակմանը – շնորհակալություն։","In bar":"Վահանակում","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Անկախ է վահանակից և էկրանի եզրերից։","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Անկախ է վահանակից։ Յուրաքանչյուր եզր կարելի է առանձին միացնել։","Information":"Տեղեկություն","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Ինտուիտիվ, բնական պատուհանների վարք։","Join at the end":"Միանում են վերջում","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K՝ KWin · Snap՝ ավելի խելացի կպցում · Unity՝ ամեն ինչ մեկ համակարգում","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE-ն ունի էկրանի եզրերի սեփական գործողություններ և պատուհանների կցում։ Եթե նույն գործառույթն այստեղ միացված է, անջատեք KDE-ինը՝ Համակարգի կարգավորումներ → Պատուհանների կառավարում → Էկրանի եզրեր, և Պատուհանի վարքագիծ → Տեղաշարժ։","KDE's own edge tiling":"KDE-ի սեփական եզրերի սալիկավորում","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"KDE-ի սեփական մեծացումն ու սալիկավորումը եզրերին – իր ուրվագծով – դադարում են, քանի դեռ KSnapUnity-ն աշխատում է, որպեսզի մեկ նախադիտում երևա։ KDE-ի կարգավորումները չեն փոխվում՝ անջատեք սա, անջատեք կամ հեռացրեք KSnapUnity-ն, և KDE-ի վարքը կվերադառնա։","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"KDE-ի էկրանի եզրերի սեփական գործողությունները դեռ միացված են, ուստի նույն քաշմանը արձագանքում են երկու օգնական։ Անջատեք «Առավելագույնի հասցնել»-ը և «Սալիկավորել»-ը՝ Համակարգի կարգավորումներ → Պատուհանների կառավարում → Էկրանի եզրեր։","KDE's own window snapping":"KDE-ի սեփական պատուհանների կցում","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE-ի պատուհանների սեփական կցումը նույնպես միացված է։ Միասնական զգացողության համար դրա գոտիները դրեք «Ոչ մեկը»՝ Համակարգի կարգավորումներ → Պատուհանների կառավարում → Պատուհանի վարքագիծ → Տեղաշարժ։","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"KDE-ի դյուրանցումների ծառայությունը չպատասխանեց։ Ստեղները դեռ կարող եք սահմանել Համակարգի կարգավորումներ → Դյուրանցումներ → KWin բաժնում։","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – կարգավորումների խմբագիր","Keep stacked windows in line":"Իրար վրա դրված պատուհանները մեկ գծում պահել","Keep the gap between windows":"Պահպանել միջակայքը պատուհանների միջև","Keep them":"Թողնել","Key scheme":"Ստեղների սխեմա","Keyboard shortcuts":"Ստեղնաշարի դյուրանցումներ","Keys":"Ստեղներ","Keys already in use":"Արդեն օգտագործվող ստեղներ","Layout":"Դասավորություն","Layout by number of windows":"Դասավորություն ըստ պատուհանների քանակի","Layouts":"Դասավորություններ","Layouts per row":"Դասավորություններ մեկ տողում","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Ձախ և աջ եզր՝ էկրանի կեսը","Left edge: left half":"Ձախ եզր՝ ձախ կես","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"100 %-ից պակասի դեպքում միակ պատուհանը մնում է կենտրոնում – հարմար է լայն էկրաններին։","License":"Արտոնագիր","Light":"Բաց","Linear":"Գծային","Live preview":"Կենդանի նախադիտում","Load template…":"Բեռնել ձևանմուշ…","Magnet":"Մագնիս","Main + stack":"Հիմնական + կույտ","Main and stack":"Գլխավոր և կույտ","Main area bigger":"Ավելի մեծ գլխավոր տարածք","Main area on the right":"Գլխավոր տարածքը աջում","Main area smaller":"Ավելի փոքր գլխավոր տարածք","Main in the middle":"Գլխավորը մեջտեղում","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Գլխավոր անջատիչ քաշելու և ստեղների համար։","Main window":"Գլխավոր պատուհան","Main windows":"Գլխավոր պատուհաններ","Main windows: %1":"Գլխավոր պատուհաններ՝ %1","Make it the main window":"Դարձնել գլխավոր պատուհան","Maximize":"Մեծացնել","Maximize or restore":"Առավելագույնի հասցնել կամ վերականգնել","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + ստեղն (KDE ոճ)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + ստեղն","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + ստեղն","Minimize":"Ծալել","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Հայելապատկերում է դասավորությունը՝ գլխավոր պատուհանը աջում, մյուսները ձախում։","Mode":"Ռեժիմ","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Ռեժիմ 1 – վահանակ և էկրանի եզրեր","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Ռեժիմ 2 – ավտոմատ սալիկավորում","Modes":"Ռեժիմներ","More ways":"Այլ եղանակներ","Motion curve":"Շարժման կոր","Move a window towards others…":"Տարեք պատուհանը մյուսների մոտ…","Move the window one place back":"Տեղափոխել պատուհանը մեկ տեղ հետ","Move the window one place on":"Տեղափոխել պատուհանը մեկ տեղ առաջ","Name:":"Անուն՝","New layout":"Նոր դասավորություն","New windows":"Նոր պատուհաններ","Next tiling layout":"Հաջորդ դասավորությունը","Next to the active window":"Ակտիվ պատուհանի կողքին","No key":"Ստեղն չկա","No other window open":"Այլ բաց պատուհան չկա","No outer margin":"Առանց արտաքին լուսանցքի","No shortcuts":"Առանց դյուրանցումների","None":"Ոչ մեկը","None yet.":"Դեռ ոչ մեկը։","Off":"Անջատված","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Անջատ = ռեժիմ 1, միացված = ռեժիմ 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Անջատված՝ չեզոք շրջանակ – միայն միացված նախադիտումների համար։","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Անջատված՝ ստեղները մնում են նշանակված, բայց ոչինչ չեն անում։","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Անջատված՝ պատուհանները մնում են այնտեղ, որտեղ դնում եք։ Մյուս գործառույթներն աշխատում են ամեն դեպքում։","One at a time":"Մեկ առ մեկ","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Մեկը փակվում է – մյուսները լցնում են բացը","One main window less":"Մեկ գլխավոր պատուհան պակաս","One more main window":"Եվս մեկ գլխավոր պատուհան","One window":"Մեկ պատուհան","Only one mode is switched on.":"Միացված է միայն մեկ ռեժիմ։","Open settings editor":"Բացել կարգավորումների խմբագիրը","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Նախ բացեք ծրագիրը, ապա ընտրեք այն այստեղ։","Open the layout builder":"Բացել դասավորությունների կառուցիչը","Own layouts":"Սեփական դասավորություններ","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Յուրաքանչյուր կողմի այն մասը, որը համարվում է անկյուն։","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Դադարեցնել KDE-ի եզրերի սալիկավորումը և դրա նախադիտումը","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Դադարեցնել KDE-ի կցման գոտիները, քանի դեռ մագնիսը միացված է","Preview":"Նախադիտում","Previews":"Նախադիտումներ","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Սեղմեք պատուհանը էկրանի եզրին կամ անկյունին, և այն կլցնի այդ հատվածը։ Աշխատում է վահանակով կամ առանց դրա։","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Սեղմեք պատուհանը եզրին կամ անկյունին՝ առավելագույն, կեսեր, քառորդներ։","Push delay":"Սեղմման ուշացում","Quarters":"Քառորդներ","Quick":"Արագ","Quick settings":"Արագ կարգավորումներ","Recommended values":"Առաջարկվող արժեքներ","Remove":"Հեռացնել","Remove rule":"Հեռացնել կանոնը","Remove zone":"Հեռացնել գոտին","Reset all":"Վերակայել բոլորը","Reset all keys":"Վերակայել բոլոր ստեղները","Reset to default":"Վերականգնել լռելյայնը","Resistance against overlapping":"Դիմադրություն վերադրմանը","Resize touching windows together":"Միմյանց դիպչող պատուհանների չափը միասին փոխել","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Չափափոխումն էլ է կպչում – այստեղ մինչև լրիվ բարձրություն","Restore":"Վերականգնել","Restore default layouts":"Վերականգնել լռելյայն դասավորությունները","Restore default layouts?":"Վերականգնե՞լ լռելյայն դասավորությունները","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Վերականգնել սկզբնական չափը, երբ պատուհանը դուրս է քաշվում","Restore the size before snapping":"Վերականգնել չափը մինչև կցումը","Rows":"Տողեր","Save":"Պահել","Screen edges":"Էկրանի եզրեր","Screen edges on/off":"Էկրանի եզրերը միացնել/անջատել","Screen edges preview":"Էկրանի եզրերի նախադիտում","Set":"Սահմանել","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Սահմանում է բոլոր գործողությունների ստեղները միանգամից։ Առանձին ստեղները կարող եք փոխել ներքևում։","Settings":"Կարգավորումներ","Settings file":"Կարգավորումների ֆայլ","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Չափը փոխելիս արագ թափահարեք մկնիկը առաջ-հետ, և մյուս պատուհանները կվերադառնան։ Մեկ ուղղությամբ արագ քաշելը երբեք չի բաց թողնում։","Shake to let go":"Թափահարել՝ բաց թողնելու համար","Shortcuts":"Դյուրանցումներ","Show a small handle first":"Նախ ցույց տալ փոքր բռնակ","Show layout and zone names":"Ցույց տալ դասավորությունների և գոտիների անունները","Show previews in the accent color":"Ցուցադրել նախադիտումները շեշտի գույնով","Showing":"Ցուցադրում","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Ցույց է տալիս, թե որտեղ կհայտնվի պատուհանը եզրին կամ անկյունում։ Անջատված՝ նախադիտում ընդհանրապես չկա։","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Ցույց է տալիս, թե որտեղ կհայտնվի պատուհանը, քանի դեռ վահանակի գոտին ընդգծված է։ Անջատված՝ նախադիտում ընդհանրապես չկա։","Sidebar + grid":"Կողային վահանակ + ցանց","Single zone":"Մեկ գոտի","Six tiles":"Վեց սալիկ","Size & shape":"Չափ և ձև","Size of the main area":"Գլխավոր տարածքի չափը","Slide-in duration":"Ներս սահելու տևողությունը","Slide-out duration":"Դուրս սահելու տևողությունը","Smart arranging and detection.":"Խելացի դասավորում և ճանաչում։","Smart fill":"Խելացի լցում","Smooth (default)":"Սահուն (լռելյայն)","Snap bar":"Վահանակ","Snap bar and screen edges":"Վահանակ և էկրանի եզրեր","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Վահանակն ու եզրերն անջատված են – աշխատում է միայն ռեժիմ 2-ը, և ռեժիմի դյուրանցումը ոչինչ չի անում։","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Վահանակն ու էկրանի եզրերը խանգարում են ավտոմատ սալիկավորմանը։ Ուստի դրանք աշխատում են երկու ռեժիմով – փոխեք դյուրանցմամբ կամ այստեղ։","Snap bar colors:":"Վահանակի գույներ՝","Snap bar on/off":"Վահանակը միացնել/անջատել","Snap bar preview":"Վահանակի նախադիտում","Snap bar size":"Վահանակի չափը","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Վահանակ, էկրանի եզրեր, պատուհանի մագնիս, դյուրանցումներ և պատուհանների փոխանակում։","Snap distance":"Կպչելու հեռավորություն","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Կպցնել բաժանարարները (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Կպցման դասավորություններ և ավտոմատ սալիկավորում։","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Կցեք ակտիվ պատուհանը ստեղների համակցություններով։","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Կցեք ակտիվ պատուհանը ստեղնաշարով։ Սրանք KDE-ի սովորական գլոբալ դյուրանցումներ են. դրանք կգտնեք նաև Համակարգի կարգավորումներ → Դյուրանցումներ → KWin բաժնում։","Snap to the bottom half":"Կցել ստորին կեսին","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Կցել ստորին ձախ քառորդին","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Կցել ստորին աջ քառորդին","Snap to the center third":"Կցել միջին երրորդին","Snap to the left half":"Կցել ձախ կեսին","Snap to the left third":"Կցել ձախ երրորդին","Snap to the left two thirds":"Կցել ձախ երկու երրորդին","Snap to the right half":"Կցել աջ կեսին","Snap to the right third":"Կցել աջ երրորդին","Snap to the right two thirds":"Կցել աջ երկու երրորդին","Snap to the top half":"Կցել վերին կեսին","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Կցել վերին ձախ քառորդին","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Կցել վերին աջ քառորդին","Snapping":"Կպցում","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Կպցումն ու ավտոմատ սալիկավորումը երկու ռեժիմ են – մեկ դյուրանցում փոխում է դրանց միջև։","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Այսպես միայն մեկ մագնիս է քաշում պատուհանը։ KDE-ի կարգավորումները չեն փոխվում՝ անջատեք սա, անջատեք կամ հեռացրեք KSnapUnity-ն, և KDE-ի կպցումը կվերադառնա։","Soft":"Մեղմ","Spacing":"Միջակայքեր","Spiral":"Պարույր","Split side by side":"Բաժանել կողք կողքի","Split top and bottom":"Բաժանել վերև և ներքև","Stack + main":"Կույտ + հիմնական","Stick to other windows":"Կպչել այլ պատուհաններին","Stick to the screen edges":"Կպչել էկրանի եզրերին","Sticky edges":"Կպչուն եզրեր","Support KSnapUnity":"Աջակցեք KSnapUnity-ին","Swap":"Փոխանակել","Swap windows":"Պատուհանների փոխանակում","Swap with the window above":"Փոխանակել վերևի պատուհանի հետ","Swap with the window below":"Փոխանակել ներքևի պատուհանի հետ","Swap with the window on the left":"Փոխանակել ձախ պատուհանի հետ","Swap with the window on the right":"Փոխանակել աջ պատուհանի հետ","Switch mode":"Փոխել ռեժիմը","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Փոխել ռեժիմը (կպցում / սալիկավորում)","Switch modes with:":"Ռեժիմի փոխում՝","Switch the layout by itself":"Փոխել դասավորությունն ինքնուրույն","Switched off":"Անջատված","System":"Համակարգային","Take it over":"Վերցնել","Take over all":"Վերցնել բոլորը","Take the main place":"Զբաղեցնում են գլխավոր տեղը","Test animation":"Փորձել անիմացիան","Test on screen":"Փորձել էկրանին","Test the snap bar":"Փորձել վահանակը","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Լռելյայն արժեքները հիմնված են Windows 11-ի վրա։","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Կցման գործողություններն օգտագործում են նույն միջակայքերը, ինչ վահանակը, և հիշում են չափը մինչև կցումը՝ «Վերականգնել չափը մինչև կցումը» այն վերադարձնում է։","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Այս ծրագրերը երբեք չեն դասավորվում և պահում են իրենց տեղը։ Երկխոսությունները միշտ լողում են։","Thirds":"Երրորդներ","Three columns":"Երեք սյունակ","Thumbnail width":"Մանրապատկերների լայնությունը","Tiling":"Սալիկավորում","Tip":"Խորհուրդ","Top / bottom":"Վերև / ներքև","Top edge":"Վերին եզր","Top edge: full screen":"Վերին եզր՝ լիաէկրան","Top edge: maximize":"Վերին եզր՝ մեծացնել","Top edge: top half":"Վերին եզր՝ վերին կես","Top half":"Վերին կես","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Գործարկման հեռավորությունը վերին եզրից","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Անջատեք, եթե նախընտրում եք KDE-ի սեփական ուրվագիծը – ապա վերևում անջատեք էկրանի եզրերի նախադիտումը։","Two thirds":"Երկու երրորդ","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Երկու պատուհան փոխում են տեղերը – գցեք մեկը մյուսի վրա կամ օգտագործեք ստեղները։","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Երկու պատուհան փոխում են տեղերը՝ գցեք մեկը մյուսի վրա կամ ստեղնով։","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Օգտագործել ստեղնաշարի դյուրանցումները","Use screen edges":"Օգտագործել էկրանի եզրերը","Use the system accent color":"Օգտագործել համակարգի շեշտի գույնը","Use the window magnet":"Օգտագործել պատուհանի մագնիսը","Usual combinations":"Սովորական համակցություններ","Version":"Տարբերակ","Wanted for: %1":"Անհրաժեշտ է՝ %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Երբ պատուհանը բացվում, փակվում կամ փոխվում է, մյուսները շարժվում են սահուն՝ առանց ցատկի։","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Երբ փոխում եք պատուհանի չափը, նրան դիպչող պատուհանները տեղաշարժում են ընդհանուր եզրը նրա հետ՝ ոչինչ չի վերադրվում, բաց տեղ չի մնում։","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Չափը փոխելիս չհետևող պատուհանները ցուցադրվում են թափանցիկ։","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Պատուհանը տեղաշարժելիս կամ չափը փոխելիս նրա եզրերը կպչում են մոտակա պատուհաններին և էկրանի եզրերին։","Width":"Լայնություն","Window":"Պատուհան","Window magnet":"Պատուհանի մագնիս","Window magnet on/off":"Պատուհանի մագնիսը միացնել/անջատել","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Իրար վերևում գտնվող պատուհանները պահում են ձախ և աջ եզրերը միասին, կողք կողքի պատուհանները՝ վերին և ստորին եզրերը։","Windows glide to their place":"Պատուհանները սահուն տեղավորվում են","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Պատուհանները կպչում են իրար և էկրանի եզրերին։","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Պատուհանները իրար չեն դիպչում և կանգ են առնում Ընդհանուր էջի «Միջակայք պատուհանների միջև» արժեքի վրա։","Yes":"Այո","Your own combination":"Ձեր սեփական համակցությունը","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Ձեր դասավորությունները և դրանց հերթականությունը կկորչեն։","Zone %1":"Գոտի %1","for KWin · v%1":"KWin-ի համար · v%1","windows:":"պատուհանից՝","“%1” will be removed.":"«%1»-ը կհեռացվի։","…drag it onto window B…":"…քաշեք B պատուհանի վրա…","…in every direction":"…բոլոր ուղղություններով","…let go: they trade places":"…բաց թողեք՝ նրանք փոխում են տեղերը","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…հարևանները նրա հետ մեծանում ու փոքրանում են","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Պատրաստ է – սեղմեք OK՝ կարգավորումների խմբագիրը բացելու համար։"},"id":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (salinan)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 dipakai oleh “%2”.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 dari %2 zona","0 = all in one row":"0 = semua dalam satu baris","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Bilah tempel dan tepi layar","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Tata ubin otomatis","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Jendela tunggal memakai seluruh layar, meski ada margin.","A new window joins":"Jendela baru bergabung","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Dorongan singkat memberi setengah atau seperempat. Tahan jendela sedikit lebih lama di tepi dan jendela membesar sampai jendela berikutnya – pratinjau menunjukkannya.","A single window":"Satu jendela saja","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Jendela berhenti di tepi jendela lain, juga saat Anda memindahkannya dengan cepat. Goyangkan mouse atau terus dorong sebentar untuk melepasnya. 0 = jendela boleh tumpang tindih bebas.","About & Help":"Tentang & bantuan","Accent color":"Warna aksen","Active":"Aktif","Active mode":"Mode aktif","Active width along the top edge":"Lebar aktif di sepanjang tepi atas","Add an open application":"Tambah aplikasi yang terbuka","Add rule":"Tambah aturan","All window features in one system.":"Semua fitur jendela dalam satu sistem.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Juga berubah saat Anda mengubah ukuran jendela utama secara manual.","Also while resizing":"Juga saat mengubah ukuran","Always floating":"Selalu melayang","Animation":"Animasi","Appearance":"Tampilan","Apply":"Terapkan","Arrange windows":"Atur jendela","Arrange windows automatically":"Atur jendela secara otomatis","Author":"Pembuat","Automatic tiling":"Tata ubin otomatis","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Tata ubin otomatis mati – hanya mode 1 berjalan dan pintasan mode tidak berbuat apa-apa.","Automatic tiling off":"Tata ubin otomatis mati","Automatic tiling on":"Tata ubin otomatis aktif","Automatic tiling on/off":"Tata ubin otomatis hidup/mati","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Tata ubin otomatis, tukar jendela, pintasan, dan magnet untuk jendela melayang.","Background opacity":"Opasitas latar","Behavior & Animation":"Perilaku & animasi","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Tepi bawah: separuh bawah","Bouncy":"Memantul","Buy me a coffee":"Traktir saya kopi","Cancel":"Batal","Center focus":"Fokus tengah","Center the window":"Tengahkan jendela","Change":"Ubah","Change key":"Ubah tombol","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Tombolnya diubah di penyunting pengaturan. Kedua mode memerlukan tata ubin otomatis dan bilah tempel atau tepi layar.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Ubah di halaman Pintasan keyboard. Dengan tata ubin otomatis, jendela juga bertukar tempat dalam urutan.","Choose…":"Pilih…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Klik zona untuk memilihnya · klik ganda untuk membaginya · seret pembatasnya","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Klik atau tekan %1 untuk mengganti mode.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Klik, lalu OK – penyunting pengaturan terbuka.","Close":"Tutup","Close by, the edges stick together":"Saat dekat, tepinya saling menempel","Color scheme":"Skema warna","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Warna, ukuran, dan bentuk bilah.","Columns":"Kolom","Corner radius":"Radius sudut","Corner size":"Ukuran sudut","Corner: a quarter":"Sudut: seperempat","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Sudut: seperempat layar","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + tombol (bawaan)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + papan angka","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + tombol","Custom color":"Warna khusus","Custom layout %1":"Tata letak khusus %1","Dark":"Gelap","Delay before hiding":"Jeda sebelum sembunyi","Delay before showing":"Jeda sebelum tampil","Delete":"Hapus","Delete layout?":"Hapus tata letak?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Jarak munculnya pegangan","Distance before the bar hides again":"Jarak sebelum bilah bersembunyi lagi","Distance to the edge":"Jarak ke tepi","Donate with PayPal":"Donasi dengan PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"Seret tepi bersama…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Seret jendela ke tepi…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Seret jendela ke jendela lain untuk menukarnya. Dilepas di bilah tempel atau tepi layar, jendela melayang bebas; „Biarkan jendela melayang“ mengembalikannya. Jarak diatur di halaman Umum.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Seret jendela ke tengah jendela lain – pratinjau menampilkan dua panah – lalu lepaskan. Dengan tata ubin otomatis, di mana saja di atas jendela lain sudah cukup.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Seret jendela ke tepi atas layar lalu lepaskan di sebuah zona.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Seret kartu untuk mengubah urutan di bilah. Klik ganda kartu untuk menyuntingnya.","Drop a window onto another one":"Lepaskan jendela ke jendela lain","Drop the window onto a zone":"Lepaskan jendela di sebuah zona","Duplicate":"Gandakan","Duration":"Durasi","Dwindle":"Spiral ke dalam","Dynamic":"Dinamis","Edges and corners":"Tepi dan sudut","Edit":"Sunting","Edit layout":"Sunting tata letak","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Setiap fitur bisa dinyalakan dan dimatikan sendiri-sendiri.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Setiap tata letak yang Anda buat di halaman Tata letak juga bisa menata jendela – muncul di atas. Jendela 1 mendapat zona 1 dan seterusnya; jendela tambahan berbagi zona terakhir. Jika jendela lebih sedikit dari zona, „Utama dan tumpukan“ dipakai agar tidak ada lubang.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Setiap jendela menemukan tempatnya sendiri, seperti di pengelola jendela tata ubin.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Setiap jendela menemukan tempatnya di layar sendiri. Jendela baru ikut bergabung, yang ditutup memberi ruang bagi yang lain.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Contoh: dua jendela berdampingan, mulai tiga utama dan tumpukan, mulai lima kisi. Tanpa aturan yang cocok, tata letak yang dipilih di atas dipakai.","Fade in and out":"Memudar saat masuk dan keluar","Fade the other windows":"Pudarkan jendela lain","Features":"Fitur","Feel":"Rasa","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Menyesuaikan dengan jendela yang sudah ditempel","Fits the way you work.":"Sesuai cara kerja Anda.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Biarkan jendela melayang (keluar dari tata ubin)","Four quarters":"Empat perempat","From":"Mulai","Fullscreen":"Layar penuh","Gap between windows":"Jarak antarjendela","Gap to the screen edge":"Jarak ke tepi layar","General":"Umum","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Memberi setiap aksi tombol dari skema yang dipilih lagi dan menghapus tombol yang tidak ada di skema.","Good to know":"Baik untuk diketahui","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Pegang jendela pada bilah judulnya lalu seret ke atas. Bilah akan turun; lepaskan jendela di sebuah zona dan jendela akan mengisi tepat area itu. Seret keluar lagi dan ukurannya kembali seperti semula.","Grab window A…":"Pegang jendela A…","Grid":"Kisi","Halves":"Separuh","Hiding":"Sembunyi","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Tahan di tepi untuk mengisi ruang kosong","Hold time":"Waktu tahan","Hold to fill":"Tahan untuk mengisi","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Seberapa dekat tepi harus datang sebelum terkunci di tempatnya.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Seberapa dekat kursor harus mencapai tepi.","How far the bar slides down":"Seberapa jauh bilah turun","How it works":"Cara kerjanya","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Berapa lama jendela harus menempel di tepi – dorongan kecil. 0 = langsung.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Berapa lama jendela harus tetap di tepi sebelum membesar.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Berapa jendela yang berbagi area utama (tata letak “Utama dan tumpukan”).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Jika sudah ada jendela di bawah, tepi atas memberi separuh atas alih-alih memaksimalkan. Separuh dan seperempat juga membiarkan jendela yang ditempel tetap terlihat.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Jika Anda menyukai KSnapUnity, Anda bisa mendukung pengembangannya – terima kasih!","In bar":"Di bilah","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Terpisah dari bilah tempel dan tepi layar.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Terpisah dari bilah tempel. Setiap tepi bisa dinyalakan sendiri.","Information":"Informasi","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Perilaku jendela yang intuitif dan alami.","Join at the end":"Bergabung di akhir","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K untuk KWin · Snap untuk menempel lebih cerdas · Unity untuk semuanya dalam satu sistem","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE punya aksi tepi layar sendiri dan penempelan jendela sendiri. Jika fitur yang sama aktif di sini, matikan milik KDE: Pengaturan Sistem → Manajemen Jendela → Tepi Layar, serta Perilaku Jendela → Pemindahan.","KDE's own edge tiling":"Ubin tepi milik KDE","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"Maksimalkan dan tata ubin bawaan KDE di tepi layar – dengan garis tepinya – dijeda selama KSnapUnity berjalan, agar hanya satu pratinjau muncul. Pengaturan KDE Anda tidak berubah: matikan ini, nonaktifkan atau hapus KSnapUnity, dan perilaku KDE kembali.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"Aksi tepi layar milik KDE masih aktif, jadi dua pembantu bereaksi pada seretan yang sama. Matikan “Maksimalkan” dan “Ubin” di Pengaturan Sistem → Manajemen Jendela → Tepi Layar.","KDE's own window snapping":"Snap jendela milik KDE","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"Penempelan jendela milik KDE juga aktif. Agar terasa seragam, atur zonanya ke “Tidak ada” di Pengaturan Sistem → Manajemen Jendela → Perilaku Jendela → Pemindahan.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Layanan pintasan KDE tidak menjawab. Anda tetap bisa mengatur tombol di Pengaturan Sistem → Pintasan → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – Penyunting pengaturan","Keep stacked windows in line":"Jaga jendela bertumpuk tetap sejajar","Keep the gap between windows":"Pertahankan jarak antarjendela","Keep them":"Biarkan","Key scheme":"Skema tombol","Keyboard shortcuts":"Pintasan keyboard","Keys":"Tombol","Keys already in use":"Tombol yang sudah dipakai","Layout":"Tata letak","Layout by number of windows":"Tata letak menurut jumlah jendela","Layouts":"Tata letak","Layouts per row":"Tata letak per baris","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Tepi kiri dan kanan: separuh layar","Left edge: left half":"Tepi kiri: separuh kiri","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Di bawah 100 % jendela tunggal tetap di tengah – bagus di layar lebar.","License":"Lisensi","Light":"Terang","Live preview":"Pratinjau langsung","Load template…":"Muat templat…","Main + stack":"Utama + tumpukan","Main and stack":"Utama dan tumpukan","Main area bigger":"Area utama lebih besar","Main area on the right":"Area utama di kanan","Main area smaller":"Area utama lebih kecil","Main in the middle":"Utama di tengah","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Sakelar utama untuk menyeret dan tombol.","Main window":"Jendela utama","Main windows":"Jendela utama (jumlah)","Main windows: %1":"Jendela utama: %1","Make it the main window":"Jadikan jendela utama","Maximize":"Maksimalkan","Maximize or restore":"Maksimalkan atau kembalikan","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + tombol (gaya KDE)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + tombol","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + tombol","Minimize":"Minimalkan","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Mencerminkan tata letak: jendela utama di kanan, yang lain di kiri.","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Mode 1 – Bilah tempel dan tepi layar","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Mode 2 – Tata ubin otomatis","Modes":"Mode","More ways":"Cara lain","Motion curve":"Kurva gerak","Move a window towards others…":"Dekatkan jendela ke yang lain…","Move the window one place back":"Geser jendela satu tempat mundur","Move the window one place on":"Geser jendela satu tempat maju","Name:":"Nama:","New layout":"Tata letak baru","New windows":"Jendela baru","Next tiling layout":"Tata letak ubin berikutnya","Next to the active window":"Di samping jendela aktif","No key":"Tanpa tombol","No other window open":"Tidak ada jendela lain yang terbuka","No outer margin":"Tanpa margin luar","No shortcuts":"Tanpa pintasan","None":"Tidak ada","None yet.":"Belum ada.","Off":"Mati","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Mati = mode 1, aktif = mode 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Mati: bingkai netral – hanya untuk pratinjau yang dinyalakan.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Mati: tombol tetap ditetapkan tetapi tidak melakukan apa pun.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Mati: jendela tetap di tempat Anda meletakkannya. Fitur lain tetap berfungsi.","One at a time":"Satu per satu","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Satu ditutup – yang lain mengisi celah","One main window less":"Satu jendela utama lebih sedikit","One more main window":"Satu jendela utama lagi","One window":"Satu jendela","Only one mode is switched on.":"Hanya satu mode yang aktif.","Open settings editor":"Buka penyunting pengaturan","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Buka aplikasinya dulu, lalu pilih di sini.","Open the layout builder":"Buka pembuat tata letak","Own layouts":"Tata letak sendiri","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Bagian setiap sisi yang dihitung sebagai sudut.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Jeda ubin tepi KDE dan pratinjaunya","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Jeda zona snap KDE selama magnet menyala","Preview":"Pratinjau","Previews":"Pratinjau","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Dorong jendela ke tepi atau sudut layar dan jendela itu mengisi bagian tersebut. Berfungsi dengan atau tanpa bilah tempel.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Dorong jendela ke tepi atau sudut: maksimalkan, separuh, seperempat.","Push delay":"Jeda dorongan","Quarters":"Seperempat","Quick":"Cepat","Quick settings":"Pengaturan cepat","Recommended values":"Nilai yang disarankan","Remove":"Hapus","Remove rule":"Hapus aturan","Remove zone":"Hapus zona","Reset all":"Atur ulang semua","Reset all keys":"Atur ulang semua tombol","Reset to default":"Kembalikan ke bawaan","Resistance against overlapping":"Hambatan terhadap tumpang tindih","Resize touching windows together":"Ubah ukuran jendela yang bersentuhan bersama-sama","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Mengubah ukuran juga menempel – di sini ke tinggi penuh","Restore":"Pulihkan","Restore default layouts":"Pulihkan tata letak bawaan","Restore default layouts?":"Pulihkan tata letak bawaan?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Pulihkan ukuran asli saat jendela diseret keluar","Restore the size before snapping":"Kembalikan ukuran sebelum ditempel","Rows":"Baris","Save":"Simpan","Screen edges":"Tepi layar","Screen edges on/off":"Tepi layar nyala/mati","Screen edges preview":"Pratinjau tepi layar","Set":"Atur","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Mengatur tombol semua aksi sekaligus. Tombol satuan masih bisa diubah di bawah.","Settings":"Pengaturan","Settings file":"Berkas pengaturan","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Goyangkan mouse maju-mundur dengan cepat saat mengubah ukuran, dan jendela lain melompat kembali. Tarikan cepat ke satu arah tidak pernah melepasnya.","Shake to let go":"Goyangkan untuk melepas","Shortcuts":"Pintasan","Show a small handle first":"Tampilkan pegangan kecil lebih dulu","Show layout and zone names":"Tampilkan nama tata letak dan zona","Show previews in the accent color":"Tampilkan pratinjau dengan warna aksen","Showing":"Tampil","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Menunjukkan tempat jendela mendarat di tepi atau sudut. Mati: tidak ada pratinjau sama sekali.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Menunjukkan tempat jendela mendarat selama zona bilah disorot. Mati: tidak ada pratinjau sama sekali.","Sidebar + grid":"Bilah sisi + kisi","Single zone":"Satu zona","Six tiles":"Enam ubin","Size & shape":"Ukuran & bentuk","Size of the main area":"Ukuran area utama","Slide-in duration":"Durasi masuk","Slide-out duration":"Durasi keluar","Smart arranging and detection.":"Penataan dan deteksi cerdas.","Smart fill":"Isi cerdas","Smooth (default)":"Halus (bawaan)","Snap bar":"Bilah tempel","Snap bar and screen edges":"Bilah tempel dan tepi layar","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Bilah tempel dan tepi layar mati – hanya mode 2 berjalan dan pintasan mode tidak berbuat apa-apa.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Bilah tempel dan tepi layar mengganggu tata ubin otomatis. Karena itu keduanya berjalan sebagai dua mode – ganti dengan pintasan atau di sini.","Snap bar colors:":"Warna bilah tempel:","Snap bar on/off":"Bilah tempel nyala/mati","Snap bar preview":"Pratinjau bilah snap","Snap bar size":"Ukuran bilah","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Bilah tempel, tepi layar, magnet jendela, pintasan, dan tukar jendela.","Snap distance":"Jarak tempel","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Tambatkan pembatas (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Tata letak tempel dan tata ubin otomatis.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Tempelkan jendela aktif dengan kombinasi tombol.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Tempelkan jendela aktif dengan keyboard. Ini pintasan global KDE biasa – Anda juga bisa menemukannya di Pengaturan Sistem → Pintasan → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Tempel ke separuh bawah","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Tempel ke seperempat kiri bawah","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Tempel ke seperempat kanan bawah","Snap to the center third":"Tempel ke sepertiga tengah","Snap to the left half":"Tempel ke separuh kiri","Snap to the left third":"Tempel ke sepertiga kiri","Snap to the left two thirds":"Tempel ke dua pertiga kiri","Snap to the right half":"Tempel ke separuh kanan","Snap to the right third":"Tempel ke sepertiga kanan","Snap to the right two thirds":"Tempel ke dua pertiga kanan","Snap to the top half":"Tempel ke separuh atas","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Tempel ke seperempat kiri atas","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Tempel ke seperempat kanan atas","Snapping":"Penambatan","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Penempelan dan tata ubin otomatis berjalan sebagai dua mode – satu pintasan berpindah di antaranya.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Jadi hanya satu magnet yang menarik jendela. Pengaturan KDE Anda tidak berubah: matikan ini, nonaktifkan atau hapus KSnapUnity, dan penempelan KDE kembali.","Soft":"Lembut","Spacing":"Jarak","Split side by side":"Bagi berdampingan","Split top and bottom":"Bagi atas dan bawah","Stack + main":"Tumpukan + utama","Stick to other windows":"Menempel ke jendela lain","Stick to the screen edges":"Menempel ke tepi layar","Sticky edges":"Tepi lengket","Support KSnapUnity":"Dukung KSnapUnity","Swap":"Tukar","Swap windows":"Tukar jendela","Swap with the window above":"Tukar dengan jendela di atas","Swap with the window below":"Tukar dengan jendela di bawah","Swap with the window on the left":"Tukar dengan jendela di kiri","Swap with the window on the right":"Tukar dengan jendela di kanan","Switch mode":"Ganti mode","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Ganti mode (tempel / tata ubin)","Switch modes with:":"Ganti mode dengan:","Switch the layout by itself":"Ganti tata letak sendiri","Switched off":"Mati","System":"Sistem","Take it over":"Ambil alih","Take over all":"Ambil alih semua","Take the main place":"Mengambil tempat utama","Test animation":"Uji animasi","Test on screen":"Uji di layar","Test the snap bar":"Coba bilah tempel","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Nilai bawaan mengacu pada Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Aksi penempelan memakai jarak yang sama dengan bilah dan mengingat ukuran sebelum ditempel: “Kembalikan ukuran sebelum ditempel” mengembalikannya.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Aplikasi ini tidak pernah ditata dan tetap di tempatnya. Dialog selalu melayang.","Thirds":"Sepertiga","Three columns":"Tiga kolom","Thumbnail width":"Lebar gambar mini","Tiling":"Tata ubin","Tip":"Kiat","Top / bottom":"Atas / bawah","Top edge":"Tepi atas","Top edge: full screen":"Tepi atas: layar penuh","Top edge: maximize":"Tepi atas: maksimalkan","Top edge: top half":"Tepi atas: separuh atas","Top half":"Separuh atas","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Jarak pemicu dari tepi atas","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Matikan ini jika Anda lebih suka garis luar KDE – lalu matikan pratinjau tepi layar di atas.","Two thirds":"Dua pertiga","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Dua jendela bertukar tempat – jatuhkan satu ke yang lain atau gunakan tombol.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Dua jendela bertukar tempat: jatuhkan satu ke yang lain, atau dengan tombol.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Gunakan pintasan keyboard","Use screen edges":"Gunakan tepi layar","Use the system accent color":"Gunakan warna aksen sistem","Use the window magnet":"Gunakan magnet jendela","Usual combinations":"Kombinasi umum","Version":"Versi","Wanted for: %1":"Diinginkan untuk: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Saat jendela dibuka, ditutup, atau ditukar, yang lain bergerak halus alih-alih melompat.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Saat Anda mengubah ukuran jendela, jendela yang menyentuhnya ikut menggeser tepi bersama – tidak ada yang tumpang tindih, tidak ada celah.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Saat mengubah ukuran, jendela yang tidak ikut ditampilkan transparan.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Saat Anda memindahkan atau mengubah ukuran jendela, tepinya menempel ke jendela terdekat dan ke tepi layar.","Width":"Lebar","Window":"Jendela","Window magnet":"Magnet jendela","Window magnet on/off":"Magnet jendela nyala/mati","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Jendela yang bertumpuk menjaga tepi kiri dan kanannya bersama, jendela bersebelahan tepi atas dan bawahnya.","Windows glide to their place":"Jendela meluncur ke tempatnya","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Jendela saling menempel dan menempel ke tepi layar.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Jendela berhenti di “Jarak antarjendela” dari halaman Umum alih-alih saling bersentuhan.","Yes":"Ya","Your own combination":"Kombinasi sendiri","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Tata letak buatan Anda dan urutannya akan hilang.","Zone %1":"Zona %1","for KWin · v%1":"untuk KWin · v%1","windows:":"jendela:","“%1” will be removed.":"“%1” akan dihapus.","…drag it onto window B…":"…seret ke jendela B…","…in every direction":"…ke segala arah","…let go: they trade places":"…lepaskan: keduanya bertukar tempat","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…tetangganya membesar dan mengecil bersamanya","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Siap – klik OK untuk membuka penyunting pengaturan."},"is":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (afrit)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 er notaður af „%2“.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 af %2 svæðum","0 = all in one row":"0 = allar í einni röð","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Hamur 1</b><br/>Festistika og skjábrúnir","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Hamur 2</b><br/>Sjálfvirk flísalögn","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Stakur gluggi notar allan skjáinn, jafnvel þótt spássía sé stillt.","A new window joins":"Nýr gluggi bætist við","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Stutt ýting gefur helming eða fjórðung. Haltu glugganum aðeins lengur við brúnina og hann stækkar að næsta glugga – forskoðunin sýnir það.","A single window":"Stakur gluggi","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Gluggi stoppar við jaðar annars, líka þegar þú færir hann hratt. Hristu músina eða ýttu áfram andartak til að losa. 0 = gluggar mega skarast frjálst.","About & Help":"Um og hjálp","Accent color":"Áherslulitur","Active":"Virkt","Active mode":"Virkur hamur","Active width along the top edge":"Virk breidd meðfram efri brún","Add an open application":"Bæta við opnu forriti","Add rule":"Bæta við reglu","All window features in one system.":"Allir gluggaeiginleikar í einu kerfi.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Breytist líka þegar þú breytir stærð aðalgluggans í höndunum.","Also while resizing":"Líka við stærðarbreytingu","Always floating":"Alltaf fljótandi","Animation":"Hreyfing","Appearance":"Útlit","Apply":"Virkja","Arrange windows":"Raða gluggum","Arrange windows automatically":"Raða gluggum sjálfvirkt","Author":"Höfundur","Automatic tiling":"Sjálfvirk flísalögn","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Slökkt er á sjálfvirkri flísalögn – aðeins hamur 1 keyrir og hamflýtilykillinn gerir ekkert.","Automatic tiling off":"Sjálfvirk flísalögn af","Automatic tiling on":"Sjálfvirk flísalögn á","Automatic tiling on/off":"Sjálfvirk flísalögn af/á","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Sjálfvirk flísalögn, víxlun glugga, flýtilyklar og segullinn fyrir fljótandi glugga.","Background opacity":"Ógegnsæi bakgrunns","Behavior & Animation":"Hegðun og hreyfingar","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Neðri brún: neðri helmingur","Bouncy":"Fjaðrandi","Buy me a coffee":"Gefðu mér kaffibolla","Cancel":"Hætta við","Center focus":"Áhersla á miðju","Center the window":"Miðjusetja gluggann","Change":"Breyta","Change key":"Breyta lykli","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Lyklinum breytirðu í stillingaritlinum. Báðir hamir þurfa sjálfvirka flísalögn og festistiku eða skjábrúnir.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Breyttu þeim á síðunni Flýtilyklar. Með sjálfvirkri flísalögn skipta gluggarnir líka um stað í röðinni.","Choose…":"Veldu…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Smelltu á svæði til að velja það · tvísmelltu til að skipta því · dragðu skilin","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Smelltu eða ýttu á %1 til að skipta um ham.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Smelltu, svo á Í lagi – stillingaritillinn opnast.","Close":"Loka","Close by, the edges stick together":"Nálægt festast brúnirnar saman","Color scheme":"Litastef","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Litir, stærð og lögun stikunnar.","Columns":"Dálkar","Corner radius":"Horngeisli","Corner size":"Hornastærð","Corner: a quarter":"Horn: fjórðungur","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Horn: fjórðungur skjásins","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + lykill (sjálfgefið)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + talnaborð","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + lykill","Custom color":"Eigin litur","Custom layout %1":"Eigin uppsetning %1","Dark":"Dökkt","Delay before hiding":"Töf áður en falið er","Delay before showing":"Töf áður en birt er","Delete":"Eyða","Delete layout?":"Eyða uppsetningu?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Fjarlægð þar sem handfangið birtist","Distance before the bar hides again":"Fjarlægð áður en stikan felur sig aftur","Distance to the edge":"Fjarlægð frá brún","Donate with PayPal":"Gefa með PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"Dragðu sameiginlega brún…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Dragðu glugga að brún…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Dragðu glugga á annan til að víxla þeim. Sé honum sleppt á festistikuna eða skjábrún flýtur hann frjáls; „Láta gluggann svífa“ sækir hann aftur. Bilin koma af síðunni Almennt.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Dragðu glugga yfir miðju annars – forskoðunin sýnir tvær örvar – og slepptu. Með sjálfvirkri flísalögn dugar hvar sem er yfir hinum glugganum.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Dragðu glugga upp að efri brún skjásins og slepptu honum á svæði.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Dragðu spjöldin til að breyta röðinni á stikunni. Tvísmelltu á spjald til að breyta því.","Drop a window onto another one":"Sleppa glugga á annan","Drop the window onto a zone":"Slepptu glugganum á svæði","Duplicate":"Tvítaka","Duration":"Lengd","Dwindle":"Spírall inn á við","Dynamic":"Kvikur","Edges and corners":"Brúnir og horn","Edit":"Breyta","Edit layout":"Breyta uppsetningu","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Hægt er að kveikja og slökkva á hverjum eiginleika fyrir sig.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Hver uppsetning sem þú býrð til á síðunni Uppsetningar getur líka raðað gluggum – hún birtist að ofan. Gluggi 1 fær svæði 1 og svo framvegis; fleiri gluggar deila síðasta svæðinu. Með færri gluggum en svæðum er „Aðal og stafli“ notað svo engin göt verði.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Hver gluggi finnur sér stað sjálfur, eins og í flísalagðri gluggastjórnun.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Hver gluggi finnur sér stað á skjánum sjálfur. Nýir gluggar bætast við, lokaðir rýma fyrir hinum.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Dæmi: tveir gluggar hlið við hlið, frá þremur aðal og stafli, frá fimm hnitanet. Án viðeigandi reglu gildir uppsetningin sem valin er að ofan.","Fade in and out":"Deyfa inn og út","Fade the other windows":"Deyfa hina gluggana","Features":"Eiginleikar","Feel":"Tilfinning","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Laga sig að gluggum sem þegar eru festir","Fits the way you work.":"Lagar sig að vinnulagi þínu.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Láta gluggann svífa (hætta í flísalögn)","Four quarters":"Fjórir fjórðungar","From":"Frá","Fullscreen":"Heilskjár","Gap between windows":"Bil milli glugga","Gap to the screen edge":"Bil að skjábrún","General":"Almennt","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Gefur hverri aðgerð aftur lykil valins skema og fjarlægir lykla sem skemað hefur ekki.","Good to know":"Gott að vita","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Gríptu glugga í titilstikuna og dragðu hann upp. Stikan rennur niður; slepptu glugganum á svæði og hann fyllir nákvæmlega það svæði. Ef þú dregur hann út aftur fær hann fyrri stærð sína.","Grab window A…":"Gríptu glugga A…","Grid":"Hnitanet","Halves":"Helmingar","Hiding":"Felun","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Halda við brúnina til að fylla laust pláss","Hold time":"Haldtími","Hold to fill":"Halda til að fylla","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Hversu nálægt brún þarf að koma áður en hún smellur á sinn stað.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Hversu nálægt brúninni bendillinn þarf að koma.","How far the bar slides down":"Hve langt stikan rennur niður","How it works":"Svona virkar þetta","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Hversu lengi glugginn þarf að liggja að brúninni – lítið ýt. 0 = strax.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Hversu lengi glugginn þarf að vera við brúnina áður en hann stækkar.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Hversu margir gluggar deila aðalsvæðinu (uppsetningin „Aðal og stafli“).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Ef gluggi er þegar neðst gefur efri brúnin efri helminginn í stað þess að hámarka. Helmingar og fjórðungar skilja festa glugga líka eftir lausa.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Ef þér líkar KSnapUnity geturðu stutt þróunina – takk!","In bar":"Á stiku","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Óháð festistikunni og skjábrúnunum.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Óháð festistikunni. Hverja brún má kveikja á sér.","Information":"Upplýsingar","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Eðlileg, innsæ hegðun glugga.","Join at the end":"Fara aftast","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K fyrir KWin · Snap fyrir snjallari festingu · Unity fyrir allt í einu kerfi","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE hefur sínar eigin skjábrúnaaðgerðir og sína eigin gluggafestingu. Ef sami eiginleiki er virkur hér, slökktu á KDE-útgáfunni: Kerfisstillingar → Gluggastjórnun → Skjábrúnir, og Hegðun glugga → Færsla.","KDE's own edge tiling":"Brúnaflísar KDE","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"Eigin hámörkun og flísalögn KDE við brúnirnar – með útlínu – gerir hlé meðan KSnapUnity keyrir, svo aðeins ein forskoðun birtist. KDE-stillingarnar breytast ekki: slökktu á þessu, gerðu KSnapUnity óvirkt eða fjarlægðu það og hegðun KDE kemur aftur.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"Eigin skjábrúnaaðgerðir KDE eru enn virkar, svo tveir hjálparar bregðast við sama drætti. Slökktu á „Hámarka“ og „Flísaleggja“ í Kerfisstillingar → Gluggastjórnun → Skjábrúnir.","KDE's own window snapping":"Gluggafesting KDE","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"Eigin gluggafesting KDE er líka virk. Fyrir samræmda tilfinningu skaltu setja svæði hennar á „Ekkert“ í Kerfisstillingar → Gluggastjórnun → Hegðun glugga → Færsla.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Flýtileiðaþjónusta KDE svaraði ekki. Þú getur samt sett lyklana í Kerfisstillingar → Flýtileiðir → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – Stillingaritill","Keep stacked windows in line":"Halda staflaðum gluggum í línu","Keep the gap between windows":"Halda bilinu milli glugga","Keep them":"Halda þeim","Key scheme":"Lyklaskema","Keyboard shortcuts":"Flýtilyklar","Keys":"Lyklar","Keys already in use":"Lyklar sem þegar eru í notkun","Layout":"Uppsetning","Layout by number of windows":"Uppsetning eftir fjölda glugga","Layouts":"Uppsetningar","Layouts per row":"Uppsetningar í röð","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Vinstri og hægri brún: hálfur skjár","Left edge: left half":"Vinstri brún: vinstri helmingur","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Undir 100 % helst stakur gluggi í miðjunni – fallegt á breiðum skjám.","License":"Notkunarleyfi","Light":"Ljóst","Linear":"Línulegur","Live preview":"Bein forskoðun","Load template…":"Hlaða sniðmáti…","Magnet":"Segull","Main + stack":"Aðal + stafli","Main and stack":"Aðal og stafli","Main area bigger":"Stærra aðalsvæði","Main area on the right":"Aðalsvæði hægra megin","Main area smaller":"Minna aðalsvæði","Main in the middle":"Aðal í miðjunni","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Aðalrofi fyrir drátt og lyklana.","Main window":"Aðalgluggi","Main windows":"Aðalgluggar","Main windows: %1":"Aðalgluggar: %1","Make it the main window":"Gera að aðalglugga","Maximize":"Hámarka","Maximize or restore":"Hámarka eða endurheimta","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + lykill (KDE-stíll)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + lykill","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + lykill","Minimize":"Lágmarka","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Speglar uppsetninguna: aðalglugginn hægra megin, hinir vinstra megin.","Mode":"Hamur","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Hamur 1 – Festistika og skjábrúnir","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Hamur 2 – Sjálfvirk flísalögn","Modes":"Hamir","More ways":"Fleiri leiðir","Motion curve":"Hreyfiferill","Move a window towards others…":"Færðu glugga að öðrum…","Move the window one place back":"Færa gluggann um eitt sæti aftur","Move the window one place on":"Færa gluggann um eitt sæti fram","Name:":"Heiti:","New layout":"Ný uppsetning","New windows":"Nýir gluggar","Next tiling layout":"Næsta flísauppsetning","Next to the active window":"Við hlið virka gluggans","No key":"Enginn lykill","No other window open":"Enginn annar gluggi opinn","No outer margin":"Engin ytri spássía","No shortcuts":"Engir flýtilyklar","None":"Ekkert","None yet.":"Ekkert enn.","Off":"Af","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Af = hamur 1, á = hamur 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Af: hlutlaus rammi – aðeins fyrir forskoðanir sem eru á.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Af: lyklarnir haldast úthlutaðir en gera ekkert.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Slökkt: gluggar haldast þar sem þú setur þá. Hinir eiginleikarnir virka hvort sem er.","One at a time":"Einn í einu","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Einn lokast – hinir fylla í bilið","One main window less":"Einum aðalglugga færri","One more main window":"Einum aðalglugga fleiri","One window":"Einn gluggi","Only one mode is switched on.":"Aðeins einn hamur er virkur.","Open settings editor":"Opna stillingaritilinn","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Opnaðu forritið fyrst og veldu það svo hér.","Open the layout builder":"Opna uppsetningasmiðinn","Own layouts":"Eigin uppsetningar","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Hluti hverrar hliðar sem telst horn.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Gera hlé á brúnaflísum KDE og forskoðun þeirra","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Gera hlé á festisvæðum KDE meðan segullinn er á","Preview":"Forskoðun","Previews":"Forskoðanir","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Ýttu glugga að brún eða horni skjásins og hann fyllir þann hluta. Virkar með eða án festistikunnar.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Ýttu glugga að brún eða horni: hámarka, helmingar, fjórðungar.","Push delay":"Ýtitöf","Quarters":"Fjórðungar","Quick":"Hraður","Quick settings":"Flýtistillingar","Recommended values":"Ráðlögð gildi","Remove":"Fjarlægja","Remove rule":"Fjarlægja reglu","Remove zone":"Fjarlægja svæði","Reset all":"Endurstilla allt","Reset all keys":"Endurstilla alla lykla","Reset to default":"Endurstilla á sjálfgefið","Resistance against overlapping":"Viðnám gegn skörun","Resize touching windows together":"Breyta stærð glugga sem snertast saman","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Stærðarbreyting festist líka – hér í fulla hæð","Restore":"Endurheimta","Restore default layouts":"Endurheimta sjálfgefnar uppsetningar","Restore default layouts?":"Endurheimta sjálfgefnar uppsetningar?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Endurheimta upprunalega stærð þegar glugginn er dreginn út","Restore the size before snapping":"Endurheimta stærðina fyrir festingu","Rows":"Raðir","Save":"Vista","Screen edges":"Skjábrúnir","Screen edges on/off":"Skjábrúnir af/á","Screen edges preview":"Forskoðun skjábrúna","Set":"Setja","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Setur lykla allra aðgerða í einu. Staka lykla geturðu áfram breytt hér fyrir neðan.","Settings":"Stillingar","Settings file":"Stillingaskrá","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Hristu músina hratt fram og til baka meðan þú breytir stærð og hinir gluggarnir hoppa til baka. Snöggt tog í eina átt losar aldrei.","Shake to let go":"Hrista til að sleppa","Shortcuts":"Flýtileiðir","Show a small handle first":"Sýna fyrst lítið handfang","Show layout and zone names":"Sýna heiti uppsetninga og svæða","Show previews in the accent color":"Sýna forskoðanir í áherslulitnum","Showing":"Birting","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Sýnir hvar glugginn lendir við brún eða horn. Af: engin forskoðun.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Sýnir hvar glugginn lendir á meðan svæði í stikunni er auðkennt. Af: engin forskoðun.","Sidebar + grid":"Hliðarstika + net","Single zone":"Eitt svæði","Six tiles":"Sex reitir","Size & shape":"Stærð og lögun","Size of the main area":"Stærð aðalsvæðis","Slide-in duration":"Tími inn","Slide-out duration":"Tími út","Smart arranging and detection.":"Snjöll röðun og greining.","Smart fill":"Snjöll fylling","Smooth (default)":"Mjúkur (sjálfgefið)","Snap bar":"Festistika","Snap bar and screen edges":"Festistika og skjábrúnir","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Slökkt er á festistiku og brúnum – aðeins hamur 2 keyrir og hamflýtilykillinn gerir ekkert.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Festistikan og skjábrúnirnar trufla sjálfvirka flísalögn. Þess vegna keyra þær sem tveir hamir – skiptu með flýtilykli eða hér.","Snap bar colors:":"Litir festistikunnar:","Snap bar on/off":"Festistika af/á","Snap bar preview":"Forskoðun festistikunnar","Snap bar size":"Stærð stikunnar","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Festistika, skjábrúnir, gluggasegull, flýtilyklar og víxlun glugga.","Snap distance":"Festifjarlægð","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Festa skil (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Festiuppsetningar og sjálfvirk flísalögn.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Festu virka gluggann með lyklasamsetningum.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Festu virka gluggann með lyklaborðinu. Þetta eru venjulegar víðværar flýtileiðir KDE – þú finnur þær líka í Kerfisstillingar → Flýtileiðir → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Festa í neðri helming","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Festa í neðri vinstri fjórðung","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Festa í neðri hægri fjórðung","Snap to the center third":"Festa í miðþriðjung","Snap to the left half":"Festa í vinstri helming","Snap to the left third":"Festa í vinstri þriðjung","Snap to the left two thirds":"Festa í vinstri tvo þriðju","Snap to the right half":"Festa í hægri helming","Snap to the right third":"Festa í hægri þriðjung","Snap to the right two thirds":"Festa í hægri tvo þriðju","Snap to the top half":"Festa í efri helming","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Festa í efri vinstri fjórðung","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Festa í efri hægri fjórðung","Snapping":"Festing","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Festing og sjálfvirk flísalögn keyra sem tveir hamir – einn flýtilykill skiptir á milli.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Þannig togar aðeins einn segull í glugga. KDE-stillingarnar breytast ekki: slökktu á þessu, gerðu KSnapUnity óvirkt eða fjarlægðu það og festing KDE kemur aftur.","Soft":"Rólegur","Spacing":"Bil","Spiral":"Spírall","Split side by side":"Skipta hlið við hlið","Split top and bottom":"Skipta efst og neðst","Stack + main":"Stafli + aðal","Stick to other windows":"Loða við aðra glugga","Stick to the screen edges":"Loða við skjábrúnirnar","Sticky edges":"Límandi brúnir","Support KSnapUnity":"Styddu KSnapUnity","Swap":"Víxla","Swap windows":"Víxla gluggum","Swap with the window above":"Víxla við gluggann fyrir ofan","Swap with the window below":"Víxla við gluggann fyrir neðan","Swap with the window on the left":"Víxla við gluggann til vinstri","Swap with the window on the right":"Víxla við gluggann til hægri","Switch mode":"Skipta um ham","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Skipta um ham (festing / flísalögn)","Switch modes with:":"Skipta um ham með:","Switch the layout by itself":"Skipta um uppsetningu sjálfkrafa","Switched off":"Slökkt","System":"Kerfi","Take it over":"Taka yfir","Take over all":"Taka alla yfir","Take the main place":"Taka aðalsætið","Test animation":"Prófa hreyfingu","Test on screen":"Prófa á skjánum","Test the snap bar":"Prófa festistikuna","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Sjálfgefin gildi byggja á Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Festiaðgerðirnar nota sömu bil og stikan og muna stærðina fyrir festingu: „Endurheimta stærðina fyrir festingu“ sækir hana aftur.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Þessum forritum er aldrei raðað og þau halda sínum stað. Gluggar fyrir svarglugga fljóta alltaf.","Thirds":"Þriðjungar","Three columns":"Þrír dálkar","Thumbnail width":"Breidd smámynda","Tiling":"Flísalögn","Tip":"Ábending","Top / bottom":"Efst / neðst","Top edge":"Efri brún","Top edge: full screen":"Efri brún: allur skjárinn","Top edge: maximize":"Efri brún: hámarka","Top edge: top half":"Efri brún: efri helmingur","Top half":"Efri helmingur","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Virkjunarfjarlægð frá efri brún","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Slökktu á þessu ef þú vilt frekar útlínur KDE – slökktu þá á forskoðun skjábrúna hér að ofan.","Two thirds":"Tveir þriðju","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Tveir gluggar skipta um stað – slepptu öðrum á hinn eða notaðu lyklana.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Tveir gluggar skipta um stað: slepptu öðrum á hinn, eða með lykli.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Nota flýtilykla","Use screen edges":"Nota skjábrúnir","Use the system accent color":"Nota áherslulit kerfisins","Use the window magnet":"Nota gluggasegulinn","Usual combinations":"Algengar samsetningar","Version":"Útgáfa","Wanted for: %1":"Óskað fyrir: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Þegar gluggi opnast, lokast eða skiptir um stað hreyfast hinir mjúklega í stað þess að stökkva.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Þegar þú breytir stærð glugga færa gluggar sem snerta hann sameiginlegu brúnina með – ekkert skarast, ekkert bil myndast.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Meðan stærð er breytt eru gluggar sem fylgja ekki sýndir gegnsæir.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Á meðan þú færir glugga eða breytir stærð hans loða brúnir hans við nálæga glugga og skjábrúnirnar.","Width":"Breidd","Window":"Gluggi","Window magnet":"Gluggasegull","Window magnet on/off":"Gluggasegull af/á","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Gluggar hver yfir öðrum halda vinstri og hægri brúnum saman, gluggar hlið við hlið efri og neðri brúnum.","Windows glide to their place":"Gluggar renna á sinn stað","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Gluggar loða hver við annan og við skjábrúnirnar.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Gluggar stöðvast við „Bil milli glugga“ af síðunni Almennt í stað þess að snertast.","Yes":"Já","Your own combination":"Þín eigin samsetning","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Eigin uppsetningar og röð þeirra glatast.","Zone %1":"Svæði %1","for KWin · v%1":"fyrir KWin · v%1","windows:":"gluggum:","“%1” will be removed.":"„%1“ verður fjarlægð.","…drag it onto window B…":"…dragðu hann á glugga B…","…in every direction":"…í allar áttir","…let go: they trade places":"…slepptu: þeir skipta um stað","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…nágrannarnir stækka og minnka með","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Tilbúið – smelltu á Í lagi til að opna stillingaritilinn."},"it":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (copia)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 è usato da «%2».","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 di %2 zone","0 = all in one row":"0 = tutti su una riga","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Modalità 1</b><br/>Barra di aggancio e bordi dello schermo","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Modalità 2</b><br/>Affiancamento automatico","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Una finestra da sola usa tutto lo schermo, anche con un margine impostato.","A new window joins":"Arriva una nuova finestra","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Una breve spinta dà la metà o il quarto. Tieni la finestra al bordo un po' più a lungo e cresce fino alla finestra successiva – l'anteprima lo mostra.","A single window":"Una sola finestra","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Una finestra si ferma al bordo di un’altra, anche se la muovi velocemente. Scuoti il mouse o continua a spingere per un attimo per staccarla. 0 = le finestre possono sovrapporsi liberamente.","About & Help":"Informazioni e aiuto","Accent color":"Colore di accento","Active":"Attivo","Active mode":"Modalità attiva","Active width along the top edge":"Larghezza attiva lungo il bordo superiore","Add an open application":"Aggiungi un’applicazione aperta","Add rule":"Aggiungi regola","All window features in one system.":"Tutte le funzioni delle finestre in un unico sistema.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Cambia anche quando ridimensioni a mano la finestra principale.","Also while resizing":"Anche durante il ridimensionamento","Always floating":"Sempre fluttuanti","Animation":"Animazione","Appearance":"Aspetto","Apply":"Applica","Arrange windows":"Disporre le finestre","Arrange windows automatically":"Disponi le finestre automaticamente","Author":"Autore","Automatic tiling":"Affiancamento automatico","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"L’affiancamento automatico è disattivato – funziona solo la modalità 1 e la scorciatoia di modalità non fa nulla.","Automatic tiling off":"Affiancamento automatico disattivato","Automatic tiling on":"Affiancamento automatico attivo","Automatic tiling on/off":"Affiancamento automatico sì/no","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Affiancamento automatico, scambio di finestre, scorciatoie e il magnete per le finestre fluttuanti.","Background opacity":"Opacità dello sfondo","Behavior & Animation":"Comportamento e animazione","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Bordo inferiore: metà inferiore","Bouncy":"Elastica","Buy me a coffee":"Offrimi un caffè","Cancel":"Annulla","Center focus":"Focus centrale","Center the window":"Centra la finestra","Change":"Modifica","Change key":"Cambia tasto","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Il tasto si cambia nell’editor delle impostazioni. Entrambe le modalità richiedono l’affiancamento automatico e la barra o i bordi dello schermo.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Si cambiano nella pagina Scorciatoie da tastiera. Con l’affiancamento automatico, le finestre si scambiano anche il posto nell’ordine.","Choose…":"Scegli…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Clic su una zona per selezionarla · doppio clic per dividerla · trascina i divisori","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Fai clic o premi %1 per cambiare modalità.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Fai clic, poi OK – si apre l’editor delle impostazioni.","Close":"Chiudi","Close by, the edges stick together":"Da vicino, i bordi si attaccano","Color scheme":"Schema di colori","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Colori, dimensione e forma della barra.","Columns":"Colonne","Corner radius":"Raggio degli angoli","Corner size":"Dimensione degli angoli","Corner: a quarter":"Angolo: un quarto","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Angoli: un quarto dello schermo","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + tasto (predefinito)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + tastierino numerico","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Maiusc+Alt + tasto","Custom color":"Colore personalizzato","Custom layout %1":"Layout personalizzato %1","Dark":"Scuro","Delay before hiding":"Ritardo prima della scomparsa","Delay before showing":"Ritardo prima della comparsa","Delete":"Elimina","Delete layout?":"Eliminare il layout?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Distanza a cui compare la maniglia","Distance before the bar hides again":"Distanza prima che la barra scompaia","Distance to the edge":"Distanza dal bordo","Donate with PayPal":"Dona con PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"Trascina un bordo comune…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Trascina una finestra contro un bordo…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Trascina una finestra su un’altra per scambiarle. Rilasciata sulla barra o su un bordo, fluttua liberamente; «Lascia fluttuare la finestra» la riporta indietro. Gli spazi vengono dalla pagina Generale.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Trascina una finestra sopra il centro di un’altra – l’anteprima mostra due frecce – e rilascia. Con l’affiancamento automatico basta un punto qualsiasi sopra l’altra finestra.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Trascina una finestra verso il bordo superiore dello schermo e rilasciala su una zona.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Trascina le schede per cambiare l’ordine nella barra. Doppio clic su una scheda per modificarla.","Drop a window onto another one":"Rilasciare una finestra su un’altra","Drop the window onto a zone":"Rilascia la finestra su una zona","Duplicate":"Duplica","Duration":"Durata","Dwindle":"Spirale interna","Dynamic":"Dinamica","Edges and corners":"Bordi e angoli","Edit":"Modifica","Edit layout":"Modifica layout","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Ogni funzione si può attivare e disattivare da sola.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Ogni layout che crei nella pagina Layout può anche disporre le finestre – compare qui sopra. La finestra 1 prende la zona 1 e così via; le finestre in più condividono l’ultima zona. Con meno finestre che zone si usa «Principale e pila», così non restano buchi.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Ogni finestra trova il suo posto da sola, come in un gestore di finestre a riquadri.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Ogni finestra trova da sola il suo posto sullo schermo. Le nuove finestre si aggiungono, quelle chiuse lasciano spazio alle altre.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Esempio: due finestre affiancate, da tre principale e pila, da cinque una griglia. Senza una regola adatta vale il layout scelto sopra.","Fade in and out":"Dissolvenza in entrata e in uscita","Fade the other windows":"Attenua le altre finestre","Features":"Funzioni","Feel":"Sensazione","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Adattati alle finestre già agganciate","Fits the way you work.":"Si adatta al tuo modo di lavorare.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Lascia fluttuare la finestra (esci dall’affiancamento)","Four quarters":"Quattro quarti","From":"Da","Fullscreen":"Schermo intero","Gap between windows":"Spazio tra le finestre","Gap to the screen edge":"Spazio dal bordo dello schermo","General":"Generale","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Ridà a ogni azione il tasto dello schema scelto e rimuove i tasti che lo schema non ha.","Good to know":"Buono a sapersi","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Afferra una finestra dalla barra del titolo e trascinala verso l’alto. La barra scende; rilascia la finestra su una zona e occuperà esattamente quell’area. Trascinala di nuovo via e riprende la sua dimensione precedente.","Grab window A…":"Afferra la finestra A…","Grid":"Griglia","Halves":"Metà","Hiding":"Scomparsa","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Tieni al bordo per riempire lo spazio libero","Hold time":"Tempo di attesa","Hold to fill":"Tieni premuto per riempire","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Quanto deve avvicinarsi un bordo prima di scattare in posizione.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Quanto il cursore deve avvicinarsi al bordo.","How far the bar slides down":"Quanto scende la barra","How it works":"Come funziona","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Quanto a lungo la finestra deve restare contro il bordo: una piccola spinta. 0 = subito.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Quanto a lungo la finestra deve restare al bordo prima di crescere.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Quante finestre condividono l’area principale (disposizione «Principale e pila»).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Se c’è una finestra in basso, il bordo superiore dà la metà superiore invece di massimizzare. Anche metà e quarti lasciano libere le finestre agganciate.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Se KSnapUnity ti piace, puoi sostenerne lo sviluppo – grazie!","In bar":"Nella barra","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Indipendente dalla barra di aggancio e dai bordi dello schermo.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Indipendente dalla barra di aggancio. Ogni bordo si attiva da solo.","Information":"Informazioni","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Comportamento delle finestre intuitivo e naturale.","Join at the end":"Si mettono in fondo","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K per KWin · Snap per un aggancio più furbo · Unity per tutto in un unico sistema","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE ha le sue azioni dei bordi dello schermo e il suo aggancio delle finestre. Se qui è attiva la stessa funzione, disattiva quella di KDE: Impostazioni di sistema → Gestione delle finestre → Bordi dello schermo e Comportamento delle finestre → Spostamento.","KDE's own edge tiling":"Affiancamento ai bordi di KDE","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"La massimizzazione e l’affiancamento propri di KDE ai bordi – con il loro contorno – si mettono in pausa mentre KSnapUnity è attivo, così appare una sola anteprima. Le tue impostazioni di KDE non cambiano: disattiva questa opzione, disattiva o rimuovi KSnapUnity e il comportamento di KDE ritorna.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"Le azioni dei bordi dello schermo di KDE sono ancora attive, quindi due aiuti reagiscono allo stesso trascinamento. Disattiva «Massimizza» e «Affianca» in Impostazioni di sistema → Gestione delle finestre → Bordi dello schermo.","KDE's own window snapping":"Aggancio delle finestre di KDE","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"Anche l’aggancio delle finestre di KDE è attivo. Per un comportamento uniforme, imposta le sue zone su «Nessuna» in Impostazioni di sistema → Gestione delle finestre → Comportamento delle finestre → Spostamento.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Il servizio delle scorciatoie di KDE non ha risposto. Puoi comunque impostare i tasti in Impostazioni di sistema → Scorciatoie → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – Editor delle impostazioni","Keep stacked windows in line":"Mantieni allineate le finestre impilate","Keep the gap between windows":"Mantieni lo spazio tra le finestre","Keep them":"Lasciali","Key scheme":"Schema dei tasti","Keyboard shortcuts":"Scorciatoie da tastiera","Keys":"Tasti","Keys already in use":"Tasti già in uso","Layout":"Disposizione","Layout by number of windows":"Layout in base al numero di finestre","Layouts":"Layout","Layouts per row":"Layout per riga","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Bordi sinistro e destro: metà schermo","Left edge: left half":"Bordo sinistro: metà sinistra","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Sotto il 100 % una finestra da sola resta al centro – bello sugli schermi larghi.","License":"Licenza","Light":"Chiaro","Linear":"Lineare","Live preview":"Anteprima dal vivo","Load template…":"Carica modello…","Magnet":"Magnete","Main + stack":"Principale + pila","Main and stack":"Principale e pila","Main area bigger":"Area principale più grande","Main area on the right":"Area principale a destra","Main area smaller":"Area principale più piccola","Main in the middle":"Principale al centro","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Interruttore principale per il trascinamento e i tasti.","Main window":"Finestra principale","Main windows":"Finestre principali","Main windows: %1":"Finestre principali: %1","Make it the main window":"Rendi finestra principale","Maximize":"Massimizza","Maximize or restore":"Massimizza o ripristina","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + tasto (stile KDE)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + tasto","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Maiusc + tasto","Minimize":"Minimizza","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Rispecchia il layout: la finestra principale a destra, le altre a sinistra.","Mode":"Modalità","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Modalità 1 – Barra di aggancio e bordi dello schermo","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Modalità 2 – Affiancamento automatico","Modes":"Modalità","More ways":"Altri modi","Motion curve":"Curva di movimento","Move a window towards others…":"Avvicina una finestra alle altre…","Move the window one place back":"Sposta la finestra indietro di un posto","Move the window one place on":"Sposta la finestra avanti di un posto","Name:":"Nome:","New layout":"Nuovo layout","New windows":"Nuove finestre","Next tiling layout":"Disposizione successiva","Next to the active window":"Accanto alla finestra attiva","No key":"Nessun tasto","No other window open":"Nessun’altra finestra aperta","No outer margin":"Nessun margine esterno","No shortcuts":"Nessuna scorciatoia","None":"Nessuna","None yet.":"Ancora nessuna.","Off":"Disattivato","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Disattivato = modalità 1, attivato = modalità 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Disattivato: una cornice neutra – solo per le anteprime attivate.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Disattivato: i tasti restano assegnati ma non fanno nulla.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Disattivato: le finestre restano dove le metti. Le altre funzioni vanno in ogni caso.","One at a time":"Una alla volta","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Una si chiude – le altre riempiono il vuoto","One main window less":"Una finestra principale in meno","One more main window":"Una finestra principale in più","One window":"Una finestra","Only one mode is switched on.":"È attiva una sola modalità.","Open settings editor":"Apri l’editor delle impostazioni","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Apri prima l’applicazione, poi sceglila qui.","Open the layout builder":"Apri il costruttore di layout","Own layouts":"Layout personali","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Parte di ogni lato che conta come angolo.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Sospendi l'affiancamento ai bordi di KDE e la sua anteprima","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Sospendi le zone di aggancio di KDE mentre il magnete è attivo","Preview":"Anteprima","Previews":"Anteprime","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Spingi una finestra contro un bordo o un angolo dello schermo e riempirà quella parte. Funziona con o senza la barra di aggancio.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Spingi una finestra contro un bordo o un angolo: massimizza, metà, quarti.","Push delay":"Ritardo di spinta","Quarters":"Quarti","Quick":"Rapida","Quick settings":"Impostazioni rapide","Recommended values":"Valori consigliati","Remove":"Rimuovi","Remove rule":"Rimuovi la regola","Remove zone":"Rimuovi zona","Reset all":"Ripristina tutto","Reset all keys":"Ripristina tutti i tasti","Reset to default":"Ripristina predefinito","Resistance against overlapping":"Resistenza alla sovrapposizione","Resize touching windows together":"Ridimensiona insieme le finestre che si toccano","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Anche il ridimensionamento si aggancia – qui a tutta altezza","Restore":"Ripristina","Restore default layouts":"Ripristina i layout predefiniti","Restore default layouts?":"Ripristinare i layout predefiniti?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Ripristina la dimensione originale quando trascini fuori la finestra","Restore the size before snapping":"Ripristina la dimensione prima dell’aggancio","Rows":"Righe","Save":"Salva","Screen edges":"Bordi dello schermo","Screen edges on/off":"Bordi dello schermo sì/no","Screen edges preview":"Anteprima dei bordi dello schermo","Set":"Imposta","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Imposta i tasti di tutte le azioni in una volta. Sotto puoi ancora cambiare i singoli tasti.","Settings":"Impostazioni","Settings file":"File delle impostazioni","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Scuoti velocemente il mouse avanti e indietro mentre ridimensioni e le altre finestre tornano indietro. Uno strappo veloce in una sola direzione non le stacca mai.","Shake to let go":"Scuoti per staccare","Shortcuts":"Scorciatoie","Show a small handle first":"Mostra prima una piccola maniglia","Show layout and zone names":"Mostra i nomi di layout e zone","Show previews in the accent color":"Mostra le anteprime nel colore di risalto","Showing":"Comparsa","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Mostra dove arriva la finestra su un bordo o un angolo. Disattivato: nessuna anteprima.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Mostra dove arriva la finestra mentre una zona della barra è evidenziata. Disattivato: nessuna anteprima.","Sidebar + grid":"Barra laterale + griglia","Single zone":"Zona singola","Six tiles":"Sei riquadri","Size & shape":"Dimensione e forma","Size of the main area":"Dimensione dell’area principale","Slide-in duration":"Durata della discesa","Slide-out duration":"Durata della risalita","Smart arranging and detection.":"Disposizione e riconoscimento intelligenti.","Smart fill":"Riempimento intelligente","Smooth (default)":"Morbida (predefinita)","Snap bar":"Barra di aggancio","Snap bar and screen edges":"Barra di aggancio e bordi dello schermo","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"La barra e i bordi sono disattivati – funziona solo la modalità 2 e la scorciatoia di modalità non fa nulla.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"La barra e i bordi dello schermo ostacolano l’affiancamento automatico. Per questo funzionano come due modalità – cambia con la scorciatoia o qui.","Snap bar colors:":"Colori della barra:","Snap bar on/off":"Barra di aggancio sì/no","Snap bar preview":"Anteprima della barra","Snap bar size":"Dimensione della barra","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Barra di aggancio, bordi dello schermo, magnete delle finestre, scorciatoie e scambio di finestre.","Snap distance":"Distanza di aggancio","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Aggancia i divisori (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Layout di aggancio e affiancamento automatico.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Aggancia la finestra attiva con combinazioni di tasti.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Aggancia la finestra attiva con la tastiera. Sono normali scorciatoie globali di KDE: le trovi anche in Impostazioni di sistema → Scorciatoie → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Aggancia alla metà inferiore","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Aggancia al quarto in basso a sinistra","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Aggancia al quarto in basso a destra","Snap to the center third":"Aggancia al terzo centrale","Snap to the left half":"Aggancia alla metà sinistra","Snap to the left third":"Aggancia al terzo sinistro","Snap to the left two thirds":"Aggancia ai due terzi a sinistra","Snap to the right half":"Aggancia alla metà destra","Snap to the right third":"Aggancia al terzo destro","Snap to the right two thirds":"Aggancia ai due terzi a destra","Snap to the top half":"Aggancia alla metà superiore","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Aggancia al quarto in alto a sinistra","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Aggancia al quarto in alto a destra","Snapping":"Aggancio","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Aggancio e affiancamento automatico funzionano come due modalità – una scorciatoia passa dall’una all’altra.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Così un solo magnete tira una finestra. Le tue impostazioni di KDE non cambiano: disattiva questa opzione, disattiva o rimuovi KSnapUnity e l’aggancio di KDE ritorna.","Soft":"Delicata","Spacing":"Spaziatura","Spiral":"Spirale","Split side by side":"Dividi affiancato","Split top and bottom":"Dividi sopra e sotto","Stack + main":"Pila + principale","Stick to other windows":"Attacca alle altre finestre","Stick to the screen edges":"Attacca ai bordi dello schermo","Sticky edges":"Bordi adesivi","Support KSnapUnity":"Sostieni KSnapUnity","Swap":"Scambia","Swap windows":"Scambiare le finestre","Swap with the window above":"Scambia con la finestra sopra","Swap with the window below":"Scambia con la finestra sotto","Swap with the window on the left":"Scambia con la finestra a sinistra","Swap with the window on the right":"Scambia con la finestra a destra","Switch mode":"Cambia modalità","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Cambia modalità (aggancio / affiancamento)","Switch modes with:":"Cambia modalità con:","Switch the layout by itself":"Cambia layout da solo","Switched off":"Disattivato","System":"Sistema","Take it over":"Prendilo","Take over all":"Prendili tutti","Take the main place":"Prendono il posto principale","Test animation":"Prova animazione","Test on screen":"Prova sullo schermo","Test the snap bar":"Prova la barra di aggancio","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"I valori predefiniti si basano su Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Le azioni di aggancio usano gli stessi spazi della barra e ricordano la dimensione prima dell’aggancio: «Ripristina la dimensione prima dell’aggancio» la riporta.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Queste applicazioni non vengono mai disposte e mantengono il loro posto. Le finestre di dialogo fluttuano sempre.","Thirds":"Terzi","Three columns":"Tre colonne","Thumbnail width":"Larghezza delle miniature","Tiling":"Affiancamento","Tip":"Suggerimento","Top / bottom":"Sopra / sotto","Top edge":"Bordo superiore","Top edge: full screen":"Bordo superiore: schermo intero","Top edge: maximize":"Bordo superiore: massimizza","Top edge: top half":"Bordo superiore: metà superiore","Top half":"Metà superiore","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Distanza di attivazione dal bordo superiore","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Disattivalo se preferisci il contorno di KDE – poi disattiva sopra l'anteprima dei bordi.","Two thirds":"Due terzi","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Due finestre si scambiano di posto – rilasciane una sull’altra o usa i tasti.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Due finestre si scambiano di posto: rilasciane una sull’altra, o con un tasto.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Usa le scorciatoie da tastiera","Use screen edges":"Usa i bordi dello schermo","Use the system accent color":"Usa il colore di accento del sistema","Use the window magnet":"Usa il magnete delle finestre","Usual combinations":"Combinazioni comuni","Version":"Versione","Wanted for: %1":"Richiesto per: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Quando una finestra si apre, si chiude o si scambia, le altre si muovono dolcemente invece di saltare.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Quando ridimensioni una finestra, quelle che la toccano spostano il bordo in comune con lei – nulla si sovrappone, nessuno spazio vuoto.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Durante il ridimensionamento, le finestre che non seguono sono mostrate trasparenti.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Mentre sposti o ridimensioni una finestra, i suoi bordi si attaccano alle finestre vicine e ai bordi dello schermo.","Width":"Larghezza","Window":"Finestra","Window magnet":"Magnete delle finestre","Window magnet on/off":"Magnete delle finestre sì/no","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Le finestre una sopra l'altra tengono insieme i bordi sinistro e destro, quelle affiancate i bordi superiore e inferiore.","Windows glide to their place":"Le finestre scivolano al loro posto","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Le finestre si attaccano tra loro e ai bordi dello schermo.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Le finestre si fermano allo «Spazio tra le finestre» della pagina Generale invece di toccarsi.","Yes":"Sì","Your own combination":"La tua combinazione","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"I tuoi layout e il loro ordine andranno persi.","Zone %1":"Zona %1","for KWin · v%1":"per KWin · v%1","windows:":"finestre:","“%1” will be removed.":"«%1» verrà rimosso.","…drag it onto window B…":"…trascinala sulla finestra B…","…in every direction":"…in ogni direzione","…let go: they trade places":"…rilascia: si scambiano di posto","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…le vicine crescono e si restringono con lui","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Pronto – fai clic su OK per aprire l’editor delle impostazioni."},"ja":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (コピー)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 は「%2」で使われています。","%1 of %2 zones":"%2 ゾーン中 %1","0 = all in one row":"0 = すべて 1 行に表示","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>モード1</b><br/>スナップバーと画面の端","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>モード2</b><br/>自動タイル配置","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"1つだけのウィンドウは余白を設定していても画面全体を使います。","A new window joins":"新しいウィンドウが加わる","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"短く押すと半分または 4 分の 1 になります。もう少し長く端に当てると、次のウィンドウまで広がります – プレビューで確認できます。","A single window":"ウィンドウが1つのとき","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"ウィンドウは素早く動かしても、他のウィンドウの端で止まります。離すにはマウスを振るか、少しの間押し続けます。0 = ウィンドウは自由に重なります。","About & Help":"情報とヘルプ","Accent color":"アクセントカラー","Active":"有効","Active mode":"現在のモード","Active width along the top edge":"上端の有効幅","Add an open application":"開いているアプリを追加","Add rule":"ルールを追加","All window features in one system.":"すべてのウィンドウ機能を1つのシステムに。","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"メインウィンドウのサイズを手動で変えたときにも変わります。","Also while resizing":"サイズ変更中も","Always floating":"常にフロート","Animation":"アニメーション","Appearance":"外観","Apply":"適用","Arrange windows":"ウィンドウの整列","Arrange windows automatically":"ウィンドウを自動で整列","Author":"作者","Automatic tiling":"自動タイル配置","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"自動タイル配置はオフです ― モード1だけが動作し、モードのショートカットは何もしません。","Automatic tiling off":"自動タイル配置オフ","Automatic tiling on":"自動タイル配置オン","Automatic tiling on/off":"自動タイル配置のオン/オフ","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"自動タイル配置、ウィンドウの入れ替え、ショートカット、フロートウィンドウ用のマグネット。","Background opacity":"背景の不透明度","Behavior & Animation":"動作とアニメーション","Bottom edge: bottom half":"下端：下半分","Bouncy":"バウンド","Buy me a coffee":"コーヒーをおごる","Cancel":"キャンセル","Center focus":"中央フォーカス","Center the window":"ウィンドウを中央に配置","Change":"変更","Change key":"キーを変更","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"キーは設定エディターで変更します。どちらのモードにも自動タイル配置と、スナップバーまたは画面の端が必要です。","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"キーは「キーボードショートカット」ページで変更できます。自動タイル配置では、ウィンドウは並び順でも入れ替わります。","Choose…":"選択…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"ゾーンをクリックで選択 · ダブルクリックで分割 · 区切り線をドラッグ","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"クリックするか %1 を押してモードを切り替えます。","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"クリックして OK ― 設定エディターが開きます。","Close":"閉じる","Close by, the edges stick together":"近づくと端どうしがくっつく","Color scheme":"配色","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"スナップバーの色、サイズ、形状。","Columns":"列","Corner radius":"角の半径","Corner size":"角のサイズ","Corner: a quarter":"角：4分の1","Corners: quarter of the screen":"角：画面の4分の1","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + キー（標準）","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + テンキー","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + キー","Custom color":"カスタムカラー","Custom layout %1":"カスタムレイアウト %1","Dark":"ダーク","Delay before hiding":"非表示までの遅延","Delay before showing":"表示までの遅延","Delete":"削除","Delete layout?":"レイアウトを削除しますか？","Distance at which the handle appears":"ハンドルが現れる距離","Distance before the bar hides again":"バーが再び隠れるまでの距離","Distance to the edge":"端までの距離","Donate with PayPal":"PayPal で寄付する","Drag a shared edge…":"共有の端をドラッグ…","Drag a window against an edge…":"ウィンドウを端に押し当てる…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"ウィンドウを別のウィンドウの上にドラッグすると入れ替わります。スナップバーや画面の端に落とすと自由にフロートし、「ウィンドウをフロートにする」で戻ります。間隔は「全般」ページで設定します。","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"ウィンドウを別のウィンドウの中央へドラッグし ― プレビューに2本の矢印が出たら ― 放します。自動タイル配置ではもう一方のウィンドウ上ならどこでも構いません。","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"ウィンドウを画面の上端までドラッグし、ゾーンの上でドロップします。","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"カードをドラッグしてスナップバー内の順序を変更します。カードをダブルクリックすると編集できます。","Drop a window onto another one":"ウィンドウを別のウィンドウにドロップ","Drop the window onto a zone":"ウィンドウをゾーンの上でドロップ","Duplicate":"複製","Duration":"長さ","Dwindle":"内向きスパイラル","Dynamic":"ダイナミック","Edges and corners":"端と角","Edit":"編集","Edit layout":"レイアウトを編集","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"各機能は個別にオン・オフできます。","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"レイアウトページで作ったレイアウトはウィンドウの配置にも使えます ― 上に表示されます。ウィンドウ1はゾーン1へ、以下同様。余ったウィンドウは最後のゾーンを分け合います。ゾーンよりウィンドウが少ないときは「メイン＋スタック」を使い、すき間ができません。","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"タイル型ウィンドウマネージャーのように、各ウィンドウが自動で配置されます。","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"各ウィンドウが画面上の位置を自動で見つけます。新しいウィンドウは並びに加わり、閉じたウィンドウは他のために場所を空けます。","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"例：2つは横並び、3つからはメイン＋スタック、5つからはグリッド。該当するルールがなければ上で選んだレイアウトを使います。","Fade in and out":"フェードイン・フェードアウト","Fade the other windows":"ほかのウィンドウを薄くする","Features":"機能","Feel":"操作感","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"スナップ済みのウィンドウに合わせる","Fits the way you work.":"あなたの働き方に合わせて。","Float the window (leave tiling)":"ウィンドウをフロートにする（タイル配置から外す）","Four quarters":"4 分割","From":"個から","Fullscreen":"フルスクリーン","Gap between windows":"ウィンドウ間の間隔","Gap to the screen edge":"画面端との間隔","General":"全般","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"すべてのアクションに選んだ配列のキーを再び割り当て、配列にないキーを削除します。","Good to know":"知っておくと便利","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"ウィンドウのタイトルバーをつかんで上にドラッグします。スナップバーが下りてくるので、ゾーンの上でドロップすると、ウィンドウがその領域にぴったり収まります。もう一度引き出すと、元のサイズに戻ります。","Grab window A…":"ウィンドウAをつかむ…","Grid":"グリッド","Halves":"2 分割","Hiding":"非表示","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"端で押し当てて空きスペースを埋める","Hold time":"押し当て時間","Hold to fill":"押し当てて埋める","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"端がどれだけ近づくとピタッと止まるか。","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"カーソルが端にどれだけ近づく必要があるか。","How far the bar slides down":"バーが下がる距離","How it works":"使い方","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"ウィンドウを端にどれだけ押し当てておく必要があるか（軽く押す）。0 = すぐ。","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"広がるまでにウィンドウが端にとどまる時間。","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"メイン領域を共有するウィンドウ数（レイアウト「メイン＋スタック」）。","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"下にすでにウィンドウがある場合、上端は最大化ではなく上半分になります。半分や4分の1でもスナップ済みのウィンドウを隠しません。","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"KSnapUnity を気に入っていただけたら、開発を支援できます ― ありがとうございます！","In bar":"バーに表示","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"スナップバーや画面の端とは独立しています。","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"スナップバーとは独立しています。端ごとにオンにできます。","Information":"情報","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"直感的で自然なウィンドウの動き。","Join at the end":"最後に加わる","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K は KWin · Snap はより賢いスナップ · Unity はすべてを1つのシステムに","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE には独自の画面の端のアクションとウィンドウのスナップ機能があります。ここで同じ機能をオンにしている場合は、KDE 側をオフにしてください：システム設定 → ウィンドウ管理 → スクリーンエッジ、およびウィンドウの挙動 → 移動。","KDE's own edge tiling":"KDE 自身の端のタイル配置","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"画面の端でのKDE自身の最大化とタイル配置（輪郭付き）は、KSnapUnity の動作中は一時停止し、プレビューが1つだけ表示されます。KDE の設定は変わりません：これをオフにするか、KSnapUnity を無効化または削除すれば KDE の動作に戻ります。","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"KDE 独自の画面の端のアクションがまだオンのため、同じドラッグに2つの機能が反応します。システム設定 → ウィンドウ管理 → スクリーンエッジ で「最大化」と「タイル」をオフにしてください。","KDE's own window snapping":"KDE 自身のウィンドウスナップ","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE 独自のウィンドウのスナップもオンになっています。操作感をそろえるには、システム設定 → ウィンドウ管理 → ウィンドウの挙動 → 移動 でそのゾーンを「なし」にしてください。","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"KDE のショートカットサービスが応答しませんでした。システム設定 → ショートカット → KWin でキーを設定することもできます。","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity ― 設定エディター","Keep stacked windows in line":"積み重ねたウィンドウを一直線に保つ","Keep the gap between windows":"ウィンドウ間の間隔を保つ","Keep them":"そのままにする","Key scheme":"キー配列","Keyboard shortcuts":"キーボードショートカット","Keys":"キー","Keys already in use":"すでに使われているキー","Layout":"レイアウト","Layout by number of windows":"ウィンドウ数によるレイアウト","Layouts":"レイアウト","Layouts per row":"1 行あたりのレイアウト数","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"左右の端：画面の半分","Left edge: left half":"左端：左半分","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"100 % 未満にすると1つだけのウィンドウは中央に ― ワイド画面にぴったり。","License":"ライセンス","Light":"ライト","Linear":"リニア","Live preview":"ライブプレビュー","Load template…":"テンプレートを読み込む…","Magnet":"マグネット","Main + stack":"メイン + スタック","Main and stack":"メイン＋スタック","Main area bigger":"メイン領域を大きく","Main area on the right":"メイン領域を右に","Main area smaller":"メイン領域を小さく","Main in the middle":"中央にメイン","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"ドラッグとキーのメインスイッチ。","Main window":"メインウィンドウ","Main windows":"メインウィンドウ数","Main windows: %1":"メインウィンドウ：%1","Make it the main window":"メインウィンドウにする","Maximize":"最大化","Maximize or restore":"最大化または元に戻す","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + キー（KDE スタイル）","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + キー","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + キー","Minimize":"最小化","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"レイアウトを左右反転：メインウィンドウが右、他は左。","Mode":"モード","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"モード1 ― スナップバーと画面の端","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"モード2 ― 自動タイル配置","Modes":"モード","More ways":"その他の方法","Motion curve":"モーションカーブ","Move a window towards others…":"ウィンドウを他のウィンドウに近づける…","Move the window one place back":"ウィンドウを1つ後ろへ移動","Move the window one place on":"ウィンドウを1つ先へ移動","Name:":"名前:","New layout":"新しいレイアウト","New windows":"新しいウィンドウ","Next tiling layout":"次のタイルレイアウト","Next to the active window":"アクティブなウィンドウの隣","No key":"キーなし","No other window open":"他に開いているウィンドウはありません","No outer margin":"外側の余白なし","No shortcuts":"ショートカットなし","None":"なし","None yet.":"まだありません。","Off":"オフ","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"オフ＝モード1、オン＝モード2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"オフ:ニュートラルな枠 – オンになっているプレビューのみ。","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"オフ：キーは割り当てられたままですが、何もしません。","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"オフ：ウィンドウは置いた場所にとどまります。他の機能はどちらでも動作します。","One at a time":"1 つずつ","One closes – the others fill the gap":"1つ閉じると ― 他がすき間を埋める","One main window less":"メインウィンドウを1つ減らす","One more main window":"メインウィンドウを1つ増やす","One window":"ウィンドウ1つ","Only one mode is switched on.":"有効なモードは1つだけです。","Open settings editor":"設定エディターを開く","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"先にアプリを開いてから、ここで選びます。","Open the layout builder":"レイアウトビルダーを開く","Own layouts":"自作レイアウト","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"各辺のうち角として扱う部分。","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"KDE の端のタイル配置とそのプレビューを一時停止","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"マグネットがオンの間は KDE のスナップゾーンを一時停止","Preview":"プレビュー","Previews":"プレビュー","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"ウィンドウを画面の端や角に押し付けると、その部分いっぱいに広がります。スナップバーがあってもなくても使えます。","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"ウィンドウを端や角に押し付ける：最大化、半分、4分の1。","Push delay":"押し付けの遅延","Quarters":"4分の1","Quick":"クイック","Quick settings":"クイック設定","Recommended values":"推奨値","Remove":"削除","Remove rule":"ルールを削除","Remove zone":"ゾーンを削除","Reset all":"すべてリセット","Reset all keys":"すべてのキーをリセット","Reset to default":"既定に戻す","Resistance against overlapping":"重なりへの抵抗","Resize touching windows together":"接しているウィンドウを一緒にリサイズ","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"サイズ変更でもくっつく ― ここでは高さいっぱいに","Restore":"元に戻す","Restore default layouts":"既定のレイアウトに戻す","Restore default layouts?":"既定のレイアウトに戻しますか？","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"ウィンドウを引き出したときに元のサイズに戻す","Restore the size before snapping":"スナップ前のサイズに戻す","Rows":"行","Save":"保存","Screen edges":"画面の端","Screen edges on/off":"画面の端のオン/オフ","Screen edges preview":"画面の端のプレビュー","Set":"設定","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"すべてのアクションのキーをまとめて設定します。個々のキーは下で引き続き変更できます。","Settings":"設定","Settings file":"設定ファイル","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"サイズ変更中にマウスを素早く左右に振ると、他のウィンドウが元に戻ります。一方向への素早い引きでは離れません。","Shake to let go":"振って切り離す","Shortcuts":"ショートカット","Show a small handle first":"最初に小さなハンドルを表示","Show layout and zone names":"レイアウト名とゾーン名を表示","Show previews in the accent color":"プレビューをアクセントカラーで表示","Showing":"表示","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"端や角でウィンドウがどこに収まるかを表示します。オフ:プレビューなし。","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"スナップバーのゾーンが強調されている間、ウィンドウがどこに収まるかを表示します。オフ:プレビューなし。","Sidebar + grid":"サイドバー + グリッド","Single zone":"単一ゾーン","Six tiles":"6 タイル","Size & shape":"サイズと形状","Size of the main area":"メイン領域のサイズ","Slide-in duration":"スライドインの時間","Slide-out duration":"スライドアウトの時間","Smart arranging and detection.":"賢い配置と検出。","Smart fill":"スマートフィル","Smooth (default)":"スムーズ（既定）","Snap bar":"スナップバー","Snap bar and screen edges":"スナップバーと画面の端","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"スナップバーと画面の端はオフです ― モード2だけが動作し、モードのショートカットは何もしません。","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"スナップバーと画面の端は自動タイル配置の邪魔になります。そのため2つのモードとして動作します ― ショートカットかここで切り替えます。","Snap bar colors:":"スナップバーの色：","Snap bar on/off":"スナップバーのオン/オフ","Snap bar preview":"スナップバーのプレビュー","Snap bar size":"スナップバーのサイズ","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"スナップバー、画面の端、ウィンドウマグネット、ショートカット、ウィンドウの入れ替え。","Snap distance":"吸着距離","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"区切り線をスナップ（¼、⅓、½ …）","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"スナップレイアウトと自動タイル配置。","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"アクティブなウィンドウをキーの組み合わせでスナップします。","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"アクティブなウィンドウをキーボードでスナップします。これらは通常の KDE グローバルショートカットです。システム設定 → ショートカット → KWin にもあります。","Snap to the bottom half":"下半分にスナップ","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"左下の4分の1にスナップ","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"右下の4分の1にスナップ","Snap to the center third":"中央の3分の1にスナップ","Snap to the left half":"左半分にスナップ","Snap to the left third":"左の3分の1にスナップ","Snap to the left two thirds":"左の3分の2にスナップ","Snap to the right half":"右半分にスナップ","Snap to the right third":"右の3分の1にスナップ","Snap to the right two thirds":"右の3分の2にスナップ","Snap to the top half":"上半分にスナップ","Snap to the top-left quarter":"左上の4分の1にスナップ","Snap to the top-right quarter":"右上の4分の1にスナップ","Snapping":"スナップ","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"スナップと自動タイル配置は2つのモードとして動作し、1つのショートカットで切り替えます。","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"これでウィンドウを引くマグネットは1つだけになります。KDE の設定は変わりません：これをオフにするか、KSnapUnity を無効化または削除すれば KDE のスナップに戻ります。","Soft":"ソフト","Spacing":"間隔","Spiral":"スパイラル","Split side by side":"左右に分割","Split top and bottom":"上下に分割","Stack + main":"スタック + メイン","Stick to other windows":"他のウィンドウにくっつく","Stick to the screen edges":"画面の端にくっつく","Sticky edges":"くっつく縁","Support KSnapUnity":"KSnapUnity を支援","Swap":"入れ替え","Swap windows":"ウィンドウの入れ替え","Swap with the window above":"上のウィンドウと入れ替え","Swap with the window below":"下のウィンドウと入れ替え","Swap with the window on the left":"左のウィンドウと入れ替え","Swap with the window on the right":"右のウィンドウと入れ替え","Switch mode":"モードを切り替え","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"モードを切り替え（スナップ／タイル配置）","Switch modes with:":"モードの切り替えキー：","Switch the layout by itself":"レイアウトを自動で切り替え","Switched off":"オフ","System":"システム","Take it over":"引き継ぐ","Take over all":"すべて引き継ぐ","Take the main place":"メインの位置を取る","Test animation":"アニメーションをテスト","Test on screen":"画面でテスト","Test the snap bar":"スナップバーを試す","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"既定値は Windows 11 を参考にしています。","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"スナップ操作はスナップバーと同じ間隔を使い、スナップ前のサイズを記憶します。「スナップ前のサイズに戻す」で元に戻せます。","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"これらのアプリは配置されず、自分の位置を保ちます。ダイアログは常にフロートします。","Thirds":"3分の1","Three columns":"3 列","Thumbnail width":"サムネイルの幅","Tiling":"タイル配置","Tip":"ヒント","Top / bottom":"上 / 下","Top edge":"上端","Top edge: full screen":"上端：全画面","Top edge: maximize":"上端：最大化","Top edge: top half":"上端：上半分","Top half":"上半分","Trigger distance from the top edge":"上端からの反応距離","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"KDE 自身の枠線の方がよければオフにし、上の画面の端のプレビューをオフにしてください。","Two thirds":"3 分の 2","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"2つのウィンドウが場所を入れ替えます ― 一方を他方の上に落とすか、キーを使います。","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"2つのウィンドウが場所を入れ替えます：一方を他方の上に落とすか、キーで。","Use keyboard shortcuts":"キーボードショートカットを使う","Use screen edges":"画面の端を使う","Use the system accent color":"システムのアクセントカラーを使用","Use the window magnet":"ウィンドウマグネットを使う","Usual combinations":"よく使う組み合わせ","Version":"バージョン","Wanted for: %1":"割り当て先：%1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"ウィンドウを開く・閉じる・入れ替えるとき、他のウィンドウは跳ばずに滑らかに動きます。","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"ウィンドウのサイズを変えると、接しているウィンドウも共通の縁を一緒に動かします。重なりも隙間もできません。","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"リサイズ中、一緒に動かないウィンドウを半透明で表示します。","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"ウィンドウを移動したりサイズを変えたりすると、その端が近くのウィンドウや画面の端にくっつきます。","Width":"幅","Window":"ウィンドウ","Window magnet":"ウィンドウマグネット","Window magnet on/off":"ウィンドウマグネットのオン/オフ","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"上下に並んだウィンドウは左右の縁を、左右に並んだウィンドウは上下の縁をそろえたままにします。","Windows glide to their place":"ウィンドウが滑らかに所定の位置へ","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"ウィンドウ同士や画面の端にくっつきます。","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"ウィンドウは接触せず、「全般」ページの「ウィンドウ間の間隔」で止まります。","Yes":"はい","Your own combination":"独自の組み合わせ","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"自分で作成したレイアウトとその順序は失われます。","Zone %1":"ゾーン %1","for KWin · v%1":"KWin 用 · v%1","windows:":"ウィンドウ：","“%1” will be removed.":"「%1」を削除します。","…drag it onto window B…":"…ウィンドウBの上へドラッグ…","…in every direction":"…どの方向にも","…let go: they trade places":"…放すと場所が入れ替わる","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…隣のウィンドウも一緒に伸び縮みする","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ 準備完了 ― OK をクリックすると設定エディターが開きます。"},"ka":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (ასლი)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 გამოიყენება „%2“-ის მიერ.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 / %2 ზონა","0 = all in one row":"0 = ყველა ერთ რიგში","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>რეჟიმი 1</b><br/>მიმაგრების ზოლი და ეკრანის კიდეები","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>რეჟიმი 2</b><br/>ავტომატური განლაგება","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"ერთი ფანჯარა მთელ ეკრანს იყენებს, დაშორების მითითების შემთხვევაშიც.","A new window joins":"ემატება ახალი ფანჯარა","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"მოკლე ბიძგი იძლევა ნახევარს ან მეოთხედს. ფანჯარა კიდესთან ცოტა უფრო დიდხანს დააყოვნეთ და ის შემდეგ ფანჯრამდე გაიზრდება – გადახედვა ამას აჩვენებს.","A single window":"ერთი ფანჯარა","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"ფანჯარა ჩერდება სხვის კიდესთან, მაშინაც კი, როცა სწრაფად ამოძრავებთ. გასათავისუფლებლად შეარხიეთ თაგუნა ან კიდევ წამით უბიძგეთ. 0 = ფანჯრებს შეუძლიათ თავისუფლად გადაფარვა.","About & Help":"შესახებ და დახმარება","Accent color":"აქცენტის ფერი","Active":"აქტიური","Active mode":"აქტიური რეჟიმი","Active width along the top edge":"აქტიური სიგანე ზედა კიდის გასწვრივ","Add an open application":"ღია აპის დამატება","Add rule":"წესის დამატება","All window features in one system.":"ფანჯრის ყველა ფუნქცია ერთ სისტემაში.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"იცვლება მაშინაც, როცა მთავარი ფანჯრის ზომას ხელით ცვლით.","Also while resizing":"ზომის შეცვლისასაც","Always floating":"ყოველთვის მოცურავე","Animation":"ანიმაცია","Appearance":"გარეგნობა","Apply":"გამოყენება","Arrange windows":"ფანჯრების განლაგება","Arrange windows automatically":"ფანჯრების ავტომატური განლაგება","Author":"ავტორი","Automatic tiling":"ავტომატური ფილებად განლაგება","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"ავტომატური განლაგება გამორთულია – მუშაობს მხოლოდ რეჟიმი 1 და რეჟიმის მალსახმობი არაფერს აკეთებს.","Automatic tiling off":"ავტომატური განლაგება გამორთულია","Automatic tiling on":"ავტომატური განლაგება ჩართულია","Automatic tiling on/off":"ავტომატური განლაგება ჩართ./გამორთ.","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"ავტომატური განლაგება, ფანჯრების გაცვლა, მალსახმობები და მაგნიტი მოცურავე ფანჯრებისთვის.","Background opacity":"ფონის გაუმჭვირვალობა","Behavior & Animation":"ქცევა და ანიმაცია","Bottom edge: bottom half":"ქვედა კიდე: ქვედა ნახევარი","Bouncy":"ზამბარისებრი","Buy me a coffee":"მიყიდე ყავა","Cancel":"გაუქმება","Center focus":"ფოკუსი ცენტრში","Center the window":"ფანჯრის ცენტრში მოთავსება","Change":"შეცვლა","Change key":"კლავიშის შეცვლა","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"კლავიშს პარამეტრების რედაქტორში შეცვლით. ორივე რეჟიმს სჭირდება ავტომატური განლაგება და ზოლი ან ეკრანის კიდეები.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"შეცვალეთ ისინი გვერდზე „კლავიატურის მალსახმობები“. ავტომატური განლაგებისას ფანჯრები რიგშიც ცვლიან ადგილს.","Choose…":"არჩევა…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"დააწკაპუნეთ ზონაზე მის ასარჩევად · ორჯერ დაწკაპუნება ყოფს · გადაათრიეთ გამყოფები","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"დააწკაპეთ ან დააჭირეთ %1 რეჟიმის გადასართავად.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"დააწკაპეთ, შემდეგ OK – იხსნება პარამეტრების რედაქტორი.","Close":"დახურვა","Close by, the edges stick together":"ახლოს კიდეები ერთმანეთს ეკვრის","Color scheme":"ფერთა სქემა","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"ზოლის ფერები, ზომა და ფორმა.","Columns":"სვეტები","Corner radius":"კუთხეების რადიუსი","Corner size":"კუთხის ზომა","Corner: a quarter":"კუთხე: მეოთხედი","Corners: quarter of the screen":"კუთხეები: ეკრანის მეოთხედი","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + კლავიში (ნაგულისხმევი)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + ციფრული ბლოკი","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + კლავიში","Custom color":"საკუთარი ფერი","Custom layout %1":"საკუთარი განლაგება %1","Dark":"მუქი","Delay before hiding":"დაყოვნება დამალვამდე","Delay before showing":"დაყოვნება ჩვენებამდე","Delete":"წაშლა","Delete layout?":"წავშალო განლაგება?","Distance at which the handle appears":"მანძილი, სადაც სახელური ჩნდება","Distance before the bar hides again":"მანძილი, რის შემდეგაც ზოლი ისევ იმალება","Distance to the edge":"მანძილი კიდემდე","Donate with PayPal":"შემოწირულობა PayPal-ით","Drag a shared edge…":"გადაათრიეთ საერთო კიდე…","Drag a window against an edge…":"გადაიტანეთ ფანჯარა კიდისკენ…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"გადაიტანეთ ფანჯარა მეორეზე მათ გასაცვლელად. ზოლზე ან ეკრანის კიდეზე დაგდებული თავისუფლად ცურავს; „ფანჯრის ცურვა“ აბრუნებს მას. დაშორებები ზოგადი გვერდიდან მოდის.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"გადაიტანეთ ფანჯარა მეორის შუაზე – გადახედვა ორ ისარს აჩვენებს – და გაუშვით. ავტომატური განლაგებისას საკმარისია მეორე ფანჯრის ნებისმიერი ადგილი.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"გადაათრიეთ ფანჯარა ეკრანის ზედა კიდესთან და ჩააგდეთ ზონაზე.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"გადაათრიეთ ბარათები ზოლში რიგის შესაცვლელად. ორჯერ დააწკაპუნეთ ბარათზე მის დასარედაქტირებლად.","Drop a window onto another one":"ფანჯრის ჩაგდება მეორეზე","Drop the window onto a zone":"ჩააგდეთ ფანჯარა ზონაზე","Duplicate":"დუბლირება","Duration":"ხანგრძლივობა","Dwindle":"შიგნით სპირალი","Dynamic":"დინამიკური","Edges and corners":"კიდეები და კუთხეები","Edit":"რედაქტირება","Edit layout":"განლაგების რედაქტირება","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"თითოეული ფუნქცია ცალკე ირთვება და ითიშება.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"განლაგებების გვერდზე შექმნილ ყველა განლაგებას ფანჯრების დალაგებაც შეუძლია – ის ზემოთ ჩანს. ფანჯარა 1 იღებს ზონა 1-ს და ა.შ.; დამატებითი ფანჯრები ბოლო ზონას იყოფენ. ზონებზე ნაკლები ფანჯრისას გამოიყენება „მთავარი და დასტა“, რომ ხვრელები არ დარჩეს.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"ყოველი ფანჯარა თავად პოულობს ადგილს, როგორც ფილებიან ფანჯრების მმართველში.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"ყოველი ფანჯარა თავად პოულობს ადგილს ეკრანზე. ახალი ფანჯრები ემატება, დახურულები ადგილს უთმობენ სხვებს.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"მაგალითი: ორი ფანჯარა გვერდიგვერდ, სამიდან მთავარი და დასტა, ხუთიდან ბადე. შესაბამისი წესის გარეშე მოქმედებს ზემოთ არჩეული განლაგება.","Fade in and out":"გაქრობა-გამოჩენის ეფექტი","Fade the other windows":"სხვა ფანჯრების მკრთალად ჩვენება","Features":"ფუნქციები","Feel":"შეგრძნება","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"უკვე მიმაგრებულ ფანჯრებთან მორგება","Fits the way you work.":"ერგება თქვენს მუშაობის სტილს.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"ფანჯრის ცურვა (ფილებიდან გასვლა)","Four quarters":"ოთხი მეოთხედი","From":"დან","Fullscreen":"სრული ეკრანი","Gap between windows":"დაშორება ფანჯრებს შორის","Gap to the screen edge":"დაშორება ეკრანის კიდემდე","General":"ზოგადი","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"ყველა ქმედებას ხელახლა ანიჭებს არჩეული სქემის კლავიშს და შლის კლავიშებს, რომლებიც სქემაში არ არის.","Good to know":"კარგია იცოდეთ","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"დაიჭირეთ ფანჯარა სათაურის ზოლით და აათრიეთ ზემოთ. ზოლი ჩამოსრიალდება; ჩააგდეთ ფანჯარა ზონაზე და ის ზუსტად ამ არეს დაიკავებს. ხელახლა გამოთრევისას ძველ ზომას დაიბრუნებს.","Grab window A…":"დაიჭირეთ ფანჯარა A…","Grid":"ბადე","Halves":"ნახევრები","Hiding":"დამალვა","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"კიდესთან დაჭერა თავისუფალი ადგილის შესავსებად","Hold time":"დაჭერის დრო","Hold to fill":"დაჭერა შესავსებად","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"რამდენად ახლოს უნდა მივიდეს კიდე, სანამ ადგილზე ჩაჯდება.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"რამდენად ახლოს უნდა მივიდეს კურსორი კიდესთან.","How far the bar slides down":"რამდენად ქვემოთ ჩამოდის ზოლი","How it works":"როგორ მუშაობს","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"რამდენ ხანს უნდა ეყრდნობოდეს ფანჯარა კიდეს – პატარა ბიძგი. 0 = მაშინვე.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"რამდენ ხანს უნდა დარჩეს ფანჯარა კიდესთან, სანამ გაიზრდება.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"რამდენი ფანჯარა იყოფს მთავარ არეს (განლაგება „მთავარი და დასტა“).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"თუ ქვემოთ უკვე ფანჯარაა, ზედა კიდე გადიდების ნაცვლად ზედა ნახევარს იძლევა. ნახევრები და მეოთხედებიც არ ფარავს მიმაგრებულ ფანჯრებს.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"თუ KSnapUnity მოგწონთ, შეგიძლიათ მხარი დაუჭიროთ განვითარებას – გმადლობთ!","In bar":"ზოლში","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"ზოლისა და ეკრანის კიდეებისგან დამოუკიდებელი.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"ზოლისგან დამოუკიდებელი. თითოეული კიდე ცალკე ირთვება.","Information":"ინფორმაცია","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"ინტუიციური, ბუნებრივი ფანჯრის ქცევა.","Join at the end":"ბოლოში ემატება","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K – KWin · Snap – ჭკვიანი მიმაგრება · Unity – ყველაფერი ერთ სისტემაში","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE-ს აქვს ეკრანის კიდის საკუთარი ქმედებები და ფანჯრების მიმაგრება. თუ იგივე ფუნქცია აქ ჩართულია, გამორთეთ KDE-ს ფუნქცია: სისტემის პარამეტრები → ფანჯრების მართვა → ეკრანის კიდეები და ფანჯრის ქცევა → გადაადგილება.","KDE's own edge tiling":"KDE-ს საკუთარი კიდეების ფილებად განლაგება","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"KDE-ის საკუთარი გაშლა და ფილებად განლაგება კიდეებზე – კონტურით – შეჩერებულია, სანამ KSnapUnity მუშაობს, ასე რომ მხოლოდ ერთი გადახედვა ჩანს. KDE-ის პარამეტრები არ იცვლება: გამორთეთ ეს, გათიშეთ ან წაშალეთ KSnapUnity და KDE-ის ქცევა დაბრუნდება.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"KDE-ს ეკრანის კიდის საკუთარი ქმედებები ჯერ კიდევ ჩართულია, ამიტომ ერთსა და იმავე გადათრევაზე ორი დამხმარე რეაგირებს. გამორთეთ „გადიდება“ და „ფილებად განლაგება“ აქ: სისტემის პარამეტრები → ფანჯრების მართვა → ეკრანის კიდეები.","KDE's own window snapping":"KDE-ს საკუთარი ფანჯრების მიმაგრება","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE-ს საკუთარი ფანჯრების მიმაგრებაც ჩართულია. ერთიანი შეგრძნებისთვის მისი ზონები დააყენეთ „არცერთი“-ზე: სისტემის პარამეტრები → ფანჯრების მართვა → ფანჯრის ქცევა → გადაადგილება.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"KDE-ს მალსახმობების სერვისმა არ უპასუხა. კლავიშების დაყენება მაინც შეგიძლიათ აქ: სისტემის პარამეტრები → მალსახმობები → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – პარამეტრების რედაქტორი","Keep stacked windows in line":"ერთმანეთზე დაწყობილი ფანჯრები ერთ ხაზზე","Keep the gap between windows":"დაშორების შენარჩუნება ფანჯრებს შორის","Keep them":"დატოვება","Key scheme":"კლავიშთა სქემა","Keyboard shortcuts":"კლავიატურის მალსახმობები","Keys":"კლავიშები","Keys already in use":"უკვე დაკავებული კლავიშები","Layout":"განლაგება","Layout by number of windows":"განლაგება ფანჯრების რაოდენობის მიხედვით","Layouts":"განლაგებები","Layouts per row":"განლაგებები რიგში","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"მარცხენა და მარჯვენა კიდე: ეკრანის ნახევარი","Left edge: left half":"მარცხენა კიდე: მარცხენა ნახევარი","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"100 %-ზე ნაკლები ერთ ფანჯარას ცენტრში ტოვებს – ლამაზია ფართო ეკრანზე.","License":"ლიცენზია","Light":"ღია","Linear":"წრფივი","Live preview":"ცოცხალი გადახედვა","Load template…":"შაბლონის ჩატვირთვა…","Magnet":"მაგნიტი","Main + stack":"მთავარი + დასტა","Main and stack":"მთავარი და დასტა","Main area bigger":"უფრო დიდი მთავარი არე","Main area on the right":"მთავარი არე მარჯვნივ","Main area smaller":"უფრო პატარა მთავარი არე","Main in the middle":"მთავარი შუაში","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"მთავარი ჩამრთველი გადათრევისა და კლავიშებისთვის.","Main window":"მთავარი ფანჯარა","Main windows":"მთავარი ფანჯრები","Main windows: %1":"მთავარი ფანჯრები: %1","Make it the main window":"მთავარ ფანჯრად ქცევა","Maximize":"გადიდება","Maximize or restore":"გადიდება ან აღდგენა","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + კლავიში (KDE სტილი)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + კლავიში","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + კლავიში","Minimize":"ჩაკეცვა","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"ასარკავს განლაგებას: მთავარი ფანჯარა მარჯვნივ, სხვები მარცხნივ.","Mode":"რეჟიმი","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"რეჟიმი 1 – მიმაგრების ზოლი და ეკრანის კიდეები","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"რეჟიმი 2 – ავტომატური ფილებად განლაგება","Modes":"რეჟიმები","More ways":"სხვა გზები","Motion curve":"მოძრაობის მრუდი","Move a window towards others…":"მიიტანეთ ფანჯარა სხვებთან…","Move the window one place back":"ფანჯრის ერთი ადგილით უკან გადატანა","Move the window one place on":"ფანჯრის ერთი ადგილით წინ გადატანა","Name:":"სახელი:","New layout":"ახალი განლაგება","New windows":"ახალი ფანჯრები","Next tiling layout":"შემდეგი განლაგება","Next to the active window":"აქტიური ფანჯრის გვერდით","No key":"კლავიში არ არის","No other window open":"სხვა ღია ფანჯარა არ არის","No outer margin":"გარე დაშორების გარეშე","No shortcuts":"მალსახმობების გარეშე","None":"არცერთი","None yet.":"ჯერ არაფერი.","Off":"გამორთული","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"გამორთ. = რეჟიმი 1, ჩართ. = რეჟიმი 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"გამორთული: ნეიტრალური ჩარჩო – მხოლოდ ჩართული გადახედვებისთვის.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"გამორთული: კლავიშები მინიჭებული რჩება, მაგრამ არაფერს აკეთებს.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"გამორთული: ფანჯრები რჩება იქ, სადაც დადებთ. სხვა ფუნქციები ნებისმიერ შემთხვევაში მუშაობს.","One at a time":"სათითაოდ","One closes – the others fill the gap":"ერთი იხურება – დანარჩენები ავსებს სიცარიელეს","One main window less":"ერთით ნაკლები მთავარი ფანჯარა","One more main window":"კიდევ ერთი მთავარი ფანჯარა","One window":"ერთი ფანჯარა","Only one mode is switched on.":"ჩართულია მხოლოდ ერთი რეჟიმი.","Open settings editor":"პარამეტრების რედაქტორის გახსნა","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"ჯერ გახსენით აპი, შემდეგ აქ აირჩიეთ.","Open the layout builder":"განლაგების კონსტრუქტორის გახსნა","Own layouts":"საკუთარი განლაგებები","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"თითოეული მხარის ნაწილი, რომელიც კუთხედ ითვლება.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"KDE-ს კიდეების ფილებად განლაგების და მისი გადახედვის შეჩერება","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"KDE-ს მიმაგრების ზონების შეჩერება, სანამ მაგნიტი ჩართულია","Preview":"გადახედვა","Previews":"გადახედვები","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"მიაბჯინეთ ფანჯარა ეკრანის კიდეს ან კუთხეს და ის ამ ნაწილს შეავსებს. მუშაობს ზოლით ან მის გარეშე.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"მიაბჯინეთ ფანჯარა კიდეს ან კუთხეს: გადიდება, ნახევრები, მეოთხედები.","Push delay":"მიბჯენის დაყოვნება","Quarters":"მეოთხედები","Quick":"სწრაფი","Quick settings":"სწრაფი პარამეტრები","Recommended values":"რეკომენდებული მნიშვნელობები","Remove":"წაშლა","Remove rule":"წესის წაშლა","Remove zone":"ზონის წაშლა","Reset all":"ყველაფრის ჩამოყრა","Reset all keys":"ყველა კლავიშის ჩამოყრა","Reset to default":"ნაგულისხმევზე დაბრუნება","Resistance against overlapping":"გადაფარვის წინააღმდეგობა","Resize touching windows together":"ერთმანეთზე მიბჯენილი ფანჯრების ზომის ერთად შეცვლა","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"ზომის შეცვლაც მიიმაგრება – აქ სრულ სიმაღლეზე","Restore":"აღდგენა","Restore default layouts":"ნაგულისხმევი განლაგებების აღდგენა","Restore default layouts?":"აღვადგინო ნაგულისხმევი განლაგებები?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"საწყისი ზომის აღდგენა ფანჯრის გამოთრევისას","Restore the size before snapping":"მიმაგრებამდელი ზომის აღდგენა","Rows":"სტრიქონები","Save":"შენახვა","Screen edges":"ეკრანის კიდეები","Screen edges on/off":"ეკრანის კიდეების ჩართვა/გამორთვა","Screen edges preview":"ეკრანის კიდეების გადახედვა","Set":"დაყენება","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"ყველა ქმედების კლავიშებს ერთბაშად აყენებს. ცალკეული კლავიშების შეცვლა ქვემოთ კვლავ შეგიძლიათ.","Settings":"პარამეტრები","Settings file":"პარამეტრების ფაილი","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"ზომის შეცვლისას სწრაფად შეარხიეთ თაგუნა წინ და უკან და დანარჩენი ფანჯრები უკან ხტება. ერთი მიმართულებით სწრაფი მოქაჩვა მათ არასოდეს ათავისუფლებს.","Shake to let go":"შეანჯღრიეთ გასათავისუფლებლად","Shortcuts":"მალსახმობები","Show a small handle first":"ჯერ პატარა სახელურის ჩვენება","Show layout and zone names":"განლაგებებისა და ზონების სახელების ჩვენება","Show previews in the accent color":"გადახედვების ჩვენება აქცენტის ფერით","Showing":"ჩვენება","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"აჩვენებს, სად მოხვდება ფანჯარა კიდესთან ან კუთხეში. გამორთული: გადახედვა საერთოდ არ არის.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"აჩვენებს, სად მოხვდება ფანჯარა, სანამ ზოლის ზონა მონიშნულია. გამორთული: გადახედვა საერთოდ არ არის.","Sidebar + grid":"გვერდითი ზოლი + ბადე","Single zone":"ერთი ზონა","Six tiles":"ექვსი ფილა","Size & shape":"ზომა და ფორმა","Size of the main area":"მთავარი არის ზომა","Slide-in duration":"შემოსვლის ხანგრძლივობა","Slide-out duration":"გასვლის ხანგრძლივობა","Smart arranging and detection.":"ჭკვიანი განლაგება და ამოცნობა.","Smart fill":"ჭკვიანი შევსება","Smooth (default)":"გლუვი (ნაგულისხმევი)","Snap bar":"ზოლი","Snap bar and screen edges":"მიმაგრების ზოლი და ეკრანის კიდეები","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"ზოლი და კიდეები გამორთულია – მუშაობს მხოლოდ რეჟიმი 2 და რეჟიმის მალსახმობი არაფერს აკეთებს.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"ზოლი და ეკრანის კიდეები ხელს უშლის ავტომატურ განლაგებას. ამიტომ ისინი ორ რეჟიმად მუშაობს – გადართეთ მალსახმობით ან აქ.","Snap bar colors:":"ზოლის ფერები:","Snap bar on/off":"ზოლის ჩართვა/გამორთვა","Snap bar preview":"ზოლის გადახედვა","Snap bar size":"ზოლის ზომა","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"მიმაგრების ზოლი, ეკრანის კიდეები, ფანჯრის მაგნიტი, მალსახმობები და ფანჯრების გაცვლა.","Snap distance":"მიკვრის მანძილი","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"გამყოფების მიმაგრება (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"მიმაგრების განლაგებები და ავტომატური ფილები.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"მიამაგრეთ აქტიური ფანჯარა კლავიშთა კომბინაციებით.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"მიამაგრეთ აქტიური ფანჯარა კლავიატურით. ეს KDE-ს ჩვეულებრივი გლობალური მალსახმობებია – მათ ასევე ნახავთ აქ: სისტემის პარამეტრები → მალსახმობები → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"ქვედა ნახევარზე მიმაგრება","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"ქვედა მარცხენა მეოთხედზე მიმაგრება","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"ქვედა მარჯვენა მეოთხედზე მიმაგრება","Snap to the center third":"შუა მესამედზე მიმაგრება","Snap to the left half":"მარცხენა ნახევარზე მიმაგრება","Snap to the left third":"მარცხენა მესამედზე მიმაგრება","Snap to the left two thirds":"მარცხენა ორ მესამედზე მიმაგრება","Snap to the right half":"მარჯვენა ნახევარზე მიმაგრება","Snap to the right third":"მარჯვენა მესამედზე მიმაგრება","Snap to the right two thirds":"მარჯვენა ორ მესამედზე მიმაგრება","Snap to the top half":"ზედა ნახევარზე მიმაგრება","Snap to the top-left quarter":"ზედა მარცხენა მეოთხედზე მიმაგრება","Snap to the top-right quarter":"ზედა მარჯვენა მეოთხედზე მიმაგრება","Snapping":"მიმაგრება","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"მიმაგრება და ავტომატური განლაგება ორ რეჟიმად მუშაობს – ერთი მალსახმობი ცვლის მათ შორის.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"ასე ფანჯარას მხოლოდ ერთი მაგნიტი ექაჩება. KDE-ის პარამეტრები არ იცვლება: გამორთეთ ეს, გათიშეთ ან წაშალეთ KSnapUnity და KDE-ის მიმაგრება დაბრუნდება.","Soft":"რბილი","Spacing":"დაშორებები","Spiral":"სპირალი","Split side by side":"გვერდიგვერდ დაყოფა","Split top and bottom":"ზემოთ და ქვემოთ დაყოფა","Stack + main":"დასტა + მთავარი","Stick to other windows":"სხვა ფანჯრებზე მიკვრა","Stick to the screen edges":"ეკრანის კიდეებზე მიკვრა","Sticky edges":"წებოვანი კიდეები","Support KSnapUnity":"KSnapUnity-ის მხარდაჭერა","Swap":"გაცვლა","Swap windows":"ფანჯრების გაცვლა","Swap with the window above":"გაცვლა ზედა ფანჯარასთან","Swap with the window below":"გაცვლა ქვედა ფანჯარასთან","Swap with the window on the left":"გაცვლა მარცხენა ფანჯარასთან","Swap with the window on the right":"გაცვლა მარჯვენა ფანჯარასთან","Switch mode":"რეჟიმის გადართვა","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"რეჟიმის გადართვა (მიმაგრება / ფილები)","Switch modes with:":"რეჟიმის გადართვა:","Switch the layout by itself":"განლაგების თავისით შეცვლა","Switched off":"გამორთულია","System":"სისტემური","Take it over":"გადაბარება","Take over all":"ყველას გადაბარება","Take the main place":"მთავარ ადგილს იკავებს","Test animation":"ანიმაციის გამოცდა","Test on screen":"ეკრანზე გამოცდა","Test the snap bar":"ზოლის გამოცდა","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"ნაგულისხმევი მნიშვნელობები ეფუძნება Windows 11-ს.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"მიმაგრების ქმედებები ზოლის იგივე დაშორებებს იყენებს და იმახსოვრებს ზომას მიმაგრებამდე: „მიმაგრებამდელი ზომის აღდგენა“ მას აბრუნებს.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"ეს აპები არასოდეს ლაგდება და საკუთარ ადგილს ინარჩუნებს. დიალოგები ყოველთვის ცურავს.","Thirds":"მესამედები","Three columns":"სამი სვეტი","Thumbnail width":"მინიატიურების სიგანე","Tiling":"ფილები","Tip":"რჩევა","Top / bottom":"ზემოთ / ქვემოთ","Top edge":"ზედა კიდე","Top edge: full screen":"ზედა კიდე: მთელი ეკრანი","Top edge: maximize":"ზედა კიდე: გაშლა","Top edge: top half":"ზედა კიდე: ზედა ნახევარი","Top half":"ზედა ნახევარი","Trigger distance from the top edge":"ამოქმედების მანძილი ზედა კიდიდან","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"გამორთეთ, თუ KDE-ს საკუთარი კონტური გირჩევნიათ – შემდეგ ზემოთ გამორთეთ ეკრანის კიდეების გადახედვა.","Two thirds":"ორი მესამედი","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"ორი ფანჯარა ცვლის ადგილს – დააგდეთ ერთი მეორეზე ან გამოიყენეთ კლავიშები.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"ორი ფანჯარა ცვლის ადგილს: დააგდეთ ერთი მეორეზე ან კლავიშით.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"კლავიატურის მალსახმობების გამოყენება","Use screen edges":"ეკრანის კიდეების გამოყენება","Use the system accent color":"სისტემის აქცენტის ფერის გამოყენება","Use the window magnet":"ფანჯრის მაგნიტის გამოყენება","Usual combinations":"ჩვეული კომბინაციები","Version":"ვერსია","Wanted for: %1":"საჭიროა: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"როცა ფანჯარა იხსნება, იხურება ან იცვლება, სხვები ხტუნვის ნაცვლად რბილად მოძრაობს.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"ფანჯრის ზომის შეცვლისას, მასზე მიბჯენილი ფანჯრები საერთო კიდეს მასთან ერთად ამოძრავებენ – არაფერი გადაიფარება, ღრეჩო არ ჩნდება.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"ზომის შეცვლისას ფანჯრები, რომლებიც არ მიჰყვებიან, გამჭვირვალედ ჩანს.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"ფანჯრის გადაადგილების ან ზომის შეცვლისას მისი კიდეები ახლომდებარე ფანჯრებსა და ეკრანის კიდეებს ეკვრის.","Width":"სიგანე","Window":"ფანჯარა","Window magnet":"ფანჯრის მაგნიტი","Window magnet on/off":"ფანჯრის მაგნიტის ჩართვა/გამორთვა","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"ერთმანეთის ზემოთ მყოფი ფანჯრები მარცხენა და მარჯვენა კიდეებს ერთად ინარჩუნებენ, გვერდიგვერდ მყოფები – ზედა და ქვედა კიდეებს.","Windows glide to their place":"ფანჯრები შეუფერხებლად სრიალებს ადგილზე","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"ფანჯრები ერთმანეთს და ეკრანის კიდეებს ეკვრის.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"ფანჯრები ერთმანეთს არ ეხება და ჩერდება „დაშორება ფანჯრებს შორის“ მნიშვნელობაზე ზოგადი გვერდიდან.","Yes":"დიახ","Your own combination":"საკუთარი კომბინაცია","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"თქვენი განლაგებები და მათი რიგი დაიკარგება.","Zone %1":"ზონა %1","for KWin · v%1":"KWin-ისთვის · v%1","windows:":"ფანჯარა:","“%1” will be removed.":"„%1“ წაიშლება.","…drag it onto window B…":"…გადაიტანეთ ფანჯარა B-ზე…","…in every direction":"…ყველა მიმართულებით","…let go: they trade places":"…გაუშვით: ადგილებს ცვლიან","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…მეზობლები მასთან ერთად იზრდება და მცირდება","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ მზადაა – დააწკაპეთ OK პარამეტრების რედაქტორის გასახსნელად."},"ko":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (사본)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 키는 \"%2\"에서 사용 중입니다.","%1 of %2 zones":"%2개 중 %1개 영역","0 = all in one row":"0 = 모두 한 줄에","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>모드 1</b><br/>스냅 바와 화면 가장자리","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>모드 2</b><br/>자동 타일링","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"창 하나는 여백이 설정되어 있어도 화면 전체를 씁니다.","A new window joins":"새 창이 합류합니다","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"짧게 밀면 절반이나 4분의 1이 됩니다. 창을 가장자리에 조금 더 오래 대면 다음 창까지 커집니다 – 미리 보기가 보여 줍니다.","A single window":"창 하나만 있을 때","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"창을 빠르게 움직여도 다른 창의 가장자리에서 멈춥니다. 떼려면 마우스를 흔들거나 잠시 더 미세요. 0 = 창이 자유롭게 겹칠 수 있습니다.","About & Help":"정보 및 도움말","Accent color":"강조 색상","Active":"활성","Active mode":"활성 모드","Active width along the top edge":"위쪽 가장자리의 활성 너비","Add an open application":"열린 앱 추가","Add rule":"규칙 추가","All window features in one system.":"모든 창 기능을 하나의 시스템에.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"주 창의 크기를 직접 바꿀 때도 바뀝니다.","Also while resizing":"크기 조절 중에도","Always floating":"항상 띄우기","Animation":"애니메이션","Appearance":"모양","Apply":"적용","Arrange windows":"창 정렬","Arrange windows automatically":"창 자동 정렬","Author":"제작자","Automatic tiling":"자동 타일링","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"자동 타일링이 꺼져 있습니다 – 모드 1만 동작하며 모드 단축키는 아무 일도 하지 않습니다.","Automatic tiling off":"자동 타일링 꺼짐","Automatic tiling on":"자동 타일링 켜짐","Automatic tiling on/off":"자동 타일링 켜기/끄기","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"자동 타일링, 창 바꾸기, 단축키, 떠 있는 창을 위한 자석.","Background opacity":"배경 불투명도","Behavior & Animation":"동작 및 애니메이션","Bottom edge: bottom half":"아래쪽 가장자리: 아래쪽 절반","Bouncy":"통통 튀게","Buy me a coffee":"커피 한 잔 사 주세요","Cancel":"취소","Center focus":"가운데 집중","Center the window":"창을 가운데로","Change":"변경","Change key":"키 바꾸기","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"키는 설정 편집기에서 바꿉니다. 두 모드 모두 자동 타일링과 스냅 바 또는 화면 가장자리가 필요합니다.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"키보드 단축키 페이지에서 바꿀 수 있습니다. 자동 타일링에서는 창의 순서상 자리도 바뀝니다.","Choose…":"선택…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"영역을 클릭해 선택 · 더블 클릭으로 나누기 · 구분선을 드래그","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"모드를 바꾸려면 클릭하거나 %1 키를 누르세요.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"클릭한 다음 확인 – 설정 편집기가 열립니다.","Close":"닫기","Close by, the edges stick together":"가까이 가면 가장자리가 붙습니다","Color scheme":"색 구성표","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"스냅 바의 색상, 크기 및 모양.","Columns":"열","Corner radius":"모서리 반경","Corner size":"모서리 크기","Corner: a quarter":"모서리: 4분의 1","Corners: quarter of the screen":"모서리: 화면의 4분의 1","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + 키(기본값)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + 숫자 키패드","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + 키","Custom color":"사용자 지정 색상","Custom layout %1":"사용자 지정 레이아웃 %1","Dark":"어둡게","Delay before hiding":"숨기기 전 지연","Delay before showing":"표시 전 지연","Delete":"삭제","Delete layout?":"레이아웃을 삭제할까요?","Distance at which the handle appears":"손잡이가 나타나는 거리","Distance before the bar hides again":"바가 다시 숨겨지기 전 거리","Distance to the edge":"가장자리까지의 거리","Donate with PayPal":"PayPal로 기부하기","Drag a shared edge…":"공유된 가장자리를 끌면…","Drag a window against an edge…":"창을 가장자리로 끌어 보세요…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"창을 다른 창 위로 끌면 서로 바뀝니다. 스냅 바나 화면 가장자리에 놓으면 자유롭게 뜨며, „창 띄우기“로 다시 돌아옵니다. 간격은 일반 페이지에서 정합니다.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"창을 다른 창의 가운데로 끌어 – 미리 보기에 화살표 두 개가 보이면 – 놓으세요. 자동 타일링에서는 다른 창 위 어디든 됩니다.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"창을 화면 위쪽 가장자리로 끌어 영역 위에 놓으세요.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"카드를 끌어 스냅 바의 순서를 바꾸세요. 카드를 더블 클릭하면 편집할 수 있습니다.","Drop a window onto another one":"창을 다른 창 위에 놓기","Drop the window onto a zone":"창을 영역 위에 놓으세요","Duplicate":"복제","Duration":"길이","Dwindle":"안쪽 나선","Dynamic":"역동적으로","Edges and corners":"가장자리와 모서리","Edit":"편집","Edit layout":"레이아웃 편집","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"각 기능은 따로 켜고 끌 수 있습니다.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"레이아웃 페이지에서 만든 레이아웃은 창 배치에도 쓸 수 있습니다 – 위에 나타납니다. 창 1은 영역 1로, 이런 식으로 이어지며 남는 창은 마지막 영역을 나눠 씁니다. 창이 영역보다 적으면 빈 곳이 생기지 않도록 „주 창과 스택“을 사용합니다.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"타일링 창 관리자처럼 모든 창이 스스로 자리를 찾습니다.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"모든 창이 화면에서 스스로 자리를 찾습니다. 새 창은 합류하고, 닫힌 창은 다른 창에게 자리를 내줍니다.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"예: 창 2개는 나란히, 3개부터 주 창과 스택, 5개부터 격자. 맞는 규칙이 없으면 위에서 고른 레이아웃을 씁니다.","Fade in and out":"페이드 인/아웃","Fade the other windows":"다른 창 흐리게 표시","Features":"기능","Feel":"느낌","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"이미 스냅된 창에 맞추기","Fits the way you work.":"당신의 작업 방식에 맞춥니다.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"창 띄우기(타일링에서 빼기)","Four quarters":"4분할","From":"부터","Fullscreen":"전체 화면","Gap between windows":"창 사이 간격","Gap to the screen edge":"화면 가장자리와의 간격","General":"일반","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"모든 동작에 선택한 구성의 키를 다시 지정하고 구성에 없는 키는 제거합니다.","Good to know":"알아 두면 좋은 점","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"창의 제목 표시줄을 잡고 위로 끌어 올리세요. 스냅 바가 내려오면 창을 영역 위에 놓으세요. 창이 그 영역을 정확히 채웁니다. 다시 끌어내면 이전 크기로 돌아갑니다.","Grab window A…":"창 A를 잡고…","Grid":"격자","Halves":"2분할","Hiding":"숨기기","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"가장자리에 길게 대어 빈 공간 채우기","Hold time":"대는 시간","Hold to fill":"길게 대어 채우기","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"가장자리가 얼마나 가까워져야 제자리에 딱 붙는지.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"커서가 가장자리에 얼마나 가까이 와야 하는지.","How far the bar slides down":"바가 내려오는 거리","How it works":"사용 방법","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"창이 가장자리에 얼마나 오래 닿아 있어야 하는지 – 살짝 밀기. 0 = 즉시.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"창이 커지기 전에 가장자리에 머물러야 하는 시간.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"주 영역을 함께 쓰는 창의 수(레이아웃 “주 창과 스택”).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"아래에 이미 창이 있으면 위쪽 가장자리는 최대화 대신 위쪽 절반을 줍니다. 절반과 4분의 1도 스냅된 창을 가리지 않습니다.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"KSnapUnity가 마음에 드신다면 개발을 후원할 수 있습니다 – 감사합니다!","In bar":"바에 표시","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"스냅 바, 화면 가장자리와 별개입니다.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"스냅 바와 별개입니다. 가장자리마다 따로 켤 수 있습니다.","Information":"정보","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"직관적이고 자연스러운 창 동작.","Join at the end":"맨 뒤에 추가","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K는 KWin · Snap은 더 똑똑한 스냅 · Unity는 하나의 시스템에 모든 것","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE에는 자체 화면 가장자리 동작과 창 스냅 기능이 있습니다. 여기서 같은 기능을 켰다면 KDE 쪽을 끄세요: 시스템 설정 → 창 관리 → 화면 가장자리, 그리고 창 동작 → 이동.","KDE's own edge tiling":"KDE 자체 가장자리 타일링","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"화면 가장자리에서의 KDE 자체 최대화와 타일링(윤곽선 포함)은 KSnapUnity가 실행되는 동안 일시 중지되어 미리 보기가 하나만 나타납니다. KDE 설정은 바뀌지 않습니다: 이 옵션을 끄거나 KSnapUnity를 비활성화·제거하면 KDE의 동작이 돌아옵니다.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"KDE 자체 화면 가장자리 동작이 아직 켜져 있어 같은 드래그에 두 기능이 반응합니다. 시스템 설정 → 창 관리 → 화면 가장자리에서 \"최대화\"와 \"타일\"을 끄세요.","KDE's own window snapping":"KDE 자체 창 스냅","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE 자체 창 스냅도 켜져 있습니다. 일관된 느낌을 위해 시스템 설정 → 창 관리 → 창 동작 → 이동에서 영역을 \"없음\"으로 설정하세요.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"KDE 단축키 서비스가 응답하지 않았습니다. 시스템 설정 → 단축키 → KWin에서 키를 설정할 수 있습니다.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – 설정 편집기","Keep stacked windows in line":"쌓인 창을 한 줄로 유지","Keep the gap between windows":"창 사이 간격 유지","Keep them":"그대로 두기","Key scheme":"키 구성","Keyboard shortcuts":"키보드 단축키","Keys":"키","Keys already in use":"이미 사용 중인 키","Layout":"레이아웃","Layout by number of windows":"창 개수에 따른 레이아웃","Layouts":"레이아웃","Layouts per row":"한 줄당 레이아웃 수","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"왼쪽·오른쪽 가장자리: 화면의 절반","Left edge: left half":"왼쪽 가장자리: 왼쪽 절반","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"100 % 미만이면 창 하나가 가운데에 머뭅니다 – 와이드 화면에 좋습니다.","License":"라이선스","Light":"밝게","Linear":"선형","Live preview":"실시간 미리 보기","Load template…":"템플릿 불러오기…","Magnet":"자석","Main + stack":"메인 + 스택","Main and stack":"주 창과 스택","Main area bigger":"주 영역 크게","Main area on the right":"주 영역을 오른쪽에","Main area smaller":"주 영역 작게","Main in the middle":"가운데 주 창","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"끌기와 키를 위한 주 스위치.","Main window":"주 창","Main windows":"주 창 개수","Main windows: %1":"주 창: %1","Make it the main window":"주 창으로 만들기","Maximize":"최대화","Maximize or restore":"최대화 또는 복원","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + 키(KDE 스타일)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + 키","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + 키","Minimize":"최소화","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"레이아웃을 좌우 반전: 주 창은 오른쪽, 나머지는 왼쪽.","Mode":"모드","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"모드 1 – 스냅 바와 화면 가장자리","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"모드 2 – 자동 타일링","Modes":"모드","More ways":"더 많은 방법","Motion curve":"움직임 곡선","Move a window towards others…":"창을 다른 창 쪽으로 옮기면…","Move the window one place back":"창을 한 칸 뒤로","Move the window one place on":"창을 한 칸 앞으로","Name:":"이름:","New layout":"새 레이아웃","New windows":"새 창","Next tiling layout":"다음 타일링 레이아웃","Next to the active window":"활성 창 옆","No key":"키 없음","No other window open":"다른 창이 열려 있지 않음","No outer margin":"바깥 여백 없음","No shortcuts":"단축키 없음","None":"없음","None yet.":"아직 없습니다.","Off":"끄기","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"끔 = 모드 1, 켬 = 모드 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"끄기: 중립적인 테두리 – 켜진 미리 보기에만 적용.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"끄기: 키는 할당된 채로 남지만 아무 일도 하지 않습니다.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"끔: 창이 놓은 자리에 그대로 있습니다. 다른 기능은 어느 쪽이든 작동합니다.","One at a time":"하나씩","One closes – the others fill the gap":"하나가 닫히면 – 나머지가 빈자리를 채웁니다","One main window less":"주 창 하나 덜","One more main window":"주 창 하나 더","One window":"창 하나","Only one mode is switched on.":"모드가 하나만 켜져 있습니다.","Open settings editor":"설정 편집기 열기","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"먼저 앱을 열고 여기에서 고르세요.","Open the layout builder":"레이아웃 빌더 열기","Own layouts":"나만의 레이아웃","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"각 변에서 모서리로 치는 부분.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"KDE의 가장자리 타일링과 그 미리 보기 일시 중지","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"자석이 켜져 있는 동안 KDE 스냅 영역 일시 중지","Preview":"미리 보기","Previews":"미리 보기","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"창을 화면 가장자리나 모서리로 밀면 그 부분을 채웁니다. 스냅 바가 있든 없든 작동합니다.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"창을 가장자리나 모서리로 밀기: 최대화, 절반, 4분의 1.","Push delay":"밀기 지연","Quarters":"4분의 1","Quick":"빠르게","Quick settings":"빠른 설정","Recommended values":"권장 값","Remove":"제거","Remove rule":"규칙 삭제","Remove zone":"영역 제거","Reset all":"모두 초기화","Reset all keys":"모든 키 초기화","Reset to default":"기본값으로 되돌리기","Resistance against overlapping":"겹침 저항","Resize touching windows together":"맞닿은 창의 크기를 함께 조절","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"크기 조절도 붙습니다 – 여기서는 전체 높이로","Restore":"복원","Restore default layouts":"기본 레이아웃 복원","Restore default layouts?":"기본 레이아웃을 복원할까요?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"창을 끌어낼 때 원래 크기로 복원","Restore the size before snapping":"스냅 전 크기로 복원","Rows":"행","Save":"저장","Screen edges":"화면 가장자리","Screen edges on/off":"화면 가장자리 켜기/끄기","Screen edges preview":"화면 가장자리 미리 보기","Set":"설정","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"모든 동작의 키를 한 번에 설정합니다. 개별 키는 아래에서 계속 바꿀 수 있습니다.","Settings":"설정","Settings file":"설정 파일","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"크기를 바꾸는 동안 마우스를 빠르게 앞뒤로 흔들면 다른 창이 되돌아갑니다. 한 방향으로 빠르게 당기면 절대 떨어지지 않습니다.","Shake to let go":"흔들어서 떼기","Shortcuts":"단축키","Show a small handle first":"먼저 작은 손잡이 표시","Show layout and zone names":"레이아웃 및 영역 이름 표시","Show previews in the accent color":"미리 보기를 강조 색상으로 표시","Showing":"표시","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"가장자리나 모서리에서 창이 놓일 위치를 보여 줍니다. 끄기: 미리 보기 없음.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"스냅 바의 영역이 강조된 동안 창이 놓일 위치를 보여 줍니다. 끄기: 미리 보기 없음.","Sidebar + grid":"사이드바 + 격자","Single zone":"단일 영역","Six tiles":"6타일","Size & shape":"크기 및 모양","Size of the main area":"주 영역 크기","Slide-in duration":"나타나는 시간","Slide-out duration":"사라지는 시간","Smart arranging and detection.":"똑똑한 배치와 감지.","Smart fill":"스마트 채우기","Smooth (default)":"부드럽게 (기본값)","Snap bar":"스냅 바","Snap bar and screen edges":"스냅 바와 화면 가장자리","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"스냅 바와 가장자리가 꺼져 있습니다 – 모드 2만 동작하며 모드 단축키는 아무 일도 하지 않습니다.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"스냅 바와 화면 가장자리는 자동 타일링을 방해합니다. 그래서 두 가지 모드로 동작합니다 – 단축키나 여기에서 바꾸세요.","Snap bar colors:":"스냅 바 색상:","Snap bar on/off":"스냅 바 켜기/끄기","Snap bar preview":"스냅 바 미리 보기","Snap bar size":"스냅 바 크기","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"스냅 바, 화면 가장자리, 창 자석, 단축키, 창 바꾸기.","Snap distance":"스냅 거리","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"구분선 스냅 (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"스냅 레이아웃과 자동 타일링.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"키 조합으로 활성 창을 스냅합니다.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"키보드로 활성 창을 스냅합니다. 일반적인 KDE 전역 단축키이며 시스템 설정 → 단축키 → KWin에서도 찾을 수 있습니다.","Snap to the bottom half":"아래쪽 절반에 스냅","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"왼쪽 아래 4분의 1에 스냅","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"오른쪽 아래 4분의 1에 스냅","Snap to the center third":"가운데 3분의 1에 스냅","Snap to the left half":"왼쪽 절반에 스냅","Snap to the left third":"왼쪽 3분의 1에 스냅","Snap to the left two thirds":"왼쪽 3분의 2에 스냅","Snap to the right half":"오른쪽 절반에 스냅","Snap to the right third":"오른쪽 3분의 1에 스냅","Snap to the right two thirds":"오른쪽 3분의 2에 스냅","Snap to the top half":"위쪽 절반에 스냅","Snap to the top-left quarter":"왼쪽 위 4분의 1에 스냅","Snap to the top-right quarter":"오른쪽 위 4분의 1에 스냅","Snapping":"스냅","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"스냅과 자동 타일링은 두 가지 모드로 동작하며 단축키 하나로 전환합니다.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"그래서 자석 하나만 창을 당깁니다. KDE 설정은 바뀌지 않습니다: 이 옵션을 끄거나 KSnapUnity를 비활성화·제거하면 KDE의 스냅이 돌아옵니다.","Soft":"은은하게","Spacing":"간격","Spiral":"나선형","Split side by side":"좌우로 나누기","Split top and bottom":"위아래로 나누기","Stack + main":"스택 + 메인","Stick to other windows":"다른 창에 붙기","Stick to the screen edges":"화면 가장자리에 붙기","Sticky edges":"붙는 가장자리","Support KSnapUnity":"KSnapUnity 후원","Swap":"바꾸기","Swap windows":"창 바꾸기","Swap with the window above":"위쪽 창과 바꾸기","Swap with the window below":"아래쪽 창과 바꾸기","Swap with the window on the left":"왼쪽 창과 바꾸기","Swap with the window on the right":"오른쪽 창과 바꾸기","Switch mode":"모드 전환","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"모드 전환(스냅 / 타일링)","Switch modes with:":"모드 전환 키:","Switch the layout by itself":"레이아웃 자동 전환","Switched off":"꺼짐","System":"시스템","Take it over":"가져오기","Take over all":"모두 가져오기","Take the main place":"주 자리 차지","Test animation":"애니메이션 테스트","Test on screen":"화면에서 테스트","Test the snap bar":"스냅 바 시험하기","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"기본값은 Windows 11을 기준으로 합니다.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"스냅 동작은 스냅 바와 같은 간격을 사용하고 스냅 전 크기를 기억합니다. \"스냅 전 크기로 복원\"으로 되돌릴 수 있습니다.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"이 앱들은 배치되지 않고 자기 자리를 지킵니다. 대화 상자는 항상 떠 있습니다.","Thirds":"3분의 1","Three columns":"3열","Thumbnail width":"미리 보기 이미지 너비","Tiling":"타일링","Tip":"팁","Top / bottom":"위 / 아래","Top edge":"위쪽 가장자리","Top edge: full screen":"위쪽 가장자리: 전체 화면","Top edge: maximize":"위쪽 가장자리: 최대화","Top edge: top half":"위쪽 가장자리: 위쪽 절반","Top half":"위쪽 절반","Trigger distance from the top edge":"위쪽 가장자리로부터의 작동 거리","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"KDE 자체 윤곽선이 더 좋다면 끄고, 위의 화면 가장자리 미리 보기를 끄세요.","Two thirds":"3분의 2","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"두 창이 자리를 바꿉니다 – 하나를 다른 창 위에 놓거나 키를 쓰세요.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"두 창이 자리를 바꿉니다: 하나를 다른 창 위에 놓거나 키로.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"키보드 단축키 사용","Use screen edges":"화면 가장자리 사용","Use the system accent color":"시스템 강조 색상 사용","Use the window magnet":"창 자석 사용","Usual combinations":"자주 쓰는 조합","Version":"버전","Wanted for: %1":"원하는 동작: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"창이 열리거나 닫히거나 바뀔 때 나머지 창이 튀지 않고 부드럽게 움직입니다.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"창의 크기를 바꾸면 맞닿은 창이 공유하는 가장자리를 함께 옮깁니다. 겹치지도 않고 틈도 생기지 않습니다.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"크기를 조절하는 동안 함께 움직이지 않는 창은 반투명하게 표시됩니다.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"창을 옮기거나 크기를 바꾸는 동안 가장자리가 근처 창과 화면 가장자리에 붙습니다.","Width":"너비","Window":"창","Window magnet":"창 자석","Window magnet on/off":"창 자석 켜기/끄기","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"위아래로 놓인 창은 왼쪽과 오른쪽 가장자리를, 나란히 놓인 창은 위와 아래 가장자리를 함께 유지합니다.","Windows glide to their place":"창이 부드럽게 제자리로","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"창이 서로 붙고 화면 가장자리에도 붙습니다.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"창이 서로 닿지 않고 일반 페이지의 \"창 사이 간격\"에서 멈춥니다.","Yes":"예","Your own combination":"나만의 조합","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"직접 만든 레이아웃과 순서가 사라집니다.","Zone %1":"영역 %1","for KWin · v%1":"KWin용 · v%1","windows:":"개 창:","“%1” will be removed.":"\"%1\"이(가) 제거됩니다.","…drag it onto window B…":"…창 B 위로 끌어다…","…in every direction":"…모든 방향으로","…let go: they trade places":"…놓으면 자리를 바꿉니다","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…이웃 창도 함께 커지고 작아집니다","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ 준비 완료 – 확인을 누르면 설정 편집기가 열립니다."},"lb":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (Kopie)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 gëtt vu „%2“ benotzt.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 vun %2 Zonen","0 = all in one row":"0 = all an enger Rei","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Modus 1</b><br/>Snap-Leescht a Bildschierm-Kanten","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Modus 2</b><br/>Automatesch Kachelen","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Eng eenzel Fënster notzt de ganze Bildschierm, och wann en Abstand agestallt ass.","A new window joins":"Eng nei Fënster kënnt derbäi","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"E kuerze Stouss gëtt d'Halschent oder de Véierel. Halt d'Fënster e bësse méi laang un der Kant, a si wiisst bis bei déi nächst Fënster – d'Virschau weist et.","A single window":"Eng eenzel Fënster","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Eng Fënster stoppt um Rand vun enger anerer, och wann s du se séier beweegs. Rëssel d’Maus oder dréck nach e Moment weider, fir se lass ze loossen. 0 = Fënstere kënne sech fräi iwwerlappen.","About & Help":"Info & Hëllef","Accent color":"Akzentfaarf","Active":"Aktiv","Active mode":"Aktive Modus","Active width along the top edge":"Aktiv Breet um ieweschte Rand","Add an open application":"Oppene Programm derbäisetzen","Add rule":"Regel derbäisetzen","All window features in one system.":"All Fënsterfunktiounen an engem System.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Ännert sech och, wann s du d’Haaptfënster mat der Hand méi grouss oder méi kleng zéis.","Also while resizing":"Och beim Gréisstänneren","Always floating":"Ëmmer fräi","Animation":"Animatioun","Appearance":"Ausgesinn","Apply":"Uwenden","Arrange windows":"Fënsteren arrangéieren","Arrange windows automatically":"Fënsteren automatesch arrangéieren","Author":"Auteur","Automatic tiling":"Automatesch Kachelen","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Automatesch Kachelen ass aus – nëmme Modus 1 leeft, an d’Modus-Tast mécht näischt.","Automatic tiling off":"Automatesch Kachelen aus","Automatic tiling on":"Automatesch Kachelen un","Automatic tiling on/off":"Automatesch Kachelen un/aus","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Automatesch Kachelen, Fënsteren tauschen, Tastekombinatiounen an de Magnéit fir fräi Fënsteren.","Background opacity":"Deckkraaft vum Hannergrond","Behavior & Animation":"Verhalen & Animatioun","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Ënnescht Kant: ënnescht Hällef","Bouncy":"Fiederend","Cancel":"Ofbriechen","Center focus":"Fokus an der Mëtt","Center the window":"Fënster zentréieren","Change":"Änneren","Change key":"Tast änneren","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"D’Tast ännerst de am Astellungseditor. Béid Modi brauchen dat automatescht Kachelen an d’Snap-Leescht oder d’Bildschierm-Kanten.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Änner se op der Säit Tastekombinatiounen. Beim automatesche Kachelen tauschen d’Fënsteren och hir Plaz an der Reiefolleg.","Choose…":"Wielen …","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Klickt op eng Zon fir se ze wielen · Duebelklick deelt se · Trennlinnen mat der Maus zéien","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Klick oder dréck %1, fir de Modus ze wiesselen.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Klick, dann OK – den Astellungseditor geet op.","Close":"Zoumaachen","Close by, the edges stick together":"No beieneen pechen d’Kanten zesummen","Color scheme":"Faarfschema","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Faarwen, Gréisst a Form vun der Snap-Leescht.","Columns":"Kolonnen","Corner radius":"Eckeradius","Corner size":"Eckgréisst","Corner: a quarter":"Eck: e Véierel","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Ecken: e Véierel vum Bildschierm","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Strg+Alt + Tast (Standard)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Strg+Alt + Zifferblock","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Strg+Shift+Alt + Tast","Custom color":"Eege Faarf","Custom layout %1":"Eegene Layout %1","Dark":"Däischter","Delay before hiding":"Verzögerung virum Erafueren","Delay before showing":"Verzögerung virum Erausfueren","Delete":"Läschen","Delete layout?":"Layout läschen?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Ofstand, ab deem de Grëff erschéngt","Distance before the bar hides again":"Ofstand, bis d’Leescht erëm erafiert","Distance to the edge":"Ofstand zur Kant","Donate with PayPal":"Mat PayPal spenden","Drag a shared edge…":"Zitt un enger gemeinsamer Kant …","Drag a window against an edge…":"Zitt eng Fënster géint e Rand …","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Zitt eng Fënster op eng aner, fir se ze tauschen. Op der Snap-Leescht oder engem Rand lassgelooss, schwieft se fräi; „Fënster schwiewe loossen“ hëlt se zeréck. D’Ofstänn kommen vun der Säit Allgemeng.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Zitt eng Fënster iwwer d’Mëtt vun enger anerer – d’Virschau weist zwee Feiler – a looss lass. Beim automatesche Kachelen geet iergendwou iwwer der anerer Fënster.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Zitt eng Fënster un den ieweschte Bildschiermrand a leet se op eng Zon of.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Zitt d’Kaarten, fir d’Reiefolleg an der Leescht z’änneren. Duebelklick op eng Kaart mécht den Editor op.","Drop a window onto another one":"Eng Fënster op eng aner falen loossen","Drop the window onto a zone":"Fënster op eng Zon ofleeën","Duplicate":"Duplizéieren","Duration":"Dauer","Dwindle":"Spiral no bannen","Dynamic":"Dynamesch","Edges and corners":"Kanten an Ecken","Edit":"Beaarbechten","Edit layout":"Layout beaarbechten","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"All Funktioun kann eenzel un- an ausgeschalt ginn.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"All Layout, deen s de op der Säit Layouten bauls, kann och Fënsteren uerdnen – en erschéngt uewen. Fënster 1 kritt Zon 1 a sou weider; weider Fënsteren deelen déi lescht Zon. Mat manner Fënstere wéi Zonen gëtt „Haapt a Stapel“ benotzt, fir datt keng Lächer entstinn.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"All Fënster fënnt seng Plaz vu selwer, wéi an engem kachelende Fënstermanager.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"All Fënster fënnt hir Plaz um Bildschierm vu selwer. Nei Fënsteren reien sech an, zougemaachter maache Plaz fir déi aner.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Beispill: zwou Fënsteren nieftenee, vun dräi un Haapt a Stapel, vu fënnef un e Gitter. Ouni passend Regel gëllt den uewe gewielte Layout.","Fade in and out":"Beim Eran- an Erausfueren iwwerblenden","Fade the other windows":"Aner Fënsteren ausblenden","Features":"Funktiounen","Feel":"Gefill","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"U Fënsteren upassen, déi schonn agerast sinn","Fits the way you work.":"Passt sech denger Aarbechtsweis un.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Fënster schwiewe loossen (Kachelen verloossen)","Four quarters":"Véier Véierel","From":"Vun","Fullscreen":"Vollbild","Gap between windows":"Ofstand tëscht Fënsteren","Gap to the screen edge":"Ofstand zum Bildschiermrand","General":"Allgemeng","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Gëtt all Aktioun erëm d'Tast vum gewielte Schema a läscht Tasten, déi d'Schema net huet.","Good to know":"Gutt ze wëssen","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Gräift eng Fënster un der Titelleescht a zitt se no uewen. D’Leescht fiert erof; leet d’Fënster op eng Zon of an si fëllt genee dee Beräich. Zitt se erëm ewech, da kritt se hir al Gréisst zréck.","Grab window A…":"Huel d’Fënster A …","Grid":"Gitter","Halves":"Hallefen","Hiding":"Verstoppen","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Un der Kant halen, fir de fräie Plaz ze fëllen","Hold time":"Halzäit","Hold to fill":"Halen zum Fëllen","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Wéi no eng Kant komme muss, ier se aklickt.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Wéi no de Mauszeiger un d’Kant komme muss.","How far the bar slides down":"Wéi wäit d’Leescht erofféiert","How it works":"Esou funktionéiert et","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Wéi laang d’Fënster un der Kant leie muss – e klenge Stouss. 0 = direkt.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Wéi laang d'Fënster un der Kant bleiwe muss, ier se wiisst.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Wéi vill Fënsteren den Haaptberäich deelen (Layout „Haapt a Stapel“).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Läit ënnen schonn eng Fënster, gëtt déi iewescht Kant déi iewescht Hällef amplaz ze maximéieren. Och Hälften a Véierele loossen agerast Fënstere fräi.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Wann der KSnapUnity gefält, kanns de d’Entwécklung ënnerstëtzen – merci!","In bar":"An der Leescht","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Onofhängeg vun der Snap-Leescht an de Bildschierm-Kanten.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Onofhängeg vun der Snap-Leescht. All Kant léisst sech eleng schalten.","Information":"Informatiounen","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Intuitiivt, natierlecht Fënsterverhalen.","Join at the end":"Hannen ustellen","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K fir KWin · Snap fir méi schlau Arasten · Unity fir alles an engem System","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE huet seng eege Bildschierm-Kanten-Aktiounen an säin eegent Arasten. Wann déiselwecht Funktioun hei un ass, schalt déi vu KDE aus: Systemastellungen → Fënsterverwaltung → Bildschierm-Kanten, an Fënsterverhalen → Réckelen.","KDE's own edge tiling":"KDE säin eegent Kante-Kachelen","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"KDE säin eegent Maximéieren a Kachelen un de Kanten – mat sengem Ëmress – mécht Paus, soulaang KSnapUnity leeft, fir datt nëmmen eng Virschau erschéngt. Deng KDE-Astellunge bleiwen onverännert: schalt dat aus, desaktivéier oder läsch KSnapUnity an d’KDE-Verhalen ass zeréck.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"Déi eege Bildschierm-Kanten-Aktioune vu KDE sinn nach un, sou datt zwee Hëllefer op datselwecht Zéien reagéieren. Schalt „Maximéieren“ an „Kachelen“ aus ënner Systemastellungen → Fënsterverwaltung → Bildschierm-Kanten.","KDE's own window snapping":"KDE säin eegent Fënster-Aklacken","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"Dat eegent Arasten vu KDE ass och un. Fir en eenheetlecht Gefill stell seng Zonen op „Keng“ ënner Systemastellungen → Fënsterverwaltung → Fënsterverhalen → Réckelen.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"De KDE-Kierzelendéngscht huet net geäntwert. Du kanns d’Taste nach ëmmer ënner Systemastellungen → Kierzelen → KWin setzen.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – Astellungseditor","Keep stacked windows in line":"Gestapelt Fënsteren an enger Linn halen","Keep the gap between windows":"Ofstand tëscht Fënsteren halen","Keep them":"Halen","Key scheme":"Tasteschema","Keyboard shortcuts":"Tastekombinatiounen","Keys":"Tasten","Keys already in use":"Taste schonn am Gebrauch","Layout by number of windows":"Layout no Unzuel vun de Fënsteren","Layouts":"Layouten","Layouts per row":"Layouten pro Rei","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Lénks a riets Kant: halwe Bildschierm","Left edge: left half":"Lénke Rand: lénks Hallschent","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Ënner 100 % bleift eng eenzel Fënster an der Mëtt – schéin op breede Bildschiermer.","License":"Lizenz","Light":"Hell","Live preview":"Live-Virschau","Load template…":"Virlag lueden…","Magnet":"Magnéit","Main + stack":"Haapt + Stapel","Main and stack":"Haapt a Stapel","Main area bigger":"Haaptberäich méi grouss","Main area on the right":"Haaptberäich riets","Main area smaller":"Haaptberäich méi kleng","Main in the middle":"Haapt an der Mëtt","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Haaptschalter fir d’Zéien an d’Tasten.","Main window":"Haaptfënster","Main windows":"Haaptfënsteren","Main windows: %1":"Haaptfënsteren: %1","Make it the main window":"Zur Haaptfënster maachen","Maximize":"Maximéieren","Maximize or restore":"Maximéieren oder zrécksetzen","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + Tast (KDE-Stil)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Strg+Alt + Tast","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + Tast","Minimize":"Minimiséieren","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Spigelt de Layout: d’Haaptfënster riets, déi aner lénks.","Mode":"Modus","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Modus 1 – Snap-Leescht a Bildschierm-Kanten","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Modus 2 – Automatesch Kachelen","Modes":"Modi","More ways":"Méi Weeër","Motion curve":"Beweegungskurv","Move a window towards others…":"Beweeg eng Fënster op aner zou …","Move the window one place back":"Fënster eng Plaz no hannen","Move the window one place on":"Fënster eng Plaz no vir","Name:":"Numm:","New layout":"Neie Layout","New windows":"Nei Fënsteren","Next tiling layout":"Nächst Kachel-Layout","Next to the active window":"Nieft déi aktiv Fënster","No key":"Keng Tast","No other window open":"Keng aner Fënster op","No outer margin":"Keen Ausseabstand","No shortcuts":"Keng Kierzelen","None":"Keng","None yet.":"Nach keng.","Off":"Aus","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Aus = Modus 1, un = Modus 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Aus: e neutrale Rumm – nëmme fir d'Virschauen, déi un sinn.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Aus: D’Taste bleiwen zougewisen, maachen awer näischt.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Aus: Fënsteren bleiwen, wou s du se hileeës. Déi aner Funktiounen ginn esou oder esou.","One at a time":"Eng nom aneren","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Eng mécht zou – déi aner fëllen d’Lück","One main window less":"Eng Haaptfënster manner","One more main window":"Eng Haaptfënster méi","One window":"Eng Fënster","Only one mode is switched on.":"Nëmmen ee Modus ass an.","Open settings editor":"Astellungseditor opmaachen","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Maach de Programm fir d’éischt op a wiel en dann hei.","Open the layout builder":"Layout-Baukaste opmaachen","Own layouts":"Eege Layouten","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Deel vun all Säit, deen als Eck zielt.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"KDE säi Kante-Kachelen a seng Virschau pauséieren","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"KDE seng Aklack-Zonen pauséieren, soulaang de Magnéit un ass","Preview":"Virschau","Previews":"Virschauen","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Dréck eng Fënster géint eng Kant oder en Eck vum Bildschierm, an si fëllt deen Deel aus. Geet mat oder ouni Snap-Leescht.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Dréck eng Fënster géint eng Kant oder en Eck: maximéieren, Hälften, Véierelen.","Push delay":"Dréck-Verzögerung","Quarters":"Véierelen","Quick":"Séier","Quick settings":"Quick-Astellungen","Recommended values":"Recommandéiert Wäerter","Remove":"Ewechhuelen","Remove rule":"Regel ewechhuelen","Remove zone":"Zon ewechhuelen","Reset all":"Alles zerécksetzen","Reset all keys":"All Tasten zerécksetzen","Reset to default":"Op Standard zerécksetzen","Resistance against overlapping":"Widderstand géint Iwwerlappen","Resize touching windows together":"Fënsteren, déi sech beréieren, zesummen an der Gréisst änneren","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Och d’Gréisst-Änneren rascht an – hei op déi voll Héicht","Restore":"Restauréieren","Restore default layouts":"Standard-Layouten restauréieren","Restore default layouts?":"Standard-Layouten restauréieren?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Ursprénglech Gréisst restauréieren, wann d’Fënster erausgezu gëtt","Restore the size before snapping":"Gréisst vu virum Arasten zrécksetzen","Rows":"Reien","Save":"Späicheren","Screen edges":"Bildschierm-Kanten","Screen edges on/off":"Bildschierm-Kanten un/aus","Screen edges preview":"Virschau vun de Schiermkanten","Set":"Setzen","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Setzt d’Taste vun allen Aktiounen op eemol. Eenzel Taste kanns du ënnen nach ëmmer änneren.","Settings":"Astellungen","Settings file":"Astellungsdatei","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Rëssel beim Gréisst-Änneren d’Maus séier hin an hier, an déi aner Fënsteren sprangen zréck. E séieren Zuch an eng Richtung léist se ni.","Shake to let go":"Rësele fir ze léisen","Shortcuts":"Kierzelen","Show a small handle first":"Fir d’éischt e klenge Grëff weisen","Show layout and zone names":"Nimm vu Layouten an Zone weisen","Show previews in the accent color":"Virschauen an der Akzentfaarf weisen","Showing":"Weisen","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Weist, wou d'Fënster un enger Kant oder engem Eck landt. Aus: guer keng Virschau.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Weist, wou d'Fënster landt, soulaang eng Zon vun der Leescht markéiert ass. Aus: guer keng Virschau.","Sidebar + grid":"Säitebar + Raster","Single zone":"Eng Zon","Six tiles":"Sechs Kachelen","Size & shape":"Gréisst & Form","Size of the main area":"Gréisst vum Haaptberäich","Slide-in duration":"Dauer beim Erofféieren","Slide-out duration":"Dauer beim Zréckféieren","Smart arranging and detection.":"Schlau Uerdnen an Erkennen.","Smart fill":"Intelligent Fëllen","Smooth (default)":"Sanft (Standard)","Snap bar":"Snap-Leescht","Snap bar and screen edges":"Snap-Leescht a Bildschierm-Kanten","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Snap-Leescht a Kante sinn aus – nëmme Modus 2 leeft, an d’Modus-Tast mécht näischt.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Snap-Leescht a Bildschierm-Kanten stéieren dat automatescht Kachelen. Dofir lafe se als zwee Modi – wiessel mat der Tastekombinatioun oder hei.","Snap bar colors:":"Faarwe vun der Snap-Leescht:","Snap bar on/off":"Snap-Leescht un/aus","Snap bar preview":"Virschau vun der Snap-Leescht","Snap bar size":"Gréisst vun der Leescht","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Snap-Leescht, Bildschierm-Kanten, Fënster-Magnéit, Tastekombinatiounen a Fënsteren tauschen.","Snap distance":"Arast-Ofstand","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Trennlinnen arasten (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Snap-Layouten an automatesch Kachelen.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Déi aktiv Fënster mat Tastekombinatiounen arasten.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Déi aktiv Fënster mat der Tastatur arasten. Dat sinn normal global KDE-Kierzelen – du fënns se och ënner Systemastellungen → Kierzelen → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"An déi ënnescht Hällef","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"An de Véierel ënne lénks","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"An de Véierel ënne riets","Snap to the center third":"An dat mëttelst Drëttel","Snap to the left half":"An déi lénks Hällef","Snap to the left third":"An dat lénkst Drëttel","Snap to the left two thirds":"An déi lénks zwee Drëttel","Snap to the right half":"An déi riets Hällef","Snap to the right third":"An dat rietst Drëttel","Snap to the right two thirds":"An déi riets zwee Drëttel","Snap to the top half":"An déi iewescht Hällef","Snap to the top-left quarter":"An de Véierel uewe lénks","Snap to the top-right quarter":"An de Véierel uewe riets","Snapping":"Andocken","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Arasten an automatesch Kachelen lafen als zwee Modi – eng Tastekombinatioun wiesselt tëscht hinnen.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Sou zitt nëmmen ee Magnéit un enger Fënster. Deng KDE-Astellunge bleiwen onverännert: schalt dat aus, desaktivéier oder läsch KSnapUnity an d’KDE-Arasten ass zeréck.","Soft":"Douce","Spacing":"Ofstänn","Split side by side":"Niewenteneen deelen","Split top and bottom":"Uewen an ënnen deelen","Stack + main":"Stapel + Haapt","Stick to other windows":"Un anere Fënsteren halen","Stick to the screen edges":"Un de Bildschierm-Kanten halen","Sticky edges":"Pechend Kanten","Support KSnapUnity":"KSnapUnity ënnerstëtzen","Swap":"Tauschen","Swap windows":"Fënsteren tauschen","Swap with the window above":"Mat der Fënster driwwer tauschen","Swap with the window below":"Mat der Fënster drënner tauschen","Swap with the window on the left":"Mat der Fënster lénks tauschen","Swap with the window on the right":"Mat der Fënster riets tauschen","Switch mode":"Modus wiesselen","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Modus wiesselen (Arasten / Kachelen)","Switch modes with:":"Modus wiessele mat:","Switch the layout by itself":"Layout eleng wiesselen","Switched off":"Ausgeschalt","Take it over":"Iwwerhuelen","Take over all":"All iwwerhuelen","Take the main place":"D’Haaptplaz huelen","Test animation":"Animatioun testen","Test on screen":"Um Bildschierm testen","Test the snap bar":"Snap-Leescht testen","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"D’Standardwäerter orientéiere sech u Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"D’Arast-Aktioune benotzen déiselwecht Ofstänn wéi d’Snap-Leescht a mierken sech d’Gréisst vu virum Arasten: „Gréisst vu virum Arasten zrécksetzen“ bréngt se zréck.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Dës Programmer ginn ni geuerdnet a behalen hir eege Plaz. Dialoger sinn ëmmer fräi.","Thirds":"Drëttelen","Three columns":"Dräi Kolonnen","Thumbnail width":"Breet vun de Virschaubiller","Tiling":"Kachelen","Tip":"Tipp","Top / bottom":"Uewen / Ënnen","Top edge":"Iewescht Kant","Top edge: full screen":"Ieweschte Rand: ganze Bildschierm","Top edge: maximize":"Ieweschte Rand: maximéieren","Top edge: top half":"Ieweschte Rand: iewescht Hallschent","Top half":"Iewescht Hällef","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Ausléisungsofstand vum ieweschte Rand","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Schalt dat aus, wann Dir KDE säin eegene Contour léiwer hutt – schalt dann uewen d'Virschau vun de Schiermkanten aus.","Two thirds":"Zwee Drëttel","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Zwou Fënstere tauschen d’Plazen – eng op déi aner zéien oder d’Taste benotzen.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Zwou Fënstere tauschen d’Plazen: eng op déi aner zéien oder mat enger Tast.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Tastekombinatioune benotzen","Use screen edges":"Bildschierm-Kanten benotzen","Use the system accent color":"Akzentfaarf vum System benotzen","Use the window magnet":"Fënster-Magnéit benotzen","Usual combinations":"Üblech Kombinatiounen","Version":"Versioun","Wanted for: %1":"Gewënscht fir: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Wann eng Fënster opgeet, zougeet oder tauscht, beweegen déi aner sech sanft amplaz ze sprangen.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Wann Dir eng Fënster an der Gréisst ännert, réckelen d'Fënsteren, déi se beréieren, déi gemeinsam Kant mat – näischt iwwerlappt, keng Lück entsteet.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Beim Gréisst-Änneren ginn Fënsteren, déi net matginn, duerchsichteg gewisen.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Wärend s du eng Fënster réckels oder hir Gréisst änners, halen hir Kanten un nooste Fënsteren an un de Bildschierm-Kanten.","Width":"Breet","Window":"Fënster","Window magnet":"Fënster-Magnéit","Window magnet on/off":"Fënster-Magnéit un/aus","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Fënsteren iwwerteneen halen hir lénks a riets Kanten zesummen, Fënsteren nieftenee hir iewescht an ënnescht.","Windows glide to their place":"Fënsteren gleede sanft op hir Plaz","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Fënsteren halen openeen an un de Bildschierm-Kanten.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Fënsteren halen um „Ofstand tëscht Fënsteren“ vun der Säit Allgemeng, amplaz sech ze beréieren.","Yes":"Jo","Your own combination":"Eegen Kombinatioun","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Eege Layouten an hir Reiefolleg ginn dobäi verluer.","Zone %1":"Zon %1","for KWin · v%1":"fir KWin · v%1","windows:":"Fënsteren:","“%1” will be removed.":"„%1“ gëtt ewechgeholl.","…drag it onto window B…":"… zitt se op d’Fënster B …","…in every direction":"… an all Richtung","…let go: they trade places":"… lass loossen: si tauschen d’Plazen","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"… d’Noperen wuessen a schrumpfe mat","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Prett – klick OK, fir den Astellungseditor opzemaachen."},"lt":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (kopija)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 naudoja „%2“.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 iš %2 zonų","0 = all in one row":"0 = visi vienoje eilutėje","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>1 režimas</b><br/>Prilipdymo juosta ir ekrano kraštai","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>2 režimas</b><br/>Automatinis išdėstymas plytelėmis","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Vienišas langas užima visą ekraną, net jei nustatyta paraštė.","A new window joins":"Prisijungia naujas langas","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Trumpas stumtelėjimas duoda pusę ar ketvirtį. Palaikykite langą prie krašto šiek tiek ilgiau ir jis išaugs iki kito lango – peržiūra tai parodys.","A single window":"Vienas langas","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Langas sustoja prie kito lango krašto, net jei judinate jį greitai. Papurtykite pelę arba dar akimirką stumkite, kad atleistumėte. 0 = langai gali laisvai persidengti.","About & Help":"Apie ir žinynas","Accent color":"Akcento spalva","Active":"Aktyvu","Active mode":"Aktyvus režimas","Active width along the top edge":"Aktyvus plotis palei viršutinį kraštą","Add an open application":"Pridėti atvertą programą","Add rule":"Pridėti taisyklę","All window features in one system.":"Visos langų funkcijos vienoje sistemoje.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Keičiasi ir tada, kai rankiniu būdu keičiate pagrindinio lango dydį.","Also while resizing":"Ir keičiant dydį","Always floating":"Visada plūduriuojantys","Animation":"Animacija","Appearance":"Išvaizda","Apply":"Taikyti","Arrange windows":"Langų išdėstymas","Arrange windows automatically":"Automatiškai išdėstyti langus","Author":"Autorius","Automatic tiling":"Automatinis išdėstymas plytelėmis","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Automatinis išdėstymas išjungtas – veikia tik 1 režimas, o režimo klavišas nieko nedaro.","Automatic tiling off":"Automatinis išdėstymas išjungtas","Automatic tiling on":"Automatinis išdėstymas įjungtas","Automatic tiling on/off":"Automatinis išdėstymas įj./išj.","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Automatinis išdėstymas, langų sukeitimas, spartieji klavišai ir magnetas plūduriuojantiems langams.","Background opacity":"Fono nepermatomumas","Behavior & Animation":"Elgsena ir animacija","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Apatinis kraštas: apatinė pusė","Bouncy":"Spyruoklinė","Buy me a coffee":"Nupirk man kavos","Cancel":"Atsisakyti","Center focus":"Dėmesys centre","Center the window":"Centruoti langą","Change":"Keisti","Change key":"Keisti klavišą","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Klavišą pakeisite nustatymų redaktoriuje. Abiem režimams reikia automatinio išdėstymo ir juostos arba ekrano kraštų.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Pakeiskite juos puslapyje Spartieji klavišai. Esant automatiniam išdėstymui, langai sukeičia vietas ir eilėje.","Choose…":"Pasirinkti…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Spustelėkite zoną, kad ją pažymėtumėte · dukart spustelėkite, kad padalytumėte · tempkite skirtukus","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Spustelėkite arba paspauskite %1, kad perjungtumėte režimą.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Spustelėkite, tada Gerai – atsivers nustatymų redaktorius.","Close":"Užverti","Close by, the edges stick together":"Arti kraštai prilimpa","Color scheme":"Spalvų schema","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Juostos spalvos, dydis ir forma.","Columns":"Stulpeliai","Corner radius":"Kampų spindulys","Corner size":"Kampo dydis","Corner: a quarter":"Kampas: ketvirtis","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Kampai: ketvirtadalis ekrano","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + klavišas (numatytasis)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + skaitmenų klaviatūra","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + klavišas","Custom color":"Pasirinkta spalva","Custom layout %1":"Savas išdėstymas %1","Dark":"Tamsi","Delay before hiding":"Delsa prieš slepiant","Delay before showing":"Delsa prieš rodant","Delete":"Ištrinti","Delete layout?":"Ištrinti išdėstymą?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Atstumas, kuriame atsiranda rankenėlė","Distance before the bar hides again":"Atstumas, po kurio juosta vėl pasislepia","Distance to the edge":"Atstumas iki krašto","Donate with PayPal":"Paaukoti per PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"Tempkite bendrą kraštą…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Tempkite langą prie krašto…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Nutempkite langą ant kito, kad juos sukeistumėte. Numestas ant juostos ar ekrano krašto, jis laisvai plūduriuoja; „Leisti langui plūduriuoti“ jį grąžina. Tarpai nustatomi puslapyje Bendra.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Nutempkite langą virš kito lango vidurio – peržiūra rodo dvi rodykles – ir paleiskite. Automatinio išdėstymo metu tinka bet kuri vieta virš kito lango.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Nutempkite langą prie viršutinio ekrano krašto ir paleiskite jį ant zonos.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Tempkite korteles, kad pakeistumėte tvarką juostoje. Dukart spustelėkite kortelę, kad ją redaguotumėte.","Drop a window onto another one":"Numesti langą ant kito","Drop the window onto a zone":"Paleiskite langą ant zonos","Duplicate":"Dubliuoti","Duration":"Trukmė","Dwindle":"Spiralė į vidų","Dynamic":"Dinamiška","Edges and corners":"Kraštai ir kampai","Edit":"Redaguoti","Edit layout":"Redaguoti išdėstymą","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Kiekvieną funkciją galima įjungti ir išjungti atskirai.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Kiekvienas puslapyje Išdėstymai sukurtas išdėstymas gali ir dėlioti langus – jis rodomas viršuje. 1 langas gauna 1 zoną ir t. t.; papildomi langai dalijasi paskutine zona. Kai langų mažiau nei zonų, naudojamas „Pagrindinis ir krūva“, kad neliktų skylių.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Kiekvienas langas pats randa savo vietą, kaip plytelių langų tvarkytuvėje.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Kiekvienas langas pats randa savo vietą ekrane. Nauji langai prisijungia, uždaryti atlaisvina vietą kitiems.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Pavyzdys: du langai greta, nuo trijų pagrindinis ir krūva, nuo penkių tinklelis. Be tinkamos taisyklės taikomas viršuje pasirinktas išdėstymas.","Fade in and out":"Išblukinti pasirodant ir dingstant","Fade the other windows":"Pritemdyti kitus langus","Features":"Funkcijos","Feel":"Pojūtis","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Prisitaikyti prie jau prilipdytų langų","Fits the way you work.":"Prisitaiko prie jūsų darbo būdo.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Leisti langui plūduriuoti (išeiti iš plytelių)","Four quarters":"Keturi ketvirčiai","From":"Nuo","Fullscreen":"Visas ekranas","Gap between windows":"Tarpas tarp langų","Gap to the screen edge":"Tarpas iki ekrano krašto","General":"Bendra","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Kiekvienam veiksmui vėl priskiria pasirinktos schemos klavišą ir pašalina klavišus, kurių schemoje nėra.","Good to know":"Verta žinoti","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Suimkite langą už antraštės juostos ir tempkite aukštyn. Juosta nusileidžia; paleiskite langą ant zonos ir jis užims būtent tą sritį. Ištraukus jį vėl, jis atgauna ankstesnį dydį.","Grab window A…":"Paimkite langą A…","Grid":"Tinklelis","Halves":"Pusės","Hiding":"Slėpimas","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Laikyti prie krašto, kad užpildytų laisvą vietą","Hold time":"Laikymo laikas","Hold to fill":"Laikyti, kad užpildytų","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Kaip arti turi priartėti kraštas, kol užsifiksuos.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Kaip arti krašto turi priartėti žymeklis.","How far the bar slides down":"Kaip žemai nusileidžia juosta","How it works":"Kaip tai veikia","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Kiek laiko langas turi būti prie krašto – nedidelis stumtelėjimas. 0 = iškart.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Kiek laiko langas turi būti prie krašto, kol išaugs.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Kiek langų dalijasi pagrindine sritimi (išdėstymas „Pagrindinis ir krūva“).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Jei apačioje jau yra langas, viršutinis kraštas duoda viršutinę pusę, o ne išdidina. Pusės ir ketvirčiai taip pat palieka prilipdytus langus laisvus.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Jei KSnapUnity jums patinka, galite paremti jo kūrimą – ačiū!","In bar":"Juostoje","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Nepriklauso nuo juostos ir ekrano kraštų.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Nepriklauso nuo juostos. Kiekvieną kraštą galima įjungti atskirai.","Information":"Informacija","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Intuityvi, natūrali langų elgsena.","Join at the end":"Stoja į galą","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K – KWin · Snap – protingesnis prilipdymas · Unity – viskas vienoje sistemoje","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE turi savo ekrano kraštų veiksmus ir savo langų prilipdymą. Jei čia įjungta ta pati funkcija, išjunkite KDE funkciją: Sistemos nuostatos → Langų tvarkymas → Ekrano kraštai bei Langų elgsena → Perkėlimas.","KDE's own edge tiling":"Paties KDE kraštų išdėstymas","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"Paties KDE išdidinimas ir išdėstymas prie kraštų – su kontūru – sustabdomas, kol veikia KSnapUnity, kad būtų tik viena peržiūra. Jūsų KDE nustatymai nesikeičia: išjunkite tai, išjunkite ar pašalinkite KSnapUnity, ir KDE elgsena sugrįš.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"KDE ekrano kraštų veiksmai vis dar įjungti, todėl į tą patį tempimą reaguoja du pagalbininkai. Išjunkite „Išdidinti“ ir „Išdėstyti“ skiltyje Sistemos nuostatos → Langų tvarkymas → Ekrano kraštai.","KDE's own window snapping":"Paties KDE langų prikabinimas","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE langų prilipdymas taip pat įjungtas. Kad pojūtis būtų vienodas, nustatykite jo zonas į „Nėra“ skiltyje Sistemos nuostatos → Langų tvarkymas → Langų elgsena → Perkėlimas.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"KDE sparčiųjų klavišų tarnyba neatsakė. Klavišus vis tiek galite nustatyti skiltyje Sistemos nuostatos → Spartieji klavišai → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – nustatymų redaktorius","Keep stacked windows in line":"Laikyti sukrautus langus vienoje linijoje","Keep the gap between windows":"Išlaikyti tarpą tarp langų","Keep them":"Palikti","Key scheme":"Klavišų schema","Keyboard shortcuts":"Spartieji klavišai","Keys":"Klavišai","Keys already in use":"Jau naudojami klavišai","Layout":"Išdėstymas","Layout by number of windows":"Išdėstymas pagal langų skaičių","Layouts":"Išdėstymai","Layouts per row":"Išdėstymų eilutėje","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Kairysis ir dešinysis kraštas: pusė ekrano","Left edge: left half":"Kairysis kraštas: kairė pusė","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Mažiau nei 100 % vienišą langą laiko centre – gražu plačiuose ekranuose.","License":"Licencija","Light":"Šviesi","Linear":"Tiesinė","Live preview":"Tiesioginė peržiūra","Load template…":"Įkelti šabloną…","Magnet":"Magnetas","Main + stack":"Pagrindinis + krūva","Main and stack":"Pagrindinis ir krūva","Main area bigger":"Didesnė pagrindinė sritis","Main area on the right":"Pagrindinė sritis dešinėje","Main area smaller":"Mažesnė pagrindinė sritis","Main in the middle":"Pagrindinis viduryje","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Pagrindinis jungiklis tempimui ir klavišams.","Main window":"Pagrindinis langas","Main windows":"Pagrindiniai langai","Main windows: %1":"Pagrindiniai langai: %1","Make it the main window":"Padaryti pagrindiniu langu","Maximize":"Išdidinti","Maximize or restore":"Išdidinti arba atkurti","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + klavišas (KDE stilius)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + klavišas","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + klavišas","Minimize":"Sumažinti","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Atspindi išdėstymą: pagrindinis langas dešinėje, kiti kairėje.","Mode":"Režimas","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"1 režimas – prilipdymo juosta ir ekrano kraštai","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"2 režimas – automatinis išdėstymas plytelėmis","Modes":"Režimai","More ways":"Daugiau būdų","Motion curve":"Judėjimo kreivė","Move a window towards others…":"Patraukite langą link kitų…","Move the window one place back":"Perkelti langą viena vieta atgal","Move the window one place on":"Perkelti langą viena vieta pirmyn","Name:":"Pavadinimas:","New layout":"Naujas išdėstymas","New windows":"Nauji langai","Next tiling layout":"Kitas plytelių išdėstymas","Next to the active window":"Šalia aktyvaus lango","No key":"Nėra klavišo","No other window open":"Kitų atvertų langų nėra","No outer margin":"Be išorinės paraštės","No shortcuts":"Be sparčiųjų klavišų","None":"Nėra","None yet.":"Kol kas nėra.","Off":"Išjungta","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Išj. = 1 režimas, įj. = 2 režimas","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Išjungta: neutralus rėmelis – tik įjungtoms peržiūroms.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Išjungta: klavišai lieka priskirti, bet nieko nedaro.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Išjungta: langai lieka ten, kur juos padedate. Kitos funkcijos veikia bet kuriuo atveju.","One at a time":"Po vieną","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Vienas užsidaro – kiti užpildo tarpą","One main window less":"Vienu pagrindiniu langu mažiau","One more main window":"Vienu pagrindiniu langu daugiau","One window":"Vienas langas","Only one mode is switched on.":"Įjungtas tik vienas režimas.","Open settings editor":"Atverti nustatymų redaktorių","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Pirmiausia atverkite programą, tada pasirinkite ją čia.","Open the layout builder":"Atverti išdėstymų kūrėją","Own layouts":"Savi išdėstymai","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Kiekvienos kraštinės dalis, laikoma kampu.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Pristabdyti KDE kraštų išdėstymą ir jo peržiūrą","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Pristabdyti KDE prikabinimo zonas, kol magnetas įjungtas","Preview":"Peržiūra","Previews":"Peržiūros","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Prispauskite langą prie ekrano krašto ar kampo ir jis užpildys tą dalį. Veikia su juosta ar be jos.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Prispauskite langą prie krašto ar kampo: išdidinti, pusės, ketvirčiai.","Push delay":"Prispaudimo delsa","Quarters":"Ketvirčiai","Quick":"Greita","Quick settings":"Greitieji nustatymai","Recommended values":"Rekomenduojamos reikšmės","Remove":"Pašalinti","Remove rule":"Šalinti taisyklę","Remove zone":"Pašalinti zoną","Reset all":"Atkurti viską","Reset all keys":"Atkurti visus klavišus","Reset to default":"Atkurti numatytąjį","Resistance against overlapping":"Pasipriešinimas persidengimui","Resize touching windows together":"Keisti besiliečiančių langų dydį kartu","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Keičiant dydį irgi prilimpa – čia iki viso aukščio","Restore":"Atkurti","Restore default layouts":"Atkurti numatytuosius išdėstymus","Restore default layouts?":"Atkurti numatytuosius išdėstymus?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Atkurti pradinį dydį ištraukiant langą","Restore the size before snapping":"Atkurti dydį prieš prilipdymą","Rows":"Eilutės","Save":"Įrašyti","Screen edges":"Ekrano kraštai","Screen edges on/off":"Ekrano kraštai įjungti/išjungti","Screen edges preview":"Ekrano kraštų peržiūra","Set":"Nustatyti","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Nustato visų veiksmų klavišus iš karto. Atskirus klavišus vis tiek galite keisti žemiau.","Settings":"Nustatymai","Settings file":"Nustatymų failas","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Keisdami dydį greitai papurtykite pelę pirmyn ir atgal, ir kiti langai šokteli atgal. Greitas trūktelėjimas viena kryptimi jų niekada neatleidžia.","Shake to let go":"Pakratykite, kad atkabintumėte","Shortcuts":"Spartieji klavišai","Show a small handle first":"Pirmiausia rodyti mažą rankenėlę","Show layout and zone names":"Rodyti išdėstymų ir zonų pavadinimus","Show previews in the accent color":"Rodyti peržiūras akcento spalva","Showing":"Rodymas","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Rodo, kur atsidurs langas prie krašto ar kampe. Išjungta: jokios peržiūros.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Rodo, kur atsidurs langas, kol juostos zona paryškinta. Išjungta: jokios peržiūros.","Sidebar + grid":"Šoninė juosta + tinklelis","Single zone":"Viena zona","Six tiles":"Šešios plytelės","Size & shape":"Dydis ir forma","Size of the main area":"Pagrindinės srities dydis","Slide-in duration":"Įslydimo trukmė","Slide-out duration":"Išslydimo trukmė","Smart arranging and detection.":"Išmanus išdėstymas ir atpažinimas.","Smart fill":"Išmanusis užpildymas","Smooth (default)":"Sklandi (numatytoji)","Snap bar":"Prilipdymo juosta","Snap bar and screen edges":"Prilipdymo juosta ir ekrano kraštai","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Juosta ir kraštai išjungti – veikia tik 2 režimas, o režimo klavišas nieko nedaro.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Juosta ir ekrano kraštai trukdo automatiniam išdėstymui. Todėl jie veikia kaip du režimai – perjunkite sparčiuoju klavišu arba čia.","Snap bar colors:":"Juostos spalvos:","Snap bar on/off":"Juosta įjungti/išjungti","Snap bar preview":"Prikabinimo juostos peržiūra","Snap bar size":"Juostos dydis","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Prilipdymo juosta, ekrano kraštai, langų magnetas, spartieji klavišai ir langų sukeitimas.","Snap distance":"Prilipimo atstumas","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Prikabinti skirtukus (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Prilipdymo išdėstymai ir automatinis išdėstymas plytelėmis.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Prilipdykite aktyvų langą klavišų deriniais.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Prilipdykite aktyvų langą klaviatūra. Tai įprasti KDE visuotiniai spartieji klavišai – juos rasite ir skiltyje Sistemos nuostatos → Spartieji klavišai → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Prilipdyti apatinėje pusėje","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Prilipdyti apatiniame kairiajame ketvirtyje","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Prilipdyti apatiniame dešiniajame ketvirtyje","Snap to the center third":"Prilipdyti viduriniame trečdalyje","Snap to the left half":"Prilipdyti kairėje pusėje","Snap to the left third":"Prilipdyti kairiajame trečdalyje","Snap to the left two thirds":"Prilipdyti kairiuosiuose dviejuose trečdaliuose","Snap to the right half":"Prilipdyti dešinėje pusėje","Snap to the right third":"Prilipdyti dešiniajame trečdalyje","Snap to the right two thirds":"Prilipdyti dešiniuosiuose dviejuose trečdaliuose","Snap to the top half":"Prilipdyti viršutinėje pusėje","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Prilipdyti viršutiniame kairiajame ketvirtyje","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Prilipdyti viršutiniame dešiniajame ketvirtyje","Snapping":"Prikabinimas","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Prilipdymas ir automatinis išdėstymas veikia kaip du režimai – vienas klavišas perjungia tarp jų.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Taip langą traukia tik vienas magnetas. Jūsų KDE nustatymai nesikeičia: išjunkite tai, išjunkite ar pašalinkite KSnapUnity, ir KDE prilipdymas sugrįš.","Soft":"Švelni","Spacing":"Tarpai","Spiral":"Spiralė","Split side by side":"Padalyti greta","Split top and bottom":"Padalyti viršuje ir apačioje","Stack + main":"Krūva + pagrindinis","Stick to other windows":"Limpa prie kitų langų","Stick to the screen edges":"Limpa prie ekrano kraštų","Sticky edges":"Lipnūs kraštai","Support KSnapUnity":"Paremkite KSnapUnity","Swap":"Sukeisti","Swap windows":"Langų sukeitimas","Swap with the window above":"Sukeisti su langu viršuje","Swap with the window below":"Sukeisti su langu apačioje","Swap with the window on the left":"Sukeisti su langu kairėje","Swap with the window on the right":"Sukeisti su langu dešinėje","Switch mode":"Perjungti režimą","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Perjungti režimą (prilipdymas / plytelės)","Switch modes with:":"Perjungti režimą klavišu:","Switch the layout by itself":"Keisti išdėstymą savaime","Switched off":"Išjungta","System":"Sistemos","Take it over":"Perimti","Take over all":"Perimti visus","Take the main place":"Užima pagrindinę vietą","Test animation":"Išbandyti animaciją","Test on screen":"Išbandyti ekrane","Test the snap bar":"Išbandyti juostą","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Numatytosios reikšmės pagrįstos Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Prilipdymo veiksmai naudoja tuos pačius tarpus kaip juosta ir įsimena dydį prieš prilipdymą: „Atkurti dydį prieš prilipdymą“ jį grąžina.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Šios programos niekada nedėliojamos ir išlaiko savo vietą. Dialogai visada plūduriuoja.","Thirds":"Trečdaliai","Three columns":"Trys stulpeliai","Thumbnail width":"Miniatiūrų plotis","Tiling":"Plytelės","Tip":"Patarimas","Top / bottom":"Viršus / apačia","Top edge":"Viršutinis kraštas","Top edge: full screen":"Viršutinis kraštas: visas ekranas","Top edge: maximize":"Viršutinis kraštas: išdidinti","Top edge: top half":"Viršutinis kraštas: viršutinė pusė","Top half":"Viršutinė pusė","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Suveikimo atstumas nuo viršutinio krašto","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Išjunkite, jei labiau patinka KDE kontūras – tada aukščiau išjunkite ekrano kraštų peržiūrą.","Two thirds":"Du trečdaliai","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Du langai susikeičia vietomis – numeskite vieną ant kito arba naudokite klavišus.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Du langai susikeičia vietomis: numeskite vieną ant kito arba klavišu.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Naudoti sparčiuosius klavišus","Use screen edges":"Naudoti ekrano kraštus","Use the system accent color":"Naudoti sistemos akcento spalvą","Use the window magnet":"Naudoti langų magnetą","Usual combinations":"Įprasti deriniai","Version":"Versija","Wanted for: %1":"Norima veiksmui: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Kai langas atsidaro, užsidaro ar susikeičia, kiti juda sklandžiai, o ne šokinėja.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Keičiant lango dydį, jį liečiantys langai kartu stumia bendrą kraštą – niekas nepersidengia, neatsiranda tarpo.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Keičiant dydį, nesekantys langai rodomi permatomi.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Kai perkeliate langą ar keičiate jo dydį, jo kraštai limpa prie artimų langų ir ekrano kraštų.","Width":"Plotis","Window":"Langas","Window magnet":"Langų magnetas","Window magnet on/off":"Langų magnetas įjungti/išjungti","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Vienas virš kito esantys langai laiko kairįjį ir dešinįjį kraštus kartu, greta esantys – viršutinį ir apatinį.","Windows glide to their place":"Langai sklandžiai nuslysta į vietą","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Langai limpa vienas prie kito ir prie ekrano kraštų.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Langai sustoja ties „Tarpas tarp langų“ iš puslapio Bendra, užuot lietęsi.","Yes":"Taip","Your own combination":"Jūsų derinys","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Jūsų išdėstymai ir jų tvarka bus prarasti.","Zone %1":"Zona %1","for KWin · v%1":"KWin · v%1","windows:":"langų:","“%1” will be removed.":"„%1“ bus pašalintas.","…drag it onto window B…":"…nutempkite ant lango B…","…in every direction":"…visomis kryptimis","…let go: they trade places":"…paleiskite: jie susikeičia vietomis","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…kaimynai auga ir mažėja kartu","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Paruošta – spustelėkite Gerai, kad atvertumėte nustatymų redaktorių."},"lv":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (kopija)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 izmanto “%2”.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 no %2 zonām","0 = all in one row":"0 = visi vienā rindā","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>1. režīms</b><br/>Piestiprināšanas josla un ekrāna malas","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>2. režīms</b><br/>Automātiska flīzēšana","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Vienīgais logs aizņem visu ekrānu, pat ja atkāpe ir iestatīta.","A new window joins":"Pievienojas jauns logs","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Īss grūdiens dod pusi vai ceturtdaļu. Paturiet logu pie malas mazliet ilgāk, un tas izaug līdz nākamajam logam – priekšskatījums to rāda.","A single window":"Viens logs","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Logs apstājas pie cita loga malas, arī ja to kustini ātri. Sakrati peli vai pastum vēl mirkli, lai atbrīvotu. 0 = logi drīkst brīvi pārklāties.","About & Help":"Par un palīdzība","Accent color":"Akcenta krāsa","Active":"Aktīvs","Active mode":"Aktīvais režīms","Active width along the top edge":"Aktīvais platums gar augšmalu","Add an open application":"Pievienot atvērtu lietotni","Add rule":"Pievienot noteikumu","All window features in one system.":"Visas logu funkcijas vienā sistēmā.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Mainās arī tad, kad galvenā loga izmēru maini ar roku.","Also while resizing":"Arī mainot izmēru","Always floating":"Vienmēr peldoši","Animation":"Animācija","Appearance":"Izskats","Apply":"Lietot","Arrange windows":"Logu izkārtošana","Arrange windows automatically":"Izkārtot logus automātiski","Author":"Autors","Automatic tiling":"Automātiska flīzēšana","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Automātiskā flīzēšana ir izslēgta – darbojas tikai 1. režīms, un režīma taustiņš neko nedara.","Automatic tiling off":"Automātiskā flīzēšana izslēgta","Automatic tiling on":"Automātiskā flīzēšana ieslēgta","Automatic tiling on/off":"Automātiska flīzēšana ieslēgt/izslēgt","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Automātiska flīzēšana, logu apmaiņa, īsinājumtaustiņi un magnēts peldošiem logiem.","Background opacity":"Fona necaurredzamība","Behavior & Animation":"Uzvedība un animācija","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Apakšmala: apakšējā puse","Bouncy":"Atsperīga","Buy me a coffee":"Uzsauc man kafiju","Cancel":"Atcelt","Center focus":"Fokuss centrā","Center the window":"Centrēt logu","Change":"Mainīt","Change key":"Mainīt taustiņu","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Taustiņu maināt iestatījumu redaktorā. Abiem režīmiem vajag automātisku flīzēšanu un joslu vai ekrāna malas.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Maini tos lapā Tastatūras īsinājumtaustiņi. Ar automātisku flīzēšanu logi samaina vietas arī secībā.","Choose…":"Izvēlēties…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Noklikšķiniet uz zonas, lai to atlasītu · dubultklikšķis to sadala · velciet atdalītājus","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Noklikšķiniet vai nospiediet %1, lai pārslēgtu režīmu.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Noklikšķiniet, tad Labi – atveras iestatījumu redaktors.","Close":"Aizvērt","Close by, the edges stick together":"Tuvumā malas salīp kopā","Color scheme":"Krāsu shēma","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Joslas krāsas, izmērs un forma.","Columns":"Kolonnas","Corner radius":"Stūru rādiuss","Corner size":"Stūra izmērs","Corner: a quarter":"Stūris: ceturtdaļa","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Stūri: ceturtdaļa ekrāna","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + taustiņš (noklusējums)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + ciparu bloks","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + taustiņš","Custom color":"Sava krāsa","Custom layout %1":"Savs izkārtojums %1","Dark":"Tumša","Delay before hiding":"Aizture pirms paslēpšanas","Delay before showing":"Aizture pirms rādīšanas","Delete":"Dzēst","Delete layout?":"Dzēst izkārtojumu?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Attālums, kurā parādās rokturis","Distance before the bar hides again":"Attālums, pēc kura josla atkal paslēpjas","Distance to the edge":"Attālums līdz malai","Donate with PayPal":"Ziedot ar PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"Velciet kopīgu malu…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Velciet logu pret malu…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Velciet logu uz cita, lai tos apmainītu. Nomests uz joslas vai ekrāna malas, tas brīvi peld; „Ļaut logam peldēt“ to atgriež. Atstarpes nāk no lapas Vispārīgi.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Velciet logu virs cita loga vidus – priekšskatījums rāda divas bultas – un atlaidiet. Automātiskajā flīzēšanā pietiek ar jebkuru vietu virs otra loga.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Velciet logu uz ekrāna augšmalu un nometiet to uz zonas.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Velciet kartītes, lai mainītu secību joslā. Veiciet dubultklikšķi uz kartītes, lai to rediģētu.","Drop a window onto another one":"Nomest logu uz cita","Drop the window onto a zone":"Nometiet logu uz zonas","Duplicate":"Dublēt","Duration":"Ilgums","Dwindle":"Spirāle uz iekšu","Dynamic":"Dinamiska","Edges and corners":"Malas un stūri","Edit":"Rediģēt","Edit layout":"Rediģēt izkārtojumu","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Katru funkciju var ieslēgt un izslēgt atsevišķi.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Katrs izkārtojums, ko izveidojat lapā Izkārtojumi, var arī kārtot logus – tas parādās augšā. 1. logs saņem 1. zonu utt.; papildu logi dala pēdējo zonu. Ja logu ir mazāk nekā zonu, tiek lietots „Galvenais un kaudze“, lai nepaliktu caurumi.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Katrs logs pats atrod savu vietu, kā flīzējošā logu pārvaldniekā.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Katrs logs pats atrod savu vietu ekrānā. Jauni logi pievienojas, aizvērtie atbrīvo vietu citiem.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Piemērs: divi logi blakus, no trim galvenais un kaudze, no pieciem režģis. Bez atbilstoša noteikuma tiek lietots augšā izvēlētais izkārtojums.","Fade in and out":"Izgaisināt parādoties un pazūdot","Fade the other windows":"Aptumšot pārējos logus","Features":"Funkcijas","Feel":"Sajūta","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Pielāgoties jau piestiprinātiem logiem","Fits the way you work.":"Pielāgojas jūsu darba stilam.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Ļaut logam peldēt (iziet no flīzēšanas)","Four quarters":"Četras ceturtdaļas","From":"No","Fullscreen":"Pilnekrāns","Gap between windows":"Atstarpe starp logiem","Gap to the screen edge":"Atstarpe līdz ekrāna malai","General":"Vispārīgi","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Katrai darbībai atkal piešķir izvēlētās shēmas taustiņu un noņem taustiņus, kuru shēmā nav.","Good to know":"Labi zināt","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Satveriet logu aiz virsrakstjoslas un velciet to augšup. Josla nolaižas; nometiet logu uz zonas, un tas aizņems tieši šo laukumu. Ja to atkal izvelkat, tas atgūst iepriekšējo izmēru.","Grab window A…":"Satveriet logu A…","Grid":"Režģis","Halves":"Puses","Hiding":"Paslēpšana","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Turēt pie malas, lai aizpildītu brīvo vietu","Hold time":"Turēšanas laiks","Hold to fill":"Turēt, lai aizpildītu","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Cik tuvu jānonāk malai, pirms tā nofiksējas.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Cik tuvu malai jānonāk kursoram.","How far the bar slides down":"Cik tālu josla nobīdās lejup","How it works":"Kā tas darbojas","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Cik ilgi logam jāatrodas pie malas – neliels grūdiens. 0 = uzreiz.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Cik ilgi logam jāpaliek pie malas, pirms tas izaug.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Cik logu dala galveno apgabalu (izkārtojums “Galvenais un kaudze”).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Ja apakšā jau ir logs, augšmala dod augšējo pusi, nevis maksimizē. Arī puses un ceturtdaļas atstāj piestiprinātos logus brīvus.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Ja jums patīk KSnapUnity, varat atbalstīt tā izstrādi – paldies!","In bar":"Joslā","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Neatkarīgi no joslas un ekrāna malām.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Neatkarīgi no joslas. Katru malu var ieslēgt atsevišķi.","Information":"Informācija","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Intuitīva, dabiska logu uzvedība.","Join at the end":"Nostājas beigās","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K – KWin · Snap – gudrāka piestiprināšana · Unity – viss vienā sistēmā","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE ir savas ekrāna malu darbības un sava logu piestiprināšana. Ja šeit ir ieslēgta tā pati funkcija, izslēdziet KDE funkciju: Sistēmas iestatījumi → Logu pārvaldība → Ekrāna malas, kā arī Logu uzvedība → Pārvietošana.","KDE's own edge tiling":"KDE pašas malu flīzēšana","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"Paša KDE maksimizēšana un flīzēšana pie malām – ar kontūru – tiek apturēta, kamēr darbojas KSnapUnity, lai būtu tikai viens priekšskatījums. Jūsu KDE iestatījumi nemainās: izslēdziet šo, atspējojiet vai noņemiet KSnapUnity, un KDE uzvedība atgriežas.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"KDE pašas ekrāna malu darbības joprojām ir ieslēgtas, tāpēc uz to pašu vilkšanu reaģē divi palīgi. Izslēdziet “Maksimizēt” un “Flīzēt” sadaļā Sistēmas iestatījumi → Logu pārvaldība → Ekrāna malas.","KDE's own window snapping":"KDE pašas logu piesaiste","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"Arī KDE pašas logu piestiprināšana ir ieslēgta. Vienotai sajūtai iestatiet tās zonas uz “Nav” sadaļā Sistēmas iestatījumi → Logu pārvaldība → Logu uzvedība → Pārvietošana.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"KDE īsceļu pakalpojums neatbildēja. Taustiņus joprojām varat iestatīt sadaļā Sistēmas iestatījumi → Īsceļi → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – iestatījumu redaktors","Keep stacked windows in line":"Turēt sakrautos logus vienā līnijā","Keep the gap between windows":"Saglabāt atstarpi starp logiem","Keep them":"Paturēt","Key scheme":"Taustiņu shēma","Keyboard shortcuts":"Īsinājumtaustiņi","Keys":"Taustiņi","Keys already in use":"Jau izmantoti taustiņi","Layout":"Izkārtojums","Layout by number of windows":"Izkārtojums pēc logu skaita","Layouts":"Izkārtojumi","Layouts per row":"Izkārtojumi rindā","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Kreisā un labā mala: puse ekrāna","Left edge: left half":"Kreisā mala: kreisā puse","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Zem 100 % vienīgais logs paliek centrā – skaisti platos ekrānos.","License":"Licence","Light":"Gaiša","Linear":"Lineāra","Live preview":"Tiešraides priekšskatījums","Load template…":"Ielādēt veidni…","Magnet":"Magnēts","Main + stack":"Galvenais + kaudze","Main and stack":"Galvenais un kaudze","Main area bigger":"Lielāks galvenais apgabals","Main area on the right":"Galvenā zona labajā pusē","Main area smaller":"Mazāks galvenais apgabals","Main in the middle":"Galvenais vidū","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Galvenais slēdzis vilkšanai un taustiņiem.","Main window":"Galvenais logs","Main windows":"Galvenie logi","Main windows: %1":"Galvenie logi: %1","Make it the main window":"Padarīt par galveno logu","Maximize":"Maksimizēt","Maximize or restore":"Maksimizēt vai atjaunot","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + taustiņš (KDE stils)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + taustiņš","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + taustiņš","Minimize":"Minimizēt","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Spoguļo izkārtojumu: galvenais logs pa labi, pārējie pa kreisi.","Mode":"Režīms","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"1. režīms – piestiprināšanas josla un ekrāna malas","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"2. režīms – automātiska flīzēšana","Modes":"Režīmi","More ways":"Vairāk veidu","Motion curve":"Kustības līkne","Move a window towards others…":"Pārvietojiet logu pie citiem…","Move the window one place back":"Pārvietot logu vienu vietu atpakaļ","Move the window one place on":"Pārvietot logu vienu vietu uz priekšu","Name:":"Nosaukums:","New layout":"Jauns izkārtojums","New windows":"Jauni logi","Next tiling layout":"Nākamais flīzēšanas izkārtojums","Next to the active window":"Blakus aktīvajam logam","No key":"Nav taustiņa","No other window open":"Nav atvērta cita loga","No outer margin":"Bez ārējās atkāpes","No shortcuts":"Bez īsceļiem","None":"Nav","None yet.":"Pagaidām nav.","Off":"Izslēgts","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Izsl. = 1. režīms, iesl. = 2. režīms","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Izslēgts: neitrāls rāmis – tikai ieslēgtajiem priekšskatījumiem.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Izslēgts: taustiņi paliek piešķirti, bet neko nedara.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Izslēgts: logi paliek tur, kur tos noliec. Pārējās funkcijas darbojas jebkurā gadījumā.","One at a time":"Pa vienam","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Viens aizveras – pārējie aizpilda spraugu","One main window less":"Par vienu galveno logu mazāk","One more main window":"Vēl viens galvenais logs","One window":"Viens logs","Only one mode is switched on.":"Ieslēgts ir tikai viens režīms.","Open settings editor":"Atvērt iestatījumu redaktoru","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Vispirms atveriet lietotni, tad izvēlieties to šeit.","Open the layout builder":"Atvērt izkārtojumu veidotāju","Own layouts":"Savi izkārtojumi","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Katras malas daļa, kas skaitās kā stūris.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Pauzēt KDE malu flīzēšanu un tās priekšskatījumu","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Pauzēt KDE piesaistes zonas, kamēr magnēts ir ieslēgts","Preview":"Priekšskatījums","Previews":"Priekšskatījumi","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Piespiediet logu pie ekrāna malas vai stūra, un tas aizpildīs šo daļu. Darbojas ar joslu vai bez tās.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Piespiediet logu pie malas vai stūra: maksimizēt, puses, ceturtdaļas.","Push delay":"Piespiešanas aizture","Quarters":"Ceturtdaļas","Quick":"Ātra","Quick settings":"Ātrie iestatījumi","Recommended values":"Ieteicamās vērtības","Remove":"Noņemt","Remove rule":"Noņemt noteikumu","Remove zone":"Noņemt zonu","Reset all":"Atiestatīt visu","Reset all keys":"Atiestatīt visus taustiņus","Reset to default":"Atjaunot noklusējumu","Resistance against overlapping":"Pretestība pārklāšanai","Resize touching windows together":"Mainīt savstarpēji saskarošos logu izmēru kopā","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Arī izmēra maiņa piestiprinās – šeit līdz pilnam augstumam","Restore":"Atjaunot","Restore default layouts":"Atjaunot noklusējuma izkārtojumus","Restore default layouts?":"Atjaunot noklusējuma izkārtojumus?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Atjaunot sākotnējo izmēru, izvelkot logu ārā","Restore the size before snapping":"Atjaunot izmēru pirms piestiprināšanas","Rows":"Rindas","Save":"Saglabāt","Screen edges":"Ekrāna malas","Screen edges on/off":"Ekrāna malas ieslēgt/izslēgt","Screen edges preview":"Ekrāna malu priekšskatījums","Set":"Iestatīt","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Iestata visu darbību taustiņus uzreiz. Atsevišķus taustiņus joprojām varat mainīt zemāk.","Settings":"Iestatījumi","Settings file":"Iestatījumu fails","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Mainot izmēru, ātri sakrati peli uz priekšu un atpakaļ, un pārējie logi atlec atpakaļ. Ātrs rāviens vienā virzienā tos nekad neatbrīvo.","Shake to let go":"Sakratīt, lai atlaistu","Shortcuts":"Īsceļi","Show a small handle first":"Vispirms rādīt mazu rokturi","Show layout and zone names":"Rādīt izkārtojumu un zonu nosaukumus","Show previews in the accent color":"Rādīt priekšskatījumus akcenta krāsā","Showing":"Rādīšana","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Rāda, kur logs nonāks pie malas vai stūrī. Izslēgts: nekāda priekšskatījuma.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Rāda, kur logs nonāks, kamēr joslas zona ir izcelta. Izslēgts: nekāda priekšskatījuma.","Sidebar + grid":"Sānjosla + režģis","Single zone":"Viena zona","Six tiles":"Sešas flīzes","Size & shape":"Izmērs un forma","Size of the main area":"Galvenā apgabala izmērs","Slide-in duration":"Ieslīdēšanas ilgums","Slide-out duration":"Izslīdēšanas ilgums","Smart arranging and detection.":"Gudra izkārtošana un atpazīšana.","Smart fill":"Gudrā aizpilde","Smooth (default)":"Vienmērīga (noklusējums)","Snap bar":"Piestiprināšanas josla","Snap bar and screen edges":"Piestiprināšanas josla un ekrāna malas","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Josla un malas ir izslēgtas – darbojas tikai 2. režīms, un režīma taustiņš neko nedara.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Josla un ekrāna malas traucē automātisko flīzēšanu. Tāpēc tie darbojas kā divi režīmi – pārslēdziet ar īsinājumtaustiņu vai šeit.","Snap bar colors:":"Joslas krāsas:","Snap bar on/off":"Josla ieslēgt/izslēgt","Snap bar preview":"Piesaistes joslas priekšskatījums","Snap bar size":"Joslas izmērs","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Piestiprināšanas josla, ekrāna malas, logu magnēts, īsinājumtaustiņi un logu apmaiņa.","Snap distance":"Piestiprināšanas attālums","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Piesaistīt atdalītājus (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Piestiprināšanas izkārtojumi un automātiska flīzēšana.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Piestipriniet aktīvo logu ar taustiņu kombinācijām.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Piestipriniet aktīvo logu ar tastatūru. Tie ir parasti KDE globālie īsceļi – tos atradīsiet arī sadaļā Sistēmas iestatījumi → Īsceļi → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Piestiprināt apakšējā pusē","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Piestiprināt apakšējā kreisajā ceturtdaļā","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Piestiprināt apakšējā labajā ceturtdaļā","Snap to the center third":"Piestiprināt vidējā trešdaļā","Snap to the left half":"Piestiprināt kreisajā pusē","Snap to the left third":"Piestiprināt kreisajā trešdaļā","Snap to the left two thirds":"Piestiprināt kreisajās divās trešdaļās","Snap to the right half":"Piestiprināt labajā pusē","Snap to the right third":"Piestiprināt labajā trešdaļā","Snap to the right two thirds":"Piestiprināt labajās divās trešdaļās","Snap to the top half":"Piestiprināt augšējā pusē","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Piestiprināt augšējā kreisajā ceturtdaļā","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Piestiprināt augšējā labajā ceturtdaļā","Snapping":"Piesaiste","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Piestiprināšana un automātiskā flīzēšana darbojas kā divi režīmi – viens īsinājumtaustiņš pārslēdz starp tiem.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Tā logu velk tikai viens magnēts. Jūsu KDE iestatījumi nemainās: izslēdziet šo, atspējojiet vai noņemiet KSnapUnity, un KDE piestiprināšana atgriežas.","Soft":"Maiga","Spacing":"Atstarpes","Spiral":"Spirāle","Split side by side":"Sadalīt blakus","Split top and bottom":"Sadalīt augšā un apakšā","Stack + main":"Kaudze + galvenais","Stick to other windows":"Pielipt citiem logiem","Stick to the screen edges":"Pielipt ekrāna malām","Sticky edges":"Lipīgās malas","Support KSnapUnity":"Atbalstiet KSnapUnity","Swap":"Apmainīt","Swap windows":"Logu apmaiņa","Swap with the window above":"Samainīt ar logu augšā","Swap with the window below":"Samainīt ar logu apakšā","Swap with the window on the left":"Samainīt ar logu pa kreisi","Swap with the window on the right":"Samainīt ar logu pa labi","Switch mode":"Pārslēgt režīmu","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Pārslēgt režīmu (piestiprināšana / flīzēšana)","Switch modes with:":"Režīma pārslēgšana ar:","Switch the layout by itself":"Mainīt izkārtojumu pašam","Switched off":"Izslēgts","System":"Sistēmas","Take it over":"Pārņemt","Take over all":"Pārņemt visus","Take the main place":"Ieņem galveno vietu","Test animation":"Pārbaudīt animāciju","Test on screen":"Pārbaudīt uz ekrāna","Test the snap bar":"Izmēģināt joslu","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Noklusējuma vērtības balstās uz Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Piestiprināšanas darbības izmanto tās pašas atstarpes kā josla un atceras izmēru pirms piestiprināšanas: “Atjaunot izmēru pirms piestiprināšanas” to atgriež.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Šīs lietotnes nekad netiek kārtotas un saglabā savu vietu. Dialogi vienmēr peld.","Thirds":"Trešdaļas","Three columns":"Trīs kolonnas","Thumbnail width":"Sīktēlu platums","Tiling":"Flīzēšana","Tip":"Padoms","Top / bottom":"Augša / apakša","Top edge":"Augšmala","Top edge: full screen":"Augšējā mala: pilnekrāns","Top edge: maximize":"Augšējā mala: maksimizēt","Top edge: top half":"Augšējā mala: augšējā puse","Top half":"Augšējā puse","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Aktivizēšanas attālums no augšmalas","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Izslēdziet, ja jums labāk patīk KDE kontūra – tad augstāk izslēdziet ekrāna malu priekšskatījumu.","Two thirds":"Divas trešdaļas","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Divi logi apmainās vietām – nometiet vienu uz otra vai izmantojiet taustiņus.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Divi logi apmainās vietām: nometiet vienu uz otra vai ar taustiņu.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Izmantot īsinājumtaustiņus","Use screen edges":"Izmantot ekrāna malas","Use the system accent color":"Izmantot sistēmas akcenta krāsu","Use the window magnet":"Izmantot logu magnētu","Usual combinations":"Ierastās kombinācijas","Version":"Versija","Wanted for: %1":"Vēlams darbībai: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Kad logs atveras, aizveras vai apmainās, pārējie kustas vienmērīgi, nevis lēkā.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Mainot loga izmēru, logi, kas tam pieskaras, pārvieto kopīgo malu līdzi – nekas nepārklājas, sprauga nerodas.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Mainot izmēru, logi, kas neseko, tiek rādīti caurspīdīgi.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Kamēr pārvietojat logu vai maināt tā izmēru, tā malas pielīp tuvējiem logiem un ekrāna malām.","Width":"Platums","Window":"Logs","Window magnet":"Logu magnēts","Window magnet on/off":"Logu magnēts ieslēgt/izslēgt","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Logi viens virs otra tur kreiso un labo malu kopā, logi blakus – augšējo un apakšējo.","Windows glide to their place":"Logi vienmērīgi slīd savā vietā","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Logi pielīp cits citam un ekrāna malām.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Logi apstājas pie “Atstarpe starp logiem” no lapas Vispārīgi, nevis saskaras.","Yes":"Jā","Your own combination":"Jūsu kombinācija","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Jūsu izkārtojumi un to secība tiks zaudēti.","Zone %1":"Zona %1","for KWin · v%1":"KWin · v%1","windows:":"logiem:","“%1” will be removed.":"“%1” tiks noņemts.","…drag it onto window B…":"…velciet to uz logu B…","…in every direction":"…visos virzienos","…let go: they trade places":"…atlaidiet: tie apmainās vietām","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…kaimiņi aug un sarūk līdzi","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Gatavs – noklikšķiniet Labi, lai atvērtu iestatījumu redaktoru."},"mk":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (копија)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 го користи „%2”.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 од %2 зони","0 = all in one row":"0 = сите во еден ред","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Режим 1</b><br/>Лента за закачување и рабови на екранот","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Режим 2</b><br/>Автоматско редење","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Единствениот прозорец го користи целиот екран, дури и со поставена маргина.","A new window joins":"Се приклучува нов прозорец","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Кратко туркање дава половина или четвртина. Задржете го прозорецот на работ малку подолго и порасне до следниот прозорец – прегледот го покажува тоа.","A single window":"Еден прозорец","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Прозорецот застанува на работ на друг, дури и кога брзо го движите. Протресете го глушецот или туркајте уште миг за да го пуштите. 0 = прозорците смеат слободно да се преклопуваат.","About & Help":"За програмата и помош","Accent color":"Боја на нагласување","Active":"Активно","Active mode":"Активен режим","Active width along the top edge":"Активна ширина долж горниот раб","Add an open application":"Додај отворена апликација","Add rule":"Додај правило","All window features in one system.":"Сите функции за прозорци во еден систем.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Се менува и кога рачно ја менувате големината на главниот прозорец.","Also while resizing":"И при менување големина","Always floating":"Секогаш слободни","Animation":"Анимација","Appearance":"Изглед","Apply":"Примени","Arrange windows":"Распоредување прозорци","Arrange windows automatically":"Автоматски распореди ги прозорците","Author":"Автор","Automatic tiling":"Автоматско редење","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Автоматското редење е исклучено – работи само режим 1, а кратенката за режим не прави ништо.","Automatic tiling off":"Автоматското редење е исклучено","Automatic tiling on":"Автоматското редење е вклучено","Automatic tiling on/off":"Автоматско редење вкл./искл.","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Автоматско редење, замена на прозорци, кратенки и магнет за слободни прозорци.","Background opacity":"Непроѕирност на позадината","Behavior & Animation":"Однесување и анимација","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Долен раб: долна половина","Bouncy":"Еластична","Buy me a coffee":"Купи ми кафе","Cancel":"Откажи","Center focus":"Фокус во средина","Center the window":"Центрирај го прозорецот","Change":"Промени","Change key":"Промени копче","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Копчето се менува во уредувачот на поставки. Двата режима бараат автоматско редење и лентата или рабовите на екранот.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Променете ги на страницата „Кратенки на тастатура“. Со автоматско редење прозорците си ги менуваат и местата во редоследот.","Choose…":"Изберете…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Кликнете на зона за да ја изберете · двоен клик ја дели · влечете ги разделниците","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Кликнете или притиснете %1 за промена на режимот.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Кликнете, потоа OK – се отвора уредувачот на поставки.","Close":"Затвори","Close by, the edges stick together":"Одблизу рабовите се лепат","Color scheme":"Шема на бои","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Бои, големина и облик на лентата.","Columns":"Колони","Corner radius":"Радиус на аглите","Corner size":"Големина на аглите","Corner: a quarter":"Агол: четвртина","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Агли: четвртина од екранот","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + копче (стандардно)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + нумеричка тастатура","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + копче","Custom color":"Сопствена боја","Custom layout %1":"Сопствен распоред %1","Dark":"Темна","Delay before hiding":"Задоцнување пред сокривање","Delay before showing":"Задоцнување пред прикажување","Delete":"Избриши","Delete layout?":"Да се избрише распоредот?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Растојание на кое се појавува рачката","Distance before the bar hides again":"Растојание по кое лентата повторно се сокрива","Distance to the edge":"Растојание од работ","Donate with PayPal":"Донирајте преку PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"Повлечете заеднички раб…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Повлечете прозорец кон раб…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Повлечете прозорец врз друг за да ги замените. Пуштен на лентата или раб на екранот, слободно лебди; „Пушти го прозорецот да лебди“ го враќа. Растојанијата се од страницата Општо.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Повлечете прозорец над средината на друг – прегледот покажува две стрелки – и пуштете. Со автоматско редење доволно е било каде над другиот прозорец.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Повлечете прозорец до горниот раб на екранот и пуштете го на зона.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Влечете ги картичките за да го смените редоследот во лентата. Двоен клик на картичка за уредување.","Drop a window onto another one":"Пуштање прозорец врз друг","Drop the window onto a zone":"Пуштете го прозорецот на зона","Duplicate":"Удвои","Duration":"Траење","Dwindle":"Спирала навнатре","Dynamic":"Динамична","Edges and corners":"Рабови и агли","Edit":"Уреди","Edit layout":"Уреди распоред","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Секоја функција може да се вклучи и исклучи посебно.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Секој распоред направен на страницата Распореди може и да реди прозорци – се појавува горе. Прозорецот 1 ја добива зоната 1 и така натаму; дополнителните ја делат последната зона. Со помалку прозорци од зони се користи „Главен и куп“, за да нема дупки.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Секој прозорец сам си го наоѓа местото, како во менаџер на прозорци со редење.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Секој прозорец сам си го наоѓа местото на екранот. Новите прозорци се приклучуваат, затворените прават место за другите.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Пример: два прозорци еден до друг, од три главен и куп, од пет мрежа. Без соодветно правило важи распоредот избран горе.","Fade in and out":"Постепено појавување и исчезнување","Fade the other windows":"Затемни ги другите прозорци","Features":"Функции","Feel":"Чувство","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Прилагоди се на веќе закачените прозорци","Fits the way you work.":"Се прилагодува на вашиот начин на работа.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Пушти го прозорецот да лебди (излези од редењето)","Four quarters":"Четири четвртини","From":"Од","Fullscreen":"Цел екран","Gap between windows":"Растојание меѓу прозорците","Gap to the screen edge":"Растојание до работ на екранот","General":"Општо","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"На секое дејство повторно му го дава копчето од избраната шема и ги отстранува копчињата што шемата ги нема.","Good to know":"Добро е да се знае","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Фатете прозорец за насловната лента и повлечете го нагоре. Лентата се спушта; пуштете го прозорецот на зона и тој ја пополнува токму таа површина. Кога ќе го извлечете повторно, ја враќа старата големина.","Grab window A…":"Фатете го прозорецот A…","Grid":"Мрежа","Halves":"Половини","Hiding":"Сокривање","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Држи на работ за да се пополни слободниот простор","Hold time":"Време на држење","Hold to fill":"Држи за пополнување","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Колку блиску мора да дојде работ пред да легне на место.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Колку блиску до работ мора да дојде покажувачот.","How far the bar slides down":"Колку ниско се спушта лентата","How it works":"Како работи","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Колку долго прозорецот мора да стои до работ – мало туркање. 0 = веднаш.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Колку долго прозорецот мора да остане на работ пред да порасне.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Колку прозорци ја делат главната област (распоред „Главен и куп“).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Ако долу веќе има прозорец, горниот раб дава горна половина наместо максимизирање. И половините и четвртините ги оставаат закачените прозорци слободни.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Ако ви се допаѓа KSnapUnity, можете да го поддржите развојот – благодариме!","In bar":"Во лентата","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Независно од лентата и рабовите на екранот.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Независно од лентата. Секој раб се вклучува посебно.","Information":"Информации","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Интуитивно, природно однесување на прозорците.","Join at the end":"Одат на крајот","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K за KWin · Snap за попаметно закачување · Unity за сè во еден систем","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE има сопствени дејства за рабовите на екранот и сопствено закачување прозорци. Ако истата функција е вклучена тука, исклучете ја онаа на KDE: Системски поставувања → Управување со прозорци → Рабови на екранот, и Однесување на прозорците → Поместување.","KDE's own edge tiling":"KDE-овото сопствено редење по рабовите","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"Сопственото максимизирање и редење на KDE на рабовите – со контурата – паузира додека работи KSnapUnity, за да има само еден преглед. Вашите поставки на KDE не се менуваат: исклучете го ова, деактивирајте или отстранете го KSnapUnity и однесувањето на KDE се враќа.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"Сопствените дејства за рабовите на екранот на KDE се уште се вклучени, па на истото влечење реагираат два помошника. Исклучете „Максимизирај” и „Поплочи” во Системски поставувања → Управување со прозорци → Рабови на екранот.","KDE's own window snapping":"KDE-овото сопствено закачување прозорци","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"И сопственото закачување прозорци на KDE е вклучено. За еднакво чувство поставете ги неговите зони на „Нема” во Системски поставувања → Управување со прозорци → Однесување на прозорците → Поместување.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Сервисот за кратенки на KDE не одговори. Копчињата и понатаму може да ги поставите во Системски поставувања → Кратенки → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – уредувач на поставки","Keep stacked windows in line":"Држи ги наредените прозорци во линија","Keep the gap between windows":"Задржи растојание меѓу прозорците","Keep them":"Задржи ги","Key scheme":"Шема на копчиња","Keyboard shortcuts":"Кратенки на тастатура","Keys":"Копчиња","Keys already in use":"Копчиња што веќе се користат","Layout":"Распоред","Layout by number of windows":"Распоред според бројот на прозорци","Layouts":"Распореди","Layouts per row":"Распореди по ред","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Лев и десен раб: половина екран","Left edge: left half":"Лев раб: лева половина","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Под 100 % единствениот прозорец останува во средина – убаво на широки екрани.","License":"Лиценца","Light":"Светла","Linear":"Линеарна","Live preview":"Преглед во живо","Load template…":"Вчитај шаблон…","Magnet":"Магнет","Main + stack":"Главен + куп","Main and stack":"Главен и куп","Main area bigger":"Поголема главна област","Main area on the right":"Главната област десно","Main area smaller":"Помала главна област","Main in the middle":"Главен во средина","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Главен прекинувач за влечењето и копчињата.","Main window":"Главен прозорец","Main windows":"Главни прозорци","Main windows: %1":"Главни прозорци: %1","Make it the main window":"Направи го главен прозорец","Maximize":"Максимизирај","Maximize or restore":"Максимизирај или врати","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + копче (стил на KDE)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + копче","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + копче","Minimize":"Минимизирај","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Го пресликува распоредот: главниот прозорец десно, другите лево.","Mode":"Режим","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Режим 1 – лента за закачување и рабови на екранот","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Режим 2 – автоматско редење","Modes":"Режими","More ways":"Повеќе начини","Motion curve":"Крива на движење","Move a window towards others…":"Поместете прозорец кон други…","Move the window one place back":"Помести го прозорецот едно место назад","Move the window one place on":"Помести го прозорецот едно место напред","Name:":"Име:","New layout":"Нов распоред","New windows":"Нови прозорци","Next tiling layout":"Следен распоред","Next to the active window":"До активниот прозорец","No key":"Нема копче","No other window open":"Нема друг отворен прозорец","No outer margin":"Без надворешна маргина","No shortcuts":"Без кратенки","None":"Нема","None yet.":"Сè уште нема.","Off":"Исклучено","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Искл. = режим 1, вкл. = режим 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Исклучено: неутрална рамка – само за вклучените прегледи.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Исклучено: копчињата остануваат доделени, но не прават ништо.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Исклучено: прозорците остануваат каде што ги ставате. Другите функции работат и така.","One at a time":"Еден по еден","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Еден се затвора – другите ја пополнуваат празнината","One main window less":"Еден главен прозорец помалку","One more main window":"Уште еден главен прозорец","One window":"Еден прозорец","Only one mode is switched on.":"Вклучен е само еден режим.","Open settings editor":"Отвори го уредувачот на поставки","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Прво отворете ја апликацијата, па изберете ја тука.","Open the layout builder":"Отвори го градителот на распореди","Own layouts":"Сопствени распореди","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Дел од секоја страна што се смета за агол.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Паузирај го KDE-овото редење по рабовите и неговиот преглед","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Паузирај ги KDE-овите зони за закачување додека магнетот е вклучен","Preview":"Преглед","Previews":"Прегледи","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Притиснете прозорец кон раб или агол на екранот и тој го пополнува тој дел. Работи со или без лентата.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Притиснете прозорец кон раб или агол: максимизирај, половини, четвртини.","Push delay":"Задоцнување на притисок","Quarters":"Четвртини","Quick":"Брза","Quick settings":"Брзи поставки","Recommended values":"Препорачани вредности","Remove":"Отстрани","Remove rule":"Отстрани правило","Remove zone":"Отстрани зона","Reset all":"Ресетирај сè","Reset all keys":"Ресетирај ги сите копчиња","Reset to default":"Врати на стандардно","Resistance against overlapping":"Отпор кон преклопување","Resize touching windows together":"Менувај ја големината на прозорците што се допираат заедно","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"И менувањето големина се закачува – тука до полна висина","Restore":"Врати","Restore default layouts":"Врати ги стандардните распореди","Restore default layouts?":"Да се вратат стандардните распореди?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Врати ја првобитната големина при извлекување на прозорецот","Restore the size before snapping":"Врати ја големината пред закачувањето","Rows":"Редови","Save":"Зачувај","Screen edges":"Рабови на екранот","Screen edges on/off":"Рабови на екранот вкл./искл.","Screen edges preview":"Преглед на рабовите на екранот","Set":"Постави","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Ги поставува копчињата на сите дејства одеднаш. Поединечни копчиња и понатаму може да ги менувате подолу.","Settings":"Поставки","Settings file":"Датотека со поставки","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Додека ја менувате големината, брзо протресете го глушецот напред-назад и другите прозорци скокаат назад. Брзо повлекување во една насока никогаш не ги пушта.","Shake to let go":"Протресете за да пуштите","Shortcuts":"Кратенки","Show a small handle first":"Прво прикажи мала рачка","Show layout and zone names":"Прикажи ги имињата на распоредите и зоните","Show previews in the accent color":"Прикажи прегледи во бојата на нагласување","Showing":"Прикажување","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Покажува каде слетува прозорецот на раб или во агол. Исклучено: без преглед.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Покажува каде слетува прозорецот додека е истакната зона од лентата. Исклучено: без преглед.","Sidebar + grid":"Странична лента + мрежа","Single zone":"Една зона","Six tiles":"Шест плочки","Size & shape":"Големина и облик","Size of the main area":"Големина на главната област","Slide-in duration":"Траење на спуштањето","Slide-out duration":"Траење на подигањето","Smart arranging and detection.":"Паметно редење и препознавање.","Smart fill":"Паметно пополнување","Smooth (default)":"Мазна (стандардно)","Snap bar":"Лента за закачување","Snap bar and screen edges":"Лента за закачување и рабови на екранот","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Лентата и рабовите се исклучени – работи само режим 2, а кратенката за режим не прави ништо.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Лентата и рабовите на екранот го попречуваат автоматското редење. Затоа работат како два режима – менувајте со кратенката или тука.","Snap bar colors:":"Бои на лентата:","Snap bar on/off":"Лента вкл./искл.","Snap bar preview":"Преглед на лентата за закачување","Snap bar size":"Големина на лентата","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Лента за закачување, рабови на екранот, магнет за прозорци, кратенки и замена на прозорци.","Snap distance":"Растојание на закачување","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Прилепување на разделниците (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Распореди за закачување и автоматско редење.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Закачете го активниот прозорец со комбинации на копчиња.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Закачете го активниот прозорец со тастатурата. Ова се обични глобални кратенки на KDE – ги има и во Системски поставувања → Кратенки → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Закачи во долната половина","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Закачи во долната лева четвртина","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Закачи во долната десна четвртина","Snap to the center third":"Закачи во средната третина","Snap to the left half":"Закачи во левата половина","Snap to the left third":"Закачи во левата третина","Snap to the left two thirds":"Закачи во левите две третини","Snap to the right half":"Закачи во десната половина","Snap to the right third":"Закачи во десната третина","Snap to the right two thirds":"Закачи во десните две третини","Snap to the top half":"Закачи во горната половина","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Закачи во горната лева четвртина","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Закачи во горната десна четвртина","Snapping":"Прилепување","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Закачувањето и автоматското редење работат како два режима – една кратенка менува меѓу нив.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Така само еден магнет го влече прозорецот. Вашите поставки на KDE не се менуваат: исклучете го ова, деактивирајте или отстранете го KSnapUnity и закачувањето на KDE се враќа.","Soft":"Нежна","Spacing":"Растојанија","Spiral":"Спирала","Split side by side":"Подели едно до друго","Split top and bottom":"Подели горе и долу","Stack + main":"Куп + главен","Stick to other windows":"Лепи се за други прозорци","Stick to the screen edges":"Лепи се за рабовите на екранот","Sticky edges":"Лепливи рабови","Support KSnapUnity":"Поддржете го KSnapUnity","Swap":"Замени","Swap windows":"Замена на прозорци","Swap with the window above":"Замени со прозорецот горе","Swap with the window below":"Замени со прозорецот долу","Swap with the window on the left":"Замени со прозорецот лево","Swap with the window on the right":"Замени со прозорецот десно","Switch mode":"Промени режим","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Промени режим (закачување / редење)","Switch modes with:":"Промена на режим со:","Switch the layout by itself":"Сам менувај го распоредот","Switched off":"Исклучено","System":"Систем","Take it over":"Преземи","Take over all":"Преземи ги сите","Take the main place":"Го земаат главното место","Test animation":"Испробај анимација","Test on screen":"Испробај на екранот","Test the snap bar":"Испробај ја лентата","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Стандардните вредности се засновани на Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Дејствата за закачување ги користат истите растојанија како лентата и ја паметат големината пред закачувањето: „Врати ја големината пред закачувањето” ја враќа.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Овие апликации никогаш не се редат и го чуваат своето место. Дијалозите секогаш лебдат.","Thirds":"Третини","Three columns":"Три колони","Thumbnail width":"Ширина на сликичките","Tiling":"Редење","Tip":"Совет","Top / bottom":"Горе / долу","Top edge":"Горен раб","Top edge: full screen":"Горен раб: цел екран","Top edge: maximize":"Горен раб: максимизирај","Top edge: top half":"Горен раб: горна половина","Top half":"Горна половина","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Растојание за активирање од горниот раб","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Исклучете ако повеќе ви се допаѓа KDE-овиот обрис – потоа горе исклучете го прегледот на рабовите.","Two thirds":"Две третини","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Два прозорци си ги менуваат местата – пуштете еден врз другиот или користете копчиња.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Два прозорци си ги менуваат местата: пуштете еден врз другиот или со копче.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Користи кратенки на тастатура","Use screen edges":"Користи ги рабовите на екранот","Use the system accent color":"Користи ја системската боја на нагласување","Use the window magnet":"Користи го магнетот за прозорци","Usual combinations":"Вообичаени комбинации","Version":"Верзија","Wanted for: %1":"Посакувано за: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Кога прозорец се отвора, затвора или заменува, другите се движат мазно наместо да скокаат.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Кога ја менувате големината на прозорец, прозорците што го допираат го поместуваат заедничкиот раб со него – ништо не се преклопува, нема празнина.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Додека се менува големината, прозорците што не следат се прикажуваат проѕирни.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Додека го поместувате прозорецот или му ја менувате големината, неговите рабови се лепат за блиските прозорци и рабовите на екранот.","Width":"Ширина","Window":"Прозорец","Window magnet":"Магнет за прозорци","Window magnet on/off":"Магнет за прозорци вкл./искл.","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Прозорците еден над друг ги држат левите и десните рабови заедно, прозорците еден до друг горните и долните.","Windows glide to their place":"Прозорците лизгаат на своето место","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Прозорците се лепат еден за друг и за рабовите на екранот.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Прозорците застануваат на „Растојание меѓу прозорците” од страницата Општо наместо да се допираат.","Yes":"Да","Your own combination":"Сопствена комбинација","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Вашите распореди и нивниот редослед ќе бидат изгубени.","Zone %1":"Зона %1","for KWin · v%1":"за KWin · v%1","windows:":"прозорци:","“%1” will be removed.":"„%1“ ќе биде отстранет.","…drag it onto window B…":"…повлечете го врз прозорецот B…","…in every direction":"…во секоја насока","…let go: they trade places":"…пуштете: си ги менуваат местата","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…соседите растат и се смалуваат со него","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Подготвено – кликнете OK за да се отвори уредувачот на поставки."},"mr":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (प्रत)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 “%2” वापरत आहे.","%1 of %2 zones":"%2 पैकी %1 क्षेत्रे","0 = all in one row":"0 = सर्व एकाच ओळीत","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>मोड 1</b><br/>स्नॅप बार आणि स्क्रीनच्या कडा","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>मोड 2</b><br/>स्वयंचलित टाइलिंग","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"एकटी विंडो पूर्ण स्क्रीन वापरते, समास सेट असला तरी.","A new window joins":"नवी विंडो सामील होते","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"छोटा धक्का अर्धा किंवा चतुर्थांश देतो. खिडकी कडेला थोडा जास्त वेळ ठेवा आणि ती पुढच्या खिडकीपर्यंत वाढते – पूर्वावलोकन ते दाखवते.","A single window":"एकच विंडो","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"वेगाने हलवली तरी विंडो दुसऱ्या विंडोच्या कडेवर थांबते. सोडवण्यासाठी माउस हलवा किंवा आणखी क्षणभर ढकला. 0 = विंडो मोकळेपणाने एकमेकांवर येऊ शकतात.","About & Help":"माहिती आणि मदत","Accent color":"ॲक्सेंट रंग","Active":"सक्रिय","Active mode":"सक्रिय मोड","Active width along the top edge":"वरच्या कडेलगत सक्रिय रुंदी","Add an open application":"उघडे ॲप जोडा","Add rule":"नियम जोडा","All window features in one system.":"सर्व विंडो वैशिष्ट्ये एका प्रणालीत.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"तुम्ही मुख्य विंडोचा आकार हाताने बदलता तेव्हाही बदलतो.","Also while resizing":"आकार बदलतानाही","Always floating":"नेहमी तरंगत्या","Animation":"ॲनिमेशन","Appearance":"स्वरूप","Apply":"लागू करा","Arrange windows":"विंडो मांडा","Arrange windows automatically":"विंडो आपोआप मांडा","Author":"लेखक","Automatic tiling":"स्वयंचलित टाइलिंग","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"स्वयंचलित टाइलिंग बंद आहे – फक्त मोड 1 चालतो आणि मोड शॉर्टकट काहीच करत नाही.","Automatic tiling off":"स्वयंचलित टाइलिंग बंद","Automatic tiling on":"स्वयंचलित टाइलिंग चालू","Automatic tiling on/off":"स्वयंचलित टाइलिंग चालू/बंद","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"स्वयंचलित टाइलिंग, विंडो अदलाबदल, शॉर्टकट आणि तरंगत्या विंडोंसाठी चुंबक.","Background opacity":"पार्श्वभूमीची अपारदर्शकता","Behavior & Animation":"वर्तन आणि ॲनिमेशन","Bottom edge: bottom half":"खालची कडा: खालचा अर्धा भाग","Bouncy":"उसळणारा","Buy me a coffee":"मला एक कॉफी पाजा","Cancel":"रद्द करा","Center focus":"मध्यभागी लक्ष","Center the window":"खिडकी मध्यभागी आणा","Change":"बदला","Change key":"की बदला","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"की सेटिंग्ज संपादकात बदला. दोन्ही मोडसाठी स्वयंचलित टाइलिंग आणि स्नॅप बार किंवा स्क्रीनच्या कडा लागतात.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"त्या “कीबोर्ड शॉर्टकट” पानावर बदला. स्वयंचलित टाइलिंगमध्ये विंडो क्रमातही जागा बदलतात.","Choose…":"निवडा…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"निवडण्यासाठी क्षेत्रावर क्लिक करा · विभागण्यासाठी डबल-क्लिक करा · विभाजक ओढा","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"मोड बदलण्यासाठी क्लिक करा किंवा %1 दाबा.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"क्लिक करा, मग OK – सेटिंग्ज संपादक उघडतो.","Close":"बंद करा","Close by, the edges stick together":"जवळ आल्यावर कडा चिकटतात","Color scheme":"रंगयोजना","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"स्नॅप बारचे रंग, आकार आणि आकृती.","Columns":"स्तंभ","Corner radius":"कोपऱ्यांची त्रिज्या","Corner size":"कोपऱ्याचा आकार","Corner: a quarter":"कोपरा: एक चतुर्थांश","Corners: quarter of the screen":"कोपरे: स्क्रीनचा चतुर्थांश","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + की (डीफॉल्ट)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + अंक पॅड","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + की","Custom color":"स्वतःचा रंग","Custom layout %1":"स्वतःची मांडणी %1","Dark":"गडद","Delay before hiding":"लपवण्यापूर्वी विलंब","Delay before showing":"दाखवण्यापूर्वी विलंब","Delete":"हटवा","Delete layout?":"मांडणी हटवायची?","Distance at which the handle appears":"हँडल दिसण्याचे अंतर","Distance before the bar hides again":"बार पुन्हा लपण्यापूर्वीचे अंतर","Distance to the edge":"कडेपासून अंतर","Donate with PayPal":"PayPal ने देणगी द्या","Drag a shared edge…":"सामायिक कड ओढा…","Drag a window against an edge…":"विंडो कडेकडे ओढा…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"अदलाबदलीसाठी एक विंडो दुसरीवर ओढा. स्नॅप बार किंवा स्क्रीनच्या कडेवर सोडल्यास ती मोकळी तरंगते; „विंडोला तरंगू द्या“ तिला परत आणते. अंतर सामान्य पानावरून येते.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"विंडो दुसरीच्या मध्यावर ओढा – पूर्वावलोकनात दोन बाण दिसतात – आणि सोडा. स्वयंचलित टाइलिंगमध्ये दुसऱ्या विंडोवर कुठेही चालते.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"खिडकी स्क्रीनच्या वरच्या कडेपर्यंत ओढा आणि एखाद्या क्षेत्रावर सोडा.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"स्नॅप बारमधील क्रम बदलण्यासाठी कार्ड ओढा. संपादित करण्यासाठी कार्डवर डबल-क्लिक करा.","Drop a window onto another one":"विंडो दुसऱ्यावर सोडा","Drop the window onto a zone":"खिडकी एखाद्या क्षेत्रावर सोडा","Duplicate":"प्रत बनवा","Duration":"कालावधी","Dwindle":"ड्विंडल","Dynamic":"गतिशील","Edges and corners":"कडा आणि कोपरे","Edit":"संपादित करा","Edit layout":"मांडणी संपादित करा","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"प्रत्येक वैशिष्ट्य स्वतंत्रपणे चालू आणि बंद करता येते.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"मांडण्या पानावर बनवलेली प्रत्येक मांडणी विंडोही लावू शकते – ती वर दिसते. विंडो 1 ला क्षेत्र 1 मिळते, असेच पुढे; जास्तीच्या विंडो शेवटचे क्षेत्र वाटून घेतात. क्षेत्रांपेक्षा कमी विंडो असल्यास „मुख्य आणि ढीग“ वापरले जाते, म्हणजे रिकाम्या जागा राहत नाहीत.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"प्रत्येक विंडो आपली जागा स्वतः शोधते, टाइलिंग विंडो व्यवस्थापकासारखी.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"प्रत्येक विंडो स्क्रीनवर आपली जागा स्वतः शोधते. नवीन विंडो सामील होतात, बंद झालेल्या इतरांसाठी जागा करतात.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"उदाहरण: दोन विंडो शेजारी, तीनपासून मुख्य आणि ढीग, पाचपासून ग्रिड. जुळणारा नियम नसल्यास वर निवडलेली मांडणी वापरली जाते.","Fade in and out":"येताना-जाताना फिकट करा","Fade the other windows":"इतर खिडक्या फिकट करा","Features":"वैशिष्ट्ये","Feel":"अनुभव","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"आधीच स्नॅप केलेल्या खिडक्यांभोवती बसवा","Fits the way you work.":"तुमच्या कामाच्या पद्धतीशी जुळते.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"विंडोला तरंगू द्या (टाइलिंग सोडा)","Four quarters":"चार चतुर्थांश","From":"पासून","Fullscreen":"पूर्ण स्क्रीन","Gap between windows":"खिडक्यांमधील अंतर","Gap to the screen edge":"स्क्रीनच्या कडेपासून अंतर","General":"सामान्य","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"प्रत्येक क्रियेला पुन्हा निवडलेल्या योजनेची की देते आणि योजनेत नसलेल्या की काढते.","Good to know":"माहीत असावे","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"खिडकी तिच्या शीर्षक पट्टीने धरून वर ओढा. स्नॅप बार खाली सरकतो; खिडकी एखाद्या क्षेत्रावर सोडा आणि ती नेमके तेच क्षेत्र व्यापेल. पुन्हा बाहेर ओढल्यावर तिला जुना आकार परत मिळतो.","Grab window A…":"विंडो A धरा…","Grid":"ग्रिड","Halves":"अर्धे-अर्धे","Hiding":"लपवणे","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"मोकळी जागा भरण्यासाठी कडेला धरून ठेवा","Hold time":"धरून ठेवण्याचा वेळ","Hold to fill":"भरण्यासाठी धरून ठेवा","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"कडा जागी बसण्यापूर्वी किती जवळ यावी लागते.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"कर्सरला कडेच्या किती जवळ यावे लागते.","How far the bar slides down":"बार किती खाली सरकतो","How it works":"हे कसे काम करते","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"खिडकीला कडेला किती वेळ टेकून राहावे लागते – हलका धक्का. 0 = लगेच.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"वाढण्यापूर्वी खिडकीला कडेला किती वेळ राहावे लागते.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"किती विंडो मुख्य क्षेत्र वाटून घेतात (मांडणी “मुख्य आणि ढीग”).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"खाली आधीच खिडकी असेल तर वरची कडा कमाल करण्याऐवजी वरचा अर्धा भाग देते. अर्धे आणि चतुर्थांश भागही स्नॅप केलेल्या खिडक्या उघड्या ठेवतात.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"KSnapUnity आवडत असल्यास, तुम्ही त्याच्या विकासाला पाठिंबा देऊ शकता – धन्यवाद!","In bar":"बारमध्ये","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"स्नॅप बार आणि स्क्रीनच्या कडांपासून स्वतंत्र.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"स्नॅप बारपासून स्वतंत्र. प्रत्येक कडा स्वतंत्रपणे चालू करता येते.","Information":"माहिती","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"सहज, नैसर्गिक विंडो वर्तन.","Join at the end":"शेवटी सामील होतात","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K म्हणजे KWin · Snap म्हणजे अधिक हुशार स्नॅपिंग · Unity म्हणजे सर्व काही एका प्रणालीत","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE च्या स्वतःच्या स्क्रीन-कडा क्रिया आणि खिडकी स्नॅपिंग आहेत. इथे तेच वैशिष्ट्य चालू असेल तर KDE चे बंद करा: सिस्टम सेटिंग्ज → खिडकी व्यवस्थापन → स्क्रीनच्या कडा, आणि खिडकी वर्तन → हलवणे.","KDE's own edge tiling":"KDE चे स्वतःचे कडा टाइलिंग","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"कडांवरील KDE चे स्वतःचे मोठे करणे आणि टाइलिंग – रूपरेषेसह – KSnapUnity चालू असेपर्यंत थांबते, म्हणजे एकच पूर्वावलोकन दिसते. तुमची KDE सेटिंग्ज बदलत नाहीत: हे बंद करा, KSnapUnity निष्क्रिय करा किंवा काढा आणि KDE चे वर्तन परत येते.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"KDE च्या स्वतःच्या स्क्रीन-कडा क्रिया अजून चालू आहेत, त्यामुळे एकाच ओढण्याला दोन मदतनीस प्रतिसाद देतात. सिस्टम सेटिंग्ज → खिडकी व्यवस्थापन → स्क्रीनच्या कडा मध्ये “कमाल करा” आणि “टाइल” बंद करा.","KDE's own window snapping":"KDE चे स्वतःचे खिडकी स्नॅपिंग","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE चे स्वतःचे खिडकी स्नॅपिंगही चालू आहे. एकसारख्या अनुभवासाठी सिस्टम सेटिंग्ज → खिडकी व्यवस्थापन → खिडकी वर्तन → हलवणे मध्ये त्याचे क्षेत्र “काहीही नाही” वर ठेवा.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"KDE च्या शॉर्टकट सेवेने उत्तर दिले नाही. तुम्ही की सिस्टम सेटिंग्ज → शॉर्टकट → KWin मध्येही सेट करू शकता.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – सेटिंग्ज संपादक","Keep stacked windows in line":"एकावर एक खिडक्या एका रेषेत ठेवा","Keep the gap between windows":"खिडक्यांमधील अंतर ठेवा","Keep them":"तशाच ठेवा","Key scheme":"की योजना","Keyboard shortcuts":"कीबोर्ड शॉर्टकट","Keys":"की","Keys already in use":"आधीच वापरात असलेल्या की","Layout":"मांडणी","Layout by number of windows":"विंडोंच्या संख्येनुसार मांडणी","Layouts":"मांडण्या","Layouts per row":"प्रति ओळ मांडण्या","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"डावी आणि उजवी कडा: अर्धी स्क्रीन","Left edge: left half":"डावी कड: डावा अर्धा भाग","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"100 % पेक्षा कमी असल्यास एकटी विंडो मध्यभागी राहते – रुंद स्क्रीनवर छान.","License":"परवाना","Light":"फिकट","Linear":"रेषीय","Live preview":"थेट पूर्वावलोकन","Load template…":"साचा लोड करा…","Magnet":"चुंबक","Main + stack":"मुख्य + ढीग","Main and stack":"मुख्य आणि ढीग","Main area bigger":"मोठे मुख्य क्षेत्र","Main area on the right":"मुख्य क्षेत्र उजवीकडे","Main area smaller":"लहान मुख्य क्षेत्र","Main in the middle":"मध्यभागी मुख्य","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"ओढणे आणि कींसाठी मुख्य स्विच.","Main window":"मुख्य विंडो","Main windows":"मुख्य विंडो","Main windows: %1":"मुख्य विंडो: %1","Make it the main window":"मुख्य विंडो करा","Maximize":"कमाल करा","Maximize or restore":"कमाल करा किंवा पुनर्संचयित करा","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + की (KDE शैली)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + की","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + की","Minimize":"लहान करा","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"मांडणी उलटते: मुख्य विंडो उजवीकडे, बाकी डावीकडे.","Mode":"मोड","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"मोड 1 – स्नॅप बार आणि स्क्रीनच्या कडा","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"मोड 2 – स्वयंचलित टाइलिंग","Modes":"मोड","More ways":"आणखी मार्ग","Motion curve":"हालचालीचा वक्र","Move a window towards others…":"विंडो इतरांकडे न्या…","Move the window one place back":"विंडो एक जागा मागे न्या","Move the window one place on":"विंडो एक जागा पुढे न्या","Name:":"नाव:","New layout":"नवी मांडणी","New windows":"नवीन विंडो","Next tiling layout":"पुढील टाइलिंग मांडणी","Next to the active window":"सक्रिय विंडोच्या शेजारी","No key":"की नाही","No other window open":"दुसरी कोणतीही विंडो उघडी नाही","No outer margin":"बाहेरचा समास नाही","No shortcuts":"शॉर्टकट नाहीत","None":"काहीही नाही","None yet.":"अजून काहीच नाही.","Off":"बंद","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"बंद = मोड 1, चालू = मोड 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"बंद: तटस्थ चौकट – फक्त चालू असलेल्या पूर्वावलोकनांसाठी.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"बंद: की नेमलेल्या राहतात, पण काही करत नाहीत.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"बंद: विंडो तुम्ही ठेवता तिथेच राहतात. इतर वैशिष्ट्ये कोणत्याही प्रकारे काम करतात.","One at a time":"एकावेळी एक","One closes – the others fill the gap":"एक बंद होते – बाकी रिकामी जागा भरतात","One main window less":"एक मुख्य विंडो कमी","One more main window":"आणखी एक मुख्य विंडो","One window":"एक विंडो","Only one mode is switched on.":"फक्त एकच मोड चालू आहे.","Open settings editor":"सेटिंग्ज संपादक उघडा","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"आधी ॲप उघडा, मग इथे निवडा.","Open the layout builder":"मांडणी बिल्डर उघडा","Own layouts":"स्वतःच्या मांडण्या","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"प्रत्येक बाजूचा कोपरा म्हणून मोजला जाणारा भाग.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"KDE चे कडा टाइलिंग आणि त्याचे पूर्वावलोकन थांबवा","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"चुंबक चालू असताना KDE चे स्नॅप झोन थांबवा","Preview":"पूर्वावलोकन","Previews":"पूर्वावलोकने","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"खिडकी स्क्रीनच्या कडेला किंवा कोपऱ्याला ढकला, ती तो भाग भरते. स्नॅप बारसह किंवा त्याशिवाय काम करते.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"खिडकी कडेला किंवा कोपऱ्याला ढकला: कमाल, अर्धे, चतुर्थांश.","Push delay":"ढकलण्याचा विलंब","Quarters":"चतुर्थांश","Quick":"जलद","Quick settings":"जलद सेटिंग्ज","Recommended values":"शिफारस केलेली मूल्ये","Remove":"काढा","Remove rule":"नियम काढा","Remove zone":"क्षेत्र काढा","Reset all":"सर्व रीसेट करा","Reset all keys":"सर्व की रीसेट करा","Reset to default":"डीफॉल्टवर परत आणा","Resistance against overlapping":"आच्छादनाविरुद्ध प्रतिकार","Resize touching windows together":"एकमेकींना स्पर्श करणाऱ्या खिडक्यांचा आकार एकत्र बदला","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"आकार बदलतानाही चिकटते – इथे पूर्ण उंचीपर्यंत","Restore":"पूर्वस्थितीत आणा","Restore default layouts":"मूलभूत मांडण्या पूर्वस्थितीत आणा","Restore default layouts?":"मूलभूत मांडण्या पूर्वस्थितीत आणायच्या?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"खिडकी बाहेर ओढल्यावर मूळ आकार परत आणा","Restore the size before snapping":"स्नॅपपूर्वीचा आकार पुनर्संचयित करा","Rows":"ओळी","Save":"जतन करा","Screen edges":"स्क्रीनच्या कडा","Screen edges on/off":"स्क्रीनच्या कडा चालू/बंद","Screen edges preview":"स्क्रीनच्या कडांचे पूर्वावलोकन","Set":"सेट करा","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"सर्व क्रियांच्या की एकाच वेळी सेट करते. वेगवेगळ्या की खाली अजूनही बदलता येतात.","Settings":"सेटिंग्ज","Settings file":"सेटिंग्ज फाइल","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"आकार बदलताना माउस वेगाने पुढे-मागे हलवा आणि इतर विंडो परत येतात. एका दिशेतील वेगवान ओढ त्यांना कधीच सोडत नाही.","Shake to let go":"सोडण्यासाठी हलवा","Shortcuts":"शॉर्टकट","Show a small handle first":"आधी एक छोटे हँडल दाखवा","Show layout and zone names":"मांडणी आणि क्षेत्रांची नावे दाखवा","Show previews in the accent color":"पूर्वावलोकने अ‍ॅक्सेंट रंगात दाखवा","Showing":"दाखवणे","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"कडेला किंवा कोपऱ्यात खिडकी कुठे बसेल ते दाखवते. बंद: कोणतेही पूर्वावलोकन नाही.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"स्नॅप बारमधील झोन हायलाइट असताना खिडकी कुठे बसेल ते दाखवते. बंद: कोणतेही पूर्वावलोकन नाही.","Sidebar + grid":"बाजूपट्टी + जाळी","Single zone":"एकच क्षेत्र","Six tiles":"सहा फरशा","Size & shape":"आकार आणि आकृती","Size of the main area":"मुख्य क्षेत्राचा आकार","Slide-in duration":"आत येण्याचा कालावधी","Slide-out duration":"बाहेर जाण्याचा कालावधी","Smart arranging and detection.":"हुशार मांडणी आणि ओळख.","Smart fill":"स्मार्ट भरणे","Smooth (default)":"सहज (मूलभूत)","Snap bar":"स्नॅप बार","Snap bar and screen edges":"स्नॅप बार आणि स्क्रीनच्या कडा","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"स्नॅप बार आणि कडा बंद आहेत – फक्त मोड 2 चालतो आणि मोड शॉर्टकट काहीच करत नाही.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"स्नॅप बार आणि स्क्रीनच्या कडा स्वयंचलित टाइलिंगमध्ये अडथळा आणतात. म्हणून त्या दोन मोडमध्ये चालतात – शॉर्टकटने किंवा इथून बदला.","Snap bar colors:":"स्नॅप बारचे रंग:","Snap bar on/off":"स्नॅप बार चालू/बंद","Snap bar preview":"स्नॅप बारचे पूर्वावलोकन","Snap bar size":"स्नॅप बारचा आकार","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"स्नॅप बार, स्क्रीनच्या कडा, खिडकी चुंबक, शॉर्टकट आणि विंडो अदलाबदल.","Snap distance":"स्नॅप अंतर","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"विभाजक स्नॅप करा (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"स्नॅप मांडण्या आणि स्वयंचलित टाइलिंग.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"सक्रिय खिडकी की संयोजनांनी स्नॅप करा.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"सक्रिय खिडकी कीबोर्डने स्नॅप करा. हे सामान्य KDE जागतिक शॉर्टकट आहेत – ते सिस्टम सेटिंग्ज → शॉर्टकट → KWin मध्येही मिळतात.","Snap to the bottom half":"खालच्या अर्ध्या भागात स्नॅप करा","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"खाली-डाव्या चतुर्थांशात स्नॅप करा","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"खाली-उजव्या चतुर्थांशात स्नॅप करा","Snap to the center third":"मधल्या तृतीयांशात स्नॅप करा","Snap to the left half":"डाव्या अर्ध्या भागात स्नॅप करा","Snap to the left third":"डाव्या तृतीयांशात स्नॅप करा","Snap to the left two thirds":"डाव्या दोन-तृतीयांशात स्नॅप करा","Snap to the right half":"उजव्या अर्ध्या भागात स्नॅप करा","Snap to the right third":"उजव्या तृतीयांशात स्नॅप करा","Snap to the right two thirds":"उजव्या दोन-तृतीयांशात स्नॅप करा","Snap to the top half":"वरच्या अर्ध्या भागात स्नॅप करा","Snap to the top-left quarter":"वर-डाव्या चतुर्थांशात स्नॅप करा","Snap to the top-right quarter":"वर-उजव्या चतुर्थांशात स्नॅप करा","Snapping":"स्नॅपिंग","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"स्नॅपिंग आणि स्वयंचलित टाइलिंग दोन मोडमध्ये चालतात – एक शॉर्टकट त्यांच्यात बदलतो.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"अशा प्रकारे फक्त एकच चुंबक विंडो ओढतो. तुमची KDE सेटिंग्ज बदलत नाहीत: हे बंद करा, KSnapUnity निष्क्रिय करा किंवा काढा आणि KDE चे स्नॅपिंग परत येते.","Soft":"मृदू","Spacing":"अंतर","Spiral":"सर्पिल","Split side by side":"शेजारी-शेजारी विभागा","Split top and bottom":"वर-खाली विभागा","Stack + main":"ढीग + मुख्य","Stick to other windows":"इतर खिडक्यांना चिकटा","Stick to the screen edges":"स्क्रीनच्या कडांना चिकटा","Sticky edges":"चिकटणाऱ्या कडा","Support KSnapUnity":"KSnapUnity ला पाठिंबा द्या","Swap":"अदलाबदल","Swap windows":"विंडो अदलाबदल","Swap with the window above":"वरच्या विंडोशी अदलाबदल","Swap with the window below":"खालच्या विंडोशी अदलाबदल","Swap with the window on the left":"डावीकडील विंडोशी अदलाबदल","Swap with the window on the right":"उजवीकडील विंडोशी अदलाबदल","Switch mode":"मोड बदला","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"मोड बदला (स्नॅपिंग / टाइलिंग)","Switch modes with:":"मोड बदलण्याची की:","Switch the layout by itself":"मांडणी आपोआप बदला","Switched off":"बंद","System":"प्रणाली","Take it over":"ताब्यात घ्या","Take over all":"सर्व ताब्यात घ्या","Take the main place":"मुख्य जागा घेतात","Test animation":"ॲनिमेशनची चाचणी करा","Test on screen":"स्क्रीनवर चाचणी करा","Test the snap bar":"स्नॅप बार चाचणी करा","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"मूलभूत मूल्ये Windows 11 वर आधारित आहेत.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"स्नॅप क्रिया स्नॅप बारसारखीच अंतरे वापरतात आणि स्नॅप करण्यापूर्वीचा आकार लक्षात ठेवतात: “स्नॅपपूर्वीचा आकार पुनर्संचयित करा” तो परत आणते.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"ही ॲप्स कधीच लावली जात नाहीत आणि स्वतःची जागा ठेवतात. संवाद नेहमी तरंगतात.","Thirds":"तृतीयांश","Three columns":"तीन स्तंभ","Thumbnail width":"थंबनेलची रुंदी","Tiling":"टाइलिंग","Tip":"टीप","Top / bottom":"वर / खाली","Top edge":"वरची कडा","Top edge: full screen":"वरची कड: पूर्ण स्क्रीन","Top edge: maximize":"वरची कड: मोठे करा","Top edge: top half":"वरची कड: वरचा अर्धा भाग","Top half":"वरचा अर्धा भाग","Trigger distance from the top edge":"वरच्या कडेपासून ट्रिगर अंतर","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"तुम्हाला KDE ची स्वतःची रूपरेषा आवडत असेल तर हे बंद करा – मग वर स्क्रीनच्या कडांचे पूर्वावलोकन बंद करा.","Two thirds":"दोन तृतीयांश","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"दोन विंडो जागा बदलतात – एक दुसरीवर सोडा किंवा की वापरा.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"दोन विंडो जागा बदलतात: एक दुसरीवर सोडा, किंवा कीने.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"कीबोर्ड शॉर्टकट वापरा","Use screen edges":"स्क्रीनच्या कडा वापरा","Use the system accent color":"प्रणालीचा ॲक्सेंट रंग वापरा","Use the window magnet":"खिडकी चुंबक वापरा","Usual combinations":"नेहमीची संयोजने","Version":"आवृत्ती","Wanted for: %1":"यासाठी हवी: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"विंडो उघडताना, बंद होताना किंवा अदलाबदल होताना बाकीच्या उड्या न मारता सहज हलतात.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"खिडकीचा आकार बदलताना तिला स्पर्श करणाऱ्या खिडक्या सामायिक कडा सोबत हलवतात – काहीही आच्छादित होत नाही, फट पडत नाही.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"आकार बदलताना सोबत न येणाऱ्या खिडक्या पारदर्शक दिसतात.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"खिडकी हलवताना किंवा तिचा आकार बदलताना तिच्या कडा जवळच्या खिडक्यांना आणि स्क्रीनच्या कडांना चिकटतात.","Width":"रुंदी","Window":"खिडकी","Window magnet":"खिडकी चुंबक","Window magnet on/off":"खिडकी चुंबक चालू/बंद","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"एकावर एक असलेल्या खिडक्या डाव्या आणि उजव्या कडा एकत्र ठेवतात, शेजारच्या खिडक्या वरच्या आणि खालच्या.","Windows glide to their place":"विंडो सहजपणे जागी सरकतात","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"खिडक्या एकमेकींना आणि स्क्रीनच्या कडांना चिकटतात.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"खिडक्या एकमेकींना न टेकता सामान्य पानावरील “खिडक्यांमधील अंतर” वर थांबतात.","Yes":"हो","Your own combination":"तुमचे स्वतःचे संयोजन","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"तुमच्या स्वतःच्या मांडण्या आणि त्यांचा क्रम हरवेल.","Zone %1":"क्षेत्र %1","for KWin · v%1":"KWin साठी · v%1","windows:":"विंडो:","“%1” will be removed.":"\"%1\" काढली जाईल.","…drag it onto window B…":"…ती विंडो B वर ओढा…","…in every direction":"…प्रत्येक दिशेने","…let go: they trade places":"…सोडा: त्या जागा बदलतात","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…शेजारी तिच्यासोबत वाढतात आणि कमी होतात","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ तयार – सेटिंग्ज संपादक उघडण्यासाठी OK क्लिक करा."},"ms":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (salinan)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 digunakan oleh “%2”.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 daripada %2 zon","0 = all in one row":"0 = semua dalam satu baris","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Mod 1</b><br/>Bar lekap dan tepi skrin","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Mod 2</b><br/>Tata ubin otomatis","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Tetingkap tunggal menggunakan seluruh skrin, walaupun jidar ditetapkan.","A new window joins":"Tetingkap baharu menyertai","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Tolakan pendek memberi separuh atau suku. Tahan tetingkap di tepi lebih lama sedikit dan ia membesar hingga tetingkap seterusnya – pratonton menunjukkannya.","A single window":"Satu tetingkap sahaja","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Tetingkap berhenti di tepi tetingkap lain, juga saat anda memindahkannya dengan pantas. Goncangkan tetikus atau terus dorong sekejap untuk melepasnya. 0 = tetingkap boleh bertindih bebas.","About & Help":"Perihal & bantuan","Accent color":"Warna aksen","Active":"Aktif","Active mode":"Mod aktif","Active width along the top edge":"Lebar aktif sepanjang tepi atas","Add an open application":"Tambah aplikasi yang terbuka","Add rule":"Tambah peraturan","All window features in one system.":"Semua ciri tetingkap dalam satu sistem.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Juga berubah saat anda mengubah ukuran tetingkap utama secara manual.","Also while resizing":"Juga semasa mengubah saiz","Always floating":"Sentiasa terapung","Animation":"Animasi","Appearance":"Penampilan","Apply":"Guna","Arrange windows":"Atur tetingkap","Arrange windows automatically":"Atur tetingkap secara otomatis","Author":"Pengarang","Automatic tiling":"Tata ubin otomatis","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Tata ubin otomatis dimatikan – hanya mod 1 berjalan dan pintasan mod tidak berbuat apa-apa.","Automatic tiling off":"Tata ubin otomatis mati","Automatic tiling on":"Tata ubin otomatis hidup","Automatic tiling on/off":"Tata ubin otomatis hidup/mati","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Tata ubin otomatis, tukar tetingkap, pintasan dan magnet untuk tetingkap terapung.","Background opacity":"Kelegapan latar belakang","Behavior & Animation":"Kelakuan & animasi","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Tepi bawah: separuh bawah","Bouncy":"Melantun","Buy me a coffee":"Belanja saya kopi","Cancel":"Batal","Center focus":"Fokus tengah","Center the window":"Tengahkan tetingkap","Change":"Ubah","Change key":"Tukar kekunci","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Kekunci ditukar dalam penyunting tetapan. Kedua-dua mod memerlukan tata ubin otomatis dan bar lekap atau tepi skrin.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Ubah di halaman Pintasan papan kekunci. Dengan tata ubin otomatis, tetingkap juga bertukar tempat dalam urutan.","Choose…":"Pilih…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Klik zon untuk memilihnya · klik dua kali untuk membahagi · seret pemisah","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Klik atau tekan %1 untuk menukar mod.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Klik, kemudian OK – penyunting tetapan dibuka.","Close":"Tutup","Close by, the edges stick together":"Apabila dekat, tepinya melekat","Color scheme":"Skema warna","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Warna, saiz dan bentuk bar.","Columns":"Kolom","Corner radius":"Jejari bucu","Corner size":"Saiz penjuru","Corner: a quarter":"Sudut: suku","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Penjuru: suku skrin","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + kekunci (lalai)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + pad nombor","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + kekunci","Custom color":"Warna tersuai","Custom layout %1":"Susun atur tersuai %1","Dark":"Gelap","Delay before hiding":"Lengah sebelum disembunyikan","Delay before showing":"Lengah sebelum dipaparkan","Delete":"Padam","Delete layout?":"Padam susun atur?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Jarak pemegang muncul","Distance before the bar hides again":"Jarak sebelum bar bersembunyi semula","Distance to the edge":"Jarak ke tepi","Donate with PayPal":"Derma dengan PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"Seret tepi yang dikongsi…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Seret tetingkap ke tepi…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Seret tetingkap ke atas yang lain untuk menukarnya. Jika dilepaskan pada bar atau tepi skrin, ia terapung bebas; „Biarkan tetingkap melayang“ mengembalikannya. Jarak datang dari halaman Umum.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Seret tetingkap ke atas tengah tetingkap lain – pratonton menunjukkan dua anak panah – dan lepaskan. Dengan tata ubin otomatis, di mana-mana atas tetingkap lain sudah memadai.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Seret tetingkap ke tepi atas skrin dan lepaskan pada zon.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Seret kad untuk menukar susunan dalam bar. Klik dua kali pada kad untuk menyuntingnya.","Drop a window onto another one":"Lepaskan tetingkap ke tetingkap lain","Drop the window onto a zone":"Lepaskan tetingkap pada zon","Duplicate":"Pendua","Duration":"Tempoh","Dwindle":"Lingkaran ke dalam","Dynamic":"Dinamik","Edges and corners":"Tepi dan penjuru","Edit":"Sunting","Edit layout":"Sunting susun atur","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Setiap fitur bisa dihidupkan dan dimatikan sendiri-sendiri.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Setiap susun atur yang anda bina di halaman Susun atur juga boleh menyusun tetingkap – ia muncul di atas. Tetingkap 1 mendapat zon 1 dan seterusnya; tetingkap tambahan berkongsi zon terakhir. Jika tetingkap kurang daripada zon, „Utama dan tumpukan“ digunakan supaya tiada lubang.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Setiap tetingkap menemukan tempatnya sendiri, seperti di pengelola tetingkap tata ubin.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Setiap tetingkap menemukan tempatnya di layar sendiri. Tetingkap baru ikut bergabung, yang ditutup memberi ruang bagi yang lain.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Contoh: dua tetingkap bersebelahan, dari tiga utama dan tumpukan, dari lima kisi. Tanpa peraturan yang sepadan, susun atur yang dipilih di atas digunakan.","Fade in and out":"Pudar ketika masuk dan keluar","Fade the other windows":"Malapkan tetingkap lain","Features":"Ciri","Feel":"Rasa","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Sesuaikan dengan tetingkap yang sudah dilekap","Fits the way you work.":"Sesuai dengan cara anda bekerja.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Biarkan tetingkap melayang (keluar dari tata ubin)","Four quarters":"Empat suku","From":"Dari","Fullscreen":"Skrin penuh","Gap between windows":"Jarak antara tetingkap","Gap to the screen edge":"Jarak ke tepi skrin","General":"Umum","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Memberi setiap tindakan kekunci skema yang dipilih semula dan membuang kekunci yang tiada dalam skema.","Good to know":"Bagus untuk tahu","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Pegang tetingkap pada bar tajuknya dan seret ke atas. Bar akan turun; lepaskan tetingkap pada zon dan ia mengisi tepat kawasan itu. Seret keluar semula dan saiz lamanya kembali.","Grab window A…":"Pegang tetingkap A…","Grid":"Kisi","Halves":"Separuh","Hiding":"Penyembunyian","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Tahan di tepi untuk mengisi ruang kosong","Hold time":"Masa tahan","Hold to fill":"Tahan untuk mengisi","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Sedekat mana tepi perlu datang sebelum ia terkunci di tempatnya.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Sedekat mana kursor perlu sampai ke tepi.","How far the bar slides down":"Sejauh mana bar turun","How it works":"Cara ia berfungsi","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Berapa lama tetingkap perlu berada pada tepi – tolakan kecil. 0 = serta-merta.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Berapa lama tetingkap perlu kekal di tepi sebelum membesar.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Berapa tetingkap yang berbagi area utama (tata letak “Utama dan tumpukan”).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Jika sudah ada tetingkap di bawah, tepi atas memberi separuh atas dan bukan memaksimumkan. Separuh dan suku juga membiarkan tetingkap yang dilekap kekal kelihatan.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Jika anda suka KSnapUnity, anda boleh menyokong pembangunannya – terima kasih!","In bar":"Dalam bar","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Bebas daripada bar lekap dan tepi skrin.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Bebas daripada bar lekap. Setiap tepi boleh dihidupkan sendiri.","Information":"Maklumat","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Tingkah laku tetingkap yang intuitif dan semula jadi.","Join at the end":"Menyertai di hujung","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K untuk KWin · Snap untuk lekapan lebih bijak · Unity untuk semuanya dalam satu sistem","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE ada tindakan tepi skrin sendiri dan pelekapan tetingkap sendiri. Jika ciri yang sama hidup di sini, matikan ciri KDE: Tetapan Sistem → Pengurusan Tetingkap → Tepi Skrin, dan Kelakuan Tetingkap → Pergerakan.","KDE's own edge tiling":"Jubin tepi milik KDE","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"Pemaksimuman dan tata ubin KDE sendiri di tepi skrin – dengan garis luarnya – dijeda semasa KSnapUnity berjalan, supaya hanya satu pratonton muncul. Tetapan KDE anda tidak berubah: matikan ini, nyahdayakan atau buang KSnapUnity dan tingkah laku KDE kembali.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"Tindakan tepi skrin KDE sendiri masih hidup, jadi dua pembantu bertindak balas pada seretan yang sama. Matikan “Maksimumkan” dan “Jubin” dalam Tetapan Sistem → Pengurusan Tetingkap → Tepi Skrin.","KDE's own window snapping":"Snap tetingkap milik KDE","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"Pelekapan tetingkap KDE sendiri juga hidup. Untuk rasa yang seragam, tetapkan zonnya kepada “Tiada” dalam Tetapan Sistem → Pengurusan Tetingkap → Kelakuan Tetingkap → Pergerakan.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Perkhidmatan pintasan KDE tidak menjawab. Anda masih boleh menetapkan kekunci dalam Tetapan Sistem → Pintasan → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – Penyunting tetapan","Keep stacked windows in line":"Kekalkan tetingkap bertindan sejajar","Keep the gap between windows":"Kekalkan jarak antara tetingkap","Keep them":"Biarkan","Key scheme":"Skema kekunci","Keyboard shortcuts":"Pintasan papan kekunci","Keys":"Butang","Keys already in use":"Kekunci yang sudah digunakan","Layout":"Tata letak","Layout by number of windows":"Susun atur mengikut bilangan tetingkap","Layouts":"Susun atur","Layouts per row":"Susun atur setiap baris","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Tepi kiri dan kanan: separuh skrin","Left edge: left half":"Tepi kiri: separuh kiri","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Di bawah 100 % tetingkap tunggal kekal di tengah – cantik pada skrin lebar.","License":"Lesen","Light":"Cerah","Live preview":"Pratonton langsung","Load template…":"Muatkan templat…","Main + stack":"Utama + timbunan","Main and stack":"Utama dan tumpukan","Main area bigger":"Area utama lebih besar","Main area on the right":"Kawasan utama di kanan","Main area smaller":"Area utama lebih kecil","Main in the middle":"Utama di tengah","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Suis utama untuk seretan dan kekunci.","Main window":"Tetingkap utama","Main windows":"Tetingkap utama (jumlah)","Main windows: %1":"Tetingkap utama: %1","Make it the main window":"Jadikan tetingkap utama","Maximize":"Maksimumkan","Maximize or restore":"Maksimumkan atau pulihkan","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + kekunci (gaya KDE)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + kekunci","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + kekunci","Minimize":"Minimumkan","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Mencerminkan susun atur: tetingkap utama di kanan, yang lain di kiri.","Mode":"Mod","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Mod 1 – Bar lekap dan tepi skrin","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Mod 2 – Tata ubin otomatis","Modes":"Mod","More ways":"Lebih banyak cara","Motion curve":"Lengkung gerakan","Move a window towards others…":"Dekatkan tetingkap kepada yang lain…","Move the window one place back":"Alih tetingkap satu tempat ke belakang","Move the window one place on":"Alih tetingkap satu tempat ke depan","Name:":"Nama:","New layout":"Susun atur baharu","New windows":"Tetingkap baharu","Next tiling layout":"Tata letak ubin berikutnya","Next to the active window":"Di sebelah tetingkap aktif","No key":"Tiada kekunci","No other window open":"Tiada tetingkap lain yang terbuka","No outer margin":"Tiada jidar luar","No shortcuts":"Tiada pintasan","None":"Tiada","None yet.":"Belum ada.","Off":"Mati","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Mati = mod 1, hidup = mod 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Mati: bingkai neutral – hanya untuk pratonton yang dihidupkan.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Mati: kekunci kekal ditetapkan tetapi tidak berbuat apa-apa.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Mati: tetingkap tetap di tempat anda meletakkannya. Fitur lain tetap berfungsi.","One at a time":"Satu per satu","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Satu ditutup – yang lain mengisi ruang","One main window less":"Kurang satu tetingkap utama","One more main window":"Satu tetingkap utama lagi","One window":"Satu tetingkap","Only one mode is switched on.":"Hanya satu mod dihidupkan.","Open settings editor":"Buka penyunting tetapan","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Buka aplikasi dahulu, kemudian pilih di sini.","Open the layout builder":"Buka pembina susun atur","Own layouts":"Susun atur sendiri","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Bahagian setiap sisi yang dikira sebagai penjuru.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Jeda jubin tepi KDE dan pratontonnya","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Jeda zon snap KDE semasa magnet dihidupkan","Preview":"Pratonton","Previews":"Pratonton","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Tolak tetingkap ke tepi atau penjuru skrin dan ia mengisi bahagian itu. Berfungsi dengan atau tanpa bar lekap.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Tolak tetingkap ke tepi atau penjuru: maksimumkan, separuh, suku.","Push delay":"Lengah tolakan","Quarters":"Suku","Quick":"Pantas","Quick settings":"Tetapan pantas","Recommended values":"Nilai disyorkan","Remove":"Buang","Remove rule":"Buang peraturan","Remove zone":"Buang zon","Reset all":"Set semula semua","Reset all keys":"Set semula semua kekunci","Reset to default":"Set semula ke lalai","Resistance against overlapping":"Rintangan terhadap pertindihan","Resize touching windows together":"Ubah saiz tetingkap yang bersentuhan bersama-sama","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Mengubah saiz juga melekap – di sini ke ketinggian penuh","Restore":"Pulihkan","Restore default layouts":"Pulihkan susun atur lalai","Restore default layouts?":"Pulihkan susun atur lalai?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Pulihkan saiz asal apabila tetingkap diseret keluar","Restore the size before snapping":"Pulihkan saiz sebelum dilekap","Rows":"Baris","Save":"Simpan","Screen edges":"Tepi skrin","Screen edges on/off":"Tepi skrin hidup/mati","Screen edges preview":"Pratonton tepi skrin","Set":"Tetapkan","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Menetapkan kekunci semua tindakan sekali gus. Kekunci tunggal masih boleh diubah di bawah.","Settings":"Tetapan","Settings file":"Fail tetapan","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Goncangkan tetikus maju-mundur dengan pantas saat mengubah ukuran, dan tetingkap lain melompat kembali. Tarikan pantas ke satu arah tidak pernah melepasnya.","Shake to let go":"Goncang untuk melepaskan","Shortcuts":"Pintasan","Show a small handle first":"Tunjukkan pemegang kecil dahulu","Show layout and zone names":"Tunjukkan nama susun atur dan zon","Show previews in the accent color":"Tunjukkan pratonton dalam warna aksen","Showing":"Paparan","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Menunjukkan tempat tetingkap mendarat di tepi atau sudut. Mati: tiada pratonton langsung.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Menunjukkan tempat tetingkap mendarat semasa zon bar diserlahkan. Mati: tiada pratonton langsung.","Sidebar + grid":"Bar sisi + grid","Single zone":"Satu zon","Six tiles":"Enam jubin","Size & shape":"Saiz & bentuk","Size of the main area":"Ukuran area utama","Slide-in duration":"Tempoh masuk","Slide-out duration":"Tempoh keluar","Smart arranging and detection.":"Penyusunan dan pengesanan pintar.","Smart fill":"Isian pintar","Smooth (default)":"Lancar (lalai)","Snap bar":"Bar lekap","Snap bar and screen edges":"Bar lekap dan tepi skrin","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Bar lekap dan tepi skrin dimatikan – hanya mod 2 berjalan dan pintasan mod tidak berbuat apa-apa.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Bar lekap dan tepi skrin mengganggu tata ubin otomatis. Oleh itu ia berjalan sebagai dua mod – tukar dengan pintasan atau di sini.","Snap bar colors:":"Warna bar lekap:","Snap bar on/off":"Bar lekap hidup/mati","Snap bar preview":"Pratonton bar snap","Snap bar size":"Saiz bar","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Bar lekap, tepi skrin, magnet tetingkap, pintasan dan tukar tetingkap.","Snap distance":"Jarak lekap","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Lekapkan pemisah (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Susun atur lekap dan tata ubin otomatis.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Lekap tetingkap aktif dengan gabungan kekunci.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Lekap tetingkap aktif dengan papan kekunci. Ini pintasan global KDE biasa – anda juga boleh mencarinya dalam Tetapan Sistem → Pintasan → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Lekap ke separuh bawah","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Lekap ke suku kiri bawah","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Lekap ke suku kanan bawah","Snap to the center third":"Lekap ke satu pertiga tengah","Snap to the left half":"Lekap ke separuh kiri","Snap to the left third":"Lekap ke satu pertiga kiri","Snap to the left two thirds":"Lekap ke dua pertiga kiri","Snap to the right half":"Lekap ke separuh kanan","Snap to the right third":"Lekap ke satu pertiga kanan","Snap to the right two thirds":"Lekap ke dua pertiga kanan","Snap to the top half":"Lekap ke separuh atas","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Lekap ke suku kiri atas","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Lekap ke suku kanan atas","Snapping":"Lekapan","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Lekapan dan tata ubin otomatis berjalan sebagai dua mod – satu pintasan menukar antara keduanya.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Jadi hanya satu magnet menarik tetingkap. Tetapan KDE anda tidak berubah: matikan ini, nyahdayakan atau buang KSnapUnity dan lekapan KDE kembali.","Soft":"Lembut","Spacing":"Jarak","Split side by side":"Bahagi bersebelahan","Split top and bottom":"Bahagi atas dan bawah","Stack + main":"Timbunan + utama","Stick to other windows":"Lekat pada tetingkap lain","Stick to the screen edges":"Lekat pada tepi skrin","Sticky edges":"Tepi melekit","Support KSnapUnity":"Sokong KSnapUnity","Swap":"Tukar","Swap windows":"Tukar tetingkap","Swap with the window above":"Tukar dengan tetingkap di atas","Swap with the window below":"Tukar dengan tetingkap di bawah","Swap with the window on the left":"Tukar dengan tetingkap di kiri","Swap with the window on the right":"Tukar dengan tetingkap di kanan","Switch mode":"Tukar mod","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Tukar mod (lekap / tata ubin)","Switch modes with:":"Tukar mod dengan:","Switch the layout by itself":"Tukar susun atur sendiri","Switched off":"Dimatikan","System":"Sistem","Take it over":"Ambil alih","Take over all":"Ambil alih semua","Take the main place":"Mengambil tempat utama","Test animation":"Uji animasi","Test on screen":"Uji pada skrin","Test the snap bar":"Cuba bar lekap","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Nilai lalai berasaskan Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Tindakan lekap menggunakan jarak yang sama dengan bar dan mengingati saiz sebelum dilekap: “Pulihkan saiz sebelum dilekap” mengembalikannya.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Aplikasi ini tidak pernah disusun dan kekal di tempatnya. Dialog sentiasa terapung.","Thirds":"Satu pertiga","Three columns":"Tiga lajur","Thumbnail width":"Lebar lakaran kecil","Tiling":"Tata ubin","Tip":"Petua","Top / bottom":"Atas / bawah","Top edge":"Tepi atas","Top edge: full screen":"Tepi atas: skrin penuh","Top edge: maximize":"Tepi atas: maksimumkan","Top edge: top half":"Tepi atas: separuh atas","Top half":"Separuh atas","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Jarak picu dari tepi atas","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Matikan ini jika anda lebih suka garis luar KDE – kemudian matikan pratonton tepi skrin di atas.","Two thirds":"Dua pertiga","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Dua tetingkap bertukar tempat – jatuhkan satu ke atas yang lain atau guna kekunci.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Dua tetingkap bertukar tempat: jatuhkan satu ke atas yang lain, atau dengan kekunci.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Guna pintasan papan kekunci","Use screen edges":"Guna tepi skrin","Use the system accent color":"Guna warna aksen sistem","Use the window magnet":"Guna magnet tetingkap","Usual combinations":"Gabungan biasa","Version":"Versi","Wanted for: %1":"Dikehendaki untuk: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Apabila tetingkap dibuka, ditutup atau bertukar, yang lain bergerak lancar dan bukan melompat.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Apabila anda mengubah saiz tetingkap, tetingkap yang menyentuhnya turut mengalihkan tepi yang dikongsi – tiada pertindihan, tiada ruang kosong.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Semasa mengubah saiz, tetingkap yang tidak mengikut dipaparkan lut sinar.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Semasa anda mengalih atau mengubah saiz tetingkap, tepinya melekat pada tetingkap berdekatan dan pada tepi skrin.","Width":"Lebar","Window":"Tetingkap","Window magnet":"Magnet tetingkap","Window magnet on/off":"Magnet tetingkap hidup/mati","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Tetingkap bertindan mengekalkan tepi kiri dan kanan bersama, tetingkap bersebelahan tepi atas dan bawah.","Windows glide to their place":"Tetingkap meluncur ke tempatnya","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Tetingkap melekat antara satu sama lain dan pada tepi skrin.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Tetingkap berhenti pada “Jarak antara tetingkap” dari halaman Umum dan bukan bersentuhan.","Yes":"Ya","Your own combination":"Gabungan sendiri","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Susun atur anda sendiri dan susunannya akan hilang.","Zone %1":"Zon %1","for KWin · v%1":"untuk KWin · v%1","windows:":"tetingkap:","“%1” will be removed.":"“%1” akan dibuang.","…drag it onto window B…":"…seret ke tetingkap B…","…in every direction":"…ke semua arah","…let go: they trade places":"…lepaskan: ia bertukar tempat","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…jirannya membesar dan mengecil bersamanya","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Sedia – klik OK untuk membuka penyunting tetapan."},"mt":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (kopja)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 qed jintuża minn “%2”.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 minn %2 żoni","0 = all in one row":"0 = kollha f’ringiela waħda","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Mod 1</b><br/>Strixxa tal-qbid u truf tal-iskrin","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Mod 2</b><br/>Tqegħid awtomatiku","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Tieqa waħedha tuża l-iskrin kollu, anke b’marġni ssettjat.","A new window joins":"Tieqa ġdida tingħaqad","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Imbuttatura qasira tagħti nofs jew kwart. Żomm it-tieqa fit-tarf ftit aktar u tikber sat-tieqa li jmiss – il-previżjoni turiha.","A single window":"Tieqa waħda","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Tieqa tieqaf fit-tarf ta’ oħra, anke meta ċċaqlaqha malajr. Ħawwad il-maws jew kompli imbotta għal mument biex teħlisha. 0 = it-twieqi jistgħu jirkbu fuq xulxin liberament.","About & Help":"Dwar u għajnuna","Accent color":"Kulur tal-enfasi","Active":"Attiv","Active mode":"Mod attiv","Active width along the top edge":"Wisa’ attiva tul it-tarf ta’ fuq","Add an open application":"Żid applikazzjoni miftuħa","Add rule":"Żid regola","All window features in one system.":"Il-funzjonijiet kollha tat-twieqi f’sistema waħda.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Jinbidel ukoll meta tbiddel id-daqs tat-tieqa prinċipali bl-idejn.","Also while resizing":"Anke meta tibdel id-daqs","Always floating":"Dejjem f’wiċċ l-ilma","Animation":"Animazzjoni","Appearance":"Dehra","Apply":"Applika","Arrange windows":"Irranġa t-twieqi","Arrange windows automatically":"Irranġa t-twieqi awtomatikament","Author":"Awtur","Automatic tiling":"Tqegħid awtomatiku","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"It-tqegħid awtomatiku mitfi – jaħdem biss il-mod 1 u s-shortcut tal-mod ma jagħmel xejn.","Automatic tiling off":"Tqegħid awtomatiku mitfi","Automatic tiling on":"Tqegħid awtomatiku mixgħul","Automatic tiling on/off":"Tqegħid awtomatiku mixgħul/mitfi","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Tqegħid awtomatiku, bdil tat-twieqi, shortcuts u l-kalamita għal twieqi f’wiċċ l-ilma.","Background opacity":"Opaċità tal-isfond","Behavior & Animation":"Imġiba u animazzjoni","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Tarf t’isfel: nofs t’isfel","Bouncy":"Tqabbeż","Buy me a coffee":"Ixtrili kafè","Cancel":"Ikkanċella","Center focus":"Fokus fiċ-ċentru","Center the window":"Iċċentra t-tieqa","Change":"Ibdel","Change key":"Ibdel il-buttuna","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Il-buttuna tinbidel fl-editur tal-issettjar. Iż-żewġ modi jeħtieġu t-tqegħid awtomatiku u l-istrixxa jew it-truf tal-iskrin.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Ibdilhom fil-paġna Shortcuts tat-tastiera. Bit-tqegħid awtomatiku, it-twieqi jibdlu wkoll posthom fl-ordni.","Choose…":"Agħżel…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Ikklikkja fuq żona biex tagħżilha · ikklikkja darbtejn biex taqsamha · kaxkar id-diviżorji","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Ikklikkja jew agħfas %1 biex tibdel il-mod.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Ikklikkja, imbagħad OK – jinfetaħ l-editur tal-issettjar.","Close":"Agħlaq","Close by, the edges stick together":"Meta qrib, it-truf jeħlu flimkien","Color scheme":"Skema tal-kuluri","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Kuluri, daqs u forma tal-istrixxa.","Columns":"Kolonni","Corner radius":"Raġġ tal-kantunieri","Corner size":"Daqs tal-kantunieri","Corner: a quarter":"Kantuniera: kwart","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Kantunieri: kwart tal-iskrin","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + tast (default)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + tastiera numerika","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + tast","Custom color":"Kulur personalizzat","Custom layout %1":"Tqassim personalizzat %1","Dark":"Skur","Delay before hiding":"Dewmien qabel ma tinħeba","Delay before showing":"Dewmien qabel ma tidher","Delete":"Ħassar","Delete layout?":"Tħassar it-tqassim?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Distanza li fiha jidher il-manku","Distance before the bar hides again":"Distanza qabel ma l-istrixxa terġa’ tinħeba","Distance to the edge":"Distanza mit-tarf","Donate with PayPal":"Agħti donazzjoni b'PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"Kaxkar tarf komuni…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Kaxkar tieqa ma’ tarf…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Kaxkar tieqa fuq oħra biex taqlibhom. Jekk titlaqha fuq l-istrixxa jew tarf tal-iskrin, tibqa’ f’wiċċ l-ilma; „Ħalli t-tieqa tgħum“ terġa’ ġġibha. Id-distanzi jiġu mill-paġna Ġenerali.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Kaxkar tieqa fuq in-nofs ta’ oħra – id-dehra turi żewġ vleġeġ – u erħi. Bit-tqegħid awtomatiku kull post fuq it-tieqa l-oħra jaqdi.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Kaxkar tieqa sat-tarf ta’ fuq tal-iskrin u itlaqha fuq żona.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Kaxkar il-kards biex tibdel l-ordni fl-istrixxa. Ikklikkja darbtejn fuq karta biex teditjaha.","Drop a window onto another one":"Itlaq tieqa fuq oħra","Drop the window onto a zone":"Itlaq it-tieqa fuq żona","Duplicate":"Ikkopja","Duration":"Tul","Dwindle":"Spirali ’l ġewwa","Dynamic":"Dinamika","Edges and corners":"Truf u kantunieri","Edit":"Editja","Edit layout":"Editja t-tqassim","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Kull funzjoni tista’ tinxtegħel u tintefa waħedha.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Kull tqassim li tibni fil-paġna Tqassimiet jista’ jirranġa t-twieqi wkoll – jidher hawn fuq. It-tieqa 1 tieħu ż-żona 1 u hekk; twieqi żejda jaqsmu l-aħħar żona. B’inqas twieqi minn żoni jintuża „Prinċipali u munzell“, biex ma jibqgħux toqob.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Kull tieqa ssib posta waħedha, bħal f’maniġer tat-twieqi b’madum.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Kull tieqa ssib posta fuq l-iskrin waħedha. Twieqi ġodda jingħaqdu, dawk magħluqa jħallu spazju għall-oħrajn.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Eżempju: żewġ twieqi ħdejn xulxin, minn tlieta prinċipali u munzell, minn ħamsa grilja. Mingħajr regola addattata jintuża t-tqassim magħżul hawn fuq.","Fade in and out":"Iffaddja meta tidher u tisparixxi","Fade the other windows":"Attenwa t-twieqi l-oħra","Features":"Funzjonijiet","Feel":"Sensazzjoni","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Adatta għat-twieqi diġà maqbuda","Fits the way you work.":"Jaqbel mal-mod kif taħdem.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Ħalli t-tieqa tgħum (oħroġ mill-madum)","Four quarters":"Erba’ kwarti","From":"Minn","Fullscreen":"Skrin sħiħ","Gap between windows":"Spazju bejn it-twieqi","Gap to the screen edge":"Spazju mat-tarf tal-iskrin","General":"Ġenerali","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Jerġa' jagħti lil kull azzjoni t-tast tal-iskema magħżula u jneħħi t-tasti li l-iskema m'għandhiex.","Good to know":"Tajjeb li tkun taf","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Aqbad tieqa mill-istrixxa tat-titlu u kaxkarha ’l fuq. L-istrixxa tinżel; itlaq it-tieqa fuq żona u timla eżattament dik iż-żona. Jekk terġa’ toħroġha, terġa’ tieħu d-daqs ta’ qabel.","Grab window A…":"Aqbad it-tieqa A…","Grid":"Grilja","Halves":"Nofsijiet","Hiding":"Ħbi","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Żomm fit-tarf biex timla l-ispazju ħieles","Hold time":"Ħin taż-żamma","Hold to fill":"Żomm biex timla","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Kemm irid jersaq tarf qabel ma jidħol f’postu.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Kemm irid jersaq il-kursur lejn it-tarf.","How far the bar slides down":"Kemm tinżel l-istrixxa","How it works":"Kif jaħdem","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Kemm trid tibqa’ t-tieqa mat-tarf – imbuttatura żgħira. 0 = minnufih.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Kemm għandha tibqa' t-tieqa fit-tarf qabel ma tikber.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Kemm twieqi jaqsmu ż-żona prinċipali (tqassim “Prinċipali u munzell”).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Jekk diġà hemm tieqa isfel, it-tarf ta’ fuq jagħti n-nofs ta’ fuq minflok jimmassimizza. In-nofsijiet u l-kwarti wkoll iħallu t-twieqi maqbuda ħielsa.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Jekk jogħġbok KSnapUnity, tista’ tappoġġja l-iżvilupp tiegħu – grazzi!","In bar":"Fl-istrixxa","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Indipendenti mill-istrixxa u mit-truf tal-iskrin.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Indipendenti mill-istrixxa. Kull tarf jinxtegħel għalih.","Information":"Informazzjoni","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Imġiba tat-twieqi intuwittiva u naturali.","Join at the end":"Jingħaqdu fl-aħħar","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K għal KWin · Snap għal qbid aktar għaqli · Unity għal kollox f’sistema waħda","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE għandu l-azzjonijiet tiegħu għat-truf tal-iskrin u l-qbid tat-twieqi tiegħu. Jekk l-istess funzjoni hija mixgħula hawn, itfi dik ta’ KDE: Settings tas-Sistema → Ġestjoni tat-Twieqi → Truf tal-Iskrin, u Imġiba tat-Twieqi → Ċaqliq.","KDE's own edge tiling":"It-tqegħid fit-truf ta' KDE stess","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"L-immassimizzar u t-tqegħid ta’ KDE stess fit-truf – bil-kontorn tiegħu – jieqfu waqt li jaħdem KSnapUnity, biex tidher dehra waħda biss. L-issettjar ta’ KDE ma jinbidilx: itfi dan, iddiżattiva jew neħħi KSnapUnity u l-imġiba ta’ KDE terġa’ lura.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"L-azzjonijiet ta’ KDE għat-truf tal-iskrin għadhom mixgħula, għalhekk żewġ għajnuniet jirreaġixxu għall-istess kaxkir. Itfi “Immassimizza” u “Madum” f’Settings tas-Sistema → Ġestjoni tat-Twieqi → Truf tal-Iskrin.","KDE's own window snapping":"Il-qbid tat-twieqi ta' KDE stess","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"Il-qbid tat-twieqi ta’ KDE stess huwa mixgħul ukoll. Għal sensazzjoni konsistenti, issettja ż-żoni tiegħu għal “Xejn” f’Settings tas-Sistema → Ġestjoni tat-Twieqi → Imġiba tat-Twieqi → Ċaqliq.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Is-servizz tas-shortcuts ta’ KDE ma weġibx. Xorta tista’ tissettja t-tasti f’Settings tas-Sistema → Shortcuts → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – Editur tal-issettjar","Keep stacked windows in line":"Żomm it-twieqi f'munzell f'linja waħda","Keep the gap between windows":"Żomm l-ispazju bejn it-twieqi","Keep them":"Ħallihom","Key scheme":"Skema tat-tasti","Keyboard shortcuts":"Shortcuts tat-tastiera","Keys":"Ċwievet","Keys already in use":"Tasti diġà fl-użu","Layout":"Tqassim","Layout by number of windows":"Tqassim skont l-għadd ta’ twieqi","Layouts":"Tqassimiet","Layouts per row":"Tqassimiet għal kull ringiela","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Tarf tax-xellug u tal-lemin: nofs l-iskrin","Left edge: left half":"Tarf tax-xellug: in-nofs tax-xellug","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Taħt il-100 % tieqa waħedha tibqa’ fiċ-ċentru – sabiħ fuq skrins wiesgħa.","License":"Liċenzja","Light":"Ċar","Linear":"Lineari","Live preview":"Dehra ħajja","Load template…":"Tella’ mudell…","Magnet":"Kalamita","Main + stack":"Prinċipali + munzell","Main and stack":"Prinċipali u munzell","Main area bigger":"Żona prinċipali akbar","Main area on the right":"Iż-żona prinċipali fuq il-lemin","Main area smaller":"Żona prinċipali iżgħar","Main in the middle":"Prinċipali fin-nofs","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Swiċċ prinċipali għall-kaxkar u l-buttuni.","Main window":"Tieqa prinċipali","Main windows":"Twieqi prinċipali","Main windows: %1":"Twieqi prinċipali: %1","Make it the main window":"Agħmilha t-tieqa prinċipali","Maximize":"Immassimizza","Maximize or restore":"Immassimizza jew irrestawra","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + tast (stil KDE)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + tast","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + tast","Minimize":"Imminimizza","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Iriflettu t-tqassim: it-tieqa prinċipali fuq il-lemin, l-oħrajn fuq ix-xellug.","Mode":"Mod","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Mod 1 – Strixxa tal-qbid u truf tal-iskrin","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Mod 2 – Tqegħid awtomatiku","Modes":"Modi","More ways":"Aktar modi","Motion curve":"Kurva tal-moviment","Move a window towards others…":"Mexxi tieqa lejn oħrajn…","Move the window one place back":"Mexxi t-tieqa post lura","Move the window one place on":"Mexxi t-tieqa post ’il quddiem","Name:":"Isem:","New layout":"Tqassim ġdid","New windows":"Twieqi ġodda","Next tiling layout":"Tqassim li jmiss","Next to the active window":"Ħdejn it-tieqa attiva","No key":"L-ebda buttuna","No other window open":"L-ebda tieqa oħra miftuħa","No outer margin":"Bla marġni ta’ barra","No shortcuts":"Ebda shortcut","None":"Xejn","None yet.":"Għad m’hemm xejn.","Off":"Mitfi","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Mitfi = mod 1, mixgħul = mod 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Mitfi: qafas newtrali – biss għall-previżjonijiet mixgħula.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Mitfi: it-tasti jibqgħu assenjati iżda ma jagħmlu xejn.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Mitfi: it-twieqi jibqgħu fejn tpoġġihom. Il-funzjonijiet l-oħra jaħdmu xorta.","One at a time":"Waħda waħda","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Waħda tingħalaq – l-oħrajn jimlew il-vojt","One main window less":"Tieqa prinċipali waħda inqas","One more main window":"Tieqa prinċipali oħra","One window":"Tieqa waħda","Only one mode is switched on.":"Mod wieħed biss mixgħul.","Open settings editor":"Iftaħ l-editur tal-issettjar","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"L-ewwel iftaħ l-applikazzjoni, imbagħad agħżilha hawn.","Open the layout builder":"Iftaħ il-bennej tat-tqassimiet","Own layouts":"Tqassimiet tiegħek","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Parti minn kull naħa li tgħodd bħala kantuniera.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Waqqaf temporanjament it-tqegħid fit-truf ta' KDE u l-previżjoni tiegħu","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Waqqaf iż-żoni tal-qbid ta' KDE waqt li l-kalamita tkun mixgħula","Preview":"Previżjoni","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Imbotta tieqa ma’ tarf jew kantuniera tal-iskrin u timla dik il-parti. Taħdem bl-istrixxa jew mingħajrha.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Imbotta tieqa ma’ tarf jew kantuniera: immassimizza, nofsijiet, kwarti.","Push delay":"Dewmien tal-imbuttatura","Quarters":"Kwarti","Quick":"Mgħaġġla","Quick settings":"Issettjar malajr","Recommended values":"Valuri rakkomandati","Remove":"Neħħi","Remove rule":"Neħħi r-regola","Remove zone":"Neħħi ż-żona","Reset all":"Irrisettja kollox","Reset all keys":"Irrisettja t-tasti kollha","Reset to default":"Irrisettja għall-predefinit","Resistance against overlapping":"Reżistenza kontra s-sovrapożizzjoni","Resize touching windows together":"Ibdel id-daqs tat-twieqi li jmissu flimkien","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Anke t-tibdil tad-daqs jinqabad – hawn sal-għoli sħiħ","Restore":"Irrestawra","Restore default layouts":"Irrestawra t-tqassimiet awtomatiċi","Restore default layouts?":"Tirrestawra t-tqassimiet awtomatiċi?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Irrestawra d-daqs oriġinali meta toħroġ it-tieqa","Restore the size before snapping":"Irrestawra d-daqs ta’ qabel il-qbid","Rows":"Ringieli","Save":"Issejvja","Screen edges":"Truf tal-iskrin","Screen edges on/off":"Truf tal-iskrin mixgħula/mitfija","Screen edges preview":"Previżjoni tat-truf tal-iskrin","Set":"Issettja","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Tissettja t-tasti tal-azzjonijiet kollha f’daqqa. Tasti waħdiet għadek tista’ tibdilhom hawn taħt.","Settings file":"Fajl tas-settings","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Ħawwad il-maws malajr ’il quddiem u lura waqt li tbiddel id-daqs u t-twieqi l-oħra jaqbżu lura. Ġibda mgħaġġla f’direzzjoni waħda qatt ma teħlishom.","Shake to let go":"Ħawwad biex tħalli","Show a small handle first":"Uri l-ewwel manku żgħir","Show layout and zone names":"Uri l-ismijiet tat-tqassimiet u taż-żoni","Show previews in the accent color":"Uri l-previews bil-kulur tal-enfasi","Showing":"Wiri","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Turi fejn tasal it-tieqa f'tarf jew kantuniera. Mitfi: l-ebda previżjoni.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Turi fejn tasal it-tieqa waqt li żona tal-bar hija enfasizzata. Mitfi: l-ebda previżjoni.","Sidebar + grid":"Strixxa tal-ġenb + grilja","Single zone":"Żona waħda","Six tiles":"Sitt madum","Size & shape":"Daqs u forma","Size of the main area":"Daqs taż-żona prinċipali","Slide-in duration":"Tul tal-inżul","Slide-out duration":"Tul tat-tlugħ","Smart arranging and detection.":"Tqassim u għarfien intelliġenti.","Smart fill":"Mili intelliġenti","Smooth (default)":"Ħelwa (awtomatika)","Snap bar":"Strixxa tal-qbid","Snap bar and screen edges":"Strixxa tal-qbid u truf tal-iskrin","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"L-istrixxa u t-truf mitfija – jaħdem biss il-mod 2 u s-shortcut tal-mod ma jagħmel xejn.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"L-istrixxa u t-truf tal-iskrin ifixklu t-tqegħid awtomatiku. Għalhekk jaħdmu bħala żewġ modi – ibdel bil-shortcut jew hawn.","Snap bar colors:":"Kuluri tal-istrixxa:","Snap bar on/off":"Strixxa mixgħula/mitfija","Snap bar preview":"Previżjoni tal-bar tal-qbid","Snap bar size":"Daqs tal-istrixxa","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Strixxa tal-qbid, truf tal-iskrin, kalamita tat-twieqi, shortcuts u bdil tat-twieqi.","Snap distance":"Distanza tal-qbid","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Waħħal id-diviżorji (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Tqassimiet tal-qbid u tqegħid awtomatiku.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Aqbad it-tieqa attiva b’kombinazzjonijiet ta’ tasti.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Aqbad it-tieqa attiva bit-tastiera. Dawn huma shortcuts globali normali ta’ KDE – issibhom ukoll f’Settings tas-Sistema → Shortcuts → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Aqbad fin-nofs t’isfel","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Aqbad fil-kwart t’isfel xellug","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Aqbad fil-kwart t’isfel lemin","Snap to the center third":"Aqbad fit-terz tan-nofs","Snap to the left half":"Aqbad fin-nofs tax-xellug","Snap to the left third":"Aqbad fit-terz tax-xellug","Snap to the left two thirds":"Aqbad fiż-żewġ terzi tax-xellug","Snap to the right half":"Aqbad fin-nofs tal-lemin","Snap to the right third":"Aqbad fit-terz tal-lemin","Snap to the right two thirds":"Aqbad fiż-żewġ terzi tal-lemin","Snap to the top half":"Aqbad fin-nofs ta’ fuq","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Aqbad fil-kwart ta’ fuq xellug","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Aqbad fil-kwart ta’ fuq lemin","Snapping":"Twaħħil","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Il-qbid u t-tqegħid awtomatiku jaħdmu bħala żewġ modi – shortcut wieħed jaqleb bejniethom.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Hekk kalamita waħda biss tiġbed tieqa. L-issettjar ta’ KDE ma jinbidilx: itfi dan, iddiżattiva jew neħħi KSnapUnity u l-qbid ta’ KDE jerġa’ lura.","Soft":"Ratba","Spacing":"Spazji","Spiral":"Spirali","Split side by side":"Aqsam ħdejn xulxin","Split top and bottom":"Aqsam fuq u isfel","Stack + main":"Munzell + prinċipali","Stick to other windows":"Waħħal ma’ twieqi oħra","Stick to the screen edges":"Waħħal mat-truf tal-iskrin","Sticky edges":"Truf li jeħlu","Support KSnapUnity":"Appoġġja lil KSnapUnity","Swap":"Ibdel","Swap windows":"Ibdel it-twieqi","Swap with the window above":"Ibdel mat-tieqa ta’ fuq","Swap with the window below":"Ibdel mat-tieqa ta’ taħt","Swap with the window on the left":"Ibdel mat-tieqa fuq ix-xellug","Swap with the window on the right":"Ibdel mat-tieqa fuq il-lemin","Switch mode":"Ibdel il-mod","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Ibdel il-mod (qbid / madum)","Switch modes with:":"Ibdel il-mod b’:","Switch the layout by itself":"Ibdel it-tqassim waħdu","Switched off":"Mitfi","System":"Sistema","Take it over":"Ħudu","Take over all":"Ħudhom kollha","Take the main place":"Jieħdu l-post prinċipali","Test animation":"Ipprova l-animazzjoni","Test on screen":"Ipprova fuq l-iskrin","Test the snap bar":"Ipprova l-istrixxa","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Il-valuri awtomatiċi huma bbażati fuq Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"L-azzjonijiet tal-qbid jużaw l-istess spazji tal-istrixxa u jiftakru d-daqs ta’ qabel il-qbid: “Irrestawra d-daqs ta’ qabel il-qbid” iġibu lura.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Dawn l-applikazzjonijiet qatt ma jiġu rranġati u jżommu posthom. Id-djalogi dejjem f’wiċċ l-ilma.","Thirds":"Terzi","Three columns":"Tliet kolonni","Thumbnail width":"Wisa’ tal-minjaturi","Tiling":"Madum","Tip":"Parir","Top / bottom":"Fuq / isfel","Top edge":"Tarf ta’ fuq","Top edge: full screen":"Tarf ta’ fuq: skrin sħiħ","Top edge: maximize":"Tarf ta’ fuq: immassimizza","Top edge: top half":"Tarf ta’ fuq: in-nofs ta’ fuq","Top half":"Nofs ta’ fuq","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Distanza tal-attivazzjoni mit-tarf ta’ fuq","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Itfi dan jekk tippreferi l-kontorn ta' KDE – imbagħad itfi l-previżjoni tat-truf hawn fuq.","Two thirds":"Żewġ terzi","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Żewġ twieqi jaqilbu l-postijiet – itfa’ waħda fuq l-oħra jew uża l-buttuni.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Żewġ twieqi jaqilbu l-postijiet: itfa’ waħda fuq l-oħra, jew b’buttuna.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Uża shortcuts tat-tastiera","Use screen edges":"Uża t-truf tal-iskrin","Use the system accent color":"Uża l-kulur tal-enfasi tas-sistema","Use the window magnet":"Uża l-kalamita tat-twieqi","Usual combinations":"Kombinazzjonijiet komuni","Version":"Verżjoni","Wanted for: %1":"Mixtieq għal: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Meta tieqa tinfetaħ, tingħalaq jew tinbidel, l-oħrajn jiċċaqilqu bil-mod minflok jaqbżu.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Meta tibdel id-daqs ta' tieqa, it-twieqi li jmissuha jċaqilqu t-tarf komuni magħha – xejn ma jissovrapponi, ma jinfetaħ l-ebda vojt.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Waqt li jinbidel id-daqs, it-twieqi li ma jsegwux jidhru trasparenti.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Waqt li tiċċaqlaq jew tibdel id-daqs ta’ tieqa, it-truf tagħha jeħlu mat-twieqi qrib u mat-truf tal-iskrin.","Width":"Wisa’","Window":"Tieqa","Window magnet":"Kalamita tat-twieqi","Window magnet on/off":"Kalamita mixgħula/mitfija","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"It-twieqi waħda fuq l-oħra jżommu t-truf tax-xellug u tal-lemin flimkien, it-twieqi ħdejn xulxin dawk ta' fuq u t'isfel.","Windows glide to their place":"It-twieqi jiżżerżqu f’posthom","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"It-twieqi jeħlu ma’ xulxin u mat-truf tal-iskrin.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"It-twieqi jieqfu fl-“Ispazju bejn it-twieqi” tal-paġna Ġenerali minflok imissu ma’ xulxin.","Yes":"Iva","Your own combination":"Il-kombinazzjoni tiegħek","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"It-tqassimiet tiegħek u l-ordni tagħhom se jintilfu.","Zone %1":"Żona %1","for KWin · v%1":"għal KWin · v%1","windows:":"twieqi:","“%1” will be removed.":"“%1” se jitneħħa.","…drag it onto window B…":"…kaxkarha fuq it-tieqa B…","…in every direction":"…f’kull direzzjoni","…let go: they trade places":"…erħi: jaqilbu l-postijiet","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…il-ġirien jikbru u jiċkienu miegħu","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Lest – ikklikkja OK biex tiftaħ l-editur tal-issettjar."},"nb":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (kopi)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 brukes av «%2».","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 av %2 soner","0 = all in one row":"0 = alle på én rad","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Modus 1</b><br/>Festelinje og skjermkanter","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Modus 2</b><br/>Automatisk flislegging","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Et enslig vindu bruker hele skjermen, selv når en marg er satt.","A new window joins":"Et nytt vindu blir med","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Et kort dytt gir halvdelen eller kvarten. Hold vinduet litt lenger ved kanten, så vokser det fram til neste vindu – forhåndsvisningen viser det.","A single window":"Ett enkelt vindu","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Et vindu stopper ved kanten av et annet, også når du flytter det raskt. Rist musa eller fortsett å skyve et øyeblikk for å slippe. 0 = vinduer kan overlappe fritt.","About & Help":"Om & hjelp","Accent color":"Uthevingsfarge","Active":"Aktiv","Active mode":"Aktiv modus","Active width along the top edge":"Aktiv bredde langs overkanten","Add an open application":"Legg til et åpent program","Add rule":"Legg til regel","All window features in one system.":"Alle vindusfunksjoner i ett system.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Endres også når du endrer størrelsen på hovedvinduet for hånd.","Also while resizing":"Også ved endring av størrelse","Always floating":"Alltid flytende","Animation":"Animasjon","Appearance":"Utseende","Apply":"Bruk","Arrange windows":"Ordne vinduer","Arrange windows automatically":"Ordne vinduer automatisk","Author":"Opphavsperson","Automatic tiling":"Automatisk flislegging","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Automatisk flislegging er slått av – bare modus 1 kjører, og modustasten gjør ingenting.","Automatic tiling off":"Automatisk flislegging av","Automatic tiling on":"Automatisk flislegging på","Automatic tiling on/off":"Automatisk flislegging av/på","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Automatisk flislegging, bytt vinduer, hurtigtaster og magneten for flytende vinduer.","Background opacity":"Bakgrunnens dekkevne","Behavior & Animation":"Oppførsel & animasjon","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Nederkant: nedre halvdel","Bouncy":"Fjærende","Buy me a coffee":"Spander en kaffe på meg","Cancel":"Avbryt","Center focus":"Fokus i midten","Center the window":"Midtstill vinduet","Change":"Endre","Change key":"Endre tast","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Tasten endres i innstillingsredigeringen. Begge modusene trenger automatisk flislegging og festelinjen eller skjermkantene.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Endre dem på siden Hurtigtaster. Med automatisk flislegging bytter vinduene også plass i rekkefølgen.","Choose…":"Velg …","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Klikk på en sone for å velge den · dobbeltklikk for å dele · dra i skillelinjene","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Klikk eller trykk %1 for å bytte modus.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Klikk, deretter OK – innstillingsredigeringen åpnes.","Close":"Lukk","Close by, the edges stick together":"Nær hverandre kleber kantene seg sammen","Color scheme":"Fargeoppsett","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Farger, størrelse og form på festelinjen.","Columns":"Kolonner","Corner radius":"Hjørneradius","Corner size":"Hjørnestørrelse","Corner: a quarter":"Hjørne: en firedel","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Hjørner: en fjerdedel av skjermen","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + tast (standard)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + talltastatur","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + tast","Custom color":"Egen farge","Custom layout %1":"Eget oppsett %1","Dark":"Mørkt","Delay before hiding":"Forsinkelse før skjuling","Delay before showing":"Forsinkelse før visning","Delete":"Slett","Delete layout?":"Slette oppsettet?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Avstand der håndtaket dukker opp","Distance before the bar hides again":"Avstand før linjen skjules igjen","Distance to the edge":"Avstand til kanten","Donate with PayPal":"Doner med PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"Dra i en felles kant …","Drag a window against an edge…":"Dra et vindu mot en kant …","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Dra et vindu over på et annet for å bytte dem. Slipper du det på festelinjen eller en skjermkant, flyter det fritt; «La vinduet sveve» henter det tilbake. Mellomrommene kommer fra siden Generelt.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Dra et vindu over midten av et annet – forhåndsvisningen viser to piler – og slipp. Med automatisk flislegging holder det hvor som helst over det andre vinduet.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Dra et vindu til overkanten av skjermen og slipp det på en sone.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Dra kortene for å endre rekkefølgen i festelinjen. Dobbeltklikk på et kort for å redigere det.","Drop a window onto another one":"Slipp et vindu på et annet","Drop the window onto a zone":"Slipp vinduet på en sone","Duplicate":"Dupliser","Duration":"Varighet","Dwindle":"Spiral innover","Dynamic":"Dynamisk","Edges and corners":"Kanter og hjørner","Edit":"Rediger","Edit layout":"Rediger oppsett","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Hver funksjon kan slås av og på for seg.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Hvert oppsett du bygger på siden Oppsett kan også ordne vinduer – det vises over. Vindu 1 får sone 1 og så videre; flere vinduer deler den siste sonen. Med færre vinduer enn soner brukes «Hoved og stabel», så det ikke blir hull.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Hvert vindu finner plassen sin selv, som i en flisleggende vindusbehandler.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Hvert vindu finner plassen sin på skjermen selv. Nye vinduer blir med, lukkede gir plass til de andre.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Eksempel: to vinduer side om side, fra tre hoved og stabel, fra fem et rutenett. Uten passende regel brukes oppsettet valgt over.","Fade in and out":"Ton inn og ut","Fade the other windows":"Demp de andre vinduene","Features":"Funksjoner","Feel":"Følelse","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Tilpass til vinduer som allerede er festet","Fits the way you work.":"Passer måten du jobber på.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"La vinduet sveve (forlat flislegging)","Four quarters":"Fire fjerdedeler","From":"Fra","Fullscreen":"Fullskjerm","Gap between windows":"Avstand mellom vinduer","Gap to the screen edge":"Avstand til skjermkanten","General":"Generelt","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Gir hver handling tasten fra valgt oppsett igjen og fjerner taster oppsettet ikke har.","Good to know":"Greit å vite","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Ta tak i et vindu i tittellinjen og dra det oppover. Festelinjen glir ned; slipp vinduet på en sone, så fyller det nøyaktig det området. Drar du det ut igjen, får det tilbake sin gamle størrelse.","Grab window A…":"Ta tak i vindu A …","Grid":"Rutenett","Halves":"Halvdeler","Hiding":"Skjuling","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Hold ved kanten for å fylle den ledige plassen","Hold time":"Holdetid","Hold to fill":"Hold for å fylle","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Hvor nær en kant må komme før den smekker på plass.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Hvor nær kanten pekeren må komme.","How far the bar slides down":"Hvor langt linjen glir ned","How it works":"Slik virker det","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Hvor lenge vinduet må ligge mot kanten – et lite dytt. 0 = med en gang.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Hvor lenge vinduet må bli ved kanten før det vokser.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Hvor mange vinduer som deler hovedområdet (oppsettet «Hoved og stabel»).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Ligger det allerede et vindu nederst, gir overkanten øvre halvdel i stedet for å maksimere. Halvdeler og kvarter lar også festede vinduer være fri.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Liker du KSnapUnity, kan du støtte utviklingen – takk!","In bar":"I linjen","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Uavhengig av festelinjen og skjermkantene.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Uavhengig av festelinjen. Hver kant kan slås på for seg.","Information":"Informasjon","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Intuitiv, naturlig vindusoppførsel.","Join at the end":"Stiller seg bakerst","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K for KWin · Snap for smartere festing · Unity for alt i ett system","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE har egne skjermkanthandlinger og egen vindusfesting. Når samme funksjon er på her, slå av KDEs: Systeminnstillinger → Vindusbehandling → Skjermkanter, og Vindusoppførsel → Flytting.","KDE's own edge tiling":"KDEs egne kantfliser","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"KDEs egen maksimering og flislegging ved kantene – med omriss – tar pause mens KSnapUnity kjører, så bare én forhåndsvisning vises. KDE-innstillingene dine endres ikke: slå av dette, deaktiver eller fjern KSnapUnity, og KDEs egen oppførsel er tilbake.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"KDEs egne skjermkanthandlinger er fortsatt på, så to hjelpere reagerer på samme dra. Slå av «Maksimer» og «Flislegg» i Systeminnstillinger → Vindusbehandling → Skjermkanter.","KDE's own window snapping":"KDEs egen vindusfesting","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDEs egen vindusfesting er også på. For en enhetlig følelse kan du sette sonene til «Ingen» i Systeminnstillinger → Vindusbehandling → Vindusoppførsel → Flytting.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"KDEs snarveitjeneste svarte ikke. Du kan fortsatt angi tastene i Systeminnstillinger → Snarveier → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – Innstillingsredigering","Keep stacked windows in line":"Hold stablede vinduer på linje","Keep the gap between windows":"Behold avstanden mellom vinduer","Keep them":"Behold dem","Key scheme":"Tasteskjema","Keyboard shortcuts":"Hurtigtaster","Keys":"Taster","Keys already in use":"Taster som allerede er i bruk","Layout":"Oppsett","Layout by number of windows":"Oppsett etter antall vinduer","Layouts":"Oppsett","Layouts per row":"Oppsett per rad","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Venstre og høyre kant: halve skjermen","Left edge: left half":"Venstre kant: venstre halvdel","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Under 100 % holder et enslig vindu i midten – fint på brede skjermer.","License":"Lisens","Light":"Lyst","Linear":"Lineær","Live preview":"Direkte forhåndsvisning","Load template…":"Last inn mal…","Main + stack":"Hoved + stabel","Main and stack":"Hoved og stabel","Main area bigger":"Større hovedområde","Main area on the right":"Hovedområde til høyre","Main area smaller":"Mindre hovedområde","Main in the middle":"Hoved i midten","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Hovedbryter for dra og tastene.","Main window":"Hovedvindu","Main windows":"Hovedvinduer","Main windows: %1":"Hovedvinduer: %1","Make it the main window":"Gjør til hovedvindu","Maximize":"Maksimer","Maximize or restore":"Maksimer eller gjenopprett","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + tast (KDE-stil)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + tast","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + tast","Minimize":"Minimer","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Speiler oppsettet: hovedvinduet til høyre, de andre til venstre.","Mode":"Modus","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Modus 1 – Festelinje og skjermkanter","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Modus 2 – Automatisk flislegging","Modes":"Moduser","More ways":"Flere måter","Motion curve":"Bevegelseskurve","Move a window towards others…":"Flytt et vindu mot andre …","Move the window one place back":"Flytt vinduet én plass tilbake","Move the window one place on":"Flytt vinduet én plass fram","Name:":"Navn:","New layout":"Nytt oppsett","New windows":"Nye vinduer","Next tiling layout":"Neste flisoppsett","Next to the active window":"Ved siden av det aktive vinduet","No key":"Ingen tast","No other window open":"Ingen andre vinduer åpne","No outer margin":"Ingen ytre marg","No shortcuts":"Ingen hurtigtaster","None":"Ingen","None yet.":"Ingen ennå.","Off":"Av","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Av = modus 1, på = modus 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Av: en nøytral ramme – bare for forhåndsvisningene som er slått på.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Av: tastene forblir tildelt, men gjør ingenting.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Av: vinduer blir der du legger dem. De andre funksjonene virker uansett.","One at a time":"Ett om gangen","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Ett lukkes – de andre fyller hullet","One main window less":"Ett hovedvindu mindre","One more main window":"Ett hovedvindu til","One window":"Ett vindu","Only one mode is switched on.":"Bare én modus er slått på.","Open settings editor":"Åpne innstillingsredigeringen","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Åpne programmet først, og velg det så her.","Open the layout builder":"Åpne oppsettbyggeren","Own layouts":"Egne oppsett","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Den delen av hver side som regnes som hjørne.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Sett KDEs kantfliser og forhåndsvisningen på pause","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Sett KDEs festesoner på pause mens magneten er på","Preview":"Forhåndsvisning","Previews":"Forhåndsvisninger","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Skyv et vindu mot en kant eller et hjørne av skjermen, så fyller det den delen. Virker med eller uten festelinjen.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Skyv et vindu mot en kant eller et hjørne: maksimer, halvdeler, kvarter.","Push delay":"Skyveforsinkelse","Quarters":"Kvarter","Quick":"Rask","Quick settings":"Hurtiginnstillinger","Recommended values":"Anbefalte verdier","Remove":"Fjern","Remove rule":"Fjern regel","Remove zone":"Fjern sone","Reset all":"Tilbakestill alle","Reset all keys":"Tilbakestill alle taster","Reset to default":"Tilbakestill til standard","Resistance against overlapping":"Motstand mot overlapping","Resize touching windows together":"Endre størrelsen på vinduer som berører hverandre, sammen","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Også størrelsesendring fester seg – her til full høyde","Restore":"Gjenopprett","Restore default layouts":"Gjenopprett standardoppsett","Restore default layouts?":"Gjenopprette standardoppsettene?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Gjenopprett opprinnelig størrelse når vinduet dras ut","Restore the size before snapping":"Gjenopprett størrelsen fra før festing","Rows":"Rader","Save":"Lagre","Screen edges":"Skjermkanter","Screen edges on/off":"Skjermkanter av/på","Screen edges preview":"Forhåndsvisning for skjermkantene","Set":"Angi","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Angir tastene for alle handlinger på én gang. Enkelttaster kan du fortsatt endre nedenfor.","Settings":"Innstillinger","Settings file":"Innstillingsfil","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Rist musa raskt fram og tilbake mens du endrer størrelse, så hopper de andre vinduene tilbake. Et raskt drag i én retning slipper aldri.","Shake to let go":"Rist for å slippe","Shortcuts":"Snarveier","Show a small handle first":"Vis først et lite håndtak","Show layout and zone names":"Vis navn på oppsett og soner","Show previews in the accent color":"Vis forhåndsvisninger i uthevingsfargen","Showing":"Visning","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Viser hvor vinduet havner ved en kant eller et hjørne. Av: ingen forhåndsvisning.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Viser hvor vinduet havner mens en sone i listen er uthevet. Av: ingen forhåndsvisning.","Sidebar + grid":"Sidepanel + rutenett","Single zone":"Én sone","Six tiles":"Seks ruter","Size & shape":"Størrelse & form","Size of the main area":"Størrelse på hovedområdet","Slide-in duration":"Varighet inn","Slide-out duration":"Varighet ut","Smart arranging and detection.":"Smart plassering og gjenkjenning.","Smart fill":"Smart fylling","Smooth (default)":"Myk (standard)","Snap bar":"Festelinje","Snap bar and screen edges":"Festelinje og skjermkanter","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Festelinjen og kantene er slått av – bare modus 2 kjører, og modustasten gjør ingenting.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Festelinjen og skjermkantene er i veien for automatisk flislegging. Derfor kjører de som to moduser – bytt med snarveien eller her.","Snap bar colors:":"Festelinjens farger:","Snap bar on/off":"Festelinje av/på","Snap bar preview":"Forhåndsvisning for festelisten","Snap bar size":"Størrelse på festelinjen","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Festelinje, skjermkanter, vindusmagnet, hurtigtaster og bytt vinduer.","Snap distance":"Festeavstand","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Fest skillelinjer (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Festeoppsett og automatisk flislegging.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Fest det aktive vinduet med tastekombinasjoner.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Fest det aktive vinduet med tastaturet. Dette er vanlige globale KDE-snarveier – du finner dem også i Systeminnstillinger → Snarveier → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Fest i nedre halvdel","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Fest i nedre venstre kvart","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Fest i nedre høyre kvart","Snap to the center third":"Fest i midtre tredjedel","Snap to the left half":"Fest i venstre halvdel","Snap to the left third":"Fest i venstre tredjedel","Snap to the left two thirds":"Fest i venstre to tredjedeler","Snap to the right half":"Fest i høyre halvdel","Snap to the right third":"Fest i høyre tredjedel","Snap to the right two thirds":"Fest i høyre to tredjedeler","Snap to the top half":"Fest i øvre halvdel","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Fest i øvre venstre kvart","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Fest i øvre høyre kvart","Snapping":"Festing","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Festing og automatisk flislegging kjører som to moduser – én snarvei bytter mellom dem.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Slik trekker bare én magnet i et vindu. KDE-innstillingene dine endres ikke: slå av dette, deaktiver eller fjern KSnapUnity, og KDEs egen festing er tilbake.","Soft":"Rolig","Spacing":"Avstand","Split side by side":"Del side om side","Split top and bottom":"Del øverst og nederst","Stack + main":"Stabel + hoved","Stick to other windows":"Fest til andre vinduer","Stick to the screen edges":"Fest til skjermkantene","Sticky edges":"Klebrige kanter","Support KSnapUnity":"Støtt KSnapUnity","Swap":"Bytt","Swap windows":"Bytt vinduer","Swap with the window above":"Bytt med vinduet over","Swap with the window below":"Bytt med vinduet under","Swap with the window on the left":"Bytt med vinduet til venstre","Swap with the window on the right":"Bytt med vinduet til høyre","Switch mode":"Bytt modus","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Bytt modus (festing / flislegging)","Switch modes with:":"Bytt modus med:","Switch the layout by itself":"Bytt oppsett av seg selv","Switched off":"Slått av","Take it over":"Overta","Take over all":"Overta alle","Take the main place":"Tar hovedplassen","Test animation":"Test animasjon","Test on screen":"Test på skjermen","Test the snap bar":"Test festelinjen","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Standardverdiene er basert på Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Festehandlingene bruker de samme avstandene som festelinjen og husker størrelsen fra før festing: «Gjenopprett størrelsen fra før festing» henter den tilbake.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Disse programmene ordnes aldri og beholder sin egen plass. Dialoger flyter alltid.","Thirds":"Tredjedeler","Three columns":"Tre kolonner","Thumbnail width":"Bredde på miniatyrer","Tiling":"Flislegging","Tip":"Tips","Top / bottom":"Øverst / nederst","Top edge":"Overkant","Top edge: full screen":"Øvre kant: fullskjerm","Top edge: maximize":"Øvre kant: maksimer","Top edge: top half":"Øvre kant: øvre halvdel","Top half":"Øvre halvdel","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Utløseravstand fra overkanten","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Slå av dette hvis du foretrekker KDEs eget omriss – slå da av forhåndsvisningen for skjermkantene ovenfor.","Two thirds":"To tredjedeler","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"To vinduer bytter plass – slipp det ene på det andre eller bruk tastene.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"To vinduer bytter plass: slipp det ene på det andre, eller med en tast.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Bruk hurtigtaster","Use screen edges":"Bruk skjermkanter","Use the system accent color":"Bruk systemets uthevingsfarge","Use the window magnet":"Bruk vindusmagneten","Usual combinations":"Vanlige kombinasjoner","Version":"Versjon","Wanted for: %1":"Ønsket for: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Når et vindu åpnes, lukkes eller bytter, beveger de andre seg mykt i stedet for å hoppe.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Når du endrer størrelsen på et vindu, flytter vinduer som berører det, den felles kanten med – ingenting overlapper, ingen glipe oppstår.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Mens du endrer størrelse, vises vinduer som ikke følger med, gjennomsiktige.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Mens du flytter eller endrer størrelse på et vindu, fester kantene seg til vinduer i nærheten og til skjermkantene.","Width":"Bredde","Window":"Vindu","Window magnet":"Vindusmagnet","Window magnet on/off":"Vindusmagnet av/på","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Vinduer over hverandre holder venstre og høyre kant sammen, vinduer ved siden av hverandre topp- og bunnkant.","Windows glide to their place":"Vinduer glir på plass","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Vinduer fester seg til hverandre og til skjermkantene.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Vinduer stopper ved «Avstand mellom vinduer» fra siden Generelt i stedet for å berøre hverandre.","Yes":"Ja","Your own combination":"Egen kombinasjon","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Dine egne oppsett og rekkefølgen deres går tapt.","Zone %1":"Sone %1","windows:":"vinduer:","“%1” will be removed.":"«%1» blir fjernet.","…drag it onto window B…":"… dra det over på vindu B …","…in every direction":"… i alle retninger","…let go: they trade places":"… slipp: de bytter plass","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"… naboene vokser og krymper med","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Klar – klikk OK for å åpne innstillingsredigeringen."},"nl":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (kopie)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 wordt gebruikt door „%2”.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 van %2 zones","0 = all in one row":"0 = alles op één rij","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Modus 1</b><br/>Snapbalk en schermranden","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Modus 2</b><br/>Automatisch tegelen","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Een los venster gebruikt het hele scherm, ook als er een marge is ingesteld.","A new window joins":"Er komt een nieuw venster bij","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Een korte duw geeft de helft of het kwart. Houd het venster iets langer aan de rand en het groeit tot het volgende venster – het voorbeeld laat het zien.","A single window":"Eén enkel venster","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Een venster stopt aan de rand van een ander, ook als je het snel beweegt. Schud de muis of blijf even duwen om los te laten. 0 = vensters mogen vrij overlappen.","About & Help":"Over & hulp","Accent color":"Accentkleur","Active":"Actief","Active mode":"Actieve modus","Active width along the top edge":"Actieve breedte langs de bovenrand","Add an open application":"Een geopend programma toevoegen","Add rule":"Regel toevoegen","All window features in one system.":"Alle vensterfuncties in één systeem.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Verandert ook als je het hoofdvenster met de hand van grootte verandert.","Also while resizing":"Ook bij het van grootte veranderen","Always floating":"Altijd zwevend","Animation":"Animatie","Appearance":"Uiterlijk","Apply":"Toepassen","Arrange windows":"Vensters ordenen","Arrange windows automatically":"Vensters automatisch ordenen","Author":"Auteur","Automatic tiling":"Automatisch tegelen","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Automatisch tegelen staat uit – alleen modus 1 draait en de modussneltoets doet niets.","Automatic tiling off":"Automatisch tegelen uit","Automatic tiling on":"Automatisch tegelen aan","Automatic tiling on/off":"Automatisch tegelen aan/uit","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Automatisch tegelen, vensters wisselen, sneltoetsen en de magneet voor zwevende vensters.","Background opacity":"Dekking van de achtergrond","Behavior & Animation":"Gedrag & animatie","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Onderrand: onderste helft","Bouncy":"Verend","Buy me a coffee":"Trakteer me op een koffie","Cancel":"Annuleren","Center focus":"Focus midden","Center the window":"Venster centreren","Change":"Wijzigen","Change key":"Toets wijzigen","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"De toets wijzig je in de instellingeneditor. Beide modi hebben automatisch tegelen en de snapbalk of de schermranden nodig.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Wijzig ze op de pagina Sneltoetsen. Met automatisch tegelen wisselen de vensters ook van plek in de volgorde.","Choose…":"Kiezen…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Klik op een zone om te selecteren · dubbelklik om te splitsen · sleep de scheidingslijnen","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Klik of druk op %1 om van modus te wisselen.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Klik, dan OK – de instellingeneditor gaat open.","Close":"Sluiten","Close by, the edges stick together":"Dichtbij plakken de randen aan elkaar","Color scheme":"Kleurenschema","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Kleuren, grootte en vorm van de snapbalk.","Columns":"Kolommen","Corner radius":"Hoekradius","Corner size":"Hoekgrootte","Corner: a quarter":"Hoek: een kwart","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Hoeken: kwart van het scherm","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + toets (standaard)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + numeriek toetsenblok","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + toets","Custom color":"Eigen kleur","Custom layout %1":"Eigen indeling %1","Dark":"Donker","Delay before hiding":"Vertraging vóór verbergen","Delay before showing":"Vertraging vóór tonen","Delete":"Verwijderen","Delete layout?":"Indeling verwijderen?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Afstand waarop de greep verschijnt","Distance before the bar hides again":"Afstand voordat de balk weer verdwijnt","Distance to the edge":"Afstand tot de rand","Donate with PayPal":"Doneren met PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"Sleep aan een gedeelde rand…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Sleep een venster tegen een rand…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Sleep een venster op een ander om ze te wisselen. Laat je het los op de snapbalk of een schermrand, dan zweeft het vrij; „Venster laten zweven” haalt het terug. De tussenruimtes komen van de pagina Algemeen.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Sleep een venster boven het midden van een ander – het voorbeeld toont twee pijlen – en laat los. Bij automatisch tegelen volstaat elke plek boven het andere venster.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Sleep een venster naar de bovenrand van het scherm en zet het neer op een zone.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Sleep de kaarten om de volgorde in de snapbalk te wijzigen. Dubbelklik op een kaart om deze te bewerken.","Drop a window onto another one":"Een venster op een ander laten vallen","Drop the window onto a zone":"Zet het venster neer op een zone","Duplicate":"Dupliceren","Duration":"Duur","Dwindle":"Spiraal naar binnen","Dynamic":"Dynamisch","Edges and corners":"Randen en hoeken","Edit":"Bewerken","Edit layout":"Indeling bewerken","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Elke functie kan los worden in- en uitgeschakeld.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Elke indeling die je op de pagina Indelingen bouwt, kan ook vensters ordenen – ze verschijnt hierboven. Venster 1 krijgt zone 1 enzovoort; extra vensters delen de laatste zone. Met minder vensters dan zones wordt „Hoofd en stapel” gebruikt, zodat er geen gaten ontstaan.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Elk venster krijgt vanzelf zijn plek, zoals in een tegelende vensterbeheerder.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Elk venster krijgt vanzelf zijn plek op het scherm. Nieuwe vensters schuiven aan, gesloten vensters maken plaats voor de andere.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Voorbeeld: twee vensters naast elkaar, vanaf drie hoofd en stapel, vanaf vijf een raster. Zonder passende regel geldt de indeling die hierboven is gekozen.","Fade in and out":"In- en uitfaden","Fade the other windows":"Andere vensters vervagen","Features":"Functies","Feel":"Gevoel","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Rekening houden met al gesnapte vensters","Fits the way you work.":"Past bij hoe jij werkt.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Venster laten zweven (tegelen verlaten)","Four quarters":"Vier kwarten","From":"Vanaf","Fullscreen":"Volledig scherm","Gap between windows":"Ruimte tussen vensters","Gap to the screen edge":"Ruimte tot de schermrand","General":"Algemeen","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Geeft elke actie weer de toets van het gekozen schema en verwijdert toetsen die het schema niet heeft.","Good to know":"Goed om te weten","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Pak een venster bij de titelbalk en sleep het omhoog. De snapbalk schuift naar beneden; zet het venster neer op een zone en het vult precies dat gebied. Sleep het weer weg en het krijgt zijn oude grootte terug.","Grab window A…":"Pak venster A…","Grid":"Raster","Halves":"Helften","Hiding":"Verbergen","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Aan de rand vasthouden om de vrije ruimte te vullen","Hold time":"Houdtijd","Hold to fill":"Vasthouden om te vullen","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Hoe dicht een rand moet komen voordat hij vastklikt.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Hoe dicht de cursor bij de rand moet komen.","How far the bar slides down":"Hoe ver de balk naar beneden schuift","How it works":"Zo werkt het","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Hoe lang het venster tegen de rand moet blijven – een klein duwtje. 0 = direct.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Hoe lang het venster aan de rand moet blijven voordat het groeit.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Hoeveel vensters het hoofdgebied delen (indeling “Hoofd en stapel”).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Staat er onderaan al een venster, dan geeft de bovenrand de bovenste helft in plaats van te maximaliseren. Ook helften en kwarten laten gesnapte vensters vrij.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Vind je KSnapUnity fijn, dan kun je de ontwikkeling steunen – dank je!","In bar":"In balk","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Los van de snapbalk en de schermranden.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Los van de snapbalk. Elke rand is apart in te schakelen.","Information":"Informatie","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Intuïtief, natuurlijk venstergedrag.","Join at the end":"Achteraan aansluiten","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K van KWin · Snap van slimmer vastklikken · Unity van alles in één systeem","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE heeft eigen schermrandacties en een eigen vensteruitlijning. Staat dezelfde functie hier aan, zet die van KDE dan uit: Systeeminstellingen → Vensterbeheer → Schermranden, en Venstergedrag → Verplaatsen.","KDE's own edge tiling":"KDE's eigen randtegels","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"Het eigen maximaliseren en tegelen van KDE aan de randen – met de omtrek – pauzeert zolang KSnapUnity draait, zodat er maar één voorbeeld verschijnt. Je KDE-instellingen veranderen niet: zet dit uit, schakel KSnapUnity uit of verwijder het en het gedrag van KDE is terug.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"De eigen schermrandacties van KDE staan nog aan, dus reageren twee hulpmiddelen op hetzelfde slepen. Zet „Maximaliseren” en „Tegelen” uit in Systeeminstellingen → Vensterbeheer → Schermranden.","KDE's own window snapping":"KDE's eigen venstersnappen","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"De eigen vensteruitlijning van KDE staat ook aan. Voor een consistent gevoel zet je de zones op „Geen” in Systeeminstellingen → Vensterbeheer → Venstergedrag → Verplaatsen.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"De sneltoetsdienst van KDE reageerde niet. Je kunt de toetsen nog instellen in Systeeminstellingen → Sneltoetsen → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – Instellingeneditor","Keep stacked windows in line":"Gestapelde vensters op één lijn houden","Keep the gap between windows":"Ruimte tussen vensters behouden","Keep them":"Laten staan","Key scheme":"Toetsenschema","Keyboard shortcuts":"Sneltoetsen","Keys":"Toetsen","Keys already in use":"Toetsen al in gebruik","Layout":"Indeling","Layout by number of windows":"Indeling naar aantal vensters","Layouts":"Indelingen","Layouts per row":"Indelingen per rij","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Linker- en rechterrand: half scherm","Left edge: left half":"Linkerrand: linkerhelft","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Onder 100 % blijft een los venster in het midden – mooi op brede schermen.","License":"Licentie","Light":"Licht","Linear":"Lineair","Live preview":"Live-voorbeeld","Load template…":"Sjabloon laden…","Magnet":"Magneet","Main + stack":"Hoofd + stapel","Main and stack":"Hoofd en stapel","Main area bigger":"Hoofdgebied groter","Main area on the right":"Hoofdgebied rechts","Main area smaller":"Hoofdgebied kleiner","Main in the middle":"Hoofd in het midden","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Hoofdschakelaar voor slepen en de toetsen.","Main window":"Hoofdvenster","Main windows":"Hoofdvensters","Main windows: %1":"Hoofdvensters: %1","Make it the main window":"Hoofdvenster maken","Maximize":"Maximaliseren","Maximize or restore":"Maximaliseren of herstellen","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + toets (KDE-stijl)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + toets","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + toets","Minimize":"Minimaliseren","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Spiegelt de indeling: het hoofdvenster rechts, de andere links.","Mode":"Modus","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Modus 1 – Snapbalk en schermranden","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Modus 2 – Automatisch tegelen","Modes":"Modi","More ways":"Meer manieren","Motion curve":"Bewegingscurve","Move a window towards others…":"Beweeg een venster naar andere…","Move the window one place back":"Venster één plek terug","Move the window one place on":"Venster één plek vooruit","Name:":"Naam:","New layout":"Nieuwe indeling","New windows":"Nieuwe vensters","Next tiling layout":"Volgende tegelindeling","Next to the active window":"Naast het actieve venster","No key":"Geen toets","No other window open":"Geen ander venster open","No outer margin":"Geen buitenmarge","No shortcuts":"Geen sneltoetsen","None":"Geen","None yet.":"Nog geen.","Off":"Uit","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Uit = modus 1, aan = modus 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Uit: een neutraal kader – alleen voor de voorbeelden die aan staan.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Uit: de toetsen blijven toegewezen maar doen niets.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Uit: vensters blijven waar je ze neerzet. De andere functies werken hoe dan ook.","One at a time":"Eén tegelijk","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Eén sluit – de andere vullen het gat","One main window less":"Eén hoofdvenster minder","One more main window":"Eén hoofdvenster meer","One window":"Eén venster","Only one mode is switched on.":"Er staat maar één modus aan.","Open settings editor":"Instellingeneditor openen","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Open eerst het programma en kies het dan hier.","Open the layout builder":"Indelingenbouwer openen","Own layouts":"Eigen indelingen","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Deel van elke zijde dat als hoek telt.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"KDE's randtegels en het voorbeeld ervan pauzeren","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"KDE's snapzones pauzeren zolang de magneet aan staat","Preview":"Voorbeeld","Previews":"Voorbeelden","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Duw een venster tegen een rand of hoek van het scherm en het vult dat deel. Werkt met of zonder de snapbalk.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Duw een venster tegen een rand of hoek: maximaliseren, helften, kwarten.","Push delay":"Duwvertraging","Quarters":"Kwarten","Quick":"Snel","Quick settings":"Snelle instellingen","Recommended values":"Aanbevolen waarden","Remove":"Verwijderen","Remove rule":"Regel verwijderen","Remove zone":"Zone verwijderen","Reset all":"Alles herstellen","Reset all keys":"Alle toetsen herstellen","Reset to default":"Standaard herstellen","Resistance against overlapping":"Weerstand tegen overlappen","Resize touching windows together":"Vensters die elkaar raken samen van grootte veranderen","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Ook formaat wijzigen klikt vast – hier tot de volle hoogte","Restore":"Herstellen","Restore default layouts":"Standaardindelingen herstellen","Restore default layouts?":"Standaardindelingen herstellen?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Oorspronkelijke grootte herstellen bij wegslepen","Restore the size before snapping":"Grootte van vóór het snappen herstellen","Rows":"Rijen","Save":"Opslaan","Screen edges":"Schermranden","Screen edges on/off":"Schermranden aan/uit","Screen edges preview":"Voorbeeld van de schermranden","Set":"Instellen","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Stelt de toetsen van alle acties in één keer in. Losse toetsen kun je hieronder nog wijzigen.","Settings":"Instellingen","Settings file":"Instellingenbestand","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Schud bij het van grootte veranderen de muis snel heen en weer, en de andere vensters springen terug. Een snelle ruk in één richting laat nooit los.","Shake to let go":"Schudden om los te laten","Shortcuts":"Sneltoetsen","Show a small handle first":"Eerst een kleine greep tonen","Show layout and zone names":"Namen van indelingen en zones tonen","Show previews in the accent color":"Voorbeelden in de accentkleur tonen","Showing":"Tonen","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Toont waar het venster terechtkomt aan een rand of hoek. Uit: helemaal geen voorbeeld.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Toont waar het venster terechtkomt zolang een zone van de balk gemarkeerd is. Uit: helemaal geen voorbeeld.","Sidebar + grid":"Zijbalk + raster","Single zone":"Eén zone","Six tiles":"Zes tegels","Size & shape":"Grootte & vorm","Size of the main area":"Grootte van het hoofdgebied","Slide-in duration":"Duur van inschuiven","Slide-out duration":"Duur van uitschuiven","Smart arranging and detection.":"Slim indelen en herkennen.","Smart fill":"Slim vullen","Smooth (default)":"Vloeiend (standaard)","Snap bar":"Snapbalk","Snap bar and screen edges":"Snapbalk en schermranden","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Snapbalk en randen staan uit – alleen modus 2 draait en de modussneltoets doet niets.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"De snapbalk en de schermranden zitten automatisch tegelen in de weg. Daarom draaien ze als twee modi – wissel met de sneltoets of hier.","Snap bar colors:":"Kleuren van de snapbalk:","Snap bar on/off":"Snapbalk aan/uit","Snap bar preview":"Voorbeeld van de snapbalk","Snap bar size":"Grootte van de snapbalk","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Snapbalk, schermranden, venstermagneet, sneltoetsen en vensters wisselen.","Snap distance":"Kleefafstand","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Scheidingslijnen laten vastklikken (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Snap-indelingen en automatisch tegelen.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Snap het actieve venster met toetscombinaties.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Snap het actieve venster met het toetsenbord. Dit zijn gewone globale KDE-sneltoetsen – je vindt ze ook in Systeeminstellingen → Sneltoetsen → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Naar de onderste helft snappen","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Naar het kwart linksonder snappen","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Naar het kwart rechtsonder snappen","Snap to the center third":"Naar het middelste derde snappen","Snap to the left half":"Naar de linkerhelft snappen","Snap to the left third":"Naar het linkerderde snappen","Snap to the left two thirds":"Naar de linker twee derde snappen","Snap to the right half":"Naar de rechterhelft snappen","Snap to the right third":"Naar het rechterderde snappen","Snap to the right two thirds":"Naar de rechter twee derde snappen","Snap to the top half":"Naar de bovenste helft snappen","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Naar het kwart linksboven snappen","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Naar het kwart rechtsboven snappen","Snapping":"Vastklikken","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Vastklikken en automatisch tegelen draaien als twee modi – één sneltoets wisselt ertussen.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Zo trekt maar één magneet aan een venster. Je KDE-instellingen veranderen niet: zet dit uit, schakel KSnapUnity uit of verwijder het en het vastklikken van KDE is terug.","Soft":"Zacht","Spacing":"Tussenruimte","Spiral":"Spiraal","Split side by side":"Naast elkaar splitsen","Split top and bottom":"Boven en onder splitsen","Stack + main":"Stapel + hoofd","Stick to other windows":"Aan andere vensters plakken","Stick to the screen edges":"Aan de schermranden plakken","Sticky edges":"Plakkende randen","Support KSnapUnity":"Steun KSnapUnity","Swap":"Wisselen","Swap windows":"Vensters wisselen","Swap with the window above":"Wisselen met het venster erboven","Swap with the window below":"Wisselen met het venster eronder","Swap with the window on the left":"Wisselen met het venster links","Swap with the window on the right":"Wisselen met het venster rechts","Switch mode":"Modus wisselen","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Modus wisselen (vastklikken / tegelen)","Switch modes with:":"Modus wisselen met:","Switch the layout by itself":"Indeling zelf wisselen","Switched off":"Uitgeschakeld","System":"Systeem","Take it over":"Overnemen","Take over all":"Alles overnemen","Take the main place":"De hoofdplaats nemen","Test animation":"Animatie testen","Test on screen":"Op het scherm testen","Test the snap bar":"Snapbalk testen","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"De standaardwaarden zijn gebaseerd op Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"De snapacties gebruiken dezelfde ruimtes als de snapbalk en onthouden de grootte van vóór het snappen: „Grootte van vóór het snappen herstellen” zet die terug.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Deze programma’s worden nooit geordend en houden hun eigen plek. Dialogen zweven altijd.","Thirds":"Derden","Three columns":"Drie kolommen","Thumbnail width":"Breedte van miniaturen","Tiling":"Tegelen","Top / bottom":"Boven / onder","Top edge":"Bovenrand","Top edge: full screen":"Bovenrand: volledig scherm","Top edge: maximize":"Bovenrand: maximaliseren","Top edge: top half":"Bovenrand: bovenste helft","Top half":"Bovenste helft","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Activeringsafstand vanaf de bovenrand","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Zet dit uit als je KDE's eigen omtrek liever hebt – zet dan hierboven het voorbeeld van de schermranden uit.","Two thirds":"Twee derde","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Twee vensters wisselen van plaats – laat het ene op het andere vallen of gebruik de toetsen.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Twee vensters wisselen van plaats: laat het ene op het andere vallen, of met een toets.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Sneltoetsen gebruiken","Use screen edges":"Schermranden gebruiken","Use the system accent color":"Accentkleur van het systeem gebruiken","Use the window magnet":"Venstermagneet gebruiken","Usual combinations":"Gangbare combinaties","Version":"Versie","Wanted for: %1":"Gewenst voor: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Als een venster opent, sluit of wisselt, bewegen de andere soepel in plaats van te springen.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Als je een venster van grootte verandert, schuiven vensters die het raken de gedeelde rand mee – niets overlapt, er ontstaat geen kier.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Tijdens het vergroten of verkleinen worden vensters die niet meegaan doorzichtig getoond.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Terwijl je een venster verplaatst of van grootte verandert, plakken de randen aan nabije vensters en aan de schermranden.","Width":"Breedte","Window":"Venster","Window magnet":"Venstermagneet","Window magnet on/off":"Venstermagneet aan/uit","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Vensters boven elkaar houden hun linker- en rechterrand bij elkaar, vensters naast elkaar hun boven- en onderrand.","Windows glide to their place":"Vensters glijden naar hun plek","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Vensters plakken aan elkaar en aan de schermranden.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Vensters stoppen op de „Ruimte tussen vensters” van de pagina Algemeen in plaats van elkaar te raken.","Yes":"Ja","Your own combination":"Eigen combinatie","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Je eigen indelingen en hun volgorde gaan verloren.","for KWin · v%1":"voor KWin · v%1","windows:":"vensters:","“%1” will be removed.":"‘%1’ wordt verwijderd.","…drag it onto window B…":"…sleep het op venster B…","…in every direction":"…in elke richting","…let go: they trade places":"…laat los: ze wisselen van plaats","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…de buren groeien en krimpen mee","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Klaar – klik op OK om de instellingeneditor te openen."},"pa":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (ਨਕਲ)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 ਨੂੰ “%2” ਵਰਤ ਰਿਹਾ ਹੈ।","%1 of %2 zones":"%2 ਵਿੱਚੋਂ %1 ਜ਼ੋਨ","0 = all in one row":"0 = ਸਾਰੇ ਇੱਕ ਕਤਾਰ ਵਿੱਚ","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>ਮੋਡ 1</b><br/>ਸਨੈਪ ਬਾਰ ਅਤੇ ਸਕ੍ਰੀਨ ਦੇ ਕਿਨਾਰੇ","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>ਮੋਡ 2</b><br/>ਸਵੈਚਲਿਤ ਟਾਇਲਿੰਗ","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"ਇਕੱਲੀ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਪੂਰੀ ਸਕ੍ਰੀਨ ਵਰਤਦੀ ਹੈ, ਹਾਸ਼ੀਆ ਸੈੱਟ ਹੋਣ ’ਤੇ ਵੀ।","A new window joins":"ਨਵੀਂ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਜੁੜਦੀ ਹੈ","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"ਛੋਟਾ ਧੱਕਾ ਅੱਧਾ ਜਾਂ ਚੌਥਾਈ ਦਿੰਦਾ ਹੈ। ਵਿੰਡੋ ਨੂੰ ਕਿਨਾਰੇ ’ਤੇ ਥੋੜ੍ਹਾ ਹੋਰ ਦੇਰ ਰੱਖੋ ਅਤੇ ਉਹ ਅਗਲੀ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਤੱਕ ਵਧ ਜਾਂਦੀ ਹੈ – ਝਲਕ ਇਹ ਦਿਖਾਉਂਦੀ ਹੈ।","A single window":"ਇੱਕ ਇਕੱਲੀ ਵਿੰਡੋ","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"ਤੇਜ਼ੀ ਨਾਲ ਹਿਲਾਉਣ 'ਤੇ ਵੀ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਦੂਜੀ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਦੇ ਕਿਨਾਰੇ 'ਤੇ ਰੁਕ ਜਾਂਦੀ ਹੈ। ਛੁਡਾਉਣ ਲਈ ਮਾਊਸ ਹਿਲਾਓ ਜਾਂ ਇੱਕ ਪਲ ਹੋਰ ਧੱਕੋ। 0 = ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਖੁੱਲ੍ਹ ਕੇ ਇੱਕ-ਦੂਜੇ 'ਤੇ ਆ ਸਕਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ।","About & Help":"ਬਾਰੇ ਅਤੇ ਮਦਦ","Accent color":"ਐਕਸੈਂਟ ਰੰਗ","Active":"ਸਰਗਰਮ","Active mode":"ਸਰਗਰਮ ਮੋਡ","Active width along the top edge":"ਉੱਪਰਲੇ ਕਿਨਾਰੇ ਨਾਲ ਸਰਗਰਮ ਚੌੜਾਈ","Add an open application":"ਖੁੱਲ੍ਹੀ ਐਪ ਜੋੜੋ","Add rule":"ਨਿਯਮ ਜੋੜੋ","All window features in one system.":"ਸਾਰੀਆਂ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਵਿਸ਼ੇਸ਼ਤਾਵਾਂ ਇੱਕ ਸਿਸਟਮ ਵਿੱਚ।","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"ਜਦੋਂ ਤੁਸੀਂ ਹੱਥ ਨਾਲ ਮੁੱਖ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਦਾ ਆਕਾਰ ਬਦਲਦੇ ਹੋ ਤਾਂ ਵੀ ਬਦਲਦਾ ਹੈ।","Also while resizing":"ਆਕਾਰ ਬਦਲਦੇ ਸਮੇਂ ਵੀ","Always floating":"ਹਮੇਸ਼ਾ ਤੈਰਦੀਆਂ","Animation":"ਐਨੀਮੇਸ਼ਨ","Appearance":"ਦਿੱਖ","Apply":"ਲਾਗੂ ਕਰੋ","Arrange windows":"ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਸਜਾਓ","Arrange windows automatically":"ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਆਪਣੇ ਆਪ ਸਜਾਓ","Author":"ਲੇਖਕ","Automatic tiling":"ਸਵੈਚਲਿਤ ਟਾਇਲਿੰਗ","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"ਸਵੈਚਲਿਤ ਟਾਇਲਿੰਗ ਬੰਦ ਹੈ – ਸਿਰਫ਼ ਮੋਡ 1 ਚੱਲਦਾ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਮੋਡ ਸ਼ਾਰਟਕੱਟ ਕੁਝ ਨਹੀਂ ਕਰਦਾ।","Automatic tiling off":"ਸਵੈਚਲਿਤ ਟਾਇਲਿੰਗ ਬੰਦ","Automatic tiling on":"ਸਵੈਚਲਿਤ ਟਾਇਲਿੰਗ ਚਾਲੂ","Automatic tiling on/off":"ਸਵੈਚਲਿਤ ਟਾਇਲਿੰਗ ਚਾਲੂ/ਬੰਦ","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"ਸਵੈਚਲਿਤ ਟਾਇਲਿੰਗ, ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਦੀ ਅਦਲਾ-ਬਦਲੀ, ਸ਼ਾਰਟਕੱਟ ਅਤੇ ਤੈਰਦੀਆਂ ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਲਈ ਚੁੰਬਕ।","Background opacity":"ਪਿਛੋਕੜ ਦੀ ਅਪਾਰਦਰਸ਼ਤਾ","Behavior & Animation":"ਵਿਹਾਰ ਅਤੇ ਐਨੀਮੇਸ਼ਨ","Bottom edge: bottom half":"ਹੇਠਲਾ ਕਿਨਾਰਾ: ਹੇਠਲਾ ਅੱਧ","Bouncy":"ਉਛਲਦਾ","Buy me a coffee":"ਮੈਨੂੰ ਇੱਕ ਕੌਫ਼ੀ ਪਿਲਾਓ","Cancel":"ਰੱਦ ਕਰੋ","Center focus":"ਵਿਚਕਾਰ ਧਿਆਨ","Center the window":"ਵਿੰਡੋ ਨੂੰ ਵਿਚਕਾਰ ਕਰੋ","Change":"ਬਦਲੋ","Change key":"ਕੁੰਜੀ ਬਦਲੋ","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"ਕੁੰਜੀ ਸੈਟਿੰਗਾਂ ਸੰਪਾਦਕ ਵਿੱਚ ਬਦਲੋ। ਦੋਵਾਂ ਮੋਡਾਂ ਨੂੰ ਸਵੈਚਲਿਤ ਟਾਇਲਿੰਗ ਅਤੇ ਸਨੈਪ ਬਾਰ ਜਾਂ ਸਕ੍ਰੀਨ ਦੇ ਕਿਨਾਰਿਆਂ ਦੀ ਲੋੜ ਹੈ।","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"ਇਨ੍ਹਾਂ ਨੂੰ “ਕੀਬੋਰਡ ਸ਼ਾਰਟਕੱਟ” ਸਫ਼ੇ 'ਤੇ ਬਦਲੋ। ਸਵੈਚਲਿਤ ਟਾਇਲਿੰਗ ਵਿੱਚ ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਕ੍ਰਮ ਵਿੱਚ ਵੀ ਥਾਂ ਬਦਲਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ।","Choose…":"ਚੁਣੋ…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"ਚੁਣਨ ਲਈ ਜ਼ੋਨ ’ਤੇ ਕਲਿੱਕ ਕਰੋ · ਵੰਡਣ ਲਈ ਦੋ ਵਾਰ ਕਲਿੱਕ ਕਰੋ · ਵੰਡਕ ਖਿੱਚੋ","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"ਮੋਡ ਬਦਲਣ ਲਈ ਕਲਿੱਕ ਕਰੋ ਜਾਂ %1 ਦਬਾਓ।","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"ਕਲਿੱਕ ਕਰੋ, ਫਿਰ OK – ਸੈਟਿੰਗਾਂ ਸੰਪਾਦਕ ਖੁੱਲ੍ਹਦਾ ਹੈ।","Close":"ਬੰਦ ਕਰੋ","Close by, the edges stick together":"ਨੇੜੇ ਆਉਣ ’ਤੇ ਕਿਨਾਰੇ ਚਿਪਕ ਜਾਂਦੇ ਹਨ","Color scheme":"ਰੰਗ ਸਕੀਮ","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"ਸਨੈਪ ਬਾਰ ਦੇ ਰੰਗ, ਆਕਾਰ ਅਤੇ ਸ਼ਕਲ।","Columns":"ਕਾਲਮ","Corner radius":"ਕੋਨਿਆਂ ਦਾ ਅਰਧ-ਵਿਆਸ","Corner size":"ਕੋਨੇ ਦਾ ਆਕਾਰ","Corner: a quarter":"ਕੋਨਾ: ਇੱਕ ਚੌਥਾਈ","Corners: quarter of the screen":"ਕੋਨੇ: ਸਕ੍ਰੀਨ ਦਾ ਚੌਥਾਈ","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + ਕੁੰਜੀ (ਡਿਫ਼ਾਲਟ)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + ਨੰਬਰ ਪੈਡ","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + ਕੁੰਜੀ","Custom color":"ਆਪਣਾ ਰੰਗ","Custom layout %1":"ਆਪਣਾ ਖਾਕਾ %1","Dark":"ਗੂੜ੍ਹਾ","Delay before hiding":"ਲੁਕਾਉਣ ਤੋਂ ਪਹਿਲਾਂ ਦੇਰੀ","Delay before showing":"ਦਿਖਾਉਣ ਤੋਂ ਪਹਿਲਾਂ ਦੇਰੀ","Delete":"ਮਿਟਾਓ","Delete layout?":"ਖਾਕਾ ਮਿਟਾਉਣਾ ਹੈ?","Distance at which the handle appears":"ਉਹ ਦੂਰੀ ਜਿੱਥੇ ਹੈਂਡਲ ਦਿਸਦਾ ਹੈ","Distance before the bar hides again":"ਬਾਰ ਦੇ ਮੁੜ ਲੁਕਣ ਤੋਂ ਪਹਿਲਾਂ ਦੀ ਦੂਰੀ","Distance to the edge":"ਕਿਨਾਰੇ ਤੋਂ ਦੂਰੀ","Donate with PayPal":"PayPal ਨਾਲ ਦਾਨ ਕਰੋ","Drag a shared edge…":"ਸਾਂਝਾ ਕਿਨਾਰਾ ਖਿੱਚੋ…","Drag a window against an edge…":"ਵਿੰਡੋ ਨੂੰ ਕਿਨਾਰੇ ਵੱਲ ਖਿੱਚੋ…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"ਅਦਲਾ-ਬਦਲੀ ਲਈ ਇੱਕ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਨੂੰ ਦੂਜੀ ’ਤੇ ਖਿੱਚੋ। ਸਨੈਪ ਬਾਰ ਜਾਂ ਸਕ੍ਰੀਨ ਦੇ ਕਿਨਾਰੇ ’ਤੇ ਛੱਡਣ ’ਤੇ ਇਹ ਆਜ਼ਾਦ ਤੈਰਦੀ ਹੈ; „ਵਿੰਡੋ ਨੂੰ ਤੈਰਨ ਦਿਓ“ ਇਸਨੂੰ ਵਾਪਸ ਲਿਆਉਂਦਾ ਹੈ। ਵਿੱਥ ਆਮ ਪੰਨੇ ਤੋਂ ਆਉਂਦੀ ਹੈ।","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"ਵਿੰਡੋ ਨੂੰ ਦੂਜੀ ਦੇ ਵਿਚਕਾਰ ਖਿੱਚੋ – ਝਲਕ ਦੋ ਤੀਰ ਦਿਖਾਉਂਦੀ ਹੈ – ਅਤੇ ਛੱਡੋ। ਸਵੈਚਲਿਤ ਟਾਇਲਿੰਗ ਵਿੱਚ ਦੂਜੀ ਵਿੰਡੋ ’ਤੇ ਕਿਤੇ ਵੀ ਚੱਲੇਗਾ।","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"ਵਿੰਡੋ ਨੂੰ ਸਕਰੀਨ ਦੇ ਉੱਪਰਲੇ ਕਿਨਾਰੇ ਤੱਕ ਖਿੱਚੋ ਅਤੇ ਕਿਸੇ ਜ਼ੋਨ ’ਤੇ ਛੱਡ ਦਿਓ।","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"ਸਨੈਪ ਬਾਰ ਵਿੱਚ ਕ੍ਰਮ ਬਦਲਣ ਲਈ ਕਾਰਡ ਖਿੱਚੋ। ਸੋਧਣ ਲਈ ਕਾਰਡ ’ਤੇ ਦੋ ਵਾਰ ਕਲਿੱਕ ਕਰੋ।","Drop a window onto another one":"ਵਿੰਡੋ ਨੂੰ ਦੂਜੀ 'ਤੇ ਛੱਡੋ","Drop the window onto a zone":"ਵਿੰਡੋ ਨੂੰ ਕਿਸੇ ਜ਼ੋਨ ’ਤੇ ਛੱਡੋ","Duplicate":"ਨਕਲ ਬਣਾਓ","Duration":"ਮਿਆਦ","Dwindle":"ਡਵਿੰਡਲ","Dynamic":"ਗਤੀਸ਼ੀਲ","Edges and corners":"ਕਿਨਾਰੇ ਅਤੇ ਕੋਨੇ","Edit":"ਸੋਧੋ","Edit layout":"ਖਾਕਾ ਸੋਧੋ","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"ਹਰ ਫੀਚਰ ਵੱਖਰੇ ਤੌਰ 'ਤੇ ਚਾਲੂ ਅਤੇ ਬੰਦ ਕੀਤਾ ਜਾ ਸਕਦਾ ਹੈ।","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"ਖਾਕੇ ਪੰਨੇ ’ਤੇ ਬਣਾਇਆ ਹਰ ਖਾਕਾ ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਵੀ ਸਜਾ ਸਕਦਾ ਹੈ – ਇਹ ਉੱਪਰ ਦਿਸਦਾ ਹੈ। ਵਿੰਡੋ 1 ਨੂੰ ਜ਼ੋਨ 1 ਮਿਲਦਾ ਹੈ, ਇਸੇ ਤਰ੍ਹਾਂ; ਵਾਧੂ ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਆਖਰੀ ਜ਼ੋਨ ਸਾਂਝਾ ਕਰਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ। ਜ਼ੋਨਾਂ ਤੋਂ ਘੱਟ ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਹੋਣ ’ਤੇ „ਮੁੱਖ ਅਤੇ ਢੇਰ“ ਵਰਤਿਆ ਜਾਂਦਾ ਹੈ, ਤਾਂ ਜੋ ਖਾਲੀ ਥਾਂ ਨਾ ਰਹੇ।","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"ਹਰ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਆਪਣੀ ਥਾਂ ਆਪ ਲੱਭਦੀ ਹੈ, ਟਾਇਲਿੰਗ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਮੈਨੇਜਰ ਵਾਂਗ।","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"ਹਰ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਸਕ੍ਰੀਨ 'ਤੇ ਆਪਣੀ ਥਾਂ ਆਪ ਲੱਭਦੀ ਹੈ। ਨਵੀਆਂ ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਜੁੜਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ, ਬੰਦ ਹੋਈਆਂ ਬਾਕੀਆਂ ਲਈ ਥਾਂ ਛੱਡਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ।","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"ਉਦਾਹਰਨ: ਦੋ ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਨਾਲ-ਨਾਲ, ਤਿੰਨ ਤੋਂ ਮੁੱਖ ਅਤੇ ਢੇਰ, ਪੰਜ ਤੋਂ ਗਰਿੱਡ। ਮੇਲ ਖਾਂਦਾ ਨਿਯਮ ਨਾ ਹੋਵੇ ਤਾਂ ਉੱਪਰ ਚੁਣਿਆ ਖਾਕਾ ਵਰਤਿਆ ਜਾਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","Fade in and out":"ਆਉਂਦੇ-ਜਾਂਦੇ ਫਿੱਕਾ ਕਰੋ","Fade the other windows":"ਹੋਰ ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਧੁੰਦਲੀਆਂ ਕਰੋ","Features":"ਵਿਸ਼ੇਸ਼ਤਾਵਾਂ","Feel":"ਅਹਿਸਾਸ","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"ਪਹਿਲਾਂ ਤੋਂ ਸਨੈਪ ਕੀਤੀਆਂ ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਦੇ ਦੁਆਲੇ ਫਿੱਟ ਕਰੋ","Fits the way you work.":"ਤੁਹਾਡੇ ਕੰਮ ਦੇ ਢੰਗ ਨਾਲ ਮੇਲ ਖਾਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","Float the window (leave tiling)":"ਵਿੰਡੋ ਨੂੰ ਤੈਰਨ ਦਿਓ (ਟਾਇਲਿੰਗ ਛੱਡੋ)","Four quarters":"ਚਾਰ ਚੌਥਾਈ","From":"ਤੋਂ","Fullscreen":"ਪੂਰੀ ਸਕ੍ਰੀਨ","Gap between windows":"ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਵਿਚਕਾਰ ਵਿੱਥ","Gap to the screen edge":"ਸਕਰੀਨ ਦੇ ਕਿਨਾਰੇ ਤੱਕ ਵਿੱਥ","General":"ਆਮ","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"ਹਰ ਕਿਰਿਆ ਨੂੰ ਮੁੜ ਚੁਣੀ ਯੋਜਨਾ ਦੀ ਕੁੰਜੀ ਦਿੰਦਾ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਯੋਜਨਾ ਵਿੱਚ ਨਾ ਹੋਣ ਵਾਲੀਆਂ ਕੁੰਜੀਆਂ ਹਟਾਉਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","Good to know":"ਜਾਣਨ ਯੋਗ","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"ਵਿੰਡੋ ਨੂੰ ਉਸ ਦੀ ਸਿਰਲੇਖ ਪੱਟੀ ਤੋਂ ਫੜ ਕੇ ਉੱਪਰ ਖਿੱਚੋ। ਸਨੈਪ ਬਾਰ ਹੇਠਾਂ ਆ ਜਾਂਦੀ ਹੈ; ਵਿੰਡੋ ਨੂੰ ਕਿਸੇ ਜ਼ੋਨ ’ਤੇ ਛੱਡੋ ਅਤੇ ਉਹ ਠੀਕ ਉਹੀ ਹਿੱਸਾ ਭਰ ਦੇਵੇਗੀ। ਮੁੜ ਬਾਹਰ ਖਿੱਚਣ ’ਤੇ ਉਸ ਨੂੰ ਪੁਰਾਣਾ ਆਕਾਰ ਵਾਪਸ ਮਿਲ ਜਾਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","Grab window A…":"ਵਿੰਡੋ A ਫੜੋ…","Grid":"ਗਰਿੱਡ","Halves":"ਅੱਧੇ-ਅੱਧੇ","Hiding":"ਲੁਕਾਉਣਾ","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"ਖਾਲੀ ਥਾਂ ਭਰਨ ਲਈ ਕਿਨਾਰੇ ’ਤੇ ਫੜੀ ਰੱਖੋ","Hold time":"ਫੜਨ ਦਾ ਸਮਾਂ","Hold to fill":"ਭਰਨ ਲਈ ਫੜੀ ਰੱਖੋ","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"ਕਿਨਾਰੇ ਨੂੰ ਥਾਂ ’ਤੇ ਬੈਠਣ ਤੋਂ ਪਹਿਲਾਂ ਕਿੰਨਾ ਨੇੜੇ ਆਉਣਾ ਪੈਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"ਕਰਸਰ ਨੂੰ ਕਿਨਾਰੇ ਦੇ ਕਿੰਨਾ ਨੇੜੇ ਆਉਣਾ ਪੈਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","How far the bar slides down":"ਬਾਰ ਕਿੰਨੀ ਹੇਠਾਂ ਖਿਸਕਦੀ ਹੈ","How it works":"ਇਹ ਕਿਵੇਂ ਕੰਮ ਕਰਦਾ ਹੈ","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"ਵਿੰਡੋ ਨੂੰ ਕਿਨਾਰੇ ਨਾਲ ਕਿੰਨੀ ਦੇਰ ਟਿਕੇ ਰਹਿਣਾ ਪੈਂਦਾ ਹੈ – ਹਲਕਾ ਧੱਕਾ। 0 = ਤੁਰੰਤ।","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"ਵਧਣ ਤੋਂ ਪਹਿਲਾਂ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਨੂੰ ਕਿਨਾਰੇ ’ਤੇ ਕਿੰਨੀ ਦੇਰ ਰਹਿਣਾ ਪੈਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"ਕਿੰਨੀਆਂ ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਮੁੱਖ ਖੇਤਰ ਸਾਂਝਾ ਕਰਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ (ਖਾਕਾ “ਮੁੱਖ ਅਤੇ ਢੇਰ”)।","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"ਜੇ ਹੇਠਾਂ ਪਹਿਲਾਂ ਹੀ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਹੈ, ਤਾਂ ਉੱਪਰਲਾ ਕਿਨਾਰਾ ਵੱਧ ਤੋਂ ਵੱਧ ਕਰਨ ਦੀ ਬਜਾਏ ਉੱਪਰਲਾ ਅੱਧ ਦਿੰਦਾ ਹੈ। ਅੱਧੇ ਅਤੇ ਚੌਥਾਈ ਵੀ ਸਨੈਪ ਕੀਤੀਆਂ ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਨੂੰ ਨਹੀਂ ਢਕਦੇ।","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"ਜੇ ਤੁਹਾਨੂੰ KSnapUnity ਪਸੰਦ ਹੈ, ਤਾਂ ਤੁਸੀਂ ਇਸਦੇ ਵਿਕਾਸ ਦਾ ਸਮਰਥਨ ਕਰ ਸਕਦੇ ਹੋ – ਧੰਨਵਾਦ!","In bar":"ਬਾਰ ਵਿੱਚ","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"ਸਨੈਪ ਬਾਰ ਅਤੇ ਸਕ੍ਰੀਨ ਦੇ ਕਿਨਾਰਿਆਂ ਤੋਂ ਸੁਤੰਤਰ।","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"ਸਨੈਪ ਬਾਰ ਤੋਂ ਸੁਤੰਤਰ। ਹਰ ਕਿਨਾਰਾ ਵੱਖਰੇ ਤੌਰ ’ਤੇ ਚਾਲੂ ਕੀਤਾ ਜਾ ਸਕਦਾ ਹੈ।","Information":"ਜਾਣਕਾਰੀ","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"ਸਹਿਜ, ਕੁਦਰਤੀ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਵਿਹਾਰ।","Join at the end":"ਅਖੀਰ ਵਿੱਚ ਜੁੜਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K ਯਾਨੀ KWin · Snap ਯਾਨੀ ਸਮਾਰਟ ਸਨੈਪਿੰਗ · Unity ਯਾਨੀ ਸਭ ਕੁਝ ਇੱਕ ਸਿਸਟਮ ਵਿੱਚ","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE ਦੀਆਂ ਆਪਣੀਆਂ ਸਕ੍ਰੀਨ-ਕਿਨਾਰਾ ਕਿਰਿਆਵਾਂ ਅਤੇ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਸਨੈਪਿੰਗ ਹਨ। ਜੇ ਇੱਥੇ ਉਹੀ ਵਿਸ਼ੇਸ਼ਤਾ ਚਾਲੂ ਹੈ, ਤਾਂ KDE ਵਾਲੀ ਬੰਦ ਕਰੋ: ਸਿਸਟਮ ਸੈਟਿੰਗਾਂ → ਵਿੰਡੋ ਪ੍ਰਬੰਧਨ → ਸਕ੍ਰੀਨ ਦੇ ਕਿਨਾਰੇ, ਅਤੇ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਵਿਹਾਰ → ਹਿਲਾਉਣਾ।","KDE's own edge tiling":"KDE ਦੀ ਆਪਣੀ ਕਿਨਾਰਾ ਟਾਈਲਿੰਗ","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"ਕਿਨਾਰਿਆਂ ’ਤੇ KDE ਦਾ ਆਪਣਾ ਵੱਡਾ ਕਰਨਾ ਅਤੇ ਟਾਇਲਿੰਗ – ਰੂਪਰੇਖਾ ਸਮੇਤ – KSnapUnity ਚੱਲਣ ਤੱਕ ਰੁਕਿਆ ਰਹਿੰਦਾ ਹੈ, ਤਾਂ ਜੋ ਇੱਕੋ ਝਲਕ ਦਿਖੇ। ਤੁਹਾਡੀਆਂ KDE ਸੈਟਿੰਗਾਂ ਨਹੀਂ ਬਦਲਦੀਆਂ: ਇਸਨੂੰ ਬੰਦ ਕਰੋ, KSnapUnity ਅਯੋਗ ਕਰੋ ਜਾਂ ਹਟਾਓ ਅਤੇ KDE ਦਾ ਵਿਹਾਰ ਵਾਪਸ ਆ ਜਾਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"KDE ਦੀਆਂ ਆਪਣੀਆਂ ਸਕ੍ਰੀਨ-ਕਿਨਾਰਾ ਕਿਰਿਆਵਾਂ ਅਜੇ ਵੀ ਚਾਲੂ ਹਨ, ਇਸ ਲਈ ਇੱਕੋ ਖਿੱਚ ’ਤੇ ਦੋ ਸਹਾਇਕ ਜਵਾਬ ਦਿੰਦੇ ਹਨ। ਸਿਸਟਮ ਸੈਟਿੰਗਾਂ → ਵਿੰਡੋ ਪ੍ਰਬੰਧਨ → ਸਕ੍ਰੀਨ ਦੇ ਕਿਨਾਰੇ ਵਿੱਚ “ਵੱਧ ਤੋਂ ਵੱਧ ਕਰੋ” ਅਤੇ “ਟਾਈਲ” ਬੰਦ ਕਰੋ।","KDE's own window snapping":"KDE ਦੀ ਆਪਣੀ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਸਨੈਪਿੰਗ","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE ਦੀ ਆਪਣੀ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਸਨੈਪਿੰਗ ਵੀ ਚਾਲੂ ਹੈ। ਇੱਕਸਾਰ ਅਹਿਸਾਸ ਲਈ ਸਿਸਟਮ ਸੈਟਿੰਗਾਂ → ਵਿੰਡੋ ਪ੍ਰਬੰਧਨ → ਵਿੰਡੋ ਵਿਹਾਰ → ਹਿਲਾਉਣਾ ਵਿੱਚ ਇਸਦੇ ਜ਼ੋਨ “ਕੋਈ ਨਹੀਂ” ’ਤੇ ਸੈੱਟ ਕਰੋ।","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"KDE ਦੀ ਸ਼ਾਰਟਕੱਟ ਸੇਵਾ ਨੇ ਜਵਾਬ ਨਹੀਂ ਦਿੱਤਾ। ਤੁਸੀਂ ਕੁੰਜੀਆਂ ਸਿਸਟਮ ਸੈਟਿੰਗਾਂ → ਸ਼ਾਰਟਕੱਟ → KWin ਵਿੱਚ ਵੀ ਸੈੱਟ ਕਰ ਸਕਦੇ ਹੋ।","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – ਸੈਟਿੰਗਾਂ ਸੰਪਾਦਕ","Keep stacked windows in line":"ਉੱਪਰ-ਹੇਠਾਂ ਰੱਖੀਆਂ ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਨੂੰ ਇੱਕ ਲਾਈਨ ਵਿੱਚ ਰੱਖੋ","Keep the gap between windows":"ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਵਿਚਕਾਰ ਵਿੱਥ ਰੱਖੋ","Keep them":"ਰਹਿਣ ਦਿਓ","Key scheme":"ਕੁੰਜੀ ਯੋਜਨਾ","Keyboard shortcuts":"ਕੀਬੋਰਡ ਸ਼ਾਰਟਕੱਟ","Keys":"ਕੁੰਜੀਆਂ","Keys already in use":"ਪਹਿਲਾਂ ਤੋਂ ਵਰਤੋਂ ਵਿੱਚ ਕੁੰਜੀਆਂ","Layout":"ਖਾਕਾ","Layout by number of windows":"ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਦੀ ਗਿਣਤੀ ਅਨੁਸਾਰ ਖਾਕਾ","Layouts":"ਖਾਕੇ","Layouts per row":"ਹਰ ਕਤਾਰ ਵਿੱਚ ਖਾਕੇ","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"ਖੱਬਾ ਅਤੇ ਸੱਜਾ ਕਿਨਾਰਾ: ਅੱਧੀ ਸਕ੍ਰੀਨ","Left edge: left half":"ਖੱਬਾ ਕਿਨਾਰਾ: ਖੱਬਾ ਅੱਧ","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"100 % ਤੋਂ ਘੱਟ ’ਤੇ ਇਕੱਲੀ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਵਿਚਕਾਰ ਰਹਿੰਦੀ ਹੈ – ਚੌੜੀਆਂ ਸਕ੍ਰੀਨਾਂ ’ਤੇ ਵਧੀਆ।","License":"ਲਸੰਸ","Light":"ਹਲਕਾ","Linear":"ਰੇਖਿਕ","Live preview":"ਲਾਈਵ ਝਲਕ","Load template…":"ਟੈਂਪਲੇਟ ਲੋਡ ਕਰੋ…","Magnet":"ਚੁੰਬਕ","Main + stack":"ਮੁੱਖ + ਢੇਰ","Main and stack":"ਮੁੱਖ ਅਤੇ ਢੇਰ","Main area bigger":"ਵੱਡਾ ਮੁੱਖ ਖੇਤਰ","Main area on the right":"ਮੁੱਖ ਖੇਤਰ ਸੱਜੇ","Main area smaller":"ਛੋਟਾ ਮੁੱਖ ਖੇਤਰ","Main in the middle":"ਵਿਚਕਾਰ ਮੁੱਖ","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"ਖਿੱਚਣ ਅਤੇ ਕੁੰਜੀਆਂ ਲਈ ਮੁੱਖ ਸਵਿੱਚ।","Main window":"ਮੁੱਖ ਵਿੰਡੋ","Main windows":"ਮੁੱਖ ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ","Main windows: %1":"ਮੁੱਖ ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ: %1","Make it the main window":"ਮੁੱਖ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਬਣਾਓ","Maximize":"ਵੱਧ ਤੋਂ ਵੱਧ ਕਰੋ","Maximize or restore":"ਵੱਧ ਤੋਂ ਵੱਧ ਕਰੋ ਜਾਂ ਬਹਾਲ ਕਰੋ","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + ਕੁੰਜੀ (KDE ਸ਼ੈਲੀ)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + ਕੁੰਜੀ","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + ਕੁੰਜੀ","Minimize":"ਛੋਟਾ ਕਰੋ","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"ਖਾਕੇ ਨੂੰ ਉਲਟਾਉਂਦਾ ਹੈ: ਮੁੱਖ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਸੱਜੇ, ਬਾਕੀ ਖੱਬੇ।","Mode":"ਮੋਡ","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"ਮੋਡ 1 – ਸਨੈਪ ਬਾਰ ਅਤੇ ਸਕ੍ਰੀਨ ਦੇ ਕਿਨਾਰੇ","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"ਮੋਡ 2 – ਸਵੈਚਲਿਤ ਟਾਇਲਿੰਗ","Modes":"ਮੋਡ","More ways":"ਹੋਰ ਤਰੀਕੇ","Motion curve":"ਗਤੀ ਵਕਰ","Move a window towards others…":"ਵਿੰਡੋ ਨੂੰ ਹੋਰਨਾਂ ਵੱਲ ਲੈ ਜਾਓ…","Move the window one place back":"ਵਿੰਡੋ ਨੂੰ ਇੱਕ ਥਾਂ ਪਿੱਛੇ ਕਰੋ","Move the window one place on":"ਵਿੰਡੋ ਨੂੰ ਇੱਕ ਥਾਂ ਅੱਗੇ ਕਰੋ","Name:":"ਨਾਮ:","New layout":"ਨਵਾਂ ਖਾਕਾ","New windows":"ਨਵੀਆਂ ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ","Next tiling layout":"ਅਗਲਾ ਟਾਇਲਿੰਗ ਖਾਕਾ","Next to the active window":"ਸਰਗਰਮ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਦੇ ਨਾਲ","No key":"ਕੋਈ ਕੁੰਜੀ ਨਹੀਂ","No other window open":"ਕੋਈ ਹੋਰ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਖੁੱਲ੍ਹੀ ਨਹੀਂ","No outer margin":"ਬਾਹਰੀ ਹਾਸ਼ੀਆ ਨਹੀਂ","No shortcuts":"ਕੋਈ ਸ਼ਾਰਟਕੱਟ ਨਹੀਂ","None":"ਕੋਈ ਨਹੀਂ","None yet.":"ਹਾਲੇ ਕੋਈ ਨਹੀਂ।","Off":"ਬੰਦ","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"ਬੰਦ = ਮੋਡ 1, ਚਾਲੂ = ਮੋਡ 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"ਬੰਦ: ਇੱਕ ਨਿਰਪੱਖ ਫ਼ਰੇਮ – ਸਿਰਫ਼ ਚਾਲੂ ਝਲਕਾਂ ਲਈ।","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"ਬੰਦ: ਕੁੰਜੀਆਂ ਸੌਂਪੀਆਂ ਰਹਿੰਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ ਪਰ ਕੁਝ ਨਹੀਂ ਕਰਦੀਆਂ।","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"ਬੰਦ: ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਉੱਥੇ ਹੀ ਰਹਿੰਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ ਜਿੱਥੇ ਤੁਸੀਂ ਰੱਖਦੇ ਹੋ। ਬਾਕੀ ਫੀਚਰ ਹਰ ਹਾਲ ਵਿੱਚ ਕੰਮ ਕਰਦੇ ਹਨ।","One at a time":"ਇੱਕ-ਇੱਕ ਕਰਕੇ","One closes – the others fill the gap":"ਇੱਕ ਬੰਦ ਹੁੰਦੀ ਹੈ – ਬਾਕੀ ਖਾਲੀ ਥਾਂ ਭਰਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ","One main window less":"ਇੱਕ ਮੁੱਖ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਘੱਟ","One more main window":"ਇੱਕ ਹੋਰ ਮੁੱਖ ਵਿੰਡੋ","One window":"ਇੱਕ ਵਿੰਡੋ","Only one mode is switched on.":"ਸਿਰਫ਼ ਇੱਕ ਮੋਡ ਚਾਲੂ ਹੈ।","Open settings editor":"ਸੈਟਿੰਗਾਂ ਸੰਪਾਦਕ ਖੋਲ੍ਹੋ","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"ਪਹਿਲਾਂ ਐਪ ਖੋਲ੍ਹੋ, ਫਿਰ ਇੱਥੇ ਚੁਣੋ।","Open the layout builder":"ਖਾਕਾ ਬਿਲਡਰ ਖੋਲ੍ਹੋ","Own layouts":"ਆਪਣੇ ਖਾਕੇ","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"ਹਰ ਪਾਸੇ ਦਾ ਉਹ ਹਿੱਸਾ ਜੋ ਕੋਨਾ ਗਿਣਿਆ ਜਾਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"KDE ਦੀ ਕਿਨਾਰਾ ਟਾਈਲਿੰਗ ਅਤੇ ਉਸਦੀ ਝਲਕ ਰੋਕੋ","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"ਚੁੰਬਕ ਚਾਲੂ ਹੋਣ ਤੱਕ KDE ਦੇ ਸਨੈਪ ਜ਼ੋਨ ਰੋਕੋ","Preview":"ਝਲਕ","Previews":"ਝਲਕਾਂ","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"ਵਿੰਡੋ ਨੂੰ ਸਕ੍ਰੀਨ ਦੇ ਕਿਨਾਰੇ ਜਾਂ ਕੋਨੇ ਨਾਲ ਧੱਕੋ ਅਤੇ ਉਹ ਉਸ ਹਿੱਸੇ ਨੂੰ ਭਰ ਦਿੰਦੀ ਹੈ। ਸਨੈਪ ਬਾਰ ਨਾਲ ਜਾਂ ਉਸ ਤੋਂ ਬਿਨਾਂ ਕੰਮ ਕਰਦਾ ਹੈ।","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"ਵਿੰਡੋ ਨੂੰ ਕਿਨਾਰੇ ਜਾਂ ਕੋਨੇ ਨਾਲ ਧੱਕੋ: ਵੱਧ ਤੋਂ ਵੱਧ, ਅੱਧੇ, ਚੌਥਾਈ।","Push delay":"ਧੱਕੇ ਦੀ ਦੇਰੀ","Quarters":"ਚੌਥਾਈਆਂ","Quick":"ਤੇਜ਼","Quick settings":"ਤੇਜ਼ ਸੈਟਿੰਗਾਂ","Recommended values":"ਸਿਫ਼ਾਰਸ਼ੀ ਮੁੱਲ","Remove":"ਹਟਾਓ","Remove rule":"ਨਿਯਮ ਹਟਾਓ","Remove zone":"ਜ਼ੋਨ ਹਟਾਓ","Reset all":"ਸਭ ਰੀਸੈੱਟ ਕਰੋ","Reset all keys":"ਸਾਰੀਆਂ ਕੁੰਜੀਆਂ ਰੀਸੈੱਟ ਕਰੋ","Reset to default":"ਡਿਫ਼ਾਲਟ ’ਤੇ ਵਾਪਸ ਕਰੋ","Resistance against overlapping":"ਓਵਰਲੈਪ ਦੇ ਵਿਰੁੱਧ ਵਿਰੋਧ","Resize touching windows together":"ਛੂਹਣ ਵਾਲੀਆਂ ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਦਾ ਆਕਾਰ ਇਕੱਠੇ ਬਦਲੋ","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"ਆਕਾਰ ਬਦਲਣ ’ਤੇ ਵੀ ਚਿਪਕਦਾ ਹੈ – ਇੱਥੇ ਪੂਰੀ ਉਚਾਈ ਤੱਕ","Restore":"ਮੁੜ-ਬਹਾਲ ਕਰੋ","Restore default layouts":"ਮੂਲ ਖਾਕੇ ਮੁੜ-ਬਹਾਲ ਕਰੋ","Restore default layouts?":"ਮੂਲ ਖਾਕੇ ਮੁੜ-ਬਹਾਲ ਕਰਨੇ ਹਨ?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"ਵਿੰਡੋ ਬਾਹਰ ਖਿੱਚਣ ’ਤੇ ਅਸਲ ਆਕਾਰ ਵਾਪਸ ਲਿਆਓ","Restore the size before snapping":"ਸਨੈਪ ਤੋਂ ਪਹਿਲਾਂ ਦਾ ਆਕਾਰ ਬਹਾਲ ਕਰੋ","Rows":"ਕਤਾਰਾਂ","Save":"ਸੰਭਾਲੋ","Screen edges":"ਸਕ੍ਰੀਨ ਦੇ ਕਿਨਾਰੇ","Screen edges on/off":"ਸਕ੍ਰੀਨ ਦੇ ਕਿਨਾਰੇ ਚਾਲੂ/ਬੰਦ","Screen edges preview":"ਸਕ੍ਰੀਨ ਦੇ ਕਿਨਾਰਿਆਂ ਦੀ ਝਲਕ","Set":"ਸੈੱਟ ਕਰੋ","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"ਸਾਰੀਆਂ ਕਿਰਿਆਵਾਂ ਦੀਆਂ ਕੁੰਜੀਆਂ ਇੱਕੋ ਵਾਰ ਸੈੱਟ ਕਰਦੀ ਹੈ। ਵੱਖਰੀਆਂ ਕੁੰਜੀਆਂ ਤੁਸੀਂ ਹੇਠਾਂ ਅਜੇ ਵੀ ਬਦਲ ਸਕਦੇ ਹੋ।","Settings":"ਸੈਟਿੰਗਾਂ","Settings file":"ਸੈਟਿੰਗਾਂ ਫ਼ਾਈਲ","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"ਆਕਾਰ ਬਦਲਦੇ ਸਮੇਂ ਮਾਊਸ ਨੂੰ ਤੇਜ਼ੀ ਨਾਲ ਅੱਗੇ-ਪਿੱਛੇ ਹਿਲਾਓ ਅਤੇ ਬਾਕੀ ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਵਾਪਸ ਛਾਲ ਮਾਰਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ। ਇੱਕ ਦਿਸ਼ਾ ਵਿੱਚ ਤੇਜ਼ ਖਿੱਚ ਉਨ੍ਹਾਂ ਨੂੰ ਕਦੇ ਨਹੀਂ ਛੱਡਦੀ।","Shake to let go":"ਛੱਡਣ ਲਈ ਹਿਲਾਓ","Shortcuts":"ਸ਼ਾਰਟਕੱਟ","Show a small handle first":"ਪਹਿਲਾਂ ਇੱਕ ਛੋਟਾ ਹੈਂਡਲ ਦਿਖਾਓ","Show layout and zone names":"ਖਾਕਿਆਂ ਅਤੇ ਜ਼ੋਨਾਂ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਦਿਖਾਓ","Show previews in the accent color":"ਝਲਕਾਂ ਐਕਸੈਂਟ ਰੰਗ ਵਿੱਚ ਦਿਖਾਓ","Showing":"ਦਿਖਾਉਣਾ","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"ਦਿਖਾਉਂਦਾ ਹੈ ਕਿ ਕਿਨਾਰੇ ਜਾਂ ਕੋਨੇ ’ਤੇ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਕਿੱਥੇ ਜਾਵੇਗੀ। ਬੰਦ: ਕੋਈ ਝਲਕ ਨਹੀਂ।","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"ਜਦੋਂ ਸਨੈਪ ਬਾਰ ਦਾ ਕੋਈ ਜ਼ੋਨ ਉਜਾਗਰ ਹੋਵੇ, ਦਿਖਾਉਂਦਾ ਹੈ ਕਿ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਕਿੱਥੇ ਜਾਵੇਗੀ। ਬੰਦ: ਕੋਈ ਝਲਕ ਨਹੀਂ।","Sidebar + grid":"ਸਾਈਡਬਾਰ + ਗਰਿੱਡ","Single zone":"ਇੱਕ ਜ਼ੋਨ","Six tiles":"ਛੇ ਟਾਈਲਾਂ","Size & shape":"ਆਕਾਰ ਅਤੇ ਸ਼ਕਲ","Size of the main area":"ਮੁੱਖ ਖੇਤਰ ਦਾ ਆਕਾਰ","Slide-in duration":"ਅੰਦਰ ਆਉਣ ਦਾ ਸਮਾਂ","Slide-out duration":"ਬਾਹਰ ਜਾਣ ਦਾ ਸਮਾਂ","Smart arranging and detection.":"ਸਮਝਦਾਰ ਤਰਤੀਬ ਅਤੇ ਪਛਾਣ।","Smart fill":"ਸਮਾਰਟ ਭਰਾਈ","Smooth (default)":"ਸੁਚੱਜਾ (ਮੂਲ)","Snap bar":"ਸਨੈਪ ਬਾਰ","Snap bar and screen edges":"ਸਨੈਪ ਬਾਰ ਅਤੇ ਸਕ੍ਰੀਨ ਦੇ ਕਿਨਾਰੇ","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"ਸਨੈਪ ਬਾਰ ਅਤੇ ਕਿਨਾਰੇ ਬੰਦ ਹਨ – ਸਿਰਫ਼ ਮੋਡ 2 ਚੱਲਦਾ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਮੋਡ ਸ਼ਾਰਟਕੱਟ ਕੁਝ ਨਹੀਂ ਕਰਦਾ।","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"ਸਨੈਪ ਬਾਰ ਅਤੇ ਸਕ੍ਰੀਨ ਦੇ ਕਿਨਾਰੇ ਸਵੈਚਲਿਤ ਟਾਇਲਿੰਗ ਵਿੱਚ ਰੁਕਾਵਟ ਪਾਉਂਦੇ ਹਨ। ਇਸ ਲਈ ਇਹ ਦੋ ਮੋਡਾਂ ਵਜੋਂ ਚੱਲਦੇ ਹਨ – ਸ਼ਾਰਟਕੱਟ ਨਾਲ ਜਾਂ ਇੱਥੋਂ ਬਦਲੋ।","Snap bar colors:":"ਸਨੈਪ ਬਾਰ ਦੇ ਰੰਗ:","Snap bar on/off":"ਸਨੈਪ ਬਾਰ ਚਾਲੂ/ਬੰਦ","Snap bar preview":"ਸਨੈਪ ਬਾਰ ਦੀ ਝਲਕ","Snap bar size":"ਸਨੈਪ ਬਾਰ ਦਾ ਆਕਾਰ","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"ਸਨੈਪ ਬਾਰ, ਸਕ੍ਰੀਨ ਦੇ ਕਿਨਾਰੇ, ਵਿੰਡੋ ਚੁੰਬਕ, ਸ਼ਾਰਟਕੱਟ ਅਤੇ ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਦੀ ਅਦਲਾ-ਬਦਲੀ।","Snap distance":"ਸਨੈਪ ਦੂਰੀ","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"ਵੰਡਕ ਸਨੈਪ ਕਰੋ (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"ਸਨੈਪ ਖਾਕੇ ਅਤੇ ਸਵੈਚਲਿਤ ਟਾਇਲਿੰਗ।","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"ਸਰਗਰਮ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਨੂੰ ਕੁੰਜੀ ਮੇਲਾਂ ਨਾਲ ਸਨੈਪ ਕਰੋ।","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"ਸਰਗਰਮ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਨੂੰ ਕੀਬੋਰਡ ਨਾਲ ਸਨੈਪ ਕਰੋ। ਇਹ ਆਮ KDE ਗਲੋਬਲ ਸ਼ਾਰਟਕੱਟ ਹਨ – ਇਹ ਸਿਸਟਮ ਸੈਟਿੰਗਾਂ → ਸ਼ਾਰਟਕੱਟ → KWin ਵਿੱਚ ਵੀ ਮਿਲਦੇ ਹਨ।","Snap to the bottom half":"ਹੇਠਲੇ ਅੱਧ ਵਿੱਚ ਸਨੈਪ ਕਰੋ","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"ਹੇਠਾਂ-ਖੱਬੇ ਚੌਥਾਈ ਵਿੱਚ ਸਨੈਪ ਕਰੋ","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"ਹੇਠਾਂ-ਸੱਜੇ ਚੌਥਾਈ ਵਿੱਚ ਸਨੈਪ ਕਰੋ","Snap to the center third":"ਵਿਚਕਾਰਲੇ ਤੀਜੇ ਹਿੱਸੇ ਵਿੱਚ ਸਨੈਪ ਕਰੋ","Snap to the left half":"ਖੱਬੇ ਅੱਧ ਵਿੱਚ ਸਨੈਪ ਕਰੋ","Snap to the left third":"ਖੱਬੇ ਤੀਜੇ ਹਿੱਸੇ ਵਿੱਚ ਸਨੈਪ ਕਰੋ","Snap to the left two thirds":"ਖੱਬੇ ਦੋ-ਤਿਹਾਈ ਵਿੱਚ ਸਨੈਪ ਕਰੋ","Snap to the right half":"ਸੱਜੇ ਅੱਧ ਵਿੱਚ ਸਨੈਪ ਕਰੋ","Snap to the right third":"ਸੱਜੇ ਤੀਜੇ ਹਿੱਸੇ ਵਿੱਚ ਸਨੈਪ ਕਰੋ","Snap to the right two thirds":"ਸੱਜੇ ਦੋ-ਤਿਹਾਈ ਵਿੱਚ ਸਨੈਪ ਕਰੋ","Snap to the top half":"ਉੱਪਰਲੇ ਅੱਧ ਵਿੱਚ ਸਨੈਪ ਕਰੋ","Snap to the top-left quarter":"ਉੱਪਰ-ਖੱਬੇ ਚੌਥਾਈ ਵਿੱਚ ਸਨੈਪ ਕਰੋ","Snap to the top-right quarter":"ਉੱਪਰ-ਸੱਜੇ ਚੌਥਾਈ ਵਿੱਚ ਸਨੈਪ ਕਰੋ","Snapping":"ਸਨੈਪਿੰਗ","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"ਸਨੈਪਿੰਗ ਅਤੇ ਸਵੈਚਲਿਤ ਟਾਇਲਿੰਗ ਦੋ ਮੋਡਾਂ ਵਜੋਂ ਚੱਲਦੇ ਹਨ – ਇੱਕ ਸ਼ਾਰਟਕੱਟ ਉਹਨਾਂ ਵਿੱਚ ਬਦਲਦਾ ਹੈ।","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਹਾਂ ਸਿਰਫ਼ ਇੱਕ ਚੁੰਬਕ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਨੂੰ ਖਿੱਚਦਾ ਹੈ। ਤੁਹਾਡੀਆਂ KDE ਸੈਟਿੰਗਾਂ ਨਹੀਂ ਬਦਲਦੀਆਂ: ਇਸਨੂੰ ਬੰਦ ਕਰੋ, KSnapUnity ਅਯੋਗ ਕਰੋ ਜਾਂ ਹਟਾਓ ਅਤੇ KDE ਦੀ ਸਨੈਪਿੰਗ ਵਾਪਸ ਆ ਜਾਂਦੀ ਹੈ।","Soft":"ਕੋਮਲ","Spacing":"ਵਿੱਥਾਂ","Spiral":"ਚੱਕਰਦਾਰ","Split side by side":"ਨਾਲ-ਨਾਲ ਵੰਡੋ","Split top and bottom":"ਉੱਪਰ-ਹੇਠਾਂ ਵੰਡੋ","Stack + main":"ਢੇਰ + ਮੁੱਖ","Stick to other windows":"ਹੋਰ ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਨਾਲ ਚਿਪਕੋ","Stick to the screen edges":"ਸਕ੍ਰੀਨ ਦੇ ਕਿਨਾਰਿਆਂ ਨਾਲ ਚਿਪਕੋ","Sticky edges":"ਚਿਪਕਣ ਵਾਲੇ ਕਿਨਾਰੇ","Support KSnapUnity":"KSnapUnity ਦਾ ਸਮਰਥਨ ਕਰੋ","Swap":"ਅਦਲਾ-ਬਦਲੀ","Swap windows":"ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਦੀ ਅਦਲਾ-ਬਦਲੀ","Swap with the window above":"ਉੱਪਰਲੀ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਨਾਲ ਬਦਲੋ","Swap with the window below":"ਹੇਠਲੀ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਨਾਲ ਬਦਲੋ","Swap with the window on the left":"ਖੱਬੀ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਨਾਲ ਬਦਲੋ","Swap with the window on the right":"ਸੱਜੀ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਨਾਲ ਬਦਲੋ","Switch mode":"ਮੋਡ ਬਦਲੋ","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"ਮੋਡ ਬਦਲੋ (ਸਨੈਪਿੰਗ / ਟਾਇਲਿੰਗ)","Switch modes with:":"ਮੋਡ ਬਦਲਣ ਦੀ ਕੁੰਜੀ:","Switch the layout by itself":"ਖਾਕਾ ਆਪਣੇ ਆਪ ਬਦਲੋ","Switched off":"ਬੰਦ","System":"ਸਿਸਟਮ","Take it over":"ਲੈ ਲਓ","Take over all":"ਸਭ ਲੈ ਲਓ","Take the main place":"ਮੁੱਖ ਥਾਂ ਲੈਂਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ","Test animation":"ਐਨੀਮੇਸ਼ਨ ਪਰਖੋ","Test on screen":"ਸਕਰੀਨ ’ਤੇ ਪਰਖੋ","Test the snap bar":"ਸਨੈਪ ਬਾਰ ਅਜ਼ਮਾਓ","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"ਮੂਲ ਮੁੱਲ Windows 11 ’ਤੇ ਆਧਾਰਿਤ ਹਨ।","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"ਸਨੈਪ ਕਿਰਿਆਵਾਂ ਸਨੈਪ ਬਾਰ ਵਾਲੀਆਂ ਹੀ ਵਿੱਥਾਂ ਵਰਤਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ ਅਤੇ ਸਨੈਪ ਤੋਂ ਪਹਿਲਾਂ ਦਾ ਆਕਾਰ ਯਾਦ ਰੱਖਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ: “ਸਨੈਪ ਤੋਂ ਪਹਿਲਾਂ ਦਾ ਆਕਾਰ ਬਹਾਲ ਕਰੋ” ਉਸਨੂੰ ਵਾਪਸ ਲਿਆਉਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"ਇਹ ਐਪਾਂ ਕਦੇ ਨਹੀਂ ਸਜਾਈਆਂ ਜਾਂਦੀਆਂ ਅਤੇ ਆਪਣੀ ਥਾਂ ਰੱਖਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ। ਡਾਇਲਾਗ ਹਮੇਸ਼ਾ ਤੈਰਦੇ ਹਨ।","Thirds":"ਤਿਹਾਈਆਂ","Three columns":"ਤਿੰਨ ਕਾਲਮ","Thumbnail width":"ਥੰਬਨੇਲ ਦੀ ਚੌੜਾਈ","Tiling":"ਟਾਇਲਿੰਗ","Tip":"ਸੁਝਾਅ","Top / bottom":"ਉੱਪਰ / ਹੇਠਾਂ","Top edge":"ਉੱਪਰਲਾ ਕਿਨਾਰਾ","Top edge: full screen":"ਉੱਪਰਲਾ ਕਿਨਾਰਾ: ਪੂਰੀ ਸਕ੍ਰੀਨ","Top edge: maximize":"ਉੱਪਰਲਾ ਕਿਨਾਰਾ: ਵੱਡਾ ਕਰੋ","Top edge: top half":"ਉੱਪਰਲਾ ਕਿਨਾਰਾ: ਉੱਪਰਲਾ ਅੱਧ","Top half":"ਉੱਪਰਲਾ ਅੱਧ","Trigger distance from the top edge":"ਉੱਪਰਲੇ ਕਿਨਾਰੇ ਤੋਂ ਟ੍ਰਿਗਰ ਦੂਰੀ","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"ਜੇ ਤੁਹਾਨੂੰ KDE ਦੀ ਆਪਣੀ ਰੂਪਰੇਖਾ ਪਸੰਦ ਹੈ ਤਾਂ ਇਸ ਨੂੰ ਬੰਦ ਕਰੋ – ਫਿਰ ਉੱਪਰ ਸਕ੍ਰੀਨ ਦੇ ਕਿਨਾਰਿਆਂ ਦੀ ਝਲਕ ਬੰਦ ਕਰੋ।","Two thirds":"ਦੋ ਤਿਹਾਈ","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"ਦੋ ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਥਾਂ ਬਦਲਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ – ਇੱਕ ਨੂੰ ਦੂਜੀ ’ਤੇ ਛੱਡੋ ਜਾਂ ਕੁੰਜੀਆਂ ਵਰਤੋ।","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"ਦੋ ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਥਾਂ ਬਦਲਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ: ਇੱਕ ਨੂੰ ਦੂਜੀ ’ਤੇ ਛੱਡੋ, ਜਾਂ ਕੁੰਜੀ ਨਾਲ।","Use keyboard shortcuts":"ਕੀਬੋਰਡ ਸ਼ਾਰਟਕੱਟ ਵਰਤੋ","Use screen edges":"ਸਕ੍ਰੀਨ ਦੇ ਕਿਨਾਰੇ ਵਰਤੋ","Use the system accent color":"ਸਿਸਟਮ ਦਾ ਐਕਸੈਂਟ ਰੰਗ ਵਰਤੋ","Use the window magnet":"ਵਿੰਡੋ ਚੁੰਬਕ ਵਰਤੋ","Usual combinations":"ਆਮ ਮੇਲ","Version":"ਵਰਜਨ","Wanted for: %1":"ਇਸ ਲਈ ਚਾਹੀਦੀ: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"ਜਦੋਂ ਕੋਈ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਖੁੱਲ੍ਹਦੀ, ਬੰਦ ਹੁੰਦੀ ਜਾਂ ਬਦਲਦੀ ਹੈ, ਬਾਕੀ ਉਛਲਣ ਦੀ ਥਾਂ ਸੁਖਾਵੇਂ ਢੰਗ ਨਾਲ ਖਿਸਕਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ।","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"ਕਿਸੇ ਵਿੰਡੋ ਦਾ ਆਕਾਰ ਬਦਲਣ ’ਤੇ ਉਸ ਨੂੰ ਛੂਹਣ ਵਾਲੀਆਂ ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਸਾਂਝਾ ਕਿਨਾਰਾ ਨਾਲ ਖਿਸਕਾਉਂਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ – ਕੁਝ ਓਵਰਲੈਪ ਨਹੀਂ ਹੁੰਦਾ, ਕੋਈ ਵਿੱਥ ਨਹੀਂ ਬਣਦੀ।","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"ਆਕਾਰ ਬਦਲਦੇ ਸਮੇਂ ਜੋ ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਨਾਲ ਨਹੀਂ ਚੱਲਦੀਆਂ ਉਹ ਪਾਰਦਰਸ਼ੀ ਦਿਖਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ।","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"ਵਿੰਡੋ ਨੂੰ ਹਿਲਾਉਂਦੇ ਜਾਂ ਉਸਦਾ ਆਕਾਰ ਬਦਲਦੇ ਸਮੇਂ, ਉਸਦੇ ਕਿਨਾਰੇ ਨੇੜਲੀਆਂ ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਅਤੇ ਸਕ੍ਰੀਨ ਦੇ ਕਿਨਾਰਿਆਂ ਨਾਲ ਚਿਪਕਦੇ ਹਨ।","Width":"ਚੌੜਾਈ","Window":"ਵਿੰਡੋ","Window magnet":"ਵਿੰਡੋ ਚੁੰਬਕ","Window magnet on/off":"ਵਿੰਡੋ ਚੁੰਬਕ ਚਾਲੂ/ਬੰਦ","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"ਉੱਪਰ-ਹੇਠਾਂ ਰੱਖੀਆਂ ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਖੱਬੇ ਅਤੇ ਸੱਜੇ ਕਿਨਾਰੇ ਇਕੱਠੇ ਰੱਖਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ, ਨਾਲ-ਨਾਲ ਵਾਲੀਆਂ ਉੱਪਰਲੇ ਅਤੇ ਹੇਠਲੇ।","Windows glide to their place":"ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਆਪਣੀ ਥਾਂ ’ਤੇ ਸਰਕਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਇੱਕ ਦੂਜੇ ਨਾਲ ਅਤੇ ਸਕ੍ਰੀਨ ਦੇ ਕਿਨਾਰਿਆਂ ਨਾਲ ਚਿਪਕਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ।","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਛੂਹਣ ਦੀ ਬਜਾਏ ਆਮ ਪੰਨੇ ਦੀ “ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ ਵਿਚਕਾਰ ਵਿੱਥ” ’ਤੇ ਰੁਕਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ।","Yes":"ਹਾਂ","Your own combination":"ਆਪਣਾ ਮੇਲ","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"ਤੁਹਾਡੇ ਆਪਣੇ ਖਾਕੇ ਅਤੇ ਉਨ੍ਹਾਂ ਦਾ ਕ੍ਰਮ ਗੁਆਚ ਜਾਵੇਗਾ।","Zone %1":"ਜ਼ੋਨ %1","for KWin · v%1":"KWin ਲਈ · v%1","windows:":"ਵਿੰਡੋਆਂ:","“%1” will be removed.":"\"%1\" ਹਟਾ ਦਿੱਤਾ ਜਾਵੇਗਾ।","…drag it onto window B…":"…ਇਸਨੂੰ ਵਿੰਡੋ B ਉੱਤੇ ਖਿੱਚੋ…","…in every direction":"…ਹਰ ਦਿਸ਼ਾ ਵਿੱਚ","…let go: they trade places":"…ਛੱਡੋ: ਉਹ ਥਾਂ ਬਦਲ ਲੈਂਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…ਗੁਆਂਢੀ ਉਸ ਨਾਲ ਵਧਦੇ ਅਤੇ ਘਟਦੇ ਹਨ","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ ਤਿਆਰ – ਸੈਟਿੰਗਾਂ ਸੰਪਾਦਕ ਖੋਲ੍ਹਣ ਲਈ OK ਕਲਿੱਕ ਕਰੋ।"},"pl":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (kopia)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 jest używany przez „%2”.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 z %2 stref","0 = all in one row":"0 = wszystkie w jednym wierszu","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Tryb 1</b><br/>Pasek przyciągania i krawędzie ekranu","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Tryb 2</b><br/>Automatyczne kafelkowanie","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Samotne okno zajmuje cały ekran, nawet przy ustawionym marginesie.","A new window joins":"Dochodzi nowe okno","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Krótkie pchnięcie daje połowę lub ćwiartkę. Przytrzymaj okno trochę dłużej przy krawędzi, a urośnie do następnego okna – podgląd to pokaże.","A single window":"Pojedyncze okno","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Okno zatrzymuje się na krawędzi innego, także gdy przesuwasz je szybko. Potrząśnij myszą lub pchaj jeszcze chwilę, aby je odczepić. 0 = okna mogą swobodnie na siebie nachodzić.","About & Help":"O programie i pomoc","Accent color":"Kolor akcentu","Active":"Aktywne","Active mode":"Aktywny tryb","Active width along the top edge":"Aktywna szerokość wzdłuż górnej krawędzi","Add an open application":"Dodaj otwarty program","Add rule":"Dodaj regułę","All window features in one system.":"Wszystkie funkcje okien w jednym systemie.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Zmienia się też, gdy ręcznie zmienisz rozmiar okna głównego.","Also while resizing":"Także przy zmianie rozmiaru","Always floating":"Zawsze pływające","Animation":"Animacja","Appearance":"Wygląd","Apply":"Zastosuj","Arrange windows":"Układanie okien","Arrange windows automatically":"Układaj okna automatycznie","Author":"Autor","Automatic tiling":"Automatyczne kafelkowanie","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Automatyczne kafelkowanie jest wyłączone – działa tylko tryb 1, a skrót trybu nic nie robi.","Automatic tiling off":"Automatyczne kafelkowanie wyłączone","Automatic tiling on":"Automatyczne kafelkowanie włączone","Automatic tiling on/off":"Automatyczne kafelkowanie wł./wył.","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Automatyczne kafelkowanie, zamiana okien, skróty i magnes dla okien pływających.","Background opacity":"Krycie tła","Behavior & Animation":"Zachowanie i animacja","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Dolna krawędź: dolna połowa","Bouncy":"Sprężysta","Buy me a coffee":"Postaw mi kawę","Cancel":"Anuluj","Center focus":"Środek w centrum","Center the window":"Wyśrodkuj okno","Change":"Zmień","Change key":"Zmień klawisz","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Klawisz zmienisz w edytorze ustawień. Oba tryby wymagają automatycznego kafelkowania oraz paska lub krawędzi ekranu.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Zmienisz je na stronie Skróty klawiszowe. Przy automatycznym kafelkowaniu okna zamieniają się też miejscami w kolejności.","Choose…":"Wybierz…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Kliknij strefę, aby ją zaznaczyć · kliknij dwukrotnie, aby podzielić · przeciągaj separatory","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Kliknij lub naciśnij %1, aby przełączyć tryb.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Kliknij, potem OK – otworzy się edytor ustawień.","Close":"Zamknij","Close by, the edges stick together":"Z bliska krawędzie się sklejają","Color scheme":"Schemat kolorów","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Kolory, rozmiar i kształt paska.","Columns":"Kolumny","Corner radius":"Promień narożników","Corner size":"Rozmiar rogów","Corner: a quarter":"Róg: ćwiartka","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Rogi: ćwiartka ekranu","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + klawisz (domyślnie)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + klawiatura numeryczna","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + klawisz","Custom color":"Własny kolor","Custom layout %1":"Własny układ %1","Dark":"Ciemny","Delay before hiding":"Opóźnienie przed ukryciem","Delay before showing":"Opóźnienie przed pokazaniem","Delete":"Usuń","Delete layout?":"Usunąć układ?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Odległość, przy której pojawia się uchwyt","Distance before the bar hides again":"Odległość, po której pasek znowu się chowa","Distance to the edge":"Odległość od krawędzi","Donate with PayPal":"Wesprzyj przez PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"Przeciągnij wspólną krawędź…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Przeciągnij okno do krawędzi…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Przeciągnij okno na inne, aby je zamienić. Upuszczone na pasek lub krawędź ekranu pływa swobodnie; „Uwolnij okno” przywraca je. Odstępy ustawia się na stronie Ogólne.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Przeciągnij okno nad środek innego – podgląd pokaże dwie strzałki – i puść. Przy automatycznym kafelkowaniu wystarczy dowolne miejsce nad drugim oknem.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Przeciągnij okno do górnej krawędzi ekranu i upuść je na strefę.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Przeciągaj karty, aby zmienić kolejność w pasku. Kliknij kartę dwukrotnie, aby ją edytować.","Drop a window onto another one":"Upuść okno na inne","Drop the window onto a zone":"Upuść okno na strefę","Duplicate":"Duplikuj","Duration":"Czas trwania","Dwindle":"Spirala do środka","Dynamic":"Dynamiczna","Edges and corners":"Krawędzie i rogi","Edit":"Edytuj","Edit layout":"Edytuj układ","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Każdą funkcję można włączać i wyłączać osobno.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Każdy układ zbudowany na stronie Układy może też układać okna – pojawia się powyżej. Okno 1 dostaje strefę 1 itd.; dodatkowe okna dzielą ostatnią strefę. Gdy okien jest mniej niż stref, używany jest „Główne i stos”, żeby nie było dziur.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Każde okno samo znajduje swoje miejsce, jak w kafelkowym menedżerze okien.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Każde okno samo znajduje swoje miejsce na ekranie. Nowe okna dołączają, zamknięte robią miejsce pozostałym.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Przykład: dwa okna obok siebie, od trzech główne i stos, od pięciu siatka. Bez pasującej reguły obowiązuje układ wybrany wyżej.","Fade in and out":"Przenikanie przy pojawianiu i znikaniu","Fade the other windows":"Przyciemnij pozostałe okna","Features":"Funkcje","Feel":"Odczucie","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Dopasuj do już przyciągniętych okien","Fits the way you work.":"Dopasowuje się do twojego sposobu pracy.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Uwolnij okno (wyjdź z kafelkowania)","Four quarters":"Cztery ćwiartki","From":"Od","Fullscreen":"Pełny ekran","Gap between windows":"Odstęp między oknami","Gap to the screen edge":"Odstęp od krawędzi ekranu","General":"Ogólne","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Ponownie daje każdej akcji klawisz z wybranego schematu i usuwa klawisze, których schemat nie ma.","Good to know":"Dobrze wiedzieć","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Chwyć okno za pasek tytułu i przeciągnij je w górę. Pasek zjeżdża w dół; upuść okno na strefę, a wypełni dokładnie ten obszar. Gdy je znowu wyciągniesz, odzyska poprzedni rozmiar.","Grab window A…":"Chwyć okno A…","Grid":"Siatka","Halves":"Połówki","Hiding":"Ukrywanie","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Przytrzymaj przy krawędzi, aby wypełnić wolne miejsce","Hold time":"Czas przytrzymania","Hold to fill":"Przytrzymaj, aby wypełnić","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Jak blisko musi podejść krawędź, zanim się zatrzaśnie.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Jak blisko krawędzi musi znaleźć się kursor.","How far the bar slides down":"Jak nisko zjeżdża pasek","How it works":"Jak to działa","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Jak długo okno musi przylegać do krawędzi – małe pchnięcie. 0 = od razu.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Jak długo okno musi pozostać przy krawędzi, zanim urośnie.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Ile okien dzieli obszar główny (układ „Główne i stos”).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Jeśli na dole jest już okno, górna krawędź daje górną połowę zamiast maksymalizacji. Połowy i ćwiartki też omijają przyciągnięte okna.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Jeśli lubisz KSnapUnity, możesz wesprzeć jego rozwój – dziękujemy!","In bar":"W pasku","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Niezależny od paska przyciągania i krawędzi ekranu.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Niezależne od paska przyciągania. Każdą krawędź można włączyć osobno.","Information":"Informacje","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Intuicyjne, naturalne zachowanie okien.","Join at the end":"Dołączają na końcu","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K jak KWin · Snap jak sprytniejsze przyciąganie · Unity jak wszystko w jednym systemie","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE ma własne akcje krawędzi ekranu i własne przyciąganie okien. Jeśli ta sama funkcja jest włączona tutaj, wyłącz tę z KDE: Ustawienia systemowe → Zarządzanie oknami → Krawędzie ekranu oraz Zachowanie okien → Przesuwanie.","KDE's own edge tiling":"Własne kafelkowanie krawędzi KDE","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"Własne maksymalizowanie i kafelkowanie KDE na krawędziach – z obrysem – jest wstrzymane, dopóki działa KSnapUnity, więc widać tylko jeden podgląd. Ustawienia KDE się nie zmieniają: wyłącz to, dezaktywuj lub usuń KSnapUnity, a zachowanie KDE wróci.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"Własne akcje krawędzi ekranu KDE są nadal włączone, więc na to samo przeciąganie reagują dwa mechanizmy. Wyłącz „Maksymalizuj” i „Kafelkuj” w Ustawienia systemowe → Zarządzanie oknami → Krawędzie ekranu.","KDE's own window snapping":"Własne przyciąganie okien KDE","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"Własne przyciąganie okien KDE też jest włączone. Dla spójnego działania ustaw jego strefy na „Brak” w Ustawienia systemowe → Zarządzanie oknami → Zachowanie okien → Przesuwanie.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Usługa skrótów KDE nie odpowiedziała. Klawisze nadal możesz ustawić w Ustawienia systemowe → Skróty → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – edytor ustawień","Keep stacked windows in line":"Utrzymuj okna w stosie w jednej linii","Keep the gap between windows":"Zachowaj odstęp między oknami","Keep them":"Zostaw je","Key scheme":"Schemat klawiszy","Keyboard shortcuts":"Skróty klawiszowe","Keys":"Klawisze","Keys already in use":"Klawisze już zajęte","Layout":"Układ","Layout by number of windows":"Układ według liczby okien","Layouts":"Układy","Layouts per row":"Układy w wierszu","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Lewa i prawa krawędź: połowa ekranu","Left edge: left half":"Lewa krawędź: lewa połowa","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Poniżej 100 % samotne okno zostaje na środku – ładnie na szerokich ekranach.","License":"Licencja","Light":"Jasny","Linear":"Liniowa","Live preview":"Podgląd na żywo","Load template…":"Wczytaj szablon…","Magnet":"Magnes","Main + stack":"Główne + stos","Main and stack":"Główne i stos","Main area bigger":"Większy obszar główny","Main area on the right":"Obszar główny po prawej","Main area smaller":"Mniejszy obszar główny","Main in the middle":"Główne pośrodku","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Główny przełącznik przeciągania i klawiszy.","Main window":"Okno główne","Main windows":"Okna główne","Main windows: %1":"Okna główne: %1","Make it the main window":"Uczyń oknem głównym","Maximize":"Maksymalizuj","Maximize or restore":"Maksymalizuj lub przywróć","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + klawisz (styl KDE)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + klawisz","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + klawisz","Minimize":"Minimalizuj","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Odbija układ: okno główne po prawej, pozostałe po lewej.","Mode":"Tryb","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Tryb 1 – pasek przyciągania i krawędzie ekranu","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Tryb 2 – automatyczne kafelkowanie","Modes":"Tryby","More ways":"Więcej sposobów","Motion curve":"Krzywa ruchu","Move a window towards others…":"Przesuń okno w stronę innych…","Move the window one place back":"Przesuń okno o miejsce wstecz","Move the window one place on":"Przesuń okno o miejsce dalej","Name:":"Nazwa:","New layout":"Nowy układ","New windows":"Nowe okna","Next tiling layout":"Następny układ kafelków","Next to the active window":"Obok aktywnego okna","No key":"Brak klawisza","No other window open":"Brak innych otwartych okien","No outer margin":"Bez marginesu zewnętrznego","No shortcuts":"Bez skrótów","None":"Brak","None yet.":"Jeszcze brak.","Off":"Wyłączone","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Wył. = tryb 1, wł. = tryb 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Wyłączone: neutralna ramka – tylko dla włączonych podglądów.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Wyłączone: klawisze pozostają przypisane, ale nic nie robią.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Wyłączone: okna zostają tam, gdzie je położysz. Pozostałe funkcje działają tak czy inaczej.","One at a time":"Po jednym","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Jedno się zamyka – pozostałe wypełniają lukę","One main window less":"Jedno okno główne mniej","One more main window":"Jedno okno główne więcej","One window":"Jedno okno","Only one mode is switched on.":"Włączony jest tylko jeden tryb.","Open settings editor":"Otwórz edytor ustawień","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Najpierw otwórz program, potem wybierz go tutaj.","Open the layout builder":"Otwórz kreator układów","Own layouts":"Własne układy","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Część każdego boku liczona jako róg.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Wstrzymaj kafelkowanie krawędzi KDE i jego podgląd","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Wstrzymaj strefy przyciągania KDE, gdy magnes jest włączony","Preview":"Podgląd","Previews":"Podglądy","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Dociśnij okno do krawędzi lub rogu ekranu, a wypełni tę część. Działa z paskiem przyciągania lub bez niego.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Dociśnij okno do krawędzi lub rogu: maksymalizacja, połowy, ćwiartki.","Push delay":"Opóźnienie docisku","Quarters":"Ćwiartki","Quick":"Szybka","Quick settings":"Szybkie ustawienia","Recommended values":"Zalecane wartości","Remove":"Usuń","Remove rule":"Usuń regułę","Remove zone":"Usuń strefę","Reset all":"Przywróć wszystko","Reset all keys":"Przywróć wszystkie klawisze","Reset to default":"Przywróć domyślne","Resistance against overlapping":"Opór przed nakładaniem","Resize touching windows together":"Zmieniaj rozmiar stykających się okien razem","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Zmiana rozmiaru też przyciąga – tu do pełnej wysokości","Restore":"Przywróć","Restore default layouts":"Przywróć układy domyślne","Restore default layouts?":"Przywrócić układy domyślne?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Przywracaj pierwotny rozmiar po wyciągnięciu okna","Restore the size before snapping":"Przywróć rozmiar sprzed przyciągnięcia","Rows":"Wiersze","Save":"Zapisz","Screen edges":"Krawędzie ekranu","Screen edges on/off":"Krawędzie ekranu wł./wył.","Screen edges preview":"Podgląd krawędzi ekranu","Set":"Ustaw","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Ustawia klawisze wszystkich akcji naraz. Pojedyncze klawisze nadal zmienisz poniżej.","Settings":"Ustawienia","Settings file":"Plik ustawień","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Podczas zmiany rozmiaru szybko potrząśnij myszą w przód i w tył, a pozostałe okna wrócą. Szybkie szarpnięcie w jednym kierunku nigdy ich nie odczepia.","Shake to let go":"Potrząśnij, aby puścić","Shortcuts":"Skróty","Show a small handle first":"Najpierw pokazuj mały uchwyt","Show layout and zone names":"Pokazuj nazwy układów i stref","Show previews in the accent color":"Pokazuj podglądy w kolorze akcentu","Showing":"Pokazywanie","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Pokazuje, gdzie wyląduje okno przy krawędzi lub w rogu. Wyłączone: brak podglądu.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Pokazuje, gdzie wyląduje okno, gdy strefa paska jest podświetlona. Wyłączone: brak podglądu.","Sidebar + grid":"Panel boczny + siatka","Single zone":"Jedna strefa","Six tiles":"Sześć kafelków","Size & shape":"Rozmiar i kształt","Size of the main area":"Rozmiar obszaru głównego","Slide-in duration":"Czas wysuwania","Slide-out duration":"Czas chowania","Smart arranging and detection.":"Inteligentne układanie i wykrywanie.","Smart fill":"Inteligentne wypełnianie","Smooth (default)":"Płynna (domyślna)","Snap bar":"Pasek przyciągania","Snap bar and screen edges":"Pasek przyciągania i krawędzie ekranu","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Pasek i krawędzie są wyłączone – działa tylko tryb 2, a skrót trybu nic nie robi.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Pasek i krawędzie ekranu przeszkadzają automatycznemu kafelkowaniu. Dlatego działają jako dwa tryby – przełączaj skrótem lub tutaj.","Snap bar colors:":"Kolory paska:","Snap bar on/off":"Pasek przyciągania wł./wył.","Snap bar preview":"Podgląd paska przyciągania","Snap bar size":"Rozmiar paska","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Pasek przyciągania, krawędzie ekranu, magnes okien, skróty i zamiana okien.","Snap distance":"Odległość przyciągania","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Przyciągaj separatory (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Układy przyciągania i automatyczne kafelkowanie.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Przyciągaj aktywne okno kombinacjami klawiszy.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Przyciągaj aktywne okno klawiaturą. To zwykłe globalne skróty KDE – znajdziesz je też w Ustawienia systemowe → Skróty → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Przyciągnij do dolnej połowy","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Przyciągnij do lewej dolnej ćwiartki","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Przyciągnij do prawej dolnej ćwiartki","Snap to the center third":"Przyciągnij do środkowej jednej trzeciej","Snap to the left half":"Przyciągnij do lewej połowy","Snap to the left third":"Przyciągnij do lewej jednej trzeciej","Snap to the left two thirds":"Przyciągnij do lewych dwóch trzecich","Snap to the right half":"Przyciągnij do prawej połowy","Snap to the right third":"Przyciągnij do prawej jednej trzeciej","Snap to the right two thirds":"Przyciągnij do prawych dwóch trzecich","Snap to the top half":"Przyciągnij do górnej połowy","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Przyciągnij do lewej górnej ćwiartki","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Przyciągnij do prawej górnej ćwiartki","Snapping":"Przyciąganie","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Przyciąganie i automatyczne kafelkowanie działają jako dwa tryby – jeden skrót przełącza między nimi.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Dzięki temu okno ciągnie tylko jeden magnes. Ustawienia KDE się nie zmieniają: wyłącz to, dezaktywuj lub usuń KSnapUnity, a przyciąganie KDE wróci.","Soft":"Łagodna","Spacing":"Odstępy","Spiral":"Spirala","Split side by side":"Podziel obok siebie","Split top and bottom":"Podziel na górę i dół","Stack + main":"Stos + główne","Stick to other windows":"Przyklejaj do innych okien","Stick to the screen edges":"Przyklejaj do krawędzi ekranu","Sticky edges":"Lepkie krawędzie","Support KSnapUnity":"Wesprzyj KSnapUnity","Swap":"Zamień","Swap windows":"Zamiana okien","Swap with the window above":"Zamień z oknem powyżej","Swap with the window below":"Zamień z oknem poniżej","Swap with the window on the left":"Zamień z oknem po lewej","Swap with the window on the right":"Zamień z oknem po prawej","Switch mode":"Przełącz tryb","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Przełącz tryb (przyciąganie / kafelki)","Switch modes with:":"Przełączanie trybu:","Switch the layout by itself":"Zmieniaj układ samodzielnie","Switched off":"Wyłączone","System":"Systemowy","Take it over":"Przejmij","Take over all":"Przejmij wszystkie","Take the main place":"Zajmują miejsce główne","Test animation":"Testuj animację","Test on screen":"Testuj na ekranie","Test the snap bar":"Wypróbuj pasek przyciągania","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Wartości domyślne wzorowane są na Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Akcje przyciągania używają tych samych odstępów co pasek i zapamiętują rozmiar sprzed przyciągnięcia: „Przywróć rozmiar sprzed przyciągnięcia” go przywraca.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Te programy nigdy nie są układane i zachowują swoje miejsce. Okna dialogowe zawsze pływają.","Thirds":"Trzecie","Three columns":"Trzy kolumny","Thumbnail width":"Szerokość miniatur","Tiling":"Kafelkowanie","Tip":"Wskazówka","Top / bottom":"Góra / dół","Top edge":"Górna krawędź","Top edge: full screen":"Górna krawędź: pełny ekran","Top edge: maximize":"Górna krawędź: maksymalizuj","Top edge: top half":"Górna krawędź: górna połowa","Top half":"Górna połowa","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Odległość wyzwalania od górnej krawędzi","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Wyłącz to, jeśli wolisz obrys KDE – wtedy wyłącz powyżej podgląd krawędzi ekranu.","Two thirds":"Dwie trzecie","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Dwa okna zamieniają się miejscami – upuść jedno na drugie albo użyj klawiszy.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Dwa okna zamieniają się miejscami: upuść jedno na drugie albo klawiszem.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Używaj skrótów klawiszowych","Use screen edges":"Używaj krawędzi ekranu","Use the system accent color":"Używaj systemowego koloru akcentu","Use the window magnet":"Używaj magnesu okien","Usual combinations":"Typowe kombinacje","Version":"Wersja","Wanted for: %1":"Potrzebny dla: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Gdy okno się otwiera, zamyka lub zamienia, pozostałe przesuwają się płynnie zamiast skakać.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Gdy zmieniasz rozmiar okna, okna, które go dotykają, przesuwają wspólną krawędź razem z nim – nic na siebie nie nachodzi, nie powstaje szczelina.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Podczas zmiany rozmiaru okna, które nie podążają, są wyświetlane jako przezroczyste.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Podczas przesuwania lub zmiany rozmiaru okna jego krawędzie przyklejają się do pobliskich okien i krawędzi ekranu.","Width":"Szerokość","Window":"Okno","Window magnet":"Magnes okien","Window magnet on/off":"Magnes okien wł./wył.","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Okna jedno nad drugim trzymają razem lewe i prawe krawędzie, okna obok siebie górne i dolne.","Windows glide to their place":"Okna płynnie wsuwają się na miejsce","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Okna przyklejają się do siebie i do krawędzi ekranu.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Okna zatrzymują się na „Odstępie między oknami” ze strony Ogólne zamiast się stykać.","Yes":"Tak","Your own combination":"Własna kombinacja","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Twoje własne układy i ich kolejność zostaną utracone.","Zone %1":"Strefa %1","for KWin · v%1":"dla KWin · v%1","windows:":"okien:","“%1” will be removed.":"„%1” zostanie usunięty.","…drag it onto window B…":"…przeciągnij je na okno B…","…in every direction":"…w każdym kierunku","…let go: they trade places":"…puść: zamieniają się miejscami","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…sąsiedzi rosną i maleją razem z nią","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Gotowe – kliknij OK, aby otworzyć edytor ustawień."},"pt":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (cópia)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 é usado por «%2».","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 de %2 zonas","0 = all in one row":"0 = todas numa linha","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Modo 1</b><br/>Barra de encaixe e margens do ecrã","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Modo 2</b><br/>Mosaico automático","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Uma janela sozinha usa o ecrã inteiro, mesmo com uma margem definida.","A new window joins":"Junta-se uma nova janela","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Um empurrão curto dá a metade ou o quarto. Mantenha a janela um pouco mais na margem e ela cresce até à janela seguinte – a pré-visualização mostra-o.","A single window":"Uma única janela","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Uma janela para na margem de outra, mesmo quando a move depressa. Abane o rato ou continue a empurrar um momento para a soltar. 0 = as janelas podem sobrepor-se livremente.","About & Help":"Acerca e ajuda","Accent color":"Cor de destaque","Active":"Ativo","Active mode":"Modo ativo","Active width along the top edge":"Largura ativa ao longo do limite superior","Add an open application":"Adicionar uma aplicação aberta","Add rule":"Adicionar regra","All window features in one system.":"Todas as funções de janelas num só sistema.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Muda também quando redimensiona a janela principal à mão.","Also while resizing":"Também ao redimensionar","Always floating":"Sempre flutuantes","Animation":"Animação","Appearance":"Aspeto","Apply":"Aplicar","Arrange windows":"Organizar janelas","Arrange windows automatically":"Organizar janelas automaticamente","Author":"Autor","Automatic tiling":"Mosaico automático","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"O mosaico automático está desligado – só funciona o modo 1 e o atalho de modo não faz nada.","Automatic tiling off":"Mosaico automático desligado","Automatic tiling on":"Mosaico automático ligado","Automatic tiling on/off":"Ligar/desligar mosaico automático","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Mosaico automático, troca de janelas, atalhos e o íman para janelas flutuantes.","Background opacity":"Opacidade do fundo","Behavior & Animation":"Comportamento e animação","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Margem inferior: metade inferior","Bouncy":"Com ressalto","Buy me a coffee":"Pague-me um café","Cancel":"Cancelar","Center focus":"Foco central","Center the window":"Centrar a janela","Change":"Alterar","Change key":"Mudar tecla","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"A tecla muda-se no editor de definições. Ambos os modos precisam do mosaico automático e da barra ou das margens do ecrã.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Altere-as na página Atalhos de teclado. Com o mosaico automático, as janelas também trocam de lugar na ordem.","Choose…":"Escolher…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Clique numa zona para a selecionar · duplo clique para a dividir · arraste os divisores","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Clique ou prima %1 para mudar de modo.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Clique e depois OK – o editor de definições abre.","Close":"Fechar","Close by, the edges stick together":"De perto, as margens colam-se","Color scheme":"Esquema de cores","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Cores, tamanho e forma da barra.","Columns":"Colunas","Corner radius":"Raio dos cantos","Corner size":"Tamanho dos cantos","Corner: a quarter":"Canto: um quarto","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Cantos: um quarto do ecrã","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + tecla (predefinido)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + teclado numérico","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + tecla","Custom color":"Cor personalizada","Custom layout %1":"Disposição personalizada %1","Dark":"Escuro","Delay before hiding":"Atraso antes de ocultar","Delay before showing":"Atraso antes de mostrar","Delete":"Eliminar","Delete layout?":"Eliminar a disposição?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Distância a que a pega aparece","Distance before the bar hides again":"Distância até a barra voltar a ocultar-se","Distance to the edge":"Distância à margem","Donate with PayPal":"Doar com PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"Arraste uma margem partilhada…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Arraste uma janela contra uma margem…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Arraste uma janela sobre outra para as trocar. Largada na barra ou numa margem do ecrã, flutua livremente; «Deixar a janela flutuar» trá-la de volta. Os espaços vêm da página Geral.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Arraste uma janela sobre o centro de outra – a pré-visualização mostra duas setas – e solte. Com o mosaico automático basta qualquer ponto sobre a outra janela.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Arraste uma janela para o limite superior do ecrã e largue-a numa zona.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Arraste os cartões para mudar a ordem na barra. Faça duplo clique num cartão para o editar.","Drop a window onto another one":"Largar uma janela sobre outra","Drop the window onto a zone":"Largue a janela numa zona","Duplicate":"Duplicar","Duration":"Duração","Dwindle":"Espiral para dentro","Dynamic":"Dinâmica","Edges and corners":"Margens e cantos","Edit":"Editar","Edit layout":"Editar disposição","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Cada função pode ser ligada e desligada por si.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Cada disposição criada na página Disposições também pode organizar janelas – aparece acima. A janela 1 fica com a zona 1 e assim por diante; janelas a mais partilham a última zona. Com menos janelas do que zonas usa-se «Principal e pilha», para não ficarem buracos.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Cada janela encontra o seu lugar sozinha, como num gestor de janelas em mosaico.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Cada janela encontra sozinha o seu lugar no ecrã. As janelas novas juntam-se, as fechadas deixam espaço para as outras.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Exemplo: duas janelas lado a lado, a partir de três principal e pilha, a partir de cinco uma grelha. Sem regra adequada usa-se a disposição escolhida acima.","Fade in and out":"Desvanecer ao aparecer e desaparecer","Fade the other windows":"Esbater as outras janelas","Features":"Funcionalidades","Feel":"Sensação","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Ajustar às janelas já encaixadas","Fits the way you work.":"Adapta-se à sua forma de trabalhar.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Deixar a janela flutuar (sair do mosaico)","Four quarters":"Quatro quartos","From":"A partir de","Fullscreen":"Ecrã completo","Gap between windows":"Espaço entre janelas","Gap to the screen edge":"Espaço até ao limite do ecrã","General":"Geral","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Volta a dar a cada ação a tecla do esquema escolhido e remove as teclas que o esquema não tem.","Good to know":"Bom saber","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Agarre uma janela pela barra de título e arraste-a para cima. A barra desce; largue a janela numa zona e ela ocupa exatamente essa área. Ao arrastá-la de novo para fora, recupera o tamanho anterior.","Grab window A…":"Agarre a janela A…","Grid":"Grelha","Halves":"Metades","Hiding":"Ocultar","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Manter na margem para preencher o espaço livre","Hold time":"Tempo de espera","Hold to fill":"Manter para preencher","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Quanto uma margem tem de se aproximar antes de encaixar.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Quanto o cursor tem de se aproximar da margem.","How far the bar slides down":"Quanto a barra desce","How it works":"Como funciona","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Quanto tempo a janela tem de ficar encostada à margem – um pequeno empurrão. 0 = de imediato.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Quanto tempo a janela tem de ficar na margem antes de crescer.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Quantas janelas partilham a área principal (disposição “Principal e pilha”).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Se houver uma janela em baixo, a margem superior dá a metade superior em vez de maximizar. Metades e quartos também deixam livres as janelas encaixadas.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Se gosta do KSnapUnity, pode apoiar o seu desenvolvimento – obrigado!","In bar":"Na barra","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Independente da barra de encaixe e das margens do ecrã.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Independente da barra de encaixe. Cada margem liga-se à parte.","Information":"Informações","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Comportamento das janelas intuitivo e natural.","Join at the end":"Juntam-se no fim","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K de KWin · Snap de encaixe mais inteligente · Unity de tudo num só sistema","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"O KDE tem as suas próprias ações de margem do ecrã e o seu próprio encaixe de janelas. Se a mesma função estiver ligada aqui, desligue a do KDE: Definições do Sistema → Gestão de Janelas → Margens do Ecrã, e Comportamento das Janelas → Movimento.","KDE's own edge tiling":"Mosaico das margens do próprio KDE","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"O maximizar e o mosaico próprios do KDE nas margens – com o seu contorno – ficam em pausa enquanto o KSnapUnity funciona, para aparecer só uma pré-visualização. As definições do KDE não mudam: desligue isto, desative ou remova o KSnapUnity e o comportamento do KDE volta.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"As ações de margem do ecrã do KDE continuam ligadas, por isso dois assistentes reagem ao mesmo arrasto. Desligue «Maximizar» e «Mosaico» em Definições do Sistema → Gestão de Janelas → Margens do Ecrã.","KDE's own window snapping":"Encaixe de janelas do próprio KDE","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"O encaixe de janelas do KDE também está ligado. Para uma sensação uniforme, defina as suas zonas como «Nenhuma» em Definições do Sistema → Gestão de Janelas → Comportamento das Janelas → Movimento.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"O serviço de atalhos do KDE não respondeu. Ainda pode definir as teclas em Definições do Sistema → Atalhos → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – Editor de definições","Keep stacked windows in line":"Manter janelas empilhadas alinhadas","Keep the gap between windows":"Manter o espaço entre janelas","Keep them":"Mantê-las","Key scheme":"Esquema de teclas","Keyboard shortcuts":"Atalhos de teclado","Keys":"Teclas","Keys already in use":"Teclas já em uso","Layout":"Disposição","Layout by number of windows":"Disposição pelo número de janelas","Layouts":"Disposições","Layouts per row":"Disposições por linha","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Margens esquerda e direita: metade do ecrã","Left edge: left half":"Margem esquerda: metade esquerda","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Abaixo de 100 % uma janela sozinha fica ao centro – ótimo em ecrãs largos.","License":"Licença","Light":"Claro","Live preview":"Pré-visualização ao vivo","Load template…":"Carregar modelo…","Magnet":"Íman","Main + stack":"Principal + pilha","Main and stack":"Principal e pilha","Main area bigger":"Área principal maior","Main area on the right":"Área principal à direita","Main area smaller":"Área principal menor","Main in the middle":"Principal ao centro","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Interruptor principal para arrastar e para as teclas.","Main window":"Janela principal","Main windows":"Janelas principais","Main windows: %1":"Janelas principais: %1","Make it the main window":"Tornar janela principal","Maximize":"Maximizar","Maximize or restore":"Maximizar ou repor","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + tecla (estilo KDE)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + tecla","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + tecla","Minimize":"Minimizar","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Espelha a disposição: a janela principal à direita, as outras à esquerda.","Mode":"Modo","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Modo 1 – Barra de encaixe e margens do ecrã","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Modo 2 – Mosaico automático","Modes":"Modos","More ways":"Mais formas","Motion curve":"Curva de movimento","Move a window towards others…":"Aproxime uma janela das outras…","Move the window one place back":"Mover a janela uma posição atrás","Move the window one place on":"Mover a janela uma posição em frente","Name:":"Nome:","New layout":"Nova disposição","New windows":"Novas janelas","Next tiling layout":"Disposição seguinte","Next to the active window":"Junto da janela ativa","No key":"Sem tecla","No other window open":"Nenhuma outra janela aberta","No outer margin":"Sem margem exterior","No shortcuts":"Sem atalhos","None":"Nenhum","None yet.":"Nenhuma ainda.","Off":"Desligado","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Desligado = modo 1, ligado = modo 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Desligado: uma moldura neutra – só para as pré-visualizações ligadas.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Desligado: as teclas continuam atribuídas mas não fazem nada.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Desligado: as janelas ficam onde as pôs. As outras funções trabalham em qualquer caso.","One at a time":"Uma de cada vez","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Uma fecha – as outras preenchem o espaço","One main window less":"Menos uma janela principal","One more main window":"Mais uma janela principal","One window":"Uma janela","Only one mode is switched on.":"Só um modo está ligado.","Open settings editor":"Abrir o editor de definições","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Abra primeiro a aplicação e depois escolha-a aqui.","Open the layout builder":"Abrir o construtor de disposições","Own layouts":"Disposições próprias","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Parte de cada lado que conta como canto.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Pausar o mosaico das margens do KDE e a sua pré-visualização","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Pausar as zonas de encaixe do KDE enquanto o íman está ligado","Preview":"Pré-visualização","Previews":"Pré-visualizações","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Empurre uma janela contra uma margem ou um canto do ecrã e ela preenche essa parte. Funciona com ou sem a barra de encaixe.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Empurre uma janela contra uma margem ou um canto: maximizar, metades, quartos.","Push delay":"Atraso do empurrão","Quarters":"Quartos","Quick":"Rápida","Quick settings":"Definições rápidas","Recommended values":"Valores recomendados","Remove":"Remover","Remove rule":"Remover regra","Remove zone":"Remover zona","Reset all":"Repor tudo","Reset all keys":"Repor todas as teclas","Reset to default":"Repor predefinição","Resistance against overlapping":"Resistência à sobreposição","Resize touching windows together":"Redimensionar em conjunto as janelas que se tocam","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Redimensionar também encaixa – aqui até à altura total","Restore":"Restaurar","Restore default layouts":"Restaurar disposições predefinidas","Restore default layouts?":"Restaurar as disposições predefinidas?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Restaurar o tamanho original ao retirar a janela","Restore the size before snapping":"Repor o tamanho anterior ao encaixe","Rows":"Linhas","Save":"Guardar","Screen edges":"Margens do ecrã","Screen edges on/off":"Margens do ecrã ligar/desligar","Screen edges preview":"Pré-visualização das margens","Set":"Definir","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Define as teclas de todas as ações de uma vez. Pode continuar a alterar teclas individuais abaixo.","Settings":"Definições","Settings file":"Ficheiro de definições","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Abane o rato depressa para trás e para a frente ao redimensionar e as outras janelas voltam para trás. Um puxão rápido numa só direção nunca as solta.","Shake to let go":"Abanar para soltar","Shortcuts":"Atalhos","Show a small handle first":"Mostrar primeiro uma pequena pega","Show layout and zone names":"Mostrar nomes das disposições e zonas","Show previews in the accent color":"Mostrar as pré-visualizações na cor de destaque","Showing":"Mostrar","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Mostra onde a janela fica numa margem ou num canto. Desligado: nenhuma pré-visualização.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Mostra onde a janela fica enquanto uma zona da barra está realçada. Desligado: nenhuma pré-visualização.","Sidebar + grid":"Barra lateral + grelha","Single zone":"Zona única","Six tiles":"Seis mosaicos","Size & shape":"Tamanho e forma","Size of the main area":"Tamanho da área principal","Slide-in duration":"Duração da descida","Slide-out duration":"Duração da subida","Smart arranging and detection.":"Organização e deteção inteligentes.","Smart fill":"Preenchimento inteligente","Smooth (default)":"Suave (predefinida)","Snap bar":"Barra de encaixe","Snap bar and screen edges":"Barra de encaixe e margens do ecrã","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"A barra e as margens estão desligadas – só funciona o modo 2 e o atalho de modo não faz nada.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"A barra e as margens do ecrã atrapalham o mosaico automático. Por isso funcionam como dois modos – mude com o atalho ou aqui.","Snap bar colors:":"Cores da barra:","Snap bar on/off":"Barra de encaixe ligar/desligar","Snap bar preview":"Pré-visualização da barra","Snap bar size":"Tamanho da barra","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Barra de encaixe, margens do ecrã, íman de janelas, atalhos e troca de janelas.","Snap distance":"Distância de encaixe","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Encaixar divisores (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Disposições de encaixe e mosaico automático.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Encaixe a janela ativa com combinações de teclas.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Encaixe a janela ativa com o teclado. São atalhos globais normais do KDE – também os encontra em Definições do Sistema → Atalhos → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Encaixar na metade inferior","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Encaixar no quarto inferior esquerdo","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Encaixar no quarto inferior direito","Snap to the center third":"Encaixar no terço central","Snap to the left half":"Encaixar na metade esquerda","Snap to the left third":"Encaixar no terço esquerdo","Snap to the left two thirds":"Encaixar nos dois terços à esquerda","Snap to the right half":"Encaixar na metade direita","Snap to the right third":"Encaixar no terço direito","Snap to the right two thirds":"Encaixar nos dois terços à direita","Snap to the top half":"Encaixar na metade superior","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Encaixar no quarto superior esquerdo","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Encaixar no quarto superior direito","Snapping":"Encaixe","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"O encaixe e o mosaico automático funcionam como dois modos – um atalho alterna entre eles.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Assim só um íman puxa uma janela. As definições do KDE não mudam: desligue isto, desative ou remova o KSnapUnity e o encaixe do KDE volta.","Soft":"Delicada","Spacing":"Espaçamento","Spiral":"Espiral","Split side by side":"Dividir lado a lado","Split top and bottom":"Dividir em cima e em baixo","Stack + main":"Pilha + principal","Stick to other windows":"Colar a outras janelas","Stick to the screen edges":"Colar às margens do ecrã","Sticky edges":"Margens aderentes","Support KSnapUnity":"Apoie o KSnapUnity","Swap":"Trocar","Swap windows":"Trocar janelas","Swap with the window above":"Trocar com a janela de cima","Swap with the window below":"Trocar com a janela de baixo","Swap with the window on the left":"Trocar com a janela à esquerda","Swap with the window on the right":"Trocar com a janela à direita","Switch mode":"Mudar de modo","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Mudar de modo (encaixe / mosaico)","Switch modes with:":"Mudar de modo com:","Switch the layout by itself":"Mudar de disposição sozinho","Switched off":"Desligado","System":"Sistema","Take it over":"Ficar com ela","Take over all":"Ficar com todas","Take the main place":"Ficam com o lugar principal","Test animation":"Testar animação","Test on screen":"Testar no ecrã","Test the snap bar":"Testar a barra de encaixe","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Os valores predefinidos baseiam-se no Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"As ações de encaixe usam os mesmos espaços que a barra e lembram o tamanho anterior ao encaixe: «Repor o tamanho anterior ao encaixe» recupera-o.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Estas aplicações nunca são organizadas e mantêm o seu lugar. As caixas de diálogo flutuam sempre.","Thirds":"Terços","Three columns":"Três colunas","Thumbnail width":"Largura das miniaturas","Tiling":"Mosaico","Tip":"Dica","Top / bottom":"Cima / baixo","Top edge":"Margem superior","Top edge: full screen":"Margem superior: ecrã inteiro","Top edge: maximize":"Margem superior: maximizar","Top edge: top half":"Margem superior: metade superior","Top half":"Metade superior","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Distância de ativação a partir do limite superior","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Desligue isto se preferir o contorno do KDE – depois desligue acima a pré-visualização das margens.","Two thirds":"Dois terços","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Duas janelas trocam de lugar – largue uma sobre a outra ou use as teclas.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Duas janelas trocam de lugar: largue uma sobre a outra, ou com uma tecla.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Usar atalhos de teclado","Use screen edges":"Usar as margens do ecrã","Use the system accent color":"Usar a cor de destaque do sistema","Use the window magnet":"Usar o íman de janelas","Usual combinations":"Combinações habituais","Version":"Versão","Wanted for: %1":"Pretendido para: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Quando uma janela abre, fecha ou troca, as outras movem-se suavemente em vez de saltar.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Ao redimensionar uma janela, as que lhe tocam movem a margem partilhada com ela – nada se sobrepõe, não fica espaço.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Durante o redimensionamento, as janelas que não acompanham aparecem transparentes.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Enquanto move ou redimensiona uma janela, as suas margens colam-se às janelas próximas e às margens do ecrã.","Width":"Largura","Window":"Janela","Window magnet":"Íman de janelas","Window magnet on/off":"Íman de janelas ligar/desligar","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Janelas umas sobre as outras mantêm juntas as margens esquerda e direita; janelas lado a lado, as de cima e de baixo.","Windows glide to their place":"As janelas deslizam para o lugar","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"As janelas colam-se umas às outras e às margens do ecrã.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"As janelas param no «Espaço entre janelas» da página Geral em vez de se tocarem.","Yes":"Sim","Your own combination":"A sua combinação","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"As suas disposições e a respetiva ordem serão perdidas.","Zone %1":"Zona %1","for KWin · v%1":"para KWin · v%1","windows:":"janelas:","“%1” will be removed.":"«%1» será removida.","…drag it onto window B…":"…arraste-a sobre a janela B…","…in every direction":"…em todas as direções","…let go: they trade places":"…solte: trocam de lugar","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…as vizinhas crescem e encolhem com ela","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Pronto – clique em OK para abrir o editor de definições."},"pt_BR":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (cópia)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 é usado por “%2”.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 de %2 zonas","0 = all in one row":"0 = todos em uma linha","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Modo 1</b><br/>Barra de encaixe e bordas da tela","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Modo 2</b><br/>Mosaico automático","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Uma janela sozinha usa a tela toda, mesmo com margem definida.","A new window joins":"Uma nova janela entra","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Um empurrão curto dá a metade ou o quarto. Segure a janela um pouco mais na borda e ela cresce até a próxima janela – a prévia mostra.","A single window":"Uma única janela","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Uma janela para na borda de outra, mesmo quando você a move rápido. Sacuda o mouse ou continue empurrando um instante para soltá-la. 0 = as janelas podem se sobrepor livremente.","About & Help":"Sobre e ajuda","Accent color":"Cor de destaque","Active":"Ativo","Active mode":"Modo ativo","Active width along the top edge":"Largura ativa ao longo da borda superior","Add an open application":"Adicionar um aplicativo aberto","Add rule":"Adicionar regra","All window features in one system.":"Todos os recursos de janelas em um só sistema.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Também muda quando você redimensiona a janela principal à mão.","Also while resizing":"Também ao redimensionar","Always floating":"Sempre flutuantes","Animation":"Animação","Appearance":"Aparência","Apply":"Aplicar","Arrange windows":"Organizar janelas","Arrange windows automatically":"Organizar janelas automaticamente","Author":"Autor","Automatic tiling":"Mosaico automático","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"O mosaico automático está desligado – só o modo 1 funciona e o atalho de modo não faz nada.","Automatic tiling off":"Mosaico automático desligado","Automatic tiling on":"Mosaico automático ligado","Automatic tiling on/off":"Ligar/desligar mosaico automático","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Mosaico automático, troca de janelas, atalhos e o ímã para janelas flutuantes.","Background opacity":"Opacidade do fundo","Behavior & Animation":"Comportamento e animação","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Borda inferior: metade de baixo","Bouncy":"Com quique","Buy me a coffee":"Me pague um café","Cancel":"Cancelar","Center focus":"Foco central","Center the window":"Centralizar a janela","Change":"Alterar","Change key":"Mudar tecla","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"A tecla é alterada no editor de configurações. Os dois modos precisam do mosaico automático e da barra ou das bordas da tela.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Altere-as na página Atalhos de teclado. Com o mosaico automático, as janelas também trocam de lugar na ordem.","Choose…":"Escolher…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Clique em uma zona para selecioná-la · clique duplo para dividir · arraste os divisores","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Clique ou pressione %1 para mudar de modo.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Clique e depois OK – o editor de configurações abre.","Close":"Fechar","Close by, the edges stick together":"De perto, as bordas grudam","Color scheme":"Esquema de cores","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Cores, tamanho e forma da barra.","Columns":"Colunas","Corner radius":"Raio dos cantos","Corner size":"Tamanho dos cantos","Corner: a quarter":"Canto: um quarto","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Cantos: um quarto da tela","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + tecla (padrão)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + teclado numérico","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + tecla","Custom color":"Cor personalizada","Custom layout %1":"Layout personalizado %1","Dark":"Escuro","Delay before hiding":"Atraso antes de ocultar","Delay before showing":"Atraso antes de mostrar","Delete":"Excluir","Delete layout?":"Excluir o layout?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Distância em que a alça aparece","Distance before the bar hides again":"Distância até a barra se esconder de novo","Distance to the edge":"Distância até a borda","Donate with PayPal":"Doar com PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"Arraste uma borda compartilhada…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Arraste uma janela contra uma borda…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Arraste uma janela sobre outra para trocá-las. Solta na barra ou numa borda da tela, ela flutua livre; “Deixar a janela flutuar” a traz de volta. Os espaços vêm da página Geral.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Arraste uma janela sobre o centro de outra – a prévia mostra duas setas – e solte. Com o mosaico automático qualquer ponto sobre a outra janela serve.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Arraste uma janela até a borda superior da tela e solte-a em uma zona.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Arraste os cartões para mudar a ordem na barra. Clique duas vezes em um cartão para editá-lo.","Drop a window onto another one":"Soltar uma janela sobre outra","Drop the window onto a zone":"Solte a janela em uma zona","Duplicate":"Duplicar","Duration":"Duração","Dwindle":"Espiral para dentro","Dynamic":"Dinâmica","Edges and corners":"Bordas e cantos","Edit":"Editar","Edit layout":"Editar layout","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Cada recurso pode ser ligado e desligado separadamente.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Cada layout que você cria na página Layouts também pode organizar janelas – ele aparece acima. A janela 1 fica com a zona 1 e assim por diante; janelas extras dividem a última zona. Com menos janelas que zonas usa-se “Principal e pilha”, para não ficar buraco.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Cada janela encontra seu lugar sozinha, como em um gerenciador de janelas lado a lado.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Cada janela encontra sozinha seu lugar na tela. Janelas novas entram na fila, as fechadas dão espaço às outras.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Exemplo: duas janelas lado a lado, a partir de três principal e pilha, a partir de cinco uma grade. Sem regra adequada vale o layout escolhido acima.","Fade in and out":"Esmaecer ao aparecer e sumir","Fade the other windows":"Esmaecer as outras janelas","Features":"Recursos","Feel":"Sensação","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Ajustar às janelas já encaixadas","Fits the way you work.":"Combina com o seu jeito de trabalhar.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Deixar a janela flutuar (sair do mosaico)","Four quarters":"Quatro quartos","From":"A partir de","Fullscreen":"Tela cheia","Gap between windows":"Espaço entre janelas","Gap to the screen edge":"Espaço até a borda da tela","General":"Geral","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Dá novamente a cada ação a tecla do esquema escolhido e remove as teclas que o esquema não tem.","Good to know":"Bom saber","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Pegue uma janela pela barra de título e arraste-a para cima. A barra desce; solte a janela em uma zona e ela ocupa exatamente essa área. Ao arrastá-la para fora de novo, ela volta ao tamanho anterior.","Grab window A…":"Pegue a janela A…","Grid":"Grade","Halves":"Metades","Hiding":"Ocultação","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Segurar na borda para preencher o espaço livre","Hold time":"Tempo de espera","Hold to fill":"Segurar para preencher","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Quanto uma borda precisa chegar perto antes de encaixar.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Quanto o cursor precisa chegar perto da borda.","How far the bar slides down":"Quanto a barra desce","How it works":"Como funciona","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Quanto tempo a janela precisa ficar encostada na borda – um pequeno empurrão. 0 = na hora.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Quanto tempo a janela precisa ficar na borda antes de crescer.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Quantas janelas dividem a área principal (layout “Principal e pilha”).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Se houver uma janela embaixo, a borda superior dá a metade de cima em vez de maximizar. Metades e quartos também deixam livres as janelas encaixadas.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Se você gosta do KSnapUnity, pode apoiar o desenvolvimento – obrigado!","In bar":"Na barra","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Independente da barra de encaixe e das bordas da tela.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Independente da barra de encaixe. Cada borda pode ser ligada separadamente.","Information":"Informações","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Comportamento de janelas intuitivo e natural.","Join at the end":"Entram no fim","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K de KWin · Snap de encaixe mais esperto · Unity de tudo em um só sistema","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"O KDE tem suas próprias ações de borda da tela e seu próprio encaixe de janelas. Se a mesma função estiver ligada aqui, desligue a do KDE: Configurações do sistema → Gerenciamento de janelas → Bordas da tela, e Comportamento das janelas → Movimento.","KDE's own edge tiling":"Mosaico de bordas do próprio KDE","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"O maximizar e o mosaico próprios do KDE nas bordas – com seu contorno – ficam pausados enquanto o KSnapUnity funciona, para aparecer só uma prévia. Suas configurações do KDE não mudam: desligue isto, desative ou remova o KSnapUnity e o comportamento do KDE volta.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"As ações de borda da tela do KDE ainda estão ligadas, então dois ajudantes reagem ao mesmo arrasto. Desligue “Maximizar” e “Lado a lado” em Configurações do sistema → Gerenciamento de janelas → Bordas da tela.","KDE's own window snapping":"Encaixe de janelas do próprio KDE","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"O encaixe de janelas do próprio KDE também está ligado. Para uma sensação uniforme, defina as zonas dele como “Nenhuma” em Configurações do sistema → Gerenciamento de janelas → Comportamento das janelas → Movimento.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"O serviço de atalhos do KDE não respondeu. Você ainda pode definir as teclas em Configurações do sistema → Atalhos → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – Editor de configurações","Keep stacked windows in line":"Manter janelas empilhadas alinhadas","Keep the gap between windows":"Manter o espaço entre janelas","Keep them":"Manter","Key scheme":"Esquema de teclas","Keyboard shortcuts":"Atalhos de teclado","Keys":"Teclas","Keys already in use":"Teclas já em uso","Layout by number of windows":"Layout pelo número de janelas","Layouts per row":"Layouts por linha","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Bordas esquerda e direita: metade da tela","Left edge: left half":"Borda esquerda: metade esquerda","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Abaixo de 100 % uma janela sozinha fica centralizada – ótimo em telas largas.","License":"Licença","Light":"Claro","Live preview":"Prévia ao vivo","Load template…":"Carregar modelo…","Magnet":"Ímã","Main + stack":"Principal + pilha","Main and stack":"Principal e pilha","Main area bigger":"Área principal maior","Main area on the right":"Área principal à direita","Main area smaller":"Área principal menor","Main in the middle":"Principal no centro","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Chave principal para arrastar e para as teclas.","Main window":"Janela principal","Main windows":"Janelas principais","Main windows: %1":"Janelas principais: %1","Make it the main window":"Tornar a janela principal","Maximize":"Maximizar","Maximize or restore":"Maximizar ou restaurar","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + tecla (estilo KDE)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + tecla","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + tecla","Minimize":"Minimizar","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Espelha o layout: a janela principal à direita, as outras à esquerda.","Mode":"Modo","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Modo 1 – Barra de encaixe e bordas da tela","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Modo 2 – Mosaico automático","Modes":"Modos","More ways":"Mais formas","Motion curve":"Curva de movimento","Move a window towards others…":"Aproxime uma janela das outras…","Move the window one place back":"Mover a janela uma posição atrás","Move the window one place on":"Mover a janela uma posição adiante","Name:":"Nome:","New layout":"Novo layout","New windows":"Novas janelas","Next tiling layout":"Próximo layout de mosaico","Next to the active window":"Ao lado da janela ativa","No key":"Sem tecla","No other window open":"Nenhuma outra janela aberta","No outer margin":"Sem margem externa","No shortcuts":"Sem atalhos","None":"Nenhum","None yet.":"Nenhum ainda.","Off":"Desligado","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Desligado = modo 1, ligado = modo 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Desligado: uma moldura neutra – só para as prévias ligadas.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Desligado: as teclas continuam atribuídas, mas não fazem nada.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Desligado: as janelas ficam onde você as colocar. Os outros recursos funcionam de qualquer forma.","One at a time":"Uma por vez","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Uma fecha – as outras preenchem o vão","One main window less":"Uma janela principal a menos","One more main window":"Mais uma janela principal","One window":"Uma janela","Only one mode is switched on.":"Só um modo está ligado.","Open settings editor":"Abrir o editor de configurações","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Abra o aplicativo primeiro e depois escolha-o aqui.","Open the layout builder":"Abrir o criador de layouts","Own layouts":"Layouts próprios","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Parte de cada lado que conta como canto.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Pausar o mosaico de bordas do KDE e sua prévia","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Pausar as zonas de encaixe do KDE enquanto o ímã está ligado","Preview":"Pré-visualização","Previews":"Prévias","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Empurre uma janela contra uma borda ou um canto da tela e ela preenche essa parte. Funciona com ou sem a barra de encaixe.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Empurre uma janela contra uma borda ou um canto: maximizar, metades, quartos.","Push delay":"Atraso do empurrão","Quarters":"Quartos","Quick":"Rápida","Quick settings":"Configurações rápidas","Recommended values":"Valores recomendados","Remove":"Remover","Remove rule":"Remover regra","Remove zone":"Remover zona","Reset all":"Redefinir tudo","Reset all keys":"Redefinir todas as teclas","Reset to default":"Restaurar padrão","Resistance against overlapping":"Resistência à sobreposição","Resize touching windows together":"Redimensionar juntas as janelas que se tocam","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Redimensionar também encaixa – aqui na altura total","Restore":"Restaurar","Restore default layouts":"Restaurar layouts padrão","Restore default layouts?":"Restaurar os layouts padrão?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Restaurar o tamanho original ao tirar a janela","Restore the size before snapping":"Restaurar o tamanho antes do encaixe","Rows":"Linhas","Save":"Salvar","Screen edges":"Bordas da tela","Screen edges on/off":"Bordas da tela liga/desliga","Screen edges preview":"Prévia das bordas da tela","Set":"Definir","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Define as teclas de todas as ações de uma vez. Você ainda pode mudar teclas individuais abaixo.","Settings":"Configurações","Settings file":"Arquivo de configurações","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Sacuda o mouse rápido para frente e para trás ao redimensionar e as outras janelas voltam. Um puxão rápido em uma só direção nunca as solta.","Shake to let go":"Sacudir para soltar","Shortcuts":"Atalhos","Show a small handle first":"Mostrar primeiro uma pequena alça","Show layout and zone names":"Mostrar nomes de layouts e zonas","Show previews in the accent color":"Mostrar as prévias na cor de destaque","Showing":"Exibição","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Mostra onde a janela vai parar numa borda ou num canto. Desligado: nenhuma prévia.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Mostra onde a janela vai parar enquanto uma zona da barra está destacada. Desligado: nenhuma prévia.","Sidebar + grid":"Barra lateral + grade","Single zone":"Zona única","Six tiles":"Seis blocos","Size & shape":"Tamanho e forma","Size of the main area":"Tamanho da área principal","Slide-in duration":"Duração da descida","Slide-out duration":"Duração da subida","Smart arranging and detection.":"Organização e detecção inteligentes.","Smart fill":"Preenchimento inteligente","Smooth (default)":"Suave (padrão)","Snap bar":"Barra de encaixe","Snap bar and screen edges":"Barra de encaixe e bordas da tela","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"A barra e as bordas estão desligadas – só o modo 2 funciona e o atalho de modo não faz nada.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"A barra e as bordas da tela atrapalham o mosaico automático. Por isso funcionam como dois modos – troque com o atalho ou aqui.","Snap bar colors:":"Cores da barra:","Snap bar on/off":"Barra de encaixe liga/desliga","Snap bar preview":"Prévia da barra","Snap bar size":"Tamanho da barra","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Barra de encaixe, bordas da tela, ímã de janelas, atalhos e troca de janelas.","Snap distance":"Distância de encaixe","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Encaixar divisores (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Layouts de encaixe e mosaico automático.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Encaixe a janela ativa com combinações de teclas.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Encaixe a janela ativa com o teclado. São atalhos globais normais do KDE – você também os encontra em Configurações do sistema → Atalhos → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Encaixar na metade de baixo","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Encaixar no quarto inferior esquerdo","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Encaixar no quarto inferior direito","Snap to the center third":"Encaixar no terço central","Snap to the left half":"Encaixar na metade esquerda","Snap to the left third":"Encaixar no terço esquerdo","Snap to the left two thirds":"Encaixar nos dois terços à esquerda","Snap to the right half":"Encaixar na metade direita","Snap to the right third":"Encaixar no terço direito","Snap to the right two thirds":"Encaixar nos dois terços à direita","Snap to the top half":"Encaixar na metade de cima","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Encaixar no quarto superior esquerdo","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Encaixar no quarto superior direito","Snapping":"Encaixe","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Encaixe e mosaico automático funcionam como dois modos – um atalho alterna entre eles.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Assim só um ímã puxa uma janela. Suas configurações do KDE não mudam: desligue isto, desative ou remova o KSnapUnity e o encaixe do KDE volta.","Soft":"Delicada","Spacing":"Espaçamento","Spiral":"Espiral","Split side by side":"Dividir lado a lado","Split top and bottom":"Dividir em cima e embaixo","Stack + main":"Pilha + principal","Stick to other windows":"Grudar em outras janelas","Stick to the screen edges":"Grudar nas bordas da tela","Sticky edges":"Bordas grudentas","Support KSnapUnity":"Apoie o KSnapUnity","Swap":"Trocar","Swap windows":"Trocar janelas","Swap with the window above":"Trocar com a janela de cima","Swap with the window below":"Trocar com a janela de baixo","Swap with the window on the left":"Trocar com a janela à esquerda","Swap with the window on the right":"Trocar com a janela à direita","Switch mode":"Mudar de modo","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Mudar de modo (encaixe / mosaico)","Switch modes with:":"Mudar de modo com:","Switch the layout by itself":"Trocar o layout sozinho","Switched off":"Desligado","System":"Sistema","Take it over":"Assumir","Take over all":"Assumir todas","Take the main place":"Pegam o lugar principal","Test animation":"Testar animação","Test on screen":"Testar na tela","Test the snap bar":"Testar a barra de encaixe","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Os valores padrão são baseados no Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"As ações de encaixe usam os mesmos espaços da barra e lembram o tamanho antes do encaixe: “Restaurar o tamanho antes do encaixe” o traz de volta.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Esses aplicativos nunca são organizados e mantêm seu lugar. Diálogos sempre flutuam.","Thirds":"Terços","Three columns":"Três colunas","Thumbnail width":"Largura das miniaturas","Tiling":"Mosaico","Tip":"Dica","Top / bottom":"Cima / baixo","Top edge":"Borda superior","Top edge: full screen":"Borda superior: tela cheia","Top edge: maximize":"Borda superior: maximizar","Top edge: top half":"Borda superior: metade superior","Top half":"Metade de cima","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Distância de ativação a partir da borda superior","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Desligue isto se preferir o contorno do KDE – então desligue acima a prévia das bordas.","Two thirds":"Dois terços","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Duas janelas trocam de lugar – solte uma sobre a outra ou use as teclas.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Duas janelas trocam de lugar: solte uma sobre a outra, ou com uma tecla.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Usar atalhos de teclado","Use screen edges":"Usar as bordas da tela","Use the system accent color":"Usar a cor de destaque do sistema","Use the window magnet":"Usar o ímã de janelas","Usual combinations":"Combinações comuns","Version":"Versão","Wanted for: %1":"Desejado para: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Quando uma janela abre, fecha ou troca, as outras se movem suavemente em vez de pular.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Ao redimensionar uma janela, as que a tocam movem a borda compartilhada junto – nada se sobrepõe, não fica espaço.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Durante o redimensionamento, as janelas que não acompanham aparecem transparentes.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Enquanto você move ou redimensiona uma janela, as bordas dela grudam nas janelas próximas e nas bordas da tela.","Width":"Largura","Window":"Janela","Window magnet":"Ímã de janelas","Window magnet on/off":"Ímã de janelas liga/desliga","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Janelas uma sobre a outra mantêm juntas as bordas esquerda e direita; janelas lado a lado, as de cima e de baixo.","Windows glide to their place":"As janelas deslizam para o lugar","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"As janelas grudam umas nas outras e nas bordas da tela.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"As janelas param no “Espaço entre janelas” da página Geral em vez de se tocarem.","Yes":"Sim","Your own combination":"Sua própria combinação","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Seus layouts e a ordem deles serão perdidos.","Zone %1":"Zona %1","for KWin · v%1":"para KWin · v%1","windows:":"janelas:","“%1” will be removed.":"“%1” será removido.","…drag it onto window B…":"…arraste-a sobre a janela B…","…in every direction":"…em todas as direções","…let go: they trade places":"…solte: elas trocam de lugar","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…as vizinhas crescem e encolhem junto","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Pronto – clique em OK para abrir o editor de configurações."},"ro":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (copie)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 este folosită de „%2”.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 din %2 zone","0 = all in one row":"0 = toate pe un rând","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Modul 1</b><br/>Bara de fixare și marginile ecranului","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Modul 2</b><br/>Aranjare automată","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"O fereastră singură folosește tot ecranul, chiar dacă e setată o margine.","A new window joins":"Se alătură o fereastră nouă","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"O împingere scurtă dă jumătatea sau sfertul. Țineți fereastra puțin mai mult la margine și crește până la fereastra următoare – previzualizarea arată asta.","A single window":"O singură fereastră","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"O fereastră se oprește la marginea alteia, chiar dacă o miști repede. Scutură mouse-ul sau mai împinge o clipă ca să o desprinzi. 0 = ferestrele se pot suprapune liber.","About & Help":"Despre și ajutor","Accent color":"Culoare de accent","Active":"Activ","Active mode":"Mod activ","Active width along the top edge":"Lățimea activă de-a lungul marginii de sus","Add an open application":"Adaugă o aplicație deschisă","Add rule":"Adaugă regulă","All window features in one system.":"Toate funcțiile ferestrelor într-un singur sistem.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Se schimbă și când redimensionezi de mână fereastra principală.","Also while resizing":"Și la redimensionare","Always floating":"Mereu plutitoare","Animation":"Animație","Appearance":"Aspect","Apply":"Aplică","Arrange windows":"Aranjarea ferestrelor","Arrange windows automatically":"Aranjează ferestrele automat","Author":"Autor","Automatic tiling":"Aranjare automată","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Aranjarea automată e oprită – rulează doar modul 1, iar scurtătura de mod nu face nimic.","Automatic tiling off":"Aranjare automată oprită","Automatic tiling on":"Aranjare automată pornită","Automatic tiling on/off":"Aranjare automată pornit/oprit","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Aranjare automată, schimbarea ferestrelor, scurtături și magnetul pentru ferestrele plutitoare.","Background opacity":"Opacitatea fundalului","Behavior & Animation":"Comportament și animație","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Marginea de jos: jumătatea de jos","Bouncy":"Elastică","Buy me a coffee":"Cumpără-mi o cafea","Cancel":"Anulează","Center focus":"Focus central","Center the window":"Centrează fereastra","Change":"Schimbă","Change key":"Schimbă tasta","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Tasta se schimbă în editorul de setări. Ambele moduri au nevoie de aranjarea automată și de bară sau de marginile ecranului.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Schimbă-le pe pagina Scurtături de tastatură. Cu aranjarea automată, ferestrele își schimbă și locul în ordine.","Choose…":"Alege…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Clic pe o zonă pentru a o selecta · dublu clic pentru a o împărți · trage separatoarele","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Fă clic sau apasă %1 pentru a schimba modul.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Fă clic, apoi OK – se deschide editorul de setări.","Close":"Închide","Close by, the edges stick together":"Aproape, marginile se lipesc","Color scheme":"Schemă de culori","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Culorile, dimensiunea și forma barei.","Columns":"Coloane","Corner radius":"Raza colțurilor","Corner size":"Mărimea colțurilor","Corner: a quarter":"Colț: un sfert","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Colțuri: un sfert din ecran","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + tastă (implicit)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + tastatura numerică","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + tastă","Custom color":"Culoare personalizată","Custom layout %1":"Aranjament personalizat %1","Dark":"Întunecată","Delay before hiding":"Întârziere înainte de ascundere","Delay before showing":"Întârziere înainte de afișare","Delete":"Șterge","Delete layout?":"Ștergi aranjamentul?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Distanța la care apare mânerul","Distance before the bar hides again":"Distanța după care bara se ascunde din nou","Distance to the edge":"Distanța față de margine","Donate with PayPal":"Donează cu PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"Trage de o margine comună…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Trage o fereastră spre o margine…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Trage o fereastră peste alta ca să le schimbi. Lăsată pe bară sau pe o margine, plutește liber; „Lasă fereastra să plutească” o aduce înapoi. Spațiile vin din pagina General.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Trage o fereastră peste mijlocul alteia – previzualizarea arată două săgeți – și dă drumul. La aranjarea automată ajunge oriunde peste cealaltă fereastră.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Trage o fereastră spre marginea de sus a ecranului și las-o pe o zonă.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Trage cardurile pentru a schimba ordinea în bară. Dublu clic pe un card pentru a-l edita.","Drop a window onto another one":"Lasă o fereastră peste alta","Drop the window onto a zone":"Lasă fereastra pe o zonă","Duplicate":"Duplică","Duration":"Durată","Dwindle":"Spirală spre interior","Dynamic":"Dinamică","Edges and corners":"Margini și colțuri","Edit":"Editează","Edit layout":"Editează aranjamentul","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Fiecare funcție poate fi pornită și oprită separat.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Fiecare aranjament construit pe pagina Aranjamente poate și așeza ferestre – apare mai sus. Fereastra 1 primește zona 1 și așa mai departe; ferestrele în plus împart ultima zonă. Cu mai puține ferestre decât zone se folosește „Principală și stivă”, ca să nu rămână găuri.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Fiecare fereastră își găsește singură locul, ca într-un manager de ferestre cu dale.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Fiecare fereastră își găsește singură locul pe ecran. Ferestrele noi se alătură, cele închise fac loc celorlalte.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Exemplu: două ferestre alăturate, de la trei principală și stivă, de la cinci o grilă. Fără o regulă potrivită se folosește aranjamentul ales mai sus.","Fade in and out":"Estompare la apariție și dispariție","Fade the other windows":"Estompează celelalte ferestre","Features":"Funcții","Feel":"Senzație","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Adaptează-te la ferestrele deja fixate","Fits the way you work.":"Se potrivește felului în care lucrezi.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Lasă fereastra să plutească (ieși din aranjare)","Four quarters":"Patru sferturi","From":"De la","Fullscreen":"Ecran complet","Gap between windows":"Spațiu între ferestre","Gap to the screen edge":"Spațiu față de marginea ecranului","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Dă din nou fiecărei acțiuni tasta din schema aleasă și elimină tastele pe care schema nu le are.","Good to know":"Bine de știut","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Prinde o fereastră de bara de titlu și trage-o în sus. Bara coboară; las-o pe o zonă și fereastra ocupă exact acea suprafață. Când o tragi din nou afară, își recapătă dimensiunea anterioară.","Grab window A…":"Apucă fereastra A…","Grid":"Grilă","Halves":"Jumătăți","Hiding":"Ascundere","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Ține la margine pentru a umple spațiul liber","Hold time":"Timp de ținere","Hold to fill":"Ține pentru umplere","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Cât de aproape trebuie să vină o margine înainte să se fixeze.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Cât de aproape de margine trebuie să ajungă cursorul.","How far the bar slides down":"Cât de jos coboară bara","How it works":"Cum funcționează","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Cât timp trebuie să stea fereastra lipită de margine – o mică împingere. 0 = imediat.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Cât timp trebuie să rămână fereastra la margine înainte să crească.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Câte ferestre împart zona principală (aranjamentul „Principală și stivă”).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Dacă jos există deja o fereastră, marginea de sus dă jumătatea de sus în loc să maximizeze. Și jumătățile și sferturile lasă libere ferestrele fixate.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Dacă îți place KSnapUnity, poți susține dezvoltarea – mulțumim!","In bar":"În bară","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Independent de bara de fixare și de marginile ecranului.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Independent de bara de fixare. Fiecare margine se pornește separat.","Information":"Informații","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Comportament intuitiv și natural al ferestrelor.","Join at the end":"Intră la sfârșit","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K de la KWin · Snap pentru o fixare mai isteață · Unity pentru totul într-un singur sistem","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE are propriile acțiuni pentru marginile ecranului și propria aliniere a ferestrelor. Dacă aceeași funcție este pornită aici, oprește-o pe cea din KDE: Configurări de sistem → Gestionarea ferestrelor → Marginile ecranului, și Comportamentul ferestrelor → Mutare.","KDE's own edge tiling":"Aranjarea proprie pe margini a KDE","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"Maximizarea și aranjarea proprii KDE la margini – cu conturul lor – sunt în pauză cât timp rulează KSnapUnity, ca să apară o singură previzualizare. Setările KDE nu se schimbă: oprește asta, dezactivează sau elimină KSnapUnity și comportamentul KDE revine.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"Acțiunile proprii KDE pentru marginile ecranului sunt încă pornite, așa că doi asistenți reacționează la aceeași tragere. Oprește „Maximizează” și „Pavează” în Configurări de sistem → Gestionarea ferestrelor → Marginile ecranului.","KDE's own window snapping":"Ancorarea proprie a ferestrelor KDE","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"Alinierea proprie a ferestrelor din KDE este și ea pornită. Pentru o senzație unitară, setează-i zonele la „Niciuna” în Configurări de sistem → Gestionarea ferestrelor → Comportamentul ferestrelor → Mutare.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Serviciul de scurtături KDE nu a răspuns. Poți seta tastele și în Configurări de sistem → Scurtături → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – Editor de setări","Keep stacked windows in line":"Păstrează ferestrele stivuite aliniate","Keep the gap between windows":"Păstrează spațiul dintre ferestre","Keep them":"Păstrează-le","Key scheme":"Schema de taste","Keyboard shortcuts":"Scurtături de tastatură","Keys":"Taste","Keys already in use":"Taste deja folosite","Layout":"Aranjament","Layout by number of windows":"Aranjament după numărul de ferestre","Layouts":"Aranjamente","Layouts per row":"Aranjamente pe rând","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Marginile stângă și dreaptă: jumătate de ecran","Left edge: left half":"Marginea stângă: jumătatea stângă","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Sub 100 % o fereastră singură rămâne centrată – frumos pe ecrane late.","License":"Licență","Light":"Luminoasă","Linear":"Liniară","Live preview":"Previzualizare în direct","Load template…":"Încarcă un șablon…","Main + stack":"Principal + stivă","Main and stack":"Principală și stivă","Main area bigger":"Zonă principală mai mare","Main area on the right":"Zona principală în dreapta","Main area smaller":"Zonă principală mai mică","Main in the middle":"Principală la mijloc","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Comutator principal pentru tragere și taste.","Main window":"Fereastra principală","Main windows":"Ferestre principale","Main windows: %1":"Ferestre principale: %1","Make it the main window":"Fă-o fereastra principală","Maximize":"Maximizează","Maximize or restore":"Maximizează sau restabilește","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + tastă (stil KDE)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + tastă","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + tastă","Minimize":"Minimizează","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Oglindește aranjamentul: fereastra principală în dreapta, celelalte în stânga.","Mode":"Mod","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Modul 1 – Bara de fixare și marginile ecranului","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Modul 2 – Aranjare automată","Modes":"Moduri","More ways":"Alte moduri","Motion curve":"Curbă de mișcare","Move a window towards others…":"Apropie o fereastră de altele…","Move the window one place back":"Mută fereastra un loc înapoi","Move the window one place on":"Mută fereastra un loc înainte","Name:":"Nume:","New layout":"Aranjament nou","New windows":"Ferestre noi","Next tiling layout":"Aranjamentul următor","Next to the active window":"Lângă fereastra activă","No key":"Fără tastă","No other window open":"Nicio altă fereastră deschisă","No outer margin":"Fără margine exterioară","No shortcuts":"Fără scurtături","None":"Niciuna","None yet.":"Niciuna încă.","Off":"Oprit","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Oprit = modul 1, pornit = modul 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Dezactivat: un cadru neutru – doar pentru previzualizările activate.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Oprit: tastele rămân atribuite, dar nu fac nimic.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Oprit: ferestrele rămân unde le pui. Celelalte funcții merg oricum.","One at a time":"Câte una","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Una se închide – celelalte umplu golul","One main window less":"O fereastră principală mai puțin","One more main window":"Încă o fereastră principală","One window":"O fereastră","Only one mode is switched on.":"Doar un mod este pornit.","Open settings editor":"Deschide editorul de setări","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Deschide întâi aplicația, apoi alege-o aici.","Open the layout builder":"Deschide constructorul de aranjamente","Own layouts":"Aranjamente proprii","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Partea din fiecare latură care contează drept colț.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Pune pe pauză aranjarea pe margini a KDE și previzualizarea ei","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Pune pe pauză zonele de ancorare KDE cât magnetul este activ","Preview":"Previzualizare","Previews":"Previzualizări","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Împinge o fereastră spre o margine sau un colț al ecranului și va umple acea parte. Merge cu sau fără bara de fixare.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Împinge o fereastră spre o margine sau un colț: maximizare, jumătăți, sferturi.","Push delay":"Întârzierea împingerii","Quarters":"Sferturi","Quick":"Rapidă","Quick settings":"Setări rapide","Recommended values":"Valori recomandate","Remove":"Elimină","Remove rule":"Elimină regula","Remove zone":"Elimină zona","Reset all":"Resetează tot","Reset all keys":"Resetează toate tastele","Reset to default":"Revenire la implicit","Resistance against overlapping":"Rezistență la suprapunere","Resize touching windows together":"Redimensionează împreună ferestrele care se ating","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Și redimensionarea se fixează – aici pe toată înălțimea","Restore":"Restabilește","Restore default layouts":"Restabilește aranjamentele implicite","Restore default layouts?":"Restabilești aranjamentele implicite?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Restabilește dimensiunea inițială când scoți fereastra","Restore the size before snapping":"Restabilește mărimea dinainte de fixare","Rows":"Rânduri","Save":"Salvează","Screen edges":"Marginile ecranului","Screen edges on/off":"Marginile ecranului pornit/oprit","Screen edges preview":"Previzualizarea marginilor ecranului","Set":"Setează","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Setează tastele tuturor acțiunilor deodată. Poți schimba în continuare taste individuale mai jos.","Settings":"Setări","Settings file":"Fișier de setări","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Scutură repede mouse-ul înainte și înapoi în timp ce redimensionezi și celelalte ferestre sar înapoi. O smucitură rapidă într-o singură direcție nu le desprinde niciodată.","Shake to let go":"Scuturați pentru a desprinde","Shortcuts":"Scurtături","Show a small handle first":"Arată mai întâi un mic mâner","Show layout and zone names":"Arată numele aranjamentelor și zonelor","Show previews in the accent color":"Arată previzualizările în culoarea de accent","Showing":"Afișare","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Arată unde ajunge fereastra la o margine sau un colț. Dezactivat: nicio previzualizare.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Arată unde ajunge fereastra cât timp o zonă a barei este evidențiată. Dezactivat: nicio previzualizare.","Sidebar + grid":"Bară laterală + grilă","Single zone":"O singură zonă","Six tiles":"Șase dale","Size & shape":"Dimensiune și formă","Size of the main area":"Mărimea zonei principale","Slide-in duration":"Durata coborârii","Slide-out duration":"Durata urcării","Smart arranging and detection.":"Aranjare și recunoaștere inteligente.","Smart fill":"Umplere inteligentă","Smooth (default)":"Lină (implicit)","Snap bar":"Bara de fixare","Snap bar and screen edges":"Bara de fixare și marginile ecranului","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Bara și marginile sunt oprite – rulează doar modul 2, iar scurtătura de mod nu face nimic.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Bara și marginile ecranului încurcă aranjarea automată. De aceea funcționează ca două moduri – schimbă cu scurtătura sau aici.","Snap bar colors:":"Culorile barei:","Snap bar on/off":"Bara de fixare pornit/oprit","Snap bar preview":"Previzualizarea barei de ancorare","Snap bar size":"Dimensiunea barei","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Bara de fixare, marginile ecranului, magnetul ferestrelor, scurtături și schimbarea ferestrelor.","Snap distance":"Distanța de fixare","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Fixează separatoarele (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Aranjamente de fixare și aranjare automată.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Fixează fereastra activă cu combinații de taste.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Fixează fereastra activă cu tastatura. Sunt scurtături globale KDE obișnuite – le găsești și în Configurări de sistem → Scurtături → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Fixează în jumătatea de jos","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Fixează în sfertul din stânga jos","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Fixează în sfertul din dreapta jos","Snap to the center third":"Fixează în treimea din mijloc","Snap to the left half":"Fixează în jumătatea stângă","Snap to the left third":"Fixează în treimea stângă","Snap to the left two thirds":"Fixează în cele două treimi din stânga","Snap to the right half":"Fixează în jumătatea dreaptă","Snap to the right third":"Fixează în treimea dreaptă","Snap to the right two thirds":"Fixează în cele două treimi din dreapta","Snap to the top half":"Fixează în jumătatea de sus","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Fixează în sfertul din stânga sus","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Fixează în sfertul din dreapta sus","Snapping":"Ancorare","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Fixarea și aranjarea automată funcționează ca două moduri – o scurtătură comută între ele.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Astfel un singur magnet trage o fereastră. Setările KDE nu se schimbă: oprește asta, dezactivează sau elimină KSnapUnity și fixarea KDE revine.","Soft":"Blândă","Spacing":"Spațiere","Spiral":"Spirală","Split side by side":"Împarte alăturat","Split top and bottom":"Împarte sus și jos","Stack + main":"Stivă + principal","Stick to other windows":"Lipește de alte ferestre","Stick to the screen edges":"Lipește de marginile ecranului","Sticky edges":"Margini lipicioase","Support KSnapUnity":"Susține KSnapUnity","Swap":"Schimbă","Swap windows":"Schimbarea ferestrelor","Swap with the window above":"Schimbă cu fereastra de deasupra","Swap with the window below":"Schimbă cu fereastra de dedesubt","Swap with the window on the left":"Schimbă cu fereastra din stânga","Swap with the window on the right":"Schimbă cu fereastra din dreapta","Switch mode":"Schimbă modul","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Schimbă modul (fixare / aranjare)","Switch modes with:":"Schimbă modul cu:","Switch the layout by itself":"Schimbă aranjamentul singur","Switched off":"Oprit","System":"Sistem","Take it over":"Preia-o","Take over all":"Preia-le pe toate","Take the main place":"Iau locul principal","Test animation":"Testează animația","Test on screen":"Testează pe ecran","Test the snap bar":"Testează bara de fixare","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Valorile implicite se bazează pe Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Acțiunile de fixare folosesc aceleași spații ca bara și rețin mărimea dinainte de fixare: „Restabilește mărimea dinainte de fixare” o readuce.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Aceste aplicații nu sunt niciodată aranjate și își păstrează locul. Dialogurile plutesc mereu.","Thirds":"Treimi","Three columns":"Trei coloane","Thumbnail width":"Lățimea miniaturilor","Tiling":"Aranjare","Tip":"Sfat","Top / bottom":"Sus / jos","Top edge":"Marginea de sus","Top edge: full screen":"Marginea de sus: ecran complet","Top edge: maximize":"Marginea de sus: maximizează","Top edge: top half":"Marginea de sus: jumătatea de sus","Top half":"Jumătatea de sus","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Distanța de declanșare față de marginea de sus","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Dezactivați dacă preferați conturul KDE – apoi dezactivați mai sus previzualizarea marginilor.","Two thirds":"Două treimi","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Două ferestre își schimbă locurile – lasă una peste cealaltă sau folosește tastele.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Două ferestre își schimbă locurile: lasă una peste cealaltă, sau cu o tastă.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Folosește scurtăturile de tastatură","Use screen edges":"Folosește marginile ecranului","Use the system accent color":"Folosește culoarea de accent a sistemului","Use the window magnet":"Folosește magnetul ferestrelor","Usual combinations":"Combinații uzuale","Version":"Versiune","Wanted for: %1":"Dorită pentru: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Când o fereastră se deschide, se închide sau se schimbă, celelalte se mișcă lin în loc să sară.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Când redimensionați o fereastră, ferestrele care o ating mută marginea comună odată cu ea – nimic nu se suprapune, nu apare niciun gol.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"În timpul redimensionării, ferestrele care nu urmează sunt afișate transparent.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Când muți sau redimensionezi o fereastră, marginile ei se lipesc de ferestrele apropiate și de marginile ecranului.","Width":"Lățime","Window":"Fereastră","Window magnet":"Magnetul ferestrelor","Window magnet on/off":"Magnetul ferestrelor pornit/oprit","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Ferestrele una peste alta își păstrează marginile stânga și dreapta împreună, cele alăturate marginile de sus și de jos.","Windows glide to their place":"Ferestrele alunecă la locul lor","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Ferestrele se lipesc între ele și de marginile ecranului.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Ferestrele se opresc la „Spațiu între ferestre” din pagina General în loc să se atingă.","Yes":"Da","Your own combination":"Combinația ta","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Aranjamentele tale și ordinea lor se vor pierde.","Zone %1":"Zona %1","for KWin · v%1":"pentru KWin · v%1","windows:":"ferestre:","“%1” will be removed.":"„%1” va fi eliminat.","…drag it onto window B…":"…trage-o peste fereastra B…","…in every direction":"…în orice direcție","…let go: they trade places":"…dă drumul: își schimbă locurile","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…vecinele cresc și se micșorează odată cu ea","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Gata – fă clic pe OK pentru a deschide editorul de setări."},"ru":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (копия)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 использует «%2».","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 из %2 зон","0 = all in one row":"0 = все в одной строке","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Режим 1</b><br/>Панель прилипания и края экрана","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Режим 2</b><br/>Автоматическая мозаика","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Единственное окно занимает весь экран, даже если отступ задан.","A new window joins":"Добавляется новое окно","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Короткий толчок даёт половину или четверть. Подержите окно у края чуть дольше, и оно вырастет до следующего окна – предпросмотр это покажет.","A single window":"Одно окно","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Окно останавливается у края другого, даже если двигать его быстро. Встряхните мышь или продолжайте давить мгновение, чтобы отпустить. 0 = окна могут свободно перекрываться.","About & Help":"О программе и справка","Accent color":"Акцентный цвет","Active":"Включено","Active mode":"Активный режим","Active width along the top edge":"Активная ширина вдоль верхнего края","Add an open application":"Добавить открытую программу","Add rule":"Добавить правило","All window features in one system.":"Все функции окон в одной системе.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Меняется и тогда, когда вы вручную меняете размер главного окна.","Also while resizing":"Также при изменении размера","Always floating":"Всегда свободные","Animation":"Анимация","Appearance":"Внешний вид","Apply":"Применить","Arrange windows":"Расстановка окон","Arrange windows automatically":"Расставлять окна автоматически","Author":"Автор","Automatic tiling":"Автоматическая мозаика","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Автоматическая мозаика выключена – работает только режим 1, клавиша режима ничего не делает.","Automatic tiling off":"Автоматическая мозаика выключена","Automatic tiling on":"Автоматическая мозаика включена","Automatic tiling on/off":"Автоматическая мозаика вкл./выкл.","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Автоматическая мозаика, обмен окон, комбинации клавиш и магнит для свободных окон.","Background opacity":"Непрозрачность фона","Behavior & Animation":"Поведение и анимация","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Нижний край: нижняя половина","Bouncy":"Пружинистая","Buy me a coffee":"Угостите меня кофе","Cancel":"Отмена","Center focus":"Фокус в центре","Center the window":"Окно по центру","Change":"Изменить","Change key":"Изменить клавишу","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Клавишу можно изменить в редакторе настроек. Обоим режимам нужны автоматическая мозаика и панель или края экрана.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Изменить их можно на странице «Комбинации клавиш». При автоматической мозаике окна также меняются местами в порядке.","Choose…":"Выбрать…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Щёлкните зону, чтобы выбрать её · двойной щелчок делит · перетаскивайте разделители","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Нажмите здесь или %1, чтобы переключить режим.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Нажмите, затем OK – откроется редактор настроек.","Close":"Закрыть","Close by, the edges stick together":"Рядом края прилипают","Color scheme":"Цветовая схема","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Цвета, размер и форма панели.","Columns":"Столбцы","Corner radius":"Радиус углов","Corner size":"Размер углов","Corner: a quarter":"Угол: четверть","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Углы: четверть экрана","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + клавиша (по умолчанию)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + цифровой блок","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + клавиша","Custom color":"Свой цвет","Custom layout %1":"Своя раскладка %1","Dark":"Тёмная","Delay before hiding":"Задержка перед скрытием","Delay before showing":"Задержка перед появлением","Delete":"Удалить","Delete layout?":"Удалить раскладку?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Расстояние, на котором появляется язычок","Distance before the bar hides again":"Расстояние, после которого панель снова скрывается","Distance to the edge":"Расстояние до края","Donate with PayPal":"Пожертвовать через PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"Тяните общий край…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Перетащите окно к краю…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Перетащите окно на другое, чтобы поменять их. Отпущенное на панели или у края экрана, оно свободно; «Освободить окно» возвращает его. Промежутки задаются на странице «Общие».","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Перетащите окно на середину другого – просмотр покажет две стрелки – и отпустите. При автоматической мозаике подойдёт любое место над другим окном.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Перетащите окно к верхнему краю экрана и отпустите его на зоне.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Перетаскивайте карточки, чтобы изменить порядок на панели. Дважды щёлкните карточку, чтобы изменить её.","Drop a window onto another one":"Бросить окно на другое","Drop the window onto a zone":"Отпустите окно на зоне","Duplicate":"Дублировать","Duration":"Длительность","Dwindle":"Спираль внутрь","Dynamic":"Динамичная","Edges and corners":"Края и углы","Edit":"Изменить","Edit layout":"Изменить раскладку","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Каждую функцию можно включать и выключать отдельно.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Каждая раскладка со страницы «Раскладки» может и расставлять окна – она появляется выше. Окно 1 занимает зону 1 и т. д.; лишние окна делят последнюю зону. Если окон меньше, чем зон, используется «Главное и стопка», чтобы не было дыр.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Каждое окно само находит своё место, как в мозаичном оконном менеджере.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Каждое окно само находит своё место на экране. Новые окна встают в ряд, закрытые освобождают место для остальных.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Пример: два окна рядом, с трёх – главное и стопка, с пяти – сетка. Без подходящего правила используется выбранная выше раскладка.","Fade in and out":"Плавное появление и исчезновение","Fade the other windows":"Приглушать остальные окна","Features":"Функции","Feel":"Ощущение","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Подстраиваться под уже прикреплённые окна","Fits the way you work.":"Подстраивается под ваш стиль работы.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Освободить окно (выйти из мозаики)","Four quarters":"Четыре четверти","From":"От","Fullscreen":"Полноэкранный режим","Gap between windows":"Отступ между окнами","Gap to the screen edge":"Отступ от края экрана","General":"Общие","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Снова назначает каждому действию клавишу выбранной схемы и удаляет клавиши, которых нет в схеме.","Good to know":"Полезно знать","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Возьмите окно за заголовок и потяните вверх. Панель опускается; отпустите окно на зоне — и оно займёт ровно эту область. Если снова вытащить его, оно вернёт прежний размер.","Grab window A…":"Возьмите окно A…","Grid":"Сетка","Halves":"Половины","Hiding":"Скрытие","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Удерживать у края, чтобы заполнить свободное место","Hold time":"Время удержания","Hold to fill":"Удерживать для заполнения","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Насколько близко должен подойти край, прежде чем встать на место.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Насколько близко к краю должен подойти указатель.","How far the bar slides down":"Насколько опускается панель","How it works":"Как это работает","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Сколько окно должно пробыть у края — небольшой толчок. 0 = сразу.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Сколько окно должно пробыть у края, прежде чем вырасти.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Сколько окон делят главную область (раскладка «Главное и стопка»).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Если внизу уже есть окно, верхний край даёт верхнюю половину вместо разворачивания. Половины и четверти тоже оставляют прикреплённые окна свободными.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Если вам нравится KSnapUnity, вы можете поддержать разработку – спасибо!","In bar":"На панели","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Не зависит от панели и краёв экрана.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Не зависит от панели. Каждый край включается отдельно.","Information":"Информация","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Интуитивное, естественное поведение окон.","Join at the end":"Встают в конец","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K – это KWin · Snap – это умное прилипание · Unity – это всё в одной системе","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"У KDE есть свои действия краёв экрана и своё прилипание окон. Если здесь включена та же функция, отключите функцию KDE: Параметры системы → Диспетчер окон → Края экрана, а также Поведение окон → Перемещение.","KDE's own edge tiling":"Собственная мозаика краёв KDE","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"Собственное разворачивание и мозаика KDE у краёв – с контуром – приостанавливаются, пока работает KSnapUnity, чтобы был только один просмотр. Настройки KDE не меняются: выключите это, отключите или удалите KSnapUnity, и поведение KDE вернётся.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"Собственные действия краёв экрана KDE ещё включены, поэтому на одно и то же перетаскивание реагируют два помощника. Отключите «Развернуть» и «Мозаика» в Параметры системы → Диспетчер окон → Края экрана.","KDE's own window snapping":"Собственная привязка окон KDE","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"Собственное прилипание окон KDE тоже включено. Для единообразия задайте его зонам значение «Нет» в Параметры системы → Диспетчер окон → Поведение окон → Перемещение.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Служба комбинаций клавиш KDE не ответила. Клавиши всё равно можно задать в Параметры системы → Комбинации клавиш → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – редактор настроек","Keep stacked windows in line":"Держать окна в столбце на одной линии","Keep the gap between windows":"Сохранять отступ между окнами","Keep them":"Оставить","Key scheme":"Схема клавиш","Keyboard shortcuts":"Комбинации клавиш","Keys":"Клавиши","Keys already in use":"Уже занятые клавиши","Layout":"Раскладка","Layout by number of windows":"Раскладка по числу окон","Layouts":"Раскладки","Layouts per row":"Раскладок в строке","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Левый и правый край: половина экрана","Left edge: left half":"Левый край: левая половина","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Меньше 100 % держит единственное окно по центру – удобно на широких экранах.","License":"Лицензия","Light":"Светлая","Linear":"Линейная","Live preview":"Живой просмотр","Load template…":"Загрузить шаблон…","Magnet":"Магнит","Main + stack":"Главное + стопка","Main and stack":"Главное и стопка","Main area bigger":"Главная область больше","Main area on the right":"Главная область справа","Main area smaller":"Главная область меньше","Main in the middle":"Главное в центре","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Главный переключатель для перетаскивания и клавиш.","Main window":"Главное окно","Main windows":"Главные окна","Main windows: %1":"Главных окон: %1","Make it the main window":"Сделать главным окном","Maximize":"Развернуть","Maximize or restore":"Развернуть или восстановить","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + клавиша (стиль KDE)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + клавиша","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + клавиша","Minimize":"Свернуть","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Отражает раскладку: главное окно справа, остальные слева.","Mode":"Режим","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Режим 1 – панель прилипания и края экрана","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Режим 2 – автоматическая мозаика","Modes":"Режимы","More ways":"Другие способы","Motion curve":"Кривая движения","Move a window towards others…":"Подвиньте окно к другим…","Move the window one place back":"Переместить окно на место назад","Move the window one place on":"Переместить окно на место вперёд","Name:":"Название:","New layout":"Новая раскладка","New windows":"Новые окна","Next tiling layout":"Следующая раскладка мозаики","Next to the active window":"Рядом с активным окном","No key":"Нет клавиши","No other window open":"Других открытых окон нет","No outer margin":"Без внешнего отступа","No shortcuts":"Без комбинаций","None":"Нет","None yet.":"Пока нет.","Off":"Выключено","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Выкл. = режим 1, вкл. = режим 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Выкл.: нейтральная рамка – только для включённых предпросмотров.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Выключено: клавиши остаются назначенными, но ничего не делают.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Выкл.: окна остаются там, куда вы их положили. Остальные функции работают в любом случае.","One at a time":"По одному","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Одно закрывается – остальные заполняют пробел","One main window less":"На одно главное окно меньше","One more main window":"На одно главное окно больше","One window":"Одно окно","Only one mode is switched on.":"Включён только один режим.","Open settings editor":"Открыть редактор настроек","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Сначала откройте программу, затем выберите её здесь.","Open the layout builder":"Открыть конструктор раскладок","Own layouts":"Свои раскладки","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Часть каждой стороны, которая считается углом.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Приостановить мозаику краёв KDE и её предпросмотр","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Приостанавливать зоны привязки KDE, пока магнит включён","Preview":"Предпросмотр","Previews":"Предпросмотр","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Прижмите окно к краю или углу экрана, и оно займёт эту часть. Работает с панелью и без неё.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Прижмите окно к краю или углу: развернуть, половины, четверти.","Push delay":"Задержка прижатия","Quarters":"Четверти","Quick":"Быстрая","Quick settings":"Быстрые настройки","Recommended values":"Рекомендуемые значения","Remove":"Удалить","Remove rule":"Удалить правило","Remove zone":"Удалить зону","Reset all":"Сбросить всё","Reset all keys":"Сбросить все клавиши","Reset to default":"Сбросить по умолчанию","Resistance against overlapping":"Сопротивление перекрытию","Resize touching windows together":"Менять размер соприкасающихся окон вместе","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Изменение размера тоже прилипает – здесь на всю высоту","Restore":"Восстановить","Restore default layouts":"Восстановить стандартные раскладки","Restore default layouts?":"Восстановить стандартные раскладки?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Восстанавливать исходный размер, когда окно вытаскивают","Restore the size before snapping":"Вернуть размер до прикрепления","Rows":"Строки","Save":"Сохранить","Screen edges":"Края экрана","Screen edges on/off":"Края экрана вкл./выкл.","Screen edges preview":"Предпросмотр краёв экрана","Set":"Задать","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Задаёт клавиши всех действий сразу. Отдельные клавиши можно по-прежнему менять ниже.","Settings":"Параметры","Settings file":"Файл настроек","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Во время изменения размера быстро встряхните мышь туда-сюда, и остальные окна вернутся. Быстрый рывок в одну сторону никогда их не отпускает.","Shake to let go":"Встряхнуть, чтобы отпустить","Shortcuts":"Комбинации","Show a small handle first":"Сначала показывать маленький язычок","Show layout and zone names":"Показывать названия раскладок и зон","Show previews in the accent color":"Показывать предпросмотр акцентным цветом","Showing":"Появление","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Показывает, куда попадёт окно у края или в углу. Выкл.: никакого предпросмотра.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Показывает, куда попадёт окно, пока зона панели выделена. Выкл.: никакого предпросмотра.","Sidebar + grid":"Боковая панель + сетка","Single zone":"Одна зона","Six tiles":"Шесть плиток","Size & shape":"Размер и форма","Size of the main area":"Размер главной области","Slide-in duration":"Длительность выезда","Slide-out duration":"Длительность скрытия","Smart arranging and detection.":"Умная раскладка и распознавание.","Smart fill":"Умное заполнение","Smooth (default)":"Плавная (по умолчанию)","Snap bar":"Панель прилипания","Snap bar and screen edges":"Панель прилипания и края экрана","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Панель и края выключены – работает только режим 2, клавиша режима ничего не делает.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Панель и края экрана мешают автоматической мозаике. Поэтому они работают как два режима – переключайте сочетанием клавиш или здесь.","Snap bar colors:":"Цвета панели:","Snap bar on/off":"Панель вкл./выкл.","Snap bar preview":"Предпросмотр панели привязки","Snap bar size":"Размер панели","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Панель прилипания, края экрана, магнит окон, комбинации клавиш и обмен окон.","Snap distance":"Расстояние прилипания","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Прилипание разделителей (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Раскладки прилипания и автоматическая мозаика.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Прикрепляйте активное окно сочетаниями клавиш.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Прикрепляйте активное окно с клавиатуры. Это обычные глобальные комбинации клавиш KDE — их также можно найти в Параметры системы → Комбинации клавиш → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Прикрепить к нижней половине","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Прикрепить к нижней левой четверти","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Прикрепить к нижней правой четверти","Snap to the center third":"Прикрепить к средней трети","Snap to the left half":"Прикрепить к левой половине","Snap to the left third":"Прикрепить к левой трети","Snap to the left two thirds":"Прикрепить к левым двум третям","Snap to the right half":"Прикрепить к правой половине","Snap to the right third":"Прикрепить к правой трети","Snap to the right two thirds":"Прикрепить к правым двум третям","Snap to the top half":"Прикрепить к верхней половине","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Прикрепить к верхней левой четверти","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Прикрепить к верхней правой четверти","Snapping":"Прилипание","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Прилипание и автоматическая мозаика работают как два режима – одна клавиша переключает между ними.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Так окно тянет только один магнит. Настройки KDE не меняются: выключите это, отключите или удалите KSnapUnity, и прилипание KDE вернётся.","Soft":"Мягкая","Spacing":"Отступы","Spiral":"Спираль","Split side by side":"Разделить рядом","Split top and bottom":"Разделить сверху и снизу","Stack + main":"Стопка + главное","Stick to other windows":"Прилипать к другим окнам","Stick to the screen edges":"Прилипать к краям экрана","Sticky edges":"Липкие края","Support KSnapUnity":"Поддержать KSnapUnity","Swap":"Обмен","Swap windows":"Обмен окон","Swap with the window above":"Поменять с окном сверху","Swap with the window below":"Поменять с окном снизу","Swap with the window on the left":"Поменять с окном слева","Swap with the window on the right":"Поменять с окном справа","Switch mode":"Переключить режим","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Переключить режим (прилипание / мозаика)","Switch modes with:":"Переключение режима:","Switch the layout by itself":"Менять раскладку самостоятельно","Switched off":"Выключено","System":"Системная","Take it over":"Забрать","Take over all":"Забрать все","Take the main place":"Занимают главное место","Test animation":"Проверить анимацию","Test on screen":"Проверить на экране","Test the snap bar":"Проверить панель","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Значения по умолчанию основаны на Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Действия прилипания используют те же отступы, что и панель, и запоминают размер до прикрепления: «Вернуть размер до прикрепления» восстанавливает его.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Эти программы никогда не расставляются и остаются на своём месте. Диалоги всегда свободные.","Thirds":"Трети","Three columns":"Три столбца","Thumbnail width":"Ширина миниатюр","Tiling":"Мозаика","Tip":"Совет","Top / bottom":"Сверху / снизу","Top edge":"Верхний край","Top edge: full screen":"Верхний край: на весь экран","Top edge: maximize":"Верхний край: развернуть","Top edge: top half":"Верхний край: верхняя половина","Top half":"Верхняя половина","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Расстояние срабатывания от верхнего края","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Выключите, если вам больше нравится контур KDE, – тогда выключите выше предпросмотр краёв экрана.","Two thirds":"Две трети","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Два окна меняются местами – отпустите одно на другое или используйте клавиши.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Два окна меняются местами: отпустите одно на другое или клавишей.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Использовать комбинации клавиш","Use screen edges":"Использовать края экрана","Use the system accent color":"Использовать системный акцентный цвет","Use the window magnet":"Использовать магнит окон","Usual combinations":"Обычные сочетания","Version":"Версия","Wanted for: %1":"Нужна для: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Когда окно открывается, закрывается или меняется, остальные двигаются плавно, а не прыгают.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Когда вы меняете размер окна, касающиеся его окна сдвигают общий край вместе с ним – ничего не перекрывается, щелей нет.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Во время изменения размера окна, которые не следуют, становятся прозрачными.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Пока вы перемещаете окно или меняете его размер, его края прилипают к соседним окнам и к краям экрана.","Width":"Ширина","Window":"Окно","Window magnet":"Магнит окон","Window magnet on/off":"Магнит окон вкл./выкл.","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Окна друг над другом держат левые и правые края вместе, окна рядом – верхние и нижние.","Windows glide to their place":"Окна плавно встают на место","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Окна прилипают друг к другу и к краям экрана.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Окна останавливаются на «Отступ между окнами» со страницы «Общие», а не касаются друг друга.","Yes":"Да","Your own combination":"Своё сочетание","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Ваши раскладки и их порядок будут потеряны.","Zone %1":"Зона %1","for KWin · v%1":"для KWin · v%1","windows:":"окон:","“%1” will be removed.":"«%1» будет удалена.","…drag it onto window B…":"…перетащите его на окно B…","…in every direction":"…в любом направлении","…let go: they trade places":"…отпустите: они меняются местами","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…соседи растут и уменьшаются вместе с ним","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Готово – нажмите OK, чтобы открыть редактор настроек."},"sk":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (kópia)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 používa „%2“.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 z %2 zón","0 = all in one row":"0 = všetky v jednom riadku","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Režim 1</b><br/>Lišta prichytávania a okraje obrazovky","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Režim 2</b><br/>Automatické dlaždicovanie","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Jediné okno zaberie celú obrazovku, aj keď je nastavený okraj.","A new window joins":"Pribudne nové okno","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Krátke postrčenie dá polovicu alebo štvrtinu. Podržte okno pri okraji o chvíľu dlhšie a zväčší sa až k ďalšiemu oknu – náhľad to ukáže.","A single window":"Jediné okno","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Okno sa zastaví na okraji iného, aj keď ním pohybuješ rýchlo. Zatras myšou alebo chvíľu ďalej tlač, aby sa uvoľnilo. 0 = okná sa môžu voľne prekrývať.","About & Help":"O aplikácii a pomocník","Accent color":"Farba zvýraznenia","Active":"Aktívne","Active mode":"Aktívny režim","Active width along the top edge":"Aktívna šírka pozdĺž horného okraja","Add an open application":"Pridať otvorenú aplikáciu","Add rule":"Pridať pravidlo","All window features in one system.":"Všetky funkcie okien v jednom systéme.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Mení sa aj vtedy, keď veľkosť hlavného okna zmeníš ručne.","Also while resizing":"Aj pri zmene veľkosti","Always floating":"Vždy plávajúce","Animation":"Animácia","Appearance":"Vzhľad","Apply":"Použiť","Arrange windows":"Usporiadať okná","Arrange windows automatically":"Usporiadať okná automaticky","Author":"Autor","Automatic tiling":"Automatické dlaždicovanie","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Automatické dlaždicovanie je vypnuté – beží len režim 1 a skratka režimu nič nerobí.","Automatic tiling off":"Automatické dlaždicovanie vypnuté","Automatic tiling on":"Automatické dlaždicovanie zapnuté","Automatic tiling on/off":"Automatické dlaždicovanie zap/vyp","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Automatické dlaždicovanie, výmena okien, skratky a magnet pre plávajúce okná.","Background opacity":"Nepriehľadnosť pozadia","Behavior & Animation":"Správanie a animácia","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Dolný okraj: dolná polovica","Bouncy":"Pružná","Buy me a coffee":"Kúp mi kávu","Cancel":"Zrušiť","Center focus":"Stred v strede","Center the window":"Vycentrovať okno","Change":"Zmeniť","Change key":"Zmeniť kláves","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Kláves zmeníte v editore nastavení. Oba režimy potrebujú automatické dlaždicovanie a lištu alebo okraje obrazovky.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Zmeníš ich na stránke Klávesové skratky. Pri automatickom dlaždicovaní si okná vymenia aj miesto v poradí.","Choose…":"Vyberte…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Kliknutím zónu vyberiete · dvojklikom ju rozdelíte · ťahajte oddeľovače","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Kliknite alebo stlačte %1 na prepnutie režimu.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Kliknite, potom OK – otvorí sa editor nastavení.","Close":"Zavrieť","Close by, the edges stick together":"Nablízku sa okraje prilepia","Color scheme":"Farebná schéma","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Farby, veľkosť a tvar lišty.","Columns":"Stĺpce","Corner radius":"Polomer rohov","Corner size":"Veľkosť rohov","Corner: a quarter":"Roh: štvrtina","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Rohy: štvrtina obrazovky","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + kláves (predvolené)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + numerická klávesnica","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + kláves","Custom color":"Vlastná farba","Custom layout %1":"Vlastné rozloženie %1","Dark":"Tmavá","Delay before hiding":"Oneskorenie pred skrytím","Delay before showing":"Oneskorenie pred zobrazením","Delete":"Odstrániť","Delete layout?":"Odstrániť rozloženie?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Vzdialenosť, pri ktorej sa objaví úchyt","Distance before the bar hides again":"Vzdialenosť, po ktorej sa lišta opäť skryje","Distance to the edge":"Vzdialenosť od okraja","Donate with PayPal":"Prispieť cez PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"Ťahajte spoločný okraj…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Potiahnite okno k okraju…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Pretiahnite okno na iné a vymenia sa. Pustené na lištu alebo okraj obrazovky voľne pláva; „Nechať okno plávať“ ho vráti. Medzery sú na stránke Všeobecné.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Pretiahnite okno nad stred iného – náhľad ukáže dve šípky – a pustite. Pri automatickom dlaždicovaní stačí kdekoľvek nad druhým oknom.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Potiahnite okno k hornému okraju obrazovky a pustite ho na zónu.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Potiahnutím kariet zmeníte poradie v lište. Dvojklikom na kartu ju upravíte.","Drop a window onto another one":"Pustiť okno na iné","Drop the window onto a zone":"Pustite okno na zónu","Duplicate":"Duplikovať","Duration":"Trvanie","Dwindle":"Špirála dovnútra","Dynamic":"Dynamická","Edges and corners":"Okraje a rohy","Edit":"Upraviť","Edit layout":"Upraviť rozloženie","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Každú funkciu možno zapnúť a vypnúť samostatne.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Každé rozloženie zo stránky Rozloženia vie aj usporiadať okná – zobrazí sa vyššie. Okno 1 dostane zónu 1 atď.; ďalšie okná zdieľajú poslednú zónu. Pri menšom počte okien než zón sa použije „Hlavné a zásobník“, aby nevznikli diery.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Každé okno si samo nájde svoje miesto, ako v dlaždicovom správcovi okien.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Každé okno si samo nájde miesto na obrazovke. Nové okná sa pridajú, zatvorené uvoľnia miesto ostatným.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Príklad: dve okná vedľa seba, od troch hlavné a zásobník, od piatich mriežka. Bez vhodného pravidla platí rozloženie zvolené vyššie.","Fade in and out":"Prelínanie pri zobrazení a skrytí","Fade the other windows":"Stlmiť ostatné okná","Features":"Funkcie","Feel":"Pocit","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Prispôsobiť sa už prichyteným oknám","Fits the way you work.":"Prispôsobí sa vášmu spôsobu práce.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Nechať okno plávať (opustiť dlaždicovanie)","Four quarters":"Štyri štvrtiny","From":"Od","Fullscreen":"Celá obrazovka","Gap between windows":"Medzera medzi oknami","Gap to the screen edge":"Medzera od okraja obrazovky","General":"Všeobecné","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Dá každej akcii znova kláves zvolenej schémy a odstráni klávesy, ktoré schéma nemá.","Good to know":"Dobré vedieť","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Chyťte okno za titulkový pruh a ťahajte ho nahor. Lišta zíde nadol; pustite okno na zónu a vyplní presne túto oblasť. Keď ho znova odtiahnete, získa späť pôvodnú veľkosť.","Grab window A…":"Chyťte okno A…","Grid":"Mriežka","Halves":"Polovice","Hiding":"Skrytie","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Podržať pri okraji na vyplnenie voľného miesta","Hold time":"Čas podržania","Hold to fill":"Podržať na vyplnenie","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Ako blízko sa musí okraj dostať, kým zacvakne.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Ako blízko k okraju sa musí dostať kurzor.","How far the bar slides down":"Ako ďaleko lišta zíde nadol","How it works":"Ako to funguje","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Ako dlho musí okno zostať pri okraji – malé postrčenie. 0 = hneď.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Ako dlho musí okno zostať pri okraji, kým sa zväčší.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Koľko okien zdieľa hlavnú oblasť (rozloženie „Hlavné a zásobník“).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Ak je dole už okno, horný okraj dá hornú polovicu namiesto maximalizácie. Polovice a štvrtiny tiež nechajú prichytené okná voľné.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Ak sa vám KSnapUnity páči, môžete podporiť jeho vývoj – ďakujeme!","In bar":"V lište","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Nezávislý od lišty prichytávania a okrajov obrazovky.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Nezávislé od lišty prichytávania. Každý okraj sa dá zapnúť samostatne.","Information":"Informácie","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Intuitívne, prirodzené správanie okien.","Join at the end":"Pridajú sa na koniec","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K ako KWin · Snap ako šikovnejšie prichytávanie · Unity ako všetko v jednom systéme","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE má vlastné akcie okrajov obrazovky a vlastné prichytávanie okien. Ak je tu zapnutá rovnaká funkcia, vypnite tú v KDE: Nastavenia systému → Správa okien → Okraje obrazovky a Správanie okien → Presun.","KDE's own edge tiling":"Vlastné dlaždicovanie okrajov KDE","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"Vlastná maximalizácia a dlaždicovanie KDE na okrajoch – s obrysom – sa pozastavia, kým beží KSnapUnity, aby bol len jeden náhľad. Nastavenia KDE sa nemenia: vypnite to, deaktivujte alebo odstráňte KSnapUnity a správanie KDE sa vráti.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"Vlastné akcie okrajov obrazovky v KDE sú stále zapnuté, takže na rovnaké ťahanie reagujú dvaja pomocníci. Vypnite „Maximalizovať“ a „Dlaždice“ v Nastavenia systému → Správa okien → Okraje obrazovky.","KDE's own window snapping":"Vlastné prichytávanie okien KDE","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"Vlastné prichytávanie okien v KDE je tiež zapnuté. Pre jednotný pocit nastavte jeho zóny na „Žiadna“ v Nastavenia systému → Správa okien → Správanie okien → Presun.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Služba skratiek KDE neodpovedala. Klávesy môžete stále nastaviť v Nastavenia systému → Skratky → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – editor nastavení","Keep stacked windows in line":"Držať okná nad sebou v jednej línii","Keep the gap between windows":"Zachovať medzeru medzi oknami","Keep them":"Ponechať","Key scheme":"Schéma klávesov","Keyboard shortcuts":"Klávesové skratky","Keys":"Klávesy","Keys already in use":"Už použité klávesy","Layout":"Rozloženie","Layout by number of windows":"Rozloženie podľa počtu okien","Layouts":"Rozloženia","Layouts per row":"Rozloženia na riadok","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Ľavý a pravý okraj: polovica obrazovky","Left edge: left half":"Ľavý okraj: ľavá polovica","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Pod 100 % zostane jediné okno v strede – pekné na širokých obrazovkách.","License":"Licencia","Light":"Svetlá","Linear":"Lineárna","Live preview":"Živý náhľad","Load template…":"Načítať šablónu…","Main + stack":"Hlavné + kôpka","Main and stack":"Hlavné a zásobník","Main area bigger":"Väčšia hlavná oblasť","Main area on the right":"Hlavná oblasť vpravo","Main area smaller":"Menšia hlavná oblasť","Main in the middle":"Hlavné v strede","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Hlavný vypínač pre ťahanie a klávesy.","Main window":"Hlavné okno","Main windows":"Hlavné okná","Main windows: %1":"Hlavné okná: %1","Make it the main window":"Urobiť hlavným oknom","Maximize":"Maximalizovať","Maximize or restore":"Maximalizovať alebo obnoviť","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + kláves (štýl KDE)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + kláves","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + kláves","Minimize":"Minimalizovať","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Zrkadlí rozloženie: hlavné okno vpravo, ostatné vľavo.","Mode":"Režim","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Režim 1 – lišta prichytávania a okraje obrazovky","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Režim 2 – automatické dlaždicovanie","Modes":"Režimy","More ways":"Ďalšie spôsoby","Motion curve":"Krivka pohybu","Move a window towards others…":"Posuňte okno k ostatným…","Move the window one place back":"Posunúť okno o miesto späť","Move the window one place on":"Posunúť okno o miesto ďalej","Name:":"Názov:","New layout":"Nové rozloženie","New windows":"Nové okná","Next tiling layout":"Ďalšie rozloženie dlaždíc","Next to the active window":"Vedľa aktívneho okna","No key":"Žiadny kláves","No other window open":"Žiadne iné okno nie je otvorené","No outer margin":"Bez vonkajšieho okraja","No shortcuts":"Bez skratiek","None":"Žiadna","None yet.":"Zatiaľ žiadne.","Off":"Vypnuté","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Vyp = režim 1, zap = režim 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Vypnuté: neutrálny rámik – len pre zapnuté náhľady.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Vypnuté: klávesy zostanú priradené, ale nič nerobia.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Vypnuté: okná zostanú tam, kam ich položíš. Ostatné funkcie fungujú tak či tak.","One at a time":"Jedno po druhom","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Jedno sa zavrie – ostatné vyplnia medzeru","One main window less":"O jedno hlavné okno menej","One more main window":"O jedno hlavné okno viac","One window":"Jedno okno","Only one mode is switched on.":"Zapnutý je len jeden režim.","Open settings editor":"Otvoriť editor nastavení","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Najprv aplikáciu otvorte, potom ju vyberte tu.","Open the layout builder":"Otvoriť tvorcu rozložení","Own layouts":"Vlastné rozloženia","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Časť každej strany, ktorá sa počíta ako roh.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Pozastaviť dlaždicovanie okrajov KDE a jeho náhľad","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Pozastaviť zóny prichytenia KDE, kým je magnet zapnutý","Preview":"Náhľad","Previews":"Náhľady","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Pritlačte okno k okraju alebo rohu obrazovky a vyplní túto časť. Funguje s lištou prichytávania aj bez nej.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Pritlačte okno k okraju alebo rohu: maximalizácia, polovice, štvrtiny.","Push delay":"Oneskorenie pritlačenia","Quarters":"Štvrtiny","Quick":"Rýchla","Quick settings":"Rýchle nastavenia","Recommended values":"Odporúčané hodnoty","Remove":"Odstrániť","Remove rule":"Odstrániť pravidlo","Remove zone":"Odstrániť zónu","Reset all":"Obnoviť všetko","Reset all keys":"Obnoviť všetky klávesy","Reset to default":"Obnoviť predvolené","Resistance against overlapping":"Odpor proti prekrývaniu","Resize touching windows together":"Meniť veľkosť dotýkajúcich sa okien spoločne","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Prichytáva aj zmena veľkosti – tu na plnú výšku","Restore":"Obnoviť","Restore default layouts":"Obnoviť predvolené rozloženia","Restore default layouts?":"Obnoviť predvolené rozloženia?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Obnoviť pôvodnú veľkosť pri vytiahnutí okna","Restore the size before snapping":"Obnoviť veľkosť pred prichytením","Rows":"Riadky","Save":"Uložiť","Screen edges":"Okraje obrazovky","Screen edges on/off":"Okraje obrazovky zap./vyp.","Screen edges preview":"Náhľad okrajov obrazovky","Set":"Nastaviť","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Nastaví klávesy všetkých akcií naraz. Jednotlivé klávesy môžete ďalej meniť nižšie.","Settings":"Nastavenia","Settings file":"Súbor nastavení","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Pri zmene veľkosti rýchlo zatras myšou sem a tam a ostatné okná skočia späť. Rýchle trhnutie jedným smerom ich nikdy neuvoľní.","Shake to let go":"Zatriasť na uvoľnenie","Shortcuts":"Skratky","Show a small handle first":"Najprv zobraziť malý úchyt","Show layout and zone names":"Zobraziť názvy rozložení a zón","Show previews in the accent color":"Zobrazovať náhľady vo farbe zvýraznenia","Showing":"Zobrazenie","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Ukazuje, kam okno dopadne pri okraji alebo v rohu. Vypnuté: žiadny náhľad.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Ukazuje, kam okno dopadne, kým je zóna lišty zvýraznená. Vypnuté: žiadny náhľad.","Sidebar + grid":"Bočný panel + mriežka","Single zone":"Jedna zóna","Six tiles":"Šesť dlaždíc","Size & shape":"Veľkosť a tvar","Size of the main area":"Veľkosť hlavnej oblasti","Slide-in duration":"Trvanie vysunutia","Slide-out duration":"Trvanie zasunutia","Smart arranging and detection.":"Inteligentné usporiadanie a rozpoznávanie.","Smart fill":"Inteligentné vyplnenie","Smooth (default)":"Plynulá (predvolená)","Snap bar":"Lišta prichytávania","Snap bar and screen edges":"Lišta prichytávania a okraje obrazovky","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Lišta a okraje sú vypnuté – beží len režim 2 a skratka režimu nič nerobí.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Lišta a okraje obrazovky prekážajú automatickému dlaždicovaniu. Preto bežia ako dva režimy – prepínajte skratkou alebo tu.","Snap bar colors:":"Farby lišty:","Snap bar on/off":"Lišta prichytávania zap./vyp.","Snap bar preview":"Náhľad lišty prichytávania","Snap bar size":"Veľkosť lišty","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Lišta prichytávania, okraje obrazovky, magnet okien, skratky a výmena okien.","Snap distance":"Vzdialenosť prichytenia","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Prichytávať oddeľovače (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Rozloženia prichytávania a automatické dlaždicovanie.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Prichyťte aktívne okno kombináciou klávesov.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Prichyťte aktívne okno klávesnicou. Sú to bežné globálne skratky KDE – nájdete ich aj v Nastavenia systému → Skratky → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Prichytiť do dolnej polovice","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Prichytiť do ľavej dolnej štvrtiny","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Prichytiť do pravej dolnej štvrtiny","Snap to the center third":"Prichytiť do strednej tretiny","Snap to the left half":"Prichytiť do ľavej polovice","Snap to the left third":"Prichytiť do ľavej tretiny","Snap to the left two thirds":"Prichytiť do ľavých dvoch tretín","Snap to the right half":"Prichytiť do pravej polovice","Snap to the right third":"Prichytiť do pravej tretiny","Snap to the right two thirds":"Prichytiť do pravých dvoch tretín","Snap to the top half":"Prichytiť do hornej polovice","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Prichytiť do ľavej hornej štvrtiny","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Prichytiť do pravej hornej štvrtiny","Snapping":"Prichytávanie","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Prichytávanie a automatické dlaždicovanie bežia ako dva režimy – jedna skratka medzi nimi prepína.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Okno tak ťahá len jeden magnet. Nastavenia KDE sa nemenia: vypnite to, deaktivujte alebo odstráňte KSnapUnity a prichytávanie KDE sa vráti.","Soft":"Jemná","Spacing":"Medzery","Spiral":"Špirála","Split side by side":"Rozdeliť vedľa seba","Split top and bottom":"Rozdeliť hore a dole","Stack + main":"Kôpka + hlavné","Stick to other windows":"Prichytávať k ostatným oknám","Stick to the screen edges":"Prichytávať k okrajom obrazovky","Sticky edges":"Lepivé okraje","Support KSnapUnity":"Podporte KSnapUnity","Swap":"Vymeniť","Swap windows":"Vymeniť okná","Swap with the window above":"Vymeniť s oknom hore","Swap with the window below":"Vymeniť s oknom dole","Swap with the window on the left":"Vymeniť s oknom vľavo","Swap with the window on the right":"Vymeniť s oknom vpravo","Switch mode":"Prepnúť režim","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Prepnúť režim (prichytávanie / dlaždice)","Switch modes with:":"Prepnúť režim pomocou:","Switch the layout by itself":"Meniť rozloženie samo","Switched off":"Vypnuté","System":"Systém","Take it over":"Prevziať","Take over all":"Prevziať všetky","Take the main place":"Zoberú hlavné miesto","Test animation":"Vyskúšať animáciu","Test on screen":"Vyskúšať na obrazovke","Test the snap bar":"Vyskúšať lištu prichytávania","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Predvolené hodnoty vychádzajú z Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Akcie prichytávania používajú rovnaké medzery ako lišta a pamätajú si veľkosť pred prichytením: „Obnoviť veľkosť pred prichytením“ ju vráti.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Tieto aplikácie sa nikdy neusporiadajú a držia si svoje miesto. Dialógy plávajú vždy.","Thirds":"Tretiny","Three columns":"Tri stĺpce","Thumbnail width":"Šírka náhľadov","Tiling":"Dlaždicovanie","Top / bottom":"Hore / dole","Top edge":"Horný okraj","Top edge: full screen":"Horný okraj: celá obrazovka","Top edge: maximize":"Horný okraj: maximalizovať","Top edge: top half":"Horný okraj: horná polovica","Top half":"Horná polovica","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Vzdialenosť aktivácie od horného okraja","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Vypnite, ak uprednostňujete obrys KDE – potom hore vypnite náhľad okrajov obrazovky.","Two thirds":"Dve tretiny","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Dve okná si vymenia miesta – pustite jedno na druhé alebo použite klávesy.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Dve okná si vymenia miesta: pustite jedno na druhé, alebo klávesom.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Používať klávesové skratky","Use screen edges":"Používať okraje obrazovky","Use the system accent color":"Použiť systémovú farbu zvýraznenia","Use the window magnet":"Používať magnet okien","Usual combinations":"Bežné kombinácie","Version":"Verzia","Wanted for: %1":"Požadované pre: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Keď sa okno otvorí, zavrie alebo vymení, ostatné sa pohnú plynulo namiesto skoku.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Keď meníte veľkosť okna, okná, ktoré sa ho dotýkajú, posúvajú spoločný okraj s ním – nič sa neprekrýva, nevzniká medzera.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Počas zmeny veľkosti sú okná, ktoré nenasledujú, priehľadné.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Pri presune alebo zmene veľkosti okna sa jeho okraje prichytávajú k okolitým oknám a k okrajom obrazovky.","Width":"Šírka","Window":"Okno","Window magnet":"Magnet okien","Window magnet on/off":"Magnet okien zap./vyp.","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Okná nad sebou držia ľavé a pravé okraje spolu, okná vedľa seba horné a dolné.","Windows glide to their place":"Okná plynulo kĺžu na miesto","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Okná sa prichytávajú k sebe navzájom a k okrajom obrazovky.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Okná sa zastavia na „Medzere medzi oknami“ zo stránky Všeobecné namiesto toho, aby sa dotýkali.","Yes":"Áno","Your own combination":"Vlastná kombinácia","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Vaše vlastné rozloženia a ich poradie sa stratia.","Zone %1":"Zóna %1","for KWin · v%1":"pre KWin · v%1","windows:":"okien:","“%1” will be removed.":"„%1“ bude odstránené.","…drag it onto window B…":"…pretiahnite ho na okno B…","…in every direction":"…vo všetkých smeroch","…let go: they trade places":"…pustite: vymenia si miesta","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…susedia rastú a zmenšujú sa s ním","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Pripravené – kliknite na OK a otvorí sa editor nastavení."},"sl":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (kopija)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 uporablja »%2«.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 od %2 območij","0 = all in one row":"0 = vse v eni vrstici","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Način 1</b><br/>Vrstica za pripenjanje in robovi zaslona","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Način 2</b><br/>Samodejno tlakovanje","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Samotno okno uporabi cel zaslon, tudi če je rob nastavljen.","A new window joins":"Pridruži se novo okno","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Kratek potisk da polovico ali četrtino. Pridržite okno ob robu malo dlje in zraste do naslednjega okna – predogled to pokaže.","A single window":"Eno samo okno","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Okno se ustavi ob robu drugega, tudi če ga premikaš hitro. Stresi miško ali še malo potiskaj, da se sprosti. 0 = okna se lahko prosto prekrivajo.","About & Help":"O programu in pomoč","Accent color":"Poudarna barva","Active":"Dejavno","Active mode":"Dejavni način","Active width along the top edge":"Dejavna širina vzdolž zgornjega roba","Add an open application":"Dodaj odprt program","Add rule":"Dodaj pravilo","All window features in one system.":"Vse funkcije oken v enem sistemu.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Spremeni se tudi, ko velikost glavnega okna spremeniš ročno.","Also while resizing":"Tudi pri spreminjanju velikosti","Always floating":"Vedno plavajoča","Animation":"Animacija","Appearance":"Videz","Apply":"Uveljavi","Arrange windows":"Razporedi okna","Arrange windows automatically":"Samodejno razporedi okna","Author":"Avtor","Automatic tiling":"Samodejno tlakovanje","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Samodejno tlakovanje je izklopljeno – deluje le način 1 in bližnjica za način ne naredi ničesar.","Automatic tiling off":"Samodejno tlakovanje izklopljeno","Automatic tiling on":"Samodejno tlakovanje vklopljeno","Automatic tiling on/off":"Samodejno tlakovanje vklop/izklop","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Samodejno tlakovanje, zamenjava oken, bližnjice in magnet za plavajoča okna.","Background opacity":"Prekrivnost ozadja","Behavior & Animation":"Obnašanje in animacija","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Spodnji rob: spodnja polovica","Bouncy":"Prožna","Buy me a coffee":"Kupi mi kavo","Cancel":"Prekliči","Center focus":"Poudarek na sredini","Center the window":"Postavi okno na sredino","Change":"Spremeni","Change key":"Spremeni tipko","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Tipko spremenite v urejevalniku nastavitev. Oba načina potrebujeta samodejno tlakovanje ter vrstico ali robove zaslona.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Spremeniš jih na strani Tipkovne bližnjice. Pri samodejnem tlakovanju okna zamenjata tudi mesto v vrstnem redu.","Choose…":"Izberite…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Kliknite območje za izbor · dvoklik ga razdeli · vlecite ločilnike","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Kliknite ali pritisnite %1 za preklop načina.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Kliknite, nato V redu – odpre se urejevalnik nastavitev.","Close":"Zapri","Close by, the edges stick together":"Blizu se robovi zlepijo","Color scheme":"Barvna shema","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Barve, velikost in oblika vrstice.","Columns":"Stolpci","Corner radius":"Polmer vogalov","Corner size":"Velikost kotov","Corner: a quarter":"Kot: četrtina","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Koti: četrtina zaslona","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + tipka (privzeto)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + številčnica","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + tipka","Custom color":"Barva po meri","Custom layout %1":"Razporeditev po meri %1","Dark":"Temna","Delay before hiding":"Zakasnitev pred skritjem","Delay before showing":"Zakasnitev pred prikazom","Delete":"Izbriši","Delete layout?":"Izbrišem razporeditev?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Razdalja, pri kateri se pokaže ročaj","Distance before the bar hides again":"Razdalja, po kateri se vrstica spet skrije","Distance to the edge":"Razdalja do roba","Donate with PayPal":"Donirajte s PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"Povlecite skupni rob…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Povlecite okno ob rob…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Povlecite okno na drugo, da ju zamenjate. Spuščeno na vrstico ali rob zaslona prosto plava; »Naj okno lebdi« ga vrne. Razmiki so na strani Splošno.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Povlecite okno nad sredino drugega – predogled pokaže dve puščici – in izpustite. Pri samodejnem tlakovanju zadošča kjerkoli nad drugim oknom.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Povlecite okno k zgornjemu robu zaslona in ga spustite na območje.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Vlecite kartice, da spremenite vrstni red v vrstici. Dvokliknite kartico, da jo uredite.","Drop a window onto another one":"Spusti okno na drugo","Drop the window onto a zone":"Spustite okno na območje","Duplicate":"Podvoji","Duration":"Trajanje","Dwindle":"Spirala navznoter","Dynamic":"Dinamična","Edges and corners":"Robovi in koti","Edit":"Uredi","Edit layout":"Uredi razporeditev","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Vsako funkcijo lahko vklopiš in izklopiš posebej.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Vsaka razporeditev s strani Razporeditve lahko tudi razporeja okna – prikaže se zgoraj. Okno 1 dobi območje 1 in tako naprej; dodatna okna si delijo zadnje območje. Pri manj oknih kot območjih se uporabi »Glavno in sklad«, da ne nastanejo luknje.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Vsako okno samo najde svoje mesto, kot v tlakovnem upravljalniku oken.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Vsako okno samo najde svoje mesto na zaslonu. Nova okna se pridružijo, zaprta naredijo prostor drugim.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Primer: dve okni drugo ob drugem, od treh glavno in sklad, od petih mreža. Brez ustreznega pravila velja zgoraj izbrana razporeditev.","Fade in and out":"Pojemanje ob prikazu in skritju","Fade the other windows":"Zatemni druga okna","Features":"Funkcije","Feel":"Občutek","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Prilagodi se že pripetim oknom","Fits the way you work.":"Prilagodi se vašemu načinu dela.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Naj okno lebdi (zapusti tlakovanje)","Four quarters":"Štiri četrtine","From":"Od","Fullscreen":"Celozaslonsko","Gap between windows":"Razmik med okni","Gap to the screen edge":"Razmik do roba zaslona","General":"Splošno","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Vsakemu dejanju znova dodeli tipko izbrane sheme in odstrani tipke, ki jih shema nima.","Good to know":"Dobro je vedeti","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Primite okno za naslovno vrstico in ga povlecite navzgor. Vrstica se spusti; spustite okno na območje in zapolni natanko ta prostor. Ko ga znova izvlečete, dobi nazaj prejšnjo velikost.","Grab window A…":"Primite okno A…","Grid":"Mreža","Halves":"Polovici","Hiding":"Skrivanje","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Pridrži ob robu za zapolnitev prostega prostora","Hold time":"Čas pridržanja","Hold to fill":"Pridrži za zapolnitev","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Kako blizu mora priti rob, preden se zaskoči.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Kako blizu roba mora priti kazalec.","How far the bar slides down":"Kako nizko se vrstica spusti","How it works":"Kako deluje","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Kako dolgo mora okno ležati ob robu – majhen sunek. 0 = takoj.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Kako dolgo mora okno ostati ob robu, preden zraste.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Koliko oken si deli glavno območje (postavitev »Glavno in sklad«).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Če je spodaj že okno, zgornji rob da zgornjo polovico namesto razpetja. Tudi polovice in četrtine pustijo pripeta okna prosta.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Če vam je KSnapUnity všeč, lahko podprete njegov razvoj – hvala!","In bar":"V vrstici","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Neodvisno od vrstice in robov zaslona.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Neodvisno od vrstice. Vsak rob lahko vklopite posebej.","Information":"Podatki","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Intuitivno, naravno vedenje oken.","Join at the end":"Pridružijo se na koncu","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K kot KWin · Snap kot pametnejše pripenjanje · Unity kot vse v enem sistemu","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE ima lastna dejanja robov zaslona in lastno pripenjanje oken. Če je tukaj vklopljena ista funkcija, izklopite KDE-jevo: Sistemske nastavitve → Upravljanje oken → Robovi zaslona ter Vedenje oken → Premikanje.","KDE's own edge tiling":"KDE-jevo lastno tlakovanje robov","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"KDE-jevo lastno razpenjanje in tlakovanje ob robovih – z obrisom – je ustavljeno, dokler deluje KSnapUnity, da se prikaže le en predogled. Vaše nastavitve KDE se ne spremenijo: izklopite to, onemogočite ali odstranite KSnapUnity in vedenje KDE se vrne.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"KDE-jeva lastna dejanja robov zaslona so še vklopljena, zato se na isto vlečenje odzivata dva pomočnika. Izklopite »Razpni« in »Tlakuj« v Sistemske nastavitve → Upravljanje oken → Robovi zaslona.","KDE's own window snapping":"KDE-jevo lastno pripenjanje oken","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"Tudi KDE-jevo lastno pripenjanje oken je vklopljeno. Za enoten občutek nastavite njegove cone na »Brez« v Sistemske nastavitve → Upravljanje oken → Vedenje oken → Premikanje.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Storitev bližnjic KDE se ni odzvala. Tipke lahko še vedno nastavite v Sistemske nastavitve → Bližnjice → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – urejevalnik nastavitev","Keep stacked windows in line":"Zložena okna naj ostanejo v liniji","Keep the gap between windows":"Ohrani razmik med okni","Keep them":"Obdrži","Key scheme":"Shema tipk","Keyboard shortcuts":"Tipkovne bližnjice","Keys":"Tipke","Keys already in use":"Že uporabljene tipke","Layout":"Postavitev","Layout by number of windows":"Razporeditev glede na število oken","Layouts":"Razporeditve","Layouts per row":"Razporeditev na vrstico","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Levi in desni rob: polovica zaslona","Left edge: left half":"Levi rob: leva polovica","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Pod 100 % ostane samotno okno na sredini – lepo na širokih zaslonih.","License":"Licenca","Light":"Svetla","Linear":"Linearna","Live preview":"Predogled v živo","Load template…":"Naloži predlogo…","Main + stack":"Glavno + kup","Main and stack":"Glavno in sklad","Main area bigger":"Večje glavno območje","Main area on the right":"Glavno območje desno","Main area smaller":"Manjše glavno območje","Main in the middle":"Glavno na sredini","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Glavno stikalo za vlečenje in tipke.","Main window":"Glavno okno","Main windows":"Glavna okna","Main windows: %1":"Glavna okna: %1","Make it the main window":"Naredi za glavno okno","Maximize":"Razpni","Maximize or restore":"Razpni ali obnovi","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + tipka (slog KDE)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + tipka","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + tipka","Minimize":"Pomanjšaj","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Zrcali razporeditev: glavno okno desno, druga levo.","Mode":"Način","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Način 1 – vrstica za pripenjanje in robovi zaslona","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Način 2 – samodejno tlakovanje","Modes":"Načini","More ways":"Več načinov","Motion curve":"Krivulja gibanja","Move a window towards others…":"Premaknite okno k drugim…","Move the window one place back":"Premakni okno za mesto nazaj","Move the window one place on":"Premakni okno za mesto naprej","Name:":"Ime:","New layout":"Nova razporeditev","New windows":"Nova okna","Next tiling layout":"Naslednja postavitev tlakovanja","Next to the active window":"Ob dejavnem oknu","No key":"Brez tipke","No other window open":"Nobeno drugo okno ni odprto","No outer margin":"Brez zunanjega roba","No shortcuts":"Brez bližnjic","None":"Brez","None yet.":"Še nobenega.","Off":"Izklopljeno","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Izklop = način 1, vklop = način 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Izklopljeno: nevtralen okvir – samo za vklopljene predoglede.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Izklopljeno: tipke ostanejo dodeljene, a ne naredijo ničesar.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Izklopljeno: okna ostanejo tam, kamor jih postaviš. Druge funkcije delujejo vseeno.","One at a time":"Eno naenkrat","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Eno se zapre – druga zapolnijo vrzel","One main window less":"Eno glavno okno manj","One more main window":"Eno glavno okno več","One window":"Eno okno","Only one mode is switched on.":"Vklopljen je le en način.","Open settings editor":"Odpri urejevalnik nastavitev","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Najprej odprite program, nato ga izberite tukaj.","Open the layout builder":"Odpri graditelja razporeditev","Own layouts":"Lastne razporeditve","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Del vsake stranice, ki šteje kot kot.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Začasno ustavi KDE-jevo tlakovanje robov in njegov predogled","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Začasno ustavi KDE-jeva območja pripenjanja, ko je magnet vklopljen","Preview":"Predogled","Previews":"Predogledi","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Potisnite okno ob rob ali kot zaslona in zapolni ta del. Deluje z vrstico ali brez nje.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Potisnite okno ob rob ali kot: razpni, polovice, četrtine.","Push delay":"Zakasnitev pritiska","Quarters":"Četrtine","Quick":"Hitra","Quick settings":"Hitre nastavitve","Recommended values":"Priporočene vrednosti","Remove":"Odstrani","Remove rule":"Odstrani pravilo","Remove zone":"Odstrani območje","Reset all":"Ponastavi vse","Reset all keys":"Ponastavi vse tipke","Reset to default":"Ponastavi na privzeto","Resistance against overlapping":"Upor proti prekrivanju","Resize touching windows together":"Skupaj spreminjaj velikost oken, ki se dotikajo","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Tudi spreminjanje velikosti se pripne – tu do polne višine","Restore":"Obnovi","Restore default layouts":"Obnovi privzete razporeditve","Restore default layouts?":"Obnovim privzete razporeditve?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Obnovi prvotno velikost, ko okno izvlečete","Restore the size before snapping":"Obnovi velikost pred pripenjanjem","Rows":"Vrstice","Save":"Shrani","Screen edges":"Robovi zaslona","Screen edges on/off":"Robovi zaslona vklop/izklop","Screen edges preview":"Predogled robov zaslona","Set":"Nastavi","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Nastavi tipke vseh dejanj hkrati. Posamezne tipke lahko še vedno spremenite spodaj.","Settings":"Nastavitve","Settings file":"Datoteka nastavitev","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Med spreminjanjem velikosti hitro stresi miško sem in tja in druga okna skočijo nazaj. Hiter poteg v eno smer jih nikoli ne sprosti.","Shake to let go":"Stresite za sprostitev","Shortcuts":"Bližnjice","Show a small handle first":"Najprej pokaži majhen ročaj","Show layout and zone names":"Pokaži imena razporeditev in območij","Show previews in the accent color":"Prikaži predoglede v poudarni barvi","Showing":"Prikaz","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Pokaže, kam pristane okno ob robu ali v kotu. Izklopljeno: brez predogleda.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Pokaže, kam pristane okno, medtem ko je območje vrstice poudarjeno. Izklopljeno: brez predogleda.","Sidebar + grid":"Stranska vrstica + mreža","Single zone":"Eno območje","Six tiles":"Šest ploščic","Size & shape":"Velikost in oblika","Size of the main area":"Velikost glavnega območja","Slide-in duration":"Trajanje spusta","Slide-out duration":"Trajanje dviga","Smart arranging and detection.":"Pametno razporejanje in prepoznavanje.","Smart fill":"Pametno zapolnjevanje","Smooth (default)":"Gladka (privzeta)","Snap bar":"Vrstica za pripenjanje","Snap bar and screen edges":"Vrstica za pripenjanje in robovi zaslona","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Vrstica in robovi so izklopljeni – deluje le način 2 in bližnjica za način ne naredi ničesar.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Vrstica in robovi zaslona motijo samodejno tlakovanje. Zato delujejo kot dva načina – preklopite z bližnjico ali tukaj.","Snap bar colors:":"Barve vrstice:","Snap bar on/off":"Vrstica vklop/izklop","Snap bar preview":"Predogled vrstice za pripenjanje","Snap bar size":"Velikost vrstice","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Vrstica za pripenjanje, robovi zaslona, magnet oken, bližnjice in zamenjava oken.","Snap distance":"Razdalja pripenjanja","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Pripenjaj ločilnike (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Razporeditve za pripenjanje in samodejno tlakovanje.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Pripnite dejavno okno s kombinacijami tipk.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Pripnite dejavno okno s tipkovnico. To so običajne globalne bližnjice KDE – najdete jih tudi v Sistemske nastavitve → Bližnjice → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Pripni v spodnjo polovico","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Pripni v spodnjo levo četrtino","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Pripni v spodnjo desno četrtino","Snap to the center third":"Pripni v srednjo tretjino","Snap to the left half":"Pripni v levo polovico","Snap to the left third":"Pripni v levo tretjino","Snap to the left two thirds":"Pripni v levi dve tretjini","Snap to the right half":"Pripni v desno polovico","Snap to the right third":"Pripni v desno tretjino","Snap to the right two thirds":"Pripni v desni dve tretjini","Snap to the top half":"Pripni v zgornjo polovico","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Pripni v zgornjo levo četrtino","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Pripni v zgornjo desno četrtino","Snapping":"Pripenjanje","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Pripenjanje in samodejno tlakovanje delujeta kot dva načina – ena bližnjica preklaplja med njima.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Tako okno vleče le en magnet. Vaše nastavitve KDE se ne spremenijo: izklopite to, onemogočite ali odstranite KSnapUnity in pripenjanje KDE se vrne.","Soft":"Mehka","Spacing":"Razmiki","Spiral":"Spirala","Split side by side":"Razdeli drug ob drugem","Split top and bottom":"Razdeli zgoraj in spodaj","Stack + main":"Kup + glavno","Stick to other windows":"Lepi se na druga okna","Stick to the screen edges":"Lepi se na robove zaslona","Sticky edges":"Lepljivi robovi","Support KSnapUnity":"Podprite KSnapUnity","Swap":"Zamenjaj","Swap windows":"Zamenjaj okna","Swap with the window above":"Zamenjaj z oknom zgoraj","Swap with the window below":"Zamenjaj z oknom spodaj","Swap with the window on the left":"Zamenjaj z oknom na levi","Swap with the window on the right":"Zamenjaj z oknom na desni","Switch mode":"Preklopi način","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Preklopi način (pripenjanje / tlakovanje)","Switch modes with:":"Preklop načina s:","Switch the layout by itself":"Sama menjaj razporeditev","Switched off":"Izklopljeno","System":"Sistemska","Take it over":"Prevzemi","Take over all":"Prevzemi vse","Take the main place":"Zasedejo glavno mesto","Test animation":"Preizkusi animacijo","Test on screen":"Preizkusi na zaslonu","Test the snap bar":"Preizkusi vrstico","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Privzete vrednosti temeljijo na Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Dejanja pripenjanja uporabljajo enake razmike kot vrstica in si zapomnijo velikost pred pripenjanjem: »Obnovi velikost pred pripenjanjem« jo vrne.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Ti programi se nikoli ne razporejajo in obdržijo svoje mesto. Pogovorna okna vedno plavajo.","Thirds":"Tretjine","Three columns":"Trije stolpci","Thumbnail width":"Širina sličic","Tiling":"Tlakovanje","Tip":"Namig","Top / bottom":"Zgoraj / spodaj","Top edge":"Zgornji rob","Top edge: full screen":"Zgornji rob: celoten zaslon","Top edge: maximize":"Zgornji rob: razpni","Top edge: top half":"Zgornji rob: zgornja polovica","Top half":"Zgornja polovica","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Razdalja sprožitve od zgornjega roba","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Izklopite, če vam je ljubši KDE-jev obris – nato zgoraj izklopite predogled robov zaslona.","Two thirds":"Dve tretjini","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Dve okni zamenjata mesti – spustite eno na drugo ali uporabite tipke.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Dve okni zamenjata mesti: spustite eno na drugo ali s tipko.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Uporabljaj tipkovne bližnjice","Use screen edges":"Uporabljaj robove zaslona","Use the system accent color":"Uporabi sistemsko poudarno barvo","Use the window magnet":"Uporabljaj magnet oken","Usual combinations":"Običajne kombinacije","Version":"Različica","Wanted for: %1":"Želeno za: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Ko se okno odpre, zapre ali zamenja, se druga premaknejo gladko namesto skokovito.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Ko spremenite velikost okna, okna, ki se ga dotikajo, premaknejo skupni rob z njim – nič se ne prekriva, ne nastane reža.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Med spreminjanjem velikosti so okna, ki ne sledijo, prosojna.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Medtem ko okno premikate ali mu spreminjate velikost, se njegovi robovi lepijo na bližnja okna in na robove zaslona.","Width":"Širina","Window":"Okno","Window magnet":"Magnet oken","Window magnet on/off":"Magnet oken vklop/izklop","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Okna drugo nad drugim držijo leve in desne robove skupaj, okna drugo ob drugem zgornje in spodnje.","Windows glide to their place":"Okna gladko zdrsnejo na mesto","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Okna se lepijo drugo na drugo in na robove zaslona.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Okna se ustavijo pri »Razmik med okni« s strani Splošno, namesto da bi se dotikala.","Yes":"Da","Your own combination":"Vaša kombinacija","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Vaše razporeditve in njihov vrstni red bodo izgubljeni.","Zone %1":"Območje %1","for KWin · v%1":"za KWin · v%1","windows:":"oken:","“%1” will be removed.":"»%1« bo odstranjena.","…drag it onto window B…":"…povlecite ga na okno B…","…in every direction":"…v vse smeri","…let go: they trade places":"…izpustite: zamenjata mesti","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…sosedi rastejo in se krčijo z njim","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Pripravljeno – kliknite V redu, da se odpre urejevalnik nastavitev."},"sq":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (kopje)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 përdoret nga „%2”.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 nga %2 zona","0 = all in one row":"0 = të gjitha në një rresht","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Mënyra 1</b><br/>Shiriti i ngjitjes dhe skajet e ekranit","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Mënyra 2</b><br/>Rregullim automatik","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Dritarja e vetme përdor gjithë ekranin, edhe kur është caktuar diferencë.","A new window joins":"Shtohet një dritare e re","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Një shtytje e shkurtër jep gjysmën ose çerekun. Mbajeni dritaren pak më gjatë në skaj dhe ajo rritet deri te dritarja tjetër – pamja paraprake e tregon.","A single window":"Një dritare e vetme","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Një dritare ndalon në skajin e një tjetre, edhe kur e lëviz shpejt. Tunde miun ose vazhdo të shtysh edhe një çast për ta lëshuar. 0 = dritaret mund të mbivendosen lirisht.","About & Help":"Rreth dhe ndihmë","Accent color":"Ngjyra theksuese","Active":"Aktiv","Active mode":"Mënyra aktive","Active width along the top edge":"Gjerësia aktive përgjatë buzës së sipërme","Add an open application":"Shto një aplikacion të hapur","Add rule":"Shto rregull","All window features in one system.":"Të gjitha veçoritë e dritareve në një sistem.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Ndryshon edhe kur e ndryshon me dorë madhësinë e dritares kryesore.","Also while resizing":"Edhe gjatë ripërmasimit","Always floating":"Gjithmonë pluskuese","Animation":"Animacioni","Appearance":"Pamja","Apply":"Zbato","Arrange windows":"Rregullimi i dritareve","Arrange windows automatically":"Rregullo dritaret automatikisht","Author":"Autori","Automatic tiling":"Rregullim automatik","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Rregullimi automatik është fikur – punon vetëm mënyra 1 dhe shkurtorja e mënyrës nuk bën asgjë.","Automatic tiling off":"Rregullimi automatik fikur","Automatic tiling on":"Rregullimi automatik ndezur","Automatic tiling on/off":"Rregullimi automatik ndez/fik","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Rregullim automatik, ndërrimi i dritareve, shkurtoret dhe magneti për dritaret pluskuese.","Background opacity":"Patejdukshmëria e sfondit","Behavior & Animation":"Sjellja dhe animacioni","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Skaji i poshtëm: gjysma e poshtme","Bouncy":"Kërcyese","Buy me a coffee":"Më bli një kafe","Cancel":"Anulo","Center focus":"Fokus në qendër","Center the window":"Vendose dritaren në qendër","Change":"Ndrysho","Change key":"Ndrysho tastin","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Tasti ndryshohet te redaktori i rregullimeve. Të dyja mënyrat kërkojnë rregullimin automatik dhe shiritin ose skajet e ekranit.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Ndryshoji te faqja Shkurtoret e tastierës. Me rregullimin automatik, dritaret ndërrojnë edhe vendin në radhë.","Choose…":"Zgjidh…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Klikoni një zonë për ta përzgjedhur · klikim i dyfishtë e ndan · tërhiqni ndarëset","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Kliko ose shtyp %1 për të ndërruar mënyrën.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Kliko, pastaj OK – hapet redaktori i rregullimeve.","Close":"Mbyll","Close by, the edges stick together":"Afër, skajet ngjiten","Color scheme":"Skema e ngjyrave","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Ngjyrat, madhësia dhe forma e shiritit.","Columns":"Kolona","Corner radius":"Rrezja e qosheve","Corner size":"Madhësia e cepave","Corner: a quarter":"Qoshja: një çerek","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Cepat: çereku i ekranit","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + tast (parazgjedhje)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + blloku numerik","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + tast","Custom color":"Ngjyrë e zgjedhur","Custom layout %1":"Skemë vetjake %1","Dark":"E errët","Delay before hiding":"Vonesa para fshehjes","Delay before showing":"Vonesa para shfaqjes","Delete":"Fshi","Delete layout?":"Ta fshij skemën?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Largësia ku shfaqet doreza","Distance before the bar hides again":"Largësia pas së cilës shiriti fshihet sërish","Distance to the edge":"Largësia nga skaji","Donate with PayPal":"Dhuro me PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"Tërhiq një skaj të përbashkët…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Tërhiq një dritare drejt një skaji…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Tërhiq një dritare mbi një tjetër për t’i ndërruar. Nëse e lëshon në shirit ose skaj ekrani, pluskon e lirë; „Lëre dritaren të pluskojë“ e kthen. Hapësirat vijnë nga faqja Të përgjithshme.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Tërhiq një dritare mbi mesin e një tjetre – paraparja tregon dy shigjeta – dhe lëshoje. Me rregullim automatik mjafton kudo mbi dritaren tjetër.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Tërhiqni një dritare te buza e sipërme e ekranit dhe lëshojeni mbi një zonë.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Tërhiqni kartat për të ndryshuar renditjen në shirit. Klikoni dy herë mbi një kartë për ta përpunuar.","Drop a window onto another one":"Lësho një dritare mbi një tjetër","Drop the window onto a zone":"Lëshojeni dritaren mbi një zonë","Duplicate":"Dyfisho","Duration":"Kohëzgjatja","Dwindle":"Spirale nga brenda","Dynamic":"Dinamike","Edges and corners":"Skaje dhe cepa","Edit":"Përpuno","Edit layout":"Përpuno skemën","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Çdo funksion mund të ndizet dhe fiket më vete.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Çdo skemë që ndërton në faqen Skemat mund të rregullojë edhe dritare – shfaqet më lart. Dritarja 1 merr zonën 1 e kështu me radhë; dritaret e tepërta ndajnë zonën e fundit. Me më pak dritare se zona përdoret „Kryesore dhe stivë“, që të mos mbeten vrima.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Çdo dritare gjen vetë vendin e saj, si në një menaxhues dritaresh me pllaka.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Çdo dritare gjen vetë vendin e saj në ekran. Dritaret e reja bashkohen, ato të mbyllurat u lënë vend të tjerave.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Shembull: dy dritare krah për krah, nga tre kryesore dhe stivë, nga pesë rrjetë. Pa rregull të përshtatshëm vlen skema e zgjedhur më lart.","Fade in and out":"Zbehje në shfaqje dhe zhdukje","Fade the other windows":"Zbeh dritaret e tjera","Features":"Veçori","Feel":"Ndjesia","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Përshtatu me dritaret tashmë të ngjitura","Fits the way you work.":"Përshtatet me mënyrën si punon.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Lëre dritaren të pluskojë (dil nga pllakat)","Four quarters":"Katër çerekë","From":"Nga","Fullscreen":"Ekran i plotë","Gap between windows":"Hapësira mes dritareve","Gap to the screen edge":"Hapësira deri te buza e ekranit","General":"Të përgjithshme","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"I jep sërish çdo veprimi tastin e skemës së zgjedhur dhe heq tastet që skema nuk i ka.","Good to know":"Mirë të dihet","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Kapni një dritare nga shiriti i titullit dhe tërhiqeni lart. Shiriti zbret; lëshojeni dritaren mbi një zonë dhe ajo mbush saktësisht atë hapësirë. Kur e tërhiqni sërish jashtë, merr përsëri madhësinë e vjetër.","Grab window A…":"Kap dritaren A…","Grid":"Rrjetë","Halves":"Gjysma","Hiding":"Fshehja","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Mbaj në skaj për të mbushur hapësirën e lirë","Hold time":"Koha e mbajtjes","Hold to fill":"Mbaj për ta mbushur","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Sa afër duhet të vijë një skaj para se të kërcejë në vend.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Sa afër skajit duhet të vijë kursori.","How far the bar slides down":"Sa poshtë rrëshqet shiriti","How it works":"Si funksionon","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Sa gjatë duhet të qëndrojë dritarja pranë skajit – një shtytje e vogël. 0 = menjëherë.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Sa gjatë duhet të qëndrojë dritarja në skaj para se të rritet.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Sa dritare ndajnë zonën kryesore (paraqitja “Kryesore dhe stivë”).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Nëse poshtë ka tashmë një dritare, skaji i sipërm jep gjysmën e sipërme në vend që të maksimizojë. Edhe gjysmat dhe çerekët i lënë të lira dritaret e ngjitura.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Nëse të pëlqen KSnapUnity, mund të mbështesësh zhvillimin e tij – faleminderit!","In bar":"Në shirit","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"I pavarur nga shiriti dhe skajet e ekranit.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"I pavarur nga shiriti. Çdo skaj ndizet më vete.","Information":"Informacion","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Sjellje intuitive dhe e natyrshme e dritareve.","Join at the end":"Shtohen në fund","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K për KWin · Snap për ngjitje më të zgjuar · Unity për gjithçka në një sistem","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE ka veprimet e veta për skajet e ekranit dhe ngjitjen e vet të dritareve. Nëse e njëjta veçori është ndezur këtu, fikni atë të KDE-së: Rregullime sistemi → Administrim dritaresh → Skajet e ekranit, dhe Sjellje dritaresh → Lëvizje.","KDE's own edge tiling":"Shtrimi në skaje i vetë KDE","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"Maksimizimi dhe pllakëzimi i vetë KDE-së në skaje – me konturin e tij – pushojnë sa kohë punon KSnapUnity, që të shfaqet vetëm një paraparje. Rregullimet e KDE-së nuk ndryshojnë: fike këtë, çaktivizo ose hiq KSnapUnity dhe sjellja e KDE-së kthehet.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"Veprimet e KDE-së për skajet e ekranit janë ende të ndezura, prandaj dy ndihmës reagojnë ndaj të njëjtës tërheqje. Fikni „Maksimizo” dhe „Pllakëzo” te Rregullime sistemi → Administrim dritaresh → Skajet e ekranit.","KDE's own window snapping":"Ngjitja e dritareve e vetë KDE","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"Edhe ngjitja e dritareve e vetë KDE-së është ndezur. Për një ndjesi të njëtrajtshme, vendosni zonat e saj në „Asnjë” te Rregullime sistemi → Administrim dritaresh → Sjellje dritaresh → Lëvizje.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Shërbimi i shkurtoreve të KDE-së nuk u përgjigj. Tastet mund t’i caktoni ende te Rregullime sistemi → Shkurtore → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – Redaktori i rregullimeve","Keep stacked windows in line":"Mbaji dritaret e mbivendosura në një vijë","Keep the gap between windows":"Ruaj hapësirën mes dritareve","Keep them":"Mbaji","Key scheme":"Skema e tasteve","Keyboard shortcuts":"Shkurtore tastiere","Keys":"Tastet","Keys already in use":"Taste që përdoren tashmë","Layout":"Paraqitja","Layout by number of windows":"Skema sipas numrit të dritareve","Layouts":"Skemat","Layouts per row":"Skema për rresht","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Skaji i majtë dhe i djathtë: gjysma e ekranit","Left edge: left half":"Skaji i majtë: gjysma e majtë","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Nën 100 % dritarja e vetme qëndron në mes – bukur në ekrane të gjera.","License":"Licenca","Light":"E çelët","Linear":"Lineare","Live preview":"Paraparje e drejtpërdrejtë","Load template…":"Ngarko model…","Main + stack":"Kryesore + grumbull","Main and stack":"Kryesore dhe stivë","Main area bigger":"Zonë kryesore më e madhe","Main area on the right":"Zona kryesore djathtas","Main area smaller":"Zonë kryesore më e vogël","Main in the middle":"Kryesore në mes","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Çelësi kryesor për tërheqjen dhe tastet.","Main window":"Dritarja kryesore","Main windows":"Dritaret kryesore","Main windows: %1":"Dritare kryesore: %1","Make it the main window":"Bëje dritare kryesore","Maximize":"Maksimizo","Maximize or restore":"Maksimizo ose rikthe","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + tast (stil KDE)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + tast","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + tast","Minimize":"Minimizo","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Pasqyron skemën: dritarja kryesore djathtas, të tjerat majtas.","Mode":"Mënyra","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Mënyra 1 – Shiriti i ngjitjes dhe skajet e ekranit","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Mënyra 2 – Rregullim automatik","Modes":"Mënyrat","More ways":"Më shumë mënyra","Motion curve":"Lakorja e lëvizjes","Move a window towards others…":"Afroje një dritare te të tjerat…","Move the window one place back":"Lëvize dritaren një vend prapa","Move the window one place on":"Lëvize dritaren një vend përpara","Name:":"Emri:","New layout":"Skemë e re","New windows":"Dritare të reja","Next tiling layout":"Paraqitja tjetër","Next to the active window":"Pranë dritares aktive","No key":"Pa tast","No other window open":"Asnjë dritare tjetër e hapur","No outer margin":"Pa diferencë të jashtme","No shortcuts":"Pa shkurtore","None":"Asnjë","None yet.":"Ende asnjë.","Off":"Fikur","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Fikur = mënyra 1, ndezur = mënyra 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Joaktive: një kornizë neutrale – vetëm për pamjet paraprake të aktivizuara.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Fikur: tastet mbeten të caktuara, por nuk bëjnë asgjë.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Fikur: dritaret mbeten ku i vendos. Funksionet e tjera punojnë gjithsesi.","One at a time":"Një nga një","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Një mbyllet – të tjerat mbushin boshllëkun","One main window less":"Një dritare kryesore më pak","One more main window":"Edhe një dritare kryesore","One window":"Një dritare","Only one mode is switched on.":"Vetëm një mënyrë është e ndezur.","Open settings editor":"Hap redaktorin e rregullimeve","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Hap fillimisht aplikacionin, pastaj zgjidhe këtu.","Open the layout builder":"Hap ndërtuesin e skemave","Own layouts":"Skema të vetat","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Pjesa e çdo ane që llogaritet si cep.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Ndalo përkohësisht shtrimin në skaje të KDE dhe pamjen e tij","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Ndalo përkohësisht zonat e ngjitjes së KDE ndërsa magneti është aktiv","Preview":"Paraparje","Previews":"Parapamje","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Shtyjeni një dritare drejt një skaji ose cepi të ekranit dhe ajo e mbush atë pjesë. Punon me ose pa shiritin.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Shtyjeni një dritare drejt një skaji ose cepi: maksimizo, gjysma, çerekë.","Push delay":"Vonesa e shtytjes","Quarters":"Çerekë","Quick":"E shpejtë","Quick settings":"Rregullime të shpejta","Recommended values":"Vlera të rekomanduara","Remove":"Hiq","Remove rule":"Hiq rregullin","Remove zone":"Hiq zonën","Reset all":"Rivendos të gjitha","Reset all keys":"Rivendos të gjithë tastet","Reset to default":"Rikthe parazgjedhjen","Resistance against overlapping":"Rezistencë ndaj mbivendosjes","Resize touching windows together":"Ndrysho madhësinë e dritareve që preken së bashku","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Edhe ndryshimi i madhësisë ngjitet – këtu në lartësi të plotë","Restore":"Rikthe","Restore default layouts":"Rikthe skemat parazgjedhje","Restore default layouts?":"T’i rikthej skemat parazgjedhje?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Rikthe madhësinë fillestare kur dritarja nxirret jashtë","Restore the size before snapping":"Rikthe madhësinë para ngjitjes","Rows":"Rreshta","Save":"Ruaje","Screen edges":"Skajet e ekranit","Screen edges on/off":"Skajet e ekranit ndez/fik","Screen edges preview":"Pamja paraprake e skajeve të ekranit","Set":"Cakto","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Cakton tastet e të gjitha veprimeve njëherësh. Taste të veçanta mund t’i ndryshoni ende më poshtë.","Settings":"Cilësimet","Settings file":"Kartela e rregullimeve","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Gjatë ndryshimit të madhësisë tunde shpejt miun para-mbrapa dhe dritaret e tjera kthehen mbrapsht. Një tërheqje e shpejtë në një drejtim nuk i lëshon kurrë.","Shake to let go":"Shkundni për ta lëshuar","Shortcuts":"Shkurtore","Show a small handle first":"Shfaq fillimisht një dorezë të vogël","Show layout and zone names":"Shfaq emrat e skemave dhe zonave","Show previews in the accent color":"Shfaq parapamjet me ngjyrën theksuese","Showing":"Shfaqja","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Tregon ku do të vendoset dritarja në një skaj ose kënd. Joaktive: asnjë pamje paraprake.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Tregon ku do të vendoset dritarja ndërsa një zonë e shiritit është e theksuar. Joaktive: asnjë pamje paraprake.","Sidebar + grid":"Anështyllë + rrjetë","Single zone":"Një zonë","Six tiles":"Gjashtë pllaka","Size & shape":"Madhësia dhe forma","Size of the main area":"Madhësia e zonës kryesore","Slide-in duration":"Kohëzgjatja e zbritjes","Slide-out duration":"Kohëzgjatja e ngjitjes","Smart arranging and detection.":"Renditje dhe dallim i zgjuar.","Smart fill":"Mbushje e zgjuar","Smooth (default)":"E butë (parazgjedhje)","Snap bar":"Shiriti i ngjitjes","Snap bar and screen edges":"Shiriti i ngjitjes dhe skajet e ekranit","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Shiriti dhe skajet janë fikur – punon vetëm mënyra 2 dhe shkurtorja e mënyrës nuk bën asgjë.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Shiriti dhe skajet e ekranit pengojnë rregullimin automatik. Prandaj punojnë si dy mënyra – ndërro me shkurtoren ose këtu.","Snap bar colors:":"Ngjyrat e shiritit:","Snap bar on/off":"Shiriti ndez/fik","Snap bar preview":"Pamja paraprake e shiritit të ngjitjes","Snap bar size":"Madhësia e shiritit","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Shiriti i ngjitjes, skajet e ekranit, magneti i dritareve, shkurtoret dhe ndërrimi i dritareve.","Snap distance":"Largësia e ngjitjes","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Ngjit ndarëset (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Skema ngjitjeje dhe rregullim automatik.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Ngjiteni dritaren aktive me kombinime tastesh.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Ngjiteni dritaren aktive me tastierë. Këto janë shkurtore të zakonshme globale të KDE-së – i gjeni edhe te Rregullime sistemi → Shkurtore → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Ngjite në gjysmën e poshtme","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Ngjite në çerekun poshtë majtas","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Ngjite në çerekun poshtë djathtas","Snap to the center third":"Ngjite në të tretën e mesit","Snap to the left half":"Ngjite në gjysmën e majtë","Snap to the left third":"Ngjite në të tretën e majtë","Snap to the left two thirds":"Ngjite në dy të tretat e majta","Snap to the right half":"Ngjite në gjysmën e djathtë","Snap to the right third":"Ngjite në të tretën e djathtë","Snap to the right two thirds":"Ngjite në dy të tretat e djathta","Snap to the top half":"Ngjite në gjysmën e sipërme","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Ngjite në çerekun lart majtas","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Ngjite në çerekun lart djathtas","Snapping":"Ngjitja","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Ngjitja dhe rregullimi automatik punojnë si dy mënyra – një shkurtore ndërron mes tyre.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Kështu vetëm një magnet tërheq dritaren. Rregullimet e KDE-së nuk ndryshojnë: fike këtë, çaktivizo ose hiq KSnapUnity dhe ngjitja e KDE-së kthehet.","Soft":"E qetë","Spacing":"Hapësirat","Spiral":"Spirale","Split side by side":"Ndaj krah për krah","Split top and bottom":"Ndaj lart dhe poshtë","Stack + main":"Grumbull + kryesore","Stick to other windows":"Ngjitu me dritare të tjera","Stick to the screen edges":"Ngjitu me skajet e ekranit","Sticky edges":"Skaje ngjitëse","Support KSnapUnity":"Mbështet KSnapUnity","Swap":"Ndërro","Swap windows":"Ndërrimi i dritareve","Swap with the window above":"Ndërro me dritaren sipër","Swap with the window below":"Ndërro me dritaren poshtë","Swap with the window on the left":"Ndërro me dritaren majtas","Swap with the window on the right":"Ndërro me dritaren djathtas","Switch mode":"Ndërro mënyrën","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Ndërro mënyrën (ngjitje / pllaka)","Switch modes with:":"Ndërro mënyrën me:","Switch the layout by itself":"Ndërro skemën vetë","Switched off":"Fikur","System":"Sistemi","Take it over":"Merre","Take over all":"Merri të gjitha","Take the main place":"Marrin vendin kryesor","Test animation":"Provo animacionin","Test on screen":"Provo në ekran","Test the snap bar":"Provo shiritin","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Vlerat parazgjedhje bazohen te Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Veprimet e ngjitjes përdorin të njëjtat hapësira si shiriti dhe mbajnë mend madhësinë para ngjitjes: „Rikthe madhësinë para ngjitjes” e sjell mbrapsht.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Këto aplikacione nuk rregullohen kurrë dhe e mbajnë vendin e tyre. Dialogët pluskojnë gjithmonë.","Thirds":"Të treta","Three columns":"Tri shtylla","Thumbnail width":"Gjerësia e miniaturave","Tiling":"Pllaka","Tip":"Këshillë","Top / bottom":"Lart / poshtë","Top edge":"Skaji i sipërm","Top edge: full screen":"Skaji i sipërm: ekran i plotë","Top edge: maximize":"Skaji i sipërm: maksimizo","Top edge: top half":"Skaji i sipërm: gjysma e sipërme","Top half":"Gjysma e sipërme","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Largësia e aktivizimit nga buza e sipërme","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Çaktivizojeni nëse preferoni konturin e KDE – pastaj çaktivizoni më sipër pamjen e skajeve.","Two thirds":"Dy të tretat","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Dy dritare ndërrojnë vendet – lësho njërën mbi tjetrën ose përdor tastet.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Dy dritare ndërrojnë vendet: lësho njërën mbi tjetrën, ose me tast.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Përdor shkurtore tastiere","Use screen edges":"Përdor skajet e ekranit","Use the system accent color":"Përdor ngjyrën theksuese të sistemit","Use the window magnet":"Përdor magnetin e dritareve","Usual combinations":"Kombinime të zakonshme","Version":"Versioni","Wanted for: %1":"E dëshiruar për: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Kur një dritare hapet, mbyllet ose ndërrohet, të tjerat lëvizin butë në vend që të kërcejnë.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Kur ndryshoni madhësinë e një dritareje, dritaret që e prekin lëvizin skajin e përbashkët me të – asgjë nuk mbivendoset, nuk hapet boshllëk.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Gjatë ndryshimit të madhësisë, dritaret që nuk ndjekin shfaqen të tejdukshme.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Ndërsa lëvizni ose ripërmasoni një dritare, skajet e saj ngjiten me dritaret pranë dhe me skajet e ekranit.","Width":"Gjerësia","Window":"Dritare","Window magnet":"Magneti i dritareve","Window magnet on/off":"Magneti i dritareve ndez/fik","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Dritaret njëra mbi tjetrën mbajnë skajet majtas dhe djathtas bashkë, dritaret krah për krah ato sipër dhe poshtë.","Windows glide to their place":"Dritaret rrëshqasin në vend","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Dritaret ngjiten me njëra-tjetrën dhe me skajet e ekranit.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Dritaret ndalen te „Hapësira mes dritareve” nga faqja Të përgjithshme në vend që të prekin njëra-tjetrën.","Yes":"Po","Your own combination":"Kombinimi juaj","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Skemat tuaja dhe renditja e tyre do të humbasin.","Zone %1":"Zona %1","for KWin · v%1":"për KWin · v%1","windows:":"dritare:","“%1” will be removed.":"“%1” do të hiqet.","…drag it onto window B…":"…tërhiqe mbi dritaren B…","…in every direction":"…në çdo drejtim","…let go: they trade places":"…lëshoje: ndërrojnë vendet","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…fqinjët rriten e tkurren bashkë me të","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Gati – kliko OK për të hapur redaktorin e rregullimeve."},"sr":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (копија)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 користи „%2”.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 од %2 зона","0 = all in one row":"0 = сви у једном реду","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Режим 1</b><br/>Трака за качење и ивице екрана","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Режим 2</b><br/>Аутоматско поплочавање","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Самостални прозор заузима цео екран, чак и уз задату маргину.","A new window joins":"Придружује се нови прозор","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Кратко гурање даје половину или четвртину. Задржите прозор уз ивицу мало дуже и нарасте до следећег прозора – преглед то показује.","A single window":"Један прозор","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Прозор се зауставља на ивици другог, и кад га брзо помераш. Протреси миш или гурај још тренутак да га пустиш. 0 = прозори смеју слободно да се преклапају.","About & Help":"О програму и помоћ","Accent color":"Боја истицања","Active":"Активно","Active mode":"Активан режим","Active width along the top edge":"Активна ширина дуж горње ивице","Add an open application":"Додај отворен програм","Add rule":"Додај правило","All window features in one system.":"Све функције прозора у једном систему.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Мења се и кад ручно промениш величину главног прозора.","Also while resizing":"И при промени величине","Always floating":"Увек слободни","Animation":"Анимација","Appearance":"Изглед","Apply":"Примени","Arrange windows":"Распоређивање прозора","Arrange windows automatically":"Аутоматски распореди прозоре","Author":"Аутор","Automatic tiling":"Аутоматско поплочавање","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Аутоматско поплочавање је искључено – ради само режим 1, а пречица режима не ради ништа.","Automatic tiling off":"Аутоматско поплочавање искључено","Automatic tiling on":"Аутоматско поплочавање укључено","Automatic tiling on/off":"Аутоматско поплочавање укљ./искљ.","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Аутоматско поплочавање, замена прозора, пречице и магнет за слободне прозоре.","Background opacity":"Непрозирност позадине","Behavior & Animation":"Понашање и анимација","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Доња ивица: доња половина","Bouncy":"Еластична","Buy me a coffee":"Частите ме кафом","Cancel":"Откажи","Center focus":"Фокус у средини","Center the window":"Центрирај прозор","Change":"Промени","Change key":"Промени тастер","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Тастер мењате у уређивачу подешавања. Оба режима траже аутоматско поплочавање и траку или ивице екрана.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Промени их на страници Пречице на тастатури. Уз аутоматско поплочавање прозори мењају и место у редоследу.","Choose…":"Изаберите…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Кликните на зону да је изаберете · двоклик је дели · превлачите разделнике","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Кликните или притисните %1 за промену режима.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Кликните, па У реду – отвара се уређивач подешавања.","Close":"Затвори","Close by, the edges stick together":"Изблиза се ивице лепе","Color scheme":"Шема боја","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Боје, величина и облик траке.","Columns":"Колоне","Corner radius":"Полупречник углова","Corner size":"Величина углова","Corner: a quarter":"Угао: четвртина","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Углови: четвртина екрана","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + тастер (подразумевано)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + нумерички блок","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + тастер","Custom color":"Сопствена боја","Custom layout %1":"Сопствени распоред %1","Dark":"Тамна","Delay before hiding":"Кашњење пре скривања","Delay before showing":"Кашњење пре приказа","Delete":"Обриши","Delete layout?":"Обрисати распоред?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Удаљеност на којој се појављује ручица","Distance before the bar hides again":"Удаљеност после које се трака поново скрива","Distance to the edge":"Удаљеност од ивице","Donate with PayPal":"Донирајте путем PayPal-а","Drag a shared edge…":"Превуците заједничку ивицу…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Превуците прозор ка ивици…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Превуците прозор на други да их замените. Спуштен на траку или ивицу екрана, лебди слободно; „Пусти прозор да лебди“ га враћа. Размаци долазе са странице Опште.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Превуците прозор изнад средине другог – преглед показује две стрелице – и пустите. Код аутоматског поплочавања довољно је било где изнад другог прозора.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Превуците прозор до горње ивице екрана и спустите га на зону.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Превлачите картице да бисте променили редослед на траци. Двокликните на картицу да бисте је уредили.","Drop a window onto another one":"Пусти прозор на други","Drop the window onto a zone":"Спустите прозор на зону","Duplicate":"Удвостручи","Duration":"Трајање","Dwindle":"Спирала унутра","Dynamic":"Динамична","Edges and corners":"Ивице и углови","Edit":"Уреди","Edit layout":"Уреди распоред","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Свака функција може да се укључи и искључи засебно.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Сваки распоред са странице Распореди може и да распоређује прозоре – појављује се изнад. Прозор 1 добија зону 1 и тако даље; додатни прозори деле последњу зону. Са мање прозора него зона користи се „Главни и гомила“, да не би било рупа.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Сваки прозор сам проналази своје место, као у менаџеру прозора са поплочавањем.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Сваки прозор сам проналази своје место на екрану. Нови прозори се придружују, затворени ослобађају место осталима.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Пример: два прозора један поред другог, од три главни и гомила, од пет мрежа. Без одговарајућег правила важи горе изабрани распоред.","Fade in and out":"Постепено појављивање и нестајање","Fade the other windows":"Затамни остале прозоре","Features":"Функције","Feel":"Осећај","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Прилагоди се већ закаченим прозорима","Fits the way you work.":"Прилагођава се вашем начину рада.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Пусти прозор да лебди (напусти поплочавање)","Four quarters":"Четири четвртине","From":"Од","Fullscreen":"Цео екран","Gap between windows":"Размак између прозора","Gap to the screen edge":"Размак до ивице екрана","General":"Опште","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Свакој радњи поново даје тастер изабране шеме и уклања тастере које шема нема.","Good to know":"Добро је знати","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Ухватите прозор за насловну траку и превуците га нагоре. Трака се спушта; спустите прозор на зону и он попуњава тачно ту област. Кад га поново извучете, враћа му се стара величина.","Grab window A…":"Ухватите прозор A…","Grid":"Мрежа","Halves":"Половине","Hiding":"Скривање","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Држи уз ивицу за попуњавање слободног простора","Hold time":"Време држања","Hold to fill":"Држи за попуњавање","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Колико близу ивица мора да дође пре него што легне на место.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Колико близу ивице показивач мора да дође.","How far the bar slides down":"Колико се трака спушта","How it works":"Како ради","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Колико дуго прозор мора да буде уз ивицу – мали гурак. 0 = одмах.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Колико дуго прозор мора да остане уз ивицу пре него што нарасте.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Колико прозора дели главну област (распоред „Главни и гомила“).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Ако је доле већ прозор, горња ивица даје горњу половину уместо максимизовања. И половине и четвртине остављају закачене прозоре слободним.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Ако вам се свиђа KSnapUnity, можете подржати развој – хвала!","In bar":"На траци","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Независно од траке и ивица екрана.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Независно од траке. Свака ивица се укључује засебно.","Information":"Информације","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Интуитивно, природно понашање прозора.","Join at the end":"Иду на крај","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K за KWin · Snap за паметније качење · Unity за све у једном систему","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE има сопствене радње ивица екрана и сопствено качење прозора. Ако је овде укључена иста функција, искључите KDE-ову: Системске поставке → Управљање прозорима → Ивице екрана, и Понашање прозора → Померање.","KDE's own edge tiling":"KDE-ово сопствено слагање уз ивице","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"KDE-ово максимизовање и поплочавање на ивицама – са обрисом – паузира док ради KSnapUnity, па се види само један преглед. Подешавања KDE-а се не мењају: искључите ово, деактивирајте или уклоните KSnapUnity и понашање KDE-а се враћа.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"Сопствене радње ивица екрана у KDE-у су још укључене, па на исто превлачење реагују два помоћника. Искључите „Максимизуј” и „Поплочај” у Системске поставке → Управљање прозорима → Ивице екрана.","KDE's own window snapping":"KDE-ово сопствено качење прозора","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"И сопствено качење прозора у KDE-у је укључено. За уједначен осећај поставите његове зоне на „Ниједна” у Системске поставке → Управљање прозорима → Понашање прозора → Померање.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"KDE сервис за пречице није одговорио. Тастере и даље можете поставити у Системске поставке → Пречице → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – уређивач подешавања","Keep stacked windows in line":"Држи наслагане прозоре у линији","Keep the gap between windows":"Задржи размак између прозора","Keep them":"Задржи их","Key scheme":"Шема тастера","Keyboard shortcuts":"Пречице тастатуре","Keys":"Тастери","Keys already in use":"Тастери који се већ користе","Layout":"Распоред","Layout by number of windows":"Распоред према броју прозора","Layouts":"Распореди","Layouts per row":"Распореда по реду","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Лева и десна ивица: пола екрана","Left edge: left half":"Лева ивица: лева половина","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Испод 100 % самостални прозор остаје у средини – лепо на широким екранима.","License":"Лиценца","Light":"Светла","Linear":"Линеарна","Live preview":"Преглед уживо","Load template…":"Учитај шаблон…","Magnet":"Магнет","Main + stack":"Главни + гомила","Main and stack":"Главни и гомила","Main area bigger":"Већа главна област","Main area on the right":"Главна област десно","Main area smaller":"Мања главна област","Main in the middle":"Главни у средини","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Главни прекидач за превлачење и тастере.","Main window":"Главни прозор","Main windows":"Главни прозори","Main windows: %1":"Главни прозори: %1","Make it the main window":"Учини главним прозором","Maximize":"Максимизуј","Maximize or restore":"Максимизуј или врати","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + тастер (KDE стил)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + тастер","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + тастер","Minimize":"Минимизуј","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Пресликава распоред: главни прозор десно, остали лево.","Mode":"Режим","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Режим 1 – трака за качење и ивице екрана","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Режим 2 – аутоматско поплочавање","Modes":"Режими","More ways":"Још начина","Motion curve":"Крива кретања","Move a window towards others…":"Померите прозор ка другима…","Move the window one place back":"Помери прозор једно место назад","Move the window one place on":"Помери прозор једно место напред","Name:":"Назив:","New layout":"Нови распоред","New windows":"Нови прозори","Next tiling layout":"Следећи распоред поплочавања","Next to the active window":"Поред активног прозора","No key":"Нема тастера","No other window open":"Нема другог отвореног прозора","No outer margin":"Без спољне маргине","No shortcuts":"Без пречица","None":"Ниједна","None yet.":"Још ништа.","Off":"Искључено","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Искљ. = режим 1, укљ. = режим 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Искључено: неутралан оквир – само за укључене прегледе.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Искључено: тастери остају додељени, али ништа не раде.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Искључено: прозори остају где их ставиш. Остале функције раде свеједно.","One at a time":"Један по један","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Један се затвара – остали попуњавају празнину","One main window less":"Један главни прозор мање","One more main window":"Још један главни прозор","One window":"Један прозор","Only one mode is switched on.":"Укључен је само један режим.","Open settings editor":"Отвори уређивач подешавања","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Прво отворите програм, па га изаберите овде.","Open the layout builder":"Отвори градитеља распореда","Own layouts":"Сопствени распореди","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Део сваке странице који се рачуна као угао.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Паузирај KDE-ово слагање уз ивице и његов преглед","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Паузирај KDE-ове зоне качења док је магнет укључен","Preview":"Преглед","Previews":"Прегледи","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Притисните прозор уз ивицу или угао екрана и он испуни тај део. Ради са траком или без ње.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Притисните прозор уз ивицу или угао: максимизуј, половине, четвртине.","Push delay":"Кашњење притиска","Quarters":"Четвртине","Quick":"Брза","Quick settings":"Брза подешавања","Recommended values":"Препоручене вредности","Remove":"Уклони","Remove rule":"Уклони правило","Remove zone":"Уклони зону","Reset all":"Ресетуј све","Reset all keys":"Ресетуј све тастере","Reset to default":"Врати на подразумевано","Resistance against overlapping":"Отпор преклапању","Resize touching windows together":"Мењај величину прозора који се додирују заједно","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"И промена величине се качи – овде до пуне висине","Restore":"Врати","Restore default layouts":"Врати подразумеване распореде","Restore default layouts?":"Вратити подразумеване распореде?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Врати првобитну величину при извлачењу прозора","Restore the size before snapping":"Врати величину пре качења","Rows":"Редови","Save":"Сачувај","Screen edges":"Ивице екрана","Screen edges on/off":"Ивице екрана укљ./искљ.","Screen edges preview":"Преглед ивица екрана","Set":"Постави","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Поставља тастере свих радњи одједном. Појединачне тастере и даље можете мењати испод.","Settings":"Подешавања","Settings file":"Датотека подешавања","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Док мењаш величину, брзо протреси миш напред-назад и остали прозори скоче назад. Брз потез у једном смеру их никад не пушта.","Shake to let go":"Протресите за отпуштање","Shortcuts":"Пречице","Show a small handle first":"Прво прикажи малу ручицу","Show layout and zone names":"Прикажи називе распореда и зона","Show previews in the accent color":"Прикажи прегледе у боји истицања","Showing":"Приказивање","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Показује где прозор слеће на ивици или у углу. Искључено: никакав преглед.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Показује где прозор слеће док је зона траке истакнута. Искључено: никакав преглед.","Sidebar + grid":"Бочна трака + мрежа","Single zone":"Једна зона","Six tiles":"Шест плочица","Size & shape":"Величина и облик","Size of the main area":"Величина главне области","Slide-in duration":"Трајање спуштања","Slide-out duration":"Трајање подизања","Smart arranging and detection.":"Паметно распоређивање и препознавање.","Smart fill":"Паметно попуњавање","Smooth (default)":"Глатка (подразумевано)","Snap bar":"Трака за качење","Snap bar and screen edges":"Трака за качење и ивице екрана","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Трака и ивице су искључене – ради само режим 2, а пречица режима не ради ништа.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Трака и ивице екрана сметају аутоматском поплочавању. Зато раде као два режима – мењајте пречицом или овде.","Snap bar colors:":"Боје траке:","Snap bar on/off":"Трака укљ./искљ.","Snap bar preview":"Преглед траке за качење","Snap bar size":"Величина траке","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Трака за качење, ивице екрана, магнет прозора, пречице и замена прозора.","Snap distance":"Удаљеност качења","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Пријањање разделника (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Распореди за качење и аутоматско поплочавање.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Закачите активни прозор комбинацијама тастера.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Закачите активни прозор тастатуром. То су обичне глобалне KDE пречице – налазе се и у Системске поставке → Пречице → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Закачи у доњу половину","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Закачи у доњу леву четвртину","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Закачи у доњу десну четвртину","Snap to the center third":"Закачи у средњу трећину","Snap to the left half":"Закачи у леву половину","Snap to the left third":"Закачи у леву трећину","Snap to the left two thirds":"Закачи у леве две трећине","Snap to the right half":"Закачи у десну половину","Snap to the right third":"Закачи у десну трећину","Snap to the right two thirds":"Закачи у десне две трећине","Snap to the top half":"Закачи у горњу половину","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Закачи у горњу леву четвртину","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Закачи у горњу десну четвртину","Snapping":"Пријањање","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Качење и аутоматско поплочавање раде као два режима – једна пречица их мења.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Тако само један магнет вуче прозор. Подешавања KDE-а се не мењају: искључите ово, деактивирајте или уклоните KSnapUnity и KDE-ово качење се враћа.","Soft":"Блага","Spacing":"Размаци","Spiral":"Спирала","Split side by side":"Подели једно поред другог","Split top and bottom":"Подели горе и доле","Stack + main":"Гомила + главни","Stick to other windows":"Лепи се уз друге прозоре","Stick to the screen edges":"Лепи се уз ивице екрана","Sticky edges":"Лепљиве ивице","Support KSnapUnity":"Подржите KSnapUnity","Swap":"Замени","Swap windows":"Замена прозора","Swap with the window above":"Замени са прозором изнад","Swap with the window below":"Замени са прозором испод","Swap with the window on the left":"Замени са прозором лево","Swap with the window on the right":"Замени са прозором десно","Switch mode":"Промени режим","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Промени режим (качење / поплочавање)","Switch modes with:":"Промена режима:","Switch the layout by itself":"Сам мењај распоред","Switched off":"Искључено","System":"Систем","Take it over":"Преузми","Take over all":"Преузми све","Take the main place":"Узимају главно место","Test animation":"Испробај анимацију","Test on screen":"Испробај на екрану","Test the snap bar":"Испробај траку","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Подразумеване вредности засноване су на Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Радње качења користе исте размаке као трака и памте величину пре качења: „Врати величину пре качења” је враћа.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Ови програми се никад не распоређују и задржавају своје место. Дијалози су увек слободни.","Thirds":"Трећине","Three columns":"Три колоне","Thumbnail width":"Ширина сличица","Tiling":"Поплочавање","Tip":"Савет","Top / bottom":"Горе / доле","Top edge":"Горња ивица","Top edge: full screen":"Горња ивица: цео екран","Top edge: maximize":"Горња ивица: максимизуј","Top edge: top half":"Горња ивица: горња половина","Top half":"Горња половина","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Удаљеност активације од горње ивице","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Искључите ако вам је дражи KDE-ов обрис – тада горе искључите преглед ивица екрана.","Two thirds":"Две трећине","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Два прозора мењају места – спустите један на други или користите тастере.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Два прозора мењају места: спустите један на други или тастером.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Користи пречице тастатуре","Use screen edges":"Користи ивице екрана","Use the system accent color":"Користи системску боју истицања","Use the window magnet":"Користи магнет прозора","Usual combinations":"Уобичајене комбинације","Version":"Верзија","Wanted for: %1":"Жељено за: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Када се прозор отвори, затвори или замени, остали се померају глатко уместо да скачу.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Када мењате величину прозора, прозори који га додирују померају заједничку ивицу с њим – ништа се не преклапа, не настаје празнина.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Током промене величине прозори који не прате приказују се провидно.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Док померате прозор или му мењате величину, његове ивице се лепе уз оближње прозоре и ивице екрана.","Width":"Ширина","Window":"Прозор","Window magnet":"Магнет прозора","Window magnet on/off":"Магнет прозора укљ./искљ.","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Прозори један изнад другог држе леве и десне ивице заједно, прозори један поред другог горње и доње.","Windows glide to their place":"Прозори клизе на своје место","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Прозори се лепе један уз други и уз ивице екрана.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Прозори се зауставе на „Размак између прозора” са странице Опште уместо да се додирују.","Yes":"Да","Your own combination":"Сопствена комбинација","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Ваши распореди и њихов редослед биће изгубљени.","Zone %1":"Зона %1","for KWin · v%1":"за KWin · v%1","windows:":"прозора:","“%1” will be removed.":"„%1“ ће бити уклоњен.","…drag it onto window B…":"…превуците га на прозор B…","…in every direction":"…у сваком смеру","…let go: they trade places":"…пустите: мењају места","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…суседи расту и смањују се са њом","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Спремно – кликните У реду да отворите уређивач подешавања."},"sr@latin":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (kopija)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 koristi „%2”.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 od %2 zona","0 = all in one row":"0 = svi u jednom redu","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Režim 1</b><br/>Traka za kačenje i ivice ekrana","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Režim 2</b><br/>Automatsko popločavanje","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Samostalni prozor zauzima ceo ekran, čak i uz zadatu marginu.","A new window joins":"Pridružuje se novi prozor","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Kratko guranje daje polovinu ili četvrtinu. Zadržite prozor uz ivicu malo duže i naraste do sledećeg prozora – pregled to pokazuje.","A single window":"Jedan prozor","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Prozor se zaustavlja na ivici drugog, i kad ga brzo pomeraš. Protresi miš ili guraj još trenutak da ga pustiš. 0 = prozori smeju slobodno da se preklapaju.","About & Help":"O programu i pomoć","Accent color":"Boja isticanja","Active":"Aktivno","Active mode":"Aktivan režim","Active width along the top edge":"Aktivna širina duž gornje ivice","Add an open application":"Dodaj otvoren program","Add rule":"Dodaj pravilo","All window features in one system.":"Sve funkcije prozora u jednom sistemu.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Menja se i kad ručno promeniš veličinu glavnog prozora.","Also while resizing":"I pri promeni veličine","Always floating":"Uvek slobodni","Animation":"Animacija","Appearance":"Izgled","Apply":"Primeni","Arrange windows":"Raspoređivanje prozora","Arrange windows automatically":"Automatski rasporedi prozore","Author":"Autor","Automatic tiling":"Automatsko popločavanje","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Automatsko popločavanje je isključeno – radi samo režim 1, a prečica režima ne radi ništa.","Automatic tiling off":"Automatsko popločavanje isključeno","Automatic tiling on":"Automatsko popločavanje uključeno","Automatic tiling on/off":"Automatsko popločavanje uklj./isklj.","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Automatsko popločavanje, zamena prozora, prečice i magnet za slobodne prozore.","Background opacity":"Neprozirnost pozadine","Behavior & Animation":"Ponašanje i animacija","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Donja ivica: donja polovina","Bouncy":"Elastična","Buy me a coffee":"Častite me kafom","Cancel":"Otkaži","Center focus":"Fokus u sredini","Center the window":"Centriraj prozor","Change":"Promeni","Change key":"Promeni taster","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Taster menjate u uređivaču podešavanja. Oba režima traže automatsko popločavanje i traku ili ivice ekrana.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Promeni ih na stranici Prečice na tastaturi. Uz automatsko popločavanje prozori menjaju i mesto u redosledu.","Choose…":"Izaberite…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Kliknite na zonu da je izaberete · dvoklik je deli · prevlačite razdelnike","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Kliknite ili pritisnite %1 za promenu režima.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Kliknite, pa U redu – otvara se uređivač podešavanja.","Close":"Zatvori","Close by, the edges stick together":"Izbliza se ivice lepe","Color scheme":"Šema boja","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Boje, veličina i oblik trake.","Columns":"Kolone","Corner radius":"Poluprečnik uglova","Corner size":"Veličina uglova","Corner: a quarter":"Ugao: četvrtina","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Uglovi: četvrtina ekrana","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + taster (podrazumevano)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + numerički blok","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + taster","Custom color":"Sopstvena boja","Custom layout %1":"Sopstveni raspored %1","Dark":"Tamna","Delay before hiding":"Kašnjenje pre skrivanja","Delay before showing":"Kašnjenje pre prikaza","Delete":"Obriši","Delete layout?":"Obrisati raspored?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Udaljenost na kojoj se pojavljuje ručica","Distance before the bar hides again":"Udaljenost posle koje se traka ponovo skriva","Distance to the edge":"Udaljenost od ivice","Donate with PayPal":"Donirajte putem PayPal-a","Drag a shared edge…":"Prevucite zajedničku ivicu…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Prevucite prozor ka ivici…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Prevucite prozor na drugi da ih zamenite. Spušten na traku ili ivicu ekrana, lebdi slobodno; „Pusti prozor da lebdi“ ga vraća. Razmaci dolaze sa stranice Opšte.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Prevucite prozor iznad sredine drugog – pregled pokazuje dve strelice – i pustite. Kod automatskog popločavanja dovoljno je bilo gde iznad drugog prozora.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Prevucite prozor do gornje ivice ekrana i spustite ga na zonu.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Prevlačite kartice da biste promenili redosled na traci. Dvokliknite na karticu da biste je uredili.","Drop a window onto another one":"Pusti prozor na drugi","Drop the window onto a zone":"Spustite prozor na zonu","Duplicate":"Udvostruči","Duration":"Trajanje","Dwindle":"Spirala unutra","Dynamic":"Dinamična","Edges and corners":"Ivice i uglovi","Edit":"Uredi","Edit layout":"Uredi raspored","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Svaka funkcija može da se uključi i isključi zasebno.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Svaki raspored sa stranice Rasporedi može i da raspoređuje prozore – pojavljuje se iznad. Prozor 1 dobija zonu 1 i tako dalje; dodatni prozori dele poslednju zonu. Sa manje prozora nego zona koristi se „Glavni i gomila“, da ne bi bilo rupa.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Svaki prozor sam pronalazi svoje mesto, kao u menadžeru prozora sa popločavanjem.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Svaki prozor sam pronalazi svoje mesto na ekranu. Novi prozori se pridružuju, zatvoreni oslobađaju mesto ostalima.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Primer: dva prozora jedan pored drugog, od tri glavni i gomila, od pet mreža. Bez odgovarajućeg pravila važi gore izabrani raspored.","Fade in and out":"Postepeno pojavljivanje i nestajanje","Fade the other windows":"Zatamni ostale prozore","Features":"Funkcije","Feel":"Osećaj","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Prilagodi se već zakačenim prozorima","Fits the way you work.":"Prilagođava se vašem načinu rada.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Pusti prozor da lebdi (napusti popločavanje)","Four quarters":"Četiri četvrtine","From":"Od","Fullscreen":"Ceo ekran","Gap between windows":"Razmak između prozora","Gap to the screen edge":"Razmak do ivice ekrana","General":"Opšte","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Svakoj radnji ponovo daje taster izabrane šeme i uklanja tastere koje šema nema.","Good to know":"Dobro je znati","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Uhvatite prozor za naslovnu traku i prevucite ga nagore. Traka se spušta; spustite prozor na zonu i on popunjava tačno tu oblast. Kad ga ponovo izvučete, vraća mu se stara veličina.","Grab window A…":"Uhvatite prozor A…","Grid":"Mreža","Halves":"Polovine","Hiding":"Skrivanje","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Drži uz ivicu za popunjavanje slobodnog prostora","Hold time":"Vreme držanja","Hold to fill":"Drži za popunjavanje","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Koliko blizu ivica mora da dođe pre nego što legne na mesto.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Koliko blizu ivice pokazivač mora da dođe.","How far the bar slides down":"Koliko se traka spušta","How it works":"Kako radi","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Koliko dugo prozor mora da bude uz ivicu – mali gurak. 0 = odmah.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Koliko dugo prozor mora da ostane uz ivicu pre nego što naraste.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Koliko prozora deli glavnu oblast (raspored „Glavni i gomila“).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Ako je dole već prozor, gornja ivica daje gornju polovinu umesto maksimizovanja. I polovine i četvrtine ostavljaju zakačene prozore slobodnim.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Ako vam se sviđa KSnapUnity, možete podržati razvoj – hvala!","In bar":"Na traci","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Nezavisno od trake i ivica ekrana.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Nezavisno od trake. Svaka ivica se uključuje zasebno.","Information":"Informacije","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Intuitivno, prirodno ponašanje prozora.","Join at the end":"Idu na kraj","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K za KWin · Snap za pametnije kačenje · Unity za sve u jednom sistemu","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE ima sopstvene radnje ivica ekrana i sopstveno kačenje prozora. Ako je ovde uključena ista funkcija, isključite KDE-ovu: Sistemske postavke → Upravljanje prozorima → Ivice ekrana, i Ponašanje prozora → Pomeranje.","KDE's own edge tiling":"KDE-ovo sopstveno slaganje uz ivice","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"KDE-ovo maksimizovanje i popločavanje na ivicama – sa obrisom – pauzira dok radi KSnapUnity, pa se vidi samo jedan pregled. Podešavanja KDE-a se ne menjaju: isključite ovo, deaktivirajte ili uklonite KSnapUnity i ponašanje KDE-a se vraća.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"Sopstvene radnje ivica ekrana u KDE-u su još uključene, pa na isto prevlačenje reaguju dva pomoćnika. Isključite „Maksimizuj” i „Popločaj” u Sistemske postavke → Upravljanje prozorima → Ivice ekrana.","KDE's own window snapping":"KDE-ovo sopstveno kačenje prozora","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"I sopstveno kačenje prozora u KDE-u je uključeno. Za ujednačen osećaj postavite njegove zone na „Nijedna” u Sistemske postavke → Upravljanje prozorima → Ponašanje prozora → Pomeranje.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"KDE servis za prečice nije odgovorio. Tastere i dalje možete postaviti u Sistemske postavke → Prečice → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – uređivač podešavanja","Keep stacked windows in line":"Drži naslagane prozore u liniji","Keep the gap between windows":"Zadrži razmak između prozora","Keep them":"Zadrži ih","Key scheme":"Šema tastera","Keyboard shortcuts":"Prečice tastature","Keys":"Tasteri","Keys already in use":"Tasteri koji se već koriste","Layout":"Raspored","Layout by number of windows":"Raspored prema broju prozora","Layouts":"Rasporedi","Layouts per row":"Rasporeda po redu","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Leva i desna ivica: pola ekrana","Left edge: left half":"Leva ivica: leva polovina","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Ispod 100 % samostalni prozor ostaje u sredini – lepo na širokim ekranima.","License":"Licenca","Light":"Svetla","Linear":"Linearna","Live preview":"Pregled uživo","Load template…":"Učitaj šablon…","Main + stack":"Glavni + gomila","Main and stack":"Glavni i gomila","Main area bigger":"Veća glavna oblast","Main area on the right":"Glavna oblast desno","Main area smaller":"Manja glavna oblast","Main in the middle":"Glavni u sredini","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Glavni prekidač za prevlačenje i tastere.","Main window":"Glavni prozor","Main windows":"Glavni prozori","Main windows: %1":"Glavni prozori: %1","Make it the main window":"Učini glavnim prozorom","Maximize":"Maksimizuj","Maximize or restore":"Maksimizuj ili vrati","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + taster (KDE stil)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + taster","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + taster","Minimize":"Minimizuj","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Preslikava raspored: glavni prozor desno, ostali levo.","Mode":"Režim","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Režim 1 – traka za kačenje i ivice ekrana","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Režim 2 – automatsko popločavanje","Modes":"Režimi","More ways":"Još načina","Motion curve":"Kriva kretanja","Move a window towards others…":"Pomerite prozor ka drugima…","Move the window one place back":"Pomeri prozor jedno mesto nazad","Move the window one place on":"Pomeri prozor jedno mesto napred","Name:":"Naziv:","New layout":"Novi raspored","New windows":"Novi prozori","Next tiling layout":"Sledeći raspored popločavanja","Next to the active window":"Pored aktivnog prozora","No key":"Nema tastera","No other window open":"Nema drugog otvorenog prozora","No outer margin":"Bez spoljne margine","No shortcuts":"Bez prečica","None":"Nijedna","None yet.":"Još ništa.","Off":"Isključeno","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Isklj. = režim 1, uklj. = režim 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Isključeno: neutralan okvir – samo za uključene preglede.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Isključeno: tasteri ostaju dodeljeni, ali ništa ne rade.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Isključeno: prozori ostaju gde ih staviš. Ostale funkcije rade svejedno.","One at a time":"Jedan po jedan","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Jedan se zatvara – ostali popunjavaju prazninu","One main window less":"Jedan glavni prozor manje","One more main window":"Još jedan glavni prozor","One window":"Jedan prozor","Only one mode is switched on.":"Uključen je samo jedan režim.","Open settings editor":"Otvori uređivač podešavanja","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Prvo otvorite program, pa ga izaberite ovde.","Open the layout builder":"Otvori graditelja rasporeda","Own layouts":"Sopstveni rasporedi","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Deo svake stranice koji se računa kao ugao.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Pauziraj KDE-ovo slaganje uz ivice i njegov pregled","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Pauziraj KDE-ove zone kačenja dok je magnet uključen","Preview":"Pregled","Previews":"Pregledi","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Pritisnite prozor uz ivicu ili ugao ekrana i on ispuni taj deo. Radi sa trakom ili bez nje.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Pritisnite prozor uz ivicu ili ugao: maksimizuj, polovine, četvrtine.","Push delay":"Kašnjenje pritiska","Quarters":"Četvrtine","Quick":"Brza","Quick settings":"Brza podešavanja","Recommended values":"Preporučene vrednosti","Remove":"Ukloni","Remove rule":"Ukloni pravilo","Remove zone":"Ukloni zonu","Reset all":"Resetuj sve","Reset all keys":"Resetuj sve tastere","Reset to default":"Vrati na podrazumevano","Resistance against overlapping":"Otpor preklapanju","Resize touching windows together":"Menjaj veličinu prozora koji se dodiruju zajedno","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"I promena veličine se kači – ovde do pune visine","Restore":"Vrati","Restore default layouts":"Vrati podrazumevane rasporede","Restore default layouts?":"Vratiti podrazumevane rasporede?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Vrati prvobitnu veličinu pri izvlačenju prozora","Restore the size before snapping":"Vrati veličinu pre kačenja","Rows":"Redovi","Save":"Sačuvaj","Screen edges":"Ivice ekrana","Screen edges on/off":"Ivice ekrana uklj./isklj.","Screen edges preview":"Pregled ivica ekrana","Set":"Postavi","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Postavlja tastere svih radnji odjednom. Pojedinačne tastere i dalje možete menjati ispod.","Settings":"Podešavanja","Settings file":"Datoteka podešavanja","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Dok menjaš veličinu, brzo protresi miš napred-nazad i ostali prozori skoče nazad. Brz potez u jednom smeru ih nikad ne pušta.","Shake to let go":"Protresite za otpuštanje","Shortcuts":"Prečice","Show a small handle first":"Prvo prikaži malu ručicu","Show layout and zone names":"Prikaži nazive rasporeda i zona","Show previews in the accent color":"Prikaži preglede u boji isticanja","Showing":"Prikazivanje","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Pokazuje gde prozor sleće na ivici ili u uglu. Isključeno: nikakav pregled.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Pokazuje gde prozor sleće dok je zona trake istaknuta. Isključeno: nikakav pregled.","Sidebar + grid":"Bočna traka + mreža","Single zone":"Jedna zona","Six tiles":"Šest pločica","Size & shape":"Veličina i oblik","Size of the main area":"Veličina glavne oblasti","Slide-in duration":"Trajanje spuštanja","Slide-out duration":"Trajanje podizanja","Smart arranging and detection.":"Pametno raspoređivanje i prepoznavanje.","Smart fill":"Pametno popunjavanje","Smooth (default)":"Glatka (podrazumevano)","Snap bar":"Traka za kačenje","Snap bar and screen edges":"Traka za kačenje i ivice ekrana","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Traka i ivice su isključene – radi samo režim 2, a prečica režima ne radi ništa.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Traka i ivice ekrana smetaju automatskom popločavanju. Zato rade kao dva režima – menjajte prečicom ili ovde.","Snap bar colors:":"Boje trake:","Snap bar on/off":"Traka uklj./isklj.","Snap bar preview":"Pregled trake za kačenje","Snap bar size":"Veličina trake","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Traka za kačenje, ivice ekrana, magnet prozora, prečice i zamena prozora.","Snap distance":"Udaljenost kačenja","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Prijanjanje razdelnika (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Rasporedi za kačenje i automatsko popločavanje.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Zakačite aktivni prozor kombinacijama tastera.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Zakačite aktivni prozor tastaturom. To su obične globalne KDE prečice – nalaze se i u Sistemske postavke → Prečice → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Zakači u donju polovinu","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Zakači u donju levu četvrtinu","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Zakači u donju desnu četvrtinu","Snap to the center third":"Zakači u srednju trećinu","Snap to the left half":"Zakači u levu polovinu","Snap to the left third":"Zakači u levu trećinu","Snap to the left two thirds":"Zakači u leve dve trećine","Snap to the right half":"Zakači u desnu polovinu","Snap to the right third":"Zakači u desnu trećinu","Snap to the right two thirds":"Zakači u desne dve trećine","Snap to the top half":"Zakači u gornju polovinu","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Zakači u gornju levu četvrtinu","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Zakači u gornju desnu četvrtinu","Snapping":"Prijanjanje","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Kačenje i automatsko popločavanje rade kao dva režima – jedna prečica ih menja.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Tako samo jedan magnet vuče prozor. Podešavanja KDE-a se ne menjaju: isključite ovo, deaktivirajte ili uklonite KSnapUnity i KDE-ovo kačenje se vraća.","Soft":"Blaga","Spacing":"Razmaci","Spiral":"Spirala","Split side by side":"Podeli jedno pored drugog","Split top and bottom":"Podeli gore i dole","Stack + main":"Gomila + glavni","Stick to other windows":"Lepi se uz druge prozore","Stick to the screen edges":"Lepi se uz ivice ekrana","Sticky edges":"Lepljive ivice","Support KSnapUnity":"Podržite KSnapUnity","Swap":"Zameni","Swap windows":"Zamena prozora","Swap with the window above":"Zameni sa prozorom iznad","Swap with the window below":"Zameni sa prozorom ispod","Swap with the window on the left":"Zameni sa prozorom levo","Swap with the window on the right":"Zameni sa prozorom desno","Switch mode":"Promeni režim","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Promeni režim (kačenje / popločavanje)","Switch modes with:":"Promena režima:","Switch the layout by itself":"Sam menjaj raspored","Switched off":"Isključeno","System":"Sistem","Take it over":"Preuzmi","Take over all":"Preuzmi sve","Take the main place":"Uzimaju glavno mesto","Test animation":"Isprobaj animaciju","Test on screen":"Isprobaj na ekranu","Test the snap bar":"Isprobaj traku","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Podrazumevane vrednosti zasnovane su na Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Radnje kačenja koriste iste razmake kao traka i pamte veličinu pre kačenja: „Vrati veličinu pre kačenja” je vraća.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Ovi programi se nikad ne raspoređuju i zadržavaju svoje mesto. Dijalozi su uvek slobodni.","Thirds":"Trećine","Three columns":"Tri kolone","Thumbnail width":"Širina sličica","Tiling":"Popločavanje","Tip":"Savet","Top / bottom":"Gore / dole","Top edge":"Gornja ivica","Top edge: full screen":"Gornja ivica: ceo ekran","Top edge: maximize":"Gornja ivica: maksimizuj","Top edge: top half":"Gornja ivica: gornja polovina","Top half":"Gornja polovina","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Udaljenost aktivacije od gornje ivice","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Isključite ako vam je draži KDE-ov obris – tada gore isključite pregled ivica ekrana.","Two thirds":"Dve trećine","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Dva prozora menjaju mesta – spustite jedan na drugi ili koristite tastere.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Dva prozora menjaju mesta: spustite jedan na drugi ili tasterom.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Koristi prečice tastature","Use screen edges":"Koristi ivice ekrana","Use the system accent color":"Koristi sistemsku boju isticanja","Use the window magnet":"Koristi magnet prozora","Usual combinations":"Uobičajene kombinacije","Version":"Verzija","Wanted for: %1":"Željeno za: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Kada se prozor otvori, zatvori ili zameni, ostali se pomeraju glatko umesto da skaču.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Kada menjate veličinu prozora, prozori koji ga dodiruju pomeraju zajedničku ivicu s njim – ništa se ne preklapa, ne nastaje praznina.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Tokom promene veličine prozori koji ne prate prikazuju se providno.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Dok pomerate prozor ili mu menjate veličinu, njegove ivice se lepe uz obližnje prozore i ivice ekrana.","Width":"Širina","Window":"Prozor","Window magnet":"Magnet prozora","Window magnet on/off":"Magnet prozora uklj./isklj.","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Prozori jedan iznad drugog drže leve i desne ivice zajedno, prozori jedan pored drugog gornje i donje.","Windows glide to their place":"Prozori klize na svoje mesto","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Prozori se lepe jedan uz drugi i uz ivice ekrana.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Prozori se zaustave na „Razmak između prozora” sa stranice Opšte umesto da se dodiruju.","Yes":"Da","Your own combination":"Sopstvena kombinacija","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Vaši rasporedi i njihov redosled biće izgubljeni.","Zone %1":"Zona %1","for KWin · v%1":"za KWin · v%1","windows:":"prozora:","“%1” will be removed.":"„%1“ će biti uklonjen.","…drag it onto window B…":"…prevucite ga na prozor B…","…in every direction":"…u svakom smeru","…let go: they trade places":"…pustite: menjaju mesta","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…susedi rastu i smanjuju se sa njom","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Spremno – kliknite U redu da otvorite uređivač podešavanja."},"sv":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (kopia)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 används av ”%2”.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 av %2 zoner","0 = all in one row":"0 = alla på en rad","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Läge 1</b><br/>Fästlist och skärmkanter","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Läge 2</b><br/>Automatisk sida vid sida","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Ett ensamt fönster använder hela skärmen, även om en marginal är satt.","A new window joins":"Ett nytt fönster ansluter","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"En kort knuff ger halvan eller kvarten. Håll fönstret lite längre vid kanten så växer det fram till nästa fönster – förhandsvisningen visar det.","A single window":"Ett enda fönster","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Ett fönster stannar vid kanten av ett annat, även när du flyttar det snabbt. Skaka musen eller fortsätt trycka en stund för att släppa. 0 = fönster får överlappa fritt.","About & Help":"Om & hjälp","Accent color":"Accentfärg","Active":"Aktiv","Active mode":"Aktivt läge","Active width along the top edge":"Aktiv bredd längs överkanten","Add an open application":"Lägg till ett öppet program","Add rule":"Lägg till regel","All window features in one system.":"Alla fönsterfunktioner i ett system.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Ändras också när du ändrar huvudfönstrets storlek för hand.","Also while resizing":"Även vid storleksändring","Always floating":"Alltid flytande","Animation":"Animering","Appearance":"Utseende","Apply":"Verkställ","Arrange windows":"Ordna fönster","Arrange windows automatically":"Ordna fönster automatiskt","Author":"Upphovsperson","Automatic tiling":"Automatisk sida vid sida","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Automatisk sida vid sida är avstängd – bara läge 1 körs och lägeskommandot gör ingenting.","Automatic tiling off":"Automatisk sida vid sida av","Automatic tiling on":"Automatisk sida vid sida på","Automatic tiling on/off":"Automatisk sida vid sida på/av","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Automatisk sida vid sida, byt fönster, kortkommandon och magneten för flytande fönster.","Background opacity":"Bakgrundens opacitet","Behavior & Animation":"Beteende & animering","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Nederkant: nedre halvan","Bouncy":"Studsande","Buy me a coffee":"Bjud mig på en kaffe","Cancel":"Avbryt","Center focus":"Fokus i mitten","Center the window":"Centrera fönstret","Change":"Ändra","Change key":"Ändra tangent","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Tangenten ändras i inställningsredigeraren. Båda lägena behöver automatisk sida vid sida och fästlisten eller skärmkanterna.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Ändra dem på sidan Kortkommandon. Med automatisk sida vid sida byter fönstren också plats i ordningen.","Choose…":"Välj …","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Klicka på en zon för att markera den · dubbelklicka för att dela · dra i avdelarna","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Klicka eller tryck %1 för att byta läge.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Klicka, sedan OK – inställningsredigeraren öppnas.","Close":"Stäng","Close by, the edges stick together":"Nära varandra fastnar kanterna","Color scheme":"Färgschema","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Fästlistens färger, storlek och form.","Columns":"Kolumner","Corner radius":"Hörnradie","Corner size":"Hörnstorlek","Corner: a quarter":"Hörn: en fjärdedel","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Hörn: en fjärdedel av skärmen","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + tangent (standard)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + numeriskt tangentbord","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Skift+Alt + tangent","Custom color":"Egen färg","Custom layout %1":"Egen layout %1","Dark":"Mörkt","Delay before hiding":"Fördröjning innan döljning","Delay before showing":"Fördröjning innan visning","Delete":"Ta bort","Delete layout?":"Ta bort layouten?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Avstånd där handtaget visas","Distance before the bar hides again":"Avstånd innan listen döljs igen","Distance to the edge":"Avstånd till kanten","Donate with PayPal":"Donera med PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"Dra i en gemensam kant …","Drag a window against an edge…":"Dra ett fönster mot en kant …","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Dra ett fönster över ett annat för att byta dem. Släpps det på fästlisten eller en skärmkant flyter det fritt; ”Låt fönstret sväva” hämtar tillbaka det. Avstånden kommer från sidan Allmänt.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Dra ett fönster över mitten av ett annat – förhandsvisningen visar två pilar – och släpp. Med automatisk sida vid sida räcker var som helst över det andra fönstret.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Dra ett fönster till skärmens överkant och släpp det på en zon.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Dra korten för att ändra ordningen i fästlisten. Dubbelklicka på ett kort för att redigera det.","Drop a window onto another one":"Släpp ett fönster på ett annat","Drop the window onto a zone":"Släpp fönstret på en zon","Duplicate":"Duplicera","Duration":"Varaktighet","Dwindle":"Spiral inåt","Dynamic":"Dynamisk","Edges and corners":"Kanter och hörn","Edit":"Redigera","Edit layout":"Redigera layout","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Varje funktion kan slås på och av för sig.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Varje layout du bygger på sidan Layouter kan också ordna fönster – den visas ovan. Fönster 1 får zon 1 och så vidare; fler fönster delar den sista zonen. Med färre fönster än zoner används ”Huvud och stapel”, så att inga hål uppstår.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Varje fönster hittar sin plats av sig självt, som i en kaklande fönsterhanterare.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Varje fönster hittar sin plats på skärmen av sig självt. Nya fönster ansluter, stängda lämnar plats åt de andra.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Exempel: två fönster sida vid sida, från tre huvud och stapel, från fem ett rutnät. Utan passande regel gäller layouten som valts ovan.","Fade in and out":"Tona in och ut","Fade the other windows":"Tona ned de andra fönstren","Features":"Funktioner","Feel":"Känsla","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Anpassa efter redan fästa fönster","Fits the way you work.":"Passar ditt sätt att arbeta.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Låt fönstret sväva (lämna sida vid sida)","Four quarters":"Fyra fjärdedelar","From":"Från","Fullscreen":"Helskärm","Gap between windows":"Avstånd mellan fönster","Gap to the screen edge":"Avstånd till skärmkanten","General":"Allmänt","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Ger varje åtgärd tangenten från det valda schemat igen och tar bort tangenter som schemat saknar.","Good to know":"Bra att veta","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Ta tag i ett fönster i namnlisten och dra det uppåt. Fästlisten glider ner; släpp fönstret på en zon så fyller det exakt det området. Drar du ut det igen får det tillbaka sin gamla storlek.","Grab window A…":"Ta tag i fönster A …","Grid":"Rutnät","Halves":"Halvor","Hiding":"Döljning","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Håll vid kanten för att fylla det lediga utrymmet","Hold time":"Hålltid","Hold to fill":"Håll för att fylla","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Hur nära en kant måste komma innan den snäpper fast.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Hur nära kanten markören måste komma.","How far the bar slides down":"Hur långt listen glider ner","How it works":"Så fungerar det","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Hur länge fönstret måste ligga mot kanten – en liten knuff. 0 = direkt.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Hur länge fönstret måste stanna vid kanten innan det växer.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Hur många fönster som delar huvudytan (layouten ”Huvud och stapel”).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Finns det redan ett fönster längst ner ger överkanten övre halvan i stället för att maximera. Halvor och fjärdedelar lämnar också fästa fönster fria.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Om du gillar KSnapUnity kan du stödja utvecklingen – tack!","In bar":"I listen","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Oberoende av fästlisten och skärmkanterna.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Oberoende av fästlisten. Varje kant kan slås på för sig.","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Intuitivt, naturligt fönsterbeteende.","Join at the end":"Ställer sig sist","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K för KWin · Snap för smartare fästning · Unity för allt i ett system","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE har egna skärmkantsåtgärder och egen fönsterfästning. Om samma funktion är på här, stäng av KDE:s: Systeminställningar → Fönsterhantering → Skärmkanter, samt Fönsterbeteende → Förflyttning.","KDE's own edge tiling":"KDE:s egna kantplattor","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"KDE:s egen maximering och sida vid sida vid kanterna – med kontur – pausas medan KSnapUnity körs, så att bara en förhandsvisning syns. Dina KDE-inställningar ändras inte: stäng av detta, inaktivera eller ta bort KSnapUnity så är KDE:s beteende tillbaka.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"KDE:s egna skärmkantsåtgärder är fortfarande på, så två hjälpare reagerar på samma dragning. Stäng av ”Maximera” och ”Sida vid sida” i Systeminställningar → Fönsterhantering → Skärmkanter.","KDE's own window snapping":"KDE:s egen fönsterfästning","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE:s egen fönsterfästning är också på. För en enhetlig känsla, ställ in dess zoner på ”Ingen” i Systeminställningar → Fönsterhantering → Fönsterbeteende → Förflyttning.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"KDE:s genvägstjänst svarade inte. Du kan fortfarande ange tangenterna i Systeminställningar → Genvägar → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – Inställningsredigerare","Keep stacked windows in line":"Håll staplade fönster i linje","Keep the gap between windows":"Behåll avståndet mellan fönster","Keep them":"Behåll dem","Key scheme":"Tangentschema","Keyboard shortcuts":"Kortkommandon","Keys":"Tangenter","Keys already in use":"Tangenter som redan används","Layout by number of windows":"Layout efter antal fönster","Layouts":"Layouter","Layouts per row":"Layouter per rad","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Vänster och höger kant: halva skärmen","Left edge: left half":"Vänster kant: vänstra halvan","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Under 100 % hålls ett ensamt fönster i mitten – snyggt på breda skärmar.","License":"Licens","Light":"Ljust","Linear":"Linjär","Live preview":"Liveförhandsvisning","Load template…":"Läs in mall…","Main + stack":"Huvud + stapel","Main and stack":"Huvud och stapel","Main area bigger":"Större huvudyta","Main area on the right":"Huvudområde till höger","Main area smaller":"Mindre huvudyta","Main in the middle":"Huvud i mitten","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Huvudbrytare för dragning och tangenterna.","Main window":"Huvudfönster","Main windows":"Huvudfönster (antal)","Main windows: %1":"Huvudfönster: %1","Make it the main window":"Gör till huvudfönster","Maximize":"Maximera","Maximize or restore":"Maximera eller återställ","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + tangent (KDE-stil)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + tangent","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Skift + tangent","Minimize":"Minimera","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Speglar layouten: huvudfönstret till höger, de andra till vänster.","Mode":"Läge","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Läge 1 – Fästlist och skärmkanter","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Läge 2 – Automatisk sida vid sida","Modes":"Lägen","More ways":"Fler sätt","Motion curve":"Rörelsekurva","Move a window towards others…":"Flytta ett fönster mot andra …","Move the window one place back":"Flytta fönstret en plats bakåt","Move the window one place on":"Flytta fönstret en plats framåt","Name:":"Namn:","New layout":"Ny layout","New windows":"Nya fönster","Next tiling layout":"Nästa layout","Next to the active window":"Bredvid det aktiva fönstret","No key":"Ingen tangent","No other window open":"Inget annat fönster öppet","No outer margin":"Ingen yttre marginal","No shortcuts":"Inga kortkommandon","None":"Ingen","None yet.":"Inga ännu.","Off":"Av","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Av = läge 1, på = läge 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Av: en neutral ram – bara för de förhandsvisningar som är på.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Av: tangenterna förblir tilldelade men gör ingenting.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Av: fönster stannar där du lägger dem. De andra funktionerna fungerar ändå.","One at a time":"Ett i taget","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Ett stängs – de andra fyller luckan","One main window less":"Ett huvudfönster färre","One more main window":"Ett huvudfönster till","One window":"Ett fönster","Only one mode is switched on.":"Bara ett läge är påslaget.","Open settings editor":"Öppna inställningsredigeraren","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Öppna programmet först och välj det sedan här.","Open the layout builder":"Öppna layoutbyggaren","Own layouts":"Egna layouter","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Del av varje sida som räknas som hörn.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Pausa KDE:s kantplattor och dess förhandsvisning","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Pausa KDE:s fästzoner medan magneten är på","Preview":"Förhandsgranskning","Previews":"Förhandsvisningar","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Tryck ett fönster mot en kant eller ett hörn av skärmen så fyller det den delen. Fungerar med eller utan fästlisten.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Tryck ett fönster mot en kant eller ett hörn: maximera, halvor, fjärdedelar.","Push delay":"Tryckfördröjning","Quarters":"Fjärdedelar","Quick":"Snabb","Quick settings":"Snabbinställningar","Recommended values":"Rekommenderade värden","Remove":"Ta bort","Remove rule":"Ta bort regel","Remove zone":"Ta bort zon","Reset all":"Återställ alla","Reset all keys":"Återställ alla tangenter","Reset to default":"Återställ till standard","Resistance against overlapping":"Motstånd mot överlappning","Resize touching windows together":"Ändra storlek på fönster som rör varandra tillsammans","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Även storleksändring fäster – här till full höjd","Restore":"Återställ","Restore default layouts":"Återställ standardlayouter","Restore default layouts?":"Återställa standardlayouterna?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Återställ ursprunglig storlek när fönstret dras ut","Restore the size before snapping":"Återställ storleken före fästning","Rows":"Rader","Save":"Spara","Screen edges":"Skärmkanter","Screen edges on/off":"Skärmkanter på/av","Screen edges preview":"Förhandsvisning för skärmkanterna","Set":"Ange","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Ställer in tangenterna för alla åtgärder på en gång. Enskilda tangenter kan du fortfarande ändra nedan.","Settings":"Inställningar","Settings file":"Inställningsfil","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Skaka musen snabbt fram och tillbaka medan du ändrar storlek, så hoppar de andra fönstren tillbaka. Ett snabbt drag åt ett håll släpper aldrig.","Shake to let go":"Skaka för att släppa","Shortcuts":"Genvägar","Show a small handle first":"Visa först ett litet handtag","Show layout and zone names":"Visa namn på layouter och zoner","Show previews in the accent color":"Visa förhandsvisningar i accentfärgen","Showing":"Visning","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Visar var fönstret hamnar vid en kant eller ett hörn. Av: ingen förhandsvisning alls.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Visar var fönstret hamnar medan en zon i listen är markerad. Av: ingen förhandsvisning alls.","Sidebar + grid":"Sidopanel + rutnät","Single zone":"En zon","Six tiles":"Sex rutor","Size & shape":"Storlek & form","Size of the main area":"Huvudytans storlek","Slide-in duration":"Varaktighet in","Slide-out duration":"Varaktighet ut","Smart arranging and detection.":"Smart placering och igenkänning.","Smart fill":"Smart fyllning","Smooth (default)":"Mjuk (standard)","Snap bar":"Fästlist","Snap bar and screen edges":"Fästlist och skärmkanter","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Fästlisten och kanterna är avstängda – bara läge 2 körs och lägeskommandot gör ingenting.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Fästlisten och skärmkanterna står i vägen för automatisk sida vid sida. Därför körs de som två lägen – byt med kortkommandot eller här.","Snap bar colors:":"Fästlistens färger:","Snap bar on/off":"Fästlist på/av","Snap bar preview":"Förhandsvisning för fästlisten","Snap bar size":"Fästlistens storlek","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Fästlist, skärmkanter, fönstermagnet, kortkommandon och byt fönster.","Snap distance":"Fästavstånd","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Fäst avdelare (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Fästlayouter och automatisk sida vid sida.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Fäst det aktiva fönstret med tangentkombinationer.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Fäst det aktiva fönstret med tangentbordet. Det är vanliga globala KDE-genvägar – du hittar dem också i Systeminställningar → Genvägar → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Fäst i nedre halvan","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Fäst i nedre vänstra fjärdedelen","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Fäst i nedre högra fjärdedelen","Snap to the center third":"Fäst i mittersta tredjedelen","Snap to the left half":"Fäst i vänstra halvan","Snap to the left third":"Fäst i vänstra tredjedelen","Snap to the left two thirds":"Fäst i vänstra två tredjedelarna","Snap to the right half":"Fäst i högra halvan","Snap to the right third":"Fäst i högra tredjedelen","Snap to the right two thirds":"Fäst i högra två tredjedelarna","Snap to the top half":"Fäst i övre halvan","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Fäst i övre vänstra fjärdedelen","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Fäst i övre högra fjärdedelen","Snapping":"Fästning","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Fästning och automatisk sida vid sida körs som två lägen – ett kortkommando växlar mellan dem.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Så drar bara en magnet i ett fönster. Dina KDE-inställningar ändras inte: stäng av detta, inaktivera eller ta bort KSnapUnity så är KDE:s fästning tillbaka.","Soft":"Lugn","Spacing":"Avstånd","Split side by side":"Dela sida vid sida","Split top and bottom":"Dela upptill och nedtill","Stack + main":"Stapel + huvud","Stick to other windows":"Fäst mot andra fönster","Stick to the screen edges":"Fäst mot skärmkanterna","Sticky edges":"Klistriga kanter","Support KSnapUnity":"Stöd KSnapUnity","Swap":"Byt","Swap windows":"Byt fönster","Swap with the window above":"Byt med fönstret ovanför","Swap with the window below":"Byt med fönstret nedanför","Swap with the window on the left":"Byt med fönstret till vänster","Swap with the window on the right":"Byt med fönstret till höger","Switch mode":"Byt läge","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Byt läge (fästning / sida vid sida)","Switch modes with:":"Byt läge med:","Switch the layout by itself":"Byt layout av sig själv","Switched off":"Avstängt","Take it over":"Ta över","Take over all":"Ta över alla","Take the main place":"Tar huvudplatsen","Test animation":"Testa animering","Test on screen":"Testa på skärmen","Test the snap bar":"Testa fästlisten","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Standardvärdena utgår från Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Fäståtgärderna använder samma avstånd som fästlisten och minns storleken före fästningen: ”Återställ storleken före fästning” tar tillbaka den.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Dessa program ordnas aldrig och behåller sin egen plats. Dialoger flyter alltid.","Thirds":"Tredjedelar","Three columns":"Tre kolumner","Thumbnail width":"Miniatyrernas bredd","Tiling":"Sida vid sida","Tip":"Tips","Top / bottom":"Upptill / nedtill","Top edge":"Överkant","Top edge: full screen":"Övre kant: helskärm","Top edge: maximize":"Övre kant: maximera","Top edge: top half":"Övre kant: övre halvan","Top half":"Övre halvan","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Aktiveringsavstånd från överkanten","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Stäng av detta om du föredrar KDE:s egen kontur – stäng då av förhandsvisningen för skärmkanterna ovan.","Two thirds":"Två tredjedelar","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Två fönster byter plats – släpp det ena på det andra eller använd tangenterna.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Två fönster byter plats: släpp det ena på det andra, eller med en tangent.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Använd kortkommandon","Use screen edges":"Använd skärmkanter","Use the system accent color":"Använd systemets accentfärg","Use the window magnet":"Använd fönstermagneten","Usual combinations":"Vanliga kombinationer","Wanted for: %1":"Önskad för: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"När ett fönster öppnas, stängs eller byts rör sig de andra mjukt i stället för att hoppa.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"När du ändrar storlek på ett fönster flyttar fönster som rör det den gemensamma kanten med – inget överlappar, ingen glipa uppstår.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Medan du ändrar storlek visas fönster som inte följer med genomskinliga.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Medan du flyttar eller ändrar storlek på ett fönster fäster dess kanter mot närliggande fönster och mot skärmkanterna.","Width":"Bredd","Window":"Fönster","Window magnet":"Fönstermagnet","Window magnet on/off":"Fönstermagnet på/av","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Fönster ovanför varandra håller ihop vänster- och högerkanter, fönster bredvid varandra över- och underkanter.","Windows glide to their place":"Fönster glider på plats","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Fönster fäster mot varandra och mot skärmkanterna.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Fönster stannar vid ”Avstånd mellan fönster” från sidan Allmänt i stället för att röra varandra.","Yes":"Ja","Your own combination":"Egen kombination","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Dina egna layouter och deras ordning går förlorade.","Zone %1":"Zon %1","for KWin · v%1":"för KWin · v%1","windows:":"fönster:","“%1” will be removed.":"”%1” tas bort.","…drag it onto window B…":"… dra det över fönster B …","…in every direction":"… åt alla håll","…let go: they trade places":"… släpp: de byter plats","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"… grannarna växer och krymper med","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Klart – klicka på OK för att öppna inställningsredigeraren."},"ta":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (நகல்)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 ஐ \"%2\" பயன்படுத்துகிறது.","%1 of %2 zones":"%2 இல் %1 மண்டலங்கள்","0 = all in one row":"0 = அனைத்தும் ஒரே வரிசையில்","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>பயன்முறை 1</b><br/>பட்டி மற்றும் திரை விளிம்புகள்","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>பயன்முறை 2</b><br/>தானியங்கி டைலிங்","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"ஓரம் அமைக்கப்பட்டிருந்தாலும் தனிச் சாளரம் முழுத் திரையையும் பயன்படுத்தும்.","A new window joins":"புதிய சாளரம் சேர்கிறது","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"ஒரு சிறு தள்ளு பாதி அல்லது கால்பகுதியைத் தரும். சாளரத்தை விளிம்பில் சற்று நேரம் கூடுதலாக வைத்தால் அது அடுத்த சாளரம் வரை வளரும் – முன்னோட்டம் அதைக் காட்டும்.","A single window":"ஒற்றைச் சாளரம்","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"வேகமாக நகர்த்தினாலும் சாளரம் மற்றொன்றின் ஓரத்தில் நிற்கும். விடுவிக்க சுட்டியை அசைக்கவும் அல்லது இன்னும் ஒரு கணம் தள்ளவும். 0 = சாளரங்கள் சுதந்திரமாக ஒன்றின் மேல் ஒன்று வரலாம்.","About & Help":"பற்றி & உதவி","Accent color":"முனைப்பு நிறம்","Active":"செயலில்","Active mode":"செயலில் உள்ள பயன்முறை","Active width along the top edge":"மேல் விளிம்பில் செயல்படும் அகலம்","Add an open application":"திறந்த பயன்பாட்டைச் சேர்","Add rule":"விதியைச் சேர்","All window features in one system.":"எல்லாச் சாளர அம்சங்களும் ஒரே அமைப்பில்.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"முதன்மைச் சாளரத்தின் அளவைக் கையால் மாற்றும் போதும் மாறும்.","Also while resizing":"அளவை மாற்றும்போதும்","Always floating":"எப்போதும் மிதக்கும்","Animation":"அசைவூட்டம்","Appearance":"தோற்றம்","Apply":"பயன்படுத்து","Arrange windows":"சாளரங்களை ஒழுங்குபடுத்து","Arrange windows automatically":"சாளரங்களைத் தானாக ஒழுங்குபடுத்து","Author":"ஆசிரியர்","Automatic tiling":"தானியங்கி டைலிங்","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"தானியங்கி டைலிங் அணைக்கப்பட்டுள்ளது – பயன்முறை 1 மட்டும் இயங்குகிறது, பயன்முறை குறுக்குவழி எதுவும் செய்யாது.","Automatic tiling off":"தானியங்கி டைலிங் அணைப்பு","Automatic tiling on":"தானியங்கி டைலிங் இயக்கம்","Automatic tiling on/off":"தானியங்கி டைலிங் இயக்கு/அணை","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"தானியங்கி டைலிங், சாளர மாற்றம், குறுக்குவழிகள் மற்றும் மிதக்கும் சாளரங்களுக்கான காந்தம்.","Background opacity":"பின்னணி ஒளிபுகாமை","Behavior & Animation":"நடத்தை & அசைவூட்டம்","Bottom edge: bottom half":"கீழ் விளிம்பு: கீழ் பாதி","Bouncy":"துள்ளல்","Buy me a coffee":"எனக்கு ஒரு காபி வாங்கித் தாருங்கள்","Cancel":"ரத்து","Center focus":"மையக் கவனம்","Center the window":"சாளரத்தை நடுவில் வை","Change":"மாற்று","Change key":"விசையை மாற்று","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"விசையை அமைப்புகள் திருத்தியில் மாற்றவும். இரண்டு பயன்முறைகளுக்கும் தானியங்கி டைலிங்கும் பட்டி அல்லது திரை விளிம்புகளும் தேவை.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"அவற்றை “விசைப்பலகை குறுக்குவழிகள்” பக்கத்தில் மாற்றவும். தானியங்கி டைலிங்கில் சாளரங்கள் வரிசையிலும் இடம் மாறும்.","Choose…":"தேர்ந்தெடு…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"தேர்ந்தெடுக்க மண்டலத்தைச் சொடுக்கவும் · பிரிக்க இருமுறை சொடுக்கவும் · பிரிப்பான்களை இழுக்கவும்","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"பயன்முறையை மாற்ற சொடுக்கவும் அல்லது %1 அழுத்தவும்.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"சொடுக்கி, பின் OK – அமைப்புகள் திருத்தி திறக்கும்.","Close":"மூடு","Close by, the edges stick together":"அருகில் வந்தால் விளிம்புகள் ஒட்டிக்கொள்ளும்","Color scheme":"நிறத் திட்டம்","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"பட்டியின் நிறங்கள், அளவு மற்றும் வடிவம்.","Columns":"நெடுவரிசைகள்","Corner radius":"மூலை ஆரம்","Corner size":"மூலை அளவு","Corner: a quarter":"மூலை: கால் பங்கு","Corners: quarter of the screen":"மூலைகள்: திரையின் கால்பகுதி","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + விசை (இயல்பு)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + எண் விசைப்பலகை","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + விசை","Custom color":"விருப்ப நிறம்","Custom layout %1":"விருப்பத் தளவமைப்பு %1","Dark":"அடர்","Delay before hiding":"மறைக்கும் முன் தாமதம்","Delay before showing":"காட்டும் முன் தாமதம்","Delete":"அழி","Delete layout?":"தளவமைப்பை அழிக்கவா?","Distance at which the handle appears":"கைப்பிடி தோன்றும் தூரம்","Distance before the bar hides again":"பட்டி மீண்டும் மறையும் முன் தூரம்","Distance to the edge":"விளிம்பிலிருந்து தூரம்","Donate with PayPal":"PayPal மூலம் நன்கொடை","Drag a shared edge…":"பொதுவான விளிம்பை இழுக்கவும்…","Drag a window against an edge…":"ஒரு சாளரத்தை விளிம்புக்கு இழுக்கவும்…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"மாற்ற ஒரு சாளரத்தை மற்றொன்றின் மீது இழுக்கவும். பட்டியில் அல்லது திரை விளிம்பில் விட்டால் அது சுதந்திரமாக மிதக்கும்; „சாளரத்தை மிதக்க விடு“ அதைத் திரும்பக் கொண்டுவரும். இடைவெளிகள் பொதுப் பக்கத்திலிருந்து வருகின்றன.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"ஒரு சாளரத்தை மற்றொன்றின் நடுவுக்கு இழுக்கவும் – முன்னோட்டம் இரண்டு அம்புகளைக் காட்டும் – பின் விடுங்கள். தானியங்கி டைலிங்கில் மற்றச் சாளரத்தின் மேல் எங்கும் போதும்.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"சாளரத்தைத் திரையின் மேல் விளிம்புக்கு இழுத்து ஒரு மண்டலத்தில் விடவும்.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"பட்டியில் வரிசையை மாற்ற அட்டைகளை இழுக்கவும். திருத்த ஒரு அட்டையை இருமுறை சொடுக்கவும்.","Drop a window onto another one":"சாளரத்தை மற்றொன்றின் மேல் விடு","Drop the window onto a zone":"சாளரத்தை ஒரு மண்டலத்தில் விடவும்","Duplicate":"நகலெடு","Duration":"கால அளவு","Dwindle":"உள்நோக்கிச் சுருள்","Dynamic":"ஆற்றல்மிக்க","Edges and corners":"விளிம்புகளும் மூலைகளும்","Edit":"திருத்து","Edit layout":"தளவமைப்பைத் திருத்து","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"ஒவ்வொரு அம்சத்தையும் தனியாக இயக்கலாம், அணைக்கலாம்.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"தளவமைப்புகள் பக்கத்தில் நீங்கள் உருவாக்கும் ஒவ்வொரு தளவமைப்பும் சாளரங்களையும் அடுக்கும் – அது மேலே தெரியும். சாளரம் 1 மண்டலம் 1-ஐப் பெறும், இப்படியே; கூடுதல் சாளரங்கள் கடைசி மண்டலத்தைப் பகிரும். மண்டலங்களைவிடக் குறைவான சாளரங்கள் இருந்தால் „முதன்மை மற்றும் அடுக்கு“ பயன்படும், இடைவெளிகள் வராது.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"டைலிங் சாளர மேலாளரில் போல, ஒவ்வொரு சாளரமும் தன் இடத்தைத் தானே கண்டுபிடிக்கும்.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"ஒவ்வொரு சாளரமும் திரையில் தன் இடத்தைத் தானே கண்டுபிடிக்கும். புதிய சாளரங்கள் சேரும், மூடியவை மற்றவற்றுக்கு இடம் விடும்.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"உதாரணம்: இரண்டு சாளரங்கள் அருகருகே, மூன்றிலிருந்து முதன்மை மற்றும் அடுக்கு, ஐந்திலிருந்து கட்டம். பொருந்தும் விதி இல்லையெனில் மேலே தேர்ந்த தளவமைப்பு பயன்படும்.","Fade in and out":"தோன்றும்போதும் மறையும்போதும் மங்கு","Fade the other windows":"மற்ற சாளரங்களை மங்கச் செய்","Features":"அம்சங்கள்","Feel":"உணர்வு","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"ஏற்கெனவே பொருத்திய சாளரங்களுக்கு ஏற்ப அமை","Fits the way you work.":"நீங்கள் வேலை செய்யும் விதத்துக்குப் பொருந்தும்.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"சாளரத்தை மிதக்க விடு (டைலிங்கிலிருந்து வெளியேறு)","Four quarters":"நான்கு கால்கள்","From":"இலிருந்து","Fullscreen":"முழுத்திரை","Gap between windows":"சாளரங்களுக்கு இடையிலான இடைவெளி","Gap to the screen edge":"திரை விளிம்புக்கான இடைவெளி","General":"பொது","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"ஒவ்வொரு செயலுக்கும் தேர்ந்த திட்டத்தின் விசையை மீண்டும் தருகிறது, திட்டத்தில் இல்லாத விசைகளை நீக்குகிறது.","Good to know":"தெரிந்துகொள்ள நல்லது","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"சாளரத்தை அதன் தலைப்புப் பட்டியால் பிடித்து மேலே இழுக்கவும். பட்டி கீழே இறங்கும்; சாளரத்தை ஒரு மண்டலத்தில் விட்டால் அது அந்தப் பகுதியைச் சரியாக நிரப்பும். மீண்டும் வெளியே இழுத்தால் பழைய அளவு திரும்பக் கிடைக்கும்.","Grab window A…":"சாளரம் A-வைப் பிடிக்கவும்…","Grid":"கட்டம்","Halves":"பாதிகள்","Hiding":"மறைத்தல்","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"காலியிடத்தை நிரப்ப விளிம்பில் பிடித்திரு","Hold time":"பிடித்திருக்கும் நேரம்","Hold to fill":"நிரப்ப பிடித்திரு","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"விளிம்பு இடத்தில் பொருந்துவதற்கு முன் எவ்வளவு அருகில் வர வேண்டும்.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"சுட்டி விளிம்புக்கு எவ்வளவு அருகில் வர வேண்டும்.","How far the bar slides down":"பட்டி எவ்வளவு கீழே இறங்குகிறது","How it works":"இது எப்படி வேலை செய்கிறது","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"சாளரம் விளிம்பில் எவ்வளவு நேரம் சாய்ந்திருக்க வேண்டும் – ஒரு சிறு தள்ளு. 0 = உடனே.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"வளர்வதற்கு முன் சாளரம் விளிம்பில் எவ்வளவு நேரம் இருக்க வேண்டும்.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"எத்தனை சாளரங்கள் முதன்மைப் பகுதியைப் பகிர்கின்றன (தளவமைப்பு “முதன்மை மற்றும் அடுக்கு”).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"கீழே ஏற்கெனவே சாளரம் இருந்தால், மேல் விளிம்பு பெரிதாக்குவதற்குப் பதில் மேல் பாதியைத் தரும். பாதிகளும் கால்பகுதிகளும் பொருத்திய சாளரங்களை மறைக்காது.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"KSnapUnity பிடித்திருந்தால், அதன் மேம்பாட்டை ஆதரிக்கலாம் – நன்றி!","In bar":"பட்டியில்","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"பட்டியிலிருந்தும் திரை விளிம்புகளிலிருந்தும் தனியானது.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"பட்டியிலிருந்து தனியானது. ஒவ்வொரு விளிம்பையும் தனியாக இயக்கலாம்.","Information":"தகவல்","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"இயல்பான, உள்ளுணர்வுடைய சாளர நடத்தை.","Join at the end":"கடைசியில் சேரும்","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K என்றால் KWin · Snap என்றால் புத்திசாலித்தனமான ஒட்டுதல் · Unity என்றால் எல்லாம் ஒரே அமைப்பில்","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE-க்குத் தனது சொந்த திரை விளிம்புச் செயல்களும் சாளரப் பொருத்தலும் உள்ளன. அதே அம்சம் இங்கே இயக்கத்தில் இருந்தால், KDE-யினுடையதை அணையுங்கள்: கணினி அமைப்புகள் → சாளர மேலாண்மை → திரை விளிம்புகள், மற்றும் சாளர நடத்தை → நகர்த்துதல்.","KDE's own edge tiling":"KDE-யின் சொந்த விளிம்பு ஓடு அமைப்பு","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"விளிம்புகளில் KDE-யின் சொந்த பெரிதாக்கலும் டைலிங்கும் – அதன் வெளிக்கோட்டுடன் – KSnapUnity இயங்கும்வரை நிறுத்தப்படும், அதனால் ஒரே முன்னோட்டம் தெரியும். உங்கள் KDE அமைப்புகள் மாறாது: இதை அணையுங்கள், KSnapUnity-ஐ முடக்குங்கள் அல்லது நீக்குங்கள், KDE-யின் நடத்தை திரும்பும்.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"KDE-யின் சொந்த திரை விளிம்புச் செயல்கள் இன்னும் இயக்கத்தில் உள்ளன, எனவே ஒரே இழுப்புக்கு இரண்டு உதவிகள் பதிலளிக்கின்றன. கணினி அமைப்புகள் → சாளர மேலாண்மை → திரை விளிம்புகள் என்பதில் \"பெரிதாக்கு\", \"ஓடு\" ஆகியவற்றை அணையுங்கள்.","KDE's own window snapping":"KDE-யின் சொந்த சாளரப் பொருத்தல்","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE-யின் சொந்த சாளரப் பொருத்தலும் இயக்கத்தில் உள்ளது. ஒரே மாதிரியான உணர்வுக்கு, கணினி அமைப்புகள் → சாளர மேலாண்மை → சாளர நடத்தை → நகர்த்துதல் என்பதில் அதன் மண்டலங்களை \"எதுவுமில்லை\" என அமையுங்கள்.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"KDE குறுக்குவழிச் சேவை பதிலளிக்கவில்லை. விசைகளைக் கணினி அமைப்புகள் → குறுக்குவழிகள் → KWin இல் இன்னும் அமைக்கலாம்.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – அமைப்புகள் திருத்தி","Keep stacked windows in line":"அடுக்கிய சாளரங்களை ஒரே வரிசையில் வை","Keep the gap between windows":"சாளரங்களுக்கு இடையிலான இடைவெளியை வைத்திரு","Keep them":"விட்டுவிடு","Key scheme":"விசைத் திட்டம்","Keyboard shortcuts":"விசைப்பலகை குறுக்குவழிகள்","Keys":"விசைகள்","Keys already in use":"ஏற்கெனவே பயன்பாட்டில் உள்ள விசைகள்","Layout":"தளவமைப்பு","Layout by number of windows":"சாளர எண்ணிக்கைப்படி தளவமைப்பு","Layouts":"தளவமைப்புகள்","Layouts per row":"ஒரு வரிசைக்கு தளவமைப்புகள்","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"இடது, வலது விளிம்பு: பாதித் திரை","Left edge: left half":"இடது விளிம்பு: இடது பாதி","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"100 %-க்குக் குறைவாக இருந்தால் தனிச் சாளரம் நடுவில் இருக்கும் – அகலத் திரைகளில் அழகு.","License":"உரிமம்","Light":"வெளிர்","Linear":"நேரியல்","Live preview":"நேரலை முன்னோட்டம்","Load template…":"வார்ப்புருவை ஏற்று…","Magnet":"காந்தம்","Main + stack":"முதன்மை + அடுக்கு","Main and stack":"முதன்மை மற்றும் அடுக்கு","Main area bigger":"பெரிய முதன்மைப் பகுதி","Main area on the right":"முதன்மைப் பகுதி வலப்பக்கம்","Main area smaller":"சிறிய முதன்மைப் பகுதி","Main in the middle":"நடுவில் முதன்மை","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"இழுத்தலுக்கும் விசைகளுக்குமான முதன்மை நிலைமாற்றி.","Main window":"முதன்மைச் சாளரம்","Main windows":"முதன்மைச் சாளரங்கள்","Main windows: %1":"முதன்மைச் சாளரங்கள்: %1","Make it the main window":"முதன்மைச் சாளரமாக்கு","Maximize":"பெரிதாக்கு","Maximize or restore":"பெரிதாக்கு அல்லது மீட்டமை","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + விசை (KDE பாணி)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + விசை","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + விசை","Minimize":"சிறிதாக்கு","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"தளவமைப்பைப் பிரதிபலிக்கும்: முதன்மைச் சாளரம் வலம், மற்றவை இடம்.","Mode":"பயன்முறை","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"பயன்முறை 1 – பட்டி மற்றும் திரை விளிம்புகள்","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"பயன்முறை 2 – தானியங்கி டைலிங்","Modes":"பயன்முறைகள்","More ways":"மேலும் வழிகள்","Motion curve":"இயக்க வளைவு","Move a window towards others…":"ஒரு சாளரத்தை மற்றவற்றின் அருகே நகர்த்தவும்…","Move the window one place back":"சாளரத்தை ஒரு இடம் பின் நகர்த்து","Move the window one place on":"சாளரத்தை ஒரு இடம் முன் நகர்த்து","Name:":"பெயர்:","New layout":"புதிய தளவமைப்பு","New windows":"புதிய சாளரங்கள்","Next tiling layout":"அடுத்த டைலிங் தளவமைப்பு","Next to the active window":"செயலில் உள்ள சாளரத்தின் அருகில்","No key":"விசை இல்லை","No other window open":"வேறு சாளரம் திறந்திருக்கவில்லை","No outer margin":"வெளி ஓரம் இல்லை","No shortcuts":"குறுக்குவழிகள் இல்லை","None":"எதுவுமில்லை","None yet.":"இன்னும் இல்லை.","Off":"அணைவு","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"அணை = பயன்முறை 1, இயக்கு = பயன்முறை 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"அணைவு: நடுநிலை சட்டம் – இயக்கத்தில் உள்ள முன்னோட்டங்களுக்கு மட்டும்.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"அணைவு: விசைகள் ஒதுக்கப்பட்டபடியே இருக்கும், ஆனால் எதுவும் செய்யாது.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"அணை: சாளரங்கள் நீங்கள் வைத்த இடத்திலேயே இருக்கும். மற்ற அம்சங்கள் எப்படியும் வேலை செய்யும்.","One at a time":"ஒவ்வொன்றாக","One closes – the others fill the gap":"ஒன்று மூடுகிறது – மற்றவை இடைவெளியை நிரப்புகின்றன","One main window less":"ஒரு முதன்மை சாளரம் குறைவு","One more main window":"இன்னும் ஒரு முதன்மை சாளரம்","One window":"ஒரு சாளரம்","Only one mode is switched on.":"ஒரே ஒரு பயன்முறை மட்டும் இயக்கத்தில் உள்ளது.","Open settings editor":"அமைப்புகள் திருத்தியைத் திற","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"முதலில் பயன்பாட்டைத் திறந்து, பின் இங்கே தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும்.","Open the layout builder":"தளவமைப்பு உருவாக்கியைத் திற","Own layouts":"சொந்த தளவமைப்புகள்","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"ஒவ்வொரு பக்கத்திலும் மூலையாகக் கணக்கிடப்படும் பகுதி.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"KDE-யின் விளிம்பு ஓடு அமைப்பையும் அதன் முன்னோட்டத்தையும் இடைநிறுத்து","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"காந்தம் இயக்கத்தில் இருக்கும்போது KDE-யின் பொருத்தும் மண்டலங்களை இடைநிறுத்து","Preview":"முன்னோட்டம்","Previews":"முன்னோட்டங்கள்","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"சாளரத்தைத் திரையின் விளிம்பு அல்லது மூலையில் தள்ளினால் அது அந்தப் பகுதியை நிரப்பும். பட்டியுடனும் அது இல்லாமலும் வேலை செய்யும்.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"சாளரத்தை விளிம்பு அல்லது மூலையில் தள்ளுங்கள்: பெரிதாக்கு, பாதிகள், கால்பகுதிகள்.","Push delay":"தள்ளுதல் தாமதம்","Quarters":"கால்பகுதிகள்","Quick":"விரைவு","Quick settings":"விரைவு அமைப்புகள்","Recommended values":"பரிந்துரைக்கப்பட்ட மதிப்புகள்","Remove":"நீக்கு","Remove rule":"விதியை நீக்கு","Remove zone":"மண்டலத்தை நீக்கு","Reset all":"அனைத்தையும் மீட்டமை","Reset all keys":"எல்லா விசைகளையும் மீட்டமை","Reset to default":"இயல்புக்கு மீட்டமை","Resistance against overlapping":"மேலெழுதலுக்கு எதிர்ப்பு","Resize touching windows together":"தொட்டுக்கொள்ளும் சாளரங்களின் அளவை ஒன்றாக மாற்று","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"அளவை மாற்றும்போதும் ஒட்டும் – இங்கே முழு உயரத்துக்கு","Restore":"மீட்டமை","Restore default layouts":"இயல்புத் தளவமைப்புகளை மீட்டமை","Restore default layouts?":"இயல்புத் தளவமைப்புகளை மீட்டமைக்கவா?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"சாளரத்தை வெளியே இழுக்கும்போது அசல் அளவை மீட்டமை","Restore the size before snapping":"பொருத்துவதற்கு முந்தைய அளவை மீட்டமை","Rows":"வரிசைகள்","Save":"சேமி","Screen edges":"திரை விளிம்புகள்","Screen edges on/off":"திரை விளிம்புகள் இயக்கு/அணை","Screen edges preview":"திரை விளிம்புகளின் முன்னோட்டம்","Set":"அமை","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"எல்லாச் செயல்களின் விசைகளையும் ஒரே நேரத்தில் அமைக்கிறது. தனித்தனி விசைகளைக் கீழே இன்னும் மாற்றலாம்.","Settings":"அமைப்புகள்","Settings file":"அமைப்புக் கோப்பு","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"அளவு மாற்றும் போது சுட்டியை வேகமாக முன்னும் பின்னும் அசைத்தால் மற்ற சாளரங்கள் திரும்பும். ஒரு திசையில் வேகமான இழுப்பு அவற்றை ஒருபோதும் விடுவிக்காது.","Shake to let go":"விடுவிக்க அசை","Shortcuts":"குறுக்குவழிகள்","Show a small handle first":"முதலில் சிறிய கைப்பிடியைக் காட்டு","Show layout and zone names":"தளவமைப்பு மற்றும் மண்டலப் பெயர்களைக் காட்டு","Show previews in the accent color":"முன்னோட்டங்களை முனைப்பு நிறத்தில் காட்டு","Showing":"காட்டுதல்","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"விளிம்பில் அல்லது மூலையில் சாளரம் எங்கே அமையும் என்று காட்டும். அணைவு: முன்னோட்டமே இல்லை.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"பட்டியின் ஒரு மண்டலம் ஒளிர்ந்திருக்கும்போது சாளரம் எங்கே அமையும் என்று காட்டும். அணைவு: முன்னோட்டமே இல்லை.","Sidebar + grid":"பக்கப்பட்டி + கட்டம்","Single zone":"ஒற்றை மண்டலம்","Six tiles":"ஆறு ஓடுகள்","Size & shape":"அளவு & வடிவம்","Size of the main area":"முதன்மைப் பகுதியின் அளவு","Slide-in duration":"உள்ளே வரும் நேரம்","Slide-out duration":"வெளியே போகும் நேரம்","Smart arranging and detection.":"புத்திசாலியான அடுக்கலும் கண்டறிதலும்.","Smart fill":"அறிவார்ந்த நிரப்புதல்","Smooth (default)":"மென்மையான (இயல்பு)","Snap bar":"பட்டி","Snap bar and screen edges":"பட்டி மற்றும் திரை விளிம்புகள்","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"பட்டியும் விளிம்புகளும் அணைக்கப்பட்டுள்ளன – பயன்முறை 2 மட்டும் இயங்குகிறது, பயன்முறை குறுக்குவழி எதுவும் செய்யாது.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"பட்டியும் திரை விளிம்புகளும் தானியங்கி டைலிங்கிற்கு இடையூறு. அதனால் அவை இரண்டு பயன்முறைகளாக இயங்குகின்றன – குறுக்குவழியால் அல்லது இங்கே மாற்றவும்.","Snap bar colors:":"பட்டியின் நிறங்கள்:","Snap bar on/off":"பட்டி இயக்கு/அணை","Snap bar preview":"பட்டியின் முன்னோட்டம்","Snap bar size":"பட்டியின் அளவு","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"பட்டி, திரை விளிம்புகள், சாளரக் காந்தம், குறுக்குவழிகள் மற்றும் சாளர மாற்றம்.","Snap distance":"ஒட்டும் தூரம்","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"பிரிப்பான்களைப் பொருத்து (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"ஒட்டுதல் தளவமைப்புகள் மற்றும் தானியங்கி டைலிங்.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"செயலில் உள்ள சாளரத்தை விசைச் சேர்க்கைகளால் பொருத்துங்கள்.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"செயலில் உள்ள சாளரத்தை விசைப்பலகையால் பொருத்துங்கள். இவை வழக்கமான KDE உலகளாவிய குறுக்குவழிகள் – கணினி அமைப்புகள் → குறுக்குவழிகள் → KWin இலும் காணலாம்.","Snap to the bottom half":"கீழ் பாதியில் பொருத்து","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"கீழ்-இடது கால்பகுதியில் பொருத்து","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"கீழ்-வலது கால்பகுதியில் பொருத்து","Snap to the center third":"நடு மூன்றிலொன்றில் பொருத்து","Snap to the left half":"இடது பாதியில் பொருத்து","Snap to the left third":"இடது மூன்றிலொன்றில் பொருத்து","Snap to the left two thirds":"இடது மூன்றில் இரண்டில் பொருத்து","Snap to the right half":"வலது பாதியில் பொருத்து","Snap to the right third":"வலது மூன்றிலொன்றில் பொருத்து","Snap to the right two thirds":"வலது மூன்றில் இரண்டில் பொருத்து","Snap to the top half":"மேல் பாதியில் பொருத்து","Snap to the top-left quarter":"மேல்-இடது கால்பகுதியில் பொருத்து","Snap to the top-right quarter":"மேல்-வலது கால்பகுதியில் பொருத்து","Snapping":"பொருத்துதல்","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"ஒட்டுதலும் தானியங்கி டைலிங்கும் இரண்டு பயன்முறைகளாக இயங்குகின்றன – ஒரு குறுக்குவழி இரண்டுக்கும் இடையே மாற்றும்.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"இதனால் ஒரே காந்தம் மட்டுமே சாளரத்தை இழுக்கும். உங்கள் KDE அமைப்புகள் மாறாது: இதை அணையுங்கள், KSnapUnity-ஐ முடக்குங்கள் அல்லது நீக்குங்கள், KDE-யின் ஒட்டுதல் திரும்பும்.","Soft":"இதமான","Spacing":"இடைவெளிகள்","Spiral":"சுருள்","Split side by side":"அருகருகே பிரி","Split top and bottom":"மேலும் கீழுமாகப் பிரி","Stack + main":"அடுக்கு + முதன்மை","Stick to other windows":"மற்ற சாளரங்களில் ஒட்டு","Stick to the screen edges":"திரை விளிம்புகளில் ஒட்டு","Sticky edges":"ஒட்டும் விளிம்புகள்","Support KSnapUnity":"KSnapUnity-ஐ ஆதரியுங்கள்","Swap":"மாற்று","Swap windows":"சாளரங்களை மாற்றிடு","Swap with the window above":"மேலுள்ள சாளரத்துடன் மாற்று","Swap with the window below":"கீழுள்ள சாளரத்துடன் மாற்று","Swap with the window on the left":"இடது சாளரத்துடன் மாற்று","Swap with the window on the right":"வலது சாளரத்துடன் மாற்று","Switch mode":"பயன்முறையை மாற்று","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"பயன்முறையை மாற்று (ஒட்டுதல் / டைலிங்)","Switch modes with:":"பயன்முறை மாற்றும் விசை:","Switch the layout by itself":"தளவமைப்பைத் தானாக மாற்று","Switched off":"அணைக்கப்பட்டது","System":"அமைப்பு","Take it over":"எடுத்துக்கொள்","Take over all":"அனைத்தையும் எடுத்துக்கொள்","Take the main place":"முதன்மை இடத்தை எடுக்கும்","Test animation":"அசைவூட்டத்தைச் சோதி","Test on screen":"திரையில் சோதி","Test the snap bar":"பட்டியைச் சோதி","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"இயல்பு மதிப்புகள் Windows 11 ஐ அடிப்படையாகக் கொண்டவை.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"பொருத்தும் செயல்கள் பட்டியின் அதே இடைவெளிகளைப் பயன்படுத்துகின்றன, பொருத்துவதற்கு முந்தைய அளவையும் நினைவில் கொள்கின்றன: \"பொருத்துவதற்கு முந்தைய அளவை மீட்டமை\" அதைத் திருப்பித் தரும்.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"இந்தப் பயன்பாடுகள் ஒருபோதும் அடுக்கப்படாது, தங்கள் இடத்தை வைத்துக்கொள்ளும். உரையாடல்கள் எப்போதும் மிதக்கும்.","Thirds":"மூன்றிலொன்றுகள்","Three columns":"மூன்று நெடுவரிசைகள்","Thumbnail width":"சிறுபடங்களின் அகலம்","Tiling":"டைலிங்","Tip":"குறிப்பு","Top / bottom":"மேல் / கீழ்","Top edge":"மேல் விளிம்பு","Top edge: full screen":"மேல் விளிம்பு: முழுத் திரை","Top edge: maximize":"மேல் விளிம்பு: பெரிதாக்கு","Top edge: top half":"மேல் விளிம்பு: மேல் பாதி","Top half":"மேல் பாதி","Trigger distance from the top edge":"மேல் விளிம்பிலிருந்து தூண்டும் தூரம்","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"KDE-யின் சொந்த வெளிக்கோடு பிடித்திருந்தால் இதை அணையுங்கள் – பின் மேலே உள்ள திரை விளிம்புகளின் முன்னோட்டத்தை அணையுங்கள்.","Two thirds":"மூன்றில் இரண்டு","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"இரண்டு சாளரங்கள் இடம் மாறுகின்றன – ஒன்றை மற்றொன்றின் மீது விடுங்கள் அல்லது விசைகளைப் பயன்படுத்துங்கள்.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"இரண்டு சாளரங்கள் இடம் மாறுகின்றன: ஒன்றை மற்றொன்றின் மீது விடுங்கள், அல்லது விசையால்.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"விசைப்பலகை குறுக்குவழிகளைப் பயன்படுத்து","Use screen edges":"திரை விளிம்புகளைப் பயன்படுத்து","Use the system accent color":"அமைப்பின் முனைப்பு நிறத்தைப் பயன்படுத்து","Use the window magnet":"சாளரக் காந்தத்தைப் பயன்படுத்து","Usual combinations":"வழக்கமான சேர்க்கைகள்","Version":"பதிப்பு","Wanted for: %1":"தேவைப்படுவது: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"ஒரு சாளரம் திறக்கும்போது, மூடும்போது அல்லது மாறும்போது, மற்றவை குதிக்காமல் மென்மையாக நகரும்.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"ஒரு சாளரத்தின் அளவை மாற்றும்போது அதைத் தொடும் சாளரங்கள் பகிர்ந்த விளிம்பை உடன் நகர்த்துகின்றன – எதுவும் மேலெழுதாது, இடைவெளி வராது.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"அளவை மாற்றும்போது உடன் வராத சாளரங்கள் ஒளிபுகும் வகையில் காட்டப்படும்.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"சாளரத்தை நகர்த்தும்போது அல்லது அளவை மாற்றும்போது, அதன் விளிம்புகள் அருகிலுள்ள சாளரங்களிலும் திரை விளிம்புகளிலும் ஒட்டிக்கொள்கின்றன.","Width":"அகலம்","Window":"சாளரம்","Window magnet":"சாளரக் காந்தம்","Window magnet on/off":"சாளரக் காந்தம் இயக்கு/அணை","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"ஒன்றன் மேல் ஒன்றான சாளரங்கள் இடது, வலது விளிம்புகளையும், அருகருகே உள்ளவை மேல், கீழ் விளிம்புகளையும் சேர்த்து வைக்கின்றன.","Windows glide to their place":"சாளரங்கள் தங்கள் இடத்துக்கு மென்மையாக நகரும்","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"சாளரங்கள் ஒன்றோடொன்றும் திரை விளிம்புகளோடும் ஒட்டிக்கொள்கின்றன.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"சாளரங்கள் தொட்டுக்கொள்ளாமல் பொது பக்கத்தின் \"சாளரங்களுக்கு இடையிலான இடைவெளி\"யில் நிற்கும்.","Yes":"ஆம்","Your own combination":"உங்கள் சொந்த சேர்க்கை","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"உங்கள் சொந்தத் தளவமைப்புகளும் அவற்றின் வரிசையும் இழக்கப்படும்.","Zone %1":"மண்டலம் %1","for KWin · v%1":"KWin-க்கு · v%1","windows:":"சாளரங்கள்:","“%1” will be removed.":"\"%1\" நீக்கப்படும்.","…drag it onto window B…":"…அதைச் சாளரம் B மீது இழுக்கவும்…","…in every direction":"…எல்லாத் திசைகளிலும்","…let go: they trade places":"…விடுங்கள்: அவை இடம் மாறுகின்றன","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…அண்டைச் சாளரங்கள் அதனுடன் பெரிதாகி சிறிதாகும்","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ தயார் – அமைப்புகள் திருத்தியைத் திறக்க OK சொடுக்கவும்."},"te":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (నకలు)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 ని \"%2\" వాడుతోంది.","%1 of %2 zones":"%2 లో %1 జోన్‌లు","0 = all in one row":"0 = అన్నీ ఒకే వరుసలో","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>మోడ్ 1</b><br/>స్నాప్ బార్ మరియు స్క్రీన్ అంచులు","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>మోడ్ 2</b><br/>ఆటోమేటిక్ టైలింగ్","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"అంచు సెట్ చేసినా ఒంటరి విండో మొత్తం తెరను వాడుతుంది.","A new window joins":"కొత్త విండో చేరుతుంది","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"చిన్న తోపు సగం లేదా పావు భాగం ఇస్తుంది. విండోను అంచు వద్ద కొంచెం ఎక్కువసేపు ఉంచితే అది తర్వాతి విండో వరకు పెరుగుతుంది – ప్రివ్యూ అది చూపిస్తుంది.","A single window":"ఒకే విండో","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"వేగంగా కదిలించినా విండో మరో విండో అంచు వద్ద ఆగుతుంది. విడిపించడానికి మౌస్‌ను కదిలించండి లేదా మరో క్షణం నెట్టండి. 0 = విండోలు స్వేచ్ఛగా ఒకదానిపై ఒకటి రావచ్చు.","About & Help":"గురించి & సహాయం","Accent color":"యాక్సెంట్ రంగు","Active":"సక్రియం","Active mode":"క్రియాశీల మోడ్","Active width along the top edge":"పై అంచు వెంట సక్రియ వెడల్పు","Add an open application":"తెరిచిన యాప్‌ను జోడించు","Add rule":"నియమం జోడించు","All window features in one system.":"అన్ని విండో ఫీచర్లు ఒకే వ్యవస్థలో.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"ప్రధాన విండో పరిమాణాన్ని చేతితో మార్చినప్పుడూ మారుతుంది.","Also while resizing":"పరిమాణం మార్చేటప్పుడు కూడా","Always floating":"ఎల్లప్పుడూ తేలేవి","Animation":"యానిమేషన్","Appearance":"రూపం","Apply":"వర్తింపజేయి","Arrange windows":"విండోలను అమర్చు","Arrange windows automatically":"విండోలను ఆటోమేటిక్‌గా అమర్చు","Author":"రచయిత","Automatic tiling":"ఆటోమేటిక్ టైలింగ్","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"ఆటోమేటిక్ టైలింగ్ ఆపివేయబడింది – మోడ్ 1 మాత్రమే నడుస్తుంది, మోడ్ షార్ట్‌కట్ ఏమీ చేయదు.","Automatic tiling off":"ఆటోమేటిక్ టైలింగ్ ఆఫ్","Automatic tiling on":"ఆటోమేటిక్ టైలింగ్ ఆన్","Automatic tiling on/off":"ఆటోమేటిక్ టైలింగ్ ఆన్/ఆఫ్","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"ఆటోమేటిక్ టైలింగ్, విండోల మార్పిడి, షార్ట్‌కట్‌లు మరియు తేలే విండోల కోసం అయస్కాంతం.","Background opacity":"నేపథ్య అపారదర్శకత","Behavior & Animation":"ప్రవర్తన & యానిమేషన్","Bottom edge: bottom half":"కింది అంచు: కింది సగం","Bouncy":"ఎగిరే","Buy me a coffee":"నాకు ఒక కాఫీ ఇప్పించండి","Cancel":"రద్దు","Center focus":"మధ్యలో దృష్టి","Center the window":"విండోను మధ్యలో ఉంచు","Change":"మార్చు","Change key":"కీ మార్చు","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"కీని సెట్టింగ్‌ల ఎడిటర్‌లో మార్చండి. రెండు మోడ్‌లకూ ఆటోమేటిక్ టైలింగ్ మరియు స్నాప్ బార్ లేదా స్క్రీన్ అంచులు అవసరం.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"వాటిని “కీబోర్డ్ షార్ట్‌కట్‌లు” పేజీలో మార్చండి. ఆటోమేటిక్ టైలింగ్‌లో విండోలు క్రమంలోనూ స్థానాలు మార్చుకుంటాయి.","Choose…":"ఎంచుకోండి…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"ఎంచుకోవడానికి జోన్‌పై క్లిక్ చేయండి · విభజించడానికి డబుల్-క్లిక్ చేయండి · విభాజకాలను లాగండి","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"మోడ్ మార్చడానికి క్లిక్ చేయండి లేదా %1 నొక్కండి.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"క్లిక్ చేసి, ఆపై OK – సెట్టింగ్‌ల ఎడిటర్ తెరుచుకుంటుంది.","Close":"మూసివేయి","Close by, the edges stick together":"దగ్గరకు వస్తే అంచులు అతుక్కుంటాయి","Color scheme":"రంగుల పథకం","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"స్నాప్ బార్ రంగులు, పరిమాణం మరియు ఆకారం.","Columns":"నిలువు వరుసలు","Corner radius":"మూలల వ్యాసార్ధం","Corner size":"మూల పరిమాణం","Corner: a quarter":"మూల: పావు భాగం","Corners: quarter of the screen":"మూలలు: స్క్రీన్‌లో పావు భాగం","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + కీ (డిఫాల్ట్)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + నంబర్ ప్యాడ్","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + కీ","Custom color":"అనుకూల రంగు","Custom layout %1":"అనుకూల లేఅవుట్ %1","Dark":"ముదురు","Delay before hiding":"దాచే ముందు ఆలస్యం","Delay before showing":"చూపించే ముందు ఆలస్యం","Delete":"తొలగించు","Delete layout?":"లేఅవుట్‌ను తొలగించాలా?","Distance at which the handle appears":"హ్యాండిల్ కనిపించే దూరం","Distance before the bar hides again":"బార్ మళ్ళీ దాగే ముందు దూరం","Distance to the edge":"అంచు నుంచి దూరం","Donate with PayPal":"PayPal ద్వారా విరాళం ఇవ్వండి","Drag a shared edge…":"ఉమ్మడి అంచును లాగండి…","Drag a window against an edge…":"విండోను అంచు వైపు లాగండి…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"మార్చడానికి ఒక విండోను మరొకదానిపైకి లాగండి. స్నాప్ బార్‌పై లేదా స్క్రీన్ అంచుపై వదిలితే అది స్వేచ్ఛగా తేలుతుంది; „విండోను తేలనివ్వు“ దాన్ని వెనక్కి తెస్తుంది. ఖాళీలు సాధారణ పేజీ నుండి వస్తాయి.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"విండోను మరొకదాని మధ్య పైకి లాగండి – ప్రివ్యూ రెండు బాణాలు చూపుతుంది – మరియు వదలండి. ఆటోమేటిక్ టైలింగ్‌లో మరో విండో పైన ఎక్కడైనా సరిపోతుంది.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"విండోను స్క్రీన్ పై అంచుకు లాగి ఒక జోన్‌పై వదలండి.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"స్నాప్ బార్‌లో క్రమాన్ని మార్చడానికి కార్డులను లాగండి. సవరించడానికి కార్డుపై డబుల్-క్లిక్ చేయండి.","Drop a window onto another one":"విండోను మరొకదానిపై వదులు","Drop the window onto a zone":"విండోను ఒక జోన్‌పై వదలండి","Duplicate":"నకిలీ చేయి","Duration":"వ్యవధి","Dwindle":"లోపలి సర్పిలం","Dynamic":"చలనాత్మక","Edges and corners":"అంచులు, మూలలు","Edit":"సవరించు","Edit layout":"లేఅవుట్‌ను సవరించు","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"ప్రతి ఫీచర్‌ను విడిగా ఆన్ మరియు ఆఫ్ చేయవచ్చు.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"లేఅవుట్‌ల పేజీలో మీరు నిర్మించే ప్రతి లేఅవుట్ విండోలను కూడా అమర్చగలదు – అది పైన కనిపిస్తుంది. విండో 1 కి జోన్ 1 వస్తుంది, ఇలా; అదనపు విండోలు చివరి జోన్‌ను పంచుకుంటాయి. జోన్‌ల కంటే తక్కువ విండోలు ఉంటే „ప్రధానం మరియు కుప్ప“ వాడబడుతుంది, ఖాళీలు ఉండవు.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"టైలింగ్ విండో మేనేజర్‌లో లాగా, ప్రతి విండో తన స్థానాన్ని తానే కనుగొంటుంది.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"ప్రతి విండో స్క్రీన్‌పై తన స్థానాన్ని తానే కనుగొంటుంది. కొత్త విండోలు చేరతాయి, మూసినవి మిగతావాటికి చోటిస్తాయి.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"ఉదాహరణ: రెండు విండోలు పక్కపక్కన, మూడు నుండి ప్రధానం మరియు కుప్ప, ఐదు నుండి గ్రిడ్. సరిపోయే నియమం లేకుంటే పైన ఎంచుకున్న లేఅవుట్ వాడబడుతుంది.","Fade in and out":"వచ్చేటప్పుడు, వెళ్ళేటప్పుడు ఫేడ్ చేయి","Fade the other windows":"ఇతర విండోలను మసకబార్చు","Features":"ఫీచర్లు","Feel":"అనుభూతి","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"ఇప్పటికే స్నాప్ అయిన విండోలకు తగ్గట్టు సర్దుకో","Fits the way you work.":"మీ పని తీరుకు సరిపోతుంది.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"విండోను తేలనివ్వు (టైలింగ్ నుండి బయటకు)","Four quarters":"నాలుగు పావులు","From":"నుండి","Fullscreen":"పూర్తి స్క్రీన్","Gap between windows":"విండోల మధ్య ఖాళీ","Gap to the screen edge":"స్క్రీన్ అంచుకు ఖాళీ","General":"సాధారణం","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"ప్రతి చర్యకు ఎంచుకున్న పథకం కీని మళ్లీ ఇస్తుంది, పథకంలో లేని కీలను తీసివేస్తుంది.","Good to know":"తెలుసుకోవడం మంచిది","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"విండోను దాని శీర్షిక పట్టీ ద్వారా పట్టుకుని పైకి లాగండి. స్నాప్ బార్ కిందకు జారుతుంది; విండోను ఒక జోన్‌పై వదలండి, అది సరిగ్గా ఆ ప్రాంతాన్ని నింపుతుంది. మళ్ళీ బయటకు లాగితే పాత పరిమాణం తిరిగి వస్తుంది.","Grab window A…":"విండో A ని పట్టుకోండి…","Grid":"గ్రిడ్","Halves":"సగాలు","Hiding":"దాచడం","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"ఖాళీ స్థలాన్ని నింపడానికి అంచు వద్ద పట్టి ఉంచు","Hold time":"పట్టి ఉంచే సమయం","Hold to fill":"నింపడానికి పట్టి ఉంచు","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"అంచు స్థానంలో కుదురుకునే ముందు ఎంత దగ్గరగా రావాలి.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"కర్సర్ అంచుకు ఎంత దగ్గరగా రావాలి.","How far the bar slides down":"బార్ ఎంత కిందకు జారుతుంది","How it works":"ఇది ఎలా పనిచేస్తుంది","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"విండో అంచుకు ఎంతసేపు ఆనుకుని ఉండాలి – చిన్న తోపు. 0 = వెంటనే.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"పెరగడానికి ముందు విండో అంచు వద్ద ఎంతసేపు ఉండాలి.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"ఎన్ని విండోలు ప్రధాన ప్రాంతాన్ని పంచుకుంటాయి (లేఅవుట్ “ప్రధానం మరియు కుప్ప”).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"కింద ఇప్పటికే విండో ఉంటే, పై అంచు గరిష్ఠీకరించకుండా పై సగాన్ని ఇస్తుంది. సగాలు, పావు భాగాలు కూడా స్నాప్ అయిన విండోలను కప్పవు.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"మీకు KSnapUnity నచ్చితే, దాని అభివృద్ధికి మద్దతు ఇవ్వవచ్చు – ధన్యవాదాలు!","In bar":"బార్‌లో","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"స్నాప్ బార్, స్క్రీన్ అంచులతో సంబంధం లేదు.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"స్నాప్ బార్‌తో సంబంధం లేదు. ప్రతి అంచును విడిగా ఆన్ చేయవచ్చు.","Information":"సమాచారం","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"సహజమైన, సులభమైన విండో ప్రవర్తన.","Join at the end":"చివరన చేరతాయి","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K అంటే KWin · Snap అంటే తెలివైన స్నాపింగ్ · Unity అంటే అన్నీ ఒకే వ్యవస్థలో","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDEకి సొంత స్క్రీన్ అంచు చర్యలు, సొంత విండో స్నాపింగ్ ఉన్నాయి. ఇక్కడ అదే ఫీచర్ ఆన్‌లో ఉంటే, KDEది ఆఫ్ చేయండి: సిస్టమ్ సెట్టింగ్‌లు → విండో నిర్వహణ → స్క్రీన్ అంచులు, ఇంకా విండో ప్రవర్తన → కదలిక.","KDE's own edge tiling":"KDE సొంత అంచు టైలింగ్","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"అంచుల వద్ద KDE సొంత గరిష్ఠీకరణ మరియు టైలింగ్ – దాని రూపురేఖతో – KSnapUnity నడుస్తున్నంత వరకు ఆగుతాయి, అందువల్ల ఒకే ప్రివ్యూ కనిపిస్తుంది. మీ KDE సెట్టింగ్‌లు మారవు: దీన్ని ఆపివేయండి, KSnapUnity ని నిలిపివేయండి లేదా తొలగించండి, KDE ప్రవర్తన తిరిగి వస్తుంది.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"KDE సొంత స్క్రీన్ అంచు చర్యలు ఇంకా ఆన్‌లో ఉన్నాయి, కాబట్టి ఒకే లాగుడుకు ఇద్దరు సహాయకులు స్పందిస్తారు. సిస్టమ్ సెట్టింగ్‌లు → విండో నిర్వహణ → స్క్రీన్ అంచులులో \"గరిష్ఠీకరించు\", \"టైల్\" ఆఫ్ చేయండి.","KDE's own window snapping":"KDE సొంత విండో స్నాపింగ్","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE సొంత విండో స్నాపింగ్ కూడా ఆన్‌లో ఉంది. ఏకరీతి అనుభూతి కోసం సిస్టమ్ సెట్టింగ్‌లు → విండో నిర్వహణ → విండో ప్రవర్తన → కదలికలో దాని జోన్‌లను \"ఏదీ లేదు\"కి సెట్ చేయండి.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"KDE షార్ట్‌కట్ సేవ స్పందించలేదు. మీరు కీలను సిస్టమ్ సెట్టింగ్‌లు → షార్ట్‌కట్‌లు → KWinలో ఇంకా సెట్ చేయవచ్చు.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – సెట్టింగ్‌ల ఎడిటర్","Keep stacked windows in line":"పేర్చిన విండోలను ఒకే వరుసలో ఉంచు","Keep the gap between windows":"విండోల మధ్య ఖాళీని ఉంచు","Keep them":"ఉంచు","Key scheme":"కీ పథకం","Keyboard shortcuts":"కీబోర్డ్ షార్ట్‌కట్‌లు","Keys":"కీలు","Keys already in use":"ఇప్పటికే వాడుతున్న కీలు","Layout":"లేఅవుట్","Layout by number of windows":"విండోల సంఖ్య ప్రకారం లేఅవుట్","Layouts":"లేఅవుట్‌లు","Layouts per row":"ఒక్కో వరుసకు లేఅవుట్‌లు","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"ఎడమ, కుడి అంచు: సగం స్క్రీన్","Left edge: left half":"ఎడమ అంచు: ఎడమ సగం","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"100 % కంటే తక్కువ అయితే ఒంటరి విండో మధ్యలో ఉంటుంది – వెడల్పైన తెరలపై బాగుంటుంది.","License":"లైసెన్స్","Light":"లేత","Linear":"రేఖీయ","Live preview":"ప్రత్యక్ష ప్రివ్యూ","Load template…":"టెంప్లేట్‌ను లోడ్ చేయి…","Magnet":"అయస్కాంతం","Main + stack":"ప్రధాన + స్టాక్","Main and stack":"ప్రధానం మరియు కుప్ప","Main area bigger":"పెద్ద ప్రధాన ప్రాంతం","Main area on the right":"ప్రధాన ప్రాంతం కుడివైపు","Main area smaller":"చిన్న ప్రధాన ప్రాంతం","Main in the middle":"మధ్యలో ప్రధానం","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"లాగడం మరియు కీల కోసం ప్రధాన స్విచ్.","Main window":"ప్రధాన విండో","Main windows":"ప్రధాన విండోలు","Main windows: %1":"ప్రధాన విండోలు: %1","Make it the main window":"ప్రధాన విండోగా చేయి","Maximize":"గరిష్ఠీకరించు","Maximize or restore":"గరిష్ఠీకరించు లేదా పునరుద్ధరించు","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + కీ (KDE శైలి)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + కీ","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + కీ","Minimize":"కనిష్ఠీకరించు","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"లేఅవుట్‌ను అద్దంలా తిప్పుతుంది: ప్రధాన విండో కుడివైపు, మిగతావి ఎడమవైపు.","Mode":"మోడ్","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"మోడ్ 1 – స్నాప్ బార్ మరియు స్క్రీన్ అంచులు","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"మోడ్ 2 – ఆటోమేటిక్ టైలింగ్","Modes":"మోడ్‌లు","More ways":"మరిన్ని మార్గాలు","Motion curve":"కదలిక వక్రం","Move a window towards others…":"విండోను ఇతరుల వైపు జరపండి…","Move the window one place back":"విండోను ఒక స్థానం వెనక్కి జరుపు","Move the window one place on":"విండోను ఒక స్థానం ముందుకు జరుపు","Name:":"పేరు:","New layout":"కొత్త లేఅవుట్","New windows":"కొత్త విండోలు","Next tiling layout":"తదుపరి టైలింగ్ లేఅవుట్","Next to the active window":"క్రియాశీల విండో పక్కన","No key":"కీ లేదు","No other window open":"ఇంకే విండో తెరిచి లేదు","No outer margin":"బయటి అంచు లేదు","No shortcuts":"షార్ట్‌కట్‌లు లేవు","None":"ఏదీ లేదు","None yet.":"ఇంకా ఏవీ లేవు.","Off":"ఆఫ్","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"ఆఫ్ = మోడ్ 1, ఆన్ = మోడ్ 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"ఆఫ్: తటస్థ ఫ్రేమ్ – ఆన్‌లో ఉన్న ప్రివ్యూలకు మాత్రమే.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"ఆఫ్: కీలు కేటాయించే ఉంటాయి, కానీ ఏమీ చేయవు.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"ఆఫ్: మీరు ఉంచిన చోటే విండోలు ఉంటాయి. మిగతా ఫీచర్లు ఎలాగైనా పనిచేస్తాయి.","One at a time":"ఒక్కొక్కటిగా","One closes – the others fill the gap":"ఒకటి మూసుకుంటుంది – మిగతావి ఖాళీని నింపుతాయి","One main window less":"ఒక ప్రధాన విండో తక్కువ","One more main window":"మరో ప్రధాన విండో","One window":"ఒక విండో","Only one mode is switched on.":"ఒకే ఒక మోడ్ ఆన్‌లో ఉంది.","Open settings editor":"సెట్టింగ్‌ల ఎడిటర్ తెరువు","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"ముందు యాప్‌ను తెరిచి, ఆపై ఇక్కడ ఎంచుకోండి.","Open the layout builder":"లేఅవుట్ బిల్డర్ తెరువు","Own layouts":"సొంత లేఅవుట్‌లు","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"ప్రతి వైపులో మూలగా లెక్కించే భాగం.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"KDE అంచు టైలింగ్‌ను, దాని ప్రివ్యూను నిలిపివేయి","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"అయస్కాంతం ఆన్‌లో ఉన్నప్పుడు KDE స్నాప్ జోన్‌లను నిలిపివేయి","Preview":"మునుజూపు","Previews":"ప్రివ్యూలు","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"విండోను స్క్రీన్ అంచు లేదా మూలకు నెట్టండి, అది ఆ భాగాన్ని నింపుతుంది. స్నాప్ బార్‌తో లేదా లేకుండా పనిచేస్తుంది.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"విండోను అంచు లేదా మూలకు నెట్టండి: గరిష్ఠీకరించు, సగాలు, పావు భాగాలు.","Push delay":"నెట్టడం ఆలస్యం","Quarters":"పావు భాగాలు","Quick":"వేగవంతమైన","Quick settings":"త్వరిత సెట్టింగ్‌లు","Recommended values":"సిఫార్సు చేసిన విలువలు","Remove":"తీసివేయి","Remove rule":"నియమాన్ని తొలగించు","Remove zone":"జోన్‌ను తీసివేయి","Reset all":"అన్నీ రీసెట్ చేయి","Reset all keys":"అన్ని కీలను రీసెట్ చేయి","Reset to default":"డిఫాల్ట్‌కు పునరుద్ధరించు","Resistance against overlapping":"అతివ్యాప్తికి నిరోధం","Resize touching windows together":"తాకుతున్న విండోల పరిమాణాన్ని కలిసి మార్చు","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"పరిమాణం మార్చినా అతుక్కుంటుంది – ఇక్కడ పూర్తి ఎత్తుకు","Restore":"పునరుద్ధరించు","Restore default layouts":"డిఫాల్ట్ లేఅవుట్‌లను పునరుద్ధరించు","Restore default layouts?":"డిఫాల్ట్ లేఅవుట్‌లను పునరుద్ధరించాలా?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"విండోను బయటకు లాగినప్పుడు అసలు పరిమాణాన్ని పునరుద్ధరించు","Restore the size before snapping":"స్నాప్‌కు ముందు పరిమాణాన్ని పునరుద్ధరించు","Rows":"అడ్డు వరుసలు","Save":"భద్రపరచు","Screen edges":"స్క్రీన్ అంచులు","Screen edges on/off":"స్క్రీన్ అంచులు ఆన్/ఆఫ్","Screen edges preview":"స్క్రీన్ అంచుల ప్రివ్యూ","Set":"సెట్ చేయి","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"అన్ని చర్యల కీలను ఒకేసారి సెట్ చేస్తుంది. విడి కీలను కింద ఇంకా మార్చవచ్చు.","Settings":"సెట్టింగ్‌లు","Settings file":"సెట్టింగ్‌ల ఫైల్","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"పరిమాణం మార్చేటప్పుడు మౌస్‌ను వేగంగా ముందుకు వెనక్కి కదిలించండి, మిగతా విండోలు తిరిగి దూకుతాయి. ఒకే దిశలో వేగవంతమైన లాగు వాటిని ఎప్పుడూ విడిపించదు.","Shake to let go":"వదలడానికి కుదుపు","Shortcuts":"షార్ట్‌కట్‌లు","Show a small handle first":"ముందుగా చిన్న హ్యాండిల్ చూపించు","Show layout and zone names":"లేఅవుట్ మరియు జోన్ పేర్లను చూపించు","Show previews in the accent color":"ప్రివ్యూలను యాక్సెంట్ రంగులో చూపించు","Showing":"చూపించడం","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"అంచు లేదా మూల వద్ద విండో ఎక్కడ పడుతుందో చూపిస్తుంది. ఆఫ్: ప్రివ్యూ అసలు ఉండదు.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"స్నాప్ బార్‌లోని జోన్ హైలైట్ అయి ఉన్నప్పుడు విండో ఎక్కడ పడుతుందో చూపిస్తుంది. ఆఫ్: ప్రివ్యూ అసలు ఉండదు.","Sidebar + grid":"సైడ్‌బార్ + గ్రిడ్","Single zone":"ఒకే జోన్","Six tiles":"ఆరు టైల్‌లు","Size & shape":"పరిమాణం & ఆకారం","Size of the main area":"ప్రధాన ప్రాంతం పరిమాణం","Slide-in duration":"లోపలికి జారే వ్యవధి","Slide-out duration":"బయటకు జారే వ్యవధి","Smart arranging and detection.":"తెలివైన అమరిక మరియు గుర్తింపు.","Smart fill":"తెలివైన నింపడం","Smooth (default)":"మృదువైన (డిఫాల్ట్)","Snap bar":"స్నాప్ బార్","Snap bar and screen edges":"స్నాప్ బార్ మరియు స్క్రీన్ అంచులు","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"స్నాప్ బార్ మరియు అంచులు ఆపివేయబడ్డాయి – మోడ్ 2 మాత్రమే నడుస్తుంది, మోడ్ షార్ట్‌కట్ ఏమీ చేయదు.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"స్నాప్ బార్ మరియు స్క్రీన్ అంచులు ఆటోమేటిక్ టైలింగ్‌కు అడ్డు వస్తాయి. అందుకే అవి రెండు మోడ్‌లుగా నడుస్తాయి – షార్ట్‌కట్‌తో లేదా ఇక్కడ మార్చండి.","Snap bar colors:":"స్నాప్ బార్ రంగులు:","Snap bar on/off":"స్నాప్ బార్ ఆన్/ఆఫ్","Snap bar preview":"స్నాప్ బార్ ప్రివ్యూ","Snap bar size":"స్నాప్ బార్ పరిమాణం","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"స్నాప్ బార్, స్క్రీన్ అంచులు, విండో అయస్కాంతం, షార్ట్‌కట్‌లు మరియు విండోల మార్పిడి.","Snap distance":"స్నాప్ దూరం","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"విభాజకాలను స్నాప్ చేయి (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"స్నాప్ లేఅవుట్‌లు మరియు ఆటోమేటిక్ టైలింగ్.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"కీ కలయికలతో క్రియాశీల విండోను స్నాప్ చేయండి.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"కీబోర్డ్‌తో క్రియాశీల విండోను స్నాప్ చేయండి. ఇవి సాధారణ KDE గ్లోబల్ షార్ట్‌కట్‌లు – సిస్టమ్ సెట్టింగ్‌లు → షార్ట్‌కట్‌లు → KWinలో కూడా దొరుకుతాయి.","Snap to the bottom half":"కింది సగానికి స్నాప్","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"కింది-ఎడమ పావుకు స్నాప్","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"కింది-కుడి పావుకు స్నాప్","Snap to the center third":"మధ్య మూడో వంతుకు స్నాప్","Snap to the left half":"ఎడమ సగానికి స్నాప్","Snap to the left third":"ఎడమ మూడో వంతుకు స్నాప్","Snap to the left two thirds":"ఎడమ మూడింట రెండు వంతులకు స్నాప్","Snap to the right half":"కుడి సగానికి స్నాప్","Snap to the right third":"కుడి మూడో వంతుకు స్నాప్","Snap to the right two thirds":"కుడి మూడింట రెండు వంతులకు స్నాప్","Snap to the top half":"పై సగానికి స్నాప్","Snap to the top-left quarter":"పై-ఎడమ పావుకు స్నాప్","Snap to the top-right quarter":"పై-కుడి పావుకు స్నాప్","Snapping":"స్నాపింగ్","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"స్నాపింగ్ మరియు ఆటోమేటిక్ టైలింగ్ రెండు మోడ్‌లుగా నడుస్తాయి – ఒక షార్ట్‌కట్ వాటి మధ్య మారుస్తుంది.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"ఇలా ఒకే అయస్కాంతం విండోను లాగుతుంది. మీ KDE సెట్టింగ్‌లు మారవు: దీన్ని ఆపివేయండి, KSnapUnity ని నిలిపివేయండి లేదా తొలగించండి, KDE స్నాపింగ్ తిరిగి వస్తుంది.","Soft":"సున్నితమైన","Spacing":"ఖాళీలు","Spiral":"సర్పిలం","Split side by side":"పక్కపక్కనే విభజించు","Split top and bottom":"పైకి కిందకు విభజించు","Stack + main":"స్టాక్ + ప్రధాన","Stick to other windows":"ఇతర విండోలకు అతుక్కో","Stick to the screen edges":"స్క్రీన్ అంచులకు అతుక్కో","Sticky edges":"అంటుకునే అంచులు","Support KSnapUnity":"KSnapUnity కి మద్దతు ఇవ్వండి","Swap":"మార్చు","Swap windows":"విండోలను మార్చు","Swap with the window above":"పై విండోతో మార్చు","Swap with the window below":"కింది విండోతో మార్చు","Swap with the window on the left":"ఎడమ విండోతో మార్చు","Swap with the window on the right":"కుడి విండోతో మార్చు","Switch mode":"మోడ్ మార్చు","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"మోడ్ మార్చు (స్నాపింగ్ / టైలింగ్)","Switch modes with:":"మోడ్ మార్చే కీ:","Switch the layout by itself":"లేఅవుట్‌ను స్వయంగా మార్చు","Switched off":"ఆపివేయబడింది","System":"సిస్టమ్","Take it over":"తీసుకో","Take over all":"అన్నీ తీసుకో","Take the main place":"ప్రధాన స్థానం తీసుకుంటాయి","Test animation":"యానిమేషన్‌ను పరీక్షించు","Test on screen":"స్క్రీన్‌పై పరీక్షించు","Test the snap bar":"స్నాప్ బార్‌ను ప్రయత్నించు","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"డిఫాల్ట్ విలువలు Windows 11 ఆధారంగా ఉన్నాయి.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"స్నాప్ చర్యలు స్నాప్ బార్ వాడే ఖాళీలనే వాడతాయి, స్నాప్‌కు ముందు పరిమాణాన్ని గుర్తుంచుకుంటాయి: \"స్నాప్‌కు ముందు పరిమాణాన్ని పునరుద్ధరించు\" దాన్ని తిరిగి తెస్తుంది.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"ఈ యాప్‌లు ఎప్పుడూ అమర్చబడవు మరియు తమ స్థానాన్ని నిలుపుకుంటాయి. డైలాగ్‌లు ఎల్లప్పుడూ తేలుతాయి.","Thirds":"మూడో వంతులు","Three columns":"మూడు నిలువు వరుసలు","Thumbnail width":"థంబ్‌నెయిల్ వెడల్పు","Tiling":"టైలింగ్","Tip":"చిట్కా","Top / bottom":"పైన / కింద","Top edge":"పై అంచు","Top edge: full screen":"పై అంచు: పూర్తి తెర","Top edge: maximize":"పై అంచు: గరిష్ఠీకరించు","Top edge: top half":"పై అంచు: పై సగం","Top half":"పై సగం","Trigger distance from the top edge":"పై అంచు నుండి ట్రిగ్గర్ దూరం","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"మీకు KDE సొంత రూపరేఖ నచ్చితే దీన్ని ఆఫ్ చేయండి – తర్వాత పైన ఉన్న స్క్రీన్ అంచుల ప్రివ్యూను ఆఫ్ చేయండి.","Two thirds":"మూడింట రెండు","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"రెండు విండోలు స్థానాలు మార్చుకుంటాయి – ఒకదాన్ని మరొకదానిపై వదలండి లేదా కీలను వాడండి.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"రెండు విండోలు స్థానాలు మార్చుకుంటాయి: ఒకదాన్ని మరొకదానిపై వదలండి, లేదా కీతో.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"కీబోర్డ్ షార్ట్‌కట్‌లను ఉపయోగించు","Use screen edges":"స్క్రీన్ అంచులను ఉపయోగించు","Use the system accent color":"సిస్టమ్ యాక్సెంట్ రంగును వాడు","Use the window magnet":"విండో అయస్కాంతాన్ని ఉపయోగించు","Usual combinations":"సాధారణ కలయికలు","Version":"వెర్షన్","Wanted for: %1":"కావలసింది: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"ఒక విండో తెరుచుకున్నప్పుడు, మూసుకున్నప్పుడు లేదా మారినప్పుడు, మిగతావి ఎగరకుండా సాఫీగా కదులుతాయి.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"విండో పరిమాణం మార్చినప్పుడు దాన్ని తాకే విండోలు పంచుకున్న అంచును దానితో కదుపుతాయి – ఏదీ అతివ్యాప్తి కాదు, ఖాళీ రాదు.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"పరిమాణం మార్చేటప్పుడు అనుసరించని విండోలు పారదర్శకంగా కనిపిస్తాయి.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"మీరు విండోను కదిలించేటప్పుడు లేదా పరిమాణం మార్చేటప్పుడు, దాని అంచులు దగ్గరి విండోలకు, స్క్రీన్ అంచులకు అతుక్కుంటాయి.","Width":"వెడల్పు","Window":"విండో","Window magnet":"విండో అయస్కాంతం","Window magnet on/off":"విండో అయస్కాంతం ఆన్/ఆఫ్","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"ఒకదానిపై ఒకటి ఉన్న విండోలు ఎడమ, కుడి అంచులను, పక్కపక్కన ఉన్నవి పై, కింది అంచులను కలిపి ఉంచుతాయి.","Windows glide to their place":"విండోలు సాఫీగా తమ స్థానానికి జారుతాయి","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"విండోలు ఒకదానికొకటి, స్క్రీన్ అంచులకు అతుక్కుంటాయి.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"విండోలు తాకకుండా సాధారణం పేజీలోని \"విండోల మధ్య ఖాళీ\" వద్ద ఆగుతాయి.","Yes":"అవును","Your own combination":"మీ సొంత కలయిక","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"మీ సొంత లేఅవుట్‌లు మరియు వాటి క్రమం పోతాయి.","Zone %1":"జోన్ %1","for KWin · v%1":"KWin కోసం · v%1","windows:":"విండోలు:","“%1” will be removed.":"\"%1\" తీసివేయబడుతుంది.","…drag it onto window B…":"…దాన్ని విండో B పైకి లాగండి…","…in every direction":"…అన్ని దిశల్లో","…let go: they trade places":"…వదలండి: అవి స్థానాలు మార్చుకుంటాయి","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…పక్క విండోలు దానితో పాటు పెరిగి తగ్గుతాయి","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ సిద్ధం – సెట్టింగ్‌ల ఎడిటర్ తెరవడానికి OK క్లిక్ చేయండి."},"th":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (สำเนา)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 ถูกใช้โดย “%2”","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 จาก %2 โซน","0 = all in one row":"0 = ทั้งหมดในแถวเดียว","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>โหมด 1</b><br/>แถบจัดวางและขอบจอ","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>โหมด 2</b><br/>จัดเรียงแบบไทล์อัตโนมัติ","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"หน้าต่างเดียวใช้ทั้งจอ แม้จะตั้งขอบไว้","A new window joins":"มีหน้าต่างใหม่เข้ามา","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"ดันสั้น ๆ จะได้ครึ่งหรือหนึ่งในสี่ ค้างหน้าต่างไว้ที่ขอบนานขึ้นอีกนิด แล้วมันจะขยายไปจนถึงหน้าต่างถัดไป – ตัวอย่างจะแสดงให้เห็น","A single window":"หน้าต่างเดียว","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"หน้าต่างจะหยุดที่ขอบของอีกหน้าต่าง แม้จะเลื่อนเร็วก็ตาม เขย่าเมาส์หรือดันต่ออีกครู่เพื่อปล่อย 0 = หน้าต่างซ้อนกันได้อิสระ","About & Help":"เกี่ยวกับและความช่วยเหลือ","Accent color":"สีเน้น","Active":"ทำงาน","Active mode":"โหมดที่ใช้งาน","Active width along the top edge":"ความกว้างที่ใช้งานได้ตามขอบบน","Add an open application":"เพิ่มแอปที่เปิดอยู่","Add rule":"เพิ่มกฎ","All window features in one system.":"ทุกฟีเจอร์หน้าต่างในระบบเดียว","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"เปลี่ยนด้วยเมื่อคุณปรับขนาดหน้าต่างหลักเอง","Also while resizing":"รวมถึงตอนปรับขนาด","Always floating":"ลอยเสมอ","Animation":"ภาพเคลื่อนไหว","Appearance":"ลักษณะ","Apply":"นำไปใช้","Arrange windows":"จัดเรียงหน้าต่าง","Arrange windows automatically":"จัดเรียงหน้าต่างอัตโนมัติ","Author":"ผู้สร้าง","Automatic tiling":"จัดเรียงแบบไทล์อัตโนมัติ","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"การจัดเรียงอัตโนมัติปิดอยู่ – ทำงานแค่โหมด 1 และปุ่มลัดโหมดไม่ทำอะไร","Automatic tiling off":"ปิดการจัดเรียงอัตโนมัติ","Automatic tiling on":"เปิดการจัดเรียงอัตโนมัติ","Automatic tiling on/off":"เปิด/ปิดไทล์อัตโนมัติ","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"จัดเรียงอัตโนมัติ สลับหน้าต่าง ปุ่มลัด และแม่เหล็กสำหรับหน้าต่างลอย","Background opacity":"ความทึบของพื้นหลัง","Behavior & Animation":"การทำงานและภาพเคลื่อนไหว","Bottom edge: bottom half":"ขอบล่าง: ครึ่งล่าง","Bouncy":"เด้ง","Buy me a coffee":"เลี้ยงกาแฟฉันสักแก้ว","Cancel":"ยกเลิก","Center focus":"เน้นตรงกลาง","Center the window":"จัดหน้าต่างไว้กลาง","Change":"เปลี่ยน","Change key":"เปลี่ยนปุ่ม","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"เปลี่ยนปุ่มได้ในตัวแก้ไขการตั้งค่า ทั้งสองโหมดต้องใช้การจัดเรียงอัตโนมัติและแถบจัดวางหรือขอบจอ","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"เปลี่ยนได้ที่หน้า ปุ่มลัด เมื่อจัดเรียงแบบไทล์อัตโนมัติ หน้าต่างจะสลับที่ในลำดับด้วย","Choose…":"เลือก…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"คลิกโซนเพื่อเลือก · ดับเบิลคลิกเพื่อแบ่ง · ลากเส้นแบ่ง","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"คลิกหรือกด %1 เพื่อสลับโหมด","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"คลิก แล้วตกลง – ตัวแก้ไขการตั้งค่าจะเปิด","Close":"ปิด","Close by, the edges stick together":"เมื่อใกล้กัน ขอบจะติดกัน","Color scheme":"ชุดสี","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"สี ขนาด และรูปทรงของแถบ","Columns":"คอลัมน์","Corner radius":"รัศมีมุม","Corner size":"ขนาดมุม","Corner: a quarter":"มุม: หนึ่งในสี่","Corners: quarter of the screen":"มุม: หนึ่งในสี่ของจอ","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + ปุ่ม (ค่าเริ่มต้น)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + แป้นตัวเลข","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + ปุ่ม","Custom color":"สีที่กำหนดเอง","Custom layout %1":"เลย์เอาต์กำหนดเอง %1","Dark":"มืด","Delay before hiding":"หน่วงเวลาก่อนซ่อน","Delay before showing":"หน่วงเวลาก่อนแสดง","Delete":"ลบ","Delete layout?":"ลบเลย์เอาต์หรือไม่?","Distance at which the handle appears":"ระยะที่ที่จับปรากฏ","Distance before the bar hides again":"ระยะก่อนที่แถบจะซ่อนอีกครั้ง","Distance to the edge":"ระยะถึงขอบ","Donate with PayPal":"บริจาคผ่าน PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"ลากขอบที่ใช้ร่วมกัน…","Drag a window against an edge…":"ลากหน้าต่างไปชนขอบ…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"ลากหน้าต่างไปวางบนอีกหน้าต่างเพื่อสลับกัน ถ้าปล่อยบนแถบจัดวางหรือขอบจอ จะลอยอิสระ „ให้หน้าต่างลอย“ จะนำกลับมา ระยะห่างมาจากหน้าทั่วไป","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"ลากหน้าต่างไปเหนือกึ่งกลางของอีกหน้าต่าง – ตัวอย่างแสดงลูกศรสองอัน – แล้วปล่อย ในโหมดไทล์อัตโนมัติ ตรงไหนบนอีกหน้าต่างก็ได้","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"ลากหน้าต่างไปที่ขอบบนของหน้าจอ แล้วปล่อยลงบนโซน","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"ลากการ์ดเพื่อเปลี่ยนลำดับในแถบ ดับเบิลคลิกการ์ดเพื่อแก้ไข","Drop a window onto another one":"วางหน้าต่างบนอีกหน้าต่าง","Drop the window onto a zone":"ปล่อยหน้าต่างลงบนโซน","Duplicate":"ทำสำเนา","Duration":"ระยะเวลา","Dwindle":"เกลียวเข้าใน","Dynamic":"ไดนามิก","Edges and corners":"ขอบและมุม","Edit":"แก้ไข","Edit layout":"แก้ไขเลย์เอาต์","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"เปิดและปิดแต่ละฟีเจอร์ได้แยกกัน","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"ทุกเลย์เอาต์ที่คุณสร้างในหน้าเลย์เอาต์ใช้จัดหน้าต่างได้ด้วย – จะปรากฏด้านบน หน้าต่าง 1 ได้โซน 1 ไปเรื่อย ๆ หน้าต่างที่เกินจะแบ่งโซนสุดท้าย ถ้าหน้าต่างน้อยกว่าโซนจะใช้ „หลักและกอง“ เพื่อไม่ให้มีช่องว่าง","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"ทุกหน้าต่างหาที่ของตัวเองได้เอง เหมือนในตัวจัดการหน้าต่างแบบไทล์","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"ทุกหน้าต่างหาที่ของตัวเองบนหน้าจอได้เอง หน้าต่างใหม่เข้ามาต่อแถว หน้าต่างที่ปิดจะเว้นที่ให้หน้าต่างอื่น","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"ตัวอย่าง: สองหน้าต่างวางข้างกัน ตั้งแต่สามเป็นหลักและกอง ตั้งแต่ห้าเป็นตาราง ถ้าไม่มีกฎที่ตรงจะใช้เลย์เอาต์ที่เลือกด้านบน","Fade in and out":"ค่อย ๆ จางเข้าและจางออก","Fade the other windows":"ทำให้หน้าต่างอื่นจางลง","Features":"คุณสมบัติ","Feel":"ความรู้สึก","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"ปรับตามหน้าต่างที่จัดวางไว้แล้ว","Fits the way you work.":"เข้ากับวิธีทำงานของคุณ","Float the window (leave tiling)":"ให้หน้าต่างลอย (ออกจากไทล์)","Four quarters":"สี่ส่วน","From":"ตั้งแต่","Fullscreen":"เต็มจอ","Gap between windows":"ระยะห่างระหว่างหน้าต่าง","Gap to the screen edge":"ระยะห่างจากขอบหน้าจอ","General":"ทั่วไป","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"กำหนดปุ่มจากรูปแบบที่เลือกให้ทุกการกระทำอีกครั้ง และลบปุ่มที่รูปแบบไม่มี","Good to know":"ควรรู้","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"จับหน้าต่างที่แถบชื่อแล้วลากขึ้น แถบจะเลื่อนลงมา ปล่อยหน้าต่างลงบนโซนแล้วหน้าต่างจะเต็มพื้นที่นั้นพอดี เมื่อลากออกอีกครั้ง หน้าต่างจะกลับเป็นขนาดเดิม","Grab window A…":"จับหน้าต่าง A…","Grid":"ตาราง","Halves":"ครึ่ง-ครึ่ง","Hiding":"การซ่อน","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"ค้างไว้ที่ขอบเพื่อเติมพื้นที่ว่าง","Hold time":"เวลาค้าง","Hold to fill":"ค้างไว้เพื่อเติมเต็ม","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"ขอบต้องเข้าใกล้แค่ไหนก่อนจะล็อกเข้าที่","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"เคอร์เซอร์ต้องเข้าใกล้ขอบแค่ไหน","How far the bar slides down":"แถบเลื่อนลงมาไกลแค่ไหน","How it works":"วิธีการทำงาน","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"หน้าต่างต้องแนบขอบนานแค่ไหน – ดันเบา ๆ 0 = ทันที","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"หน้าต่างต้องอยู่ที่ขอบนานเท่าใดก่อนจะขยาย","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"จำนวนหน้าต่างที่แบ่งพื้นที่หลัก (เลย์เอาต์ “หลักและกอง”)","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"หากด้านล่างมีหน้าต่างอยู่แล้ว ขอบบนจะให้ครึ่งบนแทนการขยายใหญ่สุด ครึ่งจอและหนึ่งในสี่ก็จะเว้นหน้าต่างที่จัดวางไว้","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"ถ้าคุณชอบ KSnapUnity คุณสามารถสนับสนุนการพัฒนาได้ – ขอบคุณ!","In bar":"อยู่ในแถบ","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"แยกจากแถบจัดวางและขอบจอ","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"แยกจากแถบจัดวาง แต่ละขอบเปิดแยกกันได้","Information":"ข้อมูล","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"พฤติกรรมหน้าต่างที่เป็นธรรมชาติและเข้าใจง่าย","Join at the end":"ต่อท้าย","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K คือ KWin · Snap คือการจัดวางที่ฉลาดขึ้น · Unity คือทุกอย่างในระบบเดียว","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE มีการทำงานที่ขอบจอและการจัดวางหน้าต่างของตัวเอง หากเปิดคุณสมบัติเดียวกันไว้ที่นี่ ให้ปิดของ KDE: การตั้งค่าระบบ → การจัดการหน้าต่าง → ขอบจอ และ พฤติกรรมหน้าต่าง → การย้าย","KDE's own edge tiling":"การจัดเรียงที่ขอบของ KDE เอง","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"การขยายเต็มและการไทล์ของ KDE เองที่ขอบจอ – พร้อมเส้นขอบ – จะหยุดชั่วคราวขณะ KSnapUnity ทำงาน เพื่อให้เห็นตัวอย่างเดียว การตั้งค่า KDE ไม่เปลี่ยน: ปิดตัวเลือกนี้ ปิดใช้หรือถอด KSnapUnity แล้วพฤติกรรมของ KDE จะกลับมา","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"การทำงานที่ขอบจอของ KDE ยังเปิดอยู่ จึงมีตัวช่วยสองตัวตอบสนองต่อการลากเดียวกัน ปิด “ขยายใหญ่สุด” และ “เรียงต่อ” ใน การตั้งค่าระบบ → การจัดการหน้าต่าง → ขอบจอ","KDE's own window snapping":"การสแนปหน้าต่างของ KDE เอง","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"การจัดวางหน้าต่างของ KDE เองก็เปิดอยู่ด้วย เพื่อความรู้สึกที่สม่ำเสมอ ให้ตั้งโซนของมันเป็น “ไม่มี” ใน การตั้งค่าระบบ → การจัดการหน้าต่าง → พฤติกรรมหน้าต่าง → การย้าย","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"บริการปุ่มลัดของ KDE ไม่ตอบสนอง คุณยังกำหนดปุ่มได้ที่ การตั้งค่าระบบ → ปุ่มลัด → KWin","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – ตัวแก้ไขการตั้งค่า","Keep stacked windows in line":"จัดหน้าต่างที่ซ้อนกันให้อยู่ในแนวเดียว","Keep the gap between windows":"คงระยะห่างระหว่างหน้าต่าง","Keep them":"คงไว้","Key scheme":"ชุดรูปแบบปุ่ม","Keyboard shortcuts":"ปุ่มลัดแป้นพิมพ์","Keys":"ปุ่ม","Keys already in use":"ปุ่มที่ถูกใช้แล้ว","Layout":"เลย์เอาต์","Layout by number of windows":"เลย์เอาต์ตามจำนวนหน้าต่าง","Layouts":"เลย์เอาต์","Layouts per row":"จำนวนเลย์เอาต์ต่อแถว","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"ขอบซ้ายและขวา: ครึ่งจอ","Left edge: left half":"ขอบซ้าย: ครึ่งซ้าย","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"ต่ำกว่า 100 % หน้าต่างเดียวจะอยู่ตรงกลาง – สวยบนจอกว้าง","License":"สัญญาอนุญาต","Light":"สว่าง","Linear":"เชิงเส้น","Live preview":"ตัวอย่างสด","Load template…":"โหลดแม่แบบ…","Magnet":"แม่เหล็ก","Main + stack":"หลัก + กอง","Main and stack":"หลักและกอง","Main area bigger":"พื้นที่หลักใหญ่ขึ้น","Main area on the right":"พื้นที่หลักด้านขวา","Main area smaller":"พื้นที่หลักเล็กลง","Main in the middle":"หลักตรงกลาง","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"สวิตช์หลักสำหรับการลากและปุ่ม","Main window":"หน้าต่างหลัก","Main windows":"จำนวนหน้าต่างหลัก","Main windows: %1":"หน้าต่างหลัก: %1","Make it the main window":"ทำให้เป็นหน้าต่างหลัก","Maximize":"ขยายใหญ่สุด","Maximize or restore":"ขยายใหญ่สุดหรือคืนค่า","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + ปุ่ม (แบบ KDE)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + ปุ่ม","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + ปุ่ม","Minimize":"ย่อ","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"กลับด้านเลย์เอาต์: หน้าต่างหลักอยู่ขวา ที่เหลืออยู่ซ้าย","Mode":"โหมด","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"โหมด 1 – แถบจัดวางและขอบจอ","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"โหมด 2 – จัดเรียงแบบไทล์อัตโนมัติ","Modes":"โหมด","More ways":"วิธีเพิ่มเติม","Motion curve":"เส้นโค้งการเคลื่อนไหว","Move a window towards others…":"เลื่อนหน้าต่างเข้าหาหน้าต่างอื่น…","Move the window one place back":"เลื่อนหน้าต่างถอยหลังหนึ่งตำแหน่ง","Move the window one place on":"เลื่อนหน้าต่างไปข้างหน้าหนึ่งตำแหน่ง","Name:":"ชื่อ:","New layout":"เลย์เอาต์ใหม่","New windows":"หน้าต่างใหม่","Next tiling layout":"เลย์เอาต์ไทล์ถัดไป","Next to the active window":"ข้างหน้าต่างที่ใช้งาน","No key":"ไม่มีปุ่ม","No other window open":"ไม่มีหน้าต่างอื่นเปิดอยู่","No outer margin":"ไม่มีขอบนอก","No shortcuts":"ไม่มีปุ่มลัด","None":"ไม่มี","None yet.":"ยังไม่มี","Off":"ปิด","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"ปิด = โหมด 1, เปิด = โหมด 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"ปิด: กรอบสีกลาง – เฉพาะตัวอย่างที่เปิดอยู่","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"ปิด: ปุ่มยังถูกกำหนดไว้แต่ไม่ทำอะไร","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"ปิด: หน้าต่างอยู่ที่ที่คุณวางไว้ ฟีเจอร์อื่นทำงานได้ทั้งสองแบบ","One at a time":"ทีละหน้าต่าง","One closes – the others fill the gap":"ปิดไปหนึ่ง – ที่เหลือเติมช่องว่าง","One main window less":"หน้าต่างหลักลดลงหนึ่ง","One more main window":"หน้าต่างหลักเพิ่มอีกหนึ่ง","One window":"หน้าต่างเดียว","Only one mode is switched on.":"เปิดอยู่เพียงโหมดเดียว","Open settings editor":"เปิดตัวแก้ไขการตั้งค่า","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"เปิดแอปก่อน แล้วเลือกที่นี่","Open the layout builder":"เปิดตัวสร้างเลย์เอาต์","Own layouts":"เลย์เอาต์ของคุณเอง","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"ส่วนของแต่ละด้านที่นับเป็นมุม","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"หยุดการจัดเรียงที่ขอบของ KDE และตัวอย่างของมันชั่วคราว","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"หยุดโซนสแนปของ KDE ชั่วคราวขณะที่แม่เหล็กเปิดอยู่","Preview":"ตัวอย่าง","Previews":"ตัวอย่าง","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"ดันหน้าต่างชนขอบหรือมุมจอ แล้วหน้าต่างจะเต็มส่วนนั้น ใช้ได้ทั้งมีและไม่มีแถบจัดวาง","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"ดันหน้าต่างชนขอบหรือมุม: ขยายใหญ่สุด ครึ่งจอ หนึ่งในสี่","Push delay":"หน่วงการดัน","Quarters":"หนึ่งในสี่","Quick":"รวดเร็ว","Quick settings":"ตั้งค่าด่วน","Recommended values":"ค่าที่แนะนำ","Remove":"เอาออก","Remove rule":"ลบกฎ","Remove zone":"ลบโซน","Reset all":"รีเซ็ตทั้งหมด","Reset all keys":"รีเซ็ตปุ่มทั้งหมด","Reset to default":"คืนค่าเริ่มต้น","Resistance against overlapping":"แรงต้านการซ้อนทับ","Resize touching windows together":"ปรับขนาดหน้าต่างที่ชิดกันไปพร้อมกัน","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"การปรับขนาดก็จัดวางเช่นกัน – ที่นี่สูงเต็มจอ","Restore":"คืนค่า","Restore default layouts":"คืนค่าเลย์เอาต์เริ่มต้น","Restore default layouts?":"คืนค่าเลย์เอาต์เริ่มต้นหรือไม่?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"คืนขนาดเดิมเมื่อลากหน้าต่างออก","Restore the size before snapping":"คืนขนาดก่อนจัดวาง","Rows":"แถว","Save":"บันทึก","Screen edges":"ขอบจอ","Screen edges on/off":"เปิด/ปิดขอบจอ","Screen edges preview":"ตัวอย่างของขอบหน้าจอ","Set":"กำหนด","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"กำหนดปุ่มของทุกการทำงานพร้อมกัน ยังเปลี่ยนปุ่มทีละปุ่มได้ด้านล่าง","Settings":"การตั้งค่า","Settings file":"ไฟล์การตั้งค่า","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"ระหว่างปรับขนาด ให้เขย่าเมาส์ไปมาเร็วๆ แล้วหน้าต่างอื่นจะเด้งกลับ การดึงเร็วไปทางเดียวจะไม่ปล่อยเลย","Shake to let go":"เขย่าเพื่อปล่อย","Shortcuts":"ปุ่มลัด","Show a small handle first":"แสดงที่จับเล็ก ๆ ก่อน","Show layout and zone names":"แสดงชื่อเลย์เอาต์และโซน","Show previews in the accent color":"แสดงตัวอย่างด้วยสีเน้น","Showing":"การแสดง","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"แสดงตำแหน่งที่หน้าต่างจะไปอยู่ที่ขอบหรือมุม ปิด: ไม่มีตัวอย่างเลย","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"แสดงตำแหน่งที่หน้าต่างจะไปอยู่ขณะที่โซนในแถบถูกไฮไลต์ ปิด: ไม่มีตัวอย่างเลย","Sidebar + grid":"แถบข้าง + ตาราง","Single zone":"โซนเดียว","Six tiles":"หกช่อง","Size & shape":"ขนาดและรูปทรง","Size of the main area":"ขนาดพื้นที่หลัก","Slide-in duration":"ระยะเวลาเลื่อนเข้า","Slide-out duration":"ระยะเวลาเลื่อนออก","Smart arranging and detection.":"การจัดเรียงและตรวจจับอย่างชาญฉลาด","Smart fill":"เติมอัจฉริยะ","Smooth (default)":"นุ่มนวล (ค่าเริ่มต้น)","Snap bar":"แถบจัดวาง","Snap bar and screen edges":"แถบจัดวางและขอบจอ","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"แถบจัดวางและขอบจอปิดอยู่ – ทำงานแค่โหมด 2 และปุ่มลัดโหมดไม่ทำอะไร","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"แถบจัดวางและขอบจอรบกวนการจัดเรียงแบบไทล์อัตโนมัติ จึงทำงานเป็นสองโหมด – สลับด้วยปุ่มลัดหรือที่นี่","Snap bar colors:":"สีของแถบจัดวาง:","Snap bar on/off":"เปิด/ปิดแถบจัดวาง","Snap bar preview":"ตัวอย่างของแถบสแนป","Snap bar size":"ขนาดแถบ","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"แถบจัดวาง ขอบจอ แม่เหล็กหน้าต่าง ปุ่มลัด และสลับหน้าต่าง","Snap distance":"ระยะดูด","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"ให้เส้นแบ่งดูดเข้าที่ (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"เลย์เอาต์จัดวางและไทล์อัตโนมัติ","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"จัดวางหน้าต่างที่ใช้งานอยู่ด้วยชุดปุ่ม","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"จัดวางหน้าต่างที่ใช้งานอยู่ด้วยแป้นพิมพ์ นี่คือปุ่มลัดส่วนกลางปกติของ KDE – พบได้ที่ การตั้งค่าระบบ → ปุ่มลัด → KWin เช่นกัน","Snap to the bottom half":"จัดวางที่ครึ่งล่าง","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"จัดวางที่หนึ่งในสี่ล่างซ้าย","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"จัดวางที่หนึ่งในสี่ล่างขวา","Snap to the center third":"จัดวางที่หนึ่งในสามกลาง","Snap to the left half":"จัดวางที่ครึ่งซ้าย","Snap to the left third":"จัดวางที่หนึ่งในสามซ้าย","Snap to the left two thirds":"จัดวางที่สองในสามซ้าย","Snap to the right half":"จัดวางที่ครึ่งขวา","Snap to the right third":"จัดวางที่หนึ่งในสามขวา","Snap to the right two thirds":"จัดวางที่สองในสามขวา","Snap to the top half":"จัดวางที่ครึ่งบน","Snap to the top-left quarter":"จัดวางที่หนึ่งในสี่บนซ้าย","Snap to the top-right quarter":"จัดวางที่หนึ่งในสี่บนขวา","Snapping":"การจัดวางอัตโนมัติ","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"การจัดวางและการไทล์อัตโนมัติทำงานเป็นสองโหมด – ปุ่มลัดเดียวสลับระหว่างกัน","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"ดังนั้นแม่เหล็กเพียงอันเดียวดึงหน้าต่าง การตั้งค่า KDE ไม่เปลี่ยน: ปิดตัวเลือกนี้ ปิดใช้หรือถอด KSnapUnity แล้วการจัดวางของ KDE จะกลับมา","Soft":"ละมุน","Spacing":"ระยะห่าง","Spiral":"เกลียว","Split side by side":"แบ่งซ้าย-ขวา","Split top and bottom":"แบ่งบน-ล่าง","Stack + main":"กอง + หลัก","Stick to other windows":"ติดกับหน้าต่างอื่น","Stick to the screen edges":"ติดกับขอบจอ","Sticky edges":"ขอบแบบติด","Support KSnapUnity":"สนับสนุน KSnapUnity","Swap":"สลับ","Swap windows":"สลับหน้าต่าง","Swap with the window above":"สลับกับหน้าต่างด้านบน","Swap with the window below":"สลับกับหน้าต่างด้านล่าง","Swap with the window on the left":"สลับกับหน้าต่างด้านซ้าย","Swap with the window on the right":"สลับกับหน้าต่างด้านขวา","Switch mode":"สลับโหมด","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"สลับโหมด (จัดวาง / ไทล์)","Switch modes with:":"สลับโหมดด้วย:","Switch the layout by itself":"เปลี่ยนเลย์เอาต์เอง","Switched off":"ปิดอยู่","System":"ระบบ","Take it over":"เอามาใช้","Take over all":"เอามาใช้ทั้งหมด","Take the main place":"เอาที่หลัก","Test animation":"ทดสอบภาพเคลื่อนไหว","Test on screen":"ทดสอบบนหน้าจอ","Test the snap bar":"ทดลองแถบจัดวาง","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"ค่าเริ่มต้นอ้างอิงจาก Windows 11","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"การจัดวางใช้ระยะห่างเดียวกับแถบและจำขนาดก่อนจัดวาง: “คืนขนาดก่อนจัดวาง” จะนำกลับมา","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"แอปเหล่านี้จะไม่ถูกจัดเรียงและคงที่ของตัวเอง กล่องโต้ตอบลอยเสมอ","Thirds":"หนึ่งในสาม","Three columns":"สามคอลัมน์","Thumbnail width":"ความกว้างภาพย่อ","Tiling":"ไทล์","Tip":"เคล็ดลับ","Top / bottom":"บน / ล่าง","Top edge":"ขอบบน","Top edge: full screen":"ขอบบน: เต็มจอ","Top edge: maximize":"ขอบบน: ขยายเต็ม","Top edge: top half":"ขอบบน: ครึ่งบน","Top half":"ครึ่งบน","Trigger distance from the top edge":"ระยะที่ทำให้แถบปรากฏจากขอบบน","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"ปิดตัวเลือกนี้หากคุณชอบเส้นขอบของ KDE เอง – แล้วปิดตัวอย่างของขอบหน้าจอด้านบน","Two thirds":"สองในสาม","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"สองหน้าต่างสลับที่กัน – ปล่อยหน้าต่างหนึ่งลงบนอีกหน้าต่าง หรือใช้ปุ่ม","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"สองหน้าต่างสลับที่กัน: ปล่อยหน้าต่างหนึ่งลงบนอีกหน้าต่าง หรือใช้ปุ่ม","Use keyboard shortcuts":"ใช้ปุ่มลัดแป้นพิมพ์","Use screen edges":"ใช้ขอบจอ","Use the system accent color":"ใช้สีเน้นของระบบ","Use the window magnet":"ใช้แม่เหล็กหน้าต่าง","Usual combinations":"ชุดปุ่มที่ใช้บ่อย","Version":"รุ่น","Wanted for: %1":"ต้องการสำหรับ: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"เมื่อหน้าต่างเปิด ปิด หรือสลับ หน้าต่างอื่นจะเคลื่อนอย่างนุ่มนวลแทนการกระโดด","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"เมื่อปรับขนาดหน้าต่าง หน้าต่างที่ชิดอยู่จะเลื่อนขอบที่ใช้ร่วมกันตามไปด้วย ไม่มีการซ้อนทับ ไม่มีช่องว่าง","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"ขณะปรับขนาด หน้าต่างที่ไม่ตามมาจะแสดงแบบโปร่งใส","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"ขณะย้ายหรือปรับขนาดหน้าต่าง ขอบของมันจะติดกับหน้าต่างใกล้เคียงและขอบจอ","Width":"ความกว้าง","Window":"หน้าต่าง","Window magnet":"แม่เหล็กหน้าต่าง","Window magnet on/off":"เปิด/ปิดแม่เหล็กหน้าต่าง","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"หน้าต่างที่อยู่บนล่างกันจะคงขอบซ้ายและขวาไว้ด้วยกัน หน้าต่างที่อยู่ข้างกันคงขอบบนและล่าง","Windows glide to their place":"หน้าต่างเลื่อนเข้าที่อย่างนุ่มนวล","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"หน้าต่างติดกันเองและติดขอบจอ","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"หน้าต่างจะหยุดที่ “ระยะห่างระหว่างหน้าต่าง” จากหน้า ทั่วไป แทนการชนกัน","Yes":"ใช่","Your own combination":"ชุดปุ่มของคุณเอง","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"เลย์เอาต์ของคุณเองและลำดับจะหายไป","Zone %1":"โซน %1","for KWin · v%1":"สำหรับ KWin · v%1","windows:":"หน้าต่าง:","“%1” will be removed.":"“%1” จะถูกลบออก","…drag it onto window B…":"…ลากไปวางบนหน้าต่าง B…","…in every direction":"…ได้ทุกทิศทาง","…let go: they trade places":"…ปล่อย: สลับที่กัน","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…หน้าต่างข้างเคียงขยายและหดตาม","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ พร้อม – คลิกตกลงเพื่อเปิดตัวแก้ไขการตั้งค่า"},"tl":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (kopya)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"Ginagamit ang %1 ng “%2”.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 sa %2 zone","0 = all in one row":"0 = lahat sa iisang hilera","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar at mga gilid ng screen","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Awtomatikong pag-tile","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Ginagamit ng nag-iisang window ang buong screen, kahit may margin na nakatakda.","A new window joins":"May bagong window na sumasali","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Ang maikling tulak ay nagbibigay ng kalahati o kapat. Hawakan nang mas matagal nang kaunti ang window sa gilid at lalaki ito hanggang sa susunod na window – ipinapakita ito ng preview.","A single window":"Iisang window","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Humihinto ang window sa gilid ng isa pa, kahit mabilis mo itong igalaw. Alugin ang mouse o ituloy ang pagtulak sandali para bitawan. 0 = malayang magpatong ang mga window.","About & Help":"Tungkol at tulong","Active":"Aktibo","Active mode":"Aktibong mode","Active width along the top edge":"Aktibong lapad sa itaas na gilid","Add an open application":"Magdagdag ng bukas na app","Add rule":"Magdagdag ng tuntunin","All window features in one system.":"Lahat ng feature ng window sa iisang sistema.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Nagbabago rin kapag manu-mano mong pinalitan ang laki ng pangunahing window.","Also while resizing":"Pati habang binabago ang laki","Always floating":"Laging lumulutang","Animation":"Animasyon","Appearance":"Itsura","Apply":"Ilapat","Arrange windows":"Ayusin ang mga window","Arrange windows automatically":"Awtomatikong ayusin ang mga window","Author":"May-akda","Automatic tiling":"Awtomatikong pag-tile","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Naka-off ang awtomatikong pag-tile – mode 1 lang ang tumatakbo at walang ginagawa ang shortcut ng mode.","Automatic tiling off":"Naka-off ang awtomatikong pag-tile","Automatic tiling on":"Naka-on ang awtomatikong pag-tile","Automatic tiling on/off":"Awtomatikong pag-tile on/off","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Awtomatikong pag-tile, pagpapalit ng window, mga shortcut at ang magnet para sa lumulutang na window.","Background opacity":"Opacity ng background","Behavior & Animation":"Gawi at animasyon","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Ibabang gilid: ibabang kalahati","Bouncy":"Patalbog","Buy me a coffee":"Ilibre mo ako ng kape","Cancel":"Kanselahin","Center focus":"Pokus sa gitna","Center the window":"Igitna ang window","Change":"Palitan","Change key":"Palitan ang key","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Palitan ang key sa editor ng mga setting. Kailangan ng dalawang mode ang awtomatikong pag-tile at ang snap bar o mga gilid ng screen.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Palitan ang mga ito sa pahinang Mga keyboard shortcut. Sa awtomatikong pag-tile, nagpapalit din ng puwesto ang mga window sa pagkakasunod.","Choose…":"Pumili…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"I-click ang zone para piliin · i-double-click para hatiin · hilahin ang mga divider","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"I-click o pindutin ang %1 para lumipat ng mode.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"I-click, saka OK – magbubukas ang editor ng mga setting.","Close":"Isara","Close by, the edges stick together":"Kapag malapit, nagdidikit ang mga gilid","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Mga kulay, laki at hugis ng snap bar.","Columns":"Mga column","Corner radius":"Radius ng mga sulok","Corner size":"Laki ng sulok","Corner: a quarter":"Sulok: isang kapat","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Mga sulok: kapat ng screen","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + number pad","Custom color":"Sariling kulay","Custom layout %1":"Sariling layout %1","Dark":"Madilim","Delay before hiding":"Pagkaantala bago itago","Delay before showing":"Pagkaantala bago ipakita","Delete":"Burahin","Delete layout?":"Burahin ang layout?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Layo kung saan lumilitaw ang hawakan","Distance before the bar hides again":"Layo bago muling magtago ang bar","Distance to the edge":"Layo sa gilid","Donate with PayPal":"Mag-donate gamit ang PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"I-drag ang pinagsasaluhang gilid…","Drag a window against an edge…":"I-drag ang window sa gilid…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"I-drag ang window sa isa pa para palitan sila. Kapag binitawan sa snap bar o gilid ng screen, malaya itong lulutang; ibinabalik ito ng „Palutangin ang window“. Ang mga puwang ay mula sa pahinang Pangkalahatan.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"I-drag ang window sa gitna ng isa pa – nagpapakita ang preview ng dalawang arrow – at bitawan. Sa awtomatikong pag-tile, kahit saan sa ibabaw ng isa pang window ay puwede.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Hilahin ang window sa itaas na gilid ng screen at bitawan sa isang zone.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Hilahin ang mga card para baguhin ang ayos sa snap bar. I-double-click ang card para i-edit ito.","Drop a window onto another one":"Ibagsak ang window sa isa pa","Drop the window onto a zone":"Bitawan ang window sa isang zone","Duplicate":"Doblehin","Duration":"Tagal","Dwindle":"Spiral papasok","Dynamic":"Dinamiko","Edges and corners":"Mga gilid at sulok","Edit":"I-edit","Edit layout":"I-edit ang layout","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Bawat feature ay mabubuksan at maisasara nang hiwalay.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Bawat layout na gagawin mo sa pahinang Mga layout ay puwede ring mag-ayos ng mga window – lumalabas ito sa itaas. Ang window 1 ay napupunta sa zone 1 at iba pa; ang sobrang window ay naghahati sa huling zone. Kapag mas kaunti ang window kaysa zone, ginagamit ang „Pangunahin at patong“ para walang butas.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Bawat window ay kusang nakakahanap ng puwesto, gaya sa isang tiling window manager.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Bawat window ay kusang nakakahanap ng puwesto sa screen. Sumasali ang mga bagong window, nagbibigay-daan ang mga isinara.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Halimbawa: dalawang window magkatabi, mula tatlo pangunahin at patong, mula lima grid. Kung walang tugmang tuntunin, ginagamit ang layout na pinili sa itaas.","Fade in and out":"Mag-fade kapag lumilitaw at nawawala","Fade the other windows":"Palabuin ang ibang mga window","Features":"Mga feature","Feel":"Pakiramdam","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Umangkop sa mga window na naka-snap na","Fits the way you work.":"Akma sa paraan ng iyong pagtatrabaho.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Palutangin ang window (umalis sa pag-tile)","Four quarters":"Apat na kapat","From":"Mula","Gap between windows":"Pagitan ng mga window","Gap to the screen edge":"Pagitan sa gilid ng screen","General":"Pangkalahatan","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Ibinabalik sa bawat aksyon ang key ng napiling scheme at inaalis ang mga key na wala sa scheme.","Good to know":"Mabuting malaman","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Hawakan ang window sa title bar nito at hilahin pataas. Bababa ang snap bar; bitawan ang window sa isang zone at pupunuin nito ang eksaktong lugar na iyon. Kapag hinila mo ulit palabas, babalik ang dati nitong laki.","Grab window A…":"Hawakan ang window A…","Halves":"Kalahati","Hiding":"Pagtatago","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Hawakan sa gilid para punuin ang bakanteng espasyo","Hold time":"Oras ng paghawak","Hold to fill":"Hawakan para punuin","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Gaano kalapit dapat dumating ang gilid bago ito pumuwesto.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Gaano kalapit sa gilid dapat dumating ang cursor.","How far the bar slides down":"Gaano kalayo bumababa ang bar","How it works":"Paano ito gumagana","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Gaano katagal dapat nakadikit ang window sa gilid – isang maliit na tulak. 0 = agad.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Gaano katagal dapat manatili ang window sa gilid bago ito lumaki.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Ilang window ang naghahati sa pangunahing bahagi (layout na “Pangunahin at patong”).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Kung may window na sa ibaba, ang itaas na gilid ay nagbibigay ng itaas na kalahati sa halip na mag-maximize. Hindi rin tinatakpan ng kalahati at kapat ang mga naka-snap na window.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Kung gusto mo ang KSnapUnity, puwede mong suportahan ang pag-develop nito – salamat!","In bar":"Nasa bar","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Hiwalay sa snap bar at sa mga gilid ng screen.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Hiwalay sa snap bar. Bawat gilid ay puwedeng i-on nang hiwalay.","Information":"Impormasyon","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Natural at madaling maunawaang kilos ng window.","Join at the end":"Sumasali sa dulo","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K para sa KWin · Snap para sa mas matalinong pag-snap · Unity para sa lahat sa iisang sistema","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"May sariling mga aksyon sa gilid ng screen at sariling pag-snap ng window ang KDE. Kung naka-on dito ang parehong feature, i-off ang sa KDE: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, at Window Behavior → Movement.","KDE's own edge tiling":"Sariling edge tiling ng KDE","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"Naka-pause ang sariling pag-maximize at pag-tile ng KDE sa mga gilid – kasama ang outline nito – habang tumatakbo ang KSnapUnity, para isang preview lang ang lumabas. Hindi nagbabago ang mga setting ng KDE: i-off ito, i-disable o alisin ang KSnapUnity at babalik ang kilos ng KDE.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"Naka-on pa ang sariling mga aksyon ng KDE sa gilid ng screen, kaya dalawang tumutulong ang tumutugon sa iisang paghila. I-off ang “Maximize” at “Tile” sa System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.","KDE's own window snapping":"Sariling snapping ng window ng KDE","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"Naka-on din ang sariling pag-snap ng window ng KDE. Para pare-pareho ang pakiramdam, itakda ang mga zone nito sa “Wala” sa System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Hindi sumagot ang shortcut service ng KDE. Puwede mo pa ring itakda ang mga key sa System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – Editor ng mga setting","Keep stacked windows in line":"Panatilihing nakahanay ang mga nakasalansang window","Keep the gap between windows":"Panatilihin ang pagitan ng mga window","Keep them":"Hayaan","Key scheme":"Scheme ng key","Keyboard shortcuts":"Mga keyboard shortcut","Keys":"Mga key","Keys already in use":"Mga key na ginagamit na","Layout by number of windows":"Layout ayon sa dami ng window","Layouts":"Mga layout","Layouts per row":"Mga layout bawat hilera","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Kaliwa at kanang gilid: kalahati ng screen","Left edge: left half":"Kaliwang gilid: kaliwang kalahati","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Sa ilalim ng 100 % nananatili sa gitna ang nag-iisang window – maganda sa malalapad na screen.","License":"Lisensya","Light":"Maliwanag","Live preview":"Live na preview","Load template…":"Mag-load ng template…","Main + stack":"Pangunahin + salansan","Main and stack":"Pangunahin at patong","Main area bigger":"Mas malaking pangunahing bahagi","Main area on the right":"Pangunahing lugar sa kanan","Main area smaller":"Mas maliit na pangunahing bahagi","Main in the middle":"Pangunahin sa gitna","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Pangunahing switch para sa pag-drag at mga key.","Main window":"Pangunahing window","Main windows":"Mga pangunahing window","Main windows: %1":"Mga pangunahing window: %1","Make it the main window":"Gawing pangunahing window","Maximize":"I-maximize","Maximize or restore":"I-maximize o ibalik","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + key (istilong KDE)","Minimize":"I-minimize","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Binabaligtad ang layout: pangunahing window sa kanan, ang iba sa kaliwa.","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Mode 1 – Snap bar at mga gilid ng screen","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Mode 2 – Awtomatikong pag-tile","Modes":"Mga mode","More ways":"Iba pang paraan","Motion curve":"Kurba ng galaw","Move a window towards others…":"Ilapit ang window sa iba…","Move the window one place back":"Ilipat ang window ng isang puwesto pabalik","Move the window one place on":"Ilipat ang window ng isang puwesto pasulong","Name:":"Pangalan:","New layout":"Bagong layout","New windows":"Mga bagong window","Next tiling layout":"Susunod na layout ng tile","Next to the active window":"Katabi ng aktibong window","No key":"Walang key","No other window open":"Walang ibang bukas na window","No outer margin":"Walang panlabas na margin","No shortcuts":"Walang shortcut","None":"Wala","None yet.":"Wala pa.","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Off = mode 1, on = mode 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Off: isang neutral na frame – para lang sa mga preview na naka-on.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Off: nananatiling nakatakda ang mga key pero walang ginagawa.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Naka-off: nananatili ang mga window kung saan mo inilagay. Gumagana pa rin ang ibang feature.","One at a time":"Isa-isa","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Isa ang nagsasara – pinupunan ng iba ang puwang","One main window less":"Isang pangunahing window na mas kaunti","One more main window":"Isa pang pangunahing window","One window":"Isang window","Only one mode is switched on.":"Isang mode lang ang naka-on.","Open settings editor":"Buksan ang editor ng mga setting","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Buksan muna ang app, saka piliin dito.","Open the layout builder":"Buksan ang tagabuo ng layout","Own layouts":"Sariling mga layout","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Bahagi ng bawat gilid na itinuturing na sulok.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"I-pause ang edge tiling ng KDE at ang preview nito","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"I-pause ang mga snap zone ng KDE habang naka-on ang magnet","Previews":"Mga preview","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Itulak ang window sa gilid o sulok ng screen at pupunuin nito ang bahaging iyon. Gumagana kahit may snap bar o wala.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Itulak ang window sa gilid o sulok: i-maximize, kalahati, kapat.","Push delay":"Antala ng tulak","Quarters":"Mga kapat","Quick":"Mabilis","Quick settings":"Mabilisang setting","Recommended values":"Mga inirerekomendang value","Remove":"Alisin","Remove rule":"Alisin ang tuntunin","Remove zone":"Alisin ang zone","Reset all":"I-reset lahat","Reset all keys":"I-reset ang lahat ng key","Reset to default":"Ibalik sa default","Resistance against overlapping":"Paglaban sa pagpapatong","Resize touching windows together":"Sabay na baguhin ang laki ng mga window na nagdidikit","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Kumakapit din ang pag-resize – dito hanggang buong taas","Restore":"Ibalik","Restore default layouts":"Ibalik ang mga default na layout","Restore default layouts?":"Ibalik ang mga default na layout?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Ibalik ang orihinal na laki kapag hinila palabas ang window","Restore the size before snapping":"Ibalik ang laki bago mag-snap","Rows":"Mga row","Save":"I-save","Screen edges":"Mga gilid ng screen","Screen edges on/off":"Mga gilid ng screen on/off","Screen edges preview":"Preview ng mga gilid ng screen","Set":"Itakda","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Itinatakda ang mga key ng lahat ng aksyon nang sabay. Puwede mo pa ring baguhin ang bawat key sa ibaba.","Settings":"Mga setting","Settings file":"File ng mga setting","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Habang nagpapalit ng laki, alugin nang mabilis pabalik-balik ang mouse at babalik ang ibang window. Ang mabilis na hila sa iisang direksyon ay hindi kailanman bumibitaw.","Shake to let go":"Kalugin para bitawan","Shortcuts":"Mga shortcut","Show a small handle first":"Magpakita muna ng maliit na hawakan","Show layout and zone names":"Ipakita ang mga pangalan ng layout at zone","Show previews in the accent color":"Ipakita ang mga preview sa accent color","Showing":"Pagpapakita","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Ipinapakita kung saan lalapag ang window sa gilid o sulok. Off: walang preview.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Ipinapakita kung saan lalapag ang window habang naka-highlight ang isang zone ng bar. Off: walang preview.","Single zone":"Iisang zone","Six tiles":"Anim na tile","Size & shape":"Laki at hugis","Size of the main area":"Laki ng pangunahing bahagi","Slide-in duration":"Tagal ng pagpasok","Slide-out duration":"Tagal ng paglabas","Smart arranging and detection.":"Matalinong pag-aayos at pagtukoy.","Smart fill":"Matalinong pagpuno","Smooth (default)":"Makinis (default)","Snap bar and screen edges":"Snap bar at mga gilid ng screen","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Naka-off ang snap bar at mga gilid – mode 2 lang ang tumatakbo at walang ginagawa ang shortcut ng mode.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Nakakasagabal ang snap bar at mga gilid ng screen sa awtomatikong pag-tile. Kaya tumatakbo sila bilang dalawang mode – lumipat gamit ang shortcut o dito.","Snap bar colors:":"Mga kulay ng snap bar:","Snap bar preview":"Preview ng snap bar","Snap bar size":"Laki ng snap bar","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Snap bar, mga gilid ng screen, magnet ng window, mga shortcut at pagpapalit ng window.","Snap distance":"Layo ng pagdikit","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"I-snap ang mga divider (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Mga snap layout at awtomatikong pag-tile.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"I-snap ang aktibong window gamit ang mga kombinasyon ng key.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"I-snap ang aktibong window gamit ang keyboard. Karaniwang global shortcut ng KDE ang mga ito – makikita mo rin sa System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"I-snap sa ibabang kalahati","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"I-snap sa ibaba-kaliwang kapat","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"I-snap sa ibaba-kanang kapat","Snap to the center third":"I-snap sa gitnang ikatlo","Snap to the left half":"I-snap sa kaliwang kalahati","Snap to the left third":"I-snap sa kaliwang ikatlo","Snap to the left two thirds":"I-snap sa kaliwang dalawang ikatlo","Snap to the right half":"I-snap sa kanang kalahati","Snap to the right third":"I-snap sa kanang ikatlo","Snap to the right two thirds":"I-snap sa kanang dalawang ikatlo","Snap to the top half":"I-snap sa itaas na kalahati","Snap to the top-left quarter":"I-snap sa itaas-kaliwang kapat","Snap to the top-right quarter":"I-snap sa itaas-kanang kapat","Snapping":"Pag-snap","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Tumatakbo ang pag-snap at awtomatikong pag-tile bilang dalawang mode – isang shortcut ang nagpapalit sa pagitan nila.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Kaya isang magnet lang ang humihila sa window. Hindi nagbabago ang mga setting ng KDE: i-off ito, i-disable o alisin ang KSnapUnity at babalik ang pag-snap ng KDE.","Soft":"Malambot","Spacing":"Pagitan","Split side by side":"Hatiin nang magkatabi","Split top and bottom":"Hatiin sa itaas at ibaba","Stack + main":"Salansan + pangunahin","Stick to other windows":"Dumikit sa ibang window","Stick to the screen edges":"Dumikit sa mga gilid ng screen","Sticky edges":"Malagkit na gilid","Support KSnapUnity":"Suportahan ang KSnapUnity","Swap":"Pagpalitin","Swap windows":"Pagpalitin ang mga window","Swap with the window above":"Ipalit sa window sa itaas","Swap with the window below":"Ipalit sa window sa ibaba","Swap with the window on the left":"Ipalit sa window sa kaliwa","Swap with the window on the right":"Ipalit sa window sa kanan","Switch mode":"Lumipat ng mode","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Lumipat ng mode (snap / tile)","Switch modes with:":"Lumipat ng mode gamit ang:","Switch the layout by itself":"Kusang palitan ang layout","Switched off":"Naka-off","Take it over":"Kunin","Take over all":"Kunin lahat","Take the main place":"Kinukuha ang pangunahing puwesto","Test animation":"Subukan ang animasyon","Test on screen":"Subukan sa screen","Test the snap bar":"Subukan ang snap bar","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Ang mga default na value ay batay sa Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Ginagamit ng mga aksyon sa pag-snap ang parehong pagitan ng snap bar at natatandaan ang laki bago mag-snap: ibinabalik ito ng “Ibalik ang laki bago mag-snap”.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Hindi kailanman inaayos ang mga app na ito at pinapanatili nila ang sariling puwesto. Laging lumulutang ang mga dialog.","Thirds":"Mga ikatlo","Three columns":"Tatlong column","Thumbnail width":"Lapad ng mga thumbnail","Tiling":"Pag-tile","Top / bottom":"Itaas / ibaba","Top edge":"Itaas na gilid","Top edge: full screen":"Itaas na gilid: buong screen","Top edge: maximize":"Itaas na gilid: i-maximize","Top edge: top half":"Itaas na gilid: itaas na kalahati","Top half":"Itaas na kalahati","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Layo ng pag-trigger mula sa itaas na gilid","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"I-off ito kung mas gusto mo ang sariling outline ng KDE – pagkatapos ay i-off ang preview ng mga gilid sa itaas.","Two thirds":"Dalawang ikatlo","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Nagpapalitan ng puwesto ang dalawang window – ihulog ang isa sa isa pa o gamitin ang mga key.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Nagpapalitan ng puwesto ang dalawang window: ihulog ang isa sa isa pa, o gamit ang key.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Gamitin ang mga keyboard shortcut","Use screen edges":"Gamitin ang mga gilid ng screen","Use the system accent color":"Gamitin ang accent color ng system","Use the window magnet":"Gamitin ang magnet ng window","Usual combinations":"Karaniwang kombinasyon","Version":"Bersyon","Wanted for: %1":"Gusto para sa: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Kapag may window na nagbubukas, nagsasara o nagpapalit, maayos na gumagalaw ang iba sa halip na tumalon.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Kapag binago mo ang laki ng window, sumasabay ang mga window na nakadikit dito sa paggalaw ng pinagsasaluhang gilid – walang nagpapatong, walang puwang.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Habang binabago ang laki, ipinapakitang malinaw ang mga window na hindi sumasabay.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Habang inililipat o binabago mo ang laki ng window, dumidikit ang mga gilid nito sa mga kalapit na window at sa mga gilid ng screen.","Width":"Lapad","Window magnet":"Magnet ng window","Window magnet on/off":"Magnet ng window on/off","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Ang mga window na magkapatong ay pinagsasama ang kaliwa at kanang gilid, ang magkatabi ang itaas at ibabang gilid.","Windows glide to their place":"Dumudulas sa puwesto ang mga window","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Dumidikit ang mga window sa isa’t isa at sa mga gilid ng screen.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Humihinto ang mga window sa “Pagitan ng mga window” mula sa pahinang Pangkalahatan sa halip na magdikit.","Yes":"Oo","Your own combination":"Sariling kombinasyon","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Mawawala ang sarili mong mga layout at ang ayos nila.","for KWin · v%1":"para sa KWin · v%1","windows:":"window:","“%1” will be removed.":"Aalisin ang “%1”.","…drag it onto window B…":"…i-drag ito sa window B…","…in every direction":"…sa lahat ng direksyon","…let go: they trade places":"…bitawan: nagpapalitan sila ng puwesto","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…lumalaki at lumiliit ang mga katabi kasabay nito","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Handa na – i-click ang OK para buksan ang editor ng mga setting."},"tr":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (kopya)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1, “%2” tarafından kullanılıyor.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 / %2 bölge","0 = all in one row":"0 = hepsi tek satırda","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Kip 1</b><br/>Yaslama çubuğu ve ekran kenarları","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Kip 2</b><br/>Otomatik döşeme","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Tek pencere, kenar boşluğu ayarlı olsa bile tüm ekranı kullanır.","A new window joins":"Yeni bir pencere katılır","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Kısa bir itiş yarımı veya çeyreği verir. Pencereyi kenarda biraz daha uzun tutun, sonraki pencereye kadar büyür – önizleme bunu gösterir.","A single window":"Tek bir pencere","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Bir pencere, hızlı taşısanız bile başka birinin kenarında durur. Bırakmak için fareyi sallayın ya da bir an daha itmeye devam edin. 0 = pencereler serbestçe üst üste binebilir.","About & Help":"Hakkında ve yardım","Accent color":"Vurgu rengi","Active":"Etkin","Active mode":"Etkin kip","Active width along the top edge":"Üst kenar boyunca etkin genişlik","Add an open application":"Açık bir uygulama ekle","Add rule":"Kural ekle","All window features in one system.":"Tüm pencere özellikleri tek bir sistemde.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Ana pencereyi elle boyutlandırdığınızda da değişir.","Also while resizing":"Boyutlandırırken de","Always floating":"Her zaman serbest","Animation":"Animasyon","Appearance":"Görünüm","Apply":"Uygula","Arrange windows":"Pencereleri düzenle","Arrange windows automatically":"Pencereleri otomatik düzenle","Author":"Yazar","Automatic tiling":"Otomatik döşeme","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Otomatik döşeme kapalı – yalnızca kip 1 çalışır ve kip kısayolu hiçbir şey yapmaz.","Automatic tiling off":"Otomatik döşeme kapalı","Automatic tiling on":"Otomatik döşeme açık","Automatic tiling on/off":"Otomatik döşeme aç/kapat","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Otomatik döşeme, pencere değiştirme, kısayollar ve serbest pencereler için mıknatıs.","Background opacity":"Arka plan opaklığı","Behavior & Animation":"Davranış ve animasyon","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Alt kenar: alt yarı","Bouncy":"Yaylı","Buy me a coffee":"Bana bir kahve ısmarla","Cancel":"İptal","Center focus":"Ortada odak","Center the window":"Pencereyi ortala","Change":"Değiştir","Change key":"Tuşu değiştir","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Tuşu ayar düzenleyicide değiştirirsiniz. İki kip de otomatik döşeme ile yaslama çubuğu veya ekran kenarları gerektirir.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Bunları Klavye kısayolları sayfasında değiştirin. Otomatik döşemede pencereler sıradaki yerlerini de değiştirir.","Choose…":"Seçin…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Seçmek için bir bölgeye tıklayın · bölmek için çift tıklayın · ayırıcıları sürükleyin","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Kipi değiştirmek için tıklayın veya %1 tuşuna basın.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Tıklayın, sonra Tamam – ayar düzenleyici açılır.","Close":"Kapat","Close by, the edges stick together":"Yaklaşınca kenarlar birbirine yapışır","Color scheme":"Renk şeması","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Yaslama çubuğunun renkleri, boyutu ve şekli.","Columns":"Sütunlar","Corner radius":"Köşe yarıçapı","Corner size":"Köşe boyutu","Corner: a quarter":"Köşe: çeyrek","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Köşeler: ekranın çeyreği","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + tuş (varsayılan)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + sayısal tuş takımı","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + tuş","Custom color":"Özel renk","Custom layout %1":"Özel yerleşim %1","Dark":"Koyu","Delay before hiding":"Gizlemeden önce gecikme","Delay before showing":"Göstermeden önce gecikme","Delete":"Sil","Delete layout?":"Yerleşim silinsin mi?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Tutamacın göründüğü mesafe","Distance before the bar hides again":"Çubuğun yeniden gizlenmesi için mesafe","Distance to the edge":"Kenara uzaklık","Donate with PayPal":"PayPal ile bağış yap","Drag a shared edge…":"Ortak bir kenarı sürükleyin…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Bir pencereyi kenara sürükleyin…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Yer değiştirmek için bir pencereyi diğerinin üzerine sürükleyin. Çubuğa veya ekran kenarına bırakılırsa serbest kalır; „Pencereyi serbest bırak“ onu geri getirir. Boşluklar Genel sayfasından gelir.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Bir pencereyi diğerinin ortasına sürükleyin – önizleme iki ok gösterir – ve bırakın. Otomatik döşemede diğer pencerenin üzerinde herhangi bir yer yeterlidir.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Bir pencereyi ekranın üst kenarına sürükleyin ve bir bölgeye bırakın.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Çubuktaki sırayı değiştirmek için kartları sürükleyin. Düzenlemek için bir karta çift tıklayın.","Drop a window onto another one":"Bir pencereyi diğerinin üzerine bırak","Drop the window onto a zone":"Pencereyi bir bölgeye bırakın","Duplicate":"Çoğalt","Duration":"Süre","Dwindle":"İçe doğru sarmal","Dynamic":"Dinamik","Edges and corners":"Kenarlar ve köşeler","Edit":"Düzenle","Edit layout":"Yerleşimi düzenle","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Her özellik ayrı ayrı açılıp kapatılabilir.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Yerleşimler sayfasında oluşturduğunuz her yerleşim pencereleri de düzenleyebilir – yukarıda görünür. Pencere 1 bölge 1’i alır ve böyle devam eder; fazla pencereler son bölgeyi paylaşır. Bölgeden az pencere varsa boşluk kalmasın diye „Ana ve yığın“ kullanılır.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Her pencere yerini kendisi bulur, döşemeli bir pencere yöneticisindeki gibi.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Her pencere ekrandaki yerini kendisi bulur. Yeni pencereler sıraya katılır, kapananlar diğerlerine yer açar.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Örnek: iki pencere yan yana, üçten itibaren ana ve yığın, beşten itibaren ızgara. Uygun kural yoksa yukarıda seçilen yerleşim kullanılır.","Fade in and out":"Girerken ve çıkarken soldur","Fade the other windows":"Diğer pencereleri soldur","Features":"Özellikler","Feel":"His","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Zaten yaslanmış pencerelere uyum sağla","Fits the way you work.":"Çalışma biçiminize uyar.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Pencereyi serbest bırak (döşemeden çık)","Four quarters":"Dört çeyrek","From":"Şu sayıdan:","Fullscreen":"Tam ekran","Gap between windows":"Pencereler arası boşluk","Gap to the screen edge":"Ekran kenarına boşluk","General":"Genel","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Her eyleme seçilen şemanın tuşunu yeniden verir ve şemada olmayan tuşları kaldırır.","Good to know":"Bilmekte fayda var","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Bir pencereyi başlık çubuğundan tutun ve yukarı sürükleyin. Çubuk aşağı kayar; pencereyi bir bölgeye bırakın, tam o alanı kaplar. Yeniden dışarı çektiğinizde eski boyutuna döner.","Grab window A…":"A penceresini tutun…","Grid":"Izgara","Halves":"Yarımlar","Hiding":"Gizleme","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Boş alanı doldurmak için kenarda tut","Hold time":"Tutma süresi","Hold to fill":"Doldurmak için tut","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Bir kenarın yerine oturmadan önce ne kadar yaklaşması gerektiği.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"İmlecin kenara ne kadar yaklaşması gerektiği.","How far the bar slides down":"Çubuğun ne kadar aşağı kaydığı","How it works":"Nasıl çalışır","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Pencerenin kenarda ne kadar durması gerektiği – küçük bir itiş. 0 = hemen.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Pencerenin büyümeden önce kenarda ne kadar kalması gerektiği.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Ana alanı kaç pencerenin paylaştığı (“Ana ve yığın” yerleşimi).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Altta zaten bir pencere varsa üst kenar büyütmek yerine üst yarıyı verir. Yarımlar ve çeyrekler de yaslanmış pencereleri açıkta bırakır.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"KSnapUnity’yi beğendiyseniz geliştirilmesini destekleyebilirsiniz – teşekkürler!","In bar":"Çubukta","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Yaslama çubuğundan ve ekran kenarlarından bağımsız.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Yaslama çubuğundan bağımsız. Her kenar ayrı ayrı açılabilir.","Information":"Bilgi","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Sezgisel, doğal pencere davranışı.","Join at the end":"Sona eklenir","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K: KWin · Snap: daha akıllı yaslama · Unity: her şey tek sistemde","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE’nin kendi ekran kenarı eylemleri ve kendi pencere yaslaması vardır. Aynı özellik burada açıksa KDE’ninkini kapatın: Sistem Ayarları → Pencere Yönetimi → Ekran Kenarları ve Pencere Davranışı → Taşıma.","KDE's own edge tiling":"KDE'nin kendi kenar döşemesi","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"KDE’nin kenarlardaki kendi büyütme ve döşemesi – dış çizgisiyle – KSnapUnity çalışırken duraklatılır, böylece tek bir önizleme görünür. KDE ayarlarınız değişmez: bunu kapatın, KSnapUnity’yi devre dışı bırakın veya kaldırın; KDE’nin davranışı geri gelir.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"KDE’nin kendi ekran kenarı eylemleri hâlâ açık, bu yüzden aynı sürüklemeye iki yardımcı tepki veriyor. Sistem Ayarları → Pencere Yönetimi → Ekran Kenarları altında “Büyüt” ve “Döşe” seçeneklerini kapatın.","KDE's own window snapping":"KDE'nin kendi pencere yapışması","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE’nin kendi pencere yaslaması da açık. Tutarlı bir his için bölgelerini Sistem Ayarları → Pencere Yönetimi → Pencere Davranışı → Taşıma altında “Yok” yapın.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"KDE kısayol hizmeti yanıt vermedi. Tuşları yine de Sistem Ayarları → Kısayollar → KWin altında ayarlayabilirsiniz.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – Ayar düzenleyici","Keep stacked windows in line":"Üst üste pencereleri hizada tut","Keep the gap between windows":"Pencereler arası boşluğu koru","Keep them":"Kalsınlar","Key scheme":"Tuş düzeni","Keyboard shortcuts":"Klavye kısayolları","Keys":"Tuşlar","Keys already in use":"Zaten kullanılan tuşlar","Layout":"Yerleşim","Layout by number of windows":"Pencere sayısına göre yerleşim","Layouts":"Yerleşimler","Layouts per row":"Satır başına yerleşim","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Sol ve sağ kenar: ekranın yarısı","Left edge: left half":"Sol kenar: sol yarı","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"100 %’ün altında tek pencere ortada kalır – geniş ekranlarda hoş.","License":"Lisans","Light":"Açık","Linear":"Doğrusal","Live preview":"Canlı önizleme","Load template…":"Şablon yükle…","Magnet":"Mıknatıs","Main + stack":"Ana + yığın","Main and stack":"Ana ve yığın","Main area bigger":"Ana alanı büyüt","Main area on the right":"Ana alan sağda","Main area smaller":"Ana alanı küçült","Main in the middle":"Ortada ana","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Sürükleme ve tuşlar için ana anahtar.","Main window":"Ana pencere","Main windows":"Ana pencereler","Main windows: %1":"Ana pencereler: %1","Make it the main window":"Ana pencere yap","Maximize":"Büyüt","Maximize or restore":"Büyüt veya geri yükle","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + tuş (KDE tarzı)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + tuş","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + tuş","Minimize":"Simge durumuna küçült","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Yerleşimi aynalar: ana pencere sağda, diğerleri solda.","Mode":"Kip","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Kip 1 – Yaslama çubuğu ve ekran kenarları","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Kip 2 – Otomatik döşeme","Modes":"Kipler","More ways":"Diğer yollar","Motion curve":"Hareket eğrisi","Move a window towards others…":"Bir pencereyi diğerlerine yaklaştırın…","Move the window one place back":"Pencereyi bir sıra geri al","Move the window one place on":"Pencereyi bir sıra ileri al","Name:":"Ad:","New layout":"Yeni yerleşim","New windows":"Yeni pencereler","Next tiling layout":"Sonraki döşeme yerleşimi","Next to the active window":"Etkin pencerenin yanına","No key":"Tuş yok","No other window open":"Başka açık pencere yok","No outer margin":"Dış kenar boşluğu yok","No shortcuts":"Kısayol yok","None":"Yok","None yet.":"Henüz yok.","Off":"Kapalı","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Kapalı = kip 1, açık = kip 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Kapalı: nötr bir çerçeve – yalnızca açık önizlemeler için.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Kapalı: tuşlar atanmış kalır ama hiçbir şey yapmaz.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Kapalı: pencereler bıraktığınız yerde kalır. Diğer özellikler her durumda çalışır.","One at a time":"Birer birer","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Biri kapanır – diğerleri boşluğu doldurur","One main window less":"Bir ana pencere eksik","One more main window":"Bir ana pencere daha","One window":"Tek pencere","Only one mode is switched on.":"Yalnızca bir kip açık.","Open settings editor":"Ayar düzenleyiciyi aç","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Önce uygulamayı açın, sonra buradan seçin.","Open the layout builder":"Yerleşim oluşturucuyu aç","Own layouts":"Kendi yerleşimleriniz","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Her kenarın köşe sayılan kısmı.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"KDE'nin kenar döşemesini ve önizlemesini duraklat","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Mıknatıs açıkken KDE'nin yapışma bölgelerini duraklat","Preview":"Önizleme","Previews":"Önizlemeler","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Bir pencereyi ekranın kenarına veya köşesine bastırın, o bölümü doldursun. Yaslama çubuğuyla veya onsuz çalışır.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Bir pencereyi kenara veya köşeye bastırın: büyüt, yarımlar, çeyrekler.","Push delay":"İtme gecikmesi","Quarters":"Çeyrekler","Quick":"Hızlı","Quick settings":"Hızlı ayarlar","Recommended values":"Önerilen değerler","Remove":"Kaldır","Remove rule":"Kuralı kaldır","Remove zone":"Bölgeyi kaldır","Reset all":"Tümünü sıfırla","Reset all keys":"Tüm tuşları sıfırla","Reset to default":"Varsayılana sıfırla","Resistance against overlapping":"Örtüşmeye karşı direnç","Resize touching windows together":"Birbirine değen pencereleri birlikte boyutlandır","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Boyutlandırma da yaslanır – burada tam yüksekliğe","Restore":"Geri yükle","Restore default layouts":"Varsayılan yerleşimleri geri yükle","Restore default layouts?":"Varsayılan yerleşimler geri yüklensin mi?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Pencere dışarı çekilince özgün boyutu geri yükle","Restore the size before snapping":"Yaslamadan önceki boyutu geri yükle","Rows":"Satırlar","Save":"Kaydet","Screen edges":"Ekran kenarları","Screen edges on/off":"Ekran kenarları aç/kapat","Screen edges preview":"Ekran kenarları önizlemesi","Set":"Ata","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Tüm eylemlerin tuşlarını tek seferde ayarlar. Tek tek tuşları aşağıda değiştirmeye devam edebilirsiniz.","Settings":"Ayarlar","Settings file":"Ayar dosyası","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Boyutlandırırken fareyi hızla ileri geri sallayın, diğer pencereler geri sıçrar. Tek yöne hızlı bir çekiş onları asla bırakmaz.","Shake to let go":"Bırakmak için salla","Shortcuts":"Kısayollar","Show a small handle first":"Önce küçük bir tutamaç göster","Show layout and zone names":"Yerleşim ve bölge adlarını göster","Show previews in the accent color":"Önizlemeleri vurgu renginde göster","Showing":"Gösterme","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Pencerenin bir kenarda veya köşede nereye yerleşeceğini gösterir. Kapalı: hiç önizleme yok.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Çubuğun bir bölgesi vurgulanırken pencerenin nereye yerleşeceğini gösterir. Kapalı: hiç önizleme yok.","Sidebar + grid":"Kenar çubuğu + ızgara","Single zone":"Tek bölge","Six tiles":"Altı döşeme","Size & shape":"Boyut ve şekil","Size of the main area":"Ana alanın boyutu","Slide-in duration":"Kayarak girme süresi","Slide-out duration":"Kayarak çıkma süresi","Smart arranging and detection.":"Akıllı yerleştirme ve algılama.","Smart fill":"Akıllı doldurma","Smooth (default)":"Yumuşak (varsayılan)","Snap bar":"Yaslama çubuğu","Snap bar and screen edges":"Yaslama çubuğu ve ekran kenarları","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Çubuk ve kenarlar kapalı – yalnızca kip 2 çalışır ve kip kısayolu hiçbir şey yapmaz.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Yaslama çubuğu ve ekran kenarları otomatik döşemeyi engeller. Bu yüzden iki kip olarak çalışırlar – kısayolla veya buradan değiştirin.","Snap bar colors:":"Çubuk renkleri:","Snap bar on/off":"Yaslama çubuğu aç/kapat","Snap bar preview":"Yapışma çubuğu önizlemesi","Snap bar size":"Çubuk boyutu","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Yaslama çubuğu, ekran kenarları, pencere mıknatısı, kısayollar ve pencere değiştirme.","Snap distance":"Yapışma mesafesi","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Ayırıcıları yasla (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Yaslama yerleşimleri ve otomatik döşeme.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Etkin pencereyi tuş kombinasyonlarıyla yaslayın.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Etkin pencereyi klavyeyle yaslayın. Bunlar normal KDE genel kısayollarıdır – Sistem Ayarları → Kısayollar → KWin altında da bulabilirsiniz.","Snap to the bottom half":"Alt yarıya yasla","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Sol alt çeyreğe yasla","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Sağ alt çeyreğe yasla","Snap to the center third":"Orta üçte bire yasla","Snap to the left half":"Sol yarıya yasla","Snap to the left third":"Sol üçte bire yasla","Snap to the left two thirds":"Sol üçte ikiye yasla","Snap to the right half":"Sağ yarıya yasla","Snap to the right third":"Sağ üçte bire yasla","Snap to the right two thirds":"Sağ üçte ikiye yasla","Snap to the top half":"Üst yarıya yasla","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Sol üst çeyreğe yasla","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Sağ üst çeyreğe yasla","Snapping":"Yaslama","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Yaslama ve otomatik döşeme iki kip olarak çalışır – tek bir kısayol aralarında geçiş yapar.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Böylece pencereyi yalnızca bir mıknatıs çeker. KDE ayarlarınız değişmez: bunu kapatın, KSnapUnity’yi devre dışı bırakın veya kaldırın; KDE’nin yaslaması geri gelir.","Soft":"Sakin","Spacing":"Boşluklar","Spiral":"Sarmal","Split side by side":"Yan yana böl","Split top and bottom":"Üst ve alt olarak böl","Stack + main":"Yığın + ana","Stick to other windows":"Diğer pencerelere yapış","Stick to the screen edges":"Ekran kenarlarına yapış","Sticky edges":"Yapışkan kenarlar","Support KSnapUnity":"KSnapUnity’yi destekleyin","Swap":"Değiştir","Swap windows":"Pencereleri değiştir","Swap with the window above":"Üstteki pencereyle değiştir","Swap with the window below":"Alttaki pencereyle değiştir","Swap with the window on the left":"Soldaki pencereyle değiştir","Swap with the window on the right":"Sağdaki pencereyle değiştir","Switch mode":"Kipi değiştir","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Kipi değiştir (yaslama / döşeme)","Switch modes with:":"Kip değiştirme tuşu:","Switch the layout by itself":"Yerleşimi kendiliğinden değiştir","Switched off":"Kapalı","System":"Sistem","Take it over":"Devral","Take over all":"Hepsini devral","Take the main place":"Ana yeri alır","Test animation":"Animasyonu dene","Test on screen":"Ekranda dene","Test the snap bar":"Yaslama çubuğunu dene","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Varsayılan değerler Windows 11 temel alınarak belirlendi.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Yaslama eylemleri çubukla aynı boşlukları kullanır ve yaslamadan önceki boyutu hatırlar: “Yaslamadan önceki boyutu geri yükle” onu geri getirir.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Bu uygulamalar asla düzenlenmez ve kendi yerlerini korur. İletişim kutuları her zaman serbesttir.","Thirds":"Üçte birler","Three columns":"Üç sütun","Thumbnail width":"Küçük resim genişliği","Tiling":"Döşeme","Tip":"İpucu","Top / bottom":"Üst / alt","Top edge":"Üst kenar","Top edge: full screen":"Üst kenar: tam ekran","Top edge: maximize":"Üst kenar: büyüt","Top edge: top half":"Üst kenar: üst yarı","Top half":"Üst yarı","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Üst kenardan tetikleme mesafesi","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"KDE'nin kendi çerçevesini tercih ediyorsanız bunu kapatın – ardından yukarıdaki ekran kenarları önizlemesini kapatın.","Two thirds":"Üçte iki","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"İki pencere yer değiştirir – birini diğerinin üzerine bırakın veya tuşları kullanın.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"İki pencere yer değiştirir: birini diğerinin üzerine bırakın veya bir tuşla.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Klavye kısayollarını kullan","Use screen edges":"Ekran kenarlarını kullan","Use the system accent color":"Sistemin vurgu rengini kullan","Use the window magnet":"Pencere mıknatısını kullan","Usual combinations":"Yaygın kombinasyonlar","Version":"Sürüm","Wanted for: %1":"İstenen eylem: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Bir pencere açıldığında, kapandığında veya yer değiştirdiğinde diğerleri zıplamak yerine yumuşakça hareket eder.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Bir pencereyi boyutlandırdığınızda ona değen pencereler ortak kenarı onunla birlikte taşır – hiçbir şey örtüşmez, boşluk oluşmaz.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Boyutlandırma sırasında birlikte hareket etmeyen pencereler saydam gösterilir.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Bir pencereyi taşırken veya boyutlandırırken kenarları yakındaki pencerelere ve ekran kenarlarına yapışır.","Width":"Genişlik","Window":"Pencere","Window magnet":"Pencere mıknatısı","Window magnet on/off":"Pencere mıknatısı aç/kapat","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Üst üste duran pencereler sol ve sağ kenarlarını, yan yana duranlar üst ve alt kenarlarını birlikte tutar.","Windows glide to their place":"Pencereler yerlerine kayar","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Pencereler birbirine ve ekran kenarlarına yapışır.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Pencereler birbirine değmek yerine Genel sayfasındaki “Pencereler arası boşluk” değerinde durur.","Yes":"Evet","Your own combination":"Kendi kombinasyonunuz","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Kendi yerleşimleriniz ve sıraları kaybolacak.","Zone %1":"Bölge %1","for KWin · v%1":"KWin için · v%1","windows:":"pencere:","“%1” will be removed.":"“%1” kaldırılacak.","…drag it onto window B…":"…B penceresinin üzerine sürükleyin…","…in every direction":"…her yönde","…let go: they trade places":"…bırakın: yer değiştirirler","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…komşular onunla birlikte büyür ve küçülür","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Hazır – ayar düzenleyiciyi açmak için Tamam’a tıklayın."},"uk":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (копія)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 використовує «%2».","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 з %2 зон","0 = all in one row":"0 = усі в одному рядку","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Режим 1</b><br/>Панель прилипання і краї екрана","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Режим 2</b><br/>Автоматична мозаїка","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Єдине вікно займає весь екран, навіть якщо відступ задано.","A new window joins":"Додається нове вікно","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Короткий поштовх дає половину або чверть. Потримайте вікно біля краю трохи довше, і воно виросте до наступного вікна – перегляд це покаже.","A single window":"Одне вікно","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Вікно зупиняється біля краю іншого, навіть якщо рухати його швидко. Струсніть мишею або потисніть ще мить, щоб відпустити. 0 = вікна можуть вільно перекриватися.","About & Help":"Про програму й довідка","Accent color":"Колір акценту","Active":"Активно","Active mode":"Активний режим","Active width along the top edge":"Активна ширина вздовж верхнього краю","Add an open application":"Додати відкриту програму","Add rule":"Додати правило","All window features in one system.":"Усі функції вікон в одній системі.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Змінюється й тоді, коли ви вручну змінюєте розмір головного вікна.","Also while resizing":"Також під час зміни розміру","Always floating":"Завжди вільні","Animation":"Анімація","Appearance":"Вигляд","Apply":"Застосувати","Arrange windows":"Розташування вікон","Arrange windows automatically":"Розташовувати вікна автоматично","Author":"Автор","Automatic tiling":"Автоматична мозаїка","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Автоматичну мозаїку вимкнено – працює лише режим 1, а клавіша режиму нічого не робить.","Automatic tiling off":"Автоматичну мозаїку вимкнено","Automatic tiling on":"Автоматичну мозаїку ввімкнено","Automatic tiling on/off":"Автоматична мозаїка увімк./вимк.","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Автоматична мозаїка, обмін вікон, скорочення і магніт для вільних вікон.","Background opacity":"Непрозорість тла","Behavior & Animation":"Поведінка й анімація","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Нижній край: нижня половина","Bouncy":"Пружна","Buy me a coffee":"Пригостіть мене кавою","Cancel":"Скасувати","Center focus":"Фокус у центрі","Center the window":"Вікно по центру","Change":"Змінити","Change key":"Змінити клавішу","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Клавішу можна змінити в редакторі налаштувань. Обом режимам потрібні автоматична мозаїка і панель або краї екрана.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Змінити їх можна на сторінці «Клавіатурні скорочення». За автоматичної мозаїки вікна також міняються місцями в порядку.","Choose…":"Вибрати…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Клацніть зону, щоб вибрати її · подвійне клацання ділить · перетягуйте роздільники","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Натисніть тут або %1, щоб перемкнути режим.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Натисніть, потім OK – відкриється редактор налаштувань.","Close":"Закрити","Close by, the edges stick together":"Поруч краї прилипають","Color scheme":"Схема кольорів","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Кольори, розмір і форма панелі.","Columns":"Стовпці","Corner radius":"Радіус кутів","Corner size":"Розмір кутів","Corner: a quarter":"Кут: чверть","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Кути: чверть екрана","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + клавіша (типово)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + цифровий блок","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + клавіша","Custom color":"Власний колір","Custom layout %1":"Власне компонування %1","Dark":"Темна","Delay before hiding":"Затримка перед приховуванням","Delay before showing":"Затримка перед показом","Delete":"Вилучити","Delete layout?":"Вилучити компонування?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Відстань, на якій з’являється вушко","Distance before the bar hides again":"Відстань, після якої панель знову ховається","Distance to the edge":"Відстань до краю","Donate with PayPal":"Пожертвувати через PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"Тягніть спільний край…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Перетягніть вікно до краю…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Перетягніть вікно на інше, щоб поміняти їх. Відпущене на панелі або біля краю екрана, воно вільне; «Звільнити вікно» повертає його. Проміжки задаються на сторінці «Загальні».","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Перетягніть вікно на середину іншого – перегляд покаже дві стрілки – і відпустіть. В автоматичній мозаїці підійде будь-яке місце над іншим вікном.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Перетягніть вікно до верхнього краю екрана й відпустіть на зоні.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Перетягуйте картки, щоб змінити порядок на панелі. Двічі клацніть картку, щоб її редагувати.","Drop a window onto another one":"Кинути вікно на інше","Drop the window onto a zone":"Відпустіть вікно на зоні","Duplicate":"Дублювати","Duration":"Тривалість","Dwindle":"Спіраль усередину","Dynamic":"Динамічна","Edges and corners":"Краї та кути","Edit":"Редагувати","Edit layout":"Редагувати компонування","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Кожну функцію можна вмикати й вимикати окремо.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Кожне компонування зі сторінки «Компонування» може й розставляти вікна – воно з’являється вище. Вікно 1 займає зону 1 і так далі; зайві вікна ділять останню зону. Якщо вікон менше, ніж зон, використовується «Головне і стос», щоб не було дірок.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Кожне вікно саме знаходить своє місце, як у мозаїчному менеджері вікон.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Кожне вікно саме знаходить своє місце на екрані. Нові вікна стають у ряд, закриті звільняють місце для інших.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Приклад: два вікна поруч, від трьох – головне і стос, від п’яти – сітка. Без відповідного правила діє вибране вище компонування.","Fade in and out":"Згасання під час появи й зникнення","Fade the other windows":"Приглушувати інші вікна","Features":"Можливості","Feel":"Відчуття","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Підлаштовуватися під уже прилиплі вікна","Fits the way you work.":"Підлаштовується під ваш спосіб роботи.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Звільнити вікно (вийти з мозаїки)","Four quarters":"Чотири чверті","From":"Від","Fullscreen":"Повноекранний режим","Gap between windows":"Відступ між вікнами","Gap to the screen edge":"Відступ від краю екрана","General":"Загальне","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Знову призначає кожній дії клавішу вибраної схеми і вилучає клавіші, яких немає в схемі.","Good to know":"Варто знати","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Візьміть вікно за смужку заголовка й перетягніть угору. Панель опускається; відпустіть вікно на зоні — і воно займе саме цю ділянку. Якщо знову витягнути його, воно повернеться до попереднього розміру.","Grab window A…":"Візьміть вікно A…","Grid":"Сітка","Halves":"Половини","Hiding":"Приховування","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Утримувати біля краю, щоб заповнити вільне місце","Hold time":"Час утримання","Hold to fill":"Утримувати для заповнення","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Наскільки близько має підійти край, перш ніж стати на місце.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Наскільки близько до краю має підійти вказівник.","How far the bar slides down":"Наскільки низько опускається панель","How it works":"Як це працює","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Скільки часу вікно має бути біля краю – невеликий поштовх. 0 = одразу.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Скільки вікно має пробути біля краю, перш ніж вирости.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Скільки вікон ділять головну область (компонування «Головне і стос»).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Якщо внизу вже є вікно, верхній край дає верхню половину замість максимізації. Половини та чверті теж залишають прилиплі вікна вільними.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Якщо вам подобається KSnapUnity, ви можете підтримати розробку – дякуємо!","In bar":"На панелі","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Незалежно від панелі та країв екрана.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Незалежно від панелі. Кожен край вмикається окремо.","Information":"Інформація","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Інтуїтивна, природна поведінка вікон.","Join at the end":"Стають у кінець","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K – це KWin · Snap – це розумне прилипання · Unity – це все в одній системі","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE має власні дії країв екрана та власне прилипання вікон. Якщо тут увімкнено ту саму функцію, вимкніть функцію KDE: Системні параметри → Керування вікнами → Краї екрана, а також Поведінка вікон → Пересування.","KDE's own edge tiling":"Власна мозаїка країв KDE","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"Власне розгортання і мозаїка KDE біля країв – з контуром – призупиняються, поки працює KSnapUnity, щоб був лише один перегляд. Налаштування KDE не змінюються: вимкніть це, вимкніть або вилучіть KSnapUnity, і поведінка KDE повернеться.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"Власні дії країв екрана KDE досі увімкнено, тож на те саме перетягування реагують два помічники. Вимкніть «Максимізувати» і «Плитка» у Системні параметри → Керування вікнами → Краї екрана.","KDE's own window snapping":"Власне прилипання вікон KDE","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"Власне прилипання вікон KDE теж увімкнено. Для однакового відчуття встановіть його зони на «Немає» у Системні параметри → Керування вікнами → Поведінка вікон → Пересування.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Служба скорочень KDE не відповіла. Клавіші все одно можна задати в Системні параметри → Скорочення → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – редактор налаштувань","Keep stacked windows in line":"Тримати вікна в стовпці на одній лінії","Keep the gap between windows":"Зберігати відступ між вікнами","Keep them":"Залишити","Key scheme":"Схема клавіш","Keyboard shortcuts":"Клавіатурні скорочення","Keys":"Клавіші","Keys already in use":"Клавіші, які вже використовуються","Layout":"Компонування","Layout by number of windows":"Компонування за кількістю вікон","Layouts":"Компонування","Layouts per row":"Компонувань у рядку","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Лівий і правий край: половина екрана","Left edge: left half":"Лівий край: ліва половина","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Менше 100 % тримає єдине вікно по центру – зручно на широких екранах.","License":"Ліцензія","Light":"Світла","Linear":"Лінійна","Live preview":"Живий перегляд","Load template…":"Завантажити шаблон…","Magnet":"Магніт","Main + stack":"Головне + стос","Main and stack":"Головне і стос","Main area bigger":"Більша головна область","Main area on the right":"Головна область праворуч","Main area smaller":"Менша головна область","Main in the middle":"Головне в центрі","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Головний перемикач для перетягування і клавіш.","Main window":"Головне вікно","Main windows":"Головні вікна","Main windows: %1":"Головних вікон: %1","Make it the main window":"Зробити головним вікном","Maximize":"Максимізувати","Maximize or restore":"Максимізувати або відновити","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + клавіша (стиль KDE)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + клавіша","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + клавіша","Minimize":"Згорнути","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Віддзеркалює компонування: головне вікно праворуч, інші ліворуч.","Mode":"Режим","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Режим 1 – панель прилипання і краї екрана","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Режим 2 – автоматична мозаїка","Modes":"Режими","More ways":"Більше способів","Motion curve":"Крива руху","Move a window towards others…":"Підсуньте вікно до інших…","Move the window one place back":"Пересунути вікно на місце назад","Move the window one place on":"Пересунути вікно на місце вперед","Name:":"Назва:","New layout":"Нове компонування","New windows":"Нові вікна","Next tiling layout":"Наступне компонування мозаїки","Next to the active window":"Поруч з активним вікном","No key":"Немає клавіші","No other window open":"Інших відкритих вікон немає","No outer margin":"Без зовнішнього відступу","No shortcuts":"Без скорочень","None":"Немає","None yet.":"Поки немає.","Off":"Вимкнено","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Вимк. = режим 1, увімк. = режим 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Вимк.: нейтральна рамка – лише для увімкнених переглядів.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Вимкнено: клавіші лишаються призначеними, але нічого не роблять.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Вимк.: вікна лишаються там, куди ви їх поклали. Решта функцій працює в будь-якому разі.","One at a time":"По одному","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Одне закривається – інші заповнюють прогалину","One main window less":"На одне головне вікно менше","One more main window":"Ще одне головне вікно","One window":"Одне вікно","Only one mode is switched on.":"Увімкнено лише один режим.","Open settings editor":"Відкрити редактор налаштувань","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Спершу відкрийте програму, потім виберіть її тут.","Open the layout builder":"Відкрити конструктор компонувань","Own layouts":"Власні компонування","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Частина кожної сторони, що вважається кутом.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Призупинити мозаїку країв KDE та її перегляд","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Призупиняти зони прилипання KDE, поки магніт увімкнено","Preview":"Попередній перегляд","Previews":"Попередні перегляди","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Притисніть вікно до краю чи кута екрана, і воно заповнить цю частину. Працює з панеллю або без неї.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Притисніть вікно до краю чи кута: максимізація, половини, чверті.","Push delay":"Затримка притискання","Quarters":"Чверті","Quick":"Швидка","Quick settings":"Швидкі налаштування","Recommended values":"Рекомендовані значення","Remove":"Вилучити","Remove rule":"Вилучити правило","Remove zone":"Вилучити зону","Reset all":"Скинути все","Reset all keys":"Скинути всі клавіші","Reset to default":"Скинути до типового","Resistance against overlapping":"Опір перекриттю","Resize touching windows together":"Змінювати розмір дотичних вікон разом","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Зміна розміру теж прилипає – тут на всю висоту","Restore":"Відновити","Restore default layouts":"Відновити типові компонування","Restore default layouts?":"Відновити типові компонування?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Відновлювати початковий розмір, коли вікно витягують","Restore the size before snapping":"Відновити розмір до прилипання","Rows":"Рядки","Save":"Зберегти","Screen edges":"Краї екрана","Screen edges on/off":"Краї екрана увімк./вимк.","Screen edges preview":"Попередній перегляд країв екрана","Set":"Встановити","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Задає клавіші всіх дій одразу. Окремі клавіші можна й далі змінювати нижче.","Settings":"Параметри","Settings file":"Файл параметрів","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Під час зміни розміру швидко струсніть мишею туди-сюди, і решта вікон повернеться. Швидкий ривок в один бік ніколи їх не відпускає.","Shake to let go":"Струсити, щоб відпустити","Shortcuts":"Скорочення","Show a small handle first":"Спочатку показувати маленьке вушко","Show layout and zone names":"Показувати назви компонувань і зон","Show previews in the accent color":"Показувати попередній перегляд кольором акценту","Showing":"Показ","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Показує, куди потрапить вікно біля краю чи в куті. Вимк.: жодного перегляду.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Показує, куди потрапить вікно, поки зону панелі виділено. Вимк.: жодного перегляду.","Sidebar + grid":"Бічна панель + сітка","Single zone":"Одна зона","Six tiles":"Шість плиток","Size & shape":"Розмір і форма","Size of the main area":"Розмір головної області","Slide-in duration":"Тривалість висування","Slide-out duration":"Тривалість ховання","Smart arranging and detection.":"Розумне розташування і розпізнавання.","Smart fill":"Розумне заповнення","Smooth (default)":"Плавна (типова)","Snap bar":"Панель прилипання","Snap bar and screen edges":"Панель прилипання і краї екрана","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Панель і краї вимкнено – працює лише режим 2, а клавіша режиму нічого не робить.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Панель і краї екрана заважають автоматичній мозаїці. Тому вони працюють як два режими – перемикайте клавішами або тут.","Snap bar colors:":"Кольори панелі:","Snap bar on/off":"Панель увімк./вимк.","Snap bar preview":"Попередній перегляд панелі прилипання","Snap bar size":"Розмір панелі","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Панель прилипання, краї екрана, магніт вікон, скорочення і обмін вікон.","Snap distance":"Відстань прилипання","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Прилипання роздільників (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Компонування прилипання і автоматична мозаїка.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Прилипання активного вікна комбінаціями клавіш.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Прилипання активного вікна з клавіатури. Це звичайні глобальні скорочення KDE – їх також можна знайти в Системні параметри → Скорочення → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Приліпити до нижньої половини","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Приліпити до нижньої лівої чверті","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Приліпити до нижньої правої чверті","Snap to the center third":"Приліпити до середньої третини","Snap to the left half":"Приліпити до лівої половини","Snap to the left third":"Приліпити до лівої третини","Snap to the left two thirds":"Приліпити до лівих двох третин","Snap to the right half":"Приліпити до правої половини","Snap to the right third":"Приліпити до правої третини","Snap to the right two thirds":"Приліпити до правих двох третин","Snap to the top half":"Приліпити до верхньої половини","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Приліпити до верхньої лівої чверті","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Приліпити до верхньої правої чверті","Snapping":"Прилипання","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Прилипання і автоматична мозаїка працюють як два режими – одна клавіша перемикає між ними.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Так вікно тягне лише один магніт. Налаштування KDE не змінюються: вимкніть це, вимкніть або вилучіть KSnapUnity, і прилипання KDE повернеться.","Soft":"М’яка","Spacing":"Відступи","Spiral":"Спіраль","Split side by side":"Поділити поруч","Split top and bottom":"Поділити згори й знизу","Stack + main":"Стос + головне","Stick to other windows":"Прилипати до інших вікон","Stick to the screen edges":"Прилипати до країв екрана","Sticky edges":"Липкі краї","Support KSnapUnity":"Підтримати KSnapUnity","Swap":"Обмін","Swap windows":"Обмін вікон","Swap with the window above":"Поміняти з вікном зверху","Swap with the window below":"Поміняти з вікном знизу","Swap with the window on the left":"Поміняти з вікном ліворуч","Swap with the window on the right":"Поміняти з вікном праворуч","Switch mode":"Перемкнути режим","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Перемкнути режим (прилипання / мозаїка)","Switch modes with:":"Перемикання режиму:","Switch the layout by itself":"Змінювати компонування самостійно","Switched off":"Вимкнено","System":"Системна","Take it over":"Забрати","Take over all":"Забрати всі","Take the main place":"Займають головне місце","Test animation":"Перевірити анімацію","Test on screen":"Перевірити на екрані","Test the snap bar":"Випробувати панель","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Типові значення базуються на Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Дії прилипання використовують ті самі відступи, що й панель, і запам’ятовують розмір до прилипання: «Відновити розмір до прилипання» повертає його.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Ці програми ніколи не розставляються і залишаються на своєму місці. Діалоги завжди вільні.","Thirds":"Третини","Three columns":"Три стовпчики","Thumbnail width":"Ширина мініатюр","Tiling":"Мозаїка","Tip":"Порада","Top / bottom":"Згори / знизу","Top edge":"Верхній край","Top edge: full screen":"Верхній край: на весь екран","Top edge: maximize":"Верхній край: розгорнути","Top edge: top half":"Верхній край: верхня половина","Top half":"Верхня половина","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Відстань спрацьовування від верхнього краю","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Вимкніть, якщо вам більше подобається контур KDE, – тоді вимкніть вище перегляд країв екрана.","Two thirds":"Дві третини","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Два вікна міняються місцями – відпустіть одне на інше або скористайтеся клавішами.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Два вікна міняються місцями: відпустіть одне на інше або клавішею.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Використовувати клавіатурні скорочення","Use screen edges":"Використовувати краї екрана","Use the system accent color":"Використовувати системний колір акценту","Use the window magnet":"Використовувати магніт вікон","Usual combinations":"Звичні комбінації","Version":"Версія","Wanted for: %1":"Потрібна для: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Коли вікно відкривається, закривається або міняється, інші рухаються плавно, а не стрибають.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Коли ви змінюєте розмір вікна, дотичні до нього вікна зсувають спільний край разом із ним – ніщо не перекривається, щілин немає.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Під час зміни розміру вікна, що не рухаються разом, стають прозорими.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Поки ви пересуваєте вікно чи змінюєте його розмір, його краї прилипають до сусідніх вікон і країв екрана.","Width":"Ширина","Window":"Вікно","Window magnet":"Магніт вікон","Window magnet on/off":"Магніт вікон увімк./вимк.","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Вікна одне над одним тримають ліві та праві краї разом, вікна поруч – верхні та нижні.","Windows glide to their place":"Вікна плавно стають на місце","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Вікна прилипають одне до одного та до країв екрана.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Вікна зупиняються на «Відступ між вікнами» зі сторінки Загальне замість того, щоб торкатися.","Yes":"Так","Your own combination":"Власна комбінація","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Ваші власні компонування та їхній порядок буде втрачено.","Zone %1":"Зона %1","for KWin · v%1":"для KWin · v%1","windows:":"вікон:","“%1” will be removed.":"«%1» буде вилучено.","…drag it onto window B…":"…перетягніть його на вікно B…","…in every direction":"…у будь-якому напрямку","…let go: they trade places":"…відпустіть: вони міняються місцями","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…сусіди ростуть і зменшуються разом із ним","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Готово – натисніть OK, щоб відкрити редактор налаштувань."},"ur":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (نقل)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 کو ”%2“ استعمال کر رہا ہے۔","%1 of %2 zones":"%2 میں سے %1 زون","0 = all in one row":"0 = سب ایک قطار میں","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>موڈ 1</b><br/>اسنیپ بار اور اسکرین کے کنارے","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>موڈ 2</b><br/>خودکار ٹائلنگ","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"اکیلی کھڑکی پوری اسکرین استعمال کرتی ہے، حاشیہ مقرر ہو تب بھی۔","A new window joins":"ایک نئی کھڑکی شامل ہوتی ہے","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"چھوٹا دھکا آدھا یا چوتھائی دیتا ہے۔ ونڈو کو کنارے پر تھوڑی دیر اور رکھیں تو وہ اگلی ونڈو تک بڑھ جاتی ہے – پیش منظر یہ دکھاتا ہے۔","A single window":"اکیلی کھڑکی","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"کھڑکی دوسری کھڑکی کے کنارے پر رک جاتی ہے، تیزی سے ہلانے پر بھی۔ چھوڑنے کے لیے ماؤس ہلائیں یا ایک لمحہ اور دھکیلیں۔ 0 = کھڑکیاں آزادی سے ایک دوسرے پر آ سکتی ہیں۔","About & Help":"تعارف اور مدد","Accent color":"نمایاں رنگ","Active":"فعال","Active mode":"فعال موڈ","Active width along the top edge":"اوپری کنارے کے ساتھ فعال چوڑائی","Add an open application":"کھلی ایپ شامل کریں","Add rule":"اصول شامل کریں","All window features in one system.":"کھڑکیوں کی تمام خصوصیات ایک نظام میں۔","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"جب آپ ہاتھ سے مرکزی کھڑکی کا سائز بدلیں تب بھی بدلتا ہے۔","Also while resizing":"سائز بدلتے وقت بھی","Always floating":"ہمیشہ تیرتی","Animation":"حرکت","Appearance":"ظاہری شکل","Apply":"لاگو کریں","Arrange windows":"کھڑکیاں ترتیب دیں","Arrange windows automatically":"کھڑکیاں خود بخود ترتیب دیں","Author":"مصنف","Automatic tiling":"خودکار ٹائلنگ","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"خودکار ٹائلنگ بند ہے – صرف موڈ 1 چلتا ہے اور موڈ شارٹ کٹ کچھ نہیں کرتا۔","Automatic tiling off":"خودکار ٹائلنگ بند","Automatic tiling on":"خودکار ٹائلنگ آن","Automatic tiling on/off":"خودکار ٹائلنگ آن/آف","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"خودکار ٹائلنگ، کھڑکیوں کی ادلا بدلی، شارٹ کٹ اور تیرتی کھڑکیوں کے لیے مقناطیس۔","Background opacity":"پس منظر کی غیر شفافیت","Behavior & Animation":"رویہ اور حرکت","Bottom edge: bottom half":"نچلا کنارہ: نچلا آدھا","Bouncy":"اچھلتا","Buy me a coffee":"مجھے ایک کافی پلائیں","Cancel":"منسوخ کریں","Center focus":"درمیان میں توجہ","Center the window":"ونڈو کو درمیان میں لائیں","Change":"بدلیں","Change key":"کلید بدلیں","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"کلید ترتیبات ایڈیٹر میں بدلیں۔ دونوں موڈز کو خودکار ٹائلنگ اور اسنیپ بار یا اسکرین کے کنارے درکار ہیں۔","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"انہیں «کی بورڈ شارٹ کٹس» صفحے پر بدلیں۔ خودکار ٹائلنگ میں کھڑکیاں ترتیب میں بھی جگہ بدلتی ہیں۔","Choose…":"منتخب کریں…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"منتخب کرنے کے لیے زون پر کلک کریں · تقسیم کے لیے ڈبل کلک کریں · تقسیم کار گھسیٹیں","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"موڈ بدلنے کے لیے کلک کریں یا %1 دبائیں۔","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"کلک کریں، پھر OK – ترتیبات ایڈیٹر کھلتا ہے۔","Close":"بند کریں","Close by, the edges stick together":"قریب آنے پر کنارے چپک جاتے ہیں","Color scheme":"رنگ سکیم","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"اسنیپ بار کے رنگ، سائز اور شکل۔","Columns":"کالم","Corner radius":"کونوں کا رداس","Corner size":"کونے کا سائز","Corner: a quarter":"کونا: چوتھائی","Corners: quarter of the screen":"کونے: اسکرین کا چوتھائی","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + کلید (طے شدہ)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + نمبر پیڈ","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + کلید","Custom color":"اپنا رنگ","Custom layout %1":"اپنا خاکہ %1","Dark":"گہری","Delay before hiding":"چھپانے سے پہلے تاخیر","Delay before showing":"دکھانے سے پہلے تاخیر","Delete":"حذف کریں","Delete layout?":"خاکہ حذف کریں؟","Distance at which the handle appears":"وہ فاصلہ جہاں ہینڈل ظاہر ہوتا ہے","Distance before the bar hides again":"بار کے دوبارہ چھپنے سے پہلے کا فاصلہ","Distance to the edge":"کنارے سے فاصلہ","Donate with PayPal":"PayPal سے عطیہ دیں","Drag a shared edge…":"مشترکہ کنارا گھسیٹیں…","Drag a window against an edge…":"کھڑکی کو کنارے کی طرف گھسیٹیں…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"ادلا بدلی کے لیے ایک کھڑکی کو دوسری پر گھسیٹیں۔ اسنیپ بار یا اسکرین کے کنارے پر چھوڑنے سے یہ آزاد تیرتی ہے؛ „کھڑکی کو تیرنے دیں“ اسے واپس لاتا ہے۔ فاصلے عمومی صفحے سے آتے ہیں۔","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"کھڑکی کو دوسری کے درمیان پر گھسیٹیں – پیش نظارہ دو تیر دکھاتا ہے – اور چھوڑیں۔ خودکار ٹائلنگ میں دوسری کھڑکی پر کہیں بھی کافی ہے۔","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"ونڈو کو اسکرین کے اوپری کنارے تک گھسیٹیں اور کسی زون پر چھوڑ دیں۔","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"اسنیپ بار میں ترتیب بدلنے کے لیے کارڈ گھسیٹیں۔ ترمیم کے لیے کارڈ پر ڈبل کلک کریں۔","Drop a window onto another one":"کھڑکی کو دوسری پر چھوڑیں","Drop the window onto a zone":"ونڈو کو کسی زون پر چھوڑیں","Duplicate":"نقل بنائیں","Duration":"دورانیہ","Dwindle":"اندر کی طرف چکر","Dynamic":"متحرک","Edges and corners":"کنارے اور کونے","Edit":"ترمیم کریں","Edit layout":"خاکے میں ترمیم کریں","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"ہر خصوصیت الگ سے آن اور آف کی جا سکتی ہے۔","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"خاکے صفحے پر بنایا گیا ہر خاکہ کھڑکیاں بھی سجا سکتا ہے – یہ اوپر نظر آتا ہے۔ کھڑکی 1 کو زون 1 ملتا ہے، اسی طرح آگے؛ اضافی کھڑکیاں آخری زون بانٹتی ہیں۔ زونز سے کم کھڑکیوں پر „مرکزی اور ڈھیر“ استعمال ہوتا ہے، تاکہ خالی جگہ نہ رہے۔","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"ہر کھڑکی اپنی جگہ خود ڈھونڈتی ہے، جیسے ٹائلنگ ونڈو مینیجر میں۔","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"ہر کھڑکی اسکرین پر اپنی جگہ خود ڈھونڈتی ہے۔ نئی کھڑکیاں شامل ہوتی ہیں، بند کھڑکیاں دوسروں کے لیے جگہ چھوڑتی ہیں۔","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"مثال: دو کھڑکیاں ساتھ ساتھ، تین سے مرکزی اور ڈھیر، پانچ سے گرڈ۔ مناسب اصول نہ ہو تو اوپر منتخب خاکہ استعمال ہوتا ہے۔","Fade in and out":"آتے جاتے مدھم کریں","Fade the other windows":"دوسری ونڈوز مدھم کریں","Features":"خصوصیات","Feel":"احساس","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"پہلے سے اسنیپ شدہ ونڈوز کے گرد فٹ کریں","Fits the way you work.":"آپ کے کام کے انداز کے مطابق۔","Float the window (leave tiling)":"کھڑکی کو تیرنے دیں (ٹائلنگ چھوڑیں)","Four quarters":"چار چوتھائی","From":"سے","Fullscreen":"پوری اسکرین","Gap between windows":"ونڈوز کے درمیان فاصلہ","Gap to the screen edge":"اسکرین کے کنارے تک فاصلہ","General":"عمومی","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"ہر فعل کو دوبارہ منتخب اسکیم کی کلید دیتا ہے اور اسکیم میں نہ ہونے والی کلیدیں ہٹا دیتا ہے۔","Good to know":"جاننے کی بات","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"ونڈو کو اس کی عنوان پٹی سے پکڑ کر اوپر گھسیٹیں۔ اسنیپ بار نیچے آتی ہے؛ ونڈو کو کسی زون پر چھوڑیں اور وہ ٹھیک وہی حصہ بھر دے گی۔ دوبارہ باہر گھسیٹنے پر اسے پرانا سائز واپس مل جاتا ہے۔","Grab window A…":"کھڑکی A پکڑیں…","Grid":"گرڈ","Halves":"نصف نصف","Hiding":"چھپانا","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"خالی جگہ بھرنے کے لیے کنارے پر تھامیں","Hold time":"تھامنے کا وقت","Hold to fill":"بھرنے کے لیے تھامیں","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"کنارے کو اپنی جگہ بیٹھنے سے پہلے کتنا قریب آنا ہوتا ہے۔","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"کرسر کو کنارے کے کتنا قریب آنا ہوتا ہے۔","How far the bar slides down":"بار کتنا نیچے سرکتا ہے","How it works":"یہ کیسے کام کرتا ہے","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"ونڈو کو کنارے سے کتنی دیر لگے رہنا ہوتا ہے – ہلکا سا دھکا۔ 0 = فوراً۔","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"بڑھنے سے پہلے ونڈو کو کنارے پر کتنی دیر رہنا ہے۔","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"کتنی کھڑکیاں مرکزی حصہ بانٹتی ہیں (ترتیب «مرکزی اور ڈھیر»)۔","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"اگر نیچے پہلے سے ونڈو ہو تو اوپری کنارہ زیادہ سے زیادہ کرنے کے بجائے اوپری آدھا دیتا ہے۔ آدھے اور چوتھائی بھی اسنیپ شدہ ونڈوز کو نہیں ڈھانپتے۔","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"اگر آپ کو KSnapUnity پسند ہے تو آپ اس کی تیاری میں مدد کر سکتے ہیں – شکریہ!","In bar":"بار میں","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"اسنیپ بار اور اسکرین کے کناروں سے آزاد۔","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"اسنیپ بار سے آزاد۔ ہر کنارہ الگ سے آن کیا جا سکتا ہے۔","Information":"معلومات","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"فطری، آسانی سے سمجھ آنے والا کھڑکیوں کا رویہ۔","Join at the end":"آخر میں شامل ہوں","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K یعنی KWin · Snap یعنی زیادہ ذہین اسنیپنگ · Unity یعنی سب کچھ ایک نظام میں","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE کے اپنے اسکرین کنارے کے افعال اور ونڈو اسنیپنگ ہیں۔ اگر یہاں وہی خصوصیت آن ہے تو KDE والی بند کریں: سسٹم سیٹنگز → ونڈو مینجمنٹ → اسکرین کے کنارے، اور ونڈو کا رویہ → حرکت۔","KDE's own edge tiling":"KDE کی اپنی کنارہ ٹائلنگ","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"کناروں پر KDE کی اپنی بڑا کرنے اور ٹائلنگ – اپنے خاکے سمیت – KSnapUnity چلنے تک رکی رہتی ہے، تاکہ صرف ایک پیش نظارہ دکھے۔ آپ کی KDE ترتیبات نہیں بدلتیں: اسے بند کریں، KSnapUnity غیر فعال کریں یا ہٹا دیں اور KDE کا رویہ واپس آ جاتا ہے۔","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"KDE کے اپنے اسکرین کنارے کے افعال ابھی بھی آن ہیں، اس لیے ایک ہی گھسیٹ پر دو مددگار ردعمل دیتے ہیں۔ سسٹم سیٹنگز → ونڈو مینجمنٹ → اسکرین کے کنارے میں ”زیادہ سے زیادہ کریں“ اور ”ٹائل“ بند کریں۔","KDE's own window snapping":"KDE کی اپنی ونڈو اسنیپنگ","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE کی اپنی ونڈو اسنیپنگ بھی آن ہے۔ یکساں احساس کے لیے سسٹم سیٹنگز → ونڈو مینجمنٹ → ونڈو کا رویہ → حرکت میں اس کے زون ”کوئی نہیں“ پر سیٹ کریں۔","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"KDE کی شارٹ کٹ سروس نے جواب نہیں دیا۔ آپ کلیدیں سسٹم سیٹنگز → شارٹ کٹ → KWin میں بھی سیٹ کر سکتے ہیں۔","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – ترتیبات ایڈیٹر","Keep stacked windows in line":"اوپر نیچے رکھی ونڈوز کو ایک لائن میں رکھیں","Keep the gap between windows":"ونڈوز کے درمیان فاصلہ برقرار رکھیں","Keep them":"رہنے دیں","Key scheme":"کلیدی اسکیم","Keyboard shortcuts":"کی بورڈ شارٹ کٹ","Keys":"کلیدیں","Keys already in use":"پہلے سے استعمال میں کلیدیں","Layout":"ترتیب","Layout by number of windows":"کھڑکیوں کی تعداد کے مطابق خاکہ","Layouts":"خاکے","Layouts per row":"فی قطار خاکے","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"بایاں اور دایاں کنارہ: آدھی اسکرین","Left edge: left half":"بایاں کنارا: بایاں آدھا","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"100 % سے کم پر اکیلی کھڑکی درمیان میں رہتی ہے – چوڑی اسکرینوں پر خوبصورت۔","License":"لائسنس","Light":"ہلکی","Linear":"خطی","Live preview":"براہِ راست پیش نظارہ","Load template…":"سانچہ لوڈ کریں…","Magnet":"مقناطیس","Main + stack":"مرکزی + ڈھیر","Main and stack":"مرکزی اور ڈھیر","Main area bigger":"بڑا مرکزی حصہ","Main area on the right":"مرکزی حصہ دائیں","Main area smaller":"چھوٹا مرکزی حصہ","Main in the middle":"بیچ میں مرکزی","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"گھسیٹنے اور کلیدوں کا مرکزی سوئچ۔","Main window":"مرکزی کھڑکی","Main windows":"مرکزی کھڑکیاں","Main windows: %1":"مرکزی کھڑکیاں: %1","Make it the main window":"مرکزی کھڑکی بنائیں","Maximize":"زیادہ سے زیادہ کریں","Maximize or restore":"زیادہ سے زیادہ کریں یا بحال کریں","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + کلید (KDE انداز)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + کلید","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + کلید","Minimize":"چھوٹا کریں","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"خاکے کو الٹ دیتا ہے: مرکزی کھڑکی دائیں، باقی بائیں۔","Mode":"موڈ","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"موڈ 1 – اسنیپ بار اور اسکرین کے کنارے","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"موڈ 2 – خودکار ٹائلنگ","Modes":"موڈز","More ways":"مزید طریقے","Motion curve":"حرکت کا خم","Move a window towards others…":"کھڑکی کو دوسروں کی طرف لے جائیں…","Move the window one place back":"کھڑکی کو ایک جگہ پیچھے کریں","Move the window one place on":"کھڑکی کو ایک جگہ آگے کریں","Name:":"نام:","New layout":"نیا خاکہ","New windows":"نئی کھڑکیاں","Next tiling layout":"اگلی ٹائلنگ ترتیب","Next to the active window":"فعال کھڑکی کے ساتھ","No key":"کوئی کلید نہیں","No other window open":"کوئی اور کھڑکی کھلی نہیں","No outer margin":"بیرونی حاشیہ نہیں","No shortcuts":"کوئی شارٹ کٹ نہیں","None":"کوئی نہیں","None yet.":"ابھی کوئی نہیں۔","Off":"آف","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"بند = موڈ 1، آن = موڈ 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"بند: ایک غیر جانبدار فریم – صرف آن پیش منظر کے لیے۔","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"آف: کلیدیں تفویض رہتی ہیں لیکن کچھ نہیں کرتیں۔","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"آف: کھڑکیاں وہیں رہتی ہیں جہاں آپ رکھیں۔ باقی خصوصیات ہر حال میں چلتی ہیں۔","One at a time":"ایک ایک کر کے","One closes – the others fill the gap":"ایک بند ہوتی ہے – باقی خالی جگہ بھرتی ہیں","One main window less":"ایک مرکزی کھڑکی کم","One more main window":"ایک اور مرکزی کھڑکی","One window":"ایک کھڑکی","Only one mode is switched on.":"صرف ایک موڈ آن ہے۔","Open settings editor":"ترتیبات ایڈیٹر کھولیں","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"پہلے ایپ کھولیں، پھر یہاں منتخب کریں۔","Open the layout builder":"خاکہ ساز کھولیں","Own layouts":"اپنے خاکے","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"ہر طرف کا وہ حصہ جو کونا شمار ہوتا ہے۔","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"KDE کی کنارہ ٹائلنگ اور اس کا پیش منظر روکیں","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"مقناطیس آن ہونے تک KDE کے اسنیپ زون روکیں","Preview":"پیش منظر","Previews":"پیش منظر","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"ونڈو کو اسکرین کے کنارے یا کونے سے لگائیں اور وہ اس حصے کو بھر دیتی ہے۔ اسنیپ بار کے ساتھ یا اس کے بغیر کام کرتا ہے۔","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"ونڈو کو کنارے یا کونے سے لگائیں: زیادہ سے زیادہ، آدھے، چوتھائی۔","Push delay":"دھکے کی تاخیر","Quarters":"چوتھائیاں","Quick":"تیز","Quick settings":"فوری ترتیبات","Recommended values":"تجویز کردہ اقدار","Remove":"ہٹائیں","Remove rule":"اصول ہٹائیں","Remove zone":"زون ہٹائیں","Reset all":"سب ری سیٹ کریں","Reset all keys":"تمام کلیدیں ری سیٹ کریں","Reset to default":"طے شدہ پر واپس","Resistance against overlapping":"اوورلیپ کے خلاف مزاحمت","Resize touching windows together":"چھوتی ہوئی ونڈوز کا سائز ساتھ بدلیں","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"سائز بدلنے پر بھی چپکتا ہے – یہاں پوری اونچائی تک","Restore":"بحال کریں","Restore default layouts":"طے شدہ خاکے بحال کریں","Restore default layouts?":"طے شدہ خاکے بحال کریں؟","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"ونڈو باہر گھسیٹنے پر اصل سائز بحال کریں","Restore the size before snapping":"اسنیپ سے پہلے کا سائز بحال کریں","Rows":"قطاریں","Save":"محفوظ کریں","Screen edges":"اسکرین کے کنارے","Screen edges on/off":"اسکرین کے کنارے آن/آف","Screen edges preview":"اسکرین کے کناروں کا پیش منظر","Set":"سیٹ کریں","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"تمام افعال کی کلیدیں ایک ساتھ سیٹ کرتی ہے۔ الگ کلیدیں آپ نیچے اب بھی بدل سکتے ہیں۔","Settings":"ترتیبات","Settings file":"ترتیبات فائل","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"سائز بدلتے وقت ماؤس کو تیزی سے آگے پیچھے ہلائیں اور باقی کھڑکیاں واپس آ جائیں گی۔ ایک سمت میں تیز کھنچاؤ انہیں کبھی نہیں چھوڑتا۔","Shake to let go":"چھوڑنے کے لیے ہلائیں","Shortcuts":"شارٹ کٹ","Show a small handle first":"پہلے ایک چھوٹا ہینڈل دکھائیں","Show layout and zone names":"خاکوں اور زونز کے نام دکھائیں","Show previews in the accent color":"پیش منظر ایکسنٹ رنگ میں دکھائیں","Showing":"دکھانا","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"دکھاتا ہے کہ کنارے یا کونے پر ونڈو کہاں جائے گی۔ بند: کوئی پیش منظر نہیں۔","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"جب اسنیپ بار کا کوئی زون نمایاں ہو، دکھاتا ہے کہ ونڈو کہاں جائے گی۔ بند: کوئی پیش منظر نہیں۔","Sidebar + grid":"سائیڈ بار + گرڈ","Single zone":"ایک زون","Six tiles":"چھ ٹائلیں","Size & shape":"سائز اور شکل","Size of the main area":"مرکزی حصے کا سائز","Slide-in duration":"اندر آنے کا دورانیہ","Slide-out duration":"باہر جانے کا دورانیہ","Smart arranging and detection.":"ذہین ترتیب اور شناخت۔","Smart fill":"اسمارٹ فل","Smooth (default)":"ہموار (طے شدہ)","Snap bar":"اسنیپ بار","Snap bar and screen edges":"اسنیپ بار اور اسکرین کے کنارے","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"اسنیپ بار اور کنارے بند ہیں – صرف موڈ 2 چلتا ہے اور موڈ شارٹ کٹ کچھ نہیں کرتا۔","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"اسنیپ بار اور اسکرین کے کنارے خودکار ٹائلنگ میں رکاوٹ ہیں۔ اس لیے یہ دو موڈز کے طور پر چلتے ہیں – شارٹ کٹ سے یا یہاں سے بدلیں۔","Snap bar colors:":"اسنیپ بار کے رنگ:","Snap bar on/off":"اسنیپ بار آن/آف","Snap bar preview":"اسنیپ بار کا پیش منظر","Snap bar size":"اسنیپ بار کا سائز","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"اسنیپ بار، اسکرین کے کنارے، ونڈو مقناطیس، شارٹ کٹ اور کھڑکیوں کی ادلا بدلی۔","Snap distance":"اسنیپ فاصلہ","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"تقسیم کاروں کو اسنیپ کریں (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"اسنیپ خاکے اور خودکار ٹائلنگ۔","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"فعال ونڈو کو کلیدی امتزاج سے اسنیپ کریں۔","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"فعال ونڈو کو کی بورڈ سے اسنیپ کریں۔ یہ عام KDE عالمی شارٹ کٹ ہیں – یہ سسٹم سیٹنگز → شارٹ کٹ → KWin میں بھی ملتے ہیں۔","Snap to the bottom half":"نچلے آدھے میں اسنیپ کریں","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"نیچے بائیں چوتھائی میں اسنیپ کریں","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"نیچے دائیں چوتھائی میں اسنیپ کریں","Snap to the center third":"درمیانی تہائی میں اسنیپ کریں","Snap to the left half":"بائیں آدھے میں اسنیپ کریں","Snap to the left third":"بائیں تہائی میں اسنیپ کریں","Snap to the left two thirds":"بائیں دو تہائی میں اسنیپ کریں","Snap to the right half":"دائیں آدھے میں اسنیپ کریں","Snap to the right third":"دائیں تہائی میں اسنیپ کریں","Snap to the right two thirds":"دائیں دو تہائی میں اسنیپ کریں","Snap to the top half":"اوپری آدھے میں اسنیپ کریں","Snap to the top-left quarter":"اوپر بائیں چوتھائی میں اسنیپ کریں","Snap to the top-right quarter":"اوپر دائیں چوتھائی میں اسنیپ کریں","Snapping":"اسنیپنگ","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"اسنیپنگ اور خودکار ٹائلنگ دو موڈز کے طور پر چلتے ہیں – ایک شارٹ کٹ ان کے درمیان بدلتا ہے۔","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"یوں صرف ایک مقناطیس کھڑکی کو کھینچتا ہے۔ آپ کی KDE ترتیبات نہیں بدلتیں: اسے بند کریں، KSnapUnity غیر فعال کریں یا ہٹا دیں اور KDE کی اسنیپنگ واپس آ جاتی ہے۔","Soft":"نرم","Spacing":"فاصلے","Spiral":"چکردار","Split side by side":"ساتھ ساتھ تقسیم کریں","Split top and bottom":"اوپر نیچے تقسیم کریں","Stack + main":"ڈھیر + مرکزی","Stick to other windows":"دوسری ونڈوز سے چپکیں","Stick to the screen edges":"اسکرین کے کناروں سے چپکیں","Sticky edges":"چپکنے والے کنارے","Support KSnapUnity":"KSnapUnity کی مدد کریں","Swap":"بدلیں","Swap windows":"کھڑکیاں بدلیں","Swap with the window above":"اوپر والی کھڑکی سے بدلیں","Swap with the window below":"نیچے والی کھڑکی سے بدلیں","Swap with the window on the left":"بائیں کھڑکی سے بدلیں","Swap with the window on the right":"دائیں کھڑکی سے بدلیں","Switch mode":"موڈ بدلیں","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"موڈ بدلیں (اسنیپنگ / ٹائلنگ)","Switch modes with:":"موڈ بدلنے کی کلید:","Switch the layout by itself":"خاکہ خود بدلیں","Switched off":"بند","System":"سسٹم","Take it over":"لے لیں","Take over all":"سب لے لیں","Take the main place":"مرکزی جگہ لیں","Test animation":"حرکت آزمائیں","Test on screen":"اسکرین پر آزمائیں","Test the snap bar":"اسنیپ بار آزمائیں","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"طے شدہ اقدار Windows 11 پر مبنی ہیں۔","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"اسنیپ افعال اسنیپ بار والے ہی فاصلے استعمال کرتے ہیں اور اسنیپ سے پہلے کا سائز یاد رکھتے ہیں: ”اسنیپ سے پہلے کا سائز بحال کریں“ اسے واپس لاتا ہے۔","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"یہ ایپس کبھی ترتیب نہیں دی جاتیں اور اپنی جگہ رکھتی ہیں۔ مکالمے ہمیشہ تیرتے ہیں۔","Thirds":"تہائیاں","Three columns":"تین کالم","Thumbnail width":"تھمب نیل کی چوڑائی","Tiling":"ٹائلنگ","Tip":"مشورہ","Top / bottom":"اوپر / نیچے","Top edge":"اوپری کنارہ","Top edge: full screen":"اوپری کنارا: پوری اسکرین","Top edge: maximize":"اوپری کنارا: بڑا کریں","Top edge: top half":"اوپری کنارا: اوپری آدھا","Top half":"اوپری آدھا","Trigger distance from the top edge":"اوپری کنارے سے فعال ہونے کا فاصلہ","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"اگر آپ کو KDE کا اپنا خاکہ پسند ہے تو اسے بند کریں – پھر اوپر اسکرین کے کناروں کا پیش منظر بند کریں۔","Two thirds":"دو تہائی","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"دو کھڑکیاں جگہ بدلتی ہیں – ایک کو دوسری پر چھوڑیں یا کلیدیں استعمال کریں۔","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"دو کھڑکیاں جگہ بدلتی ہیں: ایک کو دوسری پر چھوڑیں، یا کلید سے۔","Use keyboard shortcuts":"کی بورڈ شارٹ کٹ استعمال کریں","Use screen edges":"اسکرین کے کنارے استعمال کریں","Use the system accent color":"سسٹم کا نمایاں رنگ استعمال کریں","Use the window magnet":"ونڈو مقناطیس استعمال کریں","Usual combinations":"عام امتزاج","Version":"ورژن","Wanted for: %1":"اس کے لیے درکار: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"جب کوئی کھڑکی کھلتی، بند ہوتی یا بدلتی ہے تو باقی اچھلنے کے بجائے نرمی سے سرکتی ہیں۔","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"ونڈو کا سائز بدلنے پر اسے چھونے والی ونڈوز مشترکہ کنارہ ساتھ کھسکاتی ہیں – کچھ اوورلیپ نہیں ہوتا، کوئی خلا نہیں بنتا۔","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"سائز بدلتے وقت جو ونڈوز ساتھ نہیں چلتیں وہ شفاف دکھائی دیتی ہیں۔","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"ونڈو کو حرکت دیتے یا اس کا سائز بدلتے وقت، اس کے کنارے قریبی ونڈوز اور اسکرین کے کناروں سے چپک جاتے ہیں۔","Width":"چوڑائی","Window":"ونڈو","Window magnet":"ونڈو مقناطیس","Window magnet on/off":"ونڈو مقناطیس آن/آف","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"اوپر نیچے رکھی ونڈوز بائیں اور دائیں کنارے ساتھ رکھتی ہیں، ساتھ ساتھ والی اوپر اور نیچے کے کنارے۔","Windows glide to their place":"کھڑکیاں اپنی جگہ پر سرکتی ہیں","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"ونڈوز ایک دوسرے سے اور اسکرین کے کناروں سے چپک جاتی ہیں۔","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"ونڈوز چھونے کے بجائے عمومی صفحے کے ”ونڈوز کے درمیان فاصلہ“ پر رک جاتی ہیں۔","Yes":"ہاں","Your own combination":"اپنا امتزاج","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"آپ کے اپنے خاکے اور ان کی ترتیب ضائع ہو جائے گی۔","Zone %1":"زون %1","for KWin · v%1":"KWin کے لیے · ورژن %1","windows:":"کھڑکیاں:","“%1” will be removed.":"\"%1\" ہٹا دیا جائے گا۔","…drag it onto window B…":"…اسے کھڑکی B پر گھسیٹیں…","…in every direction":"…ہر سمت میں","…let go: they trade places":"…چھوڑیں: وہ جگہ بدل لیتی ہیں","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…پڑوسی اس کے ساتھ بڑے اور چھوٹے ہوتے ہیں","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ تیار – ترتیبات ایڈیٹر کھولنے کے لیے OK پر کلک کریں۔"},"vi":{"%1 (copy)":"%1 (bản sao)","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 đang được “%2” dùng.","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 trên %2 vùng","0 = all in one row":"0 = tất cả trên một hàng","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>Chế độ 1</b><br/>Thanh gắn và cạnh màn hình","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>Chế độ 2</b><br/>Xếp ô tự động","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"Cửa sổ duy nhất dùng toàn màn hình, kể cả khi đã đặt lề.","A new window joins":"Một cửa sổ mới tham gia","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"Một cú đẩy ngắn cho nửa hoặc một phần tư. Giữ cửa sổ ở cạnh lâu hơn một chút và nó lớn ra tới cửa sổ kế tiếp – xem trước sẽ cho thấy.","A single window":"Một cửa sổ duy nhất","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"Cửa sổ dừng lại ở cạnh của cửa sổ khác, kể cả khi bạn di chuyển nhanh. Lắc chuột hoặc tiếp tục đẩy thêm một lúc để thả ra. 0 = cửa sổ có thể chồng lên nhau tự do.","About & Help":"Giới thiệu & trợ giúp","Accent color":"Màu nhấn","Active":"Đang bật","Active mode":"Chế độ hiện tại","Active width along the top edge":"Chiều rộng hoạt động dọc mép trên","Add an open application":"Thêm ứng dụng đang mở","Add rule":"Thêm quy tắc","All window features in one system.":"Mọi tính năng cửa sổ trong một hệ thống.","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"Cũng thay đổi khi bạn tự đổi kích thước cửa sổ chính bằng tay.","Also while resizing":"Cả khi đổi cỡ","Always floating":"Luôn trôi","Animation":"Hoạt ảnh","Appearance":"Giao diện","Apply":"Áp dụng","Arrange windows":"Sắp xếp cửa sổ","Arrange windows automatically":"Tự động sắp xếp cửa sổ","Author":"Tác giả","Automatic tiling":"Xếp ô tự động","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Xếp ô tự động đang tắt – chỉ chế độ 1 chạy và phím chế độ không làm gì.","Automatic tiling off":"Tắt xếp ô tự động","Automatic tiling on":"Bật xếp ô tự động","Automatic tiling on/off":"Bật/tắt xếp ô tự động","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"Xếp ô tự động, hoán đổi cửa sổ, phím tắt và nam châm cho cửa sổ trôi.","Background opacity":"Độ mờ đục của nền","Behavior & Animation":"Hành vi & hoạt ảnh","Bottom edge: bottom half":"Cạnh dưới: nửa dưới","Bouncy":"Nảy","Buy me a coffee":"Mời tôi một ly cà phê","Cancel":"Hủy","Center focus":"Tập trung giữa","Center the window":"Đặt cửa sổ vào giữa","Change":"Thay đổi","Change key":"Đổi phím","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"Đổi phím trong trình sửa thiết lập. Cả hai chế độ cần xếp ô tự động và thanh gắn hoặc cạnh màn hình.","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"Đổi chúng ở trang Phím tắt. Khi xếp ô tự động, các cửa sổ cũng đổi chỗ trong thứ tự.","Choose…":"Chọn…","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"Nhấp vào vùng để chọn · nhấp đúp để chia · kéo các đường phân cách","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"Nhấp hoặc nhấn %1 để chuyển chế độ.","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"Nhấp, rồi OK – trình sửa thiết lập mở ra.","Close":"Đóng","Close by, the edges stick together":"Khi gần, các cạnh dính vào nhau","Color scheme":"Bảng màu","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"Màu sắc, kích thước và hình dạng của thanh.","Columns":"Cột","Corner radius":"Bán kính góc","Corner size":"Kích thước góc","Corner: a quarter":"Góc: một phần tư","Corners: quarter of the screen":"Góc: một phần tư màn hình","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + phím (mặc định)","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + bàn phím số","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + phím","Custom color":"Màu tùy chọn","Custom layout %1":"Bố cục tùy chỉnh %1","Dark":"Tối","Delay before hiding":"Độ trễ trước khi ẩn","Delay before showing":"Độ trễ trước khi hiện","Delete":"Xóa","Delete layout?":"Xóa bố cục?","Distance at which the handle appears":"Khoảng cách tay nắm xuất hiện","Distance before the bar hides again":"Khoảng cách trước khi thanh ẩn lại","Distance to the edge":"Khoảng cách tới cạnh","Donate with PayPal":"Quyên góp qua PayPal","Drag a shared edge…":"Kéo một cạnh chung…","Drag a window against an edge…":"Kéo cửa sổ vào một cạnh…","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"Kéo một cửa sổ lên cửa sổ khác để đổi chỗ. Thả lên thanh gắn hoặc cạnh màn hình thì nó trôi tự do; „Cho cửa sổ trôi“ đưa nó trở lại. Khoảng cách lấy từ trang Chung.","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"Kéo cửa sổ lên giữa cửa sổ khác – bản xem trước hiện hai mũi tên – rồi thả. Khi xếp ô tự động, chỗ nào trên cửa sổ kia cũng được.","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"Kéo cửa sổ lên mép trên màn hình rồi thả vào một vùng.","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"Kéo các thẻ để đổi thứ tự trên thanh. Nhấp đúp vào thẻ để chỉnh sửa.","Drop a window onto another one":"Thả cửa sổ lên cửa sổ khác","Drop the window onto a zone":"Thả cửa sổ vào một vùng","Duplicate":"Nhân bản","Duration":"Thời lượng","Dwindle":"Xoắn vào trong","Dynamic":"Năng động","Edges and corners":"Cạnh và góc","Edit":"Sửa","Edit layout":"Sửa bố cục","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"Mỗi tính năng có thể bật và tắt riêng.","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"Mỗi bố cục bạn tạo ở trang Bố cục cũng có thể sắp xếp cửa sổ – nó hiện ở trên. Cửa sổ 1 vào vùng 1, cứ thế tiếp tục; cửa sổ dư chia nhau vùng cuối. Khi cửa sổ ít hơn số vùng, „Chính và chồng“ được dùng để không có khoảng trống.","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"Mỗi cửa sổ tự tìm chỗ của mình, như trong một trình quản lý cửa sổ xếp ô.","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"Mỗi cửa sổ tự tìm chỗ trên màn hình. Cửa sổ mới tham gia vào, cửa sổ đã đóng nhường chỗ cho các cửa sổ khác.","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"Ví dụ: hai cửa sổ cạnh nhau, từ ba là chính và chồng, từ năm là lưới. Không có quy tắc phù hợp thì dùng bố cục đã chọn ở trên.","Fade in and out":"Mờ dần khi hiện và ẩn","Fade the other windows":"Làm mờ các cửa sổ khác","Features":"Tính năng","Feel":"Cảm giác","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"Thích ứng với cửa sổ đã được gắn","Fits the way you work.":"Hợp với cách bạn làm việc.","Float the window (leave tiling)":"Cho cửa sổ trôi (rời xếp ô)","Four quarters":"Bốn phần tư","From":"Từ","Fullscreen":"Toàn màn hình","Gap between windows":"Khoảng cách giữa các cửa sổ","Gap to the screen edge":"Khoảng cách tới mép màn hình","General":"Chung","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"Gán lại cho mỗi hành động phím của sơ đồ đã chọn và xóa các phím mà sơ đồ không có.","Good to know":"Nên biết","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"Nắm cửa sổ ở thanh tiêu đề rồi kéo lên. Thanh trượt xuống; thả cửa sổ vào một vùng và nó sẽ lấp đúng vùng đó. Kéo nó ra lần nữa thì cửa sổ trở lại kích thước cũ.","Grab window A…":"Nắm cửa sổ A…","Grid":"Lưới","Halves":"Hai nửa","Hiding":"Ẩn","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"Giữ ở cạnh để lấp đầy chỗ trống","Hold time":"Thời gian giữ","Hold to fill":"Giữ để lấp đầy","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"Cạnh phải đến gần bao nhiêu trước khi khớp vào chỗ.","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"Con trỏ phải đến gần cạnh bao nhiêu.","How far the bar slides down":"Thanh trượt xuống bao xa","How it works":"Cách hoạt động","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"Cửa sổ phải tì vào cạnh bao lâu – một cú đẩy nhẹ. 0 = ngay lập tức.","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"Cửa sổ phải ở cạnh bao lâu trước khi lớn ra.","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"Bao nhiêu cửa sổ chia sẻ vùng chính (bố cục “Chính và chồng”).","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"Nếu bên dưới đã có cửa sổ, cạnh trên sẽ cho nửa trên thay vì phóng to. Các nửa và phần tư cũng chừa các cửa sổ đã gắn.","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"Nếu bạn thích KSnapUnity, bạn có thể ủng hộ việc phát triển – cảm ơn!","In bar":"Trên thanh","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"Độc lập với thanh gắn và cạnh màn hình.","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"Độc lập với thanh gắn. Mỗi cạnh có thể bật riêng.","Information":"Thông tin","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"Hành vi cửa sổ trực quan và tự nhiên.","Join at the end":"Vào cuối hàng","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K là KWin · Snap là gắn thông minh hơn · Unity là mọi thứ trong một hệ thống","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE có các hành động cạnh màn hình riêng và cơ chế gắn cửa sổ riêng. Nếu tính năng tương tự đang bật ở đây, hãy tắt tính năng của KDE: Thiết lập hệ thống → Quản lý cửa sổ → Cạnh màn hình, và Hành vi cửa sổ → Di chuyển.","KDE's own edge tiling":"Xếp ô ở cạnh của chính KDE","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"Tính năng phóng to và xếp ô riêng của KDE ở các cạnh – kèm đường viền – tạm dừng khi KSnapUnity chạy, để chỉ có một bản xem trước. Thiết lập KDE của bạn không đổi: tắt mục này, vô hiệu hoá hoặc gỡ KSnapUnity thì hành vi của KDE quay lại.","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"Các hành động cạnh màn hình của KDE vẫn đang bật, nên hai công cụ cùng phản ứng với một lần kéo. Hãy tắt “Phóng to” và “Lát” trong Thiết lập hệ thống → Quản lý cửa sổ → Cạnh màn hình.","KDE's own window snapping":"Bám cửa sổ của chính KDE","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"Cơ chế gắn cửa sổ của KDE cũng đang bật. Để cảm giác nhất quán, hãy đặt các vùng của nó thành “Không có” trong Thiết lập hệ thống → Quản lý cửa sổ → Hành vi cửa sổ → Di chuyển.","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Dịch vụ phím tắt của KDE không trả lời. Bạn vẫn có thể đặt phím trong Thiết lập hệ thống → Phím tắt → KWin.","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – Trình sửa thiết lập","Keep stacked windows in line":"Giữ các cửa sổ xếp chồng thẳng hàng","Keep the gap between windows":"Giữ khoảng cách giữa các cửa sổ","Keep them":"Giữ nguyên","Key scheme":"Sơ đồ phím","Keyboard shortcuts":"Phím tắt bàn phím","Keys":"Phím","Keys already in use":"Phím đã được dùng","Layout":"Bố cục","Layout by number of windows":"Bố cục theo số cửa sổ","Layouts":"Bố cục","Layouts per row":"Số bố cục mỗi hàng","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"Cạnh trái và phải: nửa màn hình","Left edge: left half":"Cạnh trái: nửa trái","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"Dưới 100 % cửa sổ duy nhất nằm giữa – đẹp trên màn hình rộng.","License":"Giấy phép","Light":"Sáng","Linear":"Tuyến tính","Live preview":"Xem trước trực tiếp","Load template…":"Tải mẫu…","Magnet":"Nam châm","Main + stack":"Chính + chồng","Main and stack":"Chính và chồng","Main area bigger":"Vùng chính lớn hơn","Main area on the right":"Vùng chính bên phải","Main area smaller":"Vùng chính nhỏ hơn","Main in the middle":"Chính ở giữa","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"Công tắc chính cho kéo và phím.","Main window":"Cửa sổ chính","Main windows":"Các cửa sổ chính","Main windows: %1":"Cửa sổ chính: %1","Make it the main window":"Đặt làm cửa sổ chính","Maximize":"Phóng to","Maximize or restore":"Phóng to hoặc khôi phục","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + phím (kiểu KDE)","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + phím","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + phím","Minimize":"Thu nhỏ","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"Lật bố cục: cửa sổ chính bên phải, các cửa sổ khác bên trái.","Mode":"Chế độ","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"Chế độ 1 – Thanh gắn và cạnh màn hình","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"Chế độ 2 – Xếp ô tự động","Modes":"Chế độ","More ways":"Cách khác","Motion curve":"Đường cong chuyển động","Move a window towards others…":"Đưa cửa sổ lại gần các cửa sổ khác…","Move the window one place back":"Dời cửa sổ lùi một vị trí","Move the window one place on":"Dời cửa sổ lên một vị trí","Name:":"Tên:","New layout":"Bố cục mới","New windows":"Cửa sổ mới","Next tiling layout":"Bố cục xếp ô tiếp theo","Next to the active window":"Bên cạnh cửa sổ đang dùng","No key":"Không có phím","No other window open":"Không có cửa sổ nào khác đang mở","No outer margin":"Không lề ngoài","No shortcuts":"Không có phím tắt","None":"Không có","None yet.":"Chưa có.","Off":"Tắt","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"Tắt = chế độ 1, bật = chế độ 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"Tắt: khung trung tính – chỉ cho các xem trước đang bật.","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"Tắt: phím vẫn được gán nhưng không làm gì.","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"Tắt: cửa sổ ở nguyên nơi bạn đặt. Các tính năng khác vẫn hoạt động.","One at a time":"Từng cái một","One closes – the others fill the gap":"Một cái đóng – các cái khác lấp chỗ trống","One main window less":"Bớt một cửa sổ chính","One more main window":"Thêm một cửa sổ chính","One window":"Một cửa sổ","Only one mode is switched on.":"Chỉ có một chế độ đang bật.","Open settings editor":"Mở trình sửa thiết lập","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"Mở ứng dụng trước, rồi chọn nó ở đây.","Open the layout builder":"Mở trình tạo bố cục","Own layouts":"Bố cục riêng","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"Phần của mỗi cạnh được tính là góc.","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"Tạm dừng xếp ô ở cạnh của KDE và xem trước của nó","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"Tạm dừng vùng bám của KDE khi nam châm bật","Preview":"Xem trước","Previews":"Xem trước","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"Đẩy cửa sổ vào cạnh hoặc góc màn hình và nó sẽ lấp đầy phần đó. Hoạt động có hoặc không có thanh gắn.","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"Đẩy cửa sổ vào cạnh hoặc góc: phóng to, nửa, phần tư.","Push delay":"Độ trễ đẩy","Quarters":"Phần tư","Quick":"Nhanh","Quick settings":"Thiết lập nhanh","Recommended values":"Giá trị khuyến nghị","Remove":"Xoá","Remove rule":"Xoá quy tắc","Remove zone":"Xóa vùng","Reset all":"Đặt lại tất cả","Reset all keys":"Đặt lại tất cả phím","Reset to default":"Khôi phục mặc định","Resistance against overlapping":"Lực cản chồng lấn","Resize touching windows together":"Đổi kích thước các cửa sổ chạm nhau cùng lúc","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"Đổi kích thước cũng gắn – ở đây lên hết chiều cao","Restore":"Khôi phục","Restore default layouts":"Khôi phục bố cục mặc định","Restore default layouts?":"Khôi phục bố cục mặc định?","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"Khôi phục kích thước ban đầu khi kéo cửa sổ ra","Restore the size before snapping":"Khôi phục kích thước trước khi gắn","Rows":"Hàng","Save":"Lưu","Screen edges":"Cạnh màn hình","Screen edges on/off":"Bật/tắt cạnh màn hình","Screen edges preview":"Xem trước cạnh màn hình","Set":"Đặt","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"Đặt phím cho mọi hành động cùng lúc. Bạn vẫn có thể đổi từng phím ở bên dưới.","Settings":"Cài đặt","Settings file":"Tệp cài đặt","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"Khi đổi kích thước, lắc chuột nhanh qua lại và các cửa sổ khác nhảy về. Một cú kéo nhanh theo một hướng không bao giờ thả chúng ra.","Shake to let go":"Lắc để thả","Shortcuts":"Phím tắt","Show a small handle first":"Hiện tay nắm nhỏ trước","Show layout and zone names":"Hiện tên bố cục và vùng","Show previews in the accent color":"Hiện xem trước bằng màu nhấn","Showing":"Hiển thị","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"Cho thấy cửa sổ sẽ nằm ở đâu tại một cạnh hoặc góc. Tắt: không có xem trước.","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"Cho thấy cửa sổ sẽ nằm ở đâu khi một vùng của thanh được tô sáng. Tắt: không có xem trước.","Sidebar + grid":"Thanh bên + lưới","Single zone":"Một vùng","Six tiles":"Sáu ô","Size & shape":"Kích thước & hình dạng","Size of the main area":"Kích thước vùng chính","Slide-in duration":"Thời gian trượt vào","Slide-out duration":"Thời gian trượt ra","Smart arranging and detection.":"Sắp xếp và nhận biết thông minh.","Smart fill":"Lấp đầy thông minh","Smooth (default)":"Mượt (mặc định)","Snap bar":"Thanh gắn","Snap bar and screen edges":"Thanh gắn và cạnh màn hình","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"Thanh gắn và các cạnh đang tắt – chỉ chế độ 2 chạy và phím chế độ không làm gì.","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"Thanh gắn và cạnh màn hình cản trở xếp ô tự động. Vì vậy chúng chạy thành hai chế độ – chuyển bằng phím tắt hoặc tại đây.","Snap bar colors:":"Màu thanh gắn:","Snap bar on/off":"Bật/tắt thanh gắn","Snap bar preview":"Xem trước thanh bám","Snap bar size":"Kích thước thanh","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"Thanh gắn, cạnh màn hình, nam châm cửa sổ, phím tắt và hoán đổi cửa sổ.","Snap distance":"Khoảng cách hút","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"Gắn đường phân cách (¼, ⅓, ½ …)","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"Bố cục gắn và xếp ô tự động.","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"Gắn cửa sổ đang dùng bằng tổ hợp phím.","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"Gắn cửa sổ đang dùng bằng bàn phím. Đây là các phím tắt toàn cục bình thường của KDE – bạn cũng tìm thấy chúng trong Thiết lập hệ thống → Phím tắt → KWin.","Snap to the bottom half":"Gắn vào nửa dưới","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"Gắn vào phần tư dưới trái","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"Gắn vào phần tư dưới phải","Snap to the center third":"Gắn vào một phần ba ở giữa","Snap to the left half":"Gắn vào nửa trái","Snap to the left third":"Gắn vào một phần ba bên trái","Snap to the left two thirds":"Gắn vào hai phần ba bên trái","Snap to the right half":"Gắn vào nửa phải","Snap to the right third":"Gắn vào một phần ba bên phải","Snap to the right two thirds":"Gắn vào hai phần ba bên phải","Snap to the top half":"Gắn vào nửa trên","Snap to the top-left quarter":"Gắn vào phần tư trên trái","Snap to the top-right quarter":"Gắn vào phần tư trên phải","Snapping":"Gắn cửa sổ","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"Gắn và xếp ô tự động chạy thành hai chế độ – một phím tắt chuyển qua lại.","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"Nhờ đó chỉ một nam châm kéo cửa sổ. Thiết lập KDE của bạn không đổi: tắt mục này, vô hiệu hoá hoặc gỡ KSnapUnity thì tính năng gắn của KDE quay lại.","Soft":"Êm","Spacing":"Khoảng cách","Spiral":"Xoắn ốc","Split side by side":"Chia cạnh nhau","Split top and bottom":"Chia trên và dưới","Stack + main":"Chồng + chính","Stick to other windows":"Dính vào cửa sổ khác","Stick to the screen edges":"Dính vào cạnh màn hình","Sticky edges":"Cạnh dính","Support KSnapUnity":"Ủng hộ KSnapUnity","Swap":"Hoán đổi","Swap windows":"Hoán đổi cửa sổ","Swap with the window above":"Đổi với cửa sổ phía trên","Swap with the window below":"Đổi với cửa sổ phía dưới","Swap with the window on the left":"Đổi với cửa sổ bên trái","Swap with the window on the right":"Đổi với cửa sổ bên phải","Switch mode":"Chuyển chế độ","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"Chuyển chế độ (gắn / xếp ô)","Switch modes with:":"Chuyển chế độ bằng:","Switch the layout by itself":"Tự đổi bố cục","Switched off":"Đã tắt","System":"Hệ thống","Take it over":"Lấy lại","Take over all":"Lấy lại tất cả","Take the main place":"Lấy chỗ chính","Test animation":"Thử hoạt ảnh","Test on screen":"Thử trên màn hình","Test the snap bar":"Thử thanh gắn","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"Giá trị mặc định dựa trên Windows 11.","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"Các hành động gắn dùng cùng khoảng cách như thanh gắn và nhớ kích thước trước khi gắn: “Khôi phục kích thước trước khi gắn” sẽ đưa nó trở lại.","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"Các ứng dụng này không bao giờ được sắp xếp và giữ chỗ riêng. Hộp thoại luôn trôi.","Thirds":"Phần ba","Three columns":"Ba cột","Thumbnail width":"Chiều rộng ảnh thu nhỏ","Tiling":"Xếp ô","Tip":"Mẹo","Top / bottom":"Trên / dưới","Top edge":"Cạnh trên","Top edge: full screen":"Cạnh trên: toàn màn hình","Top edge: maximize":"Cạnh trên: phóng to","Top edge: top half":"Cạnh trên: nửa trên","Top half":"Nửa trên","Trigger distance from the top edge":"Khoảng cách kích hoạt từ mép trên","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"Tắt mục này nếu bạn thích viền của KDE hơn – rồi tắt xem trước cạnh màn hình ở trên.","Two thirds":"Hai phần ba","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"Hai cửa sổ đổi chỗ – thả cái này lên cái kia hoặc dùng phím.","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"Hai cửa sổ đổi chỗ: thả cái này lên cái kia, hoặc bằng phím.","Use keyboard shortcuts":"Dùng phím tắt bàn phím","Use screen edges":"Dùng cạnh màn hình","Use the system accent color":"Dùng màu nhấn của hệ thống","Use the window magnet":"Dùng nam châm cửa sổ","Usual combinations":"Tổ hợp thông dụng","Version":"Phiên bản","Wanted for: %1":"Cần cho: %1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"Khi một cửa sổ mở, đóng hoặc đổi chỗ, các cửa sổ khác di chuyển mượt thay vì nhảy.","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"Khi bạn đổi kích thước một cửa sổ, các cửa sổ chạm vào nó dời cạnh chung theo – không gì chồng lên nhau, không có khe hở.","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"Khi đổi kích thước, các cửa sổ không đi theo được hiển thị trong suốt.","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"Khi bạn di chuyển hoặc đổi cỡ cửa sổ, các cạnh của nó dính vào cửa sổ gần đó và cạnh màn hình.","Width":"Chiều rộng","Window":"Cửa sổ","Window magnet":"Nam châm cửa sổ","Window magnet on/off":"Bật/tắt nam châm cửa sổ","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"Cửa sổ chồng lên nhau giữ cạnh trái và phải cùng nhau, cửa sổ cạnh nhau giữ cạnh trên và dưới.","Windows glide to their place":"Cửa sổ lướt vào chỗ","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"Các cửa sổ dính vào nhau và vào cạnh màn hình.","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"Cửa sổ dừng ở “Khoảng cách giữa các cửa sổ” trong trang Chung thay vì chạm nhau.","Yes":"Có","Your own combination":"Tổ hợp của riêng bạn","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"Các bố cục của bạn và thứ tự của chúng sẽ bị mất.","Zone %1":"Vùng %1","for KWin · v%1":"cho KWin · v%1","windows:":"cửa sổ:","“%1” will be removed.":"“%1” sẽ bị xóa.","…drag it onto window B…":"…kéo nó lên cửa sổ B…","…in every direction":"…theo mọi hướng","…let go: they trade places":"…thả ra: chúng đổi chỗ","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"…các cửa sổ bên cạnh lớn lên và thu lại theo","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ Sẵn sàng – nhấp OK để mở trình sửa thiết lập."},"zh_CN":{"%1 (copy)":"%1（副本）","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 已被“%2”使用。","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 / %2 个区域","0 = all in one row":"0 = 全部排成一行","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>模式 1</b><br/>吸附栏和屏幕边缘","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>模式 2</b><br/>自动平铺","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"即使设置了边距，单个窗口也占满整个屏幕。","A new window joins":"新窗口加入","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"短推一下得到二分之一或四分之一。把窗口在边缘多停一会儿，它会一直扩展到下一个窗口——预览会显示出来。","A single window":"单个窗口","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"即使快速移动，窗口也会停在另一个窗口的边缘。晃动鼠标或继续推一会儿即可松开。0 = 窗口可以自由重叠。","About & Help":"关于与帮助","Accent color":"强调色","Active":"已启用","Active mode":"当前模式","Active width along the top edge":"顶部边缘的有效宽度","Add an open application":"添加已打开的应用","Add rule":"添加规则","All window features in one system.":"所有窗口功能集于一个系统。","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"手动调整主窗口大小时也会改变。","Also while resizing":"调整大小时也吸附","Always floating":"始终浮动","Animation":"动画","Appearance":"外观","Apply":"应用","Arrange windows":"排列窗口","Arrange windows automatically":"自动排列窗口","Author":"作者","Automatic tiling":"自动平铺","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"自动平铺已关闭——只有模式 1 运行，模式快捷键不起作用。","Automatic tiling off":"自动平铺已关闭","Automatic tiling on":"自动平铺已开启","Automatic tiling on/off":"开/关自动平铺","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"自动平铺、交换窗口、快捷键，以及用于浮动窗口的磁吸。","Background opacity":"背景不透明度","Behavior & Animation":"行为与动画","Bottom edge: bottom half":"下边缘：下半部分","Bouncy":"弹性","Buy me a coffee":"请我喝杯咖啡","Cancel":"取消","Center focus":"居中聚焦","Center the window":"窗口居中","Change":"更改","Change key":"更改按键","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"按键可在设置编辑器中更改。两种模式都需要自动平铺以及吸附栏或屏幕边缘。","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"可在“键盘快捷键”页面更改。自动平铺时，窗口在顺序中的位置也会交换。","Choose…":"选择……","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"单击区域进行选择 · 双击进行分割 · 拖动分隔线","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"点击或按 %1 切换模式。","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"点击，然后点确定——设置编辑器会打开。","Close":"关闭","Close by, the edges stick together":"靠近时边缘会贴在一起","Color scheme":"配色方案","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"吸附栏的颜色、大小和形状。","Columns":"列","Corner radius":"圆角半径","Corner size":"角落大小","Corner: a quarter":"角落：四分之一","Corners: quarter of the screen":"角落：四分之一屏幕","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + 键（默认）","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + 数字小键盘","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + 键","Custom color":"自定义颜色","Custom layout %1":"自定义布局 %1","Dark":"深色","Delay before hiding":"隐藏前的延迟","Delay before showing":"显示前的延迟","Delete":"删除","Delete layout?":"删除布局？","Distance at which the handle appears":"把手出现的距离","Distance before the bar hides again":"吸附栏再次隐藏前的距离","Distance to the edge":"到边缘的距离","Donate with PayPal":"通过 PayPal 捐赠","Drag a shared edge…":"拖动共享的边缘……","Drag a window against an edge…":"把窗口拖向边缘……","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"把一个窗口拖到另一个上即可交换。放到吸附栏或屏幕边缘时它会自由浮动；“让窗口浮动”可让它回来。间距来自常规页面。","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"把窗口拖到另一个窗口中央上方——预览显示两个箭头——然后松开。自动平铺时，放在另一个窗口上方任何位置都可以。","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"将窗口拖到屏幕顶部边缘，然后放到某个区域上。","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"拖动卡片以更改吸附栏中的顺序。双击卡片进行编辑。","Drop a window onto another one":"将窗口放到另一个窗口上","Drop the window onto a zone":"将窗口放到某个区域上","Duplicate":"复制","Duration":"时长","Dwindle":"向内螺旋","Dynamic":"动感","Edges and corners":"边缘和角落","Edit":"编辑","Edit layout":"编辑布局","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"每项功能都可以单独开启或关闭。","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"你在布局页面创建的每个布局也能用来排列窗口——它会显示在上方。窗口 1 进入区域 1，依此类推；多出的窗口共享最后一个区域。窗口少于区域时使用“主区和堆叠”，不会留下空洞。","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"每个窗口自动找到自己的位置，就像平铺式窗口管理器一样。","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"每个窗口都会自动在屏幕上找到位置。新窗口加入，关闭的窗口给其他窗口腾出空间。","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"例如：两个窗口并排，三个起主区和堆叠，五个起网格。没有匹配的规则时使用上面选择的布局。","Fade in and out":"淡入淡出","Fade the other windows":"淡化其他窗口","Features":"功能","Feel":"手感","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"避开已吸附的窗口","Fits the way you work.":"贴合你的工作方式。","Float the window (leave tiling)":"让窗口浮动（离开平铺）","Four quarters":"四等分","From":"从","Fullscreen":"全屏","Gap between windows":"窗口间距","Gap to the screen edge":"与屏幕边缘的间距","General":"常规","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"重新为每个操作分配所选方案的按键，并移除方案中没有的按键。","Good to know":"小贴士","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"按住窗口标题栏向上拖动，吸附栏会滑下；把窗口放到某个区域上，它就会正好填满该区域。再次拖出时，窗口会恢复原来的大小。","Grab window A…":"抓住窗口 A……","Grid":"网格","Halves":"两等分","Hiding":"隐藏","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"在边缘按住以填满空闲区域","Hold time":"按住时间","Hold to fill":"按住以填满","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"边缘需要靠多近才会卡到位。","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"光标需要离边缘多近。","How far the bar slides down":"吸附栏下滑的距离","How it works":"使用方法","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"窗口需要贴住边缘多久——轻轻一推。0 = 立即。","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"窗口在扩展前需要在边缘停留多久。","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"共享主区域的窗口数量（布局“主区和堆叠”）。","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"如果底部已有窗口，上边缘会给出上半部分而不是最大化。二分之一和四分之一同样会避开已吸附的窗口。","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"如果你喜欢 KSnapUnity，可以支持它的开发——谢谢！","In bar":"显示在栏中","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"独立于吸附栏和屏幕边缘。","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"独立于吸附栏。每条边缘都可单独开启。","Information":"信息","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"直观、自然的窗口行为。","Join at the end":"排到最后","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K 代表 KWin · Snap 代表更聪明的吸附 · Unity 代表一切尽在一个系统","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE 有自己的屏幕边缘操作和窗口吸附。如果这里开启了相同的功能，请关闭 KDE 自带的：系统设置 → 窗口管理 → 屏幕边缘，以及 窗口行为 → 移动。","KDE's own edge tiling":"KDE 自带的边缘平铺","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"KDE 自带的屏幕边缘最大化和平铺（及其轮廓）在 KSnapUnity 运行时暂停，因此只出现一个预览。你的 KDE 设置不会改变：关闭此项、停用或移除 KSnapUnity，KDE 的行为就会恢复。","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"KDE 自带的屏幕边缘操作仍然开启，所以两个工具会对同一次拖动作出反应。请在 系统设置 → 窗口管理 → 屏幕边缘 中关闭“最大化”和“平铺”。","KDE's own window snapping":"KDE 自带的窗口吸附","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE 自带的窗口吸附也已开启。为了统一手感，请在 系统设置 → 窗口管理 → 窗口行为 → 移动 中把它的吸附区域设为“无”。","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"KDE 快捷键服务没有响应。你仍可在 系统设置 → 快捷键 → KWin 中设置按键。","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – 设置编辑器","Keep stacked windows in line":"让上下堆叠的窗口保持对齐","Keep the gap between windows":"保持窗口间距","Keep them":"保留","Key scheme":"按键方案","Keyboard shortcuts":"键盘快捷键","Keys":"按键","Keys already in use":"已被占用的按键","Layout":"布局","Layout by number of windows":"按窗口数量选择布局","Layouts":"布局","Layouts per row":"每行布局数","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"左右边缘：半个屏幕","Left edge: left half":"左边缘：左半部分","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"低于 100 % 时单个窗口保持居中——宽屏上很好看。","License":"许可证","Light":"浅色","Linear":"线性","Live preview":"实时预览","Load template…":"加载模板…","Magnet":"磁吸","Main + stack":"主窗口 + 堆叠","Main and stack":"主区和堆叠","Main area bigger":"主区域变大","Main area on the right":"主区在右侧","Main area smaller":"主区域变小","Main in the middle":"主区居中","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"拖动和按键的总开关。","Main window":"主窗口","Main windows":"主窗口数","Main windows: %1":"主窗口：%1","Make it the main window":"设为主窗口","Maximize":"最大化","Maximize or restore":"最大化或还原","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + 键（KDE 风格）","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + 键","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + 键","Minimize":"最小化","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"镜像布局：主窗口在右，其他在左。","Mode":"模式","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"模式 1 – 吸附栏和屏幕边缘","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"模式 2 – 自动平铺","Modes":"模式","More ways":"更多方式","Motion curve":"运动曲线","Move a window towards others…":"把窗口移向其他窗口……","Move the window one place back":"窗口向后移一位","Move the window one place on":"窗口向前移一位","Name:":"名称：","New layout":"新建布局","New windows":"新窗口","Next tiling layout":"下一个平铺布局","Next to the active window":"放在活动窗口旁边","No key":"无按键","No other window open":"没有其他打开的窗口","No outer margin":"无外边距","No shortcuts":"无快捷键","None":"无","None yet.":"暂无。","Off":"关闭","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"关 = 模式 1，开 = 模式 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"关闭：中性边框——仅用于已开启的预览。","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"关闭：按键保持分配，但不执行任何操作。","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"关闭：窗口停留在你放置的位置。其他功能照常工作。","One at a time":"逐个显示","One closes – the others fill the gap":"一个关闭——其他窗口填补空位","One main window less":"减少一个主窗口","One more main window":"增加一个主窗口","One window":"一个窗口","Only one mode is switched on.":"只开启了一种模式。","Open settings editor":"打开设置编辑器","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"先打开应用，然后在这里选择。","Open the layout builder":"打开布局构建器","Own layouts":"自定义布局","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"每条边中算作角落的部分。","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"暂停 KDE 的边缘平铺及其预览","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"磁吸开启时暂停 KDE 的吸附区域","Preview":"预览","Previews":"预览","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"把窗口推向屏幕的边缘或角落，它就会填满那一部分。有没有吸附栏都能用。","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"把窗口推向边缘或角落：最大化、二分之一、四分之一。","Push delay":"推动延迟","Quarters":"四分之一","Quick":"快速","Quick settings":"快速设置","Recommended values":"推荐值","Remove":"移除","Remove rule":"删除规则","Remove zone":"删除区域","Reset all":"全部重置","Reset all keys":"重置所有按键","Reset to default":"恢复默认","Resistance against overlapping":"防重叠阻力","Resize touching windows together":"一起调整相接窗口的大小","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"调整大小也会吸附——这里吸到整个高度","Restore":"还原","Restore default layouts":"恢复默认布局","Restore default layouts?":"恢复默认布局？","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"将窗口拖出时恢复原始大小","Restore the size before snapping":"恢复吸附前的大小","Rows":"行","Save":"保存","Screen edges":"屏幕边缘","Screen edges on/off":"开关屏幕边缘","Screen edges preview":"屏幕边缘预览","Set":"设置","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"一次性设置所有操作的按键。仍可在下方单独更改按键。","Settings":"设置","Settings file":"设置文件","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"调整大小时快速来回晃动鼠标，其他窗口会弹回。朝一个方向快速拉动永远不会松开它们。","Shake to let go":"摇动以分开","Shortcuts":"快捷键","Show a small handle first":"先显示一个小把手","Show layout and zone names":"显示布局和区域名称","Show previews in the accent color":"以强调色显示预览","Showing":"显示","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"显示窗口在边缘或角落时将落在哪里。关闭：完全没有预览。","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"吸附栏中的区域高亮时，显示窗口将落在哪里。关闭：完全没有预览。","Sidebar + grid":"侧栏 + 网格","Single zone":"单个区域","Six tiles":"六宫格","Size & shape":"大小与形状","Size of the main area":"主区域大小","Slide-in duration":"滑入时长","Slide-out duration":"滑出时长","Smart arranging and detection.":"智能排列与识别。","Smart fill":"智能填充","Smooth (default)":"平滑（默认）","Snap bar":"吸附栏","Snap bar and screen edges":"吸附栏和屏幕边缘","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"吸附栏和屏幕边缘已关闭——只有模式 2 运行，模式快捷键不起作用。","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"吸附栏和屏幕边缘会妨碍自动平铺，所以它们作为两种模式运行——用快捷键或在这里切换。","Snap bar colors:":"吸附栏颜色：","Snap bar on/off":"开关吸附栏","Snap bar preview":"吸附栏预览","Snap bar size":"吸附栏大小","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"吸附栏、屏幕边缘、窗口磁吸、快捷键和交换窗口。","Snap distance":"吸附距离","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"分隔线吸附（¼、⅓、½ …）","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"吸附布局和自动平铺。","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"用组合键吸附当前窗口。","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"用键盘吸附当前窗口。这些是普通的 KDE 全局快捷键——也可以在 系统设置 → 快捷键 → KWin 中找到。","Snap to the bottom half":"吸附到下半部分","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"吸附到左下四分之一","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"吸附到右下四分之一","Snap to the center third":"吸附到中间三分之一","Snap to the left half":"吸附到左半部分","Snap to the left third":"吸附到左三分之一","Snap to the left two thirds":"吸附到左侧三分之二","Snap to the right half":"吸附到右半部分","Snap to the right third":"吸附到右三分之一","Snap to the right two thirds":"吸附到右侧三分之二","Snap to the top half":"吸附到上半部分","Snap to the top-left quarter":"吸附到左上四分之一","Snap to the top-right quarter":"吸附到右上四分之一","Snapping":"吸附","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"吸附和自动平铺作为两种模式运行——一个快捷键即可切换。","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"这样只有一个磁铁吸引窗口。你的 KDE 设置不会改变：关闭此项、停用或移除 KSnapUnity，KDE 的吸附就会恢复。","Soft":"柔和","Spacing":"间距","Spiral":"螺旋","Split side by side":"左右分割","Split top and bottom":"上下分割","Stack + main":"堆叠 + 主窗口","Stick to other windows":"吸附到其他窗口","Stick to the screen edges":"吸附到屏幕边缘","Sticky edges":"粘连边缘","Support KSnapUnity":"支持 KSnapUnity","Swap":"交换","Swap windows":"交换窗口","Swap with the window above":"与上方窗口交换","Swap with the window below":"与下方窗口交换","Swap with the window on the left":"与左侧窗口交换","Swap with the window on the right":"与右侧窗口交换","Switch mode":"切换模式","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"切换模式（吸附 / 平铺）","Switch modes with:":"切换模式按键：","Switch the layout by itself":"自动切换布局","Switched off":"已关闭","System":"系统","Take it over":"接管","Take over all":"全部接管","Take the main place":"占据主位置","Test animation":"测试动画","Test on screen":"在屏幕上测试","Test the snap bar":"试用吸附栏","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"默认值参考了 Windows 11。","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"吸附操作使用与吸附栏相同的间距，并记住吸附前的大小：“恢复吸附前的大小”可将其还原。","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"这些应用从不被排列，保持自己的位置。对话框始终浮动。","Thirds":"三分之一","Three columns":"三列","Thumbnail width":"缩略图宽度","Tiling":"平铺","Tip":"提示","Top / bottom":"上 / 下","Top edge":"上边缘","Top edge: full screen":"上边缘：全屏","Top edge: maximize":"上边缘：最大化","Top edge: top half":"上边缘：上半部分","Top half":"上半部分","Trigger distance from the top edge":"距顶部边缘的触发距离","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"如果你更喜欢 KDE 自己的轮廓，就关闭此项——然后关闭上面的屏幕边缘预览。","Two thirds":"三分之二","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"两个窗口交换位置——把一个拖放到另一个上，或使用按键。","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"两个窗口交换位置：把一个拖放到另一个上，或用按键。","Use keyboard shortcuts":"使用键盘快捷键","Use screen edges":"使用屏幕边缘","Use the system accent color":"使用系统强调色","Use the window magnet":"使用窗口磁吸","Usual combinations":"常用组合","Version":"版本","Wanted for: %1":"用于：%1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"窗口打开、关闭或交换时，其他窗口平滑移动而不是跳动。","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"调整一个窗口的大小时，与它相接的窗口会一同移动共享的边缘——不会重叠，也不会留缝。","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"调整大小时，不跟随移动的窗口会显示为半透明。","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"移动窗口或调整其大小时，窗口边缘会吸附到附近的窗口和屏幕边缘。","Width":"宽度","Window":"窗口","Window magnet":"窗口磁吸","Window magnet on/off":"开关窗口磁吸","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"上下排列的窗口保持左右边缘一致，左右并排的窗口保持上下边缘一致。","Windows glide to their place":"窗口平滑滑入位置","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"窗口会互相吸附，也会吸附到屏幕边缘。","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"窗口会停在“常规”页面的“窗口间距”处，而不是贴在一起。","Yes":"是","Your own combination":"自定义组合","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"您自己的布局及其顺序将会丢失。","Zone %1":"区域 %1","for KWin · v%1":"适用于 KWin · v%1","windows:":"个窗口起：","“%1” will be removed.":"将删除“%1”。","…drag it onto window B…":"……拖到窗口 B 上……","…in every direction":"……任何方向都可以","…let go: they trade places":"……松开：它们交换位置","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"……相邻窗口随之变大变小","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ 就绪——点击确定打开设置编辑器。"},"zh_TW":{"%1 (copy)":"%1（副本）","%1 is used by “%2”.":"%1 已被「%2」使用。","%1 of %2 zones":"%1 / %2 個區域","0 = all in one row":"0 = 全部排成一列","<b>Mode 1</b><br/>Snap bar and screen edges":"<b>模式 1</b><br/>貼齊列和螢幕邊緣","<b>Mode 2</b><br/>Automatic tiling":"<b>模式 2</b><br/>自動並排","A lone window uses the whole screen, even when a margin is set.":"即使設定了邊距，單一視窗也會佔滿整個螢幕。","A new window joins":"新視窗加入","A short push gives the half or quarter. Keep the window at the edge a moment longer and it grows up to the next window – the preview shows it.":"短推一下得到二分之一或四分之一。把視窗在邊緣多停一會兒，它會一路擴展到下一個視窗——預覽會顯示出來。","A single window":"單一視窗","A window stops at the edge of another one, also when you move it fast. Shake the mouse or keep pushing for a moment to let go. 0 = windows can overlap freely.":"即使快速移動，視窗也會停在另一個視窗的邊緣。搖動滑鼠或繼續推一下即可放開。0 = 視窗可以自由重疊。","About & Help":"關於與說明","Accent color":"強調色","Active":"已啟用","Active mode":"目前模式","Active width along the top edge":"上緣的作用寬度","Add an open application":"新增已開啟的應用程式","Add rule":"新增規則","All window features in one system.":"所有視窗功能集於一個系統。","Also changes when you resize the main window by hand.":"手動調整主視窗大小時也會改變。","Also while resizing":"調整大小時也吸附","Always floating":"一律浮動","Animation":"動畫","Appearance":"外觀","Apply":"套用","Arrange windows":"排列視窗","Arrange windows automatically":"自動排列視窗","Author":"作者","Automatic tiling":"自動並排","Automatic tiling is switched off – only mode 1 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"自動並排已關閉——只有模式 1 運作，模式快捷鍵沒有作用。","Automatic tiling off":"自動並排已關閉","Automatic tiling on":"自動並排已開啟","Automatic tiling on/off":"開/關自動並排","Automatic tiling, swap windows, shortcuts, and the window magnet for floating windows.":"自動並排、交換視窗、快捷鍵，以及用於浮動視窗的磁吸。","Background opacity":"背景不透明度","Behavior & Animation":"行為與動畫","Bottom edge: bottom half":"下邊緣：下半部","Bouncy":"彈跳","Buy me a coffee":"請我喝杯咖啡","Cancel":"取消","Center focus":"置中焦點","Center the window":"視窗置中","Change":"變更","Change key":"變更按鍵","Change the key in the settings editor. Both modes need automatic tiling and the snap bar or screen edges switched on.":"按鍵可在設定編輯器中變更。兩種模式都需要自動並排以及貼齊列或螢幕邊緣。","Change them on the Keyboard shortcuts page. With automatic tiling, the windows also trade their places in the order.":"可在「鍵盤快捷鍵」頁面變更。自動並排時，視窗在順序中的位置也會交換。","Choose…":"選擇……","Click a zone to select it · double-click to split · drag the dividers":"點選區域即可選取 · 按兩下即可分割 · 拖曳分隔線","Click or press %1 to switch the mode.":"點按或按 %1 切換模式。","Click, then OK – the settings editor opens.":"點按，然後按確定——設定編輯器會開啟。","Close":"關閉","Close by, the edges stick together":"靠近時邊緣會黏在一起","Color scheme":"配色","Colors, size and shape of the snap bar.":"貼齊列的色彩、大小與形狀。","Columns":"欄","Corner radius":"圓角半徑","Corner size":"角落大小","Corner: a quarter":"角落：四分之一","Corners: quarter of the screen":"角落：四分之一個螢幕","Ctrl+Alt + key (default)":"Ctrl+Alt + 按鍵（預設）","Ctrl+Alt + number block":"Ctrl+Alt + 數字鍵台","Ctrl+Shift+Alt + key":"Ctrl+Shift+Alt + 按鍵","Custom color":"自訂色彩","Custom layout %1":"自訂版面配置 %1","Dark":"深色","Delay before hiding":"隱藏前的延遲","Delay before showing":"顯示前的延遲","Delete":"刪除","Delete layout?":"要刪除版面配置嗎？","Distance at which the handle appears":"把手出現的距離","Distance before the bar hides again":"貼齊列再次隱藏前的距離","Distance to the edge":"與邊緣的距離","Donate with PayPal":"透過 PayPal 捐款","Drag a shared edge…":"拖曳共用的邊緣……","Drag a window against an edge…":"把視窗拖向邊緣……","Drag a window onto another one to swap them. Drop it on the snap bar or a screen edge and it floats freely; “Float the window” brings it back. Gaps come from the General page.":"把一個視窗拖到另一個上即可交換。放到貼齊列或螢幕邊緣時它會自由浮動；「讓視窗浮動」可讓它回來。間距來自一般頁面。","Drag a window over the middle of another one – the preview shows two arrows – and let go. With automatic tiling anywhere over the other window will do.":"把視窗拖到另一個視窗中央上方——預覽顯示兩個箭頭——然後放開。自動並排時，放在另一個視窗上方任何位置都可以。","Drag a window to the top edge of the screen and drop it onto a zone.":"將視窗拖曳到螢幕上緣，再放到某個區域上。","Drag the cards to change the order in the snap bar. Double-click a card to edit it.":"拖曳卡片即可變更貼齊列中的順序。按兩下卡片即可編輯。","Drop a window onto another one":"將視窗放到另一個視窗上","Drop the window onto a zone":"將視窗放到某個區域上","Duplicate":"複製","Duration":"時長","Dwindle":"向內螺旋","Dynamic":"動感","Edges and corners":"邊緣與角落","Edit":"編輯","Edit layout":"編輯版面配置","Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.":"每項功能都可以個別開啟或關閉。","Every layout you build on the Layouts page can arrange windows too – it appears above. Window 1 gets zone 1 and so on; more windows share the last zone. With fewer windows than zones “Main and stack” is used, so no holes appear.":"你在版面配置頁面建立的每個版面配置也能用來排列視窗——它會顯示在上方。視窗 1 進入區域 1，依此類推；多出的視窗共用最後一個區域。視窗少於區域時使用「主區與堆疊」，不會留下空洞。","Every window gets its place by itself, like in a tiling window manager.":"每個視窗會自動找到自己的位置，就像並排式視窗管理員一樣。","Every window gets its place on the screen by itself. New windows join in, closed ones leave room for the others.":"每個視窗都會自動在螢幕上找到位置。新視窗加入，關閉的視窗讓出空間給其他視窗。","Example: two windows side by side, from three on main and stack, from five a grid. Without a matching rule the layout chosen above is used.":"例如：兩個視窗並排，三個起主區與堆疊，五個起網格。沒有符合的規則時使用上面選擇的版面配置。","Fade in and out":"淡入淡出","Fade the other windows":"淡化其他視窗","Features":"功能","Feel":"手感","Fit around windows that are already snapped":"避開已貼齊的視窗","Fits the way you work.":"貼合你的工作方式。","Float the window (leave tiling)":"讓視窗浮動（離開並排）","Four quarters":"四等分","From":"從","Fullscreen":"全螢幕","Gap between windows":"視窗間距","Gap to the screen edge":"與螢幕邊緣的間距","General":"一般","Gives every action the key of the chosen scheme again and removes keys the scheme does not have.":"重新為每個動作指定所選配置的按鍵，並移除配置中沒有的按鍵。","Good to know":"小提示","Grab a window by its title bar and drag it up. The snap bar slides down; drop the window onto a zone and it fills exactly that area. Drag it away again and it gets its old size back.":"抓住視窗的標題列往上拖曳，貼齊列就會滑下；把視窗放到某個區域上，它就會剛好填滿該區域。再次拖出時，視窗會恢復原本的大小。","Grab window A…":"抓住視窗 A……","Grid":"網格","Halves":"二等分","Hiding":"隱藏","Hold at the edge to fill the free space":"在邊緣按住以填滿空閒區域","Hold time":"按住時間","Hold to fill":"按住以填滿","How close an edge has to come before it clicks into place.":"邊緣需要靠多近才會卡到定位。","How close the cursor has to get to the edge.":"游標需要離邊緣多近。","How far the bar slides down":"貼齊列下滑的距離","How it works":"運作方式","How long the window has to rest against the edge – a small push. 0 = at once.":"視窗需要靠在邊緣多久——輕輕一推。0 = 立即。","How long the window has to stay at the edge before it grows.":"視窗在擴展前需要在邊緣停留多久。","How many windows share the main area (layout “Main and stack”).":"共用主區域的視窗數量（版面「主區與堆疊」）。","If a window sits at the bottom, the top edge gives the top half instead of maximizing. Halves and quarters also leave snapped windows uncovered.":"如果底部已有視窗，上邊緣會給出上半部而不是最大化。二分之一和四分之一同樣會避開已貼齊的視窗。","If you like KSnapUnity, you can support its development – thank you!":"如果你喜歡 KSnapUnity，可以支持它的開發——謝謝！","In bar":"顯示於列中","Independent of the snap bar and the screen edges.":"獨立於貼齊列與螢幕邊緣。","Independent of the snap bar. Each edge can be switched on its own.":"獨立於貼齊列。每個邊緣都能個別開啟。","Information":"資訊","Intuitive, natural window behavior.":"直覺、自然的視窗行為。","Join at the end":"排到最後","K for KWin · Snap for snapping smarter · Unity for everything in one system":"K 代表 KWin · Snap 代表更聰明的貼齊 · Unity 代表一切盡在一個系統","KDE has its own screen edge actions and window snapping. When the same feature is on here, turn KDE's off: System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges, and Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE 有自己的螢幕邊緣動作與視窗貼齊。如果這裡開啟了相同的功能，請關閉 KDE 內建的：系統設定 → 視窗管理 → 螢幕邊緣，以及 視窗行為 → 移動。","KDE's own edge tiling":"KDE 內建的邊緣並排","KDE's own maximize and tile at the screen edges – with its outline – pause while KSnapUnity runs, so only one preview appears. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own behavior is back.":"KDE 本身在螢幕邊緣的最大化與並排（及其外框）會在 KSnapUnity 執行時暫停，所以只會出現一個預覽。你的 KDE 設定不會改變：關閉此項、停用或移除 KSnapUnity，KDE 的行為就會恢復。","KDE's own screen edge actions are still on, so two helpers react to the same drag. Turn off “Maximize” and “Tile” in System Settings → Window Management → Screen Edges.":"KDE 內建的螢幕邊緣動作仍然開啟，所以兩個工具會對同一次拖曳作出反應。請在 系統設定 → 視窗管理 → 螢幕邊緣 中關閉「最大化」與「並排」。","KDE's own window snapping":"KDE 內建的視窗貼齊","KDE's own window snapping is on as well. For one consistent feel, set its snap zones to “None” in System Settings → Window Management → Window Behavior → Movement.":"KDE 內建的視窗貼齊也已開啟。為了一致的手感，請在 系統設定 → 視窗管理 → 視窗行為 → 移動 中把它的區域設為「無」。","KDE's shortcut service did not answer. You can still set the keys in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"KDE 快捷鍵服務沒有回應。你仍可在 系統設定 → 快捷鍵 → KWin 中設定按鍵。","KSnapUnity – Settings editor":"KSnapUnity – 設定編輯器","Keep stacked windows in line":"讓上下堆疊的視窗保持對齊","Keep the gap between windows":"保持視窗間距","Keep them":"保留","Key scheme":"按鍵配置","Keyboard shortcuts":"鍵盤快捷鍵","Keys":"按鍵","Keys already in use":"已被使用的按鍵","Layout":"版面配置","Layout by number of windows":"依視窗數量選擇版面配置","Layouts":"版面配置","Layouts per row":"每列版面配置數","Left and right edge: half of the screen":"左右邊緣：半個螢幕","Left edge: left half":"左邊緣：左半部","Less than 100 % keeps a lone window centered – nice on wide screens.":"低於 100 % 時單一視窗會置中——寬螢幕上很好看。","License":"授權條款","Light":"淺色","Linear":"線性","Live preview":"即時預覽","Load template…":"載入範本…","Magnet":"磁吸","Main + stack":"主視窗 + 堆疊","Main and stack":"主區與堆疊","Main area bigger":"主區域變大","Main area on the right":"主區在右側","Main area smaller":"主區域變小","Main in the middle":"主區置中","Main switch for dragging and the keys.":"拖曳與按鍵的總開關。","Main window":"主視窗","Main windows":"主視窗數","Main windows: %1":"主視窗：%1","Make it the main window":"設為主視窗","Maximize":"最大化","Maximize or restore":"最大化或還原","Meta + key (KDE style)":"Meta + 按鍵（KDE 風格）","Meta+Ctrl+Alt + key":"Meta+Ctrl+Alt + 按鍵","Meta+Shift + key":"Meta+Shift + 按鍵","Minimize":"最小化","Mirrors the layout: the main window sits on the right, the others on the left.":"鏡像版面配置：主視窗在右，其他在左。","Mode":"模式","Mode 1 – Snap bar and screen edges":"模式 1 – 貼齊列和螢幕邊緣","Mode 2 – Automatic tiling":"模式 2 – 自動並排","Modes":"模式","More ways":"更多方式","Motion curve":"動態曲線","Move a window towards others…":"把視窗移向其他視窗……","Move the window one place back":"視窗往後移一位","Move the window one place on":"視窗往前移一位","Name:":"名稱：","New layout":"新增版面配置","New windows":"新視窗","Next tiling layout":"下一個並排版面","Next to the active window":"放在作用中視窗旁邊","No key":"無按鍵","No other window open":"沒有其他開啟的視窗","No outer margin":"無外邊距","No shortcuts":"無快捷鍵","None":"無","None yet.":"尚無。","Off":"關閉","Off = Mode 1, on = Mode 2":"關 = 模式 1，開 = 模式 2","Off: a neutral frame – only for the previews that are switched on.":"關閉：中性外框——僅用於已開啟的預覽。","Off: the keys stay assigned but do nothing.":"關閉：按鍵保持指派，但不做任何事。","Off: windows stay where you put them. The other features work either way.":"關閉：視窗停在您放置的位置。其他功能照常運作。","One at a time":"逐一顯示","One closes – the others fill the gap":"一個關閉——其他視窗補上空位","One main window less":"減少一個主視窗","One more main window":"增加一個主視窗","One window":"一個視窗","Only one mode is switched on.":"只開啟了一種模式。","Open settings editor":"開啟設定編輯器","Open the application first, then pick it here.":"先開啟應用程式，再在這裡選擇。","Open the layout builder":"開啟版面配置建立器","Own layouts":"自訂版面配置","Part of each side that counts as corner.":"每一邊算作角落的部分。","Pause KDE's edge tiling and its preview":"暫停 KDE 的邊緣並排及其預覽","Pause KDE's snap zones while the magnet is on":"磁吸開啟時暫停 KDE 的貼齊區域","Preview":"預覽","Previews":"預覽","Push a window against an edge or a corner of the screen and it fills that part. Works with or without the snap bar.":"把視窗推向螢幕的邊緣或角落，它就會填滿那一部分。有沒有貼齊列都能用。","Push a window against an edge or corner: maximize, halves, quarters.":"把視窗推向邊緣或角落：最大化、二分之一、四分之一。","Push delay":"推動延遲","Quarters":"四分之一","Quick":"快速","Quick settings":"快速設定","Recommended values":"建議值","Remove":"移除","Remove rule":"移除規則","Remove zone":"移除區域","Reset all":"全部重設","Reset all keys":"重設所有按鍵","Reset to default":"還原預設值","Resistance against overlapping":"防重疊阻力","Resize touching windows together":"一起調整相接視窗的大小","Resizing snaps too – here to the full height":"調整大小也會貼齊——這裡貼到整個高度","Restore":"還原","Restore default layouts":"還原預設版面配置","Restore default layouts?":"要還原預設版面配置嗎？","Restore the original size when dragging a window out":"將視窗拖出時還原原始大小","Restore the size before snapping":"還原貼齊前的大小","Rows":"列","Save":"儲存","Screen edges":"螢幕邊緣","Screen edges on/off":"開關螢幕邊緣","Screen edges preview":"螢幕邊緣預覽","Set":"設定","Sets the keys of all actions at once. You can still change single keys below.":"一次設定所有動作的按鍵。仍可在下方個別變更按鍵。","Settings":"設定","Settings file":"設定檔","Shake the mouse quickly back and forth while resizing and the other windows jump back. A fast pull in one direction never lets go.":"調整大小時快速來回搖動滑鼠，其他視窗會彈回。朝單一方向快速拉動永遠不會放開它們。","Shake to let go":"搖動以分開","Shortcuts":"快捷鍵","Show a small handle first":"先顯示小把手","Show layout and zone names":"顯示版面配置與區域名稱","Show previews in the accent color":"以強調色顯示預覽","Showing":"顯示","Shows where the window lands at an edge or corner. Off: no preview at all.":"顯示視窗在邊緣或角落時將落在哪裡。關閉：完全沒有預覽。","Shows where the window lands while a zone of the snap bar is highlighted. Off: no preview at all.":"貼齊列中的區域反白時，顯示視窗將落在哪裡。關閉：完全沒有預覽。","Sidebar + grid":"側邊欄 + 格線","Single zone":"單一區域","Six tiles":"六格","Size & shape":"大小與形狀","Size of the main area":"主區域大小","Slide-in duration":"滑入時間","Slide-out duration":"滑出時間","Smart arranging and detection.":"聰明的排列與辨識。","Smart fill":"智慧填滿","Smooth (default)":"平順（預設）","Snap bar":"貼齊列","Snap bar and screen edges":"貼齊列和螢幕邊緣","Snap bar and screen edges are switched off – only mode 2 runs and the mode shortcut does nothing.":"貼齊列和邊緣已關閉——只有模式 2 運作，模式快捷鍵沒有作用。","Snap bar and screen edges get in the way of automatic tiling. So they run as two modes – switch between them with the shortcut or here.":"貼齊列和螢幕邊緣會妨礙自動並排，所以它們以兩種模式運作——用快捷鍵或在這裡切換。","Snap bar colors:":"貼齊列顏色：","Snap bar on/off":"開關貼齊列","Snap bar preview":"貼齊列預覽","Snap bar size":"貼齊列大小","Snap bar, screen edges, window magnet, shortcuts and swap windows.":"貼齊列、螢幕邊緣、視窗磁吸、快捷鍵和交換視窗。","Snap distance":"吸附距離","Snap dividers (¼, ⅓, ½ …)":"分隔線貼齊（¼、⅓、½ …）","Snap layouts and automatic tiling.":"貼齊版面配置與自動並排。","Snap the active window with key combinations.":"用組合鍵貼齊目前的視窗。","Snap the active window with the keyboard. These are normal KDE global shortcuts – you also find them in System Settings → Shortcuts → KWin.":"用鍵盤貼齊目前的視窗。這些是一般的 KDE 全域快捷鍵——也能在 系統設定 → 快捷鍵 → KWin 中找到。","Snap to the bottom half":"貼齊到下半部","Snap to the bottom-left quarter":"貼齊到左下四分之一","Snap to the bottom-right quarter":"貼齊到右下四分之一","Snap to the center third":"貼齊到中間三分之一","Snap to the left half":"貼齊到左半部","Snap to the left third":"貼齊到左三分之一","Snap to the left two thirds":"貼齊到左側三分之二","Snap to the right half":"貼齊到右半部","Snap to the right third":"貼齊到右三分之一","Snap to the right two thirds":"貼齊到右側三分之二","Snap to the top half":"貼齊到上半部","Snap to the top-left quarter":"貼齊到左上四分之一","Snap to the top-right quarter":"貼齊到右上四分之一","Snapping":"貼齊","Snapping and automatic tiling run as two modes – one shortcut switches between them.":"貼齊與自動並排以兩種模式運作——一個快捷鍵即可切換。","So only one magnet pulls at a window. Your KDE settings are not changed: switch this off, disable or remove KSnapUnity and KDE's own snapping is back.":"這樣只有一個磁鐵吸引視窗。你的 KDE 設定不會改變：關閉此項、停用或移除 KSnapUnity，KDE 的貼齊就會恢復。","Soft":"柔和","Spacing":"間距","Spiral":"螺旋","Split side by side":"左右分割","Split top and bottom":"上下分割","Stack + main":"堆疊 + 主視窗","Stick to other windows":"吸附到其他視窗","Stick to the screen edges":"吸附到螢幕邊緣","Sticky edges":"黏合邊緣","Support KSnapUnity":"支持 KSnapUnity","Swap":"交換","Swap windows":"交換視窗","Swap with the window above":"與上方視窗交換","Swap with the window below":"與下方視窗交換","Swap with the window on the left":"與左側視窗交換","Swap with the window on the right":"與右側視窗交換","Switch mode":"切換模式","Switch mode (snapping / tiling)":"切換模式（貼齊 / 並排）","Switch modes with:":"切換模式按鍵：","Switch the layout by itself":"自動切換版面配置","Switched off":"已關閉","System":"系統","Take it over":"接手","Take over all":"全部接手","Take the main place":"佔據主位置","Test animation":"測試動畫","Test on screen":"在螢幕上測試","Test the snap bar":"試用貼齊列","The default values are based on Windows 11.":"預設值參考 Windows 11。","The snapping actions use the same gaps as the snap bar and remember the size before snapping: “Restore the size before snapping” brings it back.":"貼齊動作使用與貼齊列相同的間距，並記住貼齊前的大小：「還原貼齊前的大小」可將其恢復。","These applications are never arranged and keep their own place. Dialogs always float.":"這些應用程式從不被排列，保留自己的位置。對話框一律浮動。","Thirds":"三分之一","Three columns":"三欄","Thumbnail width":"縮圖寬度","Tiling":"並排","Tip":"提示","Top / bottom":"上 / 下","Top edge":"上邊緣","Top edge: full screen":"上邊緣：全螢幕","Top edge: maximize":"上邊緣：最大化","Top edge: top half":"上邊緣：上半部","Top half":"上半部","Trigger distance from the top edge":"距上緣的觸發距離","Turn this off if you prefer KDE's own outline – then switch the screen edges preview above off.":"如果你比較喜歡 KDE 自己的外框，就關閉此項——然後關閉上方的螢幕邊緣預覽。","Two thirds":"三分之二","Two windows trade places – drop one onto the other, or use the keys.":"兩個視窗交換位置——把一個放到另一個上，或使用按鍵。","Two windows trade places: drop one onto the other, or by key.":"兩個視窗交換位置：把一個放到另一個上，或用按鍵。","Use keyboard shortcuts":"使用鍵盤快捷鍵","Use screen edges":"使用螢幕邊緣","Use the system accent color":"使用系統強調色","Use the window magnet":"使用視窗磁吸","Usual combinations":"常用組合","Version":"版本","Wanted for: %1":"用於：%1","When a window opens, closes or swaps, the others move smoothly instead of jumping.":"視窗開啟、關閉或交換時，其他視窗會平順移動而不是跳動。","When you resize a window, windows that touch it move their shared edge along – nothing overlaps, no gap opens.":"調整一個視窗的大小時，與它相接的視窗會一同移動共用的邊緣——不會重疊，也不會留縫。","While resizing, windows that do not follow are shown transparent.":"調整大小時，不跟隨移動的視窗會顯示為半透明。","While you move or resize a window, its edges stick to nearby windows and to the screen edges.":"移動視窗或調整大小時，視窗邊緣會吸附到附近的視窗與螢幕邊緣。","Width":"寬度","Window":"視窗","Window magnet":"視窗磁吸","Window magnet on/off":"開關視窗磁吸","Windows above each other keep their left and right edges together, windows side by side their top and bottom edges.":"上下排列的視窗保持左右邊緣一致，左右並排的視窗保持上下邊緣一致。","Windows glide to their place":"視窗平順滑入位置","Windows stick to each other and to the screen edges.":"視窗會互相吸附，也會吸附到螢幕邊緣。","Windows stop at “Gap between windows” from the General page instead of touching.":"視窗會停在「一般」頁面的「視窗間距」，而不是貼在一起。","Yes":"是","Your own combination":"自訂組合","Your own layouts and their order will be lost.":"您自己的版面配置及其順序將會遺失。","Zone %1":"區域 %1","for KWin · v%1":"適用於 KWin · v%1","windows:":"個視窗起：","“%1” will be removed.":"將移除「%1」。","…drag it onto window B…":"……拖到視窗 B 上……","…in every direction":"……任何方向都行","…let go: they trade places":"……放開：它們交換位置","…the neighbours grow and shrink with it":"……相鄰視窗跟著變大變小","✔ Ready – click OK to open the settings editor.":"✔ 就緒——按確定開啟設定編輯器。"}};
